      "instructions": ["0x2670|PUSH|EBX", "0x2671|PUSH|EBP", "0x2672|PUSH|ESI", "0x2673|PUSH|EDI", "0x2674|MOV|EDI, ECX", "0x2676|TEST|EDI, EDI", "0x2678|JNZ|0x6fad2698", "0x267A|PUSH|0x186", "0x267F|PUSH|0x6fbae7bc", "0x2684|PUSH|0x6fbae7b4", "0x2689|CALL|0x6fb99a7a", "0x268E|ADD|ESP, 0xc", "0x2691|PUSH|-0x1", "0x2693|CALL|0x6fb9a10f", "0x2698|MOV|EBP, dword ptr [ESP + 0x14]"],
      "comment": "Processes an array of Windows messages by dispatching them to appropriate message handlers.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate window handle is not NULL (exit with error if NULL)\n2. Initialize message index counter to 0\n3. For each message in the array:\n   a. Extract message type from offset -4 (piVar4[-1])\n   b. Extract wParam (message ID) from offset 0 (*piVar4)\n   c. Extract lParam (message parameter) from offset +4 (piVar4[1])\n   d. Switch on message type:\n      - Type 0: Call Ordinal_515 for standard message processing\n        * Special case: If wParam == 0x111 (WM_COMMAND), log error and exit\n      - Type 1: Call Ordinal_512 for message type 1\n      - Type 2: Call Ordinal_514 for message type 2  \n      - Type 3: Call Ordinal_513 for message type 3\n   e. Increment message index counter\n   f. Advance to next MessageEntry (12 bytes forward)\n4. Continue until all messages processed\n\nParameters:\nhWnd - Window handle for message processing (HWND)\npMessageArray - Pointer to array of MessageEntry structures containing messages to process\ndwMessageCount - Number of message entries in the array (uint)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If hWnd is NULL, logs error to \"C:\\Projects\\Diablo2\\Source\\D2Client...\" and terminates\n- If wParam == 0x111 (WM_COMMAND) in type 0 message, logs \"oid -> WM_COMMAND\" error and terminates\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x111 (273) - WM_COMMAND message identifier\n0x186 (390) - Error line number for NULL window handle\n0x155 (341) - Error line number for WM_COMMAND in type 0 message\n0xffffffff - Error exit code passed to termination function\n\nStructure Layout:\nMessageEntry (12 bytes):\nOffset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description\n-------|------|-----------|------|-------------\n0x00   | 4    | dwType    | uint | Message type selector (0-3)\n0x04   | 4    | dwWParam  | uint | Message ID (wParam)\n0x08   | 4    | dwLParam  | int  | Message parameter (lParam)",
      "tags": ["MOD_CORE", "PARAM_3", "SRC_WNDPROC.CPP"]
