      "comment": "Logs system performance statistics and diagnostic information to debug output.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get current tick count using GetTickCount() \n2. Update performance timing globals for frame rate tracking\n3. If timing interval < 1000ms, increment frame counters \n4. Otherwise reset counters and update timing baseline\n5. Exit early if logging is disabled (DAT_6fbdc288 == 0)\n6. Log network ping time and frame rate statistics\n7. Get system memory status using GlobalMemoryStatus()\n8. Log physical and virtual memory statistics\n9. Determine current video driver type (1=Software, 3=DirectDraw, 4=Glide, 5=OpenGL, 6=Direct3D, 7=Unknown)\n10. Log video driver name and memory usage\n11. If detailed logging enabled (DAT_6fbdc290 == 0): log GFX memory, sound buffers, async file stats\n12. Get tile cache statistics and log cache performance if cache has entries\n13. Get floor/subtile/sprite cache statistics and log each cache type separately\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Early return if DAT_6fbdc288 is 0 (logging disabled)\n- Early return if DAT_6fbdc284 != 0 (timing already initialized)\n- Magic number 0x3e9 (1001) is timing threshold in milliseconds\n- Video mode 7 references unknown driver at DAT_6fbaeac4\n- Cache statistics only logged if cache entries > 0\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n- 0x3e9 (1001) - Timing interval threshold in milliseconds\n- 0xa0 (160) - Log category ID for ping statistics  \n- 0x20 (32) - Size of MEMORYSTATUS structure\n- 0x1f4 (500) - Log category ID for video information\n- 0xa (10) - Base log priority level\n- 0x5a (90) - Log category for GFX memory\n- 0x87 (135) - Log category for async files\n- 0x1e (30) - Log category for tile cache\n- 0x28 (40) - Log category for floor cache\n- 0x32 (50) - Log category for subtile cache  \n- 0x3c (60) - Log category for sprite cache 1\n- 0x46 (70) - Log category for sprite cache 2\n- 0x50 (80) - Log category for sprite cache 3\n\nStructure Layout:\nCache Statistics Structure (accessed via pCacheStats):\nOffset | Size | Field Name        | Type | Description\n-------|------|------------------|------|------------------\n0x00   | 4    | floorCacheMisses | int  | Floor cache miss count\n0x0C   | 4    | subtileMisses    | int  | Subtile cache miss count  \n0x18   | 4    | spriteMisses1    | int  | Sprite cache 1 miss count\n0x1C   | 4    | spriteMisses2    | int  | Sprite cache 2 miss count\n0x20   | 4    | spriteMisses3    | int  | Sprite cache 3 miss count",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "STRUCT_Room2", "PARAM_0", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "GFX_CACHE", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData", "STRUCT_StatList", "PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Path", "GFX_VIDEO", "STRUCT_Skill"]
