      "comment": "Initialize viewport context for game entity processing.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Pass global viewport context pointer and entity ID to initialization function\n2. Call FUN_6fad3230 with g_ViewportContext as 'this' pointer (__thiscall)\n3. Entity ID used to configure viewport bounds and rendering parameters\n4. Return immediately after initialization completes\n\nParameters:\nnEntityId - Integer identifier for the game entity requiring viewport setup\n          - Used by initialization function to configure viewport bounds\n          - Passed via ECX register (__fastcall convention)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Function performs initialization only, no return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Simple wrapper function with no error handling or validation\n- Delegates all initialization work to FUN_6fad3230\n- Global viewport context at g_ViewportContext (0x6fbdc298) used as target\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x6fbdc298 - Address of global viewport context structure\n           - Used as 'this' pointer for __thiscall initialization function",
