      "comment": "Validates and initializes a light structure for game lighting system.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate input pointer - if NULL, trigger assertion failure with error message\n2. Call fatal error handler (FUN_6fb9a10f) with -1 to terminate process  \n3. Set initialization flag at offset 0x20 to 1 (indicates structure is initialized)\n4. Clear state flag at offset 0x1c to 0 (resets any previous state)\n5. Check light type field at offset 0xc - if equals 2 (LIGHT_TYPE_STATIC), trigger error\n6. Call assertion handler with specific error message about static light type\n7. Call fatal error handler to terminate if static light type detected\n\nParameters:\npLight (byte *): Pointer to light structure containing type and state fields\n\nReturns:\nvoid: Function does not return value, performs validation and initialization only",
