      "comment": "Thunk wrapper that forces window border calculation with nEnable=1.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set ECX to 1 (nEnable parameter for __fastcall)\n2. Tail-call CalculateWindowBorders(1)\n\nParameters:\nNone - this wrapper takes no parameters\n\nReturns:\nint: Return value from CalculateWindowBorders (0 if graphics mode is 1, non-zero otherwise)\n\nSpecial Cases:\nUnlike direct calls to CalculateWindowBorders(0), this wrapper always forces calculation\neven when g_dwFullscreenEnabled is 0, because nEnable is hardcoded to 1.\n\nRelated Functions:\nCalculateWindowBorders - The function this thunk wraps",
