      "instructions": ["0x5330|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x4]", "0x5334|PUSH|ESI", "0x5335|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [EAX + 0x10]", "0x5338|SUB|ESI, ECX", "0x533A|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [EAX + 0x14]", "0x533D|SUB|ECX, EDX", "0x533F|OR|EAX, 0xffffffff", "0x5342|TEST|ESI, ESI", "0x5344|MOV|EDX, 0x1", "0x5349|JNZ|0x6fad5359", "0x534B|TEST|ECX, ECX", "0x534D|JNZ|0x6fad5364", "0x534F|MOV|dword ptr [0x6fbe8f00], ECX", "0x5355|POP|ESI", "0x5356|RET|0x4"],
      "comment": "Calculates direction and slope for light ray casting between source and target coordinates.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Compute delta X (target X - source X) and delta Y (target Y - source Y)\n2. Handle special case: both deltas zero (same position) - set ray type to 0, return\n3. Determine X direction: negative delta sets g_nXDirection to -1, positive to +1\n4. Take absolute value of delta X for calculations\n5. Determine Y direction: negative delta sets g_nYDirection to -1, positive to +1  \n6. Take absolute value of delta Y for calculations\n7. Handle axis-aligned cases:\n   - Delta X is zero (vertical ray): set ray type to 4, return\n   - Delta Y is zero (horizontal ray): set ray type to 1, return\n8. Handle diagonal cases based on dominant axis:\n   - If |delta Y| <= |delta X| (X-dominant): set ray type to 2, slope = (delta Y << 8) / delta X\n   - If |delta Y| > |delta X| (Y-dominant): set ray type to 3, slope = (delta X << 8) / delta Y\n\nParameters:\nnSourceX - Source X coordinate for ray casting\nnSourceY - Source Y coordinate for ray casting  \npLightContext - Pointer to light context containing target coordinates at offsets +0x10 (nX) and +0x14 (nY)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Sets global state variables for ray direction and slope\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x10 (16) - Offset to X coordinate in LightContext structure\n0x14 (20) - Offset to Y coordinate in LightContext structure\n0x8 (8) - Left shift for fixed-point slope calculation (256x scaling)\n0xffffffff (-1) - Direction flag for negative axis movement\n0x1 (1) - Direction flag for positive axis movement\n\nRay Type Codes:\n0 - Same position (no movement required)\n1 - Horizontal movement only (delta Y = 0)\n2 - X-dominant diagonal movement (|delta X| >= |delta Y|)  \n3 - Y-dominant diagonal movement (|delta Y| > |delta X|)\n4 - Vertical movement only (delta X = 0)\n\nStructure Layout:\nLightContext structure (minimum 24 bytes):\nOffset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description\n+0x00  |  4   | dwType     | uint | Light type identifier\n+0x04  |  4   | dwHandle   | uint | Light handle/ID  \n+0x08  |  4   | dwFlags    | uint | Light behavior flags\n+0x0C  |  4   | dwReserved | uint | Reserved field\n+0x10  |  4   | nX         | int  | Target X coordinate\n+0x14  |  4   | nY         | int  | Target Y coordinate\n+0x18  |  4   | nRadius    | int  | Light radius/range",
      "tags": ["PARAM_3", "PROP_LEAF"]
