      "instructions": ["0x5B50|SUB|ESP, 0x8", "0x5B53|PUSH|EBX", "0x5B54|PUSH|EBP", "0x5B55|PUSH|ESI", "0x5B56|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [0x6fbe8f04]", "0x5B5C|TEST|ESI, ESI", "0x5B5E|PUSH|EDI", "0x5B5F|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x14], ECX", "0x5B63|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x10], ESI", "0x5B67|JZ|0x6fad5c65", "0x5B6D|CMP|dword ptr [ESI + 0xc], 0x2", "0x5B71|JNZ|0x6fad5c37", "0x5B77|MOV|EDX, dword ptr [ESI]", "0x5B79|CMP|EDX, 0x6", "0x5B7C|JZ|0x6fad5c47"],
      "comment": "Invalidates audio contexts whose source unit is within range of the target room.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Iterate through the global audio context linked list (g_pAudioContextListHead)\n2. Skip contexts where nMode != 2 (only process mode 2 audio contexts)\n3. Assert and exit if dwBaseValue (unit type) is 6 (invalid unit type)\n4. Retrieve the source unit based on bFlag: use FindLinkListNodeByIdAndIndex if bFlag is set, otherwise FindUnitInHashTable\n5. Assert and exit if the source unit is NULL (hSrcUnit assertion)\n6. Get the room containing the source unit via UNITS_GetRoom\n7. If source unit's room matches target room, skip to next context (no invalidation needed)\n8. Get unit coordinates via Ordinal_10326 (GetUnitY) and Ordinal_10329 (GetUnitX)\n9. Calculate search radius: dwBufferSize1 >> 3 (divide by 8)\n10. Search in 4 cardinal directions from unit position for the target room:\n    a. East: FindRegionByCoordinates(pUnitRoom, nUnitX + nRadius, nUnitY)\n    b. West: FindRegionByCoordinates(pUnitRoom, nUnitX - nRadius, nUnitY)\n    c. South: FindRegionByCoordinates(pUnitRoom, nUnitX, nUnitY + nRadius)\n    d. North: FindRegionByCoordinates(pUnitRoom, nUnitX, nUnitY - nRadius)\n11. If any adjacent region matches the target room, set dwReserved = 0 to invalidate the context\n12. Advance to next context in the linked list via pNext pointer\n\nParameters:\npTargetRoom (ECX) - Pointer to target room structure to check proximity against\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Only processes audio contexts with nMode == 2\n- Unit type 6 triggers fatal assertion (invalid unit type for audio context)\n- NULL source unit triggers fatal assertion (hSrcUnit)\n- Context is NOT invalidated if source unit is directly in target room (only adjacent rooms trigger invalidation)\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x2 - Audio mode that requires proximity checking\n0x6 - Invalid unit type that triggers assertion\n0x3 - Right shift amount for radius calculation (divide by 8)\n0x49e (1182) - Assertion line number in D2Client source\n\nError Handling:\nFatal assertion via FogAssert and ExitApplicationWithCode(-1) for:\n- Invalid unit type (dwBaseValue == 6)\n- NULL source unit from hash table or link list lookup\n\nOrdinal Function Reference:\nOrdinal_10326 - D2Common.GetUnitY: Gets Y coordinate of unit\nOrdinal_10329 - D2Common.GetUnitX: Gets X coordinate of unit",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_Skill", "SRC_dLightMap.cpp", "STRUCT_ItemData", "PARAM_1", "GFX_DRAW", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "MOD_DRAW", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
