      "comment": "Processes pixel rendering for all active cells in a grid-based rendering system.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load grid data pointer from GridManager at offset 0xeaa8\n2. Calculate total cell count as gridSize² from offset 0xeab0  \n3. Iterate through each grid cell (36-byte stride at 0x24)\n4. Check if cell has processing data at offset 0x14, call processor if present\n5. Iterate through pixel node linked list starting at offset 0x18\n6. Convert each pixel coordinate to RGBA color using MapPixelToColorPalette\n7. Pack color components into 32-bit ARGB value using bit shifting\n8. Send pixel data to rendering pipeline via FUN_6fb85590\n9. Continue to next node via offset 0x10 until end of list\n10. Advance to next grid cell and repeat until all cells processed\n\nParameters:\npGridManager - Pointer to GridManager structure containing grid data array and size\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value, function performs side effects on rendering system\n\nStructure Layout:\nGridManager (59568 bytes):\nOffset    Size  Field Name    Type         Description\n0x0000    59560 reserved1     byte[59560]  Manager data and configuration\n0xeaa8    4     pGridData     GridCell*    Pointer to grid cell array\n0xeab0    4     dwGridSize    uint         Grid dimensions (width=height)\n\nGridCell (36 bytes):\nOffset  Size  Field Name        Type      Description\n0x00    20    reserved1         byte[20]  Cell configuration data\n0x14    4     pProcessingData   void*     Optional processor function pointer\n0x18    4     pLinkedListHead   void*     Head of pixel node linked list\n0x1c    8     reserved2         byte[8]   Cell state information\n\nPixelNode (20 bytes):\nOffset  Size  Field Name    Type    Description\n0x00    4     reserved      uint    Node metadata\n0x04    4     nPixelX       int     X coordinate of pixel\n0x08    4     nPixelY       int     Y coordinate of pixel\n0x0c    4     pColorData    uint*   Pointer to pixel color data\n0x10    4     pNextNode     void*   Next node in linked list\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0xeaa8 - GridManager offset to grid data array pointer\n0xeab0 - GridManager offset to grid size value\n0x24 (36) - GridCell structure size/stride for array traversal\n0x14 (20) - GridCell offset to processing data pointer\n0x18 (24) - GridCell offset to linked list head pointer\n0x4 - PixelNode offset to X coordinate field\n0x8 - PixelNode offset to Y coordinate field  \n0xc - PixelNode offset to color data pointer field\n0x10 - PixelNode offset to next node pointer field",
