      "comment": "Processes animation effects for all entities in the game world\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate total entity count by squaring game context dimension \n2. Skip processing if entity count is zero\n3. Initialize entity array pointer from game context \n4. For each entity slot process animation timing, flags, coordinates, and rendering\n5. Advance to next entity slot and continue until all processed\n\nParameters:\npGameContext - Game context structure containing entity arrays and world state\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Function performs rendering side effects only",
