      "comment": "Flushes pending validation errors from error code arrays and reports them to the error handling system.\n\nAlgorithm:\n\n1. Initialize pointer to first validation error array at 0x6fbe8fb4\n2. Iterate through 4-element error array (0x6fbe8fb4 to 0x6fbe8fc4)\n   - Check if error code is non-zero (pending validation error)\n   - If error exists, call ReportValidationError with error code\n   - Clear error code slot by setting to zero\n   - Advance to next error slot (+4 bytes)\n3. Initialize pointer to second validation error array at 0x6fbe8f40  \n4. Iterate through 4-element error array (0x6fbe8f40 to 0x6fbe8f50)\n   - Check if error code is non-zero (pending validation error)\n   - If error exists, call ReportValidationError with error code\n   - Clear error code slot by setting to zero\n   - Advance to next error slot (+4 bytes)\n5. Return after processing both error arrays\n\nParameters:\n\nNone - function takes no parameters\n\nReturns:\n\nvoid - no return value, operates on global error arrays\n\nSpecial Cases:\n\nZero error codes are skipped (no error to report)\nArrays are fixed-size: 4 error codes each\nBoth arrays are processed sequentially regardless of content\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n\n0x6fbe8fb4 - Base address of first validation error array (4 integers)\n0x6fbe8fc4 - End address of first validation error array (exclusive)\n0x6fbe8f40 - Base address of second validation error array (4 integers)  \n0x6fbe8f50 - End address of second validation error array (exclusive)\n0x0 - Clear value written to processed error slots\n\nError Handling:\n\nErrors are reported via ReportValidationError(nErrorCode)\nNo error validation on input arrays (assumes valid global arrays)\nError slots are unconditionally cleared after reporting",
      "tags": ["PARAM_0"]
    },
