      "comment": "Updates all active timed spell effects in the global effect array\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call Ordinal_10010() to check if position updates should be applied\n2. Retrieve effect array pointer from g_dwCompressionObject3 + 0x11c\n3. Check if effect count (g_dwCompressionObject3 + 0x110) is valid (>= 0)\n4. Iterate through all effect slots in the array\n5. For each active effect (wActive != 0):\n   a. If position updates enabled (Ordinal_10010() == 0), subtract offset deltas from coordinates\n   b. Decrement timer count (nTimerCount field at +0x14)\n   c. If timer expired (count < 1), reset timer to 2 and increment frame index\n   d. If frame index exceeds limit from lookup table, call Ordinal_10065()\n6. Advance to next effect structure (24-byte stride)\n7. Continue until all effects processed\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\nWhen timer expires, resets timer count to 2 and clears state flag at +0x16\nFrame index bounds checked against DAT_6fbe8fd0 lookup table using effect type\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x11c - Offset to effect array pointer in compression object\n0x110 - Offset to effect count in compression object  \n0x18 (24) - Size of each effect structure in bytes\n0x14 (20) - Offset to timer count field\n0x10 (16) - Offset to frame index field\n0x0c (12) - Offset to effect type field\n0x04 - Offset to X coordinate field\n0x08 - Offset to Y coordinate field\n0x16 (22) - Offset to state flag field\nDAT_6fbe92d8 - X coordinate delta offset\nDAT_6fbe92dc - Y coordinate delta offset\nDAT_6fbe8fd0 - Frame limit lookup table base\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset | Size | Field Name    | Type   | Description\n+0x00  | 2    | wActive       | ushort | Effect active flag\n+0x02  | 2    | wPadding      | ushort | Padding alignment\n+0x04  | 4    | nXPosition    | int    | X coordinate\n+0x08  | 4    | nYPosition    | int    | Y coordinate  \n+0x0C  | 4    | nEffectType   | int    | Effect type for lookup\n+0x10  | 4    | nFrameIndex   | int    | Current animation frame\n+0x14  | 4    | nTimerCount   | int    | Timer countdown\n+0x16  | 2    | wState        | ushort | Effect state flags",
