      "comment": "Initialize snow particle properties for weather rendering\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get particle slot index using Ordinal_10064() (returns -1 if no slot available)\n2. Calculate particle structure pointer from compression object base + slot offset\n3. Clear particle flags at offset +0x1c  \n4. Set horizontal position based on screen width and random values\n5. Set vertical position based on screen height and offset calculations\n6. Configure particle properties based on weather conditions (DAT_6fbe9014)\n7. If normal weather: Set color/alpha from time-of-day lookup tables \n8. If special weather: Set full alpha, calculate position scaling, validate shape index\n9. Set color based on period of day and special conditions\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Early return if no particle slots available (iVar5 == -1)\n- Screen width 0: Use position 0\n- Screen height 0x57: Special positioning calculation\n- Shape index validation: Must be 0-7 or triggers fatal error\n- Period of day validation: Must be 0-3 or triggers fatal error\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x28 (40) - Vertical position offset for snow particles\n0x14 (20) - Horizontal position adjustment\n0x57 (87) - Special screen height threshold\n0x7f (127) - Half alpha for time-of-day rendering\n0xff (255) - Full alpha for special weather\n0x3c (60) - Position calculation threshold\n0x200 (512) - Random number range\n0xc (12) - Shape scaling multiplier\n0x8 (8) - Maximum shape index value\n0x3 (3) - Default particle type\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset  Size  Field Name    Type     Description\n+0x00   4     dwField_0     uint     Unknown field 1\n+0x04   4     dwPosX        uint     Horizontal position\n+0x08   4     dwPosY        uint     Vertical position  \n+0x0C   4     dwPosZ        uint     Depth position\n+0x10   4     dwField_10    uint     Shape/size index\n+0x14   4     dwField_14    uint     Animation offset\n+0x18   4     dwField_18    uint     Random seed value\n+0x1C   4     dwField_1C    uint     Particle flags (cleared to 0)\n+0x20   4     dwField_20    uint     Particle type (1=special, 3=normal)\n+0x24   1     byColor       byte     Color index from lookup table\n+0x25   1     byAlpha       byte     Alpha transparency value\n\nError Handling:\n- Shape index out of bounds: Fatal error \"tParticle->nSize < NUM_SNOW_SHAPES\" \n- Period of day invalid: Fatal error \"nPeriodOfDay > 0 && nPeriodOfDay <= 3\"\n- Both errors call exit with code -1 (0xffffffff)\n\nWeather Data Tables:\n- DAT_6fbe8f68: Color table for period 0 (dawn/dusk)\n- DAT_6fbe8f24: Color table for periods 1&3 (day/night) \n- DAT_6fbe8f84: Color table for period 2 (midday)\n- DAT_6fba6329: Alpha lookup table indexed by period * 2\n- DAT_6fbe8fc4: Special weather color table\n- DAT_6fbe8f74: Standard color lookup table",
