f\n- Link pointer checks prevent double-free on null pointers\n- Array elements processed with 12-byte stride (0xc)\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x50 - Critical section offset (DeleteCriticalSection parameter)\n0x6fba63ec - Partial destructor vtable pointer\n0x6fba63dc - Final destructor vtable pointer\n0xfffffffe - Error code passed to Ordinal_403 (-2)\n0xc - Array element stride (12 bytes per element)\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset | Size | Field Name           | Type    | Description\n0x00   | 4    | vtable              | void*   | Virtual function table pointer\n0x04   | 4    | field_4             | uint    | Unknown field\n0x08   | 4    | field_8             | uint    | Unknown field  \n0x0c   | 4    | field_c             | uint    | Unknown field\n0x10   | 4    | flags               | uint    | Object state flags\n0x14   | 4    | field_14            | uint    | Unknown field\n0x18   | 4    | arrayCount          | uint    | Number of array elements\n0x1c   | 4    | arrayPtr            | void*   | Pointer to dynamic array\n0x20   | 4    | field_20            | uint    | Unknown field\n0x24   | 4    | field_24            | uint    | Unknown field\n0x28   | 4    | secondCleanupBase   | void*   | Base pointer for second cleanup\n0x2c   | 4    | secondCleanupPtr    | void*   | Link pointer for second cleanup\n0x30   | 4    | secondCleanupCount  | uint    | Count for second cleanup\n0x34   | 4    | field_34            | uint    | Unknown field\n0x38   | 4    | firstCleanupBase    | void*   | Base pointer for first cleanup\n0x3c   | 4    | firstCleanupPtr     | void*   | Link pointer for first cleanup\n0x40   | 4    | firstCleanupCount   | uint    | Count for first cleanup\n0x44   | 4    | field_44            | uint    | Unknown field\n0x48   | 4    | field_48            | uint    | Unknown field\n0x4c   | 4    | field_4c            | uint    | Unknown field\n0x50   | 24   | criticalSection     | byte[24]| Win32 CRITICAL_SECTION object",
