      "comment": "Evaluates system state conditions and returns corresponding flag bits\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize return flags to zero\n2. Check global state variable - if active, set bit 3 (0x08)\n3. Check always-run flag - if enabled, set bit 3 (0x08) \n4. Check debug mode flag - if enabled, set bit 2 (0x04)\n5. Return combined flags value\n\nParameters:\nNone - function takes no parameters\n\nReturns:\nuint - Bitwise combination of state flags:\n  - 0x00: All states inactive (normal operation)\n  - 0x04: Debug mode active only\n  - 0x08: Global state or always-run active  \n  - 0x0C: Debug mode with global state/always-run (both active)\n\nSpecial Cases:\nBoth global state and always-run flags set the same bit (0x08)\nFunction uses OR operations to combine flags without conflicts\n\nFlag Bits:\nBit 2 (0x04): Debug mode enabled\nBit 3 (0x08): Global state active OR always-run enabled",
      "tags": ["PARAM_0", "PROP_LEAF", "PROP_SMALL"]
