      "instructions": ["0x83B0|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbe9270]", "0x83B5|MOV|dword ptr [0x6fbe92b4], 0x0", "0x83BF|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x83C1|JZ|0x6fad83db", "0x83C3|CALL|0x6fb5da70", "0x83C8|CALL|0x6fae5fe0", "0x83CD|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x4]", "0x83D1|MOV|dword ptr [EAX + 0x18], 0x0", "0x83D8|RET|0x4", "0x83DB|CALL|0x6fadcce0", "0x83E0|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x4]", "0x83E4|MOV|ECX, 0x1", "0x83E9|MOV|dword ptr [0x6fbe92d4], ECX", "0x83EF|MOV|dword ptr [EAX + 0x18], ECX", "0x83F2|MOV|dword ptr [EAX + 0x1c], 0x0"],
      "comment": "Initialize game state or server configuration based on system enablement flag.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Clear global state variable (g_dwGlobalState = 0)\n2. Check if game system is enabled (g_dwGameSystemEnabled)\n3. If enabled (game path):\n   a. Call InitializeGameStateWithValidation to set up game subsystems\n   b. Call InitializePlayerStatistics to initialize player stats\n   c. Set output state field +0x18 to 0 (success/game mode)\n4. If disabled (server path):\n   a. Call ProcessServerPortConfiguration with ECX value\n   b. Set g_dwGlobalStatus to 1\n   c. Set output state field +0x18 to 1 (server mode indicator)\n   d. Set output state field +0x1c to 0 (clear secondary field)\n\nParameters:\npOutputState (void *): Pointer to output state structure. Fields modified:\n  +0x18: Mode indicator (0 = game initialized, 1 = server configured)\n  +0x1c: Secondary state (only set to 0 in server path)\nIMPLICIT ECX: Passed to ProcessServerPortConfiguration in server path\n\nReturns:\nvoid - State communicated via output structure and globals\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- No callers found - likely called via function pointer table\n- Two distinct initialization paths based on g_dwGameSystemEnabled\n- Server path sets additional global g_dwGlobalStatus\n\nGlobal Variables:\n- g_dwGlobalState (0x6fbe92b4): Cleared to 0 at entry\n- g_dwGameSystemEnabled (0x6fbe9270): Read to determine path\n- g_dwGlobalStatus (0x6fbe92d4): Set to 1 in server path only",
