      "instructions": ["0x8400|MOV|dword ptr [0x6fbaf7a8], 0x4", "0x840A|MOV|dword ptr [0x6fbe92b0], 0x0", "0x8414|CALL|0x6fae5560", "0x8419|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbe926c]", "0x841E|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x8420|JZ|0x6fad8496", "0x8422|MOV|dword ptr [0x6fbe92a8], 0x1", "0x842C|CALL|0x6fb62880", "0x8431|MOV|EDX, dword ptr [0x6fbe92b4]", "0x8437|XOR|ECX, ECX", "0x8439|TEST|EDX, EDX", "0x843B|JZ|0x6fad8442", "0x843D|MOV|ECX, 0x8", "0x8442|MOV|EDX, dword ptr [0x6fbe92b8]", "0x8448|TEST|EDX, EDX"],
      "comment": "Process UI command and update cache node with targeting state flags.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set g_dwConstantIdentifier = 4 (UI command identifier)\n2. Clear g_dwEventCompletionFlag to 0\n3. Call ClearUnitSelectionError to reset selection state\n4. Check g_dwPostGameRenderMode - if 0, exit early (no active render context)\n5. Set g_fTargetingEnabled = 1 (enable targeting mode)\n6. Call GetGameContext to retrieve current game context pointer\n7. Build targeting flags from system state globals:\n   - If g_dwGlobalState != 0, set ECX = 0x08\n   - If g_dwAlwaysRunSetting != 0, OR ECX with 0x08\n   - If g_nGlobalStateFlag != 0, OR ECX with 0x04\n8. Read first dword from game context [EAX]\n9. If game context dword == 0:\n   - Extract screen coordinates from pCommandContext:\n     - Low word of [pCommandContext+0x0C] -> nScreenY (DX)\n     - High word of [pCommandContext+0x0C] -> nScreenX (shifted right by 16)\n   - Call ProcessUIInteractionCommand(dwActionType=0, nScreenX, nScreenY, dwFlags)\n   - Store result in g_fTargetingEnabled\n10. Set pCommandContext->field_0x18 = 1 (mark as processed)\n11. Set pCommandContext->field_0x1C = 0 (clear result field)\n12. Call InsertCacheNodeWithCookie(pCommandContext) to add to cache\n\nParameters:\n- pCommandContext: Pointer to command context structure containing:\n  - Offset 0x0C: Packed screen coordinates (low word=Y, high word=X)\n  - Offset 0x18: Processing status flag (set to 1 on success)\n  - Offset 0x1C: Result/error field (cleared to 0)\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nGlobals Modified:\n- g_dwConstantIdentifier (0x6fbaf7a8): Set to 4\n- g_dwEventCompletionFlag (0x6fbe92b0): Cleared to 0\n- g_fTargetingEnabled (0x6fbe92a8): Set to 1, then updated with ProcessUIInteractionCommand result\n\nGlobals Read:\n- g_dwPostGameRenderMode (0x6fbe926c): Checked for non-zero to continue\n- g_dwGlobalState (0x6fbe92b4): Checked for targeting flags\n- g_dwAlwaysRunSetting (0x6fbe92b8): Checked for targeting flags\n- g_nGlobalStateFlag (0x6fbe92bc): Checked for targeting flags\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x04: UI command identifier value\n- 0x08: Targeting flag bit for state/always-run conditions\n- 0x04: Targeting flag bit for global state flag\n- 0x0C: Offset to packed coordinates in command context\n- 0x18: Offset to processing status in command context\n- 0x1C: Offset to result field in command context",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
