      "comment": "Process mouse button 3 (middle click) down event and queue cache node.\n\nAlgorithm:\n\n1. Check if g_dwPostGameRenderMode is non-zero (game is rendering post-game UI)\n2. If not in post-game mode, return immediately without processing\n3. Invoke the registered mouse3 down callback handler\n4. Set cache node field at offset +0x18 to 1 (mark as active/pending)\n5. Set cache node field at offset +0x1c to 0 (clear state/cookie value)\n6. Insert the configured cache node into the cache system\n\nParameters:\n\npCacheNode (uint *) - Pointer to cache node structure to configure and insert\n  - Offset +0x18 (pCacheNode[6]): Active/pending flag, set to 1\n  - Offset +0x1c (pCacheNode[7]): State/cookie value, cleared to 0\n\nReturns:\n\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n\n- If g_dwPostGameRenderMode == 0, function returns without any action\n- No callers detected - likely registered as callback in function pointer table\n- Function is classified as Callback/Handler for mouse input events\n\nRelated Globals:\n\ng_dwPostGameRenderMode @ 0x6fbe926c - Controls post-game rendering state",
