      "comment": "Processes extended mouse button (Mouse4/Mouse5) down events.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if g_dwPostGameRenderMode is non-zero (game UI active)\n2. Extract button index from high word of pInputEvent[2]\n3. If button index is 1, invoke Mouse4 down callback\n4. Else if button index is 2, invoke Mouse5 down callback\n5. Mark event as processed: pInputEvent[6] = 1\n6. Clear event counter: pInputEvent[7] = 0\n7. Insert event into cache via InsertCacheNodeWithCookie\n\nParameters:\n  pInputEvent - Pointer to input event structure:\n    [2] (offset 0x8): High word contains button index (1=Mouse4, 2=Mouse5)\n    [6] (offset 0x18): Processed flag (set to 1 when handled)\n    [7] (offset 0x1c): Event counter/sequence (cleared to 0)\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Early return if g_dwPostGameRenderMode is 0 (game UI not active)\n  - Button indices: 1 = Mouse4 (XButton1), 2 = Mouse5 (XButton2)\n  - Event structure is cached after processing for input history\n\nRelated Functions:\n  - FUN_6fad8840: ProcessExtendedMouseButtonUp (handles button release)\n  - FUN_6fad87c0: ProcessMiddleMouseButtonDown (handles Mouse3)",
