      "instructions": ["0x8C70|SUB|ESP, 0x8", "0x8C73|MOV|ECX, 0x1f", "0x8C78|XOR|EAX, EAX", "0x8C7A|PUSH|ESI", "0x8C7B|PUSH|EDI", "0x8C7C|PUSH|0x1000", "0x8C81|MOV|EDI, 0x6fbe9050", "0x8C86|PUSH|0x40000", "0x8C8B|XOR|ESI, ESI", "0x8C8D|PUSH|0x6fbafbc8", "0x8C92|PUSH|0x6fbe9058", "0x8C97|STOSD.REP|ES:EDI", "0x8C99|MOV|dword ptr [0x6fbe927c], ESI", "0x8C9F|MOV|dword ptr [0x6fbe9278], ESI", "0x8CA5|MOV|dword ptr [0x6fbe9258], ESI"],
      "comment": "Initializes all major game systems and prepares the engine for operation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Clear global data buffer (0x6fbe9050) - zero 31 DWORDs in array\n2. Initialize core state flags to zero (0x6fbe927c through 0x6fbe92bc)\n3. Initialize client pool system with 256KB memory pool (0x40000 bytes, 0x1000 page size)\n4. Reset memory tracking counter to zero\n5. Load color configuration from Data\\Local\\Color.txt file\n6. Parse color flag from configuration file - check if value is '1'\n7. Set global color mode flag based on parsed configuration\n8. Initialize graphics system pointer if not already set\n9. Initialize core engine subsystems (graphics, memory, sound)\n10. Check system mode flags (6, 7, 8, 9) and enable compression if needed\n11. Register exception handler (LAB_6fad8c40)\n12. Initialize memory management with 1MB buffer\n13. Test initialization success and set global status flag\n14. Record system startup timestamps (GetTickCount)\n15. Initialize system components: graphics, sound, networking, AI\n16. Allocate 1360-byte message buffer from ordinal memory pool\n17. Initialize palette and buffer management systems\n18. Clear final status counters and complete initialization\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Performs initialization with no return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\nSystem Mode Check - Tests specific mode values (6, 7, 8, 9) to determine if compression should be enabled\nColor Configuration - Reads single character from configuration file to set color mode\nMemory Pool Allocation - Uses ordinal-based memory allocation with specific size (0x550 = 1360 bytes)\nException Handling - Registers custom handler at LAB_6fad8c40 for system errors\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x1f (31) - Number of DWORDs to clear in global data array\n0x40000 (262144) - Client pool memory size in bytes\n0x1000 (4096) - Memory page size for pool allocation\n0x550 (1360) - Message buffer allocation size\n'1' (0x31) - ASCII character indicating color mode enabled\n6, 7, 8, 9 - System mode values that require compression\n\nError Handling:\nConfiguration File - Function continues if Color.txt cannot be read\nMemory Allocation - No explicit error checking for memory pool initialization\nSystem Components - Individual component initialization failures handled by subsystems",
      "tags": ["SRC_Game.cpp", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_0", "MOD_GAME"]
