      "api_calls": ["GfxUpdateWindowVisibility", "RenderScene", "GfxInterface_CallMethod0xC4", "SetActiveFont", "ValidateStringId", "ValidateStringId", "SumCharacterValues", "RenderUnicodeTextWithLineHeight", "SetActiveFont", "WrapUnicodeText", "...+6 more"],
      "instructions": ["0x90E0|PUSH|ECX", "0x90E1|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbe929c]", "0x90E6|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x90E8|JZ|0x6fad9221", "0x90EE|CALL|0x6fb992c2", "0x90F3|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x90F5|JNZ|0x6fad9206", "0x90FB|PUSH|EAX", "0x90FC|PUSH|EAX", "0x90FD|PUSH|EAX", "0x90FE|PUSH|0x1", "0x9100|CALL|0x6fb992b6", "0x9105|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x9107|JZ|0x6fad9206", "0x910D|PUSH|ESI"],
      "comment": "Renders loading screen text centered on screen with word wrap support.\n\nCalled from game loop during loading screen phases. Displays localized\nstrings indexed by g_nLoadingScreenStringIndex, with special handling for\nexpansion act strings (0x14=Act5, 0x15=Act5 alternate).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if loading countdown is active (g_nLoadingScreenCountdown != 0)\n2. Call Ordinal_10026 (D2Gfx) to check render state; exit if busy\n3. Call RenderScene to initialize frame; exit if fails\n4. Initialize graphics interface and set font to size 3 (large)\n5. Look up string ID from g_awLoadingStringIds[g_nLoadingScreenStringIndex]\n6. Validate and retrieve Unicode text for the string\n7. If expansion flag (0x20) set in video state:\n   - If index 0x14: use string 0x5522 (Act 5 loading)\n   - If index 0x15: use string 0x5521 (Act 5 alternate)\n8. Calculate text height using SumCharacterValues\n9. If text fits (height < screen_height - 40):\n   - Render single line centered at Y = (height - textHeight) / 2\n   - X position fixed at 200\n10. Else (text too tall for single line):\n    - Switch to font size 2 (smaller)\n    - Wrap text to 600 pixel width, get line count\n    - For each wrapped line:\n      a. Calculate vertical center position\n      b. Get font line height property\n      c. Render at Y offset = lineHeight * lineIndex * 2 + 200\n    - Free wrapped line list\n11. Call RenderCompositeUnitFrames to finalize display\n12. Restore graphics interface state\n13. Decrement g_nLoadingScreenCountdown\n14. If countdown reaches 0: call InitializeGameEngineState\n\nParameters:\n  None (reads global state)\n\nReturns:\n  1 - Loading countdown completed (reached 0)\n  0 - Loading still in progress or inactive\n\nGlobals Accessed:\n  g_nLoadingScreenCountdown (0x6fbe929c) - Frames remaining in loading display\n  g_nLoadingScreenStringIndex (0x6fbe90e8) - Index into string ID table\n  g_awLoadingStringIds (0x6fbaf884) - Table of string IDs for loading messages\n  g_dwVideoPlaybackState (0x6fbdc250) - Video state flags at +0x1ea\n  g_dwBackBufferHeight (0x6fbdc014) - Screen height for centering\n\nSSA Temporaries (decompiler-generated, cannot be renamed):\n  bVar1 (byFontLineHeight) - Font line height from GetCurrentFontProperty\n  iVar2 (nTextHeight) - Text height in pixels from SumCharacterValues\n  uVar3 (dwLineIndex) - Loop counter for wrapped line iteration\n  pLVar4 (pCurrentLine) - Current line node in wrapped text list\n  extraout_var (byLineHeightHigh) - High bytes of font property return\n  extraout_EAX (nRenderState) - Return from Ordinal_10026\n  extraout_EAX_00 (nSceneResult) - Return from RenderScene\n  extraout_EAX_01 (pBaseText) - Text from first ValidateStringId\n  extraout_EAX_02 (pExpansionText) - Text from expansion ValidateStringId\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Returns 0 immediately if g_nLoadingScreenCountdown is 0\n  - Returns 0 (via goto) if Ordinal_10026 returns non-zero\n  - Returns 0 (via goto) if RenderScene fails\n  - Uses different fonts based on text length (3 for short, 2 for wrapped)\n  - Expansion pack (0x20 flag) overrides string for acts 0x14/0x15\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x28 (40) - Margin reserved at bottom of screen\n  200 - Base X position for text rendering\n  600 - Max width for text wrapping\n  0x5522 - String ID for Act 5 loading text\n  0x5521 - String ID for Act 5 alternate loading text\n  0x14 (20) - Loading screen index for Act 5\n  0x15 (21) - Loading screen index for Act 5 alternate\n  0x20 (32) - Expansion pack flag in video state byte",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_0", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
    },
