      "comment": "Checks application mode state and conditionally transitions to menu mode.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Read current application mode from global state variable\n2. Check if current mode equals MENU_READY state (5)\n3. If in MENU_READY state, push MENU mode (2) onto application mode stack\n4. Return current application mode value\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nuint - Current application mode value from global state variable\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Mode 5 (MENU_READY): Triggers transition to MENU mode (2)\n- Other modes: No state change, only returns current value\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x5 (5) - MENU_READY application mode state\n0x2 (2) - MENU application mode for mode stack",
