      "globals": ["0x11925C|g_bVideoInitializationEnabled|0x0", "0x10C250|g_dwVideoPlaybackState|0x0", "0x119254|g_dwVideoFrameUpdateFlag|0x0"],
      "api_count": 0,
      "api_calls": [],
      "instructions": ["0xA9D0|MOVZX|CX, byte ptr [0x6fbe925c]", "0xA9D8|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbdc250]", "0xA9DD|MOV|dword ptr [0x6fbe9254], 0x1", "0xA9E7|INC|ECX", "0xA9E8|MOV|DX, word ptr [EAX + 0x1ea]", "0xA9EF|SHL|ECX, 0xa", "0xA9F2|AND|EDX, 0xe0ff", "0xA9F8|OR|ECX, EDX", "0xA9FA|MOV|word ptr [EAX + 0x1ea], CX", "0xAA01|RET|"],
      "comment": "Increments video frame counter and updates video playback state bit field.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set video frame update flag to indicate frame processing active (g_dwVideoFrameUpdateFlag = 1)\n2. Load current frame counter value from global byte storage (g_byVideoFrameCount)\n3. Increment frame counter by 1 (wraps at 256 due to byte storage)\n4. Shift incremented counter left by 10 bits to position in upper bits (multiply by 0x400)\n5. Load current video state word from playback structure at offset 0x1ea\n6. Clear the 10-bit frame counter field using mask 0xe0ff (preserves bits 0-7 and 13-15)\n7. Combine new frame counter value with preserved bits using OR operation\n8. Store updated word back to video playback structure at offset 0x1ea\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\nFrame counter wraps from 255 to 0 due to byte storage limitation.\nBit field update is atomic - entire word is read, modified, and written back.\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x1ea (490) - Offset in video playback state structure containing frame timing bits\n0x400 (1024) - Shift multiplier to position frame counter in bits 10-19 of state word\n0xe0ff - Bit mask preserving bits 0-7 and 13-15, clearing frame counter field (bits 8-12)\n\nStructure Layout:\nVideoPlaybackState + 0x1ea (word):\n  Bits 0-7:   Reserved/other flags (preserved)\n  Bits 8-12:  Frame counter field (5 bits, unused in current implementation)\n  Bits 10-19: Frame counter field (10 bits, updated by this function)\n  Bits 13-15: Reserved/other flags (preserved)",
      "tags": ["PARAM_0", "PROP_LEAF", "PROP_SMALL"]
    },
