      "comment": "Checks if remote desktop session handling is ready and properly configured.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call GetSystemMetrics(SM_REMOTESESSION) to detect if running in remote desktop session\n2. Validate that remote session flag (g_dwRemoteSessionFlag) is enabled\n3. Check if remote session state (g_dwRemoteSessionState) equals 1 (active state)\n4. Return true if remote session is disabled (g_dwRemoteSessionEnabled == 0), false otherwise\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nbool - true if remote session handling is ready and session is disabled, false otherwise\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Returns false immediately if not running in remote desktop session\n- Returns false if remote session flag is disabled\n- Returns false if remote session state is not active (value != 1)\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x4B (75) - SM_REMOTESESSION system metric to detect remote desktop session\n1 - Active state value for g_dwRemoteSessionState\n0 - Disabled state value for g_dwRemoteSessionEnabled indicating session is not active",
