      "instructions": ["0xB940|PUSH|ESI", "0xB941|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [0x6fba61e8]", "0xB947|PUSH|0x4b", "0xB949|CALL|ESI", "0xB94B|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0xB94D|JZ|0x6fadb994", "0xB94F|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbe9298]", "0xB954|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0xB956|JZ|0x6fadba00", "0xB95C|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbe91c0]", "0xB961|DEC|EAX", "0xB962|JZ|0x6fadb978", "0xB964|DEC|EAX", "0xB965|JNZ|0x6fadb994", "0xB967|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbe91b4]"],
      "comment": "Processes remote session messages based on system metrics and session state\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if system is remote session enabled (SM_REMOTESESSION metric 0x4b)\n2. If not remote, skip to final metrics check \n3. If remote session enabled, determine session state and type\n4. For session state 1 (WTS_SESSION_LOCK): Send message array 1\n5. For session state 2 (WTS_SESSION_UNLOCK) with types 4/5: Send message array 1\n6. Send additional message arrays 2 for active remote sessions\n7. Handle special case for session type 5 (not 4): Send message array 3\n8. Final check: If remote enabled and session state allows, send message array 4\n9. Return session type for state 2, or processed message count otherwise\n\nParameters:\n(void) - No parameters\n\nReturns:\nint - Session type value for state 2, or processed message count for other states\n      0 if no remote session active\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x4b (75) - SM_REMOTESESSION system metric\n0x1 - Session state: WTS_SESSION_LOCK\n0x2 - Session state: WTS_SESSION_UNLOCK  \n0x4 - Session type: Console session\n0x5 - Session type: Remote session\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Function checks SM_REMOTESESSION twice for validation\n- Complex branching logic handles various remote session combinations\n- Session type 5 requires special message array handling\n- Global flag DAT_6fbaf7bc enables additional message processing\n\nStructure Layout:\nMessageEntry (12 bytes):\nOffset | Size | Type | Description\n-------|------|------|------------\n0x0    | 4    | uint | Message ID or type\n0x4    | 4    | uint | Message parameter 1  \n0x8    | 4    | uint | Message parameter 2\n\nGlobal Variables:\ng_dwRemoteSessionEnabled (0x6fbe9298) - Remote session capability flag\ng_dwSessionState (0x6fbe91c0) - Current session state (1=lock, 2=unlock)\ng_dwSessionType (0x6fbe91b4) - Session type (4=console, 5=remote)\nDAT_6fbaf7bc - Additional remote session processing flag\n\nMessage Arrays:\nDAT_6fbaf830 - Primary remote session messages\nDAT_6fbaf840 - Secondary session state messages  \nDAT_6fbaf858 - Session type 5 specific messages\nDAT_6fbaf870 - Additional processing messages",
      "tags": ["PARAM_0"]
    },
