      "comment": "Destructor for TSExplicitList template container holding USGAMEDATA elements.\nClears all list nodes, unlinks linked elements from the hash buckets, destroys\nbucket nodes, and frees the bucket array memory.\n\nClassification: Cleanup/Destructor\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Clear nFlags field to 0\n2. While nActiveNodeOffset > 0:\n   - Call UnlinkListNode on (pNodeBase + nActiveNodeOffset)\n   - This unlinks all active nodes from the list\n3. For each bucket (0 to nBucketCount-1):\n   - Get bucket at offset (dwBucketIndex * 0x0C) in pBuckets array\n   - While bucket has valid node offset (> 0):\n     - Compute node address from bucket base + offset\n     - If node has a next link (!= 0):\n       - Calculate target link address using relative offset\n       - If offset is negative, use bitwise NOT as absolute address\n       - Otherwise compute relative position from current node\n       - Unlink node by updating prev/next pointers\n       - Clear node's forward and backward links to 0\n4. Reset nFlags and nField24 to 0\n5. For each bucket (0 to nBucketCount-1):\n   - Call DestroyListNode on bucket with bFreeMemory=false\n6. If pBuckets is not NULL:\n   - Free pBuckets array via SMemFree\n7. Clear nCapacity, nBucketCount, and pBuckets to 0\n\nParameters:\n  pList (ECX) - Pointer to TSExplicitList structure to destroy\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - If nActiveNodeOffset <= 0, skip node unlinking loop\n  - If nBucketCount == 0, skip bucket processing loops\n  - If pBuckets is NULL, skip SMemFree call\n\nStructure Layout (TSExplicitList - 40 bytes):\n  Offset  Size  Field             Type                   Description\n  0x00    4     pVtable           void *                 Virtual function table\n  0x04    4     pNodeBase         void *                 Base pointer for list nodes\n  0x08    4     nPadding08        uint                   Reserved/padding\n  0x0C    4     nActiveNodeOffset int                    Offset to active node list head\n  0x10    4     nFlags            uint                   State flags (cleared on destroy)\n  0x14    4     nCapacity         uint                   Allocated capacity\n  0x18    4     nBucketCount      uint                   Number of hash buckets\n  0x1C    4     pBuckets          TSExplicitListNode *   Array of bucket nodes\n  0x20    4     nPadding20        uint                   Reserved/padding\n  0x24    4     nField24          uint                   Unknown field (cleared on destroy)\n\nMemory:\n  - Function does NOT free the TSExplicitList structure itself\n  - Only frees the pBuckets array via SMemFree\n  - Caller responsible for freeing pList after this returns",
