      "instructions": ["0xDA90|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbe9260]", "0xDA95|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0xDA97|JZ|0x6fadda9e", "0xDA99|CMP|EAX, 0x1", "0xDA9C|JNZ|0x6faddaa7", "0xDA9E|CALL|0x6fb992c2", "0xDAA3|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0xDAA5|JNZ|0x6faddae3", "0xDAA7|CALL|0x6fb99858", "0xDAAC|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0xDAAE|JNZ|0x6faddad6", "0xDAB0|MOV|ECX, 0x6", "0xDAB5|CALL|0x6fad9070", "0xDABA|MOV|dword ptr [0x6fbe92f8], 0x1", "0xDAC4|MOV|dword ptr [0x6fbe9268], 0x0"],
      "comment": "Callback to validate and initialize game session during connection setup\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check server port mode - if local game (port 0 or 1), verify network subsystem\n2. Call D2Net.Ordinal_10026 to check network initialization status\n3. If network check fails (returns non-zero), abort and return false\n4. Call D2Net.Ordinal_10025 to validate connection readiness\n5. If connection not ready (returns non-zero), check for pending state (==2)\n6. On success path (connection ready), initialize game difficulty to level 6\n7. Set g_dwGameSystemInitialized=1 to mark system as ready\n8. Clear g_dwPostGameStateFlags=0 to reset state machine\n9. Return true on successful initialization\n\nParameters:\nNone - uses global state for server port and connection status\n\nReturns:\nbool - true if game session initialized successfully\n     - false if network check failed (local game with network error)\n     - (EAX==2) if connection pending/waiting state\n\nSpecial Cases:\nLocal Game Mode: Server port 0 or 1 triggers network validation via Ordinal_10026\nNetwork Game Mode: Port values other than 0/1 skip Ordinal_10026 check\nPending State: Return value of 2 from Ordinal_10025 returns true (pending connection)\n\nOrdinal Functions:\nOrdinal_10026 (D2Net): Check network initialization - returns 0 on success\nOrdinal_10025 (D2Net): Validate connection ready state - returns 0=ready, 2=pending\n\nGlobal Variables:\ng_dwServerPort (0x6fbe9260): Server port mode (0=local, 1=local, other=network)\ng_dwGameSystemInitialized (0x6fbe92f8): Game system ready flag\ng_dwPostGameStateFlags (0x6fbe9268): Post-game state machine flags\n\nCalled By:\nProcessMessagePumpWithCallback in FUN_6faddaf0 - used during game connection flow",
