      "instructions": ["0xDAF0|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbe9260]", "0xDAF5|MOV|dword ptr [0x6fbe9268], 0x0", "0xDAFF|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0xDB01|JNZ|0x6faddb12", "0xDB03|PUSH|0x1", "0xDB05|PUSH|0x1", "0xDB07|CALL|0x6fb99870", "0xDB0C|PUSH|0x0", "0xDB0E|PUSH|0x1", "0xDB10|JMP|0x6faddb23", "0xDB12|CMP|EAX, 0x1", "0xDB15|JNZ|0x6faddb3b", "0xDB17|PUSH|EAX", "0xDB18|PUSH|0x2", "0xDB1A|CALL|0x6fb99870"],
      "comment": "Shuts down the current game session based on server port configuration.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Clear post-game state flags (g_dwPostGameStateFlags = 0)\n2. Branch based on g_dwServerPort value:\n   - Port 0 (Single-player): Initialize network (Ordinal_10003), start session (Ordinal_10000),\n     process messages with FUN_6fadda90 callback, terminate session (Ordinal_10023)\n   - Port 1 (TCP/IP): Same as port 0\n   - Port 4 (Open Battle.net via IP): Connect to g_szBattleNetServerIp2, start session,\n     process messages, skip compression init\n   - Port 6/8 (Closed Battle.net): Initialize network (Ordinal_10003), process network queue\n     (Ordinal_10026), terminate session (Ordinal_10023), start session (Ordinal_10000),\n     process messages\n   - Other ports: Connect to g_szBattleNetServerIp1, start session, process messages,\n     skip compression init\n3. Initialize compression service (Ordinal_10002) and set g_fCompressionServiceInitialized = 1\n4. Finalize compression (Ordinal_10046)\n5. Record connection start time via GetTickCount()\n6. Clear g_dwGameSystemInitialized = 0\n7. Process game connection timeout via ProcessGameConnectionTimeout callback\n8. Pop application mode from stack\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Ports 4, non-6, non-8: Skip compression initialization entirely (goto LAB_6faddbb4)\n- Ports 6 and 8 (Closed Battle.net): Include queue processing (Ordinal_10026)\n- Single-player and TCP/IP (0, 1): Identical handling\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0 - Single-player mode\n1 - TCP/IP direct connect mode\n4 - Open Battle.net (IP-based)\n6 - Closed Battle.net realm\n8 - Closed Battle.net realm (alternate)\n0x6fbaf3f4 - g_szBattleNetServerIp1 (207.82.87.243)\n0x6fbaf4f8 - g_szBattleNetServerIp2 (207.82.87.139)\n\nD2Net Ordinal Reference:\nOrdinal_10000 - D2Net.StartSession - Begin network session\nOrdinal_10002 - D2Net.InitCompression - Initialize packet compression\nOrdinal_10003 - D2Net.InitNetwork - Initialize network subsystem\nOrdinal_10023 - D2Net.TerminateSession - End current network session\nOrdinal_10026 - D2Net.ProcessNetQueue - Process pending network operations\nOrdinal_10046 - D2Net.FinalizeCompression - Complete compression setup",
      "tags": ["PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_0"]
    },
