      "comment": "Updates entity position coordinates and reorganizes entity management structures.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate entity ID is not -1 (invalid)\n2. Search entity management structures (DAT_6fbee284) for matching entity ID\n3. Check if entity already exists in child list at offset +0x38\n4. If entity found and not duplicate, update coordinates and data:\n   - Store X coordinate at offset +0x22\n   - Store Y coordinate at offset +0x20  \n   - Store entity data at offset +0x30\n5. Call FUN_6fae1650() for entity update notification\n6. Get current entity ID from FUN_6fb62880() +0x8 offset\n7. Search for current entity and extract X coordinate at offset +0x22\n8. Process entity cleanup loop - call FUN_6fadf420/FUN_6fadf4c0 on all entities\n9. Clear entity management structure (DAT_6fbee284 = 0)\n10. Rebuild entity list from DAT_6fbee28c based on sorting mode:\n    - If sorting disabled: call FUN_6fadf2e0()\n    - If sorting enabled: call FUN_6fadf3a0()\n11. Call FUN_6fadf520() for list reorganization\n12. If target entity found, move it to front of list\n13. Rebuild linked entity structures, linking all nodes via offset +0x80\n14. Call cleanup functions FUN_6fadf480() and FUN_6fb30200()\n15. If no target entity, call FUN_6fadf7d0() with current entity ID\n\nParameters:\nnEntityId - Entity identifier to update (-1 = invalid)\nwXCoord - New X coordinate position  \nwYCoord - New Y coordinate position\ndwParam4 - Unused parameter (reserved)\ndwEntityData - Entity-specific data stored at offset +0x30\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Returns early if nEntityId is -1 (invalid entity)\n- Returns early if DAT_6fbee284 is NULL (no entity structures)\n- Returns early if entity already exists in child list (duplicate prevention)\n- Target entity coordinate extraction returns -1 if entity not found\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset | Size | Field Name    | Type | Description\n+0x10  | 4    | dwEntityId    | int  | Primary entity identifier\n+0x20  | 2    | wYCoordinate  | short| Y position coordinate\n+0x22  | 2    | wXCoordinate  | short| X position coordinate  \n+0x30  | 4    | dwEntityData  | uint | Entity-specific data/flags\n+0x38  | 4    | pChildList    | ptr  | Pointer to child entity list\n+0x80  | 4    | pNextStruct   | ptr  | Pointer to next entity structure\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0xFFFF - Invalid coordinate value (-1 as short)\n0x10   - Offset to entity ID in structure\n0x20   - Offset to Y coordinate in structure\n0x22   - Offset to X coordinate in structure\n0x30   - Offset to entity data in structure\n0x38   - Offset to child list pointer\n0x80   - Offset to next structure pointer",
