      "comment": "Cleanup and reorganize player slot management structures.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate input player ID (-1 triggers fatal error with message)\n2. Search and remove matching player node from g_PlayerNodeList\n   - Traverse linked list comparing player ID at offset 0x10  \n   - Unlink node by updating previous node's next pointer (offset 0x80)\n   - Free node's internal lists at offsets 0x34 and 0x38\n   - Free the node itself using Ordinal_10043(0x12e)\n3. Get current active player ID from game state\n4. Search for current player node in list or sublists\n5. Build temporary SlotNode list from all remaining player nodes\n   - Extract slot ID from offset 0x22 of each player node\n   - Create or reuse SlotNode structures via FUN_6fadf400/Ordinal_10042\n   - Process slot data using sort mode selection (IsSortingModeEnabled)\n6. Execute slot processing via FUN_6fadf520\n7. Reorganize slots to prioritize current player's slot\n   - Move current player's slot to head of list if found\n   - Rebuild main player list from processed slot data  \n8. Clean up temporary SlotNode list structures\n9. Update player state if no current player (FUN_6fadf7d0)\n10. Trigger final update via FUN_6fb30200\n\nParameters:\nnPlayerId (int): Target player ID to cleanup, -1 for invalid/debug mode\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- nPlayerId = -1: Triggers debug assertion with \"INVALID_PLAYER_ID\" message\n- No current player (ID = -1): Calls FUN_6fadf7d0 for state reset\n- Missing SlotNode: Creates new structure via Ordinal_10042(0x1f9)\n\nStructure Layout:\nPlayerNode (estimated 132+ bytes):\nOffset  Size  Field Name    Type      Description  \n0x10    4     dwPlayerId    uint      Player identifier\n0x22    2     wSlotId       ushort    Slot identifier \n0x34    4     pList1        void*     First internal list\n0x38    4     pList2        void*     Second internal list  \n0x80    4     pNext         void*     Next player node\n\nSlotNode (12 bytes):\nOffset  Size  Field Name    Type      Description\n0x0     2     wSlotId       ushort    Slot identifier\n0x4     4     pSlotData     void*     Processed slot data\n0x8     4     pNext         void*     Next slot node\n\nGlobal Variables:\ng_PlayerNodeList (0x6fbee284): Head of player node linked list\ng_SlotNodeList (0x6fbee28c): Head of temporary slot node list",
