      "comment": "Remove a player action from the action queue by player ID and action type.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load global ShortListNode head pointer from DAT_6fbee28c\n2. Validate nActionType is not -1 (0xFFFF), return early if invalid\n3. Traverse ShortListNode linked list searching for matching nActionType\n4. If matching ShortListNode found and has previous node:\n   - Remove current node from list by updating previous node's next pointer\n   - Move current node to head of global list (reorganization)\n5. Access PlayerActionNode list from ShortListNode.pActionList (offset +0x4)  \n6. Traverse PlayerActionNode linked list searching for matching nPlayerId (offset +0x10)\n7. If matching PlayerActionNode found and has previous node:\n   - Remove current node from list by updating previous node's next pointer (offset +0x80)\n   - Move current node to head of ShortListNode's action list\n\nParameters:\nnPlayerId (ECX): int - Player identifier to match against PlayerActionNode.nPlayerId\nnActionType (DX): short - Action type identifier to match against ShortListNode.nActionType\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value, function performs list manipulation only\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Returns early if nActionType is -1 (0xFFFF) - invalid action type marker\n- Returns early if no ShortListNode matches nActionType\n- Returns early if no PlayerActionNode matches nPlayerId\n- Returns early if matching node has no previous node (head node removal case)\n\nStructure Layout:\nShortListNode (12 bytes):\n| Offset | Size | Field Name   | Type              | Description                    |\n|--------|------|--------------|-------------------|--------------------------------|\n| 0x0    | 2    | nActionType  | short             | Action type identifier         |\n| 0x4    | 4    | pActionList  | PlayerActionNode* | Pointer to first action node  |\n| 0x8    | 4    | pNext        | ShortListNode*    | Pointer to next short node    |\n\nPlayerActionNode (100+ bytes):\n| Offset | Size | Field Name   | Type              | Description                    |\n|--------|------|--------------|-------------------|--------------------------------|\n| 0x10   | 4    | nPlayerId    | int               | Player identifier              |\n| 0x80   | 4    | pNext        | PlayerActionNode* | Pointer to next action node   |",
