      "comment": "Retrieves the ActId from a UnitAny object with null pointer validation\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if pUnitAny pointer is null\n2. If null, return 0 (invalid ActId)\n3. If valid, access UnitAny.dwActId field at offset +0x18\n4. Return the ActId value as uint\n\nParameters:\npUnitAny - Pointer to UnitAny structure to read ActId from\n\nReturns:\nuint - ActId value from UnitAny.dwActId field, or 0 if pUnitAny is null\n\nSpecial Cases:\nNull pointer safety: Returns 0 when pUnitAny is null to prevent access violations\n\nStructure Layout:\nUnitAny structure (48 bytes total):\nOffset | Size | Field Name | Type    | Description\n-------|------|------------|---------|-------------\n  0x00 |   4  | dwUnitType | uint    | Unit type identifier  \n  0x04 |   4  | dwClassId  | uint    | Class identifier\n  0x08 |   4  | pMemPool   | void *  | Memory pool pointer\n  0x0C |   4  | dwUnitId   | uint    | Unique unit identifier\n  0x10 |   4  | dwMode     | uint    | Current unit mode\n  0x14 |   4  | pUnitData  | void *  | Unit-specific data\n  0x18 |   4  | dwActId    | uint    | ** Act identifier (accessed by this function)\n  0x1C |   4  | pAct       | void *  | Pointer to Act structure\n  0x20 |   4  | pSeed      | void *  | Seed pointer for randomization\n  0x24 |   4  | pPath      | void *  | Path data pointer  \n  0x28 |   4  | dwGfxFrame | uint    | Graphics frame counter\n  0x2C |   4  | dwFrameRemain | uint | Remaining frame count",
