      "comment": "Updates the position coordinates for a specific player in the global player list.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate input parameters - ensure player ID is not -1 and player list exists\n2. Traverse main player list starting from g_pPlayerListHead\n3. For each player slot node, check if player ID at offset +0x10 matches target\n4. If no match in main node, traverse sub-nodes linked list at offset +0x38\n5. For each sub-node, check player ID at offset +0x0 for match\n6. When player found, update position coordinates:\n   - Store X coordinate (dwXCoord) at offset +0x28\n   - Store Y coordinate (dwYCoord) at offset +0x2c\n7. Continue to next main node via pointer at offset +0x80 if no match found\n8. Return without error if player not found\n\nParameters:\nnPlayerId (int): Player identifier to search for in the list (-1 = invalid)\ndwXCoord (uint): New X coordinate position to store for the player\ndwYCoord (uint): New Y coordinate position to store for the player\n\nReturns:\nvoid: No return value, updates are performed in-place on player data structure\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Player ID -1 is treated as invalid input, function returns immediately\n- Empty player list (g_pPlayerListHead == 0) causes early return\n- Player not found in list results in no-op, no error indication\n- Null pointer checks prevent crashes when traversing linked structures\n\nStructure Layout:\nPlayerSlotNode structure accessed with these key offsets:\nOffset | Size | Field Name          | Type              | Description\n+0x00  | 4    | dwPlayerId         | uint              | Player identifier (sub-nodes only)\n+0x10  | 4    | dwMainPlayerId     | uint              | Player identifier (main nodes)  \n+0x28  | 4    | dwXCoordinate      | uint              | Player X position coordinate\n+0x2c  | 4    | dwYCoordinate      | uint              | Player Y position coordinate\n+0x38  | 4    | pSubNodeList       | PlayerSlotNode *  | Pointer to sub-node linked list\n+0x80  | 4    | pNextMainNode      | PlayerSlotNode *  | Pointer to next main list node\n\nGlobal References:\ng_pPlayerListHead (0x6fbee284): Head pointer to main player slot list",
