      "comment": "Search player list by ID and retrieve associated data value.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate player ID is not -1 (invalid marker)\n2. Check if global player list head is initialized\n3. Iterate through main player list (PlayerListNode chain)\n4. For each main player node, compare ID field at offset 0x10 with target\n5. If main node matches, return data value from offset 0x34\n6. If no main node match, search nested sub-list at offset 0x38\n7. Iterate through sub-list (PlayerSubNode chain linked at offset 0x4)\n8. For each sub-node, compare ID at offset 0x0 with target\n9. If sub-node matches, return data value from main node offset 0x34\n10. Continue to next main player node via offset 0x80 link\n11. Return 0 if no matching player ID found\n\nParameters:\n  nPlayerId - int: Player identifier to search for (-1 = invalid)\n\nReturns:\n  uint: Player data value from PlayerListNode offset 0x34, or 0 if not found\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Returns 0 immediately if nPlayerId is -1\n  - Returns 0 if g_pPlayerListHead is NULL (empty list)\n  - Returns 0 if matching player node pointer becomes NULL (corrupted list)\n\nStructure Layout:\nPlayerListNode (154 bytes):\n  Offset  Size  Field Name      Type           Description\n  0x10    4     dwPlayerId      uint           Player identifier\n  0x34    4     dwPlayerData    uint           Associated player data value\n  0x38    4     pSubList        PlayerSubNode* Nested sub-player list head\n  0x80    4     pNext           PlayerListNode* Next node in main list\n\nPlayerSubNode (8 bytes):\n  Offset  Size  Field Name      Type           Description  \n  0x0     4     dwSubPlayerId   uint           Sub-player identifier\n  0x4     4     pNext           PlayerSubNode* Next node in sub-list\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0x10 - Player ID field offset in PlayerListNode\n  0x34 - Player data field offset in PlayerListNode  \n  0x38 - Sub-list head pointer offset in PlayerListNode\n  0x80 - Next pointer offset in PlayerListNode\n  0x0  - Player ID field offset in PlayerSubNode\n  0x4  - Next pointer offset in PlayerSubNode\n  -1   - Invalid player ID sentinel value",
