      "globals": ["0x11E284|g_pPlayerListHead|00000000", "0xFFFFFFFF90530000||", "0xFFFFFFFF90530004||", "0xFFFFFFFF9053001C||", "0x11E288|g_pRosterListHead|0x0"],
      "api_count": 4,
      "api_calls": ["FogMemAlloc", "FogAssert", "FogMemAlloc", "FogAssert"],
      "instructions": ["0x10CD0|PUSH|EBX", "0x10CD1|MOV|EBX, ECX", "0x10CD3|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [0x6fbee284]", "0x10CD9|PUSH|EBP", "0x10CDA|CMP|EBX, -0x1", "0x10CDD|PUSH|ESI", "0x10CDE|MOV|EBP, EDX", "0x10CE0|JZ|0x6fae0d0f", "0x10CE2|TEST|ECX, ECX", "0x10CE4|JZ|0x6fae0d0f", "0x10CE6|CMP|dword ptr [ECX + 0x10], EBX", "0x10CE9|JZ|0x6fae0d09", "0x10CEB|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ECX + 0x38]", "0x10CEE|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x10CF0|JZ|0x6fae0cfd"],
      "comment": "Adds a player to the roster list and associates a body/unit ID with them.\n\nIf the player ID already exists in the roster (either as a primary node or in a\nsub-node list), uses the existing node. Otherwise, allocates a new PlayerListNode\n(132 bytes), zero-initializes it, and prepends it to the secondary roster list\n(g_pRosterListHead). Then ensures the body ID is linked to the player's sub-node list.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If nPlayerId == -1, skip search and create new node\n2. Search g_pPlayerListHead linked list for matching player ID\n3. For each node, also search its sub-node list (offset 0x38) for matching ID\n4. If found, use existing node; otherwise allocate new 0x84-byte PlayerListNode\n5. Zero-initialize new node with REP STOSD (0x21 dwords = 132 bytes)\n6. Set node's nPlayerId field at offset 0x10\n7. Link new node into g_pRosterListHead list via offset 0x80\n8. Search node's sub-node list for matching nBodyId\n9. If nBodyId not found, allocate 8-byte sub-node (id + next pointer)\n10. Zero-initialize sub-node, set id to nBodyId, prepend to sub-node list\n\nParameters:\n  nPlayerId (ECX) - Player ID to find or create roster entry for (-1 for always new)\n  nBodyId (EDX) - Body/unit ID to associate with the player's sub-node list\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nStructure Layout (PlayerListNode, 132 bytes):\n  Offset  Size  Field            Description\n  0x00    16    dwUnknown0-3     Zero-initialized fields\n  0x10    4     nPlayerId        Player identifier\n  0x14    36    ...              Additional fields\n  0x38    4     pSubNodeList     Pointer to linked list of body IDs (8-byte nodes)\n  0x3C    68    abTargetData     Target/position data\n  0x80    4     pNextNode        Pointer to next PlayerListNode\n\nSub-node structure (8 bytes):\n  Offset  Size  Field            Description\n  0x00    4     nBodyId          Body/unit identifier\n  0x04    4     pNext            Pointer to next sub-node\n\nError Handling:\n  - FogAssert with \"ptRoster\" if main node allocation fails, then exit(-1)\n  - FogAssert with \"ptBody\" if sub-node allocation fails, then exit(-1)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - nPlayerId == -1: Always creates new node without searching\n  - Existing node found: Reuses node, only adds body ID if not already present",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_2", "STRUCT_Other", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "MOD_GAME", "SRC_Roster.cpp"]
    },
