      "instructions": ["0x10DD0|PUSH|ESI", "0x10DD1|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [0x6fbee284]", "0x10DD7|PUSH|EDI", "0x10DD8|XOR|EDI, EDI", "0x10DDA|CMP|ECX, -0x1", "0x10DDD|JZ|0x6fae0e44", "0x10DDF|TEST|ESI, ESI", "0x10DE1|JZ|0x6fae0e44", "0x10DE3|CMP|dword ptr [ESI + 0x10], ECX", "0x10DE6|JZ|0x6fae0e06", "0x10DE8|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESI + 0x38]", "0x10DEB|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x10DED|JZ|0x6fae0dfa", "0x10DEF|CMP|dword ptr [EAX], ECX", "0x10DF1|JZ|0x6fae0e06"],
      "comment": "Removes a PlayerSubNode from a player's roster linked list.\n\nSearches the global player list (g_pPlayerListHead) to find a PlayerListNode\nmatching nPlayerId, then searches that node's sub-list (offset 0x38) to find\nand unlink a PlayerSubNode matching nSubNodeId.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load g_pPlayerListHead into ESI, initialize EDI to NULL (previous pointer)\n2. If nPlayerId is -1, exit early (invalid ID)\n3. If g_pPlayerListHead is NULL, exit (no player list)\n4. Compare PlayerListNode.field_0x10 with nPlayerId\n5. If not match, search sub-list at offset 0x38:\n   a. Load sub-list head from [ESI + 0x38]\n   b. Walk sub-list comparing [node + 0x0] with nPlayerId\n   c. Follow next pointer at [node + 0x4]\n6. If not found in sub-list, follow PlayerListNode.field_0x80 to next node\n7. Once player node found, search its sub-list for nSubNodeId:\n   a. Load sub-list from [ESI + 0x38]\n   b. Compare [node + 0x0] with nSubNodeId\n   c. Track previous node in EDI for unlinking\n8. If sub-node found:\n   a. If EDI != NULL: [EDI + 0x4] = [ECX + 0x4] (unlink from middle)\n   b. If EDI == NULL: [ESI + 0x38] = [ECX + 0x4] (unlink from head)\n   c. Call ReleasePoolAllocation(ECX, 0x6fbb00d4, 0x6b3, 0) to free node\n\nParameters:\n  nPlayerId (ECX): Player ID to search for in PlayerListNode list\n  nSubNodeId (EDX): Sub-node ID to find and remove from sub-list\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - nPlayerId == -1: Early exit, no action\n  - g_pPlayerListHead == NULL: Early exit, no player data\n  - Player not found: Silent exit\n  - Sub-node not found: Silent exit\n\nStructure Layout (PlayerListNode):\n  Offset  Size  Field                 Description\n  0x10    4     nPlayerId             Player identifier for matching\n  0x38    4     pSubNodeListHead      Pointer to PlayerSubNode linked list\n  0x80    4     pNextPlayerListNode   Next node in player list\n\nStructure Layout (PlayerSubNode):\n  Offset  Size  Field       Description\n  0x00    4     nNodeId     Node identifier for matching\n  0x04    4     pNext       Next node in sub-list\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x6b3 (1715): Pool allocation line number for debugging\n  0x6fbb00d4: Pool allocator context pointer",
      "tags": ["PARAM_2", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY", "MOD_GAME", "SRC_Roster.cpp"]
    },
