      "instructions": ["0x10E50|PUSH|ESI", "0x10E51|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [0x6fbee284]", "0x10E57|CMP|EDX, -0x1", "0x10E5A|JZ|0x6fae0eab", "0x10E5C|TEST|ESI, ESI", "0x10E5E|JZ|0x6fae0eab", "0x10E60|CMP|dword ptr [ESI + 0x10], EDX", "0x10E63|JZ|0x6fae0e83", "0x10E65|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESI + 0x38]", "0x10E68|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x10E6A|JZ|0x6fae0e77", "0x10E6C|CMP|dword ptr [EAX], EDX", "0x10E6E|JZ|0x6fae0e83", "0x10E70|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [EAX + 0x4]", "0x10E73|TEST|EAX, EAX"],
      "comment": "Checks if requesting player has permission for target player operations\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate target player ID is not -1 (invalid ID check)\n2. Verify global player list head is initialized and not null\n3. Iterate through main player list searching for target player ID:\n   a. Compare current node's player ID with target player ID\n   b. If match found, jump to permission check logic\n   c. If no direct match, search sub-node list recursively:\n      - Traverse linked list of sub-nodes using next pointer at offset +4\n      - Compare each sub-node's player ID with target player ID\n      - If found in sub-node list, jump to permission check logic\n   d. Move to next player node using pointer at offset 0x80 (abTargetData + 4)\n4. Permission check logic (LAB_6fae0e83):\n   a. Verify player node pointer is not null (safety check)\n   b. Compare requesting player ID with found player's ID\n   c. If IDs match (same player), return 1 (permission granted)\n   d. If different players, call permission validation function\n   e. Return permission check result (1 if granted, 0 if denied)\n5. Return 0 if target player not found in any list\n\nParameters:\nnRequestingPlayerId (ECX) - Player ID making the permission request\nnTargetPlayerId (EDX) - Player ID for which permission is being checked\n\nReturns:\n1 (dword) - Permission granted or same player\n0 (dword) - Permission denied or target player not found\n\nSpecial Cases:\nTarget player ID -1 returns 0 (invalid player ID)\nNull player list head returns 0 (uninitialized system)\nSame requesting and target player returns 1 (self-permission)\nPlayer not found in main or sub-node lists returns 0\n\nStructure Layout:\nPlayerListNode structure accessed at multiple offsets:\nOffset | Size | Field Name      | Type              | Description\n0x10   | 4    | nPlayerId       | int               | Unique player identifier\n0x38   | 4    | pSubNodeList    | int *             | Pointer to sub-node linked list\n0x80   | 4    | Next Node Ptr   | PlayerListNode *  | Pointer to next player (via abTargetData + 4)\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0xFFFFFFFF (-1) - Invalid player ID constant\n0x10 (16) - Offset to nPlayerId field in PlayerListNode\n0x38 (56) - Offset to pSubNodeList field in PlayerListNode  \n0x80 (128) - Offset to abTargetData field in PlayerListNode\n0x04 (4) - Next pointer offset within abTargetData field\n0x01 (1) - Permission check flag parameter to validation function",
      "tags": ["PARAM_2"]
    },
