      "comment": "Processes inventory slot decrement packet data and updates render context.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract X position (ushort) from packet offset +1\n2. Extract Y position (ushort) from packet offset +3\n3. Validate g_hRenderContext is not NULL (assert and exit if NULL)\n4. Get game context via GetGameContext()\n5. If game context exists, get room via UNITS_GetRoom()\n6. Call DecrefInventorySlots with render context, slot index, X, Y, and room\n\nParameters:\n  pbPacketData (ECX) - Pointer to packet data structure:\n    +0x00: byte   - Packet type (not used directly)\n    +0x01: ushort - X position\n    +0x03: ushort - Y position\n    +0x05: byte   - Slot index\n\nReturns: void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - If g_hRenderContext is NULL, triggers FogAssert with \"ghAct\" message\n    at D2Client.cpp line 0x6BE (1726) and exits with code -1\n  - If game context is NULL, passes NULL room context to DecrefInventorySlots\n\nGlobals Referenced:\n  g_hRenderContext (0x6fbe9284) - Current render/inventory context",
