      "comment": "CreateUnitFromParams - Wrapper function that extracts fields from UnitCreationParams structure and forwards to AllocateAndInitializeUnit\n\nFunction Classification: Thunk/Wrapper - translates a packed parameter structure into individual arguments\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract byVisibilityMode from pParams+0xd\n2. Extract bySpecialFlags from pParams+0xc\n3. Extract byStatCount from pParams+0x1\n4. Extract wInventorySlots from pParams+0xa\n5. Extract wUnitX from pParams+0x8\n6. Extract wUnitSubType from pParams+0x6\n7. Extract dwUnitType from pParams+0x2\n8. Call AllocateAndInitializeUnit with extracted values and nClassType=0\n\nParameters:\n  pParams (ECX) - UnitCreationParams *: Pointer to UnitCreationParams structure containing packed unit creation data\n  dwUnused (EDX) - uint: Unused parameter, upper 24 bits discarded (lower 8 bits may override bySpecialFlags via CONCAT31)\n\nReturns:\n  void - Return value from AllocateAndInitializeUnit is discarded\n\nStructure Layout (UnitCreationParams, 14 bytes):\n  Offset  Size  Field             Type    Description\n  0x00    1     byReserved        byte    Reserved/unused\n  0x01    1     byStatCount       byte    Number of stats for unit\n  0x02    4     dwUnitType        uint    Unit type identifier\n  0x06    2     wUnitSubType      ushort  Unit subtype/class\n  0x08    2     wUnitX            ushort  X coordinate for unit\n  0x0a    2     wInventorySlots   ushort  Number of inventory slots\n  0x0c    1     bySpecialFlags    byte    Special flags (may be modified by dwUnused lower byte)\n  0x0d    1     byVisibilityMode  byte    Visibility/rendering mode\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- The dwUnused parameter lower byte is combined with bySpecialFlags via CONCAT31 operation\n- nClassType argument to AllocateAndInitializeUnit is hardcoded to 0\n\nCross-References:\n- No callers detected - possibly dead code or called via function pointer",
