      "comment": "Processes packet header with subcommand validation against search criteria\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract combined flags and data value from packet structure at offset 0x2\n2. Check if subcommand field equals 0x1 (special processing mode)\n3. If subcommand is 0x1:\n   a. Initialize search value to 1\n   b. Get search context from FUN_6fb62880()\n   c. Find node matching criteria (search context, type 7, value 1)\n   d. Compare extracted flags/data against found search result\n   e. Exit early if values match (validation successful)\n4. If subcommand not 0x1 or validation fails:\n   a. Call FUN_6fb60ff0() with extracted value and subcommand\n\nParameters:\npPacketHeader (PacketHeader *): Packet structure containing subcommand and data fields\n   - Offset 0x1: bSubcommand - Command type, 0x1 triggers special validation\n   - Offset 0x2: Read as uint spanning bFlags+dwData for combined value\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value, processing handled via side effects\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Magic Number 0x1: Special subcommand triggering search validation\n- Magic Number 0x7: Search criteria type passed to FindNodeBySearchCriteria\n- Early return when validation succeeds (extracted value matches search result)\n\nStructure Layout:\nPacketHeader (7 bytes total):\nOffset | Size | Field Name  | Type | Description\n-------|------|-------------|------|------------------------------------------\n     0 |    1 | bCommandId  | byte | Primary command identifier\n     1 |    1 | bSubcommand | byte | Secondary command (0x1 = validation mode)\n     2 |    1 | bFlags      | byte | Flag bits\n     3 |    4 | dwData      | uint | Data payload\n\nError Handling:\n- No explicit error handling for null pointer validation\n- Assumes packet structure is valid and properly initialized\n- Validation failure results in fallback processing via FUN_6fb60ff0",
