      "comment": "Process incoming unit state action packet and optionally set player flag.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract action parameters from packet structure:\n   - wActionX from pPacket+0x7 (ushort)\n   - wActionY from pPacket+0x9 (ushort)\n   - nPlayerId from pPacket+0x2 (dword)\n   - byActionParam from pPacket+0xB (byte)\n   - byUnitType from pPacket+0x6 (byte)\n2. Build parameter array [dwActionX, dwActionY, dwActionParam] on stack\n3. Call DispatchUnitStateAction(byUnitType, pUnit, pParams, 1) to process action\n4. Check condition byte at pPacket+0x1:\n   - If zero: call SetPlayerFlagById(nPlayerId, pPacket+0xC) to set player flag\n   - If non-zero: skip flag setting\n5. Return\n\nParameters:\n- pUnit (UnitAny*, ECX): Target unit for state action dispatch\n- pPacket (byte*, EDX): Pointer to packet structure containing:\n  +0x01: byCondition - if 0, set player flag after dispatch\n  +0x02: nPlayerId (dword) - player ID for flag setting\n  +0x06: byUnitType (byte) - unit type for dispatch\n  +0x07: wActionX (ushort) - X coordinate or first param\n  +0x09: wActionY (ushort) - Y coordinate or second param  \n  +0x0B: byActionParam (byte) - additional action parameter\n  +0x0C: byFlagValue (byte) - flag value for SetPlayerFlagById\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If byCondition at pPacket+0x1 is non-zero, SetPlayerFlagById is skipped\n- Action dispatch always executed regardless of condition byte\n\nCallees:\n- DispatchUnitStateAction: Dispatches unit action based on type (0x6fb863a0)\n- SetPlayerFlagById: Sets flag on player node by ID (0x6fae1060)",
