      "comment": "Parse movement packet and dispatch unit state action.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract action parameters from packet into local state array:\n   - dwActionParam0 from pbPacket[0x0A] (byte)\n   - dwActionParam1 from pbPacket[0x0B] (dword)\n   - dwActionParam2 from pbPacket[0x0F] (byte)\n   - dwActionParam3 from pbPacket[0x11] (byte)\n   - nActionParam4 from pbPacket[0x12] (signed byte)\n   - dwActionParam5 from pbPacket[0x13] (byte)\n   - dwActionParam6 from pbPacket[0x10] (byte)\n2. Extract coordinates from packet: wXCoord from pbPacket[0x06], wYCoord from pbPacket[0x08]\n3. Call ValidateAndProcessUnitMovement with coordinates (nMovementType=0, nTargetX=0, nTargetY=0)\n4. Extract action type from pbPacket[0x05]\n5. Call DispatchUnitStateAction with action type, unit, and parameter array (nFlags=1)\n\nParameters:\npUnit (IMPLICIT ECX): Pointer to UnitAny structure to update\npbPacket (IMPLICIT EDX): Pointer to network packet data with movement/action info\n\nPacket Structure (20+ bytes):\nOffset  Size  Field           Description\n0x05    1     byActionType    Action type for DispatchUnitStateAction\n0x06    2     wXCoord         X coordinate for movement\n0x08    2     wYCoord         Y coordinate for movement\n0x0A    1     byParam0        Action parameter 0 (start of param array)\n0x0B    4     dwParam1        Action parameter 1\n0x0F    1     byParam2        Action parameter 2\n0x10    1     byParam6        Action parameter 6\n0x11    1     byParam3        Action parameter 3\n0x12    1     nParam4         Action parameter 4 (signed)\n0x13    1     byParam5        Action parameter 5\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Movement validation uses nMovementType=0 (normal movement) with no target\n- Action dispatch uses nFlags=1 (immediate execution)\n- Parameter array is 7 dwords on stack passed by reference to dispatcher",
