      "comment": "Unpacks a packed event structure and dispatches unit state action.\n\nClassification: Wrapper function - extracts fields from packed structure and forwards to DispatchUnitStateAction.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract unit type byte from pPackedEvent->bUnitType (+5)\n2. Extract ushort parameter from pPackedEvent->wParam0 (+6), zero-extend to dword\n3. Extract ushort parameter from pPackedEvent->wParam1 (+8), zero-extend to dword\n4. Extract byte parameter from pPackedEvent->bParam2 (+10), zero-extend to dword\n5. Extract byte parameter from pPackedEvent->bParam3 (+11), zero-extend to dword\n6. Build local parameter array with extracted values and constants (2, 4)\n7. Call DispatchUnitStateAction(nUnitType, pUnit, pParams, 1)\n\nParameters:\n- pUnit (UnitAny*, ECX): Pointer to unit receiving the state action\n- pPackedEvent (PackedUnitStateEvent*, EDX): Pointer to packed event structure\n\nPackedUnitStateEvent Structure Layout:\nOffset  Size  Field         Description\n+0x00   5     abHeader      Event header bytes (unused in this function)\n+0x05   1     bUnitType     Unit type for dispatch operation\n+0x06   2     wParam0       First parameter value\n+0x08   2     wParam1       Second parameter value\n+0x0a   1     bParam2       Third parameter value\n+0x0b   1     bParam3       Fourth parameter value\n\nLocal Parameter Array Layout (passed to DispatchUnitStateAction):\nIndex  Offset  Value         Source\n[0]    0x04    wParam0       pPackedEvent+6 (zero-extended)\n[1]    0x08    wParam1       pPackedEvent+8 (zero-extended)\n[2]    0x0c    bParam2       pPackedEvent+10 (zero-extended)\n[3]    0x10    2             Constant\n[4]    0x14    bParam3       pPackedEvent+11 (zero-extended)\n[5]    0x18    4             Constant\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- No callers found - likely invoked via function pointer table\n- Always passes nFlags=1 to DispatchUnitStateAction",
