      "comment": "Process unit movement and state action from network packet.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract movement coordinates (wMoveX, wMoveY) from pbPacket+0xC and pbPacket+0xE\n2. Call ValidateAndProcessUnitMovement(pUnit, wMoveX, wMoveY, 0, 0, 0) to update position\n3. Build state action parameter array on stack:\n   - dwTargetX from pbPacket+0x6 (ushort)\n   - dwTargetY from pbPacket+0x8 (ushort)\n   - dwActionType from pbPacket+0xB (byte)\n   - dwActionParam from pbPacket+0xA (byte)\n   - dwStateMode = 2 (constant)\n   - dwDispatchFlags = 4 (constant)\n4. Extract byUnitType from pbPacket+0x5 for dispatch selector\n5. Call DispatchUnitStateAction(byUnitType, pUnit, pParams, 1) to process action\n\nParameters:\npUnit (UnitAny*, ECX): Target unit for movement and state update\npbPacket (byte*, EDX): Network packet with structure:\n  +0x05: byUnitType (byte) - unit type for state dispatch\n  +0x06: wTargetX (ushort) - state action X parameter\n  +0x08: wTargetY (ushort) - state action Y parameter\n  +0x0A: byActionParam (byte) - action parameter value\n  +0x0B: byActionType (byte) - action type selector\n  +0x0C: wMoveX (ushort) - movement X coordinate\n  +0x0E: wMoveY (ushort) - movement Y coordinate\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nCallees:\n- ValidateAndProcessUnitMovement (0x6fb858f0): Validate and apply unit position\n- DispatchUnitStateAction (0x6fb863a0): Dispatch unit action by type",
