      "comment": "Process entity overlay loading with validation checks.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract overlay class ID from entity info structure (offset +6)\n2. Look up unit by entity type (offset +1) and ID (offset +2) \n3. Validate unit lookup succeeded, return early if not found\n4. Check if overlay class exceeds maximum allowed (0x124 = 292)\n5. If overlay class too large, trigger fatal error with debug info\n6. Process unit overlay using class ID and entity flags (offset +8)\n\nParameters:\n- pEntityInfo: EntityInfo * - Pointer to entity information structure\n\nReturns:\n- void - No return value, function exits early on errors\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Overlay class > 292: Triggers fatal error \"Overlay < NUM_OVERLAY_CLASSES\"\n- Unit lookup failure: Function returns silently without processing\n- Fatal error calls exit(-1) after logging to debug system\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n- 0x124 (292): Maximum allowed overlay class count\n- 0x8fa (2298): Error code for overlay validation failure \n- 0x97 (151): Special overlay class triggering additional processing\n- 0x98 (152): Special overlay class triggering different processing\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset | Size | Field Name    | Type   | Description\n-------|------|---------------|--------|------------------\n0      | 1    | bUnknown0     | byte   | Unknown field\n1      | 1    | bType         | byte   | Entity type for lookup\n2      | 4    | dwId          | uint   | Entity ID for lookup  \n6      | 2    | wOverlayClass | ushort | Overlay class to load\n8      | 1    | bFlags        | byte   | Processing flags",
