      "instructions": ["0x128B0|SUB|ESP, 0xc", "0x128B3|XOR|EAX, EAX", "0x128B5|MOV|AL, byte ptr [ECX]", "0x128B7|PUSH|EBX", "0x128B8|PUSH|EBP", "0x128B9|ADD|EAX, 0xffffff62", "0x128BE|XOR|EBP, EBP", "0x128C0|PUSH|ESI", "0x128C1|CMP|EAX, 0x4", "0x128C4|PUSH|EDI", "0x128C5|JA|0x6fae2976", "0x128CB|JMP|dword ptr [EAX*0x4 + 0x6fae2980]", "0x128D2|XOR|EAX, EAX", "0x128D4|XOR|EDX, EDX", "0x128D6|MOV|AL, byte ptr [ECX + 0x1]"],
      "comment": "Handles server-to-client packets for unit stat updates (0x9E-0xA2).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract packet type from first byte of packet data\n2. Switch on packet type to determine value encoding:\n   - 0x9E: Stat ID (byte), Unit ID (dword), Value (byte) - SetUnitStat\n   - 0x9F: Stat ID (byte), Unit ID (dword), Value (word) - SetUnitStat\n   - 0xA0: Stat ID (byte), Unit ID (dword), Value (dword) - SetUnitStat\n   - 0xA1: Stat ID (byte), Unit ID (dword), Value (byte) - SetOrAddInventoryStat\n   - 0xA2: Stat ID (byte), Unit ID (dword), Value (word) - SetOrAddInventoryStat\n3. Look up unit by ID in player unit hash table (slot type 1)\n4. If stat ID is 0xC (level), build node data struct and call ProcessUnitItemsFromNodeData\n5. Call SetOrAddInventoryStat for packets 0xA1/0xA2, SetUnitStat for 0x9E/0x9F/0xA0\n6. Return (no error handling for missing units)\n\nParameters:\n  pbPacketData (ECX): Pointer to raw packet buffer from server\n    - Offset 0: Packet type (0x9E-0xA2)\n    - Offset 1: Stat ID (byte)\n    - Offset 2-5: Unit ID (dword)\n    - Offset 6+: Stat value (size varies by packet type)\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value\n\nPacket Structure:\n  Offset  Size   Field\n  0x00    1      Packet type (0x9E-0xA2)\n  0x01    1      Stat ID\n  0x02    4      Unit ID (GUID)\n  0x06    1/2/4  Stat value (depends on packet type)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Stat ID 0xC (level stat): Creates temporary node data with packet type 0x47\n    and unit info, then processes via ProcessUnitItemsFromNodeData\n  - Packets 0xA1/0xA2 use SetOrAddInventoryStat (additive), others use SetUnitStat (set)",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_1"]
