      "api_count": 8,
      "api_calls": ["InitBitBuffer", "ReadBitsFromBuffer", "ReadBitsFromBuffer", "ReadBitsFromBuffer", "ReadBitsFromBuffer", "ReadBitsFromBuffer", "ReadBitsFromBuffer", "SetUnitStat"],
      "instructions": ["0x13150|SUB|ESP, 0x1c", "0x13153|PUSH|EDI", "0x13154|PUSH|0x9", "0x13156|LEA|EAX, [ESP + 0x14]", "0x1315A|PUSH|ECX", "0x1315B|PUSH|EAX", "0x1315C|CALL|0x6fb99b0a", "0x13161|LEA|ECX, [ESP + 0x10]", "0x13165|PUSH|0x8", "0x13167|PUSH|ECX", "0x13168|CALL|0x6fb99b04", "0x1316D|LEA|EDX, [ESP + 0x10]", "0x13171|PUSH|0xf", "0x13173|PUSH|EDX", "0x13174|CALL|0x6fb99b04"],
      "comment": "Parses a unit movement network packet and updates unit position and stats.\n\nClassification: Callback/Handler - Network packet handler for unit movement synchronization\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize bit buffer with 9 bytes of packet data\n2. Skip 8-bit packet header (message type identifier)\n3. Read 15-bit stat value (experience or stamina scaled value)\n4. Read 16-bit current X coordinate\n5. Read 16-bit current Y coordinate  \n6. Read 8-bit signed X velocity/delta\n7. Read 8-bit signed Y velocity/delta\n8. Get current game context (player unit)\n9. If unit is valid:\n   a. Set unit stat 10 with scaled stat value (value << 8)\n   b. Convert 8-bit deltas to signed values (subtract 0x100 if > 0x80)\n   c. Calculate target X = current X + signed delta X\n   d. Calculate target Y = current Y + signed delta Y\n   e. Call ValidateAndProcessUnitMovement with coordinates\n\nParameters:\n  pbPacketData - byte* [ECX] Pointer to 9-byte network packet buffer\n\nReturns: void\n\nBit Field Layout (72 bits / 9 bytes):\n  Offset  Bits  Field\n  0       8     Packet type header (discarded)\n  8       15    Stat value (experience/stamina)\n  23      16    Current X coordinate\n  39      16    Current Y coordinate\n  55      8     Signed X delta (-128 to 127)\n  63      8     Signed Y delta (-128 to 127)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x0A (10) - Stat ID for SetUnitStat (stamina/experience related)\n  0x80 - Signed byte threshold for delta conversion\n  0x100 - Subtraction value for signed conversion\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Returns immediately if GetGameContext returns NULL (no active unit)\n  - Delta values > 0x80 are converted to negative (two's complement style)",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
