      "comment": "HandleSetRotationPacket - Processes server rotation/cycle packet to update player unit orientation.\n\nClassification: Server Command Handler (Callback) - Called via command handler table for packet type 0x47.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract nCycle (4 bytes at offset +1) and nAngle (4 bytes at offset +5) from packet\n2. Validate g_hRenderContext is initialized; assert and exit if null\n3. Extract bAlt flag (1 byte at offset +9) from packet\n4. Get player entity unit via GetGameContextUnitStat()\n5. Call SetRotationAndCycle to apply rotation/cycle to render context\n6. Process all missiles and items via ProcessAllMissilesAndItems()\n7. Get game context; if valid, build node data structure and process unit items\n\nParameters:\n  pPacketData (ECX, byte*): Pointer to packet data buffer\n    +0x00: Packet type (0x47)\n    +0x01: nCycle (int, 4 bytes) - Animation cycle value\n    +0x05: nAngle (int, 4 bytes) - Unit rotation angle\n    +0x09: bAlt (byte) - Alternate mode flag\n\nReturns: void\n\nLocal Variables:\n  byPacketType (Stack[-0xc]): Set to 0x47 for ProcessUnitItemsFromNodeData call\n  byNodeType (Stack[-0xb]): Copied from game context byte 0\n  dwNodeData (Stack[-0x9]): Copied from game context dword at offset +8\n\nGlobals Accessed:\n  g_hRenderContext (0x6fbe9284): Render context handle, must be non-null\n\nCallees:\n  FogAssert: Debug assertion on null render context\n  ExitApplicationWithCode: Terminates application on assertion failure\n  GetGameContextUnitStat: Returns current player unit\n  SetRotationAndCycle: Updates unit rotation and animation cycle\n  ProcessAllMissilesAndItems: Processes missile/item rendering\n  GetGameContext: Returns game context structure\n  ProcessUnitItemsFromNodeData: Processes unit items with node data\n\nError Handling:\n  Asserts with file D2Client\\\\SCmd.cpp line 0xE75 (3701) if g_hRenderContext is null",
