      "instructions": ["0x13CF0|SUB|ESP, 0x1c", "0x13CF3|PUSH|EBX", "0x13CF4|PUSH|ESI", "0x13CF5|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x13CF7|PUSH|EDI", "0x13CF8|MOV|ECX, 0x7", "0x13CFD|XOR|EAX, EAX", "0x13CFF|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [ESI + 0x1]", "0x13D02|LEA|EDI, [ESP + 0xc]", "0x13D06|STOSD.REP|ES:EDI", "0x13D08|MOV|AX, word ptr [ESI + 0x5]", "0x13D0C|XOR|ECX, ECX", "0x13D0E|MOV|CX, word ptr [ESI + 0x7]", "0x13D12|XOR|EDX, EDX", "0x13D14|MOV|DX, word ptr [ESI + 0x9]"],
      "comment": "Creates a game unit from packed binary data and initializes its stats.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract unit ID from packed data at offset +1 (DWORD)\n2. Initialize 7-element parameter array to zero via STOSD.REP\n3. Extract and populate unit parameters from packed data:\n   - adUnitParams[0] = dwUnitId (from offset +1)\n   - adUnitParams[1] = wClassId (WORD from offset +5)  \n   - adUnitParams[2] = wXPos (WORD from offset +7)\n   - adUnitParams[3] = wYPos (WORD from offset +9)\n4. Set dwInitFlags from byte at offset +0xc\n5. Set nUnusedParam to -1 (0xffffffff marker)\n6. Call InitializeGameUnit with parameter array\n7. If unit creation failed, return\n8. Call UpdateMonsterGraphics to setup visuals\n9. Call GetUnitDamageTypeCategory to check damage type\n10. If damage category is non-zero:\n    a. Get game context via GetGameContext\n    b. Search for matching node with FindNodeBySearchCriteria\n    c. If dwUnitId matches result, return early\n11. Set unit stat 7 (STAT_MAXHP) to 0x8000\n12. Set unit stat 6 (STAT_MAXMANA) to (byte[+0xb] << 8)\n13. Return\n\nParameters:\n  pbPackedData (ECX) - byte *: Pointer to packed unit data buffer\n    Packed Data Layout:\n    +0x00: Unknown (1 byte)\n    +0x01: dwUnitId (DWORD) - Unique unit identifier  \n    +0x05: wClassId (WORD) - Unit class/type ID\n    +0x07: wXPos (WORD) - X coordinate\n    +0x09: wYPos (WORD) - Y coordinate\n    +0x0b: byMaxManaHigh (BYTE) - High byte of max mana\n    +0x0c: byInitFlags (BYTE) - Initialization flags\n\nReturns:\n  void - Unit created in-place, no return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Returns early if unit ID matches existing in damage category\n  - Stats only set when unit creation succeeds (pUnit != NULL)\n  - Max mana left-shifted 8 bits (multiplied by 256)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x8000 - Default STAT_MAXHP value (32768)\n  7 - STAT_MAXHP stat ID\n  6 - STAT_MAXMANA stat ID\n  0xffffffff - Unused parameter marker",
