      "instructions": ["0x13DA0|SUB|ESP, 0x1c", "0x13DA3|PUSH|EBX", "0x13DA4|PUSH|ESI", "0x13DA5|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x13DA7|PUSH|EDI", "0x13DA8|MOV|ECX, 0x7", "0x13DAD|XOR|EAX, EAX", "0x13DAF|LEA|EDI, [ESP + 0xc]", "0x13DB3|MOV|DX, word ptr [ESI + 0x13]", "0x13DB7|STOSD.REP|ES:EDI", "0x13DB9|MOV|AX, word ptr [ESI + 0x5]", "0x13DBD|XOR|ECX, ECX", "0x13DBF|MOV|CX, word ptr [ESI + 0x7]", "0x13DC3|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [ESI + 0x1]", "0x13DC6|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x14], ECX"],
      "comment": "Processes a unit spawn packet to create and initialize a game unit.\n\nClassification: Packet Handler (Callback)\nNo direct callers - likely registered in packet handler table.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract attribute type from packet offset +0x13 (2 bytes)\n2. Zero-initialize 7-DWORD local parameter array via REP STOSD\n3. Parse packet fields into parameter array:\n   - [0]: Unit ID from +0x01 (4 bytes)\n   - [1]: Field from +0x05 (2 bytes)\n   - [2]: Field from +0x07 (2 bytes)\n   - [3]: Field from +0x09 (2 bytes)\n4. Extract additional params: +0x0C (flag), +0x0D (2 bytes), +0x0F (4 bytes)\n5. Call InitializeGameUnit with params, buffers at +0x15 and +0x25\n6. If unit creation fails, return early\n7. Check unit damage type category:\n   - If non-zero: Get game context, search for node with criteria (7, 1)\n   - If unit ID matches search result, skip stat setup\n8. Set unit stats: stat 7 = 0x8000, stat 6 = (byte at +0x0B) << 8\n9. Re-check damage type category\n10. If category non-zero AND flag byte at +0x0C equals 1:\n    Clear bit 0x00040000 in unit field at offset 0xEC\n\nParameters:\n  pbPacketData (ECX) - Pointer to packet data buffer containing unit spawn info\n\nPacket Structure (0x35+ bytes):\n  +0x00: Packet opcode (1 byte, not parsed here)\n  +0x01: Unit ID (4 bytes, DWORD)\n  +0x05: Param field 1 (2 bytes, WORD)\n  +0x07: Param field 2 (2 bytes, WORD)\n  +0x09: Param field 3 (2 bytes, WORD)\n  +0x0B: Stat 6 value base (1 byte, shifted left 8)\n  +0x0C: Flag byte (1 byte, triggers bit clear if 0x01)\n  +0x0D: Param field for local_c (2 bytes, WORD)\n  +0x0F: Extra param (4 bytes, DWORD)\n  +0x13: Attribute type (2 bytes, WORD)\n  +0x15: Data buffer 1 (16 bytes?)\n  +0x25: Data buffer 2 (size unknown)\n\nReturns: void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Returns early if InitializeGameUnit returns NULL\n  - Skips stat setup if damage category non-zero AND unit ID matches search\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x8000 - Value set for unit stat 7\n  0x00040000 - Bit mask cleared in unit field at +0xEC\n  7 - Search criteria type / stat ID\n  6 - Stat ID for shifted byte value\n\nCallees:\n  InitializeGameUnit - Creates unit from parsed packet data\n  GetUnitDamageTypeCategory - Checks unit damage classification\n  GetGameContext - Retrieves current game state\n  FindNodeBySearchCriteria - Searches for matching node\n  SetUnitStat - Sets unit stat values",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_ItemData", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
