      "comment": "Processes server command to set player data field 924.\n\nClassification: Command Handler - processes incoming server packet\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract uint value from command packet at offset +1 (dwValue)\n2. Get current game context (player unit) via GetGameContext\n3. If no player unit exists, assert \"hUnit\" and exit with code -1\n4. Call SetPlayerData924 to apply the value to the player unit\n\nParameters:\n  pbCmd (ECX) - byte * - Pointer to command packet buffer\n                        Offset +0: Command ID (byte)\n                        Offset +1: Value to set (uint, 4 bytes)\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nCallees:\n  GetGameContext - Retrieves the local player unit\n  FogAssert - Debug assertion on failure\n  ExitApplicationWithCode - Fatal exit (called on null unit)\n  SetPlayerData924 - Sets field 924 on player data structure\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Null player unit causes fatal assertion and application exit\n  - No callers found - likely registered in command handler table",
