      "comment": "Handles a projectile creation command from a network packet or command buffer.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract missile parameters from packed command buffer at specified offsets\n2. Get current game context via GetGameContext\n3. Zero-initialize projectile configuration struct (0x58 bytes / 22 dwords)\n4. Extract missile flags byte from buffer offset 0x1E\n5. Set base projectile flags to 0x40000001 (preset coordinate mode)\n6. If source coordinates valid (X and Y both non-zero), set flags to 0x40000021 (adjust preset mode) and store source X/Y\n7. Populate projectile config: game context, missile type index, coordinate fields\n8. Call InitializeAndAllocateProjectile to create the projectile unit\n9. If allocation succeeds:\n   a. Set unit target coordinates from buffer (X at 0x19, Y at 0x1A)\n   b. Loop twice to copy missile data bytes from buffer offset 0x1F\n   c. Set missile data field 0x2C from ushort at buffer offset 0x17\n   d. Read animation frame max from unit offset 0x54 (shifted right 8)\n   e. If frame max non-zero, randomize animation start frame\n   f. Store randomized frame (shifted left 8) at unit offset 0x50\n\nParameters:\npbCommandData - Pointer to packed command buffer with projectile creation data:\n  +0x05: ushort - Missile type index\n  +0x07: uint - Coordinate field A (preset X multiplier)\n  +0x0B: uint - Coordinate field B (preset Y multiplier)\n  +0x0F: int - Source X coordinate (0 = use preset)\n  +0x13: int - Source Y coordinate (0 = use preset)\n  +0x17: ushort - Data field for missile offset 0x2C\n  +0x19: byte - Target X coordinate\n  +0x1A: int - Target Y coordinate\n  +0x1E: byte - Missile flags\n  +0x1F: byte[2] - Missile data bytes array\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If source X or Y is zero, uses preset coordinate mode (flags 0x40000001)\n- If both source coords valid, uses adjust preset mode (flags 0x40000021)\n- If projectile allocation fails, function returns early\n- Animation frame randomization only occurs if frame max > 0\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x40000001 = Preset coordinate mode flag\n0x40000021 = Adjust preset coordinate mode flag\n0x16 (22) = Number of dwords to zero in config struct\n0x58 = Size of projectile config struct in bytes",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_StatList", "STRUCT_MonsterData", "STRUCT_Path", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
