      "comment": "Handles incoming S2C entity position update packet by unpacking fields and delegating to ProcessEntityPositionUpdate.\n\nClassification: Packet Handler (Thunk/Wrapper)\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract entity ID from packet offset +1 (4-byte int)\n2. Extract X coordinate from packet offset +5 (2-byte ushort)\n3. Extract Y coordinate from packet offset +7 (2-byte ushort)\n4. Construct dwParam4 by combining dwHighWord upper 16 bits with packet offset +9 (2-byte)\n5. Extract entity data from packet offset +0xB (2-byte ushort)\n6. Call ProcessEntityPositionUpdate with extracted parameters\n\nParameters:\npbPacketData (ECX) - Pointer to incoming S2C packet buffer containing entity position data\ndwHighWord (EDX) - Contains high word component used to construct dwParam4 parameter\n  IMPLICIT: Upper 16 bits of dwHighWord combined with packet offset +9 to form dwParam4\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nPacket Structure Layout:\nOffset | Size | Field        | Type  | Description\n+0x00  | 1    | bOpcode      | byte  | Packet opcode (entity position update)\n+0x01  | 4    | nEntityId    | int   | Entity identifier for position update\n+0x05  | 2    | wXCoord      | ushort| New X coordinate position\n+0x07  | 2    | wYCoord      | ushort| New Y coordinate position\n+0x09  | 2    | wParam4Lo    | ushort| Low word combined with dwHighWord for dwParam4\n+0x0B  | 2    | wEntityData  | ushort| Entity-specific data/flags\n\nCross-References:\nNone detected - likely referenced via function pointer table\n\nCalls:\nProcessEntityPositionUpdate @ 0x6faded60 - Updates entity position in game state",
