      "comment": "Dispatches legacy overlay rendering command from packet data.\n\nClassification: Thunk/Dispatcher - Parses packet and forwards to RenderLegacyOverlay\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if packet command byte equals 0x83 (legacy overlay command)\n2. If match, extract rendering parameters from packet structure\n3. Call RenderLegacyOverlay with parsed parameters\n4. Return (no action if command byte mismatch)\n\nParameters:\n  pbPacket (ECX) - Pointer to packet/command buffer with structure:\n    Offset 0x00: Command byte (must be 0x83 for processing)\n    Offset 0x01: X coordinate data pointer base\n    Offset 0x05: Y coordinate (ushort)\n    Offset 0x07: Width (ushort, loaded as dword)\n    Offset 0x09: Height (ushort)\n    Offset 0x0B: Flags pointer\n\nReturns: void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - No-op if command byte != 0x83\n  - No callers found (orphaned function, likely called via function pointer table)\n\nPacket Structure Layout:\n  Offset  Size  Field       Type    Description\n  0x00    1     bCommand    byte    Command identifier (0x83)\n  0x01    4     dwXBase     uint    X coordinate base (passed as pointer+1)\n  0x05    2     wY          ushort  Y coordinate\n  0x07    2     wWidth      ushort  Width value\n  0x09    2     wHeight     ushort  Height value\n  0x0B    4     dwFlags     uint    Rendering flags\n\nCallee: RenderLegacyOverlay(dwX, wY, dwWidth, wHeight, dwFlags)",
