      "comment": "Process error condition and send notification messages for entity operations.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate entity by calling validation function with entity ID\n2. If validation returns a context pointer (non-null):\n   a. Access entity-specific data from context structure (offset +0xC)\n   b. Send error notification with code 0x16af (5807 decimal)\n   c. Send secondary error notification with code 0x16b0 (5808 decimal)\n   d. Perform cleanup operation on the entity\n\nParameters:\ndwEntityId (uint): Identifier for the entity to process error condition\n\nReturns:\nvoid: Function does not return a value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If entity validation fails (returns NULL), no error processing occurs\n- Function uses consecutive error codes 0x16af and 0x16b0 for notifications\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x16af (5807): Primary error notification code\n0x16b0 (5808): Secondary error notification code  \n0xC (12): Offset into entity context structure for additional data",
