      "comment": "Transform screen coordinates with viewport and perspective adjustments.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Copy input coordinate values to local variables for processing\n2. Check rendering state using Ordinal_10010 API call \n3. If rendering enabled, apply perspective transformation to Y coordinate\n4. Apply viewport offset and scroll adjustment to X coordinate\n5. Apply global coordinate offset to Y coordinate\n6. Apply viewport X position and scroll offset to X coordinate  \n7. Call Ordinal_10108 to perform final coordinate transformation\n8. Update input pointers with transformed coordinate values\n\nParameters:\npnX - Pointer to X coordinate value (input/output)\npnY - Pointer to Y coordinate value (input/output)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Coordinates updated in-place through pointer parameters\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x66666667 - Fast division constant for divide by 5 operation\n0x28 (40) - Perspective adjustment constant for depth calculation",
