      "instructions": ["0x164B0|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbf21b0]", "0x164B5|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x164B7|JNZ|0x6fae64d7", "0x164B9|PUSH|0x119", "0x164BE|PUSH|0x6fbb0ef4", "0x164C3|PUSH|0x6fbb0f74", "0x164C8|CALL|0x6fb99a7a", "0x164CD|ADD|ESP, 0xc", "0x164D0|PUSH|-0x1", "0x164D2|CALL|0x6fb9a10f", "0x164D7|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbf21b4]", "0x164DC|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x164DE|JNZ|0x6fae64fe", "0x164E0|PUSH|0x11a", "0x164E5|PUSH|0x6fbb0ef4"],
      "comment": "Creates and initializes a new Gouraud shading renderer\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate required Gouraud shading tables are initialized\n   - Check g_pGouraudTblX (0x6fbf21b0) is non-null, abort if null\n   - Check g_pGouraudTblY (0x6fbf21b4) is non-null, abort if null  \n   - Check g_pGouraudTblXVal (0x6fbf21b8) is non-null, abort if null\n2. Allocate GouraudRenderer structure (285 bytes)\n3. Initialize renderer structure\n   - Clear flags field to 0x0\n   - Initialize clipping rectangle to (0,0,0,0) using SetRect\n   - Store pointers to Gouraud shading tables at offsets 0x2c, 0x30, 0x34\n4. Perform renderer setup\n   - Call FUN_6fafb9d0() for additional initialization\n   - Call FUN_6fae7280() with renderer parameter for configuration\n5. Enable renderer and clear global status\n   - Set renderer active flag (bit 0 = 0x1) \n   - Clear global renderer status (g_dwRendererStatus = 0)\n\nParameters:\n  None\n\nReturns:\n  GouraudRenderer* - Pointer to initialized renderer structure\n  NULL - Never returned (function aborts on error)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  Validation Failure: If any Gouraud table pointer is NULL, calls Ordinal_10023 \n  (debug assert) with appropriate error message and FUN_6fb9a10f(-1) to exit\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0x11d (285) - GouraudRenderer structure size in bytes\n  0x119 (281) - Error code for missing sgpGouraudTblX\n  0x11a (282) - Error code for missing sgpGouraudTblY  \n  0x11b (283) - Error code for missing sgpGouraudTblXVal\n  0x1 - Renderer active flag bit\n  0x2c (44) - Offset to pGouraudTblX field\n  0x30 (48) - Offset to pGouraudTblY field\n  0x34 (52) - Offset to pGouraudTblXVal field\n\nError Handling:\n  Missing Gouraud tables trigger debug assertion with source file and line number\n  Application exits with code -1 if validation fails\n  No error recovery - function assumes tables are properly initialized\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset  Size  Field Name        Type      Description\n------  ----  ---------------   -------   ---------------------------\n0x00    4     dwFlags           uint      Renderer flags (bit 0 = active)\n0x04    16    rcClipRect        RECT      Clipping rectangle (set to 0,0,0,0)\n0x14    32    reserved1         byte[32]  Reserved/padding space\n0x2c    4     pGouraudTblX      void*     Pointer to X coordinate shading table\n0x30    4     pGouraudTblY      void*     Pointer to Y coordinate shading table  \n0x34    4     pGouraudTblXVal   void*     Pointer to X value shading table\n0x38    221   remainingData     byte[221] Additional renderer data/buffers",
