      "comment": "Updates scroll viewport state by clearing active flag after processing updates\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate input pointer is not null, assert/abort if null\n2. Check if either field[3] or field[4] are non-zero (has active updates)\n3. Get current scroll window mode via GetScrollWindowMode()\n4. If scroll mode is not 3, process updates via FUN_6fae72e0\n5. Clear bit 0 of field[0] to mark processing complete\n\nParameters:\n- pViewState (uint *): Pointer to viewport state structure\n  - field[0]: Status flags, bit 0 = needs processing\n  - field[3]: Update state indicator at offset 0xc\n  - field[4]: Update state indicator at offset 0x10\n- dwUpdateFlags (uint): Update flags parameter passed to processing function\n\nReturns:\n- void: No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Null pointer triggers assertion and program termination\n- Scroll mode 3 skips update processing but still clears status flag\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x0: Null pointer check value\n- 0x3: Scroll mode that bypasses update processing\n- 0xfffffffe: Mask to clear bit 0 (active processing flag)\n- 0x1d9: Line number for assertion (decimal 473)\n- 0xffffffff: Exit code for fatal error (-1)",
