      "comment": "Dispatches quest-related packets to appropriate handler functions based on message type.\n\nClassification: Dispatch handler - routes quest packets to specialized handlers via switch table.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract message type from packet offset +1 (ushort)\n2. Validate message type is within bounds (1-36 / 0x24)\n3. Use jump table lookup to dispatch to appropriate handler:\n   - Type 0x01: ExtractConfigDataFromHeader - parse quest config data\n   - Type 0x02: FindResourceInTableAndOpenDialog - show quest dialog by resource ID\n   - Type 0x03, 0x06: ValidateAndInitializeGameSlot - initialize quest slot\n   - Type 0x04, 0x0D: ProcessGameMode - handle game mode change\n   - Type 0x17: ProcessServerPortConfiguration + SetGlobalState(0) + SetInitializationFlag(1) + EnableGameSystemFlag\n   - Type 0x24: StoreSlotData - store slot data by index\n4. For invalid types, log error message via QueueLogMessage\n\nParameters:\n  pPacketData (ECX) - byte * - Pointer to 15-byte quest packet structure\n    Offset +0x01: ushort - Message type (switch selector)\n    Offset +0x03: ushort - Resource ID or slot index (type-dependent)\n\nReturns: void\n\nQuest Message Types:\n  0x01 - Extract config data from packet header\n  0x02 - Find resource and open dialog\n  0x03 - Validate/init game slot (same as 0x06)\n  0x04 - Process game mode (same as 0x0D)\n  0x06 - Validate/init game slot (same as 0x03)\n  0x0D - Process game mode (same as 0x04)\n  0x17 - Server port configuration with initialization sequence\n  0x24 - Store slot data\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Message types outside 1-36 range logged as invalid\n- Types 3/6 and 4/13 share handlers (case fallthrough)\n- Type 0x17 triggers full initialization sequence (4 function calls)\n\nImplementation Notes:\n- Uses indexed jump table at 0x6fae8104 for dispatch\n- Byte table at 0x6fae8120 maps type to jump table index\n- Subtracts 1 from type before lookup (types are 1-based)",
      "tags": ["PARAM_1", "UI_QUEST"]
    },
