      "comment": "Initializes the global quest class table from provided quest data.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Compute source pointer by adding 1 to input (skips header byte)\n2. Set destination to g_abQuestClassTable (0x6fbf2210)\n3. Copy 9 DWORDs (36 bytes) using REP MOVSD\n4. Copy 1 additional byte using MOVSB (total 37 bytes = QUEST_NUMCLASS)\n5. Set g_fQuestSystemInitialized flag to TRUE (1)\n6. Return\n\nParameters:\n- pbQuestData (ECX): Pointer to quest data buffer with 1-byte header followed by 37 bytes of quest class data\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nMemory Model:\n- Source: pbQuestData + 1 (skip header byte)\n- Destination: g_abQuestClassTable[37] at 0x6fbf2210\n- Total copy size: 37 bytes (9 DWORDs + 1 byte)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- First byte of input data is skipped (header/size byte)\n- Must be called before GetQuestClassByIndex or GetQuestSystemInitialized\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n- 9: Number of DWORDs to copy (36 bytes)\n- 1: Extra byte to copy, plus offset for header skip\n- 37 (0x25): Total quest class table size (QUEST_NUMCLASS)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- GetQuestSystemInitialized: Returns initialization flag\n- GetQuestClassByIndex: Reads from g_abQuestClassTable after initialization\n\nRelated Globals:\n- g_abQuestClassTable (0x6fbf2210): 37-byte array of quest class values\n- g_fQuestSystemInitialized (0x6fbf2238): Boolean flag set to 1 after init\n\nSource File: C:\\Projects\\Diablo2\\Source\\D2Client\\QUEST\\Quests.cpp",
