      "comment": "Retrieves the quest class value for a given quest index.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Verify quest system is initialized (g_fQuestSystemInitialized \\!= 0)\n2. Assert if not initialized, exit with error code -1\n3. Validate quest index is within bounds (nQuestIndex < QUEST_NUMCLASS)\n4. Assert if index out of bounds, exit with error code -1\n5. Return byte value from g_abQuestClassTable at specified index\n\nParameters:\n- nReserved: Reserved parameter (unused, for ordinal export compatibility)\n- nQuestIndex: Zero-based index into quest class table (0-36 valid)\n\nReturns:\n- byte: Quest class value for the specified quest index\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Exits application with code -1 if quest system not initialized\n- Exits application with code -1 if nQuestIndex >= 37 (QUEST_NUMCLASS)\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n- 0x65 (101): Source line number for initialization assertion\n- 0x6a (106): Source line number for bounds assertion\n- 0x24 (36): Maximum valid quest index (QUEST_NUMCLASS - 1)\n- 0xffffffff (-1): Application exit code on assertion failure\n\nRelated Functions:\n- D2Common_AssertionOrdinal(): Logs assertion failure message\n- ExitApplicationWithCode(): Terminates application\n\nSource File: C:\\Projects\\Diablo2\\Source\\D2Client\\QUEST\\Quests.cpp",
