      "instructions": ["0x18200|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbf2268]", "0x18205|PUSH|ESI", "0x18206|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x18208|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x1820A|JZ|0x6fae8214", "0x1820C|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x10]", "0x18210|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x18212|JZ|0x6fae827e", "0x18214|PUSH|EDI", "0x18215|MOV|ECX, 0xb", "0x1821A|XOR|EAX, EAX", "0x1821C|MOV|EDI, 0x6fbf2240", "0x18221|STOSD.REP|ES:EDI", "0x18223|TEST|ESI, ESI", "0x18225|MOV|dword ptr [0x6fbf2240], 0x1"],
      "comment": "Initialize global configuration data structure with provided parameters.\n\nAlgorithm:\n\n1. Check if configuration is already initialized (g_dwControlFlag == 0) or force reset requested (dwForceReset != 0)\n2. If initialization needed, zero out 44-byte configuration data block (11 DWORDs starting at 0x6fbf2240)\n3. Set initialization flag to 1 at beginning of data block\n4. Validate dwParam1 is non-null, exit with error code 0xffffffff if null\n5. Apply default value 0x19 to dwParam3 if it was passed as 0\n6. Calculate sum of all three numeric parameters (dwParam1 + dwParam2 + dwParam3)\n7. Store all parameters and calculated sum in global configuration structure\n\nParameters:\n\n- dwParam1 (uint): Primary parameter value, must be non-null, stored at offset 0x0c in config\n- dwParam2 (uint): Secondary parameter value, stored at offset 0x14 in config  \n- dwParam3 (uint): Tertiary parameter value, defaults to 0x19 if 0, stored at offset 0x10 in config\n- dwParam4 (uint): Additional parameter value, stored at offset 0x24 in config\n- dwForceReset (uint): Force reinitialization flag, bypasses already-initialized check\n\nReturns:\n\n- void: Function performs initialization and returns\n\nSpecial Cases:\n\n- If dwParam1 is null (0), function calls Ordinal_10023 with error message and exits process\n- If dwParam3 is 0, it is replaced with default value 0x19 (decimal 25)\n- If already initialized (g_dwControlFlag != 0) and not forcing reset, function returns early\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n\n- 0x19 (25): Default value for dwParam3 when not specified\n- 0xffffffff (-1): Process exit code for null parameter error\n- 0xb (11): Number of DWORDs to clear in configuration structure\n- 0x67 (103): Error code parameter for Ordinal_10023 call\n\nError Handling:\n\n- Null dwParam1 validation: Calls Ordinal_10023 error handler then FUN_6fb9a10f to exit process\n- Process termination with exit code -1 on critical parameter validation failure\n\nStructure Layout:\n\n| Offset | Size | Field Name       | Type | Description                    |\n|--------|------|------------------|------|--------------------------------|\n| 0x00   | 4    | dwInitialized    | uint | Initialization flag (set to 1)|\n| 0x04   | 4    | dwReserved1      | uint | Reserved/padding               |\n| 0x08   | 4    | dwReserved2      | uint | Reserved/padding               |\n| 0x0C   | 4    | dwParam1         | uint | Primary parameter storage      |\n| 0x10   | 4    | dwParam3         | uint | Tertiary parameter storage     |\n| 0x14   | 4    | dwParam2         | uint | Secondary parameter storage    |\n| 0x18   | 4    | dwCalculatedSum  | uint | Sum of params 1, 2, and 3     |\n| 0x1C   | 4    | dwReserved3      | uint | Reserved/padding               |\n| 0x20   | 4    | dwReserved4      | uint | Reserved/padding               |\n| 0x24   | 4    | dwParam4         | uint | Additional parameter storage   |\n| 0x28   | 4    | dwControlFlag    | uint | Control/state flag             |",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_5", "MOD_QUEST", "UI_QUEST", "SRC_QuestsFX.cpp"]
