      "comment": "Creates a missile visual effect at a waypoint tile location.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get current game context (player unit)\n2. Return early if no game context exists\n3. Get the room containing the player unit\n4. Find room tile at type 2, offset 0x95 (waypoint tile type)\n5. Return early if no matching tile found\n6. Get tile X coordinate via Ordinal_10329 (D2Common.DUNGEON_GetTilePosX)\n7. Get tile Y coordinate via Ordinal_10326 (D2Common.DUNGEON_GetTilePosY)\n8. Create missile type 0x15e at tile coordinates with flags=1\n9. If missile created successfully, set missile target to tile's unit ID\n\nParameters:\nNone (void function)\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Returns early if GetGameContext returns NULL (no active game)\n- Returns early if FindRoomTileByCoord returns NULL (no waypoint tile)\n- Returns early if missile creation fails\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x2 - Tile type parameter for FindRoomTileByCoord\n0x95 - Tile Y/offset parameter (149 decimal) - waypoint identifier\n0x15e - Missile type ID (350 decimal) - waypoint activation effect\n0x1 - Flags parameter for missile creation\n0x8 - Offset into tile structure for target unit ID\n\nOrdinal References:\nOrdinal_10329 - D2Common.DUNGEON_GetTilePosX - Get tile X coordinate\nOrdinal_10326 - D2Common.DUNGEON_GetTilePosY - Get tile Y coordinate",
      "tags": ["PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_0"]
    },
