      "comment": "Configures an item by retrieving status flags and applying configuration settings.\n\nAlgorithm:\n\n1. Validate item parameter is not null\n2. Get item status flags from Ordinal_10329 (dwItemFlags1)\n3. Get additional item flags from Ordinal_10326 (dwItemFlags2) \n4. Call item configuration function with magic value 0x25a\n5. If configuration returns success handle, apply final setting with 0x19\n\nParameters:\n- nItemId: int - Item identifier or handle to configure\n\nReturns:\n- void - No return value, configuration applied directly\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n- 0x25a (602): Configuration type parameter for item setup\n- 0x19 (25): Final setting parameter applied to configured item\n- 0x1: Default option value passed to configuration function\n\nError Handling:\n- Null item ID causes early return without processing\n- Zero result from configuration function skips final setting step",
