      "instructions": ["0x187B0|CMP|ECX, 0x20", "0x187B3|JL|0x6fae87d3", "0x187B5|PUSH|0x1dc", "0x187BA|PUSH|0x6fbb1154", "0x187BF|PUSH|0x6fbb11ac", "0x187C4|CALL|0x6fb99a7a", "0x187C9|ADD|ESP, 0xc", "0x187CC|PUSH|-0x1", "0x187CE|CALL|0x6fb9a10f", "0x187D3|CMP|ECX, 0x14", "0x187D6|JL|0x6fae87f6", "0x187D8|PUSH|0x1dd", "0x187DD|PUSH|0x6fbb1154", "0x187E2|PUSH|0x6fbb118c", "0x187E7|CALL|0x6fb99a7a"],
      "comment": "Dispatches quest trigger events to their specific handler functions.\n\nClassification: Dispatch/Handler function - validates trigger index and jumps to handler via table.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate trigger index is less than 32 (0x20) - assert if out of bounds\n2. Validate trigger index is less than NUM_QUEST_TRIGGERS (20/0x14) - assert if out of bounds\n3. Set the corresponding bit in g_dwQuestTriggerBitmask to mark trigger as processed\n4. Look up handler function pointer from g_apfnQuestTriggerHandlers[nTriggerIndex]\n5. If handler is NULL, return immediately (trigger has no handler)\n6. Jump to the handler function to process the trigger\n\nParameters:\n  nTriggerIndex (ECX) - Quest trigger index (0-19 valid range)\n                        Extracted from pQuestData[1] by caller\n\nReturns: void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Trigger index >= 32: Assert fires, exits with code -1\n  - Trigger index >= 20: Assert fires, exits with code -1  \n  - NULL handler pointer: Returns without processing\n\nGlobal State Modified:\n  g_dwQuestTriggerBitmask (0x6fbf226c) - Bit corresponding to trigger index is set\n\nJump Table: g_apfnQuestTriggerHandlers (0x6fbb10f8)\n  Index 0:  0x6fae8370 - Handler for trigger 0\n  Index 1:  0x6fae8290 - Handler for trigger 1\n  Index 3:  0x6fae8380 - Handler for trigger 3\n  Index 6:  0x6fae8460 - Handler for trigger 6\n  Index 12: 0x6fae84c0 - Handler for trigger 12\n  Index 13: 0x6fae85b0 - Handler for trigger 13\n  Index 14: 0x6fae8520 - Handler for trigger 14\n  Index 16: 0x6fae8610 - Handler for trigger 16\n  Index 17: 0x6fae8670 - Handler for trigger 17\n  Index 19: 0x6fae86f0 - Handler for trigger 19\n  Others:   NULL - No handler, returns immediately\n\nCaller Context:\n  ExtractQuestTriggerAndProcess passes pQuestData[1] as trigger index",
      "tags": ["PARAM_1", "MOD_QUEST", "UI_QUEST", "SRC_QuestsFX.cpp"]
    },
