      "api_calls": ["UNITS_GetRoom", "FindRoomTileByCoord", "UNITS_GetOwnerGuid", "UNITS_GetUnitY", "UNITS_GetOwnerGuid", "UNITS_GetUnitY", "MissileSetTargetUnit"],
      "instructions": ["0x18960|SUB|ESP, 0x58", "0x18963|PUSH|EBX", "0x18964|PUSH|EBP", "0x18965|PUSH|ESI", "0x18966|PUSH|EDI", "0x18967|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x18969|PUSH|0x182", "0x1896E|PUSH|0x2", "0x18970|PUSH|ESI", "0x18971|CALL|0x6fb98164", "0x18976|PUSH|EAX", "0x18977|CALL|0x6fb98374", "0x1897C|MOV|EBP, EAX", "0x1897E|TEST|EBP, EBP", "0x18980|JZ|0x6fae89ad"],
      "comment": "Initializes a graphics window with calculated dimensions and creates window context.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get display handle from the provided display context using Ordinal_10342\n2. Attempt to set display mode with resolution 0x182 (386) and mode 2 using Ordinal_11087\n3. If display mode setting fails (result == 0):\n   - Get screen dimensions from original context using Ordinals 10326 and 10329\n   - Subtract 15 pixels from both width and height for windowed mode border\n4. If display mode setting succeeds:\n   - Show error dialog using FUN_6fb8eab0 with coordinates (0x124e, 0x15e)\n   - Get screen dimensions from the new display context\n5. Initialize WindowCreationData structure (88 bytes) by clearing all fields to zero\n6. Populate structure fields with window parameters:\n   - Set dwWidth to 0x420 (1056 pixels) and dwHeight to 0x170 (368 pixels)\n   - Set both hContext1 and hContext2 to the display context handle\n   - Set dwX and dwY to the calculated adjusted dimensions\n   - Set dwFlags to 1 for window creation\n7. Create window by calling FUN_6fb77720 with populated structure\n8. If both window creation succeeds AND display mode was set:\n   - Call Ordinal_11140 to apply display context data to the created window\n\nParameters:\ndwDisplayContext (uint): Handle to display context used for dimension calculations and window creation\n\nReturns:\nvoid: No return value - function performs initialization only\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If display mode setting fails, switches to windowed mode with 15-pixel border offset\n- Error dialog is shown when display mode succeeds (at coordinates 4686, 350)\n- Final window setup only occurs if both window creation AND display mode setting succeed",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Path", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
    },
