      "comment": "Processes graphics frame updates including color component processing and render context management.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if ConfigurationData structure is initialized (dwInitialized != 0)\n2. Initialize color component pointers (RGB) from structure offsets +0, +1, +2 from dwReserved2\n3. Process pixel color components using external function with current render context\n4. Calculate configuration timing based on frame state:\n   a. If dwReserved3 < dwParam1: Use first timing calculation (dwReserved3 << 7) / dwParam1\n   b. If dwReserved3 < (dwCalculatedSum - dwParam3): Reset dwReserved1 to 0\n   c. Otherwise: Use alternative timing with 0x80 - ((delta + dwReserved3) * 0x80) / dwParam3\n5. Increment frame counter (dwReserved3++)\n6. Verify render context integrity and reset configuration if mismatch detected\n7. Process render context cleanup when DAT_6fbf2270 flag triggers after 30 frames (0x1e)\n8. Handle secondary cleanup flag DAT_6fbf2274 with similar 30-frame timeout\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If dwParam3 equals 0, defaults to 0x19 (25 decimal) to prevent division by zero\n- Configuration structure cleared with REP STOSD for 11 DWORDs when integrity check fails\n- Two independent timing systems (DAT_6fbf2270 and DAT_6fbf2274) with 30-frame thresholds\n- Render context iteration stops at null next pointer (offset +0x7c)\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x7 - Left shift count for timing calculation (multiply by 128)\n0x80 - Base timing value (128 decimal)\n0x19 - Default dwParam3 value (25 decimal) when zero division protection needed\n0x1e - Frame threshold (30 decimal) for cleanup trigger\n0xb - ConfigurationData structure size in DWORDs (44 bytes / 4 = 11)\n0x8 - Render context type identifier for pathfinding operations\n0x7c - Offset to next render context pointer in linked list\n\nStructure Layout:\nConfigurationData (44 bytes):\nOffset | Size | Field Name      | Type | Description\n-------|------|----------------|------|-------------\n0x00   | 4    | dwInitialized  | uint | Initialization flag\n0x04   | 4    | dwReserved1    | uint | Calculated timing result\n0x08   | 4    | dwReserved2    | uint | Base for RGB color pointers\n0x0C   | 4    | dwParam1       | uint | Primary timing parameter\n0x10   | 4    | dwParam3       | uint | Secondary timing divisor\n0x14   | 4    | dwParam2       | uint | Reserved parameter\n0x18   | 4    | dwCalculatedSum| uint | Sum for timing comparison\n0x1C   | 4    | dwReserved3    | uint | Frame counter\n0x20   | 4    | dwReserved4    | uint | Timing result storage\n0x24   | 4    | dwParam4       | uint | Render context verification\n0x28   | 4    | dwControlFlag  | uint | Control flags",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_0", "STRUCT_Control"]
