      "comment": "Process a skill effect without a source unit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call ProcessSkillEffect with provided parameters\n2. Pass hardcoded 0 for source unit parameter (nSourceUnit)\n3. Forward skill level and additional parameters unchanged\n\nParameters:\n- pCaster: UnitAny * - Pointer to the unit casting the skill\n- nSkillId: int - Identifier of the skill to process\n- dwSkillLevel: uint - Level of the skill effect\n- dwParam1: uint - First skill-specific parameter\n- dwParam2: uint - Second skill-specific parameter\n\nReturns:\n- void - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Always passes 0 as nSourceUnit to ProcessSkillEffect\n- Acts as wrapper for skills that don't originate from another unit\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n- 0x0: Hardcoded source unit value indicating no source",
