      "api_count": 3,
      "api_calls": ["UNITS_GetUnitDirection", "UNITS_GetOwnerGuid", "UNITS_GetUnitY"],
      "instructions": ["0x19600|SUB|ESP, 0x40", "0x19603|PUSH|EBX", "0x19604|PUSH|ESI", "0x19605|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x19607|PUSH|EDI", "0x19608|MOV|EBX, EDX", "0x1960A|PUSH|ESI", "0x1960B|CALL|0x6fb9839e", "0x19610|AND|EAX, 0xff", "0x19615|XOR|EDX, EDX", "0x19617|SHR|EAX, 0x3", "0x1961A|MOV|EDI, EAX", "0x1961C|OR|ECX, 0xffffffff", "0x1961F|MOV|EAX, 0x1", "0x19624|PUSH|ESI"],
      "comment": "Calculate directional coordinate offsets for entity movement based on facing direction.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get entity facing direction using Ordinal_10457(dwEntityId)\n2. Extract 3-bit direction index: (direction & 0xFF) >> 3 (yields 0-7 for 8 directions)\n3. Initialize lookup table with X offsets [0-7] and Y offsets [8-15]\n4. Get current entity X coordinate using Ordinal_10326(dwEntityId)\n5. Get current entity Y coordinate using Ordinal_10329(dwEntityId)  \n6. Calculate adjusted X: current_X + X_offset_table[direction_index]\n7. Calculate adjusted Y: current_Y + Y_offset_table[direction_index + 8]\n8. Store results in output parameters\n\nParameters:\ndwEntityId (uint): Entity identifier for coordinate and direction queries\npXOffset (int*): Output pointer for calculated X coordinate with directional offset\npYOffset (int*): Output pointer for calculated Y coordinate with directional offset\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Results returned via output parameters\n\nSpecial Cases:\nDirection Lookup Table Layout:\nX Offsets [0-7]:  { 0, -1, -2, -1,  0,  1,  2,  1}\nY Offsets [8-15]: { 2,  1,  0, -1, -2, -1,  0,  1}\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0xFF (255): Direction mask for 8-bit direction value\n0x3 (3): Right shift amount to extract 3-bit index (8 directions: 0-7)\n8: Y offset table starts at index 8 in combined lookup table\n\nError Handling:\nFunction assumes valid dwEntityId and non-null output pointers\nNo bounds checking on direction index (relies on 3-bit mask)",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_StatList", "STRUCT_Path", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_3", "STRUCT_Skill", "STRUCT_Room2", "STRUCT_ItemData", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
