      "comment": "Validates entity by checking type flag and key lookup in linked list structures.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FUN_6fb63760 to resolve entity query into entity data structure\n2. Validate entity data pointer is not null\n3. Check entity type flag at offset 0 equals 1 (active/valid entity)\n4. Extract key from entity data at offset 8 for linked list search\n5. Perform SearchLinkedListByKey and compare result to query key at offset 8\n6. If keys match, call FindLinkedListNodeByKey to get entity type classification\n7. Check entity type against allowed values using switch statement\n8. Return 1 for valid entity types (3-6, 11-16), 0 for invalid or failed validation\n\nParameters:\n- pEntityQuery (EntityQuery*): Pointer to entity query structure with key at offset 8\n\nReturns:\n- dword: 1 if entity is valid with approved type classification, 0 otherwise\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Returns 0 immediately if entity data resolution fails\n- Returns 0 if entity type flag is not 1 (inactive entity)  \n- Returns 0 if linked list key search fails to match query key\n- Valid entity types: 3, 4, 5, 6, 11, 12, 13, 14, 15, 16 (0x3-0x6, 0xB-0x10)\n\nStructure Layout:\nEntityQuery structure (12 bytes total):\nOffset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description\n0x0    | 4    | dwUnknown1 | uint | Unknown field\n0x4    | 4    | dwUnknown2 | uint | Unknown field  \n0x8    | 4    | dwKey      | uint | Entity lookup key for validation\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n- 0x1: Entity active flag value at offset 0 in entity data structure\n- 0x8: Offset to key field in both entity query and entity data structures\n- 3-6 (0x3-0x6): Primary entity type range\n- 11-16 (0xB-0x10): Secondary entity type range",
      "tags": ["PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_1"]
    },
