      "instructions": ["0x1B480|SUB|ESP, 0x20", "0x1B483|PUSH|EBX", "0x1B484|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x2c]", "0x1B488|PUSH|ESI", "0x1B489|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x1B48B|PUSH|EDI", "0x1B48C|MOV|ECX, 0x8", "0x1B491|XOR|EAX, EAX", "0x1B493|LEA|EDI, [ESP + 0xc]", "0x1B497|STOSD.REP|ES:EDI", "0x1B499|MOV|EAX, EBX", "0x1B49B|PUSH|ESI", "0x1B49C|OR|AL, 0x3", "0x1B49E|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x14], ESI", "0x1B4A2|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x10], EAX"],
      "comment": "Builds a query parameter block and executes item matching against criteria.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize query block array (4 dwords) to zero by iterating with pointer\n2. Store query flags with bits 0-1 set (value | 0x3) at offset 0\n3. Store item source reference at query block offset 1\n4. Store item target reference at query block offset 2\n5. Call Ordinal_10326(item_source) to get auxiliary data and store at offset 3\n6. Call Ordinal_10329(item_source) to get secondary data and store at offset 4\n7. Store criteria data at offset 5\n8. Check if query flags have bit 3 set (0x8):\n   - If set: store error marker 0x805 at offset 4\n   - If clear: leave offset 4 with function result\n9. Call FindBestMatchingItem with query block pointer\n10. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\npItemSource (ECX): Source item/entity reference passed to ordinal functions\npItemTarget (EDX): Target item/entity reference stored in query block\npCriteria (Stack[0x4]): Matching criteria data stored in query block\ndwQueryFlags (Stack[0x8]): Bit-field flags controlling query behavior (bit 0-1 always set, bit 3 = special mode)\n\nReturns:\nvoid (no return value, side effects in passed parameters via FindBestMatchingItem)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Query flags are always OR'd with 0x3 before storage (bits 0-1 always set)\n- Bit 3 of dwQueryFlags (0x8) triggers error code 0x805 substitution\n- Array is cleared with REP STOSD (8 dwords = 32 bytes)\n\nStructure Layout:\nQuery Block Array (4 dwords = 16 bytes):\nOffset  Size  Field Name          Type   Description\n0x00    0x4   dwFlagsOrMask       dword  Query flags with bits 0-1 set (param_4 | 0x3)\n0x04    0x4   dwItemSource        dword  Item source reference from pItemSource\n0x08    0x4   dwItemTarget        dword  Item target reference from pItemTarget  \n0x0c    0x4   dwAuxiliaryData     dword  Result from Ordinal_10326(pItemSource)",
