      "instructions": ["0x1BAE0|PUSH|ESI", "0x1BAE1|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x1BAE3|CMP|byte ptr [ESI + 0x5c], 0x3", "0x1BAE7|JNZ|0x6faebb20", "0x1BAE9|CMP|dword ptr [ESI], 0x0", "0x1BAEC|JNZ|0x6faebb00", "0x1BAEE|PUSH|0x0", "0x1BAF0|PUSH|0x0", "0x1BAF2|PUSH|0x0", "0x1BAF4|MOV|EDX, ESI", "0x1BAF6|MOV|ECX, 0x11e", "0x1BAFB|CALL|0x6fb8d210", "0x1BB00|CMP|dword ptr [ESI], 0x1", "0x1BB03|JNZ|0x6faebb20", "0x1BB05|CMP|dword ptr [ESI + 0x4], 0xd3"],
      "comment": "Triggers entity-specific sound effects based on entity state and type\n\nAlgorithm:\n\n1. Check if entity type field (byType at offset 0x5c) equals 0x3 (specific entity category)\n2. If type matches, examine entity state field (dwState at offset 0x0):\n   a. If state == 0: Trigger sound effect 0x11e (286 decimal) at entity location\n   b. If state == 1 AND substate (dwSubState at offset 0x4) == 0xd3 (211 decimal):\n      Trigger sound effect 0x124 (292 decimal) at entity location\n3. Sound effects are played with zero position offset (0.0, 0.0)\n\nParameters:\n\npEntity - Pointer to EntityState structure (passed in ECX via __fastcall)\n          EntityState structure contains:\n          +0x00 (dwState): Entity state/action ID (uint)\n          +0x04 (dwSubState): Entity substate or parameter (uint)\n          +0x5c (byType): Entity type identifier (byte)\n\nReturns:\n\nvoid - No return value\nFunction operates purely through side effects (sound playback)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n\n- If entity type is not 0x3, function returns immediately without action\n- State 0 always triggers sound regardless of substate value\n- State 1 only triggers sound when substate exactly matches 0xd3\n- Both sound effects use entity pointer as position reference\n- Function appears orphaned (no direct callers) - may be invoked via function pointer\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n\n0x3 (3) - Entity type requiring sound effects\n0x0 (0) - Entity state triggering sound effect 0x11e\n0x1 (1) - Entity state for conditional sound effect\n0xd3 (211) - Required substate value for state 1 sound\n0x11e (286) - Sound effect ID for state 0 condition\n0x124 (292) - Sound effect ID for state 1 + substate 0xd3 condition\n\nStructure Layout:\n\nOffset | Size | Field Name  | Type  | Description\n-------|------|-------------|-------|----------------------------------------\n0x00   | 4    | dwState     | uint  | Current entity state/action identifier\n0x04   | 4    | dwSubState  | uint  | Entity substate or action parameter\n0x08   | 84   | _reserved1  | byte[]| Reserved/unknown fields (not accessed)\n0x5c   | 1    | byType      | byte  | Entity type category identifier",
      "tags": ["PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_1"]
    },
