      "comment": "Two-stage entity validation wrapper that checks basic validation and entity state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call Ordinal_10890(pEntity) to perform basic entity validation\n2. If validation fails (returns 0), return false immediately\n3. Call ValidateEntityState with pEntity to check entity state and equipment slots\n4. Return true if ValidateEntityState returns non-zero, false otherwise\n\nParameters:\npEntity (GameInterface*): Pointer to game interface structure containing entity data\n\nReturns:\nbool: Combined validation result\n  - true: Both basic validation and entity state validation passed\n  - false: Either basic validation or entity state validation failed\n\nSpecial Cases:\nThis function acts as a validation gate combining two separate validation checks.\nFirst check (Ordinal_10890) performs basic entity validation.\nSecond check (ValidateEntityState) performs detailed state validation including equipment slot availability checks for slots 4 and 5.\nFunction short-circuits on first validation failure to avoid unnecessary processing.",
