      "api_calls": ["MissileSetTargetUnit", "MissileSetTargetUnit", "UNITS_GetOwnerGuid", "UNITS_GetUnitY", "SetMissileTargetUnitId"],
      "instructions": ["0x1BFD0|SUB|ESP, 0x60", "0x1BFD3|PUSH|EBX", "0x1BFD4|PUSH|EBP", "0x1BFD5|PUSH|ESI", "0x1BFD6|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x1BFD8|PUSH|EDI", "0x1BFD9|OR|dword ptr [ESI + 0xe8], 0x40", "0x1BFE0|CALL|0x6fb63760", "0x1BFE5|MOV|EBP, EAX", "0x1BFE7|LEA|EAX, [ESP + 0x14]", "0x1BFEB|PUSH|EAX", "0x1BFEC|LEA|EDX, [ESP + 0x14]", "0x1BFF0|MOV|ECX, ESI", "0x1BFF2|CALL|0x6fae96a0", "0x1BFF7|TEST|EAX, EAX"],
      "comment": "Spawns a projectile missile from a unit with mercenary targeting behavior.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set flag 0x40 on unit's animation state (offset 0xe8)\n2. Get mercenary position pointer via GetMercenaryPosition\n3. Calculate unit coordinates (X,Y) via CalculateUnitCoordinates\n4. Exit early if coordinate calculation fails\n5. Zero out projectile config structure (22 dwords, 0x58 bytes)\n6. Initialize projectile config: flags=0x20, missile type=0x56\n7. If mercenary position is NULL, change flags to 0x420\n8. Set source/target unit and mercenary position in config\n9. Call InitializeAndAllocateProjectile to create missile\n10. If missile creation fails, exit\n11. If mercenary exists: set target mode 1 (direct target)\n12. If no mercenary: set target mode 2, calculate offset coordinates\n    from unit position minus merc coords, pack into target ID\n\nParameters:\npUnit (UnitAny *, ECX): Source unit spawning the projectile\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- No callers found - likely called via function pointer table\n- Mercenary presence determines targeting mode (1=direct, 2=offset)\n- Flag 0x420 used when no mercenary (vs 0x20 with mercenary)\n- Missile type 0x56 (86) is hardcoded\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x40 (64): Animation state flag at offset 0xe8\n0x20 (32): Config flags with mercenary present\n0x420 (1056): Config flags without mercenary (0x400 + 0x20)\n0x56 (86): Missile type index\n0x16 (22): Number of dwords to zero in config struct\n0xe8 (232): Offset to dwGfxFrame in UnitAny[4]\n\nStructure Layout (Projectile Config at local_5c+1):\nOffset  Size  Field           Description\n0x00    4     dwFlags         0x20 or 0x420\n0x04    4     pSourceUnit     Unit creating projectile\n0x08    4     pTargetUnit     Target unit (same as source)\n0x0c    4     pdwMercPos      Mercenary position or NULL\n0x10    4     nMissileType    Missile type 0x56\n0x1c    4     nStartX         Starting X coordinate\n0x20    4     nStartY         Starting Y coordinate\n\nOrdinal References:\nOrdinal_10326: Get unit X coordinate\nOrdinal_10329: Get unit Y coordinate",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
    },
