      "api_calls": ["GetMonsterSkillId", "UNITS_GetOwnerGuid", "UNITS_GetUnitY", "UNITS_GetOwnerGuid", "UNITS_GetUnitY"],
      "instructions": ["0x1C0B0|SUB|ESP, 0x64", "0x1C0B3|PUSH|EBX", "0x1C0B4|PUSH|ESI", "0x1C0B5|PUSH|EDI", "0x1C0B6|MOV|EDI, EDX", "0x1C0B8|MOV|EBX, ECX", "0x1C0BA|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x10], EDI", "0x1C0BE|CALL|0x6fb63760", "0x1C0C3|MOV|ESI, EAX", "0x1C0C5|TEST|ESI, ESI", "0x1C0C7|JZ|0x6faec167", "0x1C0CD|PUSH|EBP", "0x1C0CE|PUSH|EDI", "0x1C0CF|PUSH|0x18", "0x1C0D1|CALL|0x6fb984e8"],
      "comment": "Fires multiple projectiles from a mercenary unit for a specific skill.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate mercenary position via GetMercenaryPosition - exit if NULL\n2. Get projectile count from GetMonsterSkillId(0x18, nSkillIndex) where 0x18 = merc type\n3. Retrieve source unit coordinates via Ordinal_10326/10329 (GetUnitX/GetUnitY)\n4. Retrieve target unit coordinates via Ordinal_10326/10329\n5. Zero-initialize 0x58-byte (22 dword) projectile config structure on stack\n6. Set projectile flags to 0x21 (0x01=preset coords, 0x20=adjust preset)\n7. Set skill mode to 0xD7 (215) for projectile behavior type\n8. Set callback to ApplyTextControlMaxValueClamp for post-spawn processing\n9. Store source unit pointer and calculate offset target coordinates\n10. Target offset = (source * 2) - target, providing trajectory direction\n11. Loop nProjectileCount times calling InitializeAndAllocateProjectile\n12. Each iteration increments projectile index stored in config for variation\n\nParameters:\npMercUnit (UnitAny *, ECX): Pointer to mercenary unit firing projectiles\nnSkillIndex (int, EDX): Skill slot/index determining projectile type and count\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Projectiles are created as side effect via InitializeAndAllocateProjectile\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Returns immediately if GetMercenaryPosition returns NULL\n- Projectile count of 0 or negative skips loop entirely\n- Each projectile uses same base config with incrementing index\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x18 = Monster type ID for mercenary skill lookup\n0x21 = Projectile flags (preset coords + adjust preset mode)\n0xD7 = Skill mode/subtype identifier (215 decimal)\n0x16 = Config struct size in dwords (22 * 4 = 0x58 bytes)\n\nOrdinal References:\nOrdinal_10326 = D2Common.GetUnitX - Get unit X coordinate\nOrdinal_10329 = D2Common.GetUnitY - Get unit Y coordinate",
