      "api_calls": ["UNITS_GetOwnerGuid", "UNITS_GetUnitY", "GetMonsterDataFieldF0", "GetMonsterLevelScaledValue", "UNITS_GetOwnerGuid", "UNITS_GetUnitY", "MissileSetTargetUnit"],
      "instructions": ["0x1C300|SUB|ESP, 0x80", "0x1C306|PUSH|EBX", "0x1C307|PUSH|EBP", "0x1C308|PUSH|ESI", "0x1C309|PUSH|EDI", "0x1C30A|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x10], EDX", "0x1C30E|MOV|EBP, ECX", "0x1C310|CALL|0x6fb63760", "0x1C315|MOV|ESI, EAX", "0x1C317|TEST|ESI, ESI", "0x1C319|JZ|0x6faec3d6", "0x1C31F|MOV|ECX, 0x8", "0x1C324|XOR|EAX, EAX", "0x1C326|LEA|EDI, [ESP + 0x18]", "0x1C32A|PUSH|ESI"],
      "comment": "Spawns a ranged projectile attack for a mercenary unit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get mercenary position coordinates via GetMercenaryPosition\n2. Return early if position is NULL (mercenary invalid or not available)\n3. Initialize item search context (32 bytes) with flags=3\n4. Set source unit to mercenary, copy Z coordinate from position[2]\n5. Call Ordinal_10326/10329 to get X/Y coordinates\n6. Retrieve monster data field 0xF0 for monster type 0x22 (34)\n7. Search for best matching item using FindBestMatchingItem\n8. If no matching item found, return early\n9. Calculate scaled damage value via GetMonsterLevelScaledValue(0x22, nSkillLevel)\n10. Initialize projectile configuration (88 bytes) with flags=0x20\n11. Set missile type to 0xE8 (232), owner unit, position pointer, skill level\n12. Get target coordinates via Ordinal_10326/10329\n13. Allocate and initialize projectile via InitializeAndAllocateProjectile\n14. If projectile created successfully, set target unit via MissileSetTargetUnit\n\nParameters:\npMercenary (UnitAny *, ECX): Pointer to mercenary unit launching the attack\nnSkillLevel (int, EDX): Skill level for damage scaling calculation\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value; projectile spawned as side effect\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- NULL mercenary position: Early return, no projectile spawned\n- No matching item found: Early return after item search\n- Projectile allocation failure: Early return, MissileSetTargetUnit not called\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x03 - Item search flags (find ranged weapon)\n0x20 - Projectile config flags (standard missile)\n0x22 (34) - Monster type index for mercenary archer\n0xE8 (232) - Missile type ID for mercenary projectile\n\nRelated Functions:\n- GetMercenaryPosition: Retrieves mercenary coordinate data\n- FindBestMatchingItem: Searches for equipped ranged weapon\n- GetMonsterLevelScaledValue: Calculates level-scaled damage\n- InitializeAndAllocateProjectile: Creates missile entity\n- MissileSetTargetUnit: Sets projectile target\n- Ordinal_10326: D2Common.GetUnitX - Get unit X coordinate\n- Ordinal_10329: D2Common.GetUnitY - Get unit Y coordinate\n\nStructure Layout (Item Search Context at ESP+0x18):\nOffset  Size  Field           Type     Description\n0x00    4     dwFlags         uint     Search flags (0x03 = ranged weapon)\n0x04    4     pSourceUnit     UnitAny* Source unit for item search\n0x08    4     dwPositionZ     dword    Z coordinate from position\n0x0C    4     dwX             dword    X coordinate (filled by ordinal)\n0x10    4     dwY             dword    Y coordinate (filled by ordinal)\n0x14    4     dwMonsterData   uint     Monster data field 0xF0\n\nStructure Layout (Projectile Config at ESP+0x38):\nOffset  Size  Field           Type     Description\n0x00    4     dwFlags         uint     Projectile flags (0x20)\n0x04    4     pOwnerUnit      UnitAny* Owner/source unit\n0x08    4     pdwPosition     dword*   Position coordinate pointer\n0x10    4     dwMissileType   uint     Missile type ID (0xE8)\n0x30    4     nSkillLevel     int      Skill level for damage",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_MonsterData", "STRUCT_Path", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_2", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_Room2", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
