      "comment": "Boolean wrapper for ValidateEntityState - returns true if entity state is valid.\n\nClassification: Thunk/Wrapper\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call ValidateEntityState(pEntity) to get validation result\n2. Convert result to boolean (non-zero becomes true)\n\nParameters:\npEntity (GameInterface*): Pointer to game entity interface to validate (ECX, fastcall)\n\nReturns:\nbool: true if ValidateEntityState returned non-zero (entity valid), false otherwise\n\nAssembly Idiom:\nNEG EAX; SBB EAX,EAX; NEG EAX - Standard x86 pattern to convert non-zero to 1:\n- NEG EAX: Sets CF if EAX was non-zero\n- SBB EAX,EAX: EAX = 0 - 0 - CF = -CF (0 or -1)\n- NEG EAX: Converts -1 to 1, 0 stays 0",
