      "comment": "Process skill parameters and trigger area-based skill effects.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set flag bit 0x40 at pSkillEntity offset +0xe8 to mark skill as area-based\n2. Allocate skill parameter buffer (0x100 bytes) using Ordinal_10594\n3. Validate allocation succeeded, error if NULL with \"ptSkill\" assertion\n4. Validate nParam2 field at buffer offset +0xf4 is non-zero, error if zero with \"ptSkill->nParam2\" assertion\n5. Calculate total iterations: nIterations = (nParam2 - 1) / buffer[+0xf4] + buffer[+0xf0]\n6. Calculate stride for area spread: nStride = nIterations / 3 using magic constant 0x55555556\n7. Call ProcessSkillAreaPositions with effect type 0x184, calculated iterations and stride\n8. Trigger skill event 0x103 using FUN_6fb8d210 with zero float parameters\n\nParameters:\n  pSkillEntity: Pointer to skill entity structure with flags at offset +0xe8 (0x3a * 4 = 232 decimal)\n  nParam2: Skill parameter value used for iteration calculation (skill level or area size multiplier)\n  IMPLICIT EBX: Preserved through PUSH/POP for skill entity pointer backup\n  IMPLICIT ESI: Preserved through PUSH/POP for nParam2 backup\n  IMPLICIT EDI: Holds allocated buffer pointer from Ordinal_10594\n\nReturns:\n  void - Function applies skill effects as side effect through ProcessSkillAreaPositions\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  If Ordinal_10594 returns NULL, calls Ordinal_10023 with error string \"ptSkill\" at line 0x2e then exits with -1\n  If allocated buffer field +0xf4 is zero, calls Ordinal_10023 with \"ptSkill->nParam2\" error at line 0x2f then exits with -1\n  Division by 3 uses compiler optimization: IMUL with 0x55555556, right shift 31, add to get quotient\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0x40 (64 decimal): Flag bit marking area-based skill processing at offset +0xe8\n  0x100 (256 decimal): Size of skill parameter buffer allocation\n  0x3a (58 decimal): Array index for flag field (byte offset 0xe8 = 58 * 4)\n  0xf4 (244 decimal): Byte offset to nParam2 divisor field in allocated buffer\n  0xf0 (240 decimal): Byte offset to base iteration offset field in allocated buffer\n  0x184 (388 decimal): Effect type constant for skill damage area effects\n  0x103 (259 decimal): Skill event code passed to FUN_6fb8d210\n  0x2e (46 decimal): Line number for \"ptSkill\" null pointer error\n  0x2f (47 decimal): Line number for \"ptSkill->nParam2\" zero value error\n  0x55555556: Magic constant for division by 3 (computed as ceil(2^32 / 3))\n  -1 (0xffffffff): Exit code for fatal assertion failure\n\nError Handling:\n  NULL allocation check calls Ordinal_10023 (assertion handler) with source file and line number\n  Zero nParam2 validation calls Ordinal_10023 with field-specific error message\n  Both errors call FUN_6fb9a10f(-1) which terminates execution without returning\n  Error messages reference C source: \"C:\\Projects\\Diablo2\\Source\\D2Client\\...\"\n\nStructure Layout:\n  Allocated Buffer Structure (via Ordinal_10594):\n    Offset  Size  Field Name       Type   Description\n    +0xf0   4     nBaseIterations  int    Base iteration count added to calculated value\n    +0xf4   4     nParam2Divisor   int    Divisor for nParam2 in iteration calculation\n\n  pSkillEntity Structure (partial):\n    Offset  Size  Field Name       Type   Description\n    +0xe8   4     dwFlags          uint   Skill processing flags, bit 0x40 = area-based",
