      "comment": "Check if unit does NOT have state flag 0x99 set.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call GetUnitStateFlag(pUnit, 0x99) to check state flag 153\n2. Apply NEG/SBB/INC idiom to invert the boolean result:\n   - NEG EAX: Sets CF if EAX != 0\n   - SBB EAX, EAX: EAX = -1 if CF set, 0 if clear\n   - INC EAX: EAX = 0 if flag was set, 1 if flag was clear\n3. Return inverted result (true if flag absent, false if flag present)\n\nParameters:\npUnit (UnitAny * in ECX) - Pointer to unit structure to check\n\nReturns:\nbool - true if state flag 0x99 is NOT set on the unit, false if it IS set\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- State flag 0x99 (153 decimal) - specific game state being checked\n- Returns inverse of GetUnitStateFlag result\n- NULL pUnit handling delegated to GetUnitStateFlag\n\nClassification: Leaf wrapper - single callee with result inversion",
