      "comment": "Consumes one charge from unit's equipped item/skill and applies full damage reduction.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate unit state by checking offset +0x38 is initialized\n2. Retrieve charge reference (skill/item) from unit via D2COMMON ordinal 10323\n3. If validation succeeded, query current charge count via D2COMMON ordinal 10976\n4. If remaining charges > 1, decrement charge count by 1 via D2COMMON ordinal 10980\n5. Apply 100% damage reduction to unit (nullifies incoming damage)\n\nParameters:\n- pUnit: Pointer to UnitAny structure representing player/monster with charged item\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Modifies unit state in place\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If validation fails (offset +0x38 null), early return without consuming charge\n- If charge count <= 1, skip charge consumption but still apply reduction\n- Charge reference (uVar2) is opaque handle from D2COMMON charge system\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x38: Offset to validation field in UnitAny (checked by FUN_6fb63760)\n- 100: Full damage reduction percentage (0% damage taken)\n- 1: Minimum charge threshold before decrement (preserves last charge)\n\nSSA Variables:\n- iVar1 (fValidated): Validation result from FUN_6fb63760, then reused for charge count\n- uVar2 (dwChargeRef): D2COMMON charge reference handle (undefined4 type)",
      "tags": ["PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_1"]
