      "instructions": ["0x1D240|PUSH|EBP", "0x1D241|PUSH|ESI", "0x1D242|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x1D244|MOV|EBP, EDX", "0x1D246|TEST|ESI, ESI", "0x1D248|JZ|0x6faed293", "0x1D24A|PUSH|EBX", "0x1D24B|PUSH|EDI", "0x1D24C|PUSH|ESI", "0x1D24D|CALL|0x6fb98566", "0x1D252|MOV|EBX, EAX", "0x1D254|CMP|EBX, 0x4e", "0x1D257|JL|0x6faed26c", "0x1D259|MOV|EBX, 0x4d", "0x1D25E|PUSH|EBX"],
      "comment": "Initialize homing path data for a missile unit\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pMissile is not NULL; return immediately if NULL\n2. Get current missile target distance via GetMissileTargetX\n3. Cap target distance at 0x4D (77) maximum:\n   - If distance > 77, set to 77\n   - Update missile target unit and data field 2C with capped value\n4. Get Path structure from missile at offset +0x38\n5. Initialize RNG state at missile offset +0x2C with provided seed\n6. Set path type to 10 (homing path type)\n7. Set cell direction count on path to target distance\n8. Calculate unit path to target with no blocker ignore\n\nParameters:\n  pMissile (ECX) - Pointer to missile UnitAny structure; NULL-checked\n  dwRngSeed (EDX) - Seed value for RNG state initialization\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x4D (77) - Maximum homing distance cap\n  0x38 - Offset to Path pointer in missile structure\n  0x2C - Offset to RNG state in missile structure\n  10 - Path type for homing missiles\n  0 - nIgnoreBlockers flag (do not ignore blockers)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  If pMissile is NULL, function returns immediately without action\n  If target distance exceeds 77, it is capped and both target unit\n  and data field 2C are updated with the capped value",
