      "api_count": 4,
      "api_calls": ["UNITS_GetSummonOwnerUnitId", "FogAssert", "SetOverlayCallback", "FogAssert"],
      "instructions": ["0x1D640|PUSH|EBX", "0x1D641|PUSH|ESI", "0x1D642|PUSH|EDI", "0x1D643|MOV|EDI, ECX", "0x1D645|MOV|ESI, EDX", "0x1D647|PUSH|EDI", "0x1D648|CALL|0x6fb983c2", "0x1D64D|SUB|ESI, 0xfb", "0x1D653|JS|0x6faed6fe", "0x1D659|CMP|ESI, 0x1e", "0x1D65C|JGE|0x6faed6fe", "0x1D662|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x1D664|JZ|0x6faed6f8", "0x1D66A|LEA|ESI, [ESI + ESI*0x4]", "0x1D66D|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x10]"],
      "comment": "Execute skill-specific effect callback for Assassin skills\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate unit pointer using Ordinal_10323(pUnit)\n2. Calculate skill table index: nSkillTableIndex = nSkillId - 0xFB (251)\n3. Validate skill table index is in range [0, 0x1E) (0-29)\n4. If out of range, log error and abort with exit code 0xFFFFFFFF\n5. If unit validation failed, return early without executing callback\n6. Check if missile target skill ID is defined (not 0xFFFF) in skill params table\n7. If missile target defined, calculate coordinates via CalculateMissileTargetCoordinates()\n8. Set unit flag 0x40 in pUnit[0x3A] after missile calculation\n9. Check if skill callback function pointer exists in params table\n10. If callback is NULL, set unit flag 0x40 and skip execution\n11. If callback exists, validate pointer is not bad code pointer via IsBadCodePtr()\n12. If bad code pointer detected, log error and abort with exit code 0xFFFFFFFF\n13. Invoke skill callback function pointer with no parameters\n14. Retrieve audio context for unit via Ordinal_10958(pUnit, 0)\n15. If audio context exists, remove it from list via RemoveAudioContextFromList()\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - Pointer to UnitAny structure representing the game entity executing the skill\n  nSkillId - Skill ID value (expected range: 0xFB to 0x119, or 251-281 decimal)\n  dwFlags - Flags controlling skill execution behavior (passed to CalculateMissileTargetCoordinates)\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value\n  \nSpecial Cases:\n  - If nSkillId < 0xFB (251) or nSkillId >= 0x119 (281), logs error and aborts\n  - If unit validation fails (Ordinal_10323 returns 0), function returns early\n  - If skill callback pointer is NULL, sets unit flag 0x40 but continues without error\n  - If callback pointer is invalid (IsBadCodePtr returns true), logs error and aborts\n\nError Handling:\n  - Out of range skill ID: Logs \"nSkillId > 0 && nSkillId < NUM_SKILLS\" assertion\n  - Invalid callback pointer: Logs \"sgpctSkillChartAssassin->nSkillId\" assertion\n  - Both errors call FUN_6fb9a10f(0xFFFFFFFF) which terminates process\n\nStructure Layout:\n  SkillParams table at 0x6FBA6D7C (30 entries, 20-byte stride):\n    Offset | Size | Field Name           | Type      | Description\n    -------|------|----------------------|-----------|----------------------------------\n    0x00   | 4    | dwMissileTargetSkill | uint      | Missile target skill ID (0xFFFF if none)\n    0x04   | 4    | pfnCallback          | void(*)() | Skill effect callback function pointer\n    0x08   | 12   | (padding/reserved)   | byte[12]  | Additional skill parameters\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0xFB (251) - Minimum Assassin skill ID (base offset for table lookup)\n  0x1E (30) - Number of Assassin skill entries in params table\n  0x119 (281) - Maximum Assassin skill ID (251 + 30)\n  0x14 (20) - Size of SkillParams structure in bytes (stride)\n  0xFFFF - Sentinel value indicating no missile target skill defined\n  0x40 - Unit flag bit set after skill execution or callback skip\n  0x3A - Offset in UnitAny structure for skill-related flags (byte offset 232)\n  0xFFFFFFFF - Exit code used for fatal assertion failures\n\nFlag Bits:\n  Unit Flags at pUnit[0x3A]:\n    Bit | Hex  | Meaning\n    ----|------|----------------------------------------------------------\n    6   | 0x40 | Skill effect executed or callback skipped flag",
      "tags": ["MOD_SKILLS", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "UI_SKILLS", "PARAM_3", "CLASS_ASSASSIN", "SRC_SkillsAss.cpp", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control"]
