      "comment": "Validates sound system initialization and plays a hardcoded sound effect.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate context handle by calling validation function\n2. If validation succeeds, check if sound system is available via external ordinal\n3. If sound system available, play sound with ID 0x9c0 (2496 decimal)\n4. Return success (1) if sound played, failure (0) if validation failed\n\nParameters:\n  nContextHandle (int) - Context or handle passed to validation function, likely game state or sound context\n  \nReturns:\n  1 (true) - Sound validation and playback succeeded\n  0 (false) - Sound validation failed or sound system unavailable\n  \nSpecial Cases:\n  - Returns 0 immediately if initial context validation fails\n  - Returns 0 if external sound system ordinal check fails\n  - Always calls FUN_6fb8d210 with hardcoded parameters: sound ID 0x9c0, x/y coordinates 0.0, instance param 0\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0x9c0 (2496 decimal) - Hardcoded sound effect ID passed to playback function",
