      "comment": "Play hit sound effect for unit when damaged\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Retrieve current game timer/tick value via Ordinal_10365\n2. Calculate hit class-based sound volume using FUN_6fb868b0 with unit and timer value\n3. Subtract 3 from calculated value and apply sign-extension mask for volume normalization\n4. Queue sound effect 0x9cc (2508) via FUN_6fb8d210 with normalized volume\n5. Return success (1)\n\nParameters:\n- pUnit: UnitAny * - Pointer to unit entity that was hit\n\nReturns:\n- bool (always 1/true) - Success indicator\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n- 0x9cc (2508): Hit sound effect identifier\n- 0x3: Volume adjustment offset for hit class calculation\n- 0.0: Initial sound position offset (uses unit position from pUnit)",
      "tags": ["PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_1"]
