      "api_count": 5,
      "api_calls": ["GetUnitAttackWeapon", "GetItemTypePropertyByte", "GetStatValue", "GetItemType", "IsItemNormalQuality"],
      "instructions": ["0x1DB70|SUB|ESP, 0x8", "0x1DB73|PUSH|EBX", "0x1DB74|PUSH|EBP", "0x1DB75|PUSH|ESI", "0x1DB76|PUSH|EDI", "0x1DB77|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x1DB79|PUSH|0x1", "0x1DB7B|MOV|EBP, EDX", "0x1DB7D|PUSH|ESI", "0x1DB7E|CALL|0x6fb983ce", "0x1DB83|MOV|EBX, EAX", "0x1DB85|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESI + 0x44]", "0x1DB88|AND|AL, 0x0", "0x1DB8A|CMP|EAX, 0x900", "0x1DB8F|JL|0x6faedb9f"],
      "comment": "Processes weapon-based missile/projectile attacks for a unit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get unit's attack weapon via GetUnitAttackWeapon(pUnit, 1)\n2. Check if unit stat at offset 0x44 (high 24 bits) >= 0x900\n   - If true, set flag 0x40 at offset 0xe8 (ranged attack mode flag)\n3. If no weapon exists, exit early\n4. Check weapon throwability via GetItemTypePropertyByte\n5. If not throwable, check stat 0x7d (STAT_ITEM_THROWABLE)\n   - If neither is set, exit early (weapon cannot be thrown/fired)\n6. Get weapon's item type via GetItemType\n7. If item type is 0xFFFF (invalid), exit early\n8. Check weapon quality via IsItemNormalQuality\n   - If quality is 0x26 (throwing weapon):\n     a. Calculate unit coordinates via CalculateUnitCoordinates\n     b. Create projectile at unit's position via CreateAndInitializeProjectile\n   - Otherwise:\n     a. Use standard missile targeting via CalculateMissileTargetCoordinates\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit (ECX) - UnitAny* - The attacking unit\n  dwMissileFlags (EDX) - uint - Missile creation flags passed to projectile functions\n\nReturns:\n  void - Side effects only (creates missile/projectile entities)\n\nLocal Variables:\n  nCoordX - int - Unit X coordinate for throwing weapon spawn\n  nCoordY - int - Unit Y coordinate for throwing weapon spawn\n\nSSA Temporaries (decompiler-generated):\n  bVar1 (byThrowable) - byte - GetItemTypePropertyByte result\n  bVar2 (fIsThrowingQuality) - bool - IsItemNormalQuality result\n  uVar3 (wItemType) - ushort - GetItemType result\n  iVar4 (nThrowableStat) - int - GetStatValue result for 0x7d\n  extraout_var* - undefined - Return value extension artifacts (ignored)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Exits early if weapon is NULL\n  - Exits early if weapon is not throwable and has no throwable stat\n  - Exits early if item type is invalid (0xFFFF)\n  - Throwing weapons (quality 0x26) spawn projectile at unit coords\n  - Other weapons use missile targeting system\n\nStructure Offsets (UnitAny):\n  Offset  Size  Field              Description\n  0x44    4     dwUnitFlags        Unit state flags (high bits checked)\n  0xe8    4     dwAttackModeFlags  Attack mode flags (0x40 = ranged mode)\n\nFlag Bits (0xe8):\n  0x40 - Ranged attack mode enabled\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x900 - Threshold for ranged attack mode activation\n  0x7d  - STAT_ITEM_THROWABLE stat ID\n  0xFFFF - Invalid item type sentinel\n  0x26  - Throwing weapon quality value",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_2", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
    },
