      "api_calls": ["UNITS_GetSummonOwnerUnitId", "FogAssert", "SetSkillTargetUnitGUID", "UNITS_GetOwnerGuid", "UNITS_GetUnitY", "UNITS_GetOwnerGuid", "UNITS_GetUnitY", "GetUnitCollisionSize", "UNITS_GetRoom", "FindValidCollisionTileSimple", "...+26 more"],
      "instructions": ["0x1DD40|SUB|ESP, 0x30", "0x1DD43|PUSH|EBX", "0x1DD44|PUSH|EBP", "0x1DD45|PUSH|ESI", "0x1DD46|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x1DD48|PUSH|EDI", "0x1DD49|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x24], EDX", "0x1DD4D|PUSH|ESI", "0x1DD4E|CALL|0x6fb983c2", "0x1DD53|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESI]", "0x1DD55|MOV|EDI, EAX", "0x1DD57|XOR|EAX, EAX", "0x1DD59|CMP|ECX, 0x1", "0x1DD5C|SETZ|AL", "0x1DD5F|MOV|EBP, EAX"],
      "comment": "Executes teleport skill targeting for player or mercenary units.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get skill from unit via Ordinal_10323\n2. Assert skill is valid (FogAssert on null)\n3. If mercenary (field_0 == 1):\n   a. Get mercenary position\n   b. If no mercenary position, calculate unit coords and clear GUID\n   c. Otherwise compute mirrored coords (2*merc - unit)\n   d. Find valid collision tile with 0x3C01 mask\n4. If player (field_0 == 0):\n   a. Calculate unit coordinates\n   b. Find region by coordinates\n   c. Validate entity DRLG subtype\n   d. Get skill range from SkillsTxt via GetMonsterLevelScaledStat\n   e. Calculate distance to target\n   f. Scale target to max range if beyond distance\n   g. Clamp delta offsets to [-2, 2] range\n   h. Iterate 3 positions (original, +delta, -delta):\n      - Find region and validate collision (0x1C09 mask)\n      - Check room attribute mask\n      - Verify collision in field bounds (0x804)\n      - Accept if distance <= max range\n   i. If no valid position, call ProcessSkillEquipmentSlotSelection(0x12)\n5. Apply tile attribute pattern (0x80)\n6. Set unit state flag 0x36\n7. Configure skill: owner type, target X/Y, GUID if mercenary\n8. If player, call InitializeGameObjectProperties(0x9D2)\n9. Set skill client func (0x1080)\n10. Process unit ability\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit (ECX): UnitAny pointer - player or mercenary unit\n  nSkillId (EDX): Skill ID for teleport\n\nReturns:\n  1 on success, 0 on failure (no valid position found)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Mercenary mode mirrors destination relative to merc position\n  - Player mode tries 3 positions with collision validation\n  - Fails if skill is null (assert + exit)\n  - Early return if coordinates/room invalid\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x1C09 - Player collision mask\n  0x3C01 - Mercenary collision mask  \n  0x804 - Field bounds collision flag\n  0x80 - Tile attribute pattern\n  0x36 - Teleport state flag\n  0x12 - Equipment slot selection mode\n  0x9D2 - Game object type for visual effect\n  0x1080 - Skill client function ID\n  0x1E8 (488) - Assert line number",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "SRC_SkillsBar.cpp", "STRUCT_ItemData", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData", "STRUCT_StatList", "PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Path", "PARAM_2", "UI_SKILLS", "STRUCT_Skill", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY"]
