      "instructions": ["0x1E540|PUSH|ECX", "0x1E541|PUSH|EBX", "0x1E542|PUSH|EBP", "0x1E543|PUSH|ESI", "0x1E544|PUSH|EDI", "0x1E545|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x1E547|MOV|EDI, EDX", "0x1E549|XOR|EBX, EBX", "0x1E54B|PUSH|ESI", "0x1E54C|MOV|EDX, dword ptr [ESI]", "0x1E54E|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESI + 0x38]", "0x1E551|CMP|EDX, 0x1", "0x1E554|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x14], EAX", "0x1E558|SETZ|BL", "0x1E55B|CALL|0x6fb98164"],
      "comment": "Initialize compression state and buffer parameters based on compression mode.\n\nAlgorithm:\n\n1. Read compression mode from context structure (offset 0x0)\n2. Read internal handle from context structure (offset 0x38)\n3. Obtain compression handle via D2COMMON.Ordinal_10342\n4. If mode == 1 (high compression mode):\n   a. If target coordinates provided (nTargetX != 0 AND nTargetY != 0):\n      - Get buffer pointer via D2COMMON.Ordinal_10210\n      - Initialize compression with buffer size 0x100 (256 bytes) via D2CMP.Ordinal_10126\n   b. Configure internal handle buffer size to 0x100 via D2COMMON.Ordinal_10182\n   c. Set internal handle parameter to 0x3c01 (15361) via D2COMMON.Ordinal_10184\n   d. Set mode value to 2\n5. Else (low compression mode):\n   a. If target coordinates provided (nTargetX != 0 AND nTargetY != 0):\n      - Get buffer pointer via D2COMMON.Ordinal_10210\n      - Initialize compression with buffer size 0x80 (128 bytes) via D2CMP.Ordinal_10126\n   b. Configure internal handle buffer size to 0x80 via D2COMMON.Ordinal_10182\n   c. Set internal handle parameter to 0x1c09 (7177) via D2COMMON.Ordinal_10184\n   d. Set mode value to 7\n6. Apply mode value to internal handle via D2COMMON.Ordinal_10185\n7. Validate compression state via FUN_6fb63680\n8. If validation returns non-zero, reset context via D2COMMON.Ordinal_10143\n\nParameters:\n\n  pCompressionContext - Pointer to compression context structure\n  nTargetX - Target X coordinate (0 = skip buffer initialization)\n  nTargetY - Target Y coordinate (0 = skip buffer initialization)\n\nReturns:\n\n  void - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n\n  - If nTargetX or nTargetY is zero, buffer initialization (step 4a/5a) is skipped\n  - Mode value 1 triggers high compression with 256-byte buffer\n  - Other mode values trigger low compression with 128-byte buffer\n\nStructure Layout:\n\nOffset | Size | Field Name         | Type | Description\n-------|------|--------------------|------|----------------------------------\n0x00   | 4    | nMode              | int  | Compression mode (1=high, other=low)\n0x38   | 4    | dwInternalHandle   | uint | Internal compression handle\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n\n  0x100 (256) - High compression buffer size in bytes\n  0x80 (128) - Low compression buffer size in bytes\n  0x3c01 (15361) - High compression mode configuration parameter\n  0x1c09 (7177) - Low compression mode configuration parameter\n  2 - High compression mode value\n  7 - Low compression mode value",
      "tags": ["PARAM_3", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
