      "comment": "Configure object properties based on validation and context mode.\n\nAlgorithm:\n\n1. Validate object by calling Ordinal_10323 to obtain handle\n2. Retrieve data context for object via FUN_6fb63760\n3. Check both handle and data context are non-NULL\n4. Validate data context with Ordinal_11020\n5. Retrieve property values from data context (Ordinal_10326, Ordinal_10329)\n6. Apply properties to handle (Ordinal_10980, Ordinal_10981)\n7. Access nested structure pointer at data context offset +0x04\n8. Call Ordinal_10582 to resolve nested structure pointer\n9. Read mode byte from nested structure at offset +0x19a\n10. Branch on mode byte value and call Ordinal_10982 with mode-specific property\n11. Return success (1) if all validations pass, failure (0) otherwise\n\nParameters:\n\npObject - Pointer to object requiring property configuration\n\nReturns:\n\ntrue (1) - Object properties successfully configured based on mode\nfalse (0) - Validation failed (NULL handle, NULL context, or validation check failed)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n\nMode byte 0x02: Sets property 0xfc (252 decimal) - Binary mode configuration\nMode byte 0x03: Sets property 0xff (255 decimal) - Extended mode configuration  \nOther values: Sets property 0xf9 (249 decimal) - Default/fallback mode\n\nStructure Layout:\n\nData Context Structure:\nOffset  Size  Field Name       Type      Description\n------  ----  ---------------  --------  -----------\n0x00    4     (unknown)        void *    Base pointer\n0x04    4     pNestedStruct    void *    Pointer to nested configuration structure\n\nNested Structure:\nOffset  Size  Field Name       Type      Description\n------  ----  ---------------  --------  -----------\n0x19a   1     byMode           byte      Configuration mode selector (0x02, 0x03, or other)\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n\n0xfc (252) - Binary mode property value\n0xf9 (249) - Default mode property value  \n0xff (255) - Extended mode property value\n0x02 - Binary mode selector\n0x03 - Extended mode selector\n0x19a (410 decimal) - Offset to mode byte in nested structure\n0x04 - Offset to nested structure pointer in data context",
