      "api_calls": ["UNITS_GetSummonOwnerUnitId", "SetOverlayCallback", "FogAssert"],
      "instructions": ["0x1EF90|PUSH|ESI", "0x1EF91|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x1EF93|PUSH|EDI", "0x1EF94|MOV|EDI, EDX", "0x1EF96|PUSH|ESI", "0x1EF97|CALL|0x6fb983c2", "0x1EF9C|SUB|EDI, 0x7e", "0x1EF9F|JS|0x6faef012", "0x1EFA1|CMP|EDI, 0x1e", "0x1EFA4|JGE|0x6faef012", "0x1EFA6|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x1EFA8|JZ|0x6faef00d", "0x1EFAA|LEA|EDI, [EDI + EDI*0x4]", "0x1EFAD|PUSH|EBX", "0x1EFAE|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x10]"],
      "comment": "Process skill event for unit and execute associated handlers\n\nAlgorithm:\n\n1. Validate unit context by calling Ordinal_10323(pUnit)\n2. Calculate skill index by subtracting base skill ID (0x7E) from dwSkillId\n3. Validate skill index range: must be >= 0 and < 0x1E (30 decimal)\n4. If validation fails, trigger assertion with error message and terminate\n5. If validation succeeds but unit context invalid, return early\n6. Calculate skill table entry address: g_SkillEventTable + nSkillIndex * 0x14\n7. Check missile target coordinate at table offset +0x0\n8. If coordinate != 0xFFFF, call CalculateMissileTargetCoordinates and set flag 0x40\n9. Retrieve callback function pointer from table offset +0x4\n10. If callback is NULL, set flag 0x40 in unit flags\n11. If callback is valid, invoke callback with (pUnit, dwParam) via __fastcall\n12. Query audio context for unit via Ordinal_10958(pUnit, 0)\n13. If audio context exists, remove it from list via RemoveAudioContextFromList\n14. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\n\npUnit - Pointer to UnitAny structure representing the game entity\ndwSkillId - Skill identifier (valid range: 0x7E to 0x9B inclusive, 126-155 decimal)\ndwParam - Additional parameter passed to skill effect callback\n\nIMPLICIT:\nEBX - Preserved parameter value passed to callback function\n\nReturns:\n\nvoid - No explicit return value\nSide effects: Modifies unit flags, removes audio context, invokes skill callbacks\n\nSpecial Cases:\n\nSkill ID out of range (< 0x7E or >= 0x9C): Assertion failure, program termination\nUnit context validation fails: Early return without processing\nMissile coordinate == 0xFFFF: Skip missile target calculation\nCallback function pointer == NULL: Set flag 0x40 but do not invoke callback\nAudio context == NULL: Skip audio context removal\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n\n0x7E (126) - Minimum valid skill ID (base skill offset)\n0x1E (30) - Maximum skill count (valid index range 0-29)\n0x9C (156) - Maximum skill ID boundary (0x7E + 0x1E)\n0x14 (20) - Skill table entry stride in bytes\n0xFFFF (65535) - Sentinel value indicating no missile target coordinate\n0x40 (64) - Unit flag bit indicating skill event processed\n0x3A (58) - Offset to flags field in UnitAny structure (byte offset 0xE8)\n0x5E3 (1507) - Assertion line number in source file\n\nSkill Event Table Layout:\n\nBase Address: g_SkillEventTable (0x6fba6ff4)\nEntry Size: 20 bytes (0x14)\nEntry Count: 30 entries (0x1E)\n\nOffset | Size | Field Name           | Type          | Description\n-------|------|----------------------|---------------|----------------------------------\n+0x0   | 4    | dwMissileCoordinate  | uint          | Target coordinate or 0xFFFF\n+0x4   | 4    | pfnCallback          | function *    | Skill effect callback or NULL\n+0x8   | 12   | (reserved/unknown)   | byte[12]      | Additional entry data\n\nFlag Bits:\n\n0x40 - Skill event processed or callback was NULL",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "UI_SKILLS", "PARAM_3", "SRC_SkillsBar.cpp", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control"]
