      "comment": "Creates Meteoric Bolts missiles for a monster unit using skill slot parameters.\n\nAlgorithm:\n\n1. Call GetMonsterSkillId with monster ID 0xe1 (225) and skill slot to get missile count\n2. Call CreateMultipleShotMissiles with:\n   - pMonsterUnit as shooter\n   - Missile ID 0x1ca (458) for Meteoric Bolts projectile type\n   - Retrieved nMissileCount for spread pattern\n   - dwSkillSlot as target X coordinate\n   - Collision detection disabled (false)\n   - Target Y coordinate 0x200 (512)\n   - Create initial targeted missile (true)\n\nParameters:\n\npMonsterUnit - Pointer to monster UnitAny creating the missiles (ECX)\ndwSkillSlot - Skill slot index passed to GetMonsterSkillId and as target X (EDX)\n\nReturns:\n\nvoid - No return value\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n\n0xe1 (225) - Monster ID for Meteoric Bolts skill lookup\n0x1ca (458) - Missile type identifier for Meteoric Bolts projectile\n0x200 (512) - Fixed target Y coordinate parameter\n0x1 (1) - fCreateTargeted flag (create initial targeted missile)\n0x0 (0) - fCollisionFlag (collision detection disabled)\n\nNote: This is a wrapper function that standardizes Meteoric Bolts missile creation\nfor monster units. The missile count is dynamically retrieved based on monster skill\nconfiguration rather than being hardcoded.",
