      "instructions": ["0x1F3F0|SUB|ESP, 0x68", "0x1F3F3|LEA|EAX, [ESP + 0x4]", "0x1F3F7|PUSH|EBP", "0x1F3F8|PUSH|ESI", "0x1F3F9|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x1F3FB|PUSH|EDI", "0x1F3FC|MOV|EBP, EDX", "0x1F3FE|PUSH|EAX", "0x1F3FF|MOV|EDI, dword ptr [ESI + 0xe8]", "0x1F405|LEA|EDX, [ESP + 0x10]", "0x1F409|OR|EDI, 0x40", "0x1F40C|MOV|dword ptr [ESI + 0xe8], EDI", "0x1F412|CALL|0x6fae96a0", "0x1F417|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x1F419|JZ|0x6faef4db"],
      "comment": "Creates 5 projectiles in a line pattern extending from the source unit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set unit anti-push flag (0x40) at UnitAny[4].dwGfxFrame\n2. Get source unit world coordinates via CalculateUnitCoordinates\n3. Get source unit's target coordinates via Ordinal_10326/10329\n4. Calculate direction vector: delta = source_pos - target_pos\n5. Scale direction vector via ScaleVectorToMinimumMagnitude and ScaleVectorToThreshold\n6. Set starting position: current_pos = source_pos - (delta * 2)\n7. Zero projectile config structure (0x16 dwords = 88 bytes)\n8. Initialize projectile config: flags=0x20, type=0x1ff\n9. Loop 5 times: spawn projectile at current position, advance by delta\n\nParameters:\npSourceUnit - UnitAny pointer to the unit creating projectiles (IMPLICIT: ECX)\ndwProjectileId - Projectile type identifier for the spawn (IMPLICIT: EDX)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If CalculateUnitCoordinates fails (returns 0), function exits without spawning\n- Starting position is offset backwards by 2x the direction vector\n- Creates projectiles moving away from target, not towards it\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x40 - Anti-push flag in UnitAny[4].dwGfxFrame\n0x20 - Projectile config flag (base flags for line spawn)\n0x1ff - Projectile type/ID value (511)\n0x16 - Number of dwords to zero (22 dwords = 88 bytes)\n5 - Number of projectiles to spawn in the line\n\nStructure Layout - Projectile Config (starts at nDeltaY+4):\nOffset  Size  Field               Type     Description\n0x00    4     dwControlFlags      dword    Projectile creation flags (0x20)\n0x04    4     pOwnerUnit          UnitAny* Source/owner unit pointer\n0x08    4     pOwnerDup           UnitAny* Duplicate owner reference\n0x10    4     dwProjectileFlags   dword    Projectile flags (0x1ff)\n0x24    4     nSpawnX             int      X coordinate for spawn\n0x28    4     nSpawnY             int      Y coordinate for spawn\n0x34    4     dwProjectileType    dword    Projectile type ID from param",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_StatList", "STRUCT_Path", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_2", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_Skill", "STRUCT_Room2", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
