      "comment": "Creates a skill-conditional overlay effect on a game unit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n\n1. Check if unit has skill 0x8b (139 decimal) active using Ordinal_10487\n2. Calculate overlay ID based on skill presence:\n   - If skill NOT present: overlay ID = 0xc6 (198)\n   - If skill IS present: overlay ID = 0xc7 (199)\n3. Create overlay with calculated ID using FUN_6fb931f0 (overlay creation function)\n4. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n\npUnit - Pointer to UnitAny structure representing the game entity receiving the overlay\n\nReturns:\n\nAlways returns 1 (undefined4) indicating successful overlay creation\n\nSpecial Cases:\n\nSkill ID 0x8b (139 decimal) - The specific skill being tested for conditional overlay selection\nOverlay ID 0xc6 (198 decimal) - Applied when skill is NOT active\nOverlay ID 0xc7 (199 decimal) - Applied when skill IS active\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n\n0x8b (139) - Skill ID parameter passed to Ordinal_10487 for skill state check\n0xc6 (198) - Base overlay ID when skill check returns false/zero\n0xc7 (199) - Alternate overlay ID when skill check returns true/non-zero\n2 - Overlay mode parameter (passed as param_3 to FUN_6fb931f0)\n0 - Unused parameters (param_4 through param_8) all zero",
