      "comment": "Apply conditional overlay effect based on unit state check.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if unit has overlay 0x8c (140) active\n2. Convert boolean result to overlay ID offset (0 or 1)\n3. Call overlay creation function with ID 200 (0xC8) or 201 (0xC9)\n4. Pass overlay mode 2 and zero for remaining parameters\n5. Return success status\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - Pointer to UnitAny structure representing game entity\n\nReturns:\n  Always returns 1 (success)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - If Ordinal_10487 check succeeds: applies overlay 201 (0xC9)\n  - If Ordinal_10487 check fails: applies overlay 200 (0xC8)\n  - Overlay mode is fixed at 2 for both cases\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x8c (140) - Overlay ID used for conditional check\n  200 (0xC8) - Base overlay ID when check fails\n  201 (0xC9) - Alternative overlay ID when check succeeds\n  2 - Overlay mode parameter (type/flags)",
