      "instructions": ["0x20010|SUB|ESP, 0x14", "0x20013|PUSH|ESI", "0x20014|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x20016|LEA|EAX, [ESP + 0x8]", "0x2001A|PUSH|EDI", "0x2001B|LEA|ECX, [ESP + 0x8]", "0x2001F|PUSH|EAX", "0x20020|PUSH|ECX", "0x20021|MOV|EDI, EDX", "0x20023|PUSH|ESI", "0x20024|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x14], 0x0", "0x2002C|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x18], 0x0", "0x20034|CALL|0x6fb9862c", "0x20039|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x8]", "0x2003D|TEST|EAX, EAX"],
      "comment": "Launches a catapult missile with calculated trajectory and validates catapult range requirements.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize delta coordinate variables to zero\n2. Call Ordinal_11066 to calculate delta X and delta Y from unit to target\n3. Validate that both deltas are non-zero (target must have valid direction)\n4. If deltas are zero, trigger assertion failure with error message\n5. Fire missile using FireMissileWithTargetValidation with unit, missile type, and target\n6. Retrieve missile stats structure using Ordinal_10589 with missile type\n7. Validate that stats range field equals 0x19 (CATAPULT_FRAMES constant)\n8. If range check fails, trigger assertion failure\n9. If missile creation succeeded, scale deltas by -25 for arc calculation\n10. Normalize scaled coordinates using Ordinal_10111\n11. Copy original deltas for separate normalization\n12. Normalize unscaled delta coordinates\n13. Set missile velocity with scaled coordinates and speed 400\n14. Set missile arc height with -16 offset and flag 1\n15. Activate missile for launch\n\nParameters:\npUnit (UnitAny *) - Pointer to unit/entity launching the catapult missile\ndwMissileType (uint) - Missile type identifier for the catapult projectile\nnTargetParam (int) - Target parameter (coordinate or entity reference)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value, terminates process on validation failure",
