      "api_count": 1,
      "api_calls": ["GetMonsterSkillId"],
      "instructions": ["0x20340|SUB|ESP, 0x58", "0x20343|PUSH|EBX", "0x20344|PUSH|EBP", "0x20345|PUSH|ESI", "0x20346|MOV|EBP, EDX", "0x20348|PUSH|EDI", "0x20349|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x2034B|PUSH|0xc0", "0x20350|MOV|EDX, 0x1d5", "0x20355|CALL|0x6faf0410", "0x2035A|PUSH|EBP", "0x2035B|PUSH|0xf1", "0x20360|CALL|0x6fb984e8", "0x20365|MOV|EDI, dword ptr [ESI + 0xe8]", "0x2036B|MOV|EBX, EAX"],
      "comment": "Casts a multi-projectile skill, spawning multiple projectiles in different directions.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call ExecuteMonsterSkill with skill id 0x1d5 and param 0xc0\n2. Get projectile count from GetMonsterSkillId(0xf1, nSkillLevel)\n3. Set flag 0x40 on unit's dwGfxFrame field (offset 0xe8 in UnitAny[4])\n4. Zero-initialize 22 dwords (0x58 bytes) of projectile config structure\n5. Initialize projectile config fields:\n   - Type = 3, SkillId = 0x1d7, Callback = ApplyTextControlMaxValueClamp\n   - Owner unit pointer and skill level\n6. Calculate unit coordinates via CalculateUnitCoordinates\n7. If coordinates valid and projectile count > 0:\n   For each projectile index 0 to count-1:\n   a. Calculate direction table index = index & 7 (cycles 0-7)\n   b. Load direction offsets from g_anProjectileDirOffsetX/Y tables\n   c. Set direction offsets in config (local_3c, local_38)\n   d. Set projectile index in config\n   e. Call InitializeAndAllocateProjectile\n8. Return 1 (always succeeds)\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit (ECX) - UnitAny* - The unit casting the skill\n  nSkillLevel (EDX) - int - Skill level affecting projectile count\n\nReturns:\n  int - Always returns 1\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Returns early without spawning if CalculateUnitCoordinates fails\n  - Returns early if GetMonsterSkillId returns 0 or negative\n  - Direction cycles through 8 values even if projectile count exceeds 8\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x1d5 - Skill ID for ExecuteMonsterSkill\n  0x1d7 - Projectile skill ID for config\n  0xf1 - Monster skill type for projectile count lookup\n  0xc0 - Parameter for ExecuteMonsterSkill\n  0x40 - GFX frame flag bit\n  0xe8 - Offset to dwGfxFrame in UnitAny structure (at index 4)\n  3 - Projectile config type value\n\nGlobal Data:\n  g_anProjectileDirOffsetX @ 0x6fba7498 - int[8] X direction offsets\n  g_anProjectileDirOffsetY @ 0x6fba74b8 - int[8] Y direction offsets",
      "tags": ["PARAM_2", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_Room2", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
