      "api_calls": ["FogAssert", "UNITS_GetUnitY", "UNITS_GetOwnerGuid", "UNITS_GetUnitDirection", "SetUnitDirection", "SetAnimationInvalidateFlag", "SetMissileTargetX"],
      "instructions": ["0x20410|PUSH|ECX", "0x20411|PUSH|EBX", "0x20412|PUSH|ESI", "0x20413|PUSH|EDI", "0x20414|MOV|EDI, ECX", "0x20416|TEST|EDI, EDI", "0x20418|MOV|EBX, EDX", "0x2041A|JNZ|0x6faf043a", "0x2041C|PUSH|0x1de", "0x20421|PUSH|0x6fbb1710", "0x20426|PUSH|0x6fbb0bcc", "0x2042B|CALL|0x6fb99a7a", "0x20430|ADD|ESP, 0xc", "0x20433|PUSH|-0x1", "0x20435|CALL|0x6fb9a10f"],
      "comment": "Execute a monster skill with specified parameters.\n\nAlgorithm:\n\n1. Validate hUnit parameter is non-null, abort with assertion error if null\n2. Retrieve skill data pointer (dwSkillData) and skill flags (dwSkillFlags) from unit\n3. Search for skill information using FUN_6fb77d70 with search flag 1\n4. If skill info found (pSkillInfo != NULL):\n   a. Get unit type byte from unit handle\n   b. Extract skill data pointer from pSkillInfo + 0x38\n   c. Call Ordinal_10161 to set skill data with unit type\n   d. Call Ordinal_10203 to initialize skill data with zero\n   e. Call Ordinal_10377 to apply dwParam to skill info\n   f. If nSkillId != 0x1d5, call FUN_6fb63670 to process skill info\n   g. Map nSkillId to internal effect ID using switch statement\n   h. Execute skill effect with FUN_6fb8d210\n5. Return without value\n\nParameters:\n\n- hUnit (HANDLE): Handle to monster unit executing the skill\n- nSkillId (int): Skill identifier to execute (0x1d2-0x1d5 range)\n- dwParam (uint): Parameter to pass to skill execution\n\nReturns:\n\n- void: No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n\n- If hUnit is NULL (0), abort execution with assertion error\n- If skill info not found, function returns early without executing skill\n- Skill ID 0x1d5 (469) uses special float parameter 8.40779e-45 and skips FUN_6fb63670 call\n- Other skill IDs use zero float parameters\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n\n- 0x1d2 (470): Monster skill mapping to effect 799 (0x31f)\n- 0x1d3 (467): Monster skill mapping to effect 804 (0x324)\n- 0x1d4 (468): Monster skill mapping to effect 795 (0x31b)\n- 0x1d5 (469): Monster skill mapping to effect 786 (0x312), special handling\n- 0x38: Offset to skill data pointer in skill info structure\n- 1: Search flag constant for FUN_6fb77d70\n- 8.40779e-45: Special float parameter for skill 0x1d5 (raw: 0x00000008)\n- 0x1de (478): Source line number for assertion failure\n\nError Handling:\n\n- Null unit handle triggers Ordinal_10023 assertion with file/line info\n- Assertion calls FUN_6fb9a10f(0xffffffff) which never returns (abort)\n- Missing skill info results in silent early return",
      "tags": ["MOD_SKILLS", "STRUCT_Inventory", "UI_SKILLS", "PARAM_3", "SRC_SkillsEMon.cpp", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
    },
