      "comment": "Executes expansion monster skill ID 469 (0x1d5) with parameter 192 (0xc0).\n\nFUNCTION TYPE: Thunk/Wrapper - Calls ExecuteMonsterSkill with hardcoded parameters\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Push parameter 0xc0 (192) onto stack\n2. Load skill ID 0x1d5 (469) into EDX\n3. Call ExecuteMonsterSkill(pUnit, 0x1d5, 0xc0)\n4. Return 1 (always succeeds)\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit (ECX) - Pointer to unit executing the skill (monster unit handle)\n\nReturns:\n  bool - Always returns TRUE (1)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x1d5 (469) - Expansion monster skill ID\n  0xc0 (192) - Skill execution parameter/flags\n\nCallees:\n  ExecuteMonsterSkill - Main skill execution dispatcher at 0x6faf0410\n\nNote: This wrapper has no callers detected - may be referenced via function pointer\ntable in monster skill chart (sgpctSkillChartMonster).",
