      "api_count": 4,
      "api_calls": ["GetMonsterLevelScaledValue", "UNITS_GetOwnerGuid", "UNITS_GetUnitY", "FogAssert"],
      "instructions": ["0x205F0|SUB|ESP, 0x58", "0x205F3|PUSH|EBX", "0x205F4|PUSH|EBP", "0x205F5|PUSH|ESI", "0x205F6|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x205F8|PUSH|EDI", "0x205F9|MOV|EBX, EDX", "0x205FB|MOV|EDI, dword ptr [ESI + 0xe8]", "0x20601|PUSH|EBX", "0x20602|OR|EDI, 0x40", "0x20605|PUSH|0x105", "0x2060A|MOV|dword ptr [ESI + 0xe8], EDI", "0x20610|CALL|0x6fb9851e", "0x20615|MOV|EBP, EAX", "0x20617|MOV|ECX, 0x16"],
      "comment": "Creates multiple level-scaled projectiles from a source unit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set flag 0x40 on source unit's GfxFrame at offset 0xe8 (marks unit as projectile emitter)\n2. Call GetMonsterLevelScaledValue(0x105, nMonsterLevel) to determine projectile count\n3. Zero-initialize MissileCreate structure (0x16 dwords = 88 bytes on stack)\n4. Set structure fields: dwFlags=0x21, pOwnerUnit=pSourceUnit\n5. Call Ordinal_10326/10329 to get source unit coordinates\n6. Set dwMissileType=0x1ef (495), pfnCallback=ApplyTextControlMaxValueClamp\n7. Store nMonsterLevel copy for callback context\n8. Call CalculateUnitCoordinates to get delta X/Y coordinates\n9. If coordinates valid, validate nDeltaX and nDeltaY are non-zero (assert failure exits)\n10. Loop nProjectileCount times calling InitializeAndAllocateProjectile with structure\n11. Store loop index in nLoopIndex before each projectile allocation\n\nParameters:\npSourceUnit - Pointer to UnitAny structure representing the projectile source/caster\nnMonsterLevel - Monster level used to scale projectile count via skill ID 0x105\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- No callers found - likely called via function pointer or unused code path\n- Zero coordinates trigger FogAssert with message \"tCreateMissile.nDX && tCreateMissile.nDY\"\n- If CalculateUnitCoordinates returns 0, function exits without creating projectiles\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x40 - GfxFrame flag bit for projectile emitter state\n0x105 (261) - Skill ID for monster level scaling lookup\n0x21 (33) - MissileCreate flags value (preset coordinate mode)\n0x16 (22) - Number of dwords in MissileCreate structure\n0x1ef (495) - Missile type ID for projectile\n0xe8 (232) - Offset to dwGfxFrame in UnitAny structure\n0x23f (575) - Source line number in assert message\n\nStructure Layout (MissileCreate on stack):\nOffset  Size  Field           Type        Description\n0x00    4     dwFlags         dword       Create flags (0x21 = preset coords)\n0x04    4     pOwnerUnit      UnitAny *   Source unit pointer\n0x14    4     dwMissileType   dword       Missile type ID (0x1ef)\n0x30    4     nLevelCopy      int         Monster level copy\n0x54    4     pfnCallback     code *      Post-create callback function\n0x58    4     nLoopIndex      int         Current projectile index\n\nOrdinal References:\nOrdinal_10326 - D2Common.GetUnitX - Get unit X coordinate\nOrdinal_10329 - D2Common.GetUnitY - Get unit Y coordinate",
      "tags": ["MOD_SKILLS", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_2", "PROP_NOCALLER", "UI_SKILLS", "SRC_SkillsEMon.cpp", "STRUCT_Room2", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
