      "api_count": 17,
      "api_calls": ["GetPathPosX", "GetPathPosY", "GetApproxDistanceToCoords", "GetMissileTemplateRecord", "FogAssert", "UNITS_GetOwnerGuid", "UNITS_GetUnitY", "FogAssert", "FogAssert", "UNITS_GetUnitDirection", "...+7 more"],
      "instructions": ["0x206C0|SUB|ESP, 0x1c", "0x206C3|PUSH|EBX", "0x206C4|PUSH|EBP", "0x206C5|MOV|EBP, ECX", "0x206C7|PUSH|ESI", "0x206C8|PUSH|EDI", "0x206C9|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [EBP + 0x38]", "0x206CC|PUSH|EAX", "0x206CD|CALL|0x6fb98392", "0x206D2|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [EBP + 0x38]", "0x206D5|MOV|ESI, EAX", "0x206D7|PUSH|ECX", "0x206D8|CALL|0x6fb9838c", "0x206DD|TEST|ESI, ESI", "0x206DF|MOV|EBX, EAX"],
      "comment": "Creates Death Mauler trail missile effect by spawning multiple missiles along path to target.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get target coordinates from missile's path data (offset 0x38)\n2. If target position is (0,0), exit early (no target)\n3. Calculate distance from missile to target position\n4. If distance is 0, set to 1 to avoid division by zero\n5. Get missile template record for trail missile (ID 0x1F7 = 503)\n6. Assert template exists (line 0x25D)\n7. Get missile source position via Ordinal_10326/10329 (GetUnitX/Y)\n8. Get spacing value from template offset 0x78 (minimum spacing)\n9. Assert spacing > 0 (line 0x263)\n10. Get secondary spacing from template offset 0x7C\n11. Assert secondary spacing > 0 (line 0x264)\n12. Loop: For each spacing interval along path to target:\n    a. Calculate interpolated X position: srcX + (distance * deltaX * 100 / totalDist) / 100\n    b. Calculate interpolated Y position: srcY + (distance * deltaY * 100 / totalDist) / 100\n    c. Create trail missile at interpolated position (missile ID 0x1F7)\n    d. If missile created successfully:\n       - Get missile's path unit pointer\n       - Set unit direction via Ordinal_10457\n       - Calculate target offset decreasing by spacing * index\n       - Set missile target unit, data field 0x2C, and field 0x38\n       - Set missile target X to 0x400 (1024 - max range)\n    e. Increment trail index\n13. Fire main missile (ID 0x1F6 = 502) with target validation\n14. If main missile created, set target X to 0x60 (96 - short range)\n\nParameters:\n  pMissile (ECX): Source missile unit creating the trail\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x1F7 (503): Trail missile ID (Death Mauler Trail particle)\n  0x1F6 (502): Main missile ID (Death Mauler projectile)\n  0x38: Unit path data offset\n  0x78: MissileTemplate spacing interval field\n  0x7C: MissileTemplate secondary spacing field\n  0x400 (1024): Maximum target range for trail missiles\n  0x60 (96): Short range for main missile\n  100: Percentage multiplier for interpolation math\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Returns early if target is at origin (0,0)\n  - Distance clamped to minimum 1 to prevent div/0\n  - Asserts if missile template missing or spacing values <= 0\n  - Trail missiles created even if some fail (loop continues)\n\nError Handling:\n  FogAssert called on critical failures, followed by ExitApplicationWithCode(-1)",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_ItemData", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData", "MOD_SKILLS", "PROP_LARGE", "UI_SKILLS", "STRUCT_Skill", "SRC_SkillsEMon.cpp", "STRUCT_Other"]
