      "instructions": ["0x208C0|PUSH|ESI", "0x208C1|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x208C3|PUSH|EDI", "0x208C4|PUSH|ESI", "0x208C5|CALL|0x6fb983c2", "0x208CA|MOV|ECX, ESI", "0x208CC|MOV|EDI, EAX", "0x208CE|CALL|0x6fb63760", "0x208D3|MOV|ESI, EAX", "0x208D5|TEST|ESI, ESI", "0x208D7|JZ|0x6faf0905", "0x208D9|PUSH|ESI", "0x208DA|CALL|0x6fb98638", "0x208DF|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x208E1|JZ|0x6faf0905"],
      "comment": "Validates entity and initializes resource configuration handles.\n\nAlgorithm:\n\n1. Create resource handle from resource ID via D2COMMON ordinal 10323\n2. Get entity pointer from resource ID via FUN_6fb63760\n3. Validate entity pointer is non-null, return 0 (false) if null\n4. Validate entity with D2COMMON ordinal 11021, return 0 (false) if validation fails\n5. Retrieve first configuration value from entity via D2COMMON ordinal 10326\n6. Store first configuration value to resource handle via D2COMMON ordinal 10980\n7. Retrieve second configuration value from entity via D2COMMON ordinal 10329\n8. Store second configuration value to resource handle via D2COMMON ordinal 10981\n9. Return 1 (true) indicating successful setup\n\nParameters:\n\nnResourceId (int): Resource identifier passed in ECX register (__fastcall convention)\n\nReturns:\n\n1 (true) - Entity validation passed and configuration handles successfully initialized\n0 (false) - Entity pointer is null or validation failed\n\nSpecial Cases:\n\n- Early return with 0 if entity pointer from FUN_6fb63760 returns null\n- Early return with 0 if entity validation via ordinal 11021 fails\n- Function uses __fastcall calling convention with parameter in ECX register\n\nError Handling:\n\nStep 2: If FUN_6fb63760 returns null pointer, abort initialization and return 0\nStep 4: If ordinal 11021 validation fails (returns 0), abort initialization and return 0\nSuccess: Both configuration values stored to resource handle, return 1",
