      "comment": "Fires a spread of linear projectiles from a monster unit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get projectile count from monster data field 0xF8 for monster type 0x13d\n2. Calculate unit's current X/Y coordinates via CalculateUnitCoordinates\n3. Early exit if coordinate calculation fails\n4. Get target X via Ordinal_10326, calculate delta X = currentX - targetX\n5. Get target Y via Ordinal_10329, calculate delta Y = currentY - targetY\n6. Normalize direction vector via ScaleVectorToMinimumMagnitude\n7. Adjust vector threshold via ScaleVectorToThreshold\n8. Calculate starting position by offsetting back by half the spread distance:\n   startX = posX - (deltaX * count) / 2\n   startY = posY - (deltaY * count) / 2\n9. Get skill ID from monster type/level, shift right by 1\n10. Zero-initialize 0x58 bytes of missile parameter structure\n11. Set missile parameters: flags=0x20, missileId=0x22a, owner=pUnit, level=nSkillLevel\n12. Loop for each projectile (count iterations):\n    a. Set missile spawn position (nMissileX, nMissileY)\n    b. Call InitializeAndAllocateProjectile to create missile\n    c. If missile created, get target X and calculate scaled stat value\n    d. Advance position by delta for next missile\n13. Check unit state flag 0xC (possibly attack state)\n14. If state flag set, call SetUnitAnimDataUpperBits(8) and set offset 0x54 to 0x600\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit (ECX): UnitAny* - Source unit firing the projectiles\n  nSkillLevel (EDX): int - Skill level for damage/effect calculation\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x13d (317) - Monster type ID for data lookup\n  0x22a (554) - Missile type ID for projectile creation\n  0x20 (32) - Missile flags in parameter structure\n  0x600 (1536) - Animation/state value set on unit after firing\n  0xC (12) - State flag checked for animation update\n  8 - Upper bits value for SetUnitAnimDataUpperBits\n\nCalled Functions:\n  GetMonsterDataField0xF8 - Get monster-specific field at offset 0xF8\n  CalculateUnitCoordinates - Get unit X/Y world coordinates\n  Ordinal_10326 - D2Common: Get target X coordinate\n  Ordinal_10329 - D2Common: Get target Y coordinate  \n  ScaleVectorToMinimumMagnitude - Normalize direction vector\n  ScaleVectorToThreshold - Clamp vector to threshold\n  GetMonsterSkillId - Get skill ID for monster/level\n  InitializeAndAllocateProjectile - Create and initialize missile unit\n  GetMissileTargetX - Get missile's target X coordinate\n  CalculateScaledStatValue - Apply scaled stat to missile\n  GetUnitStateFlag - Check unit state flag\n  SetUnitAnimDataUpperBits - Set animation data upper bits\n\nClassification: Worker function - Monster projectile attack handler\nCallers: None (orphan function, likely called via function pointer)\nMemory: Uses 0x68 bytes stack for missile parameter structure",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_StatList", "STRUCT_Path", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_2", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_Room2", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
