      "comment": "Execute expansion monster skill from skill chart table\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call Ordinal_10323 to validate unit (extraout_EAX = result)\n2. Calculate table index: nTableIndex = nSkillId - 0x119 (SKILL_EXPANSION_MONSTER_START)\n3. Validate index: must be >= 0 and < 0x26 (38 = NUM_EXPANSION_MONSTER_SKILLS)\n4. If index out of range, assert and exit with error code -1\n5. If unit validation failed (extraout_EAX == 0), return early\n6. Calculate table offset: nTableIndex * 0x14 (stride = 20 bytes)\n7. Check skill entry's missile ID at [DAT_6fba74fc + offset]; if != 0xFFFF:\n   - Call CalculateMissileTargetCoordinates(pUnit, missileId, dwParam)\n   - Set unit's gfx frame flag 0x40 at offset 0xE8 (pUnit[4].dwGfxFrame |= 0x40)\n8. Always set gfx frame flag 0x40 (redundant if already set above)\n9. Check callback function pointer at [DAT_6fba7500 + offset]; if not NULL:\n   - Validate pointer with IsBadCodePtr\n   - If bad pointer, assert and exit with error code -1\n   - Call the skill callback with ECX=pUnit, EDX=dwParam\n10. Call SetOverlayCallback(pUnit, 0) to get audio context\n11. If audio context returned, call RemoveAudioContextFromList to clean up\n\nParameters:\npUnit (ECX) - Pointer to UnitAny structure for the monster executing the skill\nnSkillId (EDX) - Raw skill ID, must be in range [0x119, 0x13E] for expansion monster skills\ndwParam (Stack+4) - Parameter passed to CalculateMissileTargetCoordinates and skill callback\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- nSkillId < 0x119 or >= 0x13F triggers assert and application exit\n- NULL unit validation result causes early return without skill execution\n- Missile ID of 0xFFFF skips missile creation but still sets gfx flag\n- NULL callback pointer skips callback execution\n- Bad callback pointer triggers assert and application exit\n\nStructure Layout (sgpctSkillChartMonster entry, stride = 0x14):\nOffset  Size  Field           Type        Description\n0x00    2     wMissileId      ushort      Missile ID (0xFFFF = no missile)\n0x04    4     pfnDoSkill      code*       Skill execution callback function\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x119 = SKILL_EXPANSION_MONSTER_START (281 decimal)\n0x26 = NUM_EXPANSION_MONSTER_SKILLS (38 skills)\n0x14 = sizeof(SkillChartEntry) (20 bytes)\n0xFFFF = MISSILE_NONE (no missile to create)\n0x40 = GFX_FLAG_SKILL_ACTIVE (flag set on pUnit[4].dwGfxFrame)\n0xE8 = Offset to dwGfxFrame in pUnit[4] (pUnit offset 0xE8)\n0x371 = Line number for pfnDoSkill assert\n0x365 = Line number for skill range assert\n\nGlobal Data:\nDAT_6fba74fc - sgpctSkillChartMonster[].wMissileId base address\nDAT_6fba7500 - sgpctSkillChartMonster[].pfnDoSkill base address",
