      "instructions": ["0x20D60|PUSH|EBX", "0x20D61|PUSH|EBP", "0x20D62|MOV|EBX, EDX", "0x20D64|PUSH|ESI", "0x20D65|PUSH|EDI", "0x20D66|SUB|EBX, 0x119", "0x20D6C|MOV|EDI, ECX", "0x20D6E|JS|0x6faf0e58", "0x20D74|CMP|EBX, 0x26", "0x20D77|JGE|0x6faf0e58", "0x20D7D|LEA|ESI, [EBX + EBX*0x4]", "0x20D80|MOV|EBP, dword ptr [ESP + 0x14]", "0x20D84|SHL|ESI, 0x2", "0x20D87|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESI + 0x6fba74f8]", "0x20D8D|TEST|EAX, EAX"],
      "comment": "Executes an expansion monster skill effect from the skill chart table.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Compute skill index by subtracting 0x119 from nSkillId (expansion skill base)\n2. Validate skill index is within range [0, 0x25] (38 expansion monster skills)\n3. Assert and exit if skill index out of bounds\n4. Calculate chart offset: nSkillIndex * 0x14 (20-byte skill chart entries)\n5. Check if skill has a pfnDoSkill function pointer at chart[nSkillIndex * 5]\n6. If function pointer exists:\n   a. Validate pointer with IsBadCodePtr - assert if invalid\n   b. Call the skill function (pfnDoSkill)\n   c. If skill function returns 0 (skill failed/completed):\n      - Call Ordinal_10324 (D2Common function)\n      - If unit is monster (dwUnitType == 1), clear state and process transition\n      - Return early\n7. If no skill function or skill succeeded, process visual/audio effects:\n   a. Call ValidateGameState with missile1 ID from chart offset +0x0\n   b. If valid missile returned, call InitializeGameObjectProperties\n   c. Call CheckAndProcessUnitState with missile2 ID from chart offset +0x4\n   d. If valid overlay returned (not 0xFFFFFFFF), call InitializeOverlayData\n   e. Check sound ID at chart offset +0xC - if not 0xFFFF, play sound\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit (UnitAny *, IMPLICIT ECX): Monster unit executing the skill\n  nSkillId (dword, IMPLICIT EDX): Skill ID (must be in range 0x119-0x13E for expansion)\n  nTargetParam (dword, Stack[0x4]): Target parameter passed to skill functions\n\nReturns:\n  void - Effects applied directly to unit and game state\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Skill IDs below 0x119 or above 0x13E trigger assertion failure and exit\n  - Invalid function pointers trigger assertion failure and exit\n  - Sound ID 0xFFFF indicates no sound effect for this skill\n  - Overlay result 0xFFFFFFFF indicates no overlay effect\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0x119 (281) - Base skill ID for expansion monster skills\n  0x25 (37) - Maximum skill index (38 skills total: 0-37)\n  0x14 (20) - Skill chart entry stride in bytes\n  0xFFFF - No sound effect sentinel value\n  0xFFFFFFFF - No overlay effect sentinel value\n\nSkill Chart Structure (20 bytes per entry):\n  Offset 0x00: Missile1 ID for ValidateGameState\n  Offset 0x04: Missile2 ID for CheckAndProcessUnitState\n  Offset 0x08: pfnDoSkill function pointer\n  Offset 0x0C: Sound ID (0xFFFF = none)\n  Offset 0x10: Reserved/unused\n\nRelated Globals:\n  g_sgpctSkillChartMonster (0x6fba74f8) - Skill chart function pointer array\n  g_sgpctSkillChartMonsterMissile1 (0x6fba74f0) - Missile1 IDs\n  g_sgpctSkillChartMonsterMissile2 (0x6fba74f4) - Missile2 IDs\n  g_sgpctSkillChartMonsterSound (0x6fba74fc) - Sound IDs",
      "tags": ["MOD_SKILLS", "PROP_NOCALLER", "UI_SKILLS", "PARAM_3", "SRC_SkillsEMon.cpp", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control"]
