      "comment": "Clears the velocity X component at offset 0x48 in a Path structure.\n\nClassification: Leaf function (no calls)\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Store 0 to [pPath + 0x48] (velocity X field in Path structure)\n2. Return\n\nParameters:\n  pPath (ECX) - Pointer to Path structure (passed via __fastcall)\n\nReturns: void\n\nStructure Layout (Path relevant fields):\n  Offset  Size  Field          Type    Description\n  0x44    4     dwUnitSize     uint    Unit collision size\n  0x48    4     dwVelocityX    uint    X velocity component (cleared by this function)\n  0x4C    12    _reserved      byte[]  Remaining reserved fields\n\nNotes:\n- Part of path velocity management system\n- Offset 0x48 is within the _5[4] reserved array in D2 Path struct\n- No callers detected - may be called via function pointer or table",
