      "comment": "Process unit list state flags and invoke D2COMMON setup routine\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize parameter constants (dwParam1 = 5, dwParam2 = 0x1000)\n2. Clear unit list state flags at offset 0xe8 (clear bits 1-3 with mask 0xfffffff1)\n3. Call D2COMMON.Ordinal_10329 to retrieve first parameter from unit\n4. Call D2COMMON.Ordinal_10326 to retrieve second parameter from unit  \n5. Call D2COMMON.Ordinal_10342 to retrieve third parameter from unit\n6. Invoke D2COMMON.Ordinal_10126 with all retrieved parameters and constants\n7. Return success value 1\n\nParameters:\npUnit - Pointer to UnitAny structure requiring list state processing\n\nReturns:\n1 - Always returns success\n\nSpecial Cases:\nFlag mask 0xfffffff1 preserves bit 0 while clearing bits 1-3 (values 0x02, 0x04, 0x08)\nThis clears linked list state flags while maintaining primary state bit\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0xe8 (232 decimal) - Offset to dwGfxFrame field in UnitAny structure (at index [4])\n0xfffffff1 (4294967281 decimal) - Bitmask to clear bits 1-3, preserving bit 0\n0x02 (2 decimal) - Bit 1 flag (cleared)\n0x04 (4 decimal) - Bit 2 flag (cleared)\n0x08 (8 decimal) - Bit 3 flag (cleared)\n5 (0x5) - First constant parameter for D2COMMON routine\n0x1000 (4096 decimal) - Second constant parameter for D2COMMON routine\n\nStructure Layout:\nUnitAny structure accessed at offset 0xe8:\nOffset  Size  Field Name   Type   Description\n------  ----  ----------   ----   -----------\n0xe8    4     dwGfxFrame   dword  Graphics frame counter / list state flags",
