      "comment": "Creates a visual projectile effect for a mercenary unit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get mercenary position data from unit via GetMercenaryPosition\n2. If position is NULL, exit early (mercenary not valid)\n3. Set flag bit 0x40 in unit's dwGfxFrame field at offset 0xe8\n4. Get mercenary X coordinate via Ordinal_10326 (D2Common.UNITS_GetClientCoordX)\n5. Get mercenary Y coordinate via Ordinal_10329 (D2Common.UNITS_GetClientCoordY)\n6. Get unit X coordinate via Ordinal_10326\n7. Get unit Y coordinate via Ordinal_10329\n8. Calculate delta X (mercenary X - unit X)\n9. Calculate delta Y (mercenary Y - unit Y)\n10. Zero-initialize 0x58-byte projectile structure (22 dwords)\n11. Calculate target X: unitX - (deltaX + sign-extend) >> 3\n12. Calculate target Y: unitY - (deltaY + sign-extend) >> 3\n13. Fill projectile structure:\n    - dwProjectileType = 3 (offset 0x00)\n    - pOwnerUnit = pUnit (offset 0x04)\n    - dwMissileId = 0x283 (offset 0x10, missile ID 643)\n    - nTargetX = calculated target X (offset 0x14)\n    - nTargetY = calculated target Y (offset 0x18)\n    - nDeltaX = deltaX (offset 0x1c)\n    - nDeltaY = deltaY (offset 0x20)\n    - dwEffectParam = dwEffectType (offset 0x2c)\n14. Allocate projectile via InitializeAndAllocateProjectile\n15. Set animation flag via SetGfxFrameAnimationFlag\n16. Set graphics info bit 0 via SetGraphicsInfoFieldBit\n17. Set property values (-6 Z offset, 1 scale) via SetGfxPropertyValues\n18. Clear color effect via ApplyColorEffectToGraphicsInfo\n19. Set draw coordinates (Z = 0x78) via SetDrawableObjectCoordinates\n\nParameters:\npUnit (UnitAny *, ECX): Unit that owns the mercenary\ndwEffectType (uint, EDX): Effect type parameter passed to projectile\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Projectile created as side effect\n\nClassification:\nWorker function - creates visual effect for mercenary projectiles\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x40 - Flag bit set in dwGfxFrame for projectile active\n0xe8 - Offset to dwGfxFrame in UnitAny\n0x283 (643) - Missile ID for mercenary projectile effect\n0x16 (22) - Number of dwords in projectile structure\n0x58 - Size of projectile structure in bytes\n0x78 (120) - Z coordinate for drawable object\n-6 - Z offset for property values\n3 - Projectile type value\n\nOrdinal Functions:\nOrdinal_10326: D2Common.UNITS_GetClientCoordX - get unit X coordinate\nOrdinal_10329: D2Common.UNITS_GetClientCoordY - get unit Y coordinate\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- NULL mercenary position causes early return (no projectile created)\n- Delta calculation uses sign-extended division by 8 for smooth trajectory",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_MonsterData", "STRUCT_Path", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_2", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_Skill", "STRUCT_ItemData", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
