      "api_calls": ["GetMissileTemplateRecord", "UNITS_GetOwnerGuid", "UNITS_GetUnitY", "UNITS_GetUnitY", "UNITS_GetOwnerGuid", "SetUnitDirectionToTarget", "UNITS_GetOwnerGuid", "UNITS_GetOwnerGuid", "UNITS_GetUnitY", "UNITS_GetUnitY", "...+4 more"],
      "instructions": ["0x222F0|SUB|ESP, 0x58", "0x222F3|PUSH|EBX", "0x222F4|PUSH|ESI", "0x222F5|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x222F7|PUSH|EDI", "0x222F8|MOV|EBX, EDX", "0x222FA|PUSH|0xb1", "0x222FF|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESI + 0xe8]", "0x22305|OR|AL, 0x40", "0x22307|MOV|dword ptr [ESI + 0xe8], EAX", "0x2230D|CALL|0x6fb9836e", "0x22312|MOV|ECX, 0x16", "0x22317|XOR|EAX, EAX", "0x22319|LEA|EDI, [ESP + 0xc]", "0x2231D|PUSH|ESI"],
      "comment": "Spawns an attack projectile for a mercenary unit using missile type 0xB1 (177).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set flag bit 0x40 on mercenary's graphics frame field (offset 0xe8)\n2. Get missile template record for missile type 0xB1\n3. Initialize 22-dword projectile configuration buffer to zero\n4. Set projectile flags to 3 (preset coords + adjust target)\n5. Set source and owner unit pointers to mercenary\n6. Set missile type ID to 0xB1\n7. Get mercenary's current X/Y coordinates via Ordinal_10326/10329\n8. Set skill level range (nMaxLevel = nSkillLevel, nAdjustedLevel = nSkillLevel - 1)\n9. Get mercenary position pointer via GetMercenaryPosition\n10. If merc position valid: calculate delta to target, set direction, spawn projectile\n11. Else: use path position as fallback, calculate delta, spawn projectile\n\nParameters:\npMercenary (UnitAny *, ECX): Mercenary unit that fires the projectile\nnSkillLevel (int, EDX): Skill level for damage/effect scaling\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If GetMercenaryPosition returns NULL, uses GetPathPosX/Y as fallback\n- Sets unit direction toward target before spawning projectile\n- Missile type 0xB1 (177) is hardcoded - mercenary-specific attack\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x40 = Graphics frame flag for projectile state\n0xB1 (177) = Mercenary attack missile type ID\n0x16 (22) = Number of dwords in projectile config buffer\n0x3 = Projectile flags (preset coords + adjust target)\n0xe8 (232) = UnitAny dwGfxFrame offset\n0x38 (56) = UnitAny animation ID / path pointer offset\n\nRelated Functions:\n- GetMissileTemplateRecord: Loads missile stats from game data\n- GetMercenaryPosition: Gets merc coordinate array pointer\n- Ordinal_10326: D2Common.UNIT_GetX - get unit X coordinate\n- Ordinal_10329: D2Common.UNIT_GetY - get unit Y coordinate\n- SetUnitDirectionToTarget: Orients unit toward target coordinates\n- InitializeAndAllocateProjectile: Creates and spawns the missile",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_2", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_ItemData", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
    },
