      "instructions": ["0x224D0|SUB|ESP, 0x58", "0x224D3|PUSH|EBX", "0x224D4|PUSH|ESI", "0x224D5|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x224D7|PUSH|EDI", "0x224D8|XOR|EAX, EAX", "0x224DA|LEA|EDI, [ESP + 0xc]", "0x224DE|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESI + 0xe8]", "0x224E4|MOV|EBX, EDX", "0x224E6|OR|ECX, 0x40", "0x224E9|PUSH|ESI", "0x224EA|MOV|dword ptr [ESI + 0xe8], ECX", "0x224F0|MOV|ECX, 0x16", "0x224F5|STOSD.REP|ES:EDI", "0x224F7|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x10], 0x21"],
      "comment": "Spawns multiple projectiles for a unit with randomized path behavior.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set projectile flag 0x40 on unit's dwGfxFrame field (offset 0xE8)\n2. Zero-initialize projectile config buffer (0x58 bytes / 22 DWORDs)\n3. Configure projectile structure:\n   - flags = 0x21 (preset coords + some behavior)\n   - source unit = pUnit\n   - Get base X/Y via Ordinal_10326/10329\n   - projectile type = 0xB3 (missile ID)\n   - callback = InitializeMissilePathWithRandomBehavior\n   - count = nProjectileCount\n4. Calculate unit coordinates via CalculateUnitCoordinates\n5. If coordinates valid, loop nProjectileCount times:\n   - Set loop index in config structure\n   - Call InitializeAndAllocateProjectile to spawn each projectile\n\nParameters:\npUnit (ECX) - Pointer to source UnitAny that spawns projectiles\nnProjectileCount (EDX) - Number of projectiles to spawn\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- No projectiles spawned if CalculateUnitCoordinates fails (returns 0)\n- No projectiles spawned if nProjectileCount <= 0\n- Each iteration updates loop index for randomization seed\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x40 - Projectile active flag for dwGfxFrame\n0x21 - Projectile flags (bit 0 = preset coords, bit 5 = some behavior)\n0xB3 - Missile template ID (179 decimal)\n0x16 - Number of DWORDs to zero (22 = 0x58/4)\n0xE8 - Offset to dwGfxFrame in UnitAny structure\n\nStructure Layout (local projectile config at ESP+0xC):\nOffset  Size  Field              Type       Description\n0x00    4     dwProjectileFlags  dword      Control flags (0x21)\n0x04    4     pSourceUnit        UnitAny*   Source unit pointer\n...\n0x1C    4     dwProjectileType   dword      Missile template ID (0xB3)\n...\n0x30    4     nSpawnCount        int        Total projectile count\n...\n0x54    4     pfnCallback        code*      Path initialization callback\n0x58    4     nLoopIndex         int        Current iteration index",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_StatList", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_2", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control"]
    },
