      "instructions": ["0x22600|SUB|ESP, 0x8", "0x22603|PUSH|EBX", "0x22604|PUSH|ESI", "0x22605|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x22607|PUSH|EDI", "0x22608|PUSH|ESI", "0x22609|CALL|0x6fb983c2", "0x2260E|MOV|EBX, EAX", "0x22610|LEA|EAX, [ESP + 0x10]", "0x22614|LEA|ECX, [ESP + 0xc]", "0x22618|PUSH|EAX", "0x22619|PUSH|ECX", "0x2261A|PUSH|ESI", "0x2261B|CALL|0x6fb98656", "0x22620|CMP|dword ptr [ESP + 0xc], 0xd"],
      "comment": "Updates unit skill animation based on current animation state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call Ordinal_10323 to get current skill pointer (stored in EBX)\n2. Get unit target XY coordinates - nAnimState receives state, local_4 receives Y\n3. If nAnimState >= 14 (0xe): exit early (animation complete)\n4. Get Path pointer from pUnit->pMemPool (offset 0x38)\n5. Get field 0x58 from path (target unit)\n6. If target unit exists and distance < 2: jump to completion\n7. Get unit flags from skill\n8. If flags & 0x2: jump to completion handler\n9. State 5 (Animating):\n   - Get attack speed stat (0x43)\n   - Calculate animation rate: (speed * 0x1400) / 100\n   - Set animation rate on path\n   - Set path type to 1\n   - Calculate path to target\n   - Set skill client func to 1\n10. State 13 (0xd - Finishing):\n    - Set pUnit[1].pPath to 0x1000 (state flag)\n    - Set animation data upper bits to 6\n11. Completion handler (LAB_6faf264e):\n    - Set skill client func to 0\n    - Set pUnit[1].pPath to 0x800 (state flag)\n    - Set animation data upper bits to 0xe\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - UnitAny pointer passed via ECX (__fastcall)\n  IMPLICIT EBX - Receives Skill pointer from Ordinal_10323\n\nReturns: void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x38 - UnitAny offset to Path/pMemPool pointer\n  0x43 - Stat ID for attack speed\n  0x54 - UnitAny offset for state flags\n  0x800 - Animation complete state flag\n  0x1000 - Animation finishing state flag\n  0x1400 - Animation rate multiplier (5120)\n\nState Machine:\n  State 5: Active animation - calculate path and rate\n  State 13 (0xd): Finishing animation - set finishing flags\n  State 14+ (0xe+): Animation complete - early exit\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - If target unit within distance 1: immediate completion\n  - If unit flags & 0x2: immediate completion",
