      "comment": "Maps skill IDs to missile IDs and launches missiles with target coordinates.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set flag 0x40 at unit offset 0xe8 (enable missile launching state)\n2. Retrieve target Y coordinate from unit using Ordinal_10519 with parameter 0xc\n3. Get skill type/classification from unit using Ordinal_11056\n4. Check skill type for special missile ID mapping:\n   - If skill type is 0xf2 (242) and skill ID is 0x14 (20), remap to missile 0x114 (276)\n   - If skill type is 0x83 (131) and skill ID is 0x15 (21), remap to missile 0x115 (277)\n   - If skill type is 0x137 (311) or 0x138 (312) and skill ID in range 0x43-0x46 (67-70), add 0x100 (256) to skill ID\n5. Call CalculateMissileTargetCoordinates with unit, final missile ID, and target Y coordinate\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - Pointer to UnitAny structure containing unit state and properties\n  nSkillId - Skill identifier to be mapped to missile ID\n\nReturns:\n  void - Function modifies unit state and triggers missile calculation\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Skill type 0xf2 with skill ID 0x14: Direct mapping to missile 0x114\n  - Skill type 0x83 with skill ID 0x15: Direct mapping to missile 0x115\n  - Skill types 0x137-0x138 with skill IDs 0x43-0x46: Adds 0x100 offset to skill ID\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0x40 (64) - Missile launching enabled flag at unit offset 0xe8\n  0xc (12) - Parameter for target coordinate retrieval\n  0xf2 (242) - Skill type classification requiring missile 0x114 mapping\n  0x83 (131) - Skill type classification requiring missile 0x115 mapping\n  0x14 (20) - Skill ID that maps to missile 0x114 when type is 0xf2\n  0x15 (21) - Skill ID that maps to missile 0x115 when type is 0x83\n  0x114 (276) - Remapped missile ID for skill type 0xf2 + skill ID 0x14\n  0x115 (277) - Remapped missile ID for skill type 0x83 + skill ID 0x15\n  0x137 (311) - First skill type in range requiring 0x100 offset\n  0x138 (312) - Second skill type in range requiring 0x100 offset\n  0x43 (67) - Lower bound (exclusive) for skill ID offset range\n  0x46 (70) - Upper bound (exclusive) for skill ID offset range\n  0x100 (256) - Offset added to skill IDs in range 0x43-0x46 for types 0x137-0x138\n  0xe8 (232) - Byte offset in UnitAny structure for missile launch flags",
