      "comment": "Process resource dimensions and update stream processing flags based on allocation results\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract resource handle from stream context via Ordinal_10323\n2. Query resource dimensions: height (Ordinal_10976), width (Ordinal_10978), size (Ordinal_10977)\n3. Attempt buffer allocation/lookup using size and width via FUN_6fb60e10\n4. If allocation fails (returns NULL), set height fallback to 1\n5. Perform stream operation with context, buffer pointer, and 0 flag via Ordinal_10361\n6. Check if operation succeeded AND height was adjusted (not equal to 1)\n7. If both conditions met: set error code 0xc on stream, increment retry counter at offset 0x54, notify resource with adjusted height\n8. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\npStreamContext - Pointer to stream processing context structure containing resource state and flags\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value (side effects modify stream context flags and invoke resource notifications)\n\nSpecial Cases:\nAllocation failure triggers height fallback to 1 (minimum dimension handling)\nStream operation failure (returns 0) skips error reporting and counter update\nHeight already at 1 (no adjustment needed) skips error reporting even if operation succeeded\nCounter at offset 0x54 incremented in upper byte (adds 0x100, preserving lower 8 bits)\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0xc (12) - Error code for dimension adjustment/allocation failure\n0x54 (84) - Byte offset to retry/attempt counter field in stream context structure\n0x100 (256) - Increment value for retry counter (upper byte of DWORD)\n0xffffff00 - Mask to preserve upper 24 bits while clearing lower 8 bits\n0 - Third parameter to Ordinal_10361 (operation mode flag)\n1 - Height fallback value for allocation failure\n\nError Handling:\nAllocation failure (NULL buffer) recorded but processing continues with height=1\nStream operation failure silently returns without error code or counter update\nSuccessful operation with adjusted height triggers error notification via Ordinal_10372\nResource notified of dimension adjustment via Ordinal_10980\n\nStructure Layout:\nStreamContext (unknown total size):\nOffset  Size  Field Name          Type    Description\n0x00    4     unknown             varies  Stream state fields\n0x54    4     dwRetryCounter      uint    Retry/attempt counter (upper byte incremented by 1)\n...     ...   ...                 ...     Additional fields not accessed",
