      "comment": "Checks if unit has specific skill and plays associated sound effect.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Retrieve skill ID from unit using Ordinal_11056\n2. Check if skill ID equals 0x1fa (Freezing Arrow skill)\n3. If match found, play sound effect 0x130 at unit's location\n4. Return success (always returns true)\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - Pointer to UnitAny structure representing the game entity\n\nReturns:\n  Always returns true (bool) regardless of skill match\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Skill ID 0x1fa (506 decimal) - Amazon Freezing Arrow skill\n  - Sound ID 0x130 (304 decimal) - Freezing Arrow impact/activation sound\n  - Sound played with zero coordinates (0.0, 0.0) uses unit's position\n  - Function always succeeds even if skill doesn't match\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0x1fa (506) - Freezing Arrow skill identifier\n  0x130 (304) - Sound effect ID for Freezing Arrow\n  0.0 - Default X coordinate (use unit position)\n  0.0 - Default Y coordinate (use unit position)\n  0 - No special sound flags",
      "tags": ["PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_1", "PROP_SMALL"]
