      "comment": "Check unit state and conditionally trigger associated sound effect.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Query unit stat/mode value using Ordinal_11056\n2. Compare stat value against 0x1fa (506 decimal)\n3. If stat matches 0x1fa, trigger sound/visual effect 0x130 (304 decimal)\n4. Set flag bit 0x40 at offset 0xe8 in unit structure\n5. Return\n\nParameters:\n- pUnit: Pointer to UnitAny structure representing the game entity\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Only processes units with stat value exactly 0x1fa (506)\n- Effect ID 0x130 (304) may correspond to specific sound or visual feedback\n- Flag bit 0x40 (bit 6) set at offset 0xe8 marks unit as having processed this state\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n- 0x1fa (506): Stat/mode ID threshold for triggering effect\n- 0x130 (304): Sound/visual effect identifier\n- 0x40 (bit 6): State flag set after effect trigger\n- 0xe8: Offset in UnitAny structure for state flags",
