      "globals": ["0xFFFFFFFF9053000C||", "0xFFFFFFFF90530004||", "0xD79C0|g_MonsterSkillEffectTable_Callback|0x0", "0xFFFFFFFF90530000||", "0xD79B8|g_MonsterSkillEffectTable|0x0", "0xD79BC|g_MonsterSkillEffectTable_OverlayParam|-0x1", "0xD79C4|g_SkillEffectTable|-0x1"],
      "api_count": 2,
      "api_calls": ["UNITS_SetStatInfoValue", "FogAssert"],
      "instructions": ["0x22E40|PUSH|EBX", "0x22E41|PUSH|EBP", "0x22E42|MOV|EBX, EDX", "0x22E44|PUSH|ESI", "0x22E45|PUSH|EDI", "0x22E46|SUB|EBX, 0x9c", "0x22E4C|MOV|EDI, ECX", "0x22E4E|JS|0x6faf2f09", "0x22E54|CMP|EBX, 0x3d", "0x22E57|JGE|0x6faf2f09", "0x22E5D|LEA|ESI, [EBX + EBX*0x4]", "0x22E60|MOV|EBP, dword ptr [ESP + 0x14]", "0x22E64|SHL|ESI, 0x2", "0x22E67|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESI + 0x6fba79c0]", "0x22E6D|TEST|EAX, EAX"],
      "comment": "Apply visual/audio effects for monster skill execution.\n\nCompanion function to ExecuteSkillEffect - handles overlay, game object, and \naudio/lighting effects while ExecuteSkillEffect handles missile targeting and callbacks.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate skill table index by subtracting 0x9C from skill ID (normalize 156-217 to 0-61)\n2. Validate skill index is within valid range (0 to 0x3C inclusive)\n3. If validation fails, assert and terminate process\n4. Check if skill has condition callback at table offset +0x8:\n   a. If callback exists and returns 0: call Ordinal_10324, then if unit is player (type 1),\n      call ClearUnitStateAndProcessTransition to reset state, and return early\n   b. If callback returns non-zero or doesn't exist: continue to effect application\n5. Call ValidateGameState with missile param from table offset +0x0:\n   a. If returns non-zero, call InitializeGameObjectProperties to create game object\n6. Call CheckAndProcessUnitState with overlay param from table offset +0x4:\n   a. If returns valid value (not -1), call InitializeOverlayData to create overlay effect\n7. Check audio effect param at table offset +0xC:\n   a. If not 0xFFFF, call InitializeAudioLightingEffect to create audio/lighting\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit (UnitAny *, IMPLICIT ECX): Pointer to unit executing the skill\n  nSkillId (dword, IMPLICIT EDX): Raw skill ID (156-217 range, normalized internally)\n  nExtraParam (dword, Stack[0x4]): Extra parameter passed to effect functions\n\nReturns:\n  void - Effects applied through side effects on unit and game state\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Skill IDs below 156 (0x9C) or above 217 (0xD8) trigger assertion failure\n  - Condition callback returning 0 triggers early exit with state transition\n  - Player units (type 1) receive special state clearing on early exit\n  - Audio effect param 0xFFFF means no audio/lighting effect for this skill\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0x9C (156) - Base skill ID offset for monster skills\n  0x3C (60) - Maximum valid skill index (0-60 range, 61 skills total)\n  0x14 (20) - Stride of skill effect table entries\n  0xFFFF - Sentinel value indicating no audio effect\n  0x6A4 (1700) - Assertion error code for invalid skill ID\n\nStructure Layout - Monster Skill Effect Table Entry (20 bytes at 0x6FBA79B8):\n  Offset | Size | Field        | Type   | Description\n  0x00   | 4    | dwMissileId  | dword  | Missile/game object parameter (0 = none)\n  0x04   | 4    | dwOverlayId  | dword  | Overlay effect parameter (-1 = none)\n  0x08   | 4    | pfnCondition | code * | Condition callback (NULL = always apply)\n  0x0C   | 4    | nAudioEffect | dword  | Audio effect ID (0xFFFF = none)\n  0x10   | 4    | (reserved)   | dword  | Additional parameter (unused here)\n\nRelated Functions:\n  - ExecuteSkillEffect: Handles missile targeting and skill callbacks\n  - ValidateGameState: Creates game objects for missile effects\n  - CheckAndProcessUnitState: Determines overlay effect to apply\n  - InitializeOverlayData: Creates visual overlay on unit\n  - InitializeAudioLightingEffect: Creates audio and lighting effects",
      "tags": ["SRC_SkillsMon.cpp", "PROP_NOCALLER", "UI_SKILLS", "PARAM_3", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control"]
    },
