      "api_count": 3,
      "api_calls": ["GetMonsterSkillId", "UNITS_GetOwnerGuid", "UNITS_GetUnitY"],
      "instructions": ["0x23030|SUB|ESP, 0x10", "0x23033|PUSH|EBX", "0x23034|PUSH|ESI", "0x23035|MOV|EBX, EDX", "0x23037|PUSH|EDI", "0x23038|PUSH|EBX", "0x23039|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x2303B|PUSH|0x43", "0x2303D|CALL|0x6fb984e8", "0x23042|MOV|EDI, EAX", "0x23044|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESI + 0xe8]", "0x2304A|OR|AL, 0x40", "0x2304C|LEA|EDX, [ESP + 0xc]", "0x23050|MOV|dword ptr [ESI + 0xe8], EAX", "0x23056|LEA|EAX, [ESP + 0x10]"],
      "comment": "Creates a spread of projectiles from a monster unit in a line pattern toward a target.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get projectile count from monster skill table (skill ID 0x43) based on skill level\n2. Set flag 0x40 on unit graphics frame at offset 0xE8 (projectile in-flight flag)\n3. Calculate monster's current X/Y coordinates via CalculateUnitCoordinates\n4. If coordinates valid:\n   a. Get target X coordinate via Ordinal_10326 (D2Common.GetTargetX)\n   b. Calculate delta X = unit X - target X\n   c. Get target Y coordinate via Ordinal_10329 (D2Common.GetTargetY)\n   d. Calculate delta Y = unit Y - target Y\n   e. Scale delta vector to minimum magnitude via ScaleVectorToMinimumMagnitude\n   f. Normalize delta vector via ScaleVectorToThreshold\n   g. Center spread: offset starting position by half spread width (delta * count / 2)\n   h. Loop count times:\n      - Create projectile (missile ID 0x72) at current position\n      - Advance position by delta vector\n\nParameters:\npMonsterUnit (UnitAny *, ECX): Pointer to monster unit firing projectiles\ndwSkillLevel (uint, EDX): Skill level determining projectile count\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Projectiles created as side effect\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If CalculateUnitCoordinates fails (returns 0), no projectiles are created\n- If projectile count <= 0, loop is skipped\n- Projectile spread is centered on target direction\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x43 (67): Skill table lookup ID for spread projectile count\n0x40 (64): Projectile in-flight flag in dwGfxFrame\n0xE8 (232): Offset to dwGfxFrame in UnitAny (via array indexing as UnitAny[4].dwGfxFrame)\n0x72 (114): Missile type ID for the created projectiles",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "PARAM_2", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
