      "comment": "Spawns a Bone Spirit projectile for the Necromancer skill.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Resolve skill handle to Skill pointer via Ordinal_10323\n2. Assert skill pointer is valid (exit with -1 if null)\n3. Zero-initialize projectile data structure (22 DWORDs = 0x58 bytes)\n4. Set projectile flags to 0x2001 (preset coords + additional flag)\n5. Set projectile count to 1\n6. Set missile type to 0x73 (Bone Spirit missile ID)\n7. Store source skill pointer in projectile data\n8. Get and store owner type from source skill\n9. Get and store target X coordinate from source skill\n10. Call InitializeAndAllocateProjectile to spawn the missile\n11. Clear source skill owner type (set to 0)\n12. Clear source skill target X (set to 0)\n\nParameters:\npSkill (ECX) - Skill handle to resolve and spawn projectile from\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Null skill pointer triggers assertion failure and application exit\n- Owner type and target X are cleared after projectile spawn (cleanup)\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0x2001 = Projectile flags (preset coords mode + unknown flag)\n  0x73 (115) = Bone Spirit missile type ID\n  0x16 (22) = Number of DWORDs in projectile data structure\n  0xf2 (242) = Source line number for assertion\n  -1 (0xffffffff) = Fatal error exit code\n\nProjectile Data Layout (0x58 bytes):\n  Offset  Size  Field            Value\n  0x00    4     dwFlags          0x2001\n  0x04    4     pSourceUnit      pSkill parameter\n  ...\n  0x1c    4     dwMissileType    0x73\n  ...\n  0x30    4     dwOwnerType      from GetSkillOwnerType\n  0x34    4     nTargetX         from GetSkillTargetX\n  ...\n  0x50    4     dwProjectileCount  1\n\nSource: SkillsNec.cpp line 242 (0xf2)",
