      "comment": "Validates that a mercenary unit has a valid room with proper DRLG sub-type.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call GetMercenaryPosition to get mercenary position from unit's animation state\n2. If position is NULL, return false (mercenary has no valid position)\n3. Get the room associated with the mercenary position via UNITS_GetRoom\n4. Call ValidateEntityDrlgSubType to check room's DRLG sub-type validity\n5. Return true (1) if validation succeeds (EAX==0), false (0) if it fails\n\nParameters:\npUnit (UnitAny *, ECX): Pointer to mercenary unit structure\n\nReturns:\nbool: true if mercenary has valid room with correct DRLG sub-type\n      false if position is NULL or validation fails\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Returns false immediately if GetMercenaryPosition returns NULL\n- Uses NEG/SBB/INC idiom to convert non-zero to 0 and zero to 1\n\nRelated Functions:\n- GetMercenaryPosition: Retrieves position coordinates from unit animation state\n- UNITS_GetRoom: Gets room pointer from position\n- ValidateEntityDrlgSubType: Validates room's DRLG sub-type",
      "tags": ["PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_1", "PROP_SMALL"]
