      "comment": "Checks if a mercenary has an active item property.\n\nClassification: Leaf function (calls only GetMercenaryPosition and GetItemPropertyFlag)\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get mercenary position/slot data from the unit\n2. Return false if no mercenary slot found (NULL check)\n3. Verify slot type equals 4 (item slot type validation)\n4. Return false if slot type mismatch\n5. Get item property flag for item index at slot offset +4\n6. Return true if property flag is non-zero\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - UnitAny pointer (IMPLICIT: ECX via __fastcall)\n          The unit whose mercenary item property is checked\n\nReturns:\n  bool - true if mercenary has active item property\n         false if no mercenary slot, wrong slot type, or no property\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Returns false immediately if GetMercenaryPosition returns NULL\n  - Slot type must equal 4 (item slot) for property check\n  - Uses NEG/SBB/NEG sequence to convert non-zero to 1\n\nAssembly Notes:\n  6faf34db-6faf34df: NEG EAX; SBB EAX,EAX; NEG EAX converts any non-zero to 1",
      "tags": ["PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_1", "PROP_SMALL"]
