      "comment": "Skill Effect Wrapper - Creates audio and light effects for Skill 66 (Sound 181)\n\nThunk function that delegates to CreateSkillAudioAndLightEffects with hardcoded\nsound ID (0xB5 = 181) and skill ID (0x42 = 66). Referenced via function pointer\ntable from ProcessNecromancerRaiseSummonSkill.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Push skill ID 0x42 (66) onto stack\n2. Push sound ID 0xB5 (181) onto stack\n3. Tail-call CreateSkillAudioAndLightEffects with pUnit and nSkillLevel in registers\n\nParameters:\npUnit (UnitAny *, ECX): Unit to apply skill effects to\nnSkillLevel (int, EDX): Skill level for effect scaling\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x42 (66): Skill ID passed to effect creation\n0xB5 (181): Sound ID for skill audio effect\n\nCalled By:\nFunction pointer table at 0x6fba7e90 (ProcessNecromancerRaiseSummonSkill)",
      "tags": ["PARAM_2", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PROP_SMALL"]
    },
