      "api_count": 4,
      "api_calls": ["GetMonsterBaseId", "GetMonsterDataFieldF0", "MissileSetField18", "MISSILE_SetTargetX"],
      "instructions": ["0x23500|SUB|ESP, 0x60", "0x23503|LEA|EAX, [ESP + 0x4]", "0x23507|PUSH|EBX", "0x23508|PUSH|EBP", "0x23509|MOV|EBP, ECX", "0x2350B|PUSH|ESI", "0x2350C|PUSH|EDI", "0x2350D|MOV|ESI, EDX", "0x2350F|MOV|EDI, dword ptr [EBP + 0xe8]", "0x23515|PUSH|EAX", "0x23516|OR|EDI, 0x40", "0x23519|LEA|EDX, [ESP + 0x14]", "0x2351D|MOV|dword ptr [EBP + 0xe8], EDI", "0x23523|CALL|0x6fae96a0", "0x23528|TEST|EAX, EAX"],
      "comment": "Creates audio source and light effect for skill activation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set unit flag 0x40 at offset 0xe8 (marks unit as having active effects)\n2. Calculate unit world coordinates using CalculateUnitCoordinates\n3. If coordinate calculation succeeds:\n   a. Query base value from Ordinal_10990(dwSkillId)\n   b. Query scaling factor from Ordinal_10991(dwSkillId)\n   c. Calculate light radius: (scalingFactor * (nSkillLevel - 1)) / 2 + baseValue\n   d. Initialize local effect structure (88 bytes zeroed, then populated)\n   e. Create audio source data via FUN_6fb77720\n   f. If audio source created:\n      - Initialize audio source via FUN_6fb637a0\n      - Create audio context with CreateAudioContext (params: 1,1,0xff,0xff,0,0)\n      - If audio context created:\n        * Set light radius with SetLightRadius\n        * Store light data pointer at AudioSourceData offset +0x88\n      - Associate sound ID via Ordinal_11131\n      - Set effect radius via Ordinal_11133\n4. Return\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit      - Pointer to UnitAny being affected by skill\n  nSkillLevel - Skill level (1-based), affects light radius calculation\n  dwSoundId   - Sound effect identifier to play\n  dwSkillId   - Skill identifier for radius lookup tables\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - If CalculateUnitCoordinates fails, function returns without creating effects\n  - If audio source creation fails, light effect is not created\n  - Light radius formula: baseValue + (scalingFactor * (level-1)) / 2\n    Example: level=1 -> radius=baseValue, level=5 -> radius=baseValue+2*scalingFactor\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0x40 (64) - Unit flags bit, marks active visual/audio effects\n  0xe8 (232) - Offset to unit flags field in UnitAny structure\n  0xbf (191) - Effect type constant (likely audio/light category identifier)\n  0x88 (136) - Offset in AudioSourceData for storing LightData pointer\n  0x16 (22) - Number of DWORDs to zero (88 bytes / 4)\n  0xff (255) - Audio context parameters (max values for both params 3 and 4)\n\nStructure Layout:\nLocal Effect Context (88 bytes on stack)\nOffset | Size | Field Name    | Type     | Description\n-------|------|---------------|----------|---------------------------\n +0x00 |   4  | dwInitFlag    | uint     | Initialization flag (set to 1)\n +0x04 |   4  | pUnitParam    | void*    | Pointer to UnitAny (cast to int)\n +0x08 |  80  | [reserved]    | byte[80] | Zeroed buffer space\n +0x18 |   4  | dwEffectType  | uint     | Effect type (0xbf)\n +0x1c |   4  | nCoordX       | int      | Unit X coordinate\n +0x20 |   4  | nCoordY       | int      | Unit Y coordinate\n +0x34 |   4  | nLevelParam   | int      | Skill level parameter\n\nNote: Function uses __fastcall convention (ECX=pUnit, EDX=nSkillLevel, stack params for dwSoundId/dwSkillId)\nNote: AudioSourceData structure actual size exceeds 12 bytes (accesses offset +0x88=136 bytes)",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_MonsterData", "STRUCT_Inventory", "STRUCT_Skill", "PARAM_4", "STRUCT_ItemData", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
