      "comment": "Wrapper that creates audio and light effects for Skill ID 72 (0x48).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Push hardcoded sound ID 0xb7 (183) and skill ID 0x48 (72) onto stack\n2. Delegate to CreateSkillAudioAndLightEffects(pUnit, nSkillLevel, 0xb7, 0x48)\n3. Return\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit       - UnitAny pointer (ECX) - The unit activating the skill\n  nSkillLevel - int (EDX) - Skill level (affects light radius calculation)\n  IMPLICIT: dwSoundId=0xb7 (183), dwSkillId=0x48 (72)\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - This is a thin wrapper binding specific skill/sound IDs to generic effect creation\n  - Sound ID 183 and Skill ID 72 are hardcoded constants for this skill variant\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0xb7 (183) - Sound effect identifier\n  0x48 (72)  - Skill identifier for radius table lookup",
