      "comment": "Thunk wrapper that creates audio/light effects for Skill ID 77 (0x4d) with Sound ID 185 (0xb9).\n\nClassification: Thunk/Wrapper - calls single function with hardcoded parameters\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Push hardcoded dwSkillId (0x4d = 77) onto stack\n2. Push hardcoded dwSoundId (0xb9 = 185) onto stack\n3. Call CreateSkillAudioAndLightEffects(pUnit, nSkillLevel, 0xb9, 0x4d)\n4. Return\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit      [ECX] - Pointer to UnitAny receiving the skill effects\n  nSkillLevel [EDX] - Skill level (1-based), affects light radius calculation\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0xb9 (185) - Sound effect ID for this skill\n  0x4d (77)  - Skill ID for radius lookup tables\n\nNote: Function has no cross-references - may be orphaned or called via function pointer table.\nThe wrapped function creates both audio source and light effects based on skill level.",
