      "comment": "Thunk wrapper for CreateSkillAudioAndLightEffects with hardcoded Skill ID 87 and Sound ID 189.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call CreateSkillAudioAndLightEffects with:\n   - pUnit (ECX) passed through\n   - nSkillLevel (EDX) passed through\n   - dwSoundId = 0xbd (189) - hardcoded sound effect\n   - dwSkillId = 0x57 (87) - hardcoded skill identifier\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit       - UnitAny * (ECX) - Pointer to unit receiving skill effects\n  nSkillLevel - int (EDX) - Skill level (1-based), affects light radius\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0xbd (189) - Sound effect ID for this skill\n  0x57 (87)  - Skill ID for radius lookup tables\n\nNotes:\n  This is a specialized thunk that wraps CreateSkillAudioAndLightEffects\n  for a specific skill type. Light radius is calculated as:\n  baseValue + (scalingFactor * (nSkillLevel - 1)) / 2",
