      "comment": "Thunk wrapper for CreateSkillAudioAndLightEffects with fixed sound/skill IDs.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call CreateSkillAudioAndLightEffects with pUnit, nSkillLevel, and fixed constants\n2. Sound ID 0xBE (190), Skill ID 0x5B (91) are passed as additional parameters\n3. Return immediately after call\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit      - UnitAny pointer, unit to apply effects to\n  nSkillLevel - Skill level (1-based), affects light radius calculation\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0xBE (190) - Sound effect ID passed to CreateSkillAudioAndLightEffects\n  0x5B (91)  - Skill ID for radius lookup tables\n\nNotes:\n  This is a simple thunk with no callers found (may be dead code or called via function pointer table).\n  Wraps CreateSkillAudioAndLightEffects to provide specific sound/skill configuration.",
