      "api_calls": ["MissileSetTargetUnit", "MissileSetTargetUnit", "UNITS_GetOwnerGuid", "UNITS_GetUnitY", "SetMissileTargetUnitId"],
      "instructions": ["0x238A0|SUB|ESP, 0x60", "0x238A3|PUSH|EBX", "0x238A4|PUSH|EBP", "0x238A5|PUSH|ESI", "0x238A6|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x238A8|PUSH|EDI", "0x238A9|OR|dword ptr [ESI + 0xe8], 0x40", "0x238B0|CALL|0x6fb63760", "0x238B5|MOV|EBP, EAX", "0x238B7|LEA|EAX, [ESP + 0x14]", "0x238BB|PUSH|EAX", "0x238BC|LEA|EDX, [ESP + 0x14]", "0x238C0|MOV|ECX, ESI", "0x238C2|CALL|0x6fae96a0", "0x238C7|TEST|EAX, EAX"],
      "comment": "Fires a homing projectile from a mercenary unit toward a target.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set unit graphics flag 0x40 at offset 0xe8 (marks unit as firing)\n2. Get mercenary position data via GetMercenaryPosition\n3. Calculate source unit coordinates via CalculateUnitCoordinates\n4. If coordinate calculation fails, exit early\n5. Zero-initialize 22 dwords of projectile initialization structure\n6. Set missile flags to 0x20 (homing) if mercenary has position, else 0x420 (ground target)\n7. Set missile ID to 0xC1 (Iron Golem Lightning projectile)\n8. Populate projectile structure with owner, target unit, and merc position\n9. Call InitializeAndAllocateProjectile to create missile\n10. If missile allocation fails, exit\n11. If mercenary has position data: set target type to 1 (unit target), return\n12. Else: set target type to 2 (coordinate target)\n13. Get source unit X via Ordinal_10326 (D2Common.UNITS_GetUnitX)\n14. Get source unit Y via Ordinal_10329 (D2Common.UNITS_GetUnitY)\n15. Calculate delta X/Y from source coords to target\n16. Pack delta into target ID format: (deltaY * 0x10000) + deltaX\n17. Call SetMissileTargetUnitId with packed coordinate delta\n\nParameters:\n  pSourceUnit (ECX) - UnitAny* pointer to the mercenary unit firing the projectile\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Early exit if CalculateUnitCoordinates fails (returns 0)\n  - Early exit if InitializeAndAllocateProjectile returns NULL\n  - Different targeting mode based on mercenary position availability:\n    - With position: unit-targeted homing (type 1)\n    - Without position: coordinate-targeted (type 2)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x40 - Graphics frame flag for firing animation\n  0xe8 - Offset to dwGfxFrame in UnitAny\n  0x20 - Missile flags for unit homing\n  0x420 - Missile flags for ground/coordinate targeting\n  0xC1 (193) - Missile ID for Iron Golem Lightning projectile\n  0x16 (22) - Number of dwords to zero in init structure",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
    },
