      "instructions": ["0x24510|SUB|ESP, 0x60", "0x24513|LEA|EAX, [ESP + 0x4]", "0x24517|PUSH|EBX", "0x24518|PUSH|ESI", "0x24519|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x2451B|PUSH|EDI", "0x2451C|MOV|EBX, EDX", "0x2451E|PUSH|EAX", "0x2451F|MOV|EDI, dword ptr [ESI + 0xe8]", "0x24525|LEA|EDX, [ESP + 0x10]", "0x24529|OR|EDI, 0x40", "0x2452C|MOV|dword ptr [ESI + 0xe8], EDI", "0x24532|CALL|0x6fae96a0", "0x24537|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x24539|JZ|0x6faf45b5"],
      "comment": "Creates and spawns a missile projectile for the given unit.\n\nClassification: Worker function - called to spawn missiles attached to units.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set graphics frame flag 0x40 on unit at offset 0xe8 (dwGfxFrame in UnitAny[4])\n2. Call CalculateUnitCoordinates to get unit spawn position (X, Y)\n3. If coordinates valid (non-zero return):\n   a. Zero-initialize 0x58 bytes (22 dwords) of projectile config structure\n   b. Set control flags to 0x20 (adjust preset coordinate mode)\n   c. Copy spawn coordinates to config (X at offset 0x10, Y at offset 0x14)\n   d. Set projectile type to 0x5c (92) at config offset 0x4\n   e. Set source and target units to pUnit (self-targeting missile)\n   f. Copy missile ID to config at offset 0x18\n4. Call InitializeAndAllocateProjectile with config structure\n5. If allocation fails: assert \"hMissile\" and exit with code -1\n6. Get missile path from allocated unit at offset 0x38 (field 0xe)\n7. Set path type to 0xe (missile path type)\n8. Calculate unit path to target with no offset\n\nParameters:\npUnit - Source unit to spawn missile from (UnitAny pointer)\ndwMissileId - Missile type identifier\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Returns early if CalculateUnitCoordinates fails (returns 0)\n- Asserts and exits on missile allocation failure\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x40 = Graphics frame flag (missile active/visible)\n0xe8 = Offset to dwGfxFrame in UnitAny structure\n0x20 = Control flags: adjust preset coordinate mode\n0x5c = Projectile type constant (92 decimal)\n0x16 = Number of dwords to zero (22 * 4 = 0x58 bytes)\n0xe = Path type for missile movement\n0x38 = Offset to path pointer in missile unit (field 0xe)\n0x1df = Assert line number in source file",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Path", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_2", "PROP_NOCALLER", "SRC_SkillsPal.cpp", "UI_SKILLS", "STRUCT_Skill", "STRUCT_Room2", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
