      "instructions": ["0x245C0|SUB|ESP, 0x58", "0x245C3|PUSH|EBX", "0x245C4|PUSH|EBP", "0x245C5|PUSH|ESI", "0x245C6|PUSH|EDI", "0x245C7|MOV|EBP, EDX", "0x245C9|MOV|EBX, ECX", "0x245CB|PUSH|0x0", "0x245CD|PUSH|0x0", "0x245CF|PUSH|0x0", "0x245D1|MOV|EDX, EBX", "0x245D3|MOV|ECX, 0x94a", "0x245D8|CALL|0x6fb8d210", "0x245DD|MOV|ECX, EBX", "0x245DF|CALL|0x6fb63760"],
      "comment": "Creates and launches a healing projectile targeting the mercenary.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize game object properties with type ID 0x94a (2378) for the mercenary\n2. Get mercenary position coordinates via GetMercenaryPosition\n3. If position is NULL, exit early (no valid mercenary position)\n4. Zero-initialize 0x16 (22) dwords of projectile configuration structure on stack\n5. Set projectile flags [0] = 1 (preset coordinate mode disabled)\n6. Set source unit [1] = pMercenary\n7. Retrieve X coordinate via Ordinal_10326 (D2Common.GetUnitX)\n8. Retrieve Y coordinate via Ordinal_10329 (D2Common.GetUnitY)\n9. Set missile type [4] = 0xe9 (233 - healing projectile type)\n10. Set skill parameter [7] = dwEffectParam\n11. Allocate and initialize projectile via InitializeAndAllocateProjectile\n12. If projectile allocation succeeds, set target unit and target unit ID from position data\n\nParameters:\npMercenary (UnitAny *): Pointer to mercenary unit to receive healing projectile\ndwEffectParam (dword): Effect modifier parameter passed to projectile config\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Returns early if GetMercenaryPosition returns NULL (invalid mercenary state)\n- Projectile may fail to allocate if InitializeAndAllocateProjectile returns NULL\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x94a (2378): Game object type ID for mercenary healing visual effect\n0x16 (22): Number of dwords in projectile configuration structure\n0xe9 (233): Missile type ID for healing projectile\n[0]: Position data X coordinate\n[2]: Position data unit ID for targeting\n\nRelated Functions:\n- InitializeGameObjectProperties: Sets up visual effect for mercenary\n- GetMercenaryPosition: Retrieves mercenary position coordinate array\n- InitializeAndAllocateProjectile: Allocates and configures missile unit\n- MissileSetTargetUnit: Sets missile target X coordinate\n- SetMissileTargetUnitId: Sets missile target unit ID\n\nStructure Layout (Projectile Config):\nOffset  Size  Field           Type    Description\n0x00    4     dwFlags         dword   Control flags (1 = use spawn coords)\n0x04    4     pSourceUnit     ptr     Source unit pointer (mercenary)\n0x08    4     dwSpawnArea     dword   Spawn area ID\n0x0c    4     pTargetUnit     ptr     Target unit (usually NULL)\n0x10    4     dwMissileType   dword   Missile type ID (0xe9)\n0x14    4     dwPresetX       dword   Preset X coordinate\n0x18    4     dwPresetY       dword   Preset Y coordinate\n0x1c    4     dwAdjustX       dword   X adjustment offset\n0x20    4     dwAdjustY       dword   Y adjustment offset (skill param)\n...",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_2", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
