      "instructions": ["0x246C0|PUSH|ECX", "0x246C1|PUSH|EBX", "0x246C2|PUSH|ESI", "0x246C3|PUSH|EDI", "0x246C4|MOV|EDI, ECX", "0x246C6|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0xc], EDX", "0x246CA|PUSH|EDI", "0x246CB|CALL|0x6fb983c2", "0x246D0|MOV|ECX, EDI", "0x246D2|MOV|EBX, EAX", "0x246D4|CALL|0x6fb63760", "0x246D9|TEST|EBX, EBX", "0x246DB|MOV|ESI, EAX", "0x246DD|JNZ|0x6faf46e6", "0x246DF|POP|EDI"],
      "comment": "Configures skill targeting for a unit by finding target position and setting direction.\n\nClassification: Worker function - Sets up skill targeting state\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call Ordinal_10323 to get unit's active skill (EBX = pSkill)\n2. Call GetMercenaryPosition to find mercenary target position\n3. If pSkill is NULL, return early (no active skill)\n4. If no mercenary position found:\n   a. Query for item target via BuildAndExecuteItemQuery(pUnit, -1, 4, 4)\n   b. If still no target, set skill owner type to 0 and return\n5. Get target coordinates via Ordinal_10329 (X) and Ordinal_10326 (Y)\n6. Set unit direction toward target via SetUnitDirectionToTarget\n7. Get skill ID from pSkill via GetSkillsTxtId\n8. Get max owner type from monster data (GetMonsterDataField104)\n9. Get resurrect mode (GetMonsterResurrectMode)\n10. Calculate owner type: resurrectMode + nModeModifier - 1\n11. Clamp owner type to max value from monster data\n12. Apply settings: SetSkillOwnerType, SetSkillTargetX, SetSkillTargetY\n13. Return success (EAX = 1)\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit (ECX) - UnitAny * - Unit whose skill is being configured\n  nModeModifier (EDX) - int - Mode adjustment value for owner type calculation\n\nReturns:\n  EAX = 0 if pSkill is NULL (no active skill)\n  EAX = 1 on success\n\nDecompiler Variables (SSA temporaries - cannot rename):\n  pSkill: Skill pointer from Ordinal_10323 (stored in EBX)\n  pdVar1 (pTargetPos): Target position pointer from GetMercenaryPosition or item query\n  extraout_EAX: Result from BuildAndExecuteItemQuery\n  extraout_EAX_00: Target X coordinate from Ordinal_10329\n  nTargetX: Target X from Ordinal_10326\n  iVar2 (nSkillId): Reused for skill ID and resurrect mode\n  dVar3 (dwMaxOwnerType): Max owner type from GetMonsterDataField104\n  dwOwnerType: Calculated clamped owner type\n\nOrdinal Functions:\n  Ordinal_10323: D2Common - Gets unit's active skill\n  Ordinal_10329: D2Common - Gets X coordinate from position struct\n  Ordinal_10326: D2Common - Gets Y coordinate from position struct\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Early return if no active skill (pSkill == NULL)\n  - Fallback to item query if mercenary not found\n  - Owner type clamped to prevent exceeding max value",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_2", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control"]
    },
