      "api_calls": ["UNITS_GetSummonOwnerUnitId", "SetOverlayCallback", "FogAssert"],
      "instructions": ["0x249B0|PUSH|ESI", "0x249B1|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x249B3|PUSH|EDI", "0x249B4|MOV|EDI, EDX", "0x249B6|PUSH|ESI", "0x249B7|CALL|0x6fb983c2", "0x249BC|SUB|EDI, 0x60", "0x249BF|JS|0x6faf4a32", "0x249C1|CMP|EDI, 0x1e", "0x249C4|JGE|0x6faf4a32", "0x249C6|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x249C8|JZ|0x6faf4a2d", "0x249CA|LEA|EDI, [EDI + EDI*0x4]", "0x249CD|PUSH|EBX", "0x249CE|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x10]"],
      "comment": "Process client-side skill activation for skill IDs 0x60-0x7d (96-125)\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate skill ID is within client skill range (Ordinal_10323 check)\n2. Calculate skill table index by subtracting 0x60 from skill ID\n3. Verify index is within bounds 0-0x1d (0-29 decimal for 30 skills)\n4. If index out of range, trigger assertion failure and terminate\n5. If skill validation failed (nIsValidSkill == 0), exit without processing\n6. Calculate table entry offset: nSkillIndex * 0x14 (20-byte stride)\n7. Load target coordinate from SkillParams table at offset +0x0\n8. If coordinate != 0xffff, call CalculateMissileTargetCoordinates with target\n9. Set unit flag 0x40 at offset 0xe8 (unit completion marker)\n10. Load function pointer from SkillParams table at offset +0x4\n11. If function pointer is NULL, set unit flag 0x40 and skip callback\n12. If function pointer is valid, invoke callback with (pUnit, dwTargetParam)\n13. Query for audio context associated with unit (Ordinal_10958)\n14. If audio context exists, remove it from active list\n15. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit (UnitAny *) - Pointer to unit activating the skill (missile/player)\n  nSkillId (int) - Skill ID to process (must be in range 0x60-0x7d)\n  dwTargetParam (uint) - Target parameter passed to skill callback and targeting\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value, function modifies unit state in-place\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Skill ID < 0x60 or >= 0x7e: Triggers assertion failure (Ordinal_10023) and terminates process\n  - Invalid skill validation: Function exits early without processing\n  - Coordinate 0xffff: Indicates no target coordinate, skips missile targeting\n  - NULL callback pointer: Sets completion flag but skips skill execution\n  - Missing audio context: Normal case, function continues without error\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0x60 (96) - Minimum client skill ID offset\n  0x7d (125) - Maximum client skill ID (0x60 + 0x1d)\n  0x1e (30) - Total number of client skills in table\n  0x14 (20) - Size of SkillParams structure (stride)\n  0xffff - Sentinel value indicating no target coordinate\n  0x40 - Unit completion flag bit\n  0xe8 - Offset to unit flags field (DWORD at index 0x3a)\n\nError Handling:\n  - Range validation failure: Calls Ordinal_10023 with source file/line, then FUN_6fb9a10f(0xffffffff) to terminate\n  - Validation check failure: Silent early return without assertion\n  - NULL callback: Not an error, sets flag and continues\n  - No audio context: Expected case, no error handling needed\n\nStructure Layout - SkillParams (20 bytes):\n  Offset | Size | Field Name      | Type     | Description\n  -------|------|-----------------|----------|----------------------------------\n  +0x0   | 4    | dwTargetCoord   | uint     | Target coordinate (0xffff if none)\n  +0x4   | 4    | pfnCallback     | void *   | Function pointer to skill handler\n  +0x8   | 12   | (remaining)     | byte[12] | Additional parameters (unknown)\n\nGlobal Data:\n  DAT_6fba80e4 - SkillParams table[30], indexed by (nSkillId - 0x60)\n  DAT_6fba80e8 - Function pointer array at offset +0x4 in each SkillParams entry",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "SRC_SkillsPal.cpp", "UI_SKILLS", "PARAM_3", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control"]
