      "instructions": ["0x24B20|PUSH|ESI", "0x24B21|PUSH|EDI", "0x24B22|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x24B24|PUSH|0xc", "0x24B26|PUSH|ESI", "0x24B27|CALL|0x6fb986a4", "0x24B2C|MOV|EDI, EAX", "0x24B2E|TEST|EDI, EDI", "0x24B30|JNZ|0x6faf4b7c", "0x24B32|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESI + 0x8]", "0x24B35|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESI]", "0x24B37|PUSH|EAX", "0x24B38|PUSH|ECX", "0x24B39|PUSH|0x14", "0x24B3B|PUSH|0x2"],
      "comment": "Initialize or create context handle with validation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n\n1. Attempt to retrieve existing handle using Ordinal_10480 with size 0xc\n2. If handle exists (non-zero return):\n   a. Clear context flags using Ordinal_10372 with parameter 8\n   b. Set context field at offset 0x54 to 0x500\n   c. Configure handle using Ordinal_10476 with parameter 6\n   d. Return success (1)\n3. If handle does not exist (zero return):\n   a. Create new handle using Ordinal_10470 with type 2, size 0x14\n   b. If creation fails, return failure (0)\n   c. Associate handle with context using Ordinal_10475\n   d. Set handle callback function pointer to LAB_6fb6e170\n   e. Configure handle size using Ordinal_10478 with value 0xc\n   f. Finalize context configuration with Ordinal_10486\n   g. Return success (1)\n\nParameters:\n\n  pContext (int *) - Pointer to context structure to initialize or attach handle\n\nReturns:\n\n  1 (success) - Handle retrieved/created and context configured\n  0 (failure) - Handle creation failed in Ordinal_10470\n\nSpecial Cases:\n\n  Existing handle path (step 2) sets field at offset 0x54 to 0x500\n  New handle path (step 3) creates handle with initial context values from offsets 0x0 and 0x8\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n\n  0xc (12 decimal) - Size parameter for handle retrieval and configuration\n  0x8 (8 decimal) - Flags parameter for context clearing operation\n  0x54 (84 decimal) - Byte offset in context structure (array index 0x15)\n  0x500 (1280 decimal) - Configuration value stored at offset 0x54\n  0x6 (6 decimal) - Handle configuration parameter\n  0x2 (2 decimal) - Handle type code for creation\n  0x14 (20 decimal) - Size parameter for new handle creation\n  0x1 (1 decimal) - Final configuration flag for Ordinal_10486\n\nStructure Layout:\n\n  Offset  Size  Field Name        Type    Description\n  ------  ----  ----------------  ------  -----------\n  0x00    4     dwInitialParam    dword   Initial parameter used in handle creation\n  0x08    4     dwSecondParam     dword   Second parameter used in handle creation\n  0x54    4     dwConfigValue     dword   Configuration value set to 0x500\n\nError Handling:\n\n  Returns 0 if Ordinal_10470 fails to create new handle\n  No error handling for existing handle path - assumes success",
      "tags": ["PARAM_1"]
