      "api_calls": ["GetEntityField", "GetGameConfigElement", "FogMemAlloc", "ReleasePoolAllocation", "FogMemAlloc", "ReleasePoolAllocation"],
      "instructions": ["0x27650|PUSH|ECX", "0x27651|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbf42a0]", "0x27656|PUSH|EBX", "0x27657|XOR|EBX, EBX", "0x27659|PUSH|ESI", "0x2765A|CMP|EAX, EBX", "0x2765C|PUSH|EDI", "0x2765D|JZ|0x6faf7667", "0x2765F|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [EAX]", "0x27661|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0xc], EAX", "0x27665|JMP|0x6faf766f", "0x27667|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0xc], 0xffffffff", "0x2766F|PUSH|EBP", "0x27670|MOV|EBP, dword ptr [ESP + 0x18]", "0x27674|PUSH|EBP"],
      "comment": "SwitchAutomapLevelContext - Switches automap context when entity changes levels\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Save current level ID from active node (or -1 if none)\n2. Get entity's current level via GetEntityField -> GetGameConfigElement\n3. Search linked list for existing node matching new level ID\n4. If not found, allocate new 0x1C byte node via FogMemAlloc, zero-fill, set level ID, prepend to list\n5. If new node differs from active node:\n   a. Serialize current trees via SerializeActiveBinaryTrees\n   b. Release sprite pages at +0x2800 offset\n   c. Clear active node fields [2-5] and sprite globals\n   d. Set new active node\n   e. Load automap data via LoadAutomapDataFromStorage\n6. Call ProcessUnitSkillsAndFlags with entity, force=1, and new level node\n7. If previous level was valid (!= -1), repeat steps 3-5 for previous level\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit (UnitAny *) - Pointer to game unit whose level context to switch\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - NULL active node: previous level ID set to -1, skips restoration phase\n  - New level same as active: skips serialization/reload, only calls ProcessUnitSkillsAndFlags\n  - Previous level -1: skips restoration phase entirely\n\nStructure Layout (AutomapLevelNode, 0x1C bytes):\n  Offset  Size  Field       Type    Description\n  0x00    4     nLevelId    int     Level identifier\n  0x04    4     field_04    int     Unknown (cleared on switch)\n  0x08    4     field_08    int     Unknown (cleared on switch)\n  0x0C    4     field_0C    int     Unknown (cleared on switch)\n  0x10    4     field_10    int     Unknown (cleared on switch)\n  0x14    4     field_14    int     Unknown (cleared on switch)\n  0x18    4     pNext       int *   Next node in linked list\n\nGlobal References:\n  g_pAutomapLevelNodeList (0x6fbf429c) - Head of level node linked list\n  g_pActiveAutomapLevelNode (0x6fbf42a0) - Currently active level node\n  g_pAutomapSpritePageList (0x6fbf4294) - Sprite page allocation list\n  g_dwAutomapSpriteAllocCount (0x6fbf4298) - Sprite allocation counter\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x1C - Size of AutomapLevelNode structure (28 bytes, 7 dwords)\n  0x5F1 - Line number in automap.cpp (1521)\n  0x2800 - Offset to next sprite page pointer in sprite page structure",
      "tags": ["SRC_automap.cpp", "UI_AUTOMAP", "MOD_UI", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "TBL_automap", "PARAM_1", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
