      "instructions": ["0x27CA0|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbe9284]", "0x27CA5|SUB|ESP, 0x1c", "0x27CA8|PUSH|ESI", "0x27CA9|XOR|ESI, ESI", "0x27CAB|CMP|EAX, ESI", "0x27CAD|JZ|0x6faf82ac", "0x27CB3|CALL|0x6fb62880", "0x27CB8|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x27CBA|JZ|0x6faf82ac", "0x27CC0|CALL|0x6fb62880", "0x27CC5|PUSH|EAX", "0x27CC6|CALL|0x6fb98164", "0x27CCB|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x27CCD|JZ|0x6faf82ac", "0x27CD3|PUSH|EDI"],
      "comment": "Updates automap rendering system with camera positioning and sprite rendering configuration\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check render context validity via g_hRenderContext\n2. Validate game context and viewport initialization state\n3. Call InitializeViewportCoordinates to reset base coordinates\n4. Process scroll window mode (left/right panel open state)\n5. Calculate horizontal viewport adjustment based on scroll mode\n6. Update automap left panel state transitions\n7. Calculate camera center position from viewport coordinates\n8. Configure camera boundaries based on graphics mode (windowed=1, fullscreen=other)\n9. Set zoom level: 0x14 (20 decimal) for windowed, 10 for fullscreen\n10. Store camera horizontal offset to _DAT_6fbf42cc\n11. Render automap sprite layers at offsets +8, +0xc, +0x10 from base\n12. Apply zoom level adjustments based on automap zoom state (1-3)\n13. Render final sprite layer at offset +0x14 with configured camera\n14. Call post-processing functions for automap rendering\n15. Set global rendering parameter DAT_6fbf42f8 to 0x18 (24 decimal)\n16. Check server port for multiplayer-specific rendering (port 6 or 8)\n17. Conditionally render multiplayer-specific overlays\n18. Check global system state for additional rendering passes\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\nScroll window mode values (dwScrollMode):\n- 1: Left panel open (inventory/character) - shift viewport left by screen_width/4\n- 2: Right panel open (skill tree/quests) - shift viewport right by screen_width/4\n- 3 or other: No panels open - restore previous state\n\nGraphics mode (g_dwGraphicsMode):\n- 1: Windowed mode - use reduced camera bounds with 1/3 buffer scaling\n- Other: Fullscreen mode - use full camera bounds\n\nAutomap zoom states (*(DAT_6fbf42a0 + 4)):\n- 0: Default zoom - minimal camera bounds (±8 horizontal, ±16 vertical in windowed)\n- 1: Zoom level 1 - camera bounds ±160 horizontal, ±100 vertical\n- 2: Zoom level 2 - camera bounds ±136 horizontal, ±90 vertical\n- 3: Zoom level 3 - camera bounds ±180 horizontal, ±170 vertical\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x28 (40 decimal) - Horizontal border offset for automap position\n0xf (15 decimal) - Vertical border offset for automap position\n0x14 (20 decimal) - Zoom level for windowed mode\n10 (0xa) - Zoom level for fullscreen mode\n0x18 (24 decimal) - Global rendering parameter value\n6 - Server port for specific multiplayer mode\n8 - Alternate server port for multiplayer mode\n0xa0 (160 decimal) - Zoom level 1 camera half-width\n100 (0x64) - Zoom level 1 camera half-height\n0x88 (136 decimal) - Zoom level 2 camera half-width\n0x5a (90 decimal) - Zoom level 2 camera half-height\n0xb4 (180 decimal) - Zoom level 3 camera half-width\n0xaa (170 decimal) - Zoom level 3 camera half-height\n0x50 (80 decimal) - Zoom level 1 horizontal span (half-width * 2 / 2)\n0x32 (50 decimal) - Zoom level 1 vertical span\n0x44 (68 decimal) - Zoom level 2 horizontal span\n0x2d (45 decimal) - Zoom level 2 vertical span\n0x5a (90 decimal) - Zoom level 3 horizontal span\n0x55 (85 decimal) - Zoom level 3 vertical span\n\nGlobal Data References:\ng_hRenderContext @ 0x6fbf4280 - Render context handle\ng_dwGraphicsMode @ 0x6fbf428c - Graphics mode flag (1=windowed)\ng_dwScreenWidth - Screen width in pixels\ng_dwBackBufferHeight - Back buffer height\ng_dwViewportHeight - Viewport height\ng_dwWindowBorderX @ 0x6fbf42c4 - Window border X offset\ng_dwWindowBorderY @ 0x6fbf42c8 - Window border Y offset\ng_dwWindowBaseX - Window base X coordinate\ng_dwWindowBaseY - Window base Y coordinate\ng_dwAutomapLeftState - Current left panel state (0=closed, 1=open)\ng_dwAutomapLeftPrevious - Previous left panel state\ng_dwAutomapLeftTarget - Target left panel state\nDAT_6fbf42a0 - Automap sprite configuration structure pointer\nDAT_6fbf42a4 - Sprite handle for default zoom\nDAT_6fbf42a8 - Sprite handle for zoom level 1\nDAT_6fbf42ac - Sprite handle for zoom level 2\nDAT_6fbf42b0 - Sprite handle for zoom level 3\n_DAT_6fbf42cc - Camera horizontal offset\n_DAT_6fbf42d0 - Camera vertical offset\nDAT_6fbf42d4 - Final automap X position\nDAT_6fbf42d8 - Final automap Y position\nDAT_6fbf42f8 - Global rendering parameter\nDAT_6fbb1d10 - Zoom level divisor (updated by function)",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_0", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
