      "comment": "Renders the player icon on the automap by drawing a series of connected line segments.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Apply Glide graphics mode offset adjustment if g_dwGraphicsMode == 1\n   - Decrement nScreenX by 1\n   - Increment nScreenY by 5\n2. Initialize pIconLineData pointer to start of line coordinate table at g_AutomapPlayerIconLineData\n3. Loop through line segment array until reaching g_AutomapPlayerIconLineDataEnd\n   a. Read four consecutive int values from table (x1_offset, y1_offset, x2_offset, y2_offset)\n   b. Calculate absolute screen coordinates by scaling offsets by 2 and adding to base position:\n      - x1 = nScreenX + pIconLineData[-2] * 2\n      - y1 = nScreenY + pIconLineData[-1] * 2\n      - x2 = nScreenX + pIconLineData[0] * 2\n      - y2 = nScreenY + pIconLineData[1] * 2\n   c. Call Ordinal_10057 (D2GFX DrawLine) to render line segment with full opacity (0xFF alpha)\n   d. Advance pIconLineData by 2 elements (8 bytes) to next line segment\n4. Return when all line segments have been rendered\n\nParameters:\n  nScreenX - Base X coordinate on automap screen where icon should be centered\n  nScreenY - Base Y coordinate on automap screen where icon should be centered\n  dwColor - 32-bit ARGB color value for drawing the icon lines\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Glide graphics mode (g_dwGraphicsMode == 1) requires position adjustment to compensate for rendering differences\n  - Line coordinate table contains relative offsets scaled by 2 to support sub-pixel precision\n  - All lines drawn with maximum alpha channel (0xFF) for full opacity\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0x1 (1 decimal) - Glide graphics mode identifier\n  -1 - X coordinate adjustment for Glide mode\n  5 - Y coordinate adjustment for Glide mode\n  2 - Scaling factor for icon coordinate offsets (allows half-pixel precision in table)\n  0xFF (255 decimal) - Maximum alpha channel value (fully opaque)\n\nStructure Layout:\n  Line Coordinate Table Entry (8 bytes per line segment):\n  Offset | Size | Field Name      | Type | Description\n  -------|------|-----------------|------|------------------------------------------\n  -0x8   | 4    | nX1Offset       | int  | Start X offset (table[i-2])\n  -0x4   | 4    | nY1Offset       | int  | Start Y offset (table[i-1])\n  +0x0   | 4    | nX2Offset       | int  | End X offset (table[i+0])\n  +0x4   | 4    | nY2Offset       | int  | End Y offset (table[i+1])\n\n  Data range: g_AutomapPlayerIconLineData (0x6fba85c0) to g_AutomapPlayerIconLineDataEnd (0x6fba8620)\n  Total entries: 12 line segments (96 bytes / 8 bytes per entry)",
