      "comment": "Initializes automap rendering resources and loads configuration settings from INI file.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call LoadAutomapSpriteResources() to load sprite data\n2. Clear 0x800 (2048) dwords of automap cache starting at DAT_6fbf228c with 0xffffffff\n3. Initialize automap cache from INI configuration table at DAT_6fbb1b88\n   - Read key-value pairs (each 8 bytes): index and value\n   - Write to cache array indexed by key: cache[index] = value\n4. Load INI setting \"AutoMapFade\" with default 0, store in g_dwAutomapFadeState\n5. Load INI setting \"AutoMap Centers\" with default 1, store in g_dwFullscreenEnabled\n6. Load INI setting \"AutoMapPartyKey\" with default 1, store in g_dwAutomapPartyMode\n7. Load INI setting \"AutoMapPartyNames\" with default 1, store in g_fShowAutomapPartyNames\n8. Load INI setting \"AutoMap Left\" with default 1, store in g_dwAutomapLeftState\n9. Initialize automap state: g_dwAutomapLeftPrevious = g_dwAutomapLeftTarget = g_dwAutomapLeftState\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x800 (2048) - Size of automap cache array in dwords\n0x6fbf228c - Base address of automap sprite cache\n0x6fbb1b88 - Base address of INI configuration table\n0x6fbb1d10 - End address of configuration table\n\nRelated Functions:\n- LoadAutomapSpriteResources() - Called first to prepare sprite resources\n- Ordinal_423() - INI file reader for loading configuration values (appears to be D2Win INI API)",
