      "instructions": ["0x29280|SUB|ESP, 0x104", "0x29286|MOV|AL, [0x6fbdc134]", "0x2928B|PUSH|ESI", "0x2928C|PUSH|EDI", "0x2928D|MOV|byte ptr [ESP + 0x8], AL", "0x29291|MOV|ECX, 0x40", "0x29296|XOR|EAX, EAX", "0x29298|LEA|EDI, [ESP + 0x9]", "0x2929C|MOV|ESI, 0x6fbf42a4", "0x292A1|STOSD.REP|ES:EDI", "0x292A3|STOSW|ES:EDI", "0x292A5|STOSB|ES:EDI", "0x292A6|XOR|EDI, EDI", "0x292A8|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESI]", "0x292AA|CMP|ECX, EDI"],
      "comment": "Initializes automap sprite resources for different acts and graphics modes.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Copy game data flag byte to local stack buffer (chPathBuffer)\n2. Initialize 259-byte buffer (dwBuffer) to zero using STOSD/STOSW/STOSB\n3. Loop through automap resource pointer array (0x6fbf42a4 to 0x6fbf42b4)\n4. For each non-null pointer, call ReportValidationError and clear pointer\n5. Check g_dwGraphicsMode: if 1 (high-res), load MaxiMapS/Act2MapS/Act4MapS/ExTnMapS\n6. If mode not 1 (low-res), load MaxiMap/Act2Map/Act4Map/ExTnMap variants\n7. For each map variant: format path with FUN_6fb9a261, write file via ConcatenatePathAndWriteFile\n8. Store file handle in DAT_6fbf42a4/a8/ac/b0, store result code in DAT_6fbf42b4/b8/bc/c0\n9. For low-res expansion map (ExTnMap), check Ordinal_10227() before loading\n10. If Ordinal_10227 returns 0, clear DAT_6fbf42b0 and _DAT_6fbf42c0 and return early\n\nParameters:\nvoid (no parameters)\n\nReturns:\nvoid (no return value)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Magic value 0x40 (decimal 64): Loop counter for 256-byte buffer zero-fill (64 dwords)\n- Magic value 0x6fbf42b4: End boundary for resource pointer array (4 pointers, 16 bytes)\n- Magic value 1: High-resolution graphics mode flag\n- Ordinal_10227 gate: Low-res expansion map requires additional check before loading\n- If Ordinal_10227 returns 0, expansion map resources are nulled instead of loaded\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n- 0x40 (64): DWORD loop count for 256-byte buffer initialization\n- 0x6fbf42b4: End address of 4-element resource pointer array\n- 1: High-resolution graphics mode identifier\n- 0: Low-resolution graphics mode identifier / null value for early exit\n\nError Handling:\n- Calls ReportValidationError for any non-null resource pointers during cleanup\n- All resource pointers cleared to 0 before loading new resources\n- Ordinal_10227 check prevents loading expansion map if prerequisite fails\n- On Ordinal_10227 failure, nulls both resource pointer and result code\n\nGlobal Variables Accessed:\n- DAT_6fbdc134: Game data flag byte (source for chPathBuffer initialization)\n- g_dwGraphicsMode: Graphics mode flag (1=high-res, other=low-res)\n- DAT_6fbf42a4: MaxiMap/MaxiMapS resource pointer\n- DAT_6fbf42a8: Act2Map/Act2MapS resource pointer\n- DAT_6fbf42ac: Act4Map/Act4MapS resource pointer\n- DAT_6fbf42b0: ExTnMap/ExTnMapS resource pointer\n- DAT_6fbf42b4: MaxiMap result code\n- _DAT_6fbf42b8: Act2Map result code\n- _DAT_6fbf42bc: Act4Map result code\n- _DAT_6fbf42c0: ExTnMap result code\n\nString Resources Referenced:\n- s__s_UI_AutoMap_MaxiMapS_6fbb20c4: High-res maxi map format string\n- s__s_UI_AutoMap_Act2MapS_6fbb20ac: High-res Act 2 map format string\n- s__s_UI_AutoMap_Act4MapS_6fbb2094: High-res Act 4 map format string\n- s__s_UI_AutoMap_ExTnMapS_6fbb207c: High-res expansion map format string\n- s__s_UI_AutoMap_MaxiMap_6fbb2124: Low-res maxi map format string\n- s__s_UI_AutoMap_Act2Map_6fbb210c: Low-res Act 2 map format string\n- s__s_UI_AutoMap_Act4Map_6fbb20f4: Low-res Act 4 map format string\n- s__s_UI_AutoMap_ExTnMap_6fbb20dc: Low-res expansion map format string",
