      "instructions": ["0x29460|PUSH|ESI", "0x29461|PUSH|EDI", "0x29462|CALL|0x6faf5d10", "0x29467|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbf42a0]", "0x2946C|XOR|EDI, EDI", "0x2946E|CMP|EAX, EDI", "0x29470|JZ|0x6faf94c6", "0x29472|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [0x6fbf4294]", "0x29478|CMP|ESI, EDI", "0x2947A|JZ|0x6faf9498", "0x2947C|PUSH|EDI", "0x2947D|MOV|ECX, ESI", "0x2947F|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [ESI + 0x2800]", "0x29485|PUSH|0x522", "0x2948A|MOV|EDX, 0x6fbb1d70"],
      "comment": "Shutdown and cleanup all automap sprite rendering systems\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Serialize active binary trees to ensure consistent state\n2. Check if automap context structure exists (DAT_6fbf42a0)\n3. If context exists:\n   a. Walk sprite page linked list starting from g_pAutomapSpritePageList\n   b. For each page node, call Ordinal_10043(0x522, 0) to free memory\n   c. Zero global page list head pointer (g_pAutomapSpritePageList)\n   d. Zero global allocation counter (g_dwAutomapSpriteAllocCount)\n   e. Zero four fields in context structure at offsets +0x08, +0x0C, +0x10, +0x14\n4. Walk error code array from 0x6fbf42a4 to 0x6fbf42b4 (4 DWORDs):\n   a. For each non-zero error code entry, call ReportValidationError\n   b. Zero the error code entry after reporting\n5. Walk secondary linked list starting from DAT_6fbf429c:\n   a. For each node at offset +0x18, call Ordinal_10043(0xbec, 0) to free memory\n   b. Continue until reaching NULL terminator\n6. Zero remaining global pointers: DAT_6fbf429c and DAT_6fbf42a0\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\nIf DAT_6fbf42a0 is NULL (automap context not initialized), skips sprite page cleanup\nand proceeds directly to error code array cleanup\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x2800 (10240 decimal) - Offset to next page pointer in sprite page structure\n0x522 (1314 decimal) - Memory allocation ID for sprite page deallocation\n0x6fbf42a4 - Start address of error code array (4 DWORDs)\n0x6fbf42b4 - End address of error code array (exclusive upper bound)\n0x18 (24 decimal) - Offset to next node pointer in secondary linked list\n0xbec (3052 decimal) - Memory allocation ID for secondary structure deallocation\n0x08, 0x0C, 0x10, 0x14 - Context structure field offsets to zero\n\nError Handling:\nCalls ReportValidationError for each non-zero error code in tracking array\nDoes not propagate errors; always completes cleanup sequence\n\nGlobal Data Modified:\ng_pAutomapSpritePageList - Sprite page linked list head (zeroed)\ng_dwAutomapSpriteAllocCount - Total sprite allocation counter (zeroed)\nDAT_6fbf42a0 - Automap context structure pointer (zeroed after field cleanup)\nDAT_6fbf42a4 to DAT_6fbf42b0 - Error code tracking array (4 DWORDs, zeroed after reporting)\nDAT_6fbf429c - Secondary linked list head (zeroed)\n\nLinked List Structure:\nSprite Page Node:\n  Offset  Size  Field Name      Type   Description\n  ------  ----  --------------  -----  ------------------------------------\n  0x0000  10240 abSpriteData    byte[] Array of sprite entries (512 × 20 bytes)\n  0x2800  4     pNextPage       void*  Pointer to next page or NULL\n\nSecondary Node:\n  Offset  Size  Field Name      Type   Description\n  ------  ----  --------------  -----  ------------------------------------\n  0x0000  24    abNodeData      byte[] Node-specific data\n  0x0018  4     pNextNode       void*  Pointer to next node or NULL\n\nContext Structure at DAT_6fbf42a0:\n  Offset  Size  Field Name      Type   Description\n  ------  ----  --------------  -----  ------------------------------------\n  0x0000  8     abUnknown1      byte[] Unknown fields (not zeroed)\n  0x0008  4     dwField1        uint   Unknown field (zeroed on cleanup)\n  0x000C  4     dwField2        uint   Unknown field (zeroed on cleanup)\n  0x0010  4     dwField3        uint   Unknown field (zeroed on cleanup)\n  0x0014  4     dwField4        uint   Unknown field (zeroed on cleanup)",
      "tags": ["SRC_automap.cpp", "UI_AUTOMAP", "MOD_UI", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "TBL_automap", "PARAM_0", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
