      "instructions": ["0x29520|PUSH|0xff", "0x29525|PUSH|0x0", "0x29527|PUSH|0x0", "0x29529|CALL|0x6fb999cc", "0x2952E|MOV|[0x6fbf42ec], AL", "0x29533|PUSH|0x0", "0x29535|PUSH|0x0", "0x29537|PUSH|0xff", "0x2953C|CALL|0x6fb999cc", "0x29541|MOV|[0x6fbf42ed], AL", "0x29546|PUSH|0xff", "0x2954B|PUSH|0x0", "0x2954D|PUSH|0xff", "0x29552|CALL|0x6fb999cc", "0x29557|MOV|[0x6fbf42ee], AL"],
      "comment": "Initializes global automap marker color palette by converting RGB values to color indices\n\nAlgorithm:\n\n1. Initialize self-player marker with blue color (RGB 0x00, 0x00, 0xFF)\n2. Initialize other area marker with red color (RGB 0xFF, 0x00, 0x00)\n3. Initialize party member marker with magenta color (RGB 0xFF, 0x00, 0xFF)\n4. Initialize default player color with green (RGB 0x00, 0xFF, 0x00)\n5. Initialize monster marker with dark blue-gray (RGB 0x44, 0x70, 0x74)\n6. Initialize connection marker with dark brown (RGB 0x48, 0xA0, 0x34)\n7. Initialize hostile marker with white (RGB 0xF4, 0xF4, 0xF4)\n8. Initialize neutral marker with gray (RGB 0x80, 0x80, 0x80)\n9. Initialize object marker with yellow (RGB 0xF4, 0xF4, 0x00)\n10. Initialize waypoint marker with blue (RGB 0x00, 0x00, 0xFF)\n11. Initialize portal marker with green (RGB 0x00, 0xFF, 0x00)\n\nParameters:\n\nNone\n\nReturns:\n\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n\nThis function is called during rendering and game state initialization to establish\nthe color palette used for all automap markers throughout gameplay.\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n\nRGB Color Values (in order: Red, Green, Blue):\n0x00, 0x00, 0xFF - Blue (self player, waypoint)\n0xFF, 0x00, 0x00 - Red (other area)\n0xFF, 0x00, 0xFF - Magenta (party member)\n0x00, 0xFF, 0x00 - Green (default player, portal)\n0x44, 0x70, 0x74 - Dark blue-gray (monster)\n0x48, 0xA0, 0x34 - Dark brown (connection)\n0xF4, 0xF4, 0xF4 - White (hostile)\n0x80, 0x80, 0x80 - Gray (neutral)\n0xF4, 0xF4, 0x00 - Yellow (object)\n\nGlobal Variables Initialized:\n\ng_byAutomapMarkerSelfPlayer      - Color for current player marker\ng_byAutomapMarkerOtherArea       - Color for markers in other areas\ng_byAutomapMarkerPartyMember     - Color for party member markers\ng_byDefaultPlayerColor           - Default player color\ng_byAutomapMarkerMonster         - Color for monster markers\ng_byAutomapMarkerConnection      - Color for level connection markers\ng_byAutomapMarkerHostile         - Color for hostile entity markers\ng_byAutomapMarkerNeutral         - Color for neutral entity markers\ng_byAutomapMarkerObject          - Color for object markers\ng_byAutomapMarkerWaypoint        - Color for waypoint markers\ng_byAutomapMarkerPortal          - Color for portal markers",
      "tags": ["PARAM_0"]
