      "instructions": ["0x297C0|SUB|ESP, 0x48", "0x297C3|PUSH|EBX", "0x297C4|PUSH|ESI", "0x297C5|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x297C7|PUSH|EDI", "0x297C8|MOV|ECX, 0x12", "0x297CD|XOR|EAX, EAX", "0x297CF|LEA|EDI, [ESP + 0xc]", "0x297D3|STOSD.REP|ES:EDI", "0x297D5|CALL|0x6fb5e380", "0x297DA|MOV|EDI, dword ptr [ESI + 0x20]", "0x297DD|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESI + 0xc]", "0x297E0|MOV|EDX, dword ptr [ESI + 0x8]", "0x297E3|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x10], EAX", "0x297E7|XOR|EAX, EAX"],
      "comment": "Render tooltip text for a UI panel when cursor is within panel bounds.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Allocate and zero-initialize 18-element graphics parameter array on stack\n2. Call InitializeUIBuySellButtonPanel to ensure panel config loaded\n3. Set anGfxParams[2] = panel Y offset (word at +0x30) + panel base Y (+0x20)\n4. Set anGfxParams[3] = 0 (unused parameter)\n5. Call GfxInterfaceCall84 with params array and panel bounds from +0x8, +0xc\n6. Get current resource X coordinate via GetCurrentResourceID (returns packed coords)\n7. Get current resource Y coordinate via GetResourceFlags (returns packed coords)\n8. Bounds check: cursor X must be >= panel.nPosX (+0x8) AND <= panel.nPosX + panel.nWidth (+0x1c)\n9. Bounds check: cursor Y must be >= panel.nPosY - panel.nHeight (+0xc - +0x18) AND <= panel.nPosY\n10. If cursor within bounds:\n    a. Save current font and set font to ID 1\n    b. Look up string ID from g_awPanelStringIds using panel type index (+0x32)\n    c. Validate and get Unicode text pointer via ValidateStringId\n    d. Calculate text width via SumCharacterValues\n    e. Calculate centered X position: panel.nPosX + (panel.nWidth - textWidth) / 2\n    f. Calculate Y position: panel.nPosY - panel.nHeight - 5\n    g. Render text via RenderUnicodeTextWithLineHeight\n    h. Restore previous font\n\nParameters:\npPanel (PanelData *) - Pointer to panel data structure with layout fields:\n  +0x08: nPosX (int) - Panel X position\n  +0x0c: nPosY (int) - Panel Y position  \n  +0x18: nHeight (int) - Panel height\n  +0x1c: nWidth (int) - Panel width\n  +0x20: nBaseY (int) - Base Y offset\n  +0x30: wYOffset (ushort) - Additional Y offset\n  +0x32: nStringIndex (int) - Index into g_awPanelStringIds for tooltip text\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Tooltip only renders when cursor is within panel bounds\n- Text is horizontally centered within panel width\n- Text positioned 5 pixels above panel bottom edge\n- Uses font ID 1 for rendering, restores original font after",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_Skill", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
