      "comment": "Initializes the chat history ring buffer by calling the Unicode default constructor on each element.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load pointer to g_awszChatHistoryBuffer (0x6fbf4598) into ESI\n2. Set loop counter EDI to 0x808 (2056 iterations)\n3. Loop: Call Unicode::_default_constructor_closure_ with ECX = current element pointer\n4. Advance pointer by 2 bytes (sizeof wchar_t)\n5. Decrement counter, repeat until all elements initialized\n6. Return\n\nParameters:\nNone - this is a static initializer with no parameters.\nIMPLICIT: ESI used as buffer pointer, EDI used as loop counter.\n\nReturns:\nvoid - no return value. Buffer is initialized in place.\n\nMemory Layout:\nThe chat history buffer is organized as 8 slots of 257 Unicode characters each (514 bytes per slot).\nTotal size: 8 * 514 = 4112 bytes, iteration count 2056 * 2 = 4112 bytes (per-character init).\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset    Size    Description\n0x0000    514     Slot 0 - chat history entry (257 wchar_t)\n0x0202    514     Slot 1 - chat history entry\n0x0404    514     Slot 2 - chat history entry\n0x0606    514     Slot 3 - chat history entry\n0x0808    514     Slot 4 - chat history entry\n0x0A0A    514     Slot 5 - chat history entry\n0x0C0C    514     Slot 6 - chat history entry\n0x0E0E    514     Slot 7 - chat history entry\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x808 (2056) - Total Unicode elements to initialize\n0x2 - Size of each Unicode element (wchar_t)\n0x202 (514) - Bytes per chat history slot (257 * 2)\n\nCalled From:\nStatic initializer table at 0x6fbae018 (C++ runtime initialization)\n\nRelated Globals:\ng_awszChatHistoryBuffer (0x6fbf4598) - The buffer being initialized\ng_dwCounterC - Current slot index for chat history navigation\ng_abChatInputBuffer - Active chat input buffer",
