      "comment": "Process Battle.net whisper command and send message to target player\n\nAlgorithm:\n\n1. Calculate command keyword length using strlen-style loop (REPNE SCASB)\n2. Calculate command text buffer length\n3. Verify command text starts with command keyword (case-insensitive comparison)\n4. Check if command text exceeds keyword length (has arguments)\n5. Parse command arguments by tokenizing with space delimiter\n   - Token 1: Target player name\n   - Token 2: Message text\n   - Token 3+: Additional message words (concatenated to token 2)\n6. If exactly 2 tokens found, copy target name to abTargetNameBuffer\n7. If 3 or more tokens found, calculate message offset and copy to szMessageText\n8. If token count != 3, show usage error message \"<BattleNet>: Correct usage is: %s (name) (message)\"\n9. If nValidatePlayer flag set, iterate through player roster to validate target exists\n10. If target player found or validation disabled, build whisper packet and compress\n11. If target not found, show error \"%s %s %s\" with player name\n12. Call game interface method to transmit packet\n\nParameters:\n\npbCommandText - Pointer to command text buffer (e.g., \"/w PlayerName Hello\")\nlpszCommandKeyword - Command keyword to match (e.g., \"/whisper\", \"/w\")\nnValidatePlayer - Flag: 1 = validate target player exists in roster, 0 = skip validation\n\nReturns:\n\n1 - Command processed successfully (whisper sent or error displayed)\n0 - Command validation failed (command text doesn't start with keyword or insufficient length)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n\n- If command text ends with space (0x20) or null (0x00), enters whisper processing\n- Token parsing uses strtok-like function (FUN_6fb9ab79) with space delimiter (0x20)\n- Case-insensitive command matching uses tolower function (FUN_6fb9ac1d)\n- Validates player name against roster using GetRosterFieldAt0x66 comparison\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n\n0x20 - Space character delimiter for token parsing\n0x02 - Packet type identifier in byPacketId2 field\n0x03 - Packet subtype identifier in byPacketId3 field  \n0x04 - Packet header identifier in byPacketId1 field\n0x15 - Whisper packet opcode at abMessageBuffer[0]\n0xFF - Maximum message length for strncpy truncation (255 bytes)\n\nStructure Layout:\n\nWhisper Packet Format (abMessageBuffer):\nOffset  Size  Field Name         Type    Description\n------  ----  -----------------  ------  ------------------------------------\n0x00    1     byOpcode           byte    Packet opcode (0x15 = whisper)\n0x01    1     byPacketType       byte    Packet type (0x02)\n0x02    1     byLanguageId       byte    Language ID from g_dwLanguageId\n0x03    N     szTargetName       char[]  Null-terminated target player name\nN+3     M     szMessageText      char[]  Null-terminated message text",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_3", "STRUCT_Skill", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
