      "comment": "Toggles the automap party names visibility setting.\n\nInverts the current party names display state on the automap.\nIf party names are shown, hides them; if hidden, shows them.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call GetAutomapShowPartyNames() to get current display state\n2. Compute boolean NOT: if state != 0, new_state = 0; else new_state = 1\n3. Tail-call SetAutomapShowPartyNames(new_state) to apply the toggled value\n\nParameters:\n  None (void)\n\nReturns:\n  void - Return value from SetAutomapShowPartyNames is discarded\n\nBoolean Inversion Pattern (assembly):\n  NEG ECX      ; ECX = -EAX (CF set if EAX != 0)\n  SBB ECX,ECX  ; ECX = (CF ? -1 : 0)\n  INC ECX      ; ECX = (CF ? 0 : 1) = (EAX == 0 ? 1 : 0)\n\nRelated Functions:\n  GetAutomapShowPartyNames (0x6faf5a40) - Gets current setting\n  SetAutomapShowPartyNames (0x6faf5a50) - Sets new value",
