      "comment": "Registers or updates a keyboard key binding for a game action.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If pwErrorCode is non-NULL, initialize it to 0\n2. If nActionId > 0x38, return 0 (action ID out of range)\n3. Call IsKeyCodeValidForBinding with wKeyCode parameter\n4. If key code is invalid, set error code 0xF8B and return 0\n5. Switch on key code (values 0x100-0x104) for remote session checks:\n   - 0x100: Call IsRemoteSessionActive\n   - 0x101: Call IsRemoteSessionSupported  \n   - 0x102: Call IsValidRemoteDesktopSession, then IsRemoteSessionHandlingReady\n6. For remote session keys: if session not valid, check g_apRemoteSessionActionTable\n   - If action blocked for remote session, set error 0xF8A and return 0\n7. If key code is 0x2C (Print Screen), check g_apSpecialKeyActionTable\n   - If action blocked, set error 0xF8B and return 0\n8. Search g_aKeyBindingTable (114 entries, 10-byte stride) for matching key code\n9. If found, clear entry (set key code to 0xFFFF) and store search index\n10. Search table again for matching (nActionId, nSecondaryActionId) pair\n11. If matching action found, update entry with new key code and return 1\n12. If no duplicate key found (step 8), use empty slot index for new binding\n13. Store new key code at calculated slot and return 0\n\nParameters:\nnActionId - Primary action identifier (0x00-0x38 valid range)\nnSecondaryActionId - Secondary action parameter for compound actions\nwKeyCode - Key code to bind (passed as ushort value)\npwErrorCode - Output: error code (0xF89=remote session blocked, 0xF8A=remote action blocked, 0xF8B=invalid key)\n\nReturns:\n1 - Successfully updated existing action binding\n0 - Created new binding, or error occurred (check pwErrorCode)\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x38 (56) - Maximum valid action ID\n0x72 (114) - Number of entries in key binding table\n0x0A (10) - Byte stride of binding table entries\n0x100-0x104 - Special remote session key codes\n0x2C (44) - Print Screen key code\n0xFFFF - Cleared/invalid key code marker\n0xF89 (3977) - Error: Remote session blocks this key\n0xF8A (3978) - Error: Remote action not available\n0xF8B (3979) - Error: Invalid key code for binding",
      "tags": ["PARAM_4", "STRUCT_UnitAny"]
