      "instructions": ["0x2F1B0|PUSH|EBX", "0x2F1B1|PUSH|ESI", "0x2F1B2|PUSH|EDI", "0x2F1B3|MOV|EDI, dword ptr [ESP + 0x10]", "0x2F1B7|TEST|dword ptr [EDI + 0xc], 0x40000000", "0x2F1BE|JNZ|0x6faff2a3", "0x2F1C4|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [EDI + 0x8]", "0x2F1C7|XOR|EDX, EDX", "0x2F1C9|MOV|ECX, 0x6fbf5628", "0x2F1CE|XOR|EAX, EAX", "0x2F1D0|MOV|AX, word ptr [ECX + 0x4]", "0x2F1D4|CMP|EAX, ESI", "0x2F1D6|JNZ|0x6faff1fb", "0x2F1D8|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ECX]", "0x2F1DA|CMP|EAX, 0xffff"],
      "comment": "Processes keyboard key-down events and dispatches bound actions.\n\nSearches the key binding table for a matching key code and executes the\nassociated action handler if found and valid.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if key event has special processing flag (0x40000000) set - if so, exit\n2. Initialize search at start of g_KeyBindingTable\n3. Loop through binding entries (10 bytes each) until end of table (0x6fbf5a9c)\n4. For each entry, check if key code matches pKeyEvent[2]\n5. Validate command ID is not 0xFFFF (unbound) and within valid range (0x39-0xDF)\n6. Verify action handler exists in g_apSpecialKeyActionTable[commandId * 3]\n7. Calculate binding offset as nBindingIndex * 10\n8. If binding requires Alt key (0x73), check Alt state via GetKeyState(VK_MENU)\n9. If Alt pressed, skip this binding (return early)\n10. If g_nGameModeState == 2, validate action in g_adwKeyActionValidationTable\n11. Verify action function pointer with IsBadCodePtr\n12. If bad pointer, call assertion (Ordinal_10023) and terminate (FUN_6fb9a10f)\n13. Call the bound action handler function\n14. Set pKeyEvent[6] = 1 (processed flag) and pKeyEvent[7] = 0\n15. Call Ordinal_511 to finalize event processing\n\nParameters:\n  pKeyEvent - Pointer to key event structure:\n              [0x08] Key scan code (word at offset +8)\n              [0x0C] Event flags (dword at offset +12, bit 30 = special processing)\n              [0x18] Processed flag (set to 1 when handled)\n              [0x1C] Result code (set to 0 when handled)\n\nReturns:\n  void - Returns early if event cannot be processed or no binding found\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Alt+key combinations are blocked if binding flag is 0x73\n- Game mode state 2 requires action validation before execution\n- Invalid function pointers trigger assertion and program termination\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0x40000000 - Special processing flag in event flags\n  0xFFFF - Unbound key binding marker\n  0x39-0xDF - Valid command ID range (57-223)\n  0x73 - Alt key modifier flag ('s' ASCII)\n  0x12 - VK_MENU (Alt key virtual key code)\n  0x8000 - Key state pressed bit\n  0x7D0 - Line number 2000 for assertion\n  10 (0x0A) - Key binding entry stride in bytes\n  12 (0x0C) - Action validation table entry stride\n\nRelated Functions:\n- Ordinal_511 - D2Win event finalization\n- Ordinal_10023 - D2Common assertion/error handler\n- FUN_6fb9a10f - Program termination handler",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "SRC_CmdTbl.cpp", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
