      "comment": "Updates dialog quest state and processes events on time interval.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load current game tick count via GetTickCount\n2. Check if minimum time interval (80ms) has elapsed since last update\n3. If time not elapsed, return early\n4. Iterate through linked list of active dialogs starting at offset 0xb08\n5. For each dialog, invoke virtual callback method at vtable offset 0x14\n6. If callback returns 1, mark dialog as quest-triggered and exit:\n   - Set quest active flag at offset 0x18 to 1\n   - Clear quest state at offset 0x1c to 0\n   - Call Ordinal_511 to process state change\n7. Check for null dialog structure, trigger assertion if null\n8. Call FUN_6faff510 to compute new quest state value\n9. Compare new state to previous state at offset 0x44\n10. Update both state offsets 0x44 and 0x48 with new value\n11. If state changed and not error (-1), call FUN_6fb8d210 for UI update\n\nParameters:\npDialog (UnitAny *): Pointer to dialog/unit structure containing quest state fields\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\nNull dialog pointer triggers assertion and program termination. State value -1 is error code, suppresses UI update.",
