      "comment": "Vtable dispatch thunk for method at offset 0x34.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load inner object pointer from pThis+8 (contained vtable holder)\n2. Dereference to get vtable pointer\n3. Call method at vtable offset 0x34 with no parameters\n\nParameters:\n- pThis (ECX): Pointer to wrapper object containing vtable holder at offset +8\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Assumes pThis+8 contains valid pointer to object with vtable\n- Method at vtable[0x34] is called with no arguments\n- Part of UI control dispatch mechanism (slider/widget system)\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset  Size  Field           Type      Description\n0x00    4     pVtable         void**    Vtable pointer (in outer wrapper)\n0x08    4     pInnerObject    void*     Pointer to inner object with its own vtable\n\nVtable Method Offsets:\n0x34 - Method called by this thunk (no params)",
