      "comment": "Initializes automap rendering and UI resources for game display.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if automap resource 0x15 is already allocated via FUN_6fb5d340(0x15)\n2. If not allocated (returns 0), initialize resource 0x15 with FUN_6fb5d370(0x15, 0, 0)\n3. Set global flag g_dwAutomapInitialized = 1\n4. Check current game state with Ordinal_10005() (returns 2 for normal game)\n5. If state is 2 (normal game):\n   a. Initialize GameStateManager automap data with Ordinal_10072(anStructArray, ...) - 7 sprite definitions (offsets 0x0, 0x100, 0x42, 0x142, 0x217, 0x30c)\n   b. Initialize viewport/cursor data from FUN_6fb5e380()\n   c. Determine panel variant based on g_dwPanelVariantFlag (returns 0x2ad if true, 0x20d if false)\n   d. Initialize WorldState data with 8 ground tile layers (0x49 base, 0x14 byte stride)\n   e. Initialize PlayerInventory structures with 15 item slot definitions using Ordinal_10072 and Ordinal_10057\n6. If state is not 2: Call InitializeAutomapFallback functions (FUN_6fb046a0, FUN_6fb05e50, FUN_6fb047f0, FUN_6fb04850, FUN_6fb05550)\n7. Return void\n\nParameters:\nNone (uses global state: g_pGameStateManager, g_pWorldState, g_pPlayerInventory, g_dwPanelVariantFlag, g_dwAutomapInitialized)\n\nReturns:\nVoid - Initializes in-place\n\nStructure Layout:\nanStructArray[18] - D2Common rendering context structure used across multiple calls:\nOffset  Size  Field Name      Type    Description\n0x0     4     dwType          int     Object type ID\n0x4     4     pHandle         int*    Game object handle/pointer\n0x8     4     dwMode          int     Rendering mode/flags\n0xc     4     reserved1       int     Reserved field\n0x10    4     dwPriority      int     Draw priority (typically 5)\n0x14    4     reserved2       int     Reserved field\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FUN_6fb5d340() - Check resource allocation status\n- FUN_6fb5d370() - Allocate/initialize resource\n- FUN_6fb5e380() - Get viewport coordinate data\n- Ordinal_10072() - D2Common sprite/layer setup equivalent\n- Ordinal_10057() - D2Common palette setup equivalent\n- Ordinal_10005() - GetGameState (returns 2 for active game)\n- FUN_6fb04bd0() - Post-initialization UI finalization\n\nNote: Function uses 3 stack-allocated temporary variables (nLoopCount, nYOffset, pointer temporaries) optimized away by decompiler",
