      "comment": "Validates game entity property states and capabilities based on entity type.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if global game state is initialized (GetGlobalSystemState)\n2. Retrieve game context and entity reference (FUN_6fb62880)\n3. Look up entity in search context using search criteria type 7\n4. Check entity skill/spell properties (Ordinal_10707 - check 0x10, 0x100)\n5. Verify entity is not corrupted/poisoned (Ordinal_10880)\n6. Check equipped item types (Ordinal_10731 - offsets 0x4c, 0x50, 0x51)\n7. Check for special skill flags (Ordinal_10731 - offsets 0x03, 0x25)\n8. Fetch entity property data pointer (FUN_6fb60e10)\n9. Get entity unique identifier (FindLinkedListNodeValue)\n10. Based on entity ID, check corresponding property flags (0x167, 0x10f, 0x152, 0x230, 0x231)\n11. For valid property combinations, apply entity transformation (Ordinal_10756)\n12. If nFlags parameter is set, log validation result via FUN_6fb89190\n\nParameters:\nnFlags - Non-zero to log validation results, zero to perform silent validation\n\nReturns:\n0 - Entity properties invalid or validation failed\n1 - Entity successfully validated and transformed\n\nSpecial Cases:\nEntity ID 0x167: Check skill flag 0x02, then flag 0x1e, conditionally apply Ordinal_10765\nEntity ID 0x10f: Check property flag 0x1b\nEntity ID 0x152: Check property flag 0x21, fallback to flag 0x22 if not found\nEntity ID 0x230: Check property flag 0x1c before Ordinal_10765\nEntity ID 0x231: Always check property flag 0x1e\nReturn value 0x55 (85) - Silent validation\nReturn value 0x53 (83) - Property transformation applied\nReturn value 0x54 (84) - Validation failed, log if nFlags set\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x3ed (1005) - Magic constant for ordinal calls, likely version/compatibility check\n0x6fbb3608 - String path reference (C:\\Projects\\Diablo2\\Source\\D2Cli)\n0x167 (359 decimal) - Entity class identifier, Rogue variant\n0x10f (271 decimal) - Entity property index, skill level\n0x152 (338 decimal) - 