      "comment": "Opens the hireling hiring dialog window, allowing player to select mercenary units.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize inventory state flag to 0 (g_dwInventoryState)\n2. Call UI initialization routine with parameter 0x23 (likely UI mode for hireling dialog)\n3. Create local variable to receive dialog result\n4. Call D2Win ordinal 423 (OpenPopupDialog) with:\n   - lpszTitle: Diablo II window title (g_szDiabloII)\n   - lpszContent: \"PopupHireling\" dialog resource string\n   - nUnknown: 0 (reserved parameter)\n   - pnResult: Pointer to local result variable\n5. Check result code - if nResult == 0, dialog was successfully opened/confirmed\n6. If successful (nResult == 0), set flag at 0x6fbf6804 to 1 indicating hireling dialog was processed\n\nParameters:\n(none) - Function takes no parameters, uses global variables for state\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value. Side effects: Sets g_dwInventoryState to 0, may set 0x6fbf6804 to 1\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If Ordinal_423 returns non-zero in nResult, the dialog operation failed or was canceled (flag not set)\n- The flag at 0x6fbf6804 serves as completion marker for hireling dialog processing",
