      "comment": "Renders the popup OK dialog used for informational messages in the main menu.\n\nClassification: Callback - Called by ProcessMessagePumpWithCallback during menu message loops.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call SendPeriodicMetricsPacket to send telemetry\n2. Call Ordinal_10026 (D2GFX.GetGfxState) - if non-zero, skip rendering\n3. Call RenderScene with g_InvalidTooltipMarker and zeros (render base scene)\n4. If RenderScene succeeds (non-zero return):\n   a. Call GfxInterface_CallMethod0xC4 and ProcessPaletteCleanup\n   b. Zero-initialize 72-byte graphics parameter buffer (18 dwords)\n   c. Set buffer[1] = g_nPopupBackgroundDcHandle, buffer[2..3] = 0\n   d. Draw left popup background at (UIXOffset+0xBC, 0x148-UIYOffset)\n   e. Set buffer[2] = 1 (flip horizontal), redraw at (UIXOffset+0x1BC, y)\n   f. Set font to index 1, save previous font\n   g. Get string 0x1430 (dialog title), draw centered at (screenWidth/2 - 0x84, 0xBE - UIYOffset)\n   h. Check if expansion MPQ exists:\n      - If expansion: get string 0x5578\n      - If classic: get string 0x1431\n   i. Draw version string centered at (screenWidth/2 - 0x84, 0xCD - UIYOffset)\n   j. Restore previous font\n   k. Zero graphics buffer again for OK button\n   l. Set buffer[1] = g_nOkButtonDcHandle, buffer[2] = g_nOkButtonFrameIndex\n   m. Draw OK button at (UIXOffset+0x110, 0x13E-UIYOffset)\n   n. Set font 1, get string 0x13EE (OK text), draw at button center\n   o. Restore font, call ProcessScreenResourceDrawing and GfxInitializeInterface\n5. Call ProcessGameFrameUpdate\n6. Return true if g_fPopupDialogResult is non-zero (dialog confirmed)\n\nParameters:\n  None - This is a callback with no explicit parameters.\n\nReturns:\n  bool - true if user confirmed dialog (g_fPopupDialogResult != 0), false otherwise\n\nString IDs:\n  0x1430 - Dialog title text\n  0x1431 - Classic version subtitle  \n  0x5578 - Expansion version subtitle\n  0x13EE - OK button label\n\nGlobals Used:\n  g_dwUIXOffset (0x6fbfd7fc) - UI horizontal offset for centering\n  g_dwUIYOffset (0x6fbfd800) - UI vertical offset for centering\n  g_dwScreenWidth (0x6fbae0e4) - Screen width for centering calculations\n  g_nPopupBackgroundDcHandle (0x6fbf680c) - DC handle for popup background texture\n  g_nOkButtonDcHandle (0x6fbf6810) - DC handle for OK button texture\n  g_nOkButtonFrameIndex (0x6fbf681c) - Current animation frame for OK button\n  g_fPopupDialogResult (0x6fbf6824) - Dialog result flag, set by button handler\n\nCallers:\n  ProcessMessagePumpWithCallback from FUN_6fb088b0 and FUN_6fb08990 (popup display routines)\n\nOrdinal Calls:\n  Ordinal_10026 (D2GFX.GetGfxState) - Returns current graphics state, non-zero skips render\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0xBC (188) - Left panel X offset from UI origin\n  0x1BC (444) - Right panel X offset (mirrored)\n  0x148 (328) - Dialog Y position base\n  0xBE (190) - Title Y position\n  0xCD (205) - Subtitle Y position\n  0x110 (272) - OK button X offset\n  0x13E (318) - OK button Y position\n  0x136 (310) - OK text Y position\n  0x170 (368) - OK text right boundary\n  0x1C4 (452) - Text box right boundary\n  0x84 (132) - Half text box width for centering",
