      "comment": "Clears the popup dialog result flag to zero.\n\nThis is a simple initialization/reset function that sets g_fPopupDialogResult to 0,\nindicating no dialog result is pending. Called to reset dialog state before displaying\na new popup or after processing a dialog result.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set g_fPopupDialogResult global to 0\n\nParameters:\n  None (hidden 4-byte parameter per RET 0x4 - likely callback signature padding)\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nRelated Functions:\n  - DisplayPopupOkDialog: Sets result to 1 on display\n  - DisplayPopupOkDialogAlt: Sets result to 1 on display  \n  - RenderPopupOkDialog: Reads result for rendering state\n  - HandleOkButtonRelease: Sets result on button click\n  - ConfirmAndDismissPopupDialog: Sets result on confirmation\n\nGlobal Variables:\n  g_fPopupDialogResult (0x6fbf6824): Bool flag indicating popup dialog result state\n    0 = No result / cleared\n    1 = Dialog confirmed/acknowledged",
