      "comment": "Renders the OK/Cancel popup dialog for video playback confirmation prompts.\n\nClassification: Callback - Invoked by message pump during popup dialog display.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Send periodic metrics packet for network monitoring\n2. Call Ordinal_10026 to check game state (D2Win function)\n3. If game state invalid (EAX == 0):\n   a. Call RenderScene with invalid tooltip marker to clear scene\n   b. If RenderScene returns success (EAX != 0):\n      - Call GfxInterface_CallMethod0xC4 and ProcessPaletteCleanup\n      - Zero-initialize 18-element draw parameter array (72 bytes)\n      - Draw left popup background panel at (UIXOffset+0xBC, 0x148-UIYOffset)\n      - Draw right popup background panel at (UIXOffset+0x1BC, 0x148-UIYOffset)\n      - Set font to style 1, draw title text (string 0x1430) centered\n      - Draw subtitle text: 0x1432 (normal) or 0x5578 (if video playing)\n      - Restore font, re-initialize draw params for buttons\n      - Draw OK button at (UIXOffset+0xCE, 0x13E-UIYOffset)\n      - Draw Cancel button at (UIXOffset+0x152, 0x13E-UIYOffset)\n      - Draw button labels: \"OK\" (0x13EE) and \"CANCEL\" (0x13EF)\n      - Call ProcessScreenResourceDrawing and GfxInitializeInterface\n4. Call ProcessGameFrameUpdate to advance game logic\n5. Return 1 if OK or Cancel confirmed, 0 to continue loop\n\nParameters:\n  None - Called as render callback from message pump.\n\nReturns:\n  int - 0: Continue dialog loop, 1: User clicked OK or Cancel (exit loop)\n\nGlobals Used:\n  g_dwUIXOffset (0x6fbfd7fc) - UI horizontal offset for centering\n  g_dwUIYOffset (0x6fbfd800) - UI vertical offset for centering\n  g_dwScreenWidth (0x6fbae0e4) - Screen width for text centering\n  g_nPopupBackgroundDcHandleAlt (0x6fbf6814) - DC handle for popup background\n  g_nOkButtonDcHandle (0x6fbf6810) - DC handle for OK button texture\n  g_nOkButtonFrameIndex (0x6fbf681c) - Current OK button animation frame\n  g_nCancelButtonFrameIndex (0x6fbf6820) - Current Cancel button animation frame\n  g_dwCurrentVideoId (0x6fbf6808) - Current video ID (affects subtitle text)\n  g_fOkConfirmedFlag (0x6fbf6828) - Set when OK button clicked\n  g_fCancelConfirmedFlag (0x6fbf682c) - Set when Cancel button clicked\n  g_InvalidTooltipMarker (0x1) - Marker to clear scene\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x148 (328) - Base Y position for popup panels\n  0x13E (318) - Base Y position for buttons\n  0x136 (310) - Base Y position for button labels\n  0xBC (188) - X offset for left popup panel\n  0x1BC (444) - X offset for right popup panel\n  0xCE (206) - X offset for OK button\n  0x152 (338) - X offset for Cancel button\n  0x12E (302) - Right edge for OK button label\n  0x1B2 (434) - Right edge for Cancel button label\n  0x1C4 (452) - Right edge for title/subtitle text\n  0x84 (132) - Half-width offset for text centering\n  0xBE (190) - Y position for title text\n  0xCD (205) - Y position for subtitle text\n  5 - Draw mode parameter for GfxInterfaceCall84\n  0xFFFFFFFF (-1) - Color parameter (default/inherit)\n\nString IDs:\n  0x1430 - Dialog title text\n  0x1432 - Normal subtitle text\n  0x5578 - Video-specific subtitle text\n  0x13EE - \"OK\" button label\n  0x13EF - \"CANCEL\" button label\n\nDraw Parameter Array Layout (72 bytes, 18 DWORDs):\n  Offset 0x00 (index 0): Reserved/flags\n  Offset 0x04 (index 1): DC handle for texture\n  Offset 0x08 (index 2): Animation frame index\n  Offset 0x0C (index 3): Additional flags (always 0)\n  Remaining: Additional draw parameters",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_Skill", "STRUCT_ItemData", "PARAM_0", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control"]
