      "api_calls": ["InitializeCleanupTimer", "ComparePaletteBuffers", "GetInitFlag", "GetInitFlag"],
      "instructions": ["0x390F0|PUSH|ESI", "0x390F1|XOR|ESI, ESI", "0x390F3|PUSH|EDI", "0x390F4|XOR|ECX, ECX", "0x390F6|MOV|EDI, 0x1", "0x390FB|MOV|dword ptr [0x6fbf682c], ESI", "0x39101|MOV|dword ptr [0x6fbf6828], ESI", "0x39107|CALL|0x6fb999d2", "0x3910C|XOR|EDX, EDX", "0x3910E|MOV|ECX, 0x6fbb36c0", "0x39113|CALL|0x6fad1000", "0x39118|XOR|EDX, EDX", "0x3911A|MOV|ECX, 0x6fbb36c0", "0x3911F|MOV|[0x6fbf680c], EAX", "0x39124|CALL|0x6fad1000"],
      "comment": "Display popup OK/Cancel dialog and wait for user confirmation.\n\nThis function displays a modal OK/Cancel dialog used during video playback\nfor user confirmation prompts. It initializes dialog resources, runs the\nmessage pump until user responds, then cleans up and returns the result.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize confirmation flags (cancel=0, ok=0)\n2. Initialize cleanup timer with false parameter\n3. Load background DC from popup OK background path (3 times for variants)\n4. Compare palette buffers for consistency\n5. Set active pointer index to 2 (dialog cursor)\n6. Get init flag and process message entry array with 4 entries\n7. Run message pump with RenderPopupOkCancelDialog callback\n8. Capture cancel flag state (bVar1 = cancel == 0 means OK pressed)\n9. Process message array cleanup with 4 entries\n10. Reset active pointer index to 0\n11. Release background DC handles if allocated (3 handles)\n12. Reload palettes\n13. Return true if OK pressed, false if Cancel pressed\n\nParameters:\nNone - Uses global state for dialog configuration\n\nReturns:\nbool - true if OK was pressed (cancel flag == 0), false if Cancel pressed\n\nSpecial Cases:\nCalled from PlayVideoById as callback for CD switching confirmation\nAll DC handles are validated before cleanup (non-zero check)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x2 - Dialog cursor pointer index for SetActivePointerIndex\n0x4 - Number of message entries in dialog message array\n0x0 - Default cursor pointer index\n\nGlobals Accessed:\ng_fCancelConfirmedFlag (0x6fbf682c) - Set when Cancel button clicked\ng_fOkConfirmedFlag (0x6fbf6828) - Set when OK button clicked\ng_nPopupBackgroundDcHandle (0x6fbf680c) - Primary background DC\ng_nPopupBackgroundDcHandleAlt (0x6fbf6814) - Alternate background DC\ng_nOkButtonDcHandle (0x6fbf6810) - OK button DC handle\ng_szPopupOkBackgroundPath - Path to popup background image\ng_aMessageEntryOkCancelDialog (0x6fbb3670) - Message entry array for dialog",
      "tags": ["PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_0", "UI_MENU"]
    },
