      "comment": "Confirms OK dialog action and inserts cache node for processing.\n\nClassification: Callback/Handler - Called via function pointer for OK dialog confirmation\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set g_fOkConfirmedFlag = 1 to mark OK as confirmed\n2. Clear g_fOkButtonPressed = 0 to reset button state\n3. Call ClearTargetingState() to reset targeting system globals\n4. Set cache node field at +0x18 to 1 (confirmed flag)\n5. Set cache node field at +0x1c to 0 (clear pending state)\n6. Call InsertCacheNodeWithCookie() to queue node for processing\n\nParameters:\ndwCacheNodePtr (uint) - Pointer to cache node structure with dialog state\n  +0x18: Confirmation status flag (set to 1)\n  +0x1c: Pending state flag (cleared to 0)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- No direct callers found; likely invoked via function pointer table\n- Related to OK/Cancel popup dialog system (see DisplayPopupOkCancelDialog)\n- Resets targeting state as side effect of dialog confirmation\n\nGlobals Modified:\n- g_fOkConfirmedFlag (0x6fbf6828): Set to 1\n- g_fOkButtonPressed (0x6fbf6818): Cleared to 0",
