      "comment": "Initializes inventory panel UI elements for the player inventory interface.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FUN_6fb5a050 to load UI panel for armor inventory slot\n2. Call FUN_6fb5a050 to load UI panel for belt inventory slot\n3. Call FUN_6fb5a050 to load UI panel for boots inventory slot\n4. Call FUN_6fb5a050 to load UI panel for helmet and glove inventory slots\n5. Call FUN_6fb5a050 to load UI panel for ring and amulet inventory slots\n6. Call FUN_6fb5a050 to load UI panel for weapons inventory slot\n7. Call FUN_6fb5a050 to load UI panel for trade button\n8. Call FUN_6fb5a050 to load UI panel for gold coin button\n9. Call Ordinal_10227 (Storm.dll GetMultiplayerMode) to check if multiplayer enabled\n10. If not multiplayer (returns 0), skip character/NPC inventory initialization and return\n11. Call GetGlobalSystemState to check if global system is ready\n12. If system not ready (returns 0), skip character/NPC inventory initialization and return\n13. Call FUN_6fb5a050 to load UI panel for character 6-tab (character inventory)\n14. Store character panel handle in g_pPanelCharInv\n15. Zero out g_dwPanelNpcMode flag\n16. Call FUN_6fb5a050 to load UI panel for NPC inventory\n17. Store NPC inventory panel handle in g_pPanelNpcInv\n18. On early exit (non-multiplayer or system not ready), zero all three panel handles\n\nParameters:\n  void\n\nReturns:\n  void - Function always succeeds; panel initialization state stored in global variables\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - In single-player mode (Ordinal_10227 returns 0), character and NPC inventory panels are not initialized\n  - If GetGlobalSystemState returns 0 (system not ready), character and NPC inventory panels are not initialized\n  - All other panels (armor, belt, boots, helm, glove, ring, amulet, weapons, trade, gold) are always initialized\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0x6fbb3ce4: Armor panel resource identifier\n  0x6fbb3cd4: Belt panel resource identifier\n  0x6fbb3cc4: Boots panel resource identifier\n  0x6fbb3cac: Helmet/glove panel resource identifier\n  0x6fbb3c94: Ring/amulet panel resource identifier\n  0x6fbb3c80: Weapons panel resource identifier\n  0x6fbb3c70: Trade button panel resource identifier\n  0x6fbb3c5c: Gold coin button panel resource identifier\n  0x6fbb3c48: Character 6-tab panel resource identifier\n  0x6fbb3c38: NPC inventory panel resource identifier\n\nGlobal Variables Used:\n  g_pPanelArmorInv (0x6fbf8ce8), g_pPanelBeltInv (0x6fbf8cec), g_pPanelBootsInv (0x6fbf8cf0)\n  g_pPanelHelmGloveInv (0x6fbf8cf4), g_pPanelRingAmuletInv (0x6fbf8cf8), g_pPanelWeaponsInv (0x6fbf8cfc)\n  g_pPanelTradeBtn (0x6fbf8d00), g_pPanelGoldCoinBtn (0x6fbf8ab4), g_pPanelCharInv (0x6fbf8d04)\n  g_dwPanelNpcMode (0x6fbf8ccc), g_pPanelNpcInv (0x6fbf8d08)",
