      "comment": "Validate and clear all pending validation error flags.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check DAT_6fbf8a94 (master validation error flag) - if set, report error and clear\n2. Check DAT_6fbf8ce8 through DAT_6fbf8d00 (8 validation flags) - if set, report and clear\n3. Check DAT_6fbf8ab4 (additional validation flag) - if set, report and clear\n4. Call Ordinal_10227() to get frame status\n5. If frame status non-zero, call GetGlobalSystemState()\n6. If global state non-zero AND DAT_6fbf8d04 is set, report and clear\n7. Check DAT_6fbf8d08 and DAT_6fbf8d0c final validation flags - report and clear if set\n8. Clear all tracked validation flags (DAT_6fbf8ce8-DAT_6fbf8ab4) to reset state\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Function always succeeds, clearing flags on each call\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Frame status check (Ordinal_10227) acts as gate for conditional validation\n- Global state must be non-zero to trigger additional validation\n- Final step clears all tracked flags regardless of prior checks",
