      "comment": "Renders UI elements for different game states and updates display mode.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get current mouse position via FUN_6fb8f680/FUN_6fb8f690\n2. Check g_dwObjectDataAvailable state (0=offline, 1-9=town, 10=not ready, 11-17=screens)\n3. For states 1-9: Initialize panel array, render UI panels at 4 positions using Ordinal_10072\n4. Process player movement visuals via RenderAreaViewportForDisplayMode\n5. Switch on game state:\n   - 0x0c-0x0d: Equipment screen - render item slots\n   - 0x0e: Inventory - render inventory grid\n   - 0x0f-0x10: Guild Vault - render vault\n   - 0x11: Trophy Case - render case\n   - 0x0b: Special mode with sprite rendering\n6. Loop through 11 item slots, check occupation, render sprites\n7. Handle item highlighting and colors based on state\n8. Render minimap elements at screen corners\n9. Clean up rendering state, return\n\nParameters:\nNone (void function)\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If g_dwObjectDataAvailable==0x0a returns early\n- Complex multi-branch state machine with 6 rendering paths",
