      "comment": "Renders animated sprite sequence for player character at specified screen coordinates.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate unit has animator data via Ordinal_10707\n2. Retrieve animation sequence index via Ordinal_10277\n3. Fetch animation direction/rotation via Ordinal_10749\n4. Query frame count via Ordinal_10816\n5. Calculate base animation frame table offset\n6. For each frame: get dimensions, fetch geometry, calculate screen coords, initialize buffer, render sprite\n7. If linked sequence exists, render linked sprites via Ordinal_10305/Ordinal_10304\n8. Increment frame index and advance frame pointer\n\nParameters:\n- pUnit (UnitAny*): Unit structure with animator and stat data\n- pAnimData (AnimData*): Animation definition with scale factors at 0x14/0x15\n- nScreenX (int): Base X coordinate on screen before frame offset applied\n- nScreenY (int): Base Y coordinate on screen before frame offset applied\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)",
