      "comment": "Calculate final stat value with item and skill bonuses applied\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize Unicode string buffer (10 Unicode characters)\n2. Check if stat has property flags 0x10 OR 0x1f set (eligibility check)\n3. Query selected unit stat value and entity type\n4. Calculate item stat bonus if entity has skill level for stat 0x65 and unit has property 0x33\n5. Apply percentage modifier (increase base by (bonus * base / 100))\n6. Query unit's primary modifier stat (offset 0xc) and secondary modifier stat (offset 0xd6)\n7. If secondary modifier value > 0, fetch stat property descriptor for shift count\n8. Apply secondary bonus with bit shift: (secondary_modifier * primary_modifier >> shift_count)\n9. Query tertiary modifier stat (offset 0xd7)\n10. If tertiary modifier > 0, fetch stat descriptor and calculate scaled tertiary bonus\n11. Apply tertiary bonus: (percentage_skill_level * (tertiary * primary >> shift) / 100)\n12. Format final stat value as string (buffer 10 chars, format template)\n13. Convert ANSI formatted string to Unicode\n14. If any bonus applied, call highlighter function with color code 3\n15. Append formatted stat to display string twice\n\nParameters:\nnBaseStatId (dword) - Stat property ID to calculate\nIMPLICIT EDI - Destination string buffer (char *)\nIMPLICIT ESI - Source string reference (char *)\nIMPLICIT ECX - Unicode output buffer pointer\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Updates destination string in-place\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If secondary/tertiary modifier stat descriptor not found, fatal error (assertions 0xb8d, 0xb97)\n- Stat eligibility check requires BOTH flags: property 0x10 must be clear OR 0x1f must be clear\n- Percentage modifiers use magic constant 0x51eb851f (division optimization)\n- Bit shifts in descriptors [offset+0x1e] must be masked with 0x1f (5-bit shift count)\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x10 - Stat property flag (required for calculation)\n0x1f - Stat property flag (alternate eligibility)\n0x65 - Skill stat ID\n0x33 - Property flag (skill application check)\n0xc - Primary modifier offset in stat descriptor\n0xd6 - Secondary modifier stat ID\n0xd7 - Tertiary modifier stat ID\n0xb8d, 0xb97 - Assertion line numbers (error handling)\n0x1e - Shift count field offset in descriptor\n0x51eb851f - Magic constant for optimized division by 100\n0x5 - Bit mask for shift count (0x1f & value)\n3 - Highlight color code (orange/buff indication)",
      "tags": ["UI_INVENTORY", "PROP_LARGE", "MOD_UI", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "SRC_inv.cpp", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_Other", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
