      "instructions": ["0x41CA0|SUB|ESP, 0x218", "0x41CA6|PUSH|EBP", "0x41CA7|PUSH|ESI", "0x41CA8|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x41CAA|PUSH|EDI", "0x41CAB|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x10], EDX", "0x41CAF|MOV|ECX, 0xf9b", "0x41CB4|CALL|0x6fb9981c", "0x41CB9|MOV|ECX, 0xf9e", "0x41CBE|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x18], EAX", "0x41CC2|CALL|0x6fb9981c", "0x41CC7|MOV|ECX, 0xf9c", "0x41CCC|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x1c], EAX", "0x41CD0|CALL|0x6fb9981c", "0x41CD5|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x20], EAX"],
      "comment": "Render character status panel with inventory/spell slots and status text.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize three UI panel constants (call Ordinal_10004 thrice) - Ordinal_10004 = UIConstantInit\n2. Get viewport scroll mode, check character level bounds (0x9-0x1C)\n3. Check for special character properties (flags 0x5C, 0x5D, 0x5E) - sets fHasSpellOrMercenary\n4. Validate level range: if level in (0x9, 0x1C), optionally set properties (0x23, 0x1B)\n5. Iterate through status panel data table g_pdwStatusPanelDataTable, scanning array with 6-byte strides until 0x6fbb3780\n6. For each table entry, call Ordinal_10731 to check if data available - Ordinal_10731 = GetPropertyState\n7. If found (iVar4 != 0): calculate offset, load strings via strcpy/strcat into output buffer\n8. If none found: initialize 512-element Unicode array (256 ushort elements), set to null via default_constructor_closure\n9. Finalize string with strcpy, add spell/mercenary suffix if fHasSpellOrMercenary set\n10. Call FUN_6fb5a3a0 with parameter 0x3 if special properties set\n\nParameters:\ndwCharIndex (dword) - Character index to render status for (passed in ECX, __fastcall)\n\nIMPLICIT (Architectural - __d2call register parameters):\nunaff_EDI (char *) - Output buffer pointer (preserved)\nunaff_EBX (char *) - String formatting buffer (preserved)\nunaff_ESI (char *) - Additional string buffer (preserved)\nthis (Unicode *) - Unicode string object context (preserved)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value, updates UI buffers via implicit register params\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Panel data lookup failure: entire array zero-initialized and rendered\n- Non-contiguous level check: range validation skips 0x0-0x8 and 0x1D+ \n- Array traversal uses implicit 6-byte stride (two uint entries + gap)\n- 4 stack-allocated temporaries optimized away (local_204, local_208, local_20c, local_210)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x5C, 0x5D, 0x5E - Character property flag constants (spell/mercenary/quest indicators)\n0x23, 0x1B - Property query codes - Ordinal_10731 argument\n0x9, 0x1C - Level range bounds (valid: 9-27)\n0x100 - Unicode buffer element count (256 * 2 bytes = 512 byte array)\n0x6 - Table stride (two uint32 entries)\n0x6fbb372c - g_pdwStatusPanelDataTable array start\n0x6fbb3780 - g_pdwStatusPanelDataTable array end (array size = 84 bytes, 14 entries)\n\nOrdinals Referenced:\nOrdinal_10004 - /* UIConstantInit - Initialize UI constants/tables */\nOrdinal_10522 - /* GetCharacterProperty - Query character flags */\nOrdinal_10731 - /* GetPropertyState - Check property availability */\nOrdinal_10878 - /* QueryStatus - Get character status/level info */",
