      "instructions": ["0x42E70|PUSH|ECX", "0x42E71|PUSH|EBX", "0x42E72|PUSH|EBP", "0x42E73|PUSH|ESI", "0x42E74|MOV|EBP, EDX", "0x42E76|PUSH|EDI", "0x42E77|MOV|EBX, ECX", "0x42E79|PUSH|EBP", "0x42E7A|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x14], 0x0", "0x42E82|CALL|0x6fb987c4", "0x42E87|MOV|ESI, EAX", "0x42E89|CALL|0x6fb8f780", "0x42E8E|CMP|EAX, 0x6", "0x42E91|JNZ|0x6fb12f3e", "0x42E97|CALL|0x6fb8f100"],
      "comment": "Processes multiplayer game state interactions for units based on game mode and interaction type.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize result (dwResult) to 0\n2. Get interaction target pointer (Ordinal_10262)\n3. Check game state (FUN_6fb8f780): branch on mode 6, mode 8, or other\n4. Mode 6 (Town/Portal):\n   a. Get game owner (FUN_6fb8f100)\n   b. Get interaction target (Ordinal_10257)\n   c. Validate target and state (FUN_6fb6e180 == 0)\n   d. Check port value != 0 and != 1\n   e. Rate-limit check: elapsed time >= 0x191 (401ms)\n   f. Send packet 0x27, update target, return 1\n5. Mode 8 (Act-specific):\n   a. Get interaction target (Ordinal_10257)\n   b. Validate target and state check\n   c. Check port and rate-limit same as mode 6\n   d. Log packet 0x4c, update target, return 1\n6. Other modes (switch on Ordinal_10299 result):\n   a. Case 0: Validate interaction, call FUN_6fb88d60 with 0x13 or 0x12\n   b. Case 1: Send packet 0x1a, animate, call FUN_6fb8d210, set flag, return 1\n   c. Case 3: Check object type, log packet 0x1c if valid, set flag, return 1\n   d. Case 5: Send packet 0x1d, animate, set dwResult=1\n\nParameters:\nnPlayerUnit (int, ECX): Game object handle for player unit\ndwType (dword, EDX): Interaction type identifier\ndwSubType (dword, [ESP+0x4]): Sub-type or attribute parameter\n\nReturns:\n1 if interaction processed successfully\n0 if interaction blocked, invalid, or rate-limited\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Port value 0 or 1 skips rate-limit check (special states)\n- Rate-limit threshold 0x191 (401ms) applies per-mode\n- Some modes have conditional returns based on FUN_6fb59f40 checks\n- Mode-dependent packet opcodes: 0x27, 0x4c, 0x1a, 0x1c, 0x1d\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x6 - Game state: Town/Portal mode\n0x8 - Game state: Act-specific mode\n0x191 - Rate-limit threshold in milliseconds (401ms)\n0x27 - Packet opcode for mode 6 interaction\n0x4c - Packet opcode for mode 8 interaction  \n0x1a - Packet opcode for case 1 (movement-related)\n0x1c - Packet opcode for case 3 (event logging)\n0x1d - Packet opcode for case 5 (animation)\n0x13, 0x12 - FUN_6fb88d60 action codes (success/failure indicators)",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_3", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
    },
