      "comment": "Convert viewport/screen coordinates to map tile coordinates\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pUnit is not NULL; if NULL, log assertion and terminate\n2. Calculate base tile X: (nViewX - viewport[4]) / viewport[0x14]\n3. Calculate base tile Y: (nViewY - viewport[0xc]) / viewport[0x15]\n4. Query unit viewport offset via Ordinal_10749 (D2Common call)\n5. Get active viewport dimensions via FUN_6fb95a30\n6. If viewport X is even (& 0x80000001), recalculate X using offset\n7. If unit viewport X matches viewport width, set X = viewport[0] >> 1\n8. If viewport Y is even (& 0x80000001), recalculate Y using offset\n9. If unit viewport Y matches viewport height, set Y = viewport[1] >> 1\n10. Write results to pOutX and pOutY\n\nParameters:\n- pUnit: Pointer to unit data (checked for NULL)\n- nViewX: Viewport X coordinate input\n- nViewY: Viewport Y coordinate input  \n- pViewport: Viewport config structure pointer\n- pOutX: Output for map tile X coordinate\n- pOutY: Output for map tile Y coordinate\n\nReturns:\n- void; coordinates written to output pointers pOutX and pOutY",
