      "instructions": ["0x44420|SUB|ESP, 0x20", "0x44423|PUSH|EBX", "0x44424|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x38]", "0x44428|PUSH|EBP", "0x44429|PUSH|ESI", "0x4442A|PUSH|EDI", "0x4442B|CMP|BL, 0xff", "0x4442E|MOV|EDI, EDX", "0x44430|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x14], ECX", "0x44434|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x10], 0x0", "0x4443C|JNZ|0x6fb14466", "0x4443E|PUSH|0x6fbb3c08", "0x44443|PUSH|0x15c0", "0x44448|PUSH|0xff", "0x4444D|PUSH|0x6fbb3d88"],
      "comment": "Process mouse click interaction with game objects in viewport\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate cursor position (return error if at -1)\n2. Retrieve unit ID from param_2 and current game state\n3. Calculate map grid row/column from viewport coordinates:\n   - dwRowIndex = (nScreenY - viewport_offset_y) / viewport_scale_y\n   - dwColIndex = (nScreenX - viewport_offset_x) / viewport_scale_x\n4. Check game context mode (6=item pickup, 8=door interaction):\n   - Handle mode 6: Item/resource interaction path\n   - Handle mode 8: Door/object interaction path\n5. For other modes/no unit context:\n   - Validate object type (0x00-0x02, 0x0b-0x0f, 0x11-0x13 allowed)\n   - Check if current player owns the object\n   - Validate server connection status (port 0 or 1)\n   - Rate-limit interaction (min 0x191ms = 401ms between interactions)\n6. Send appropriate packet based on object type:\n   - 0x27: Mode 6 item pickup\n   - 0x4c: Mode 8 door interaction\n   - 0x18: Direct object interaction\n   - 0x19: NPC interaction (with flag 0x04 check for weapon validation)\n   - 0x21/0x28/0x29/0x2a: Unit-specific interactions\n7. Send final coordinate/orientation update via CompressPackedData\n8. Update interaction animation state\n\nParameters:\n- dwScreenX (param_1): Mouse cursor X coordinate (fastcall ECX)\n- dwUnitId (param_2): Unit/object ID to interact with (fastcall EDX)\n- nScreenY (param_3): Mouse cursor Y coordinate (stack param)\n- nHeightOffset (param_4): Height offset for coordinate calculation (stack param)\n- pdwModifiers (param_5): Modifier flags (0x04=weapon check, shift/ctrl bits)\n- pbViewportScaling (param_6): Viewport config: [scale_y@+0x14, scale_x@+0x15, offset_y@+0x04, offset_x@+0x0c]\n- pdwGameState (param_7): Game state/event context\n\nReturns:\n- 1: Success (interaction processed, animation state updated)\n- 0: Failure (validation failed, rate limit exceeded, or server unavailable)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If char cVar1 (from pdwGameState & 0xff) == -1: Invalid page, log error and return 0\n- If char cVar1 == 0x01 or 0x02: Certain game modes block interaction, return 0\n- If cVar1 == 0x03: Validate item stats available (ptItemStats check at offset 0x80)\n- Server connection state affects rate limiting: 0x191ms (401ms) threshold vs 400ms for remote\n\nStructure Layout:\nViewport Scale/Offset (pbViewportScaling):\n| Offset | Size | Field Name     | Type | Description             |\n|--------|------|----------------|------|-------------------------|\n| +0x04  | 4    | nOffsetY       | int  | Y viewport offset       |\n| +0x0c  | 4    | nOffsetX       | int  | X viewport offset       |\n| +0x14  | 1    | byScaleY       | byte | Y coordinate divisor    |\n| +0x15  | 1    | byScaleX       | byte | X coordinate divisor    |\n\nObject Type Enum (g_dwObjectType):\n| Type  | Name                | Interaction |\n|-------|---------------------|-------------|\n| 0x00  | Player              | 0x18/0x19  |\n| 0x01  | NPC                 | 0x19       |\n| 0x02  | Object              | 0x18       |\n| 0x03  | (unused path)       | skip       |\n| 0x0b  | Shrine              | 0x2a       |\n| 0x0c  | Waypoint            | 0x2a       |\n| 0x0e  | Item on ground      | 0x18       |\n| 0x0f  | Destructible object | 0x18       |\n| 0x11  | Quest object        | 0x18       |\n| 0x13  | Boss object         | 0x18       |",
      "tags": ["UI_INVENTORY", "MOD_UI", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "STRUCT_Room2", "STRUCT_ItemData", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData", "STRUCT_StatList", "STRUCT_MonsterData", "PARAM_7", "PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Path", "STRUCT_Skill", "SRC_inv.cpp", "STRUCT_Other"]
