      "instructions": ["0x44D70|PUSH|EBX", "0x44D71|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x8]", "0x44D75|PUSH|EBP", "0x44D76|PUSH|ESI", "0x44D77|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [EBX + 0xc]", "0x44D7A|PUSH|EDI", "0x44D7B|XOR|EDI, EDI", "0x44D7D|XOR|EAX, EAX", "0x44D7F|MOV|DI, word ptr [EBX + 0xc]", "0x44D83|MOV|[0x6fbf8d10], EAX", "0x44D88|SHR|ESI, 0x10", "0x44D8B|MOV|[0x6fbf8d14], EAX", "0x44D90|CALL|0x6fb62880", "0x44D95|MOV|EBP, dword ptr [EAX + 0x84]", "0x44D9B|MOV|ECX, EBX"],
      "comment": "Process UI click event and dispatch to appropriate handlers based on click coordinates.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract X coordinate (low word) and Y coordinate (high word) from pClickEvent+0xc\n2. Clear UI mode flags (g_dwUIMode2Flag, g_dwUIMode3Flag)\n3. Get game context and player inventory from offset 0x84\n4. Call ValidateCoordinateInBounds to check initial bounds\n5. If bounds valid (return 0):\n   a. Check if click in UI region 1 (X: screenWidth-0x12e to screenWidth-0x10e, Y: screenHeight-0x60 to screenHeight-0x40)\n   b. If in region 1, call ProcessUIStateChange(1,1,0) and return early\n   c. Otherwise call INVENTORY_GetOwner for inventory owner check\n6. If g_dwUIMode1Flag set and g_dwObjectType == 0:\n   a. Clear g_dwUIMode1Flag\n   b. Get inventory owner unit; if NULL:\n      - Check if click in UI region 2 (X: screenWidth-0xed to screenWidth-0xd9, Y: screenHeight-0x57 to screenHeight-0x45)\n      - If in region 2 and g_dwObjectTypeNormalizationFlag == 0, call InitializeGameStatePanel(1)\n7. Call ClearTargetingState to reset targeting\n8. Check if click within screen bounds (g_dwMinScreenX_Alt to g_dwMaxScreenX_Alt2, g_dwMaxScreenY to g_dwMaxScreenY_Alt2)\n9. If within bounds and ValidateCoordinateInBounds returns 0:\n   a. Set pClickEvent+0x1c = 0 (clear flag)\n   b. Set pClickEvent+0x18 = 1 (set processed flag)\n   c. Call InsertCacheNodeWithCookie to queue event\n\nParameters:\npClickEvent (dword *): Pointer to UI event structure\n  +0x0c: Packed coordinates (low word = X, high word = Y)\n  +0x18: Processed flag (set to 1 when event handled)\n  +0x1c: Additional flag (cleared to 0)\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Early return if click in close button region (ProcessUIStateChange path)\n- No action if ValidateCoordinateInBounds fails\n- Panel initialization only if owner unit is NULL and flags permit\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x12e (302) - X offset from right edge for UI region 1 start\n0x10e (270) - X offset from right edge for UI region 1 end\n0x60 (96) - Y offset from bottom for UI region 1 start  \n0x40 (64) - Y offset from bottom for UI region 1 end\n0xed (237) - X offset from right edge for UI region 2 start\n0xd9 (217) - X offset from right edge for UI region 2 end\n0x57 (87) - Y offset from bottom for UI region 2 start\n0x45 (69) - Y offset from bottom for UI region 2 end\n0x84 - Offset to inventory pointer in game context",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
