      "comment": "Initializes UI state by clearing all UI-related global flags and handling pending validation errors.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load pending validation error code from g_dwValidationErrorCode into ECX\n2. Zero EBX register for clearing operations\n3. Clear all UI state globals to 0:\n   - g_dwObjectType = 0\n   - g_chCurrentMode = 0\n   - g_dwUIMode1Flag = 0\n   - g_dwInteractionParam0 = 0\n   - g_dwInteractionParam1 = 0\n   - _g_dwLastInteractionTime = 0\n4. Compare validation error code (ECX) with 0\n5. If error code is 0, skip to step 8 (JZ branch)\n6. If error code is non-zero, call ReportValidationError(g_dwValidationErrorCode)\n7. Clear validation error code to 0 after reporting\n8. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\n  (none)\n\nReturns:\n  (none) - void function\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - If g_dwValidationErrorCode is 0 (no pending error), clears UI state without calling error handler\n  - Error code cleared after reporting to prevent duplicate error reporting\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x6fbf69fc - Address of g_dwValidationErrorCode (validation error storage)\n  0x6fbf8a64 - Address of g_dwObjectType\n  0x6fbf8a78 - Address of g_chCurrentMode\n  0x6fbf8cb0 - Address of g_dwUIMode1Flag\n  0x6fbf69f8 - Address of g_dwInteractionParam0\n  0x6fbf6a00 - Address of g_dwInteractionParam1\n  0x6fbf69d0 - Address of _g_dwLastInteractionTime",
