      "comment": "Initializes game configuration arrays for specified game mode.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate base offset: (nGameMode * 5) in DWORDS or (nGameMode * 10) in WORDS\n2. Set g_wConfigId1_renamed[nGameMode*10] = 0\n3. Set g_dwConfigParam1[nGameMode*5] = 1\n4. Set g_dwConfigParam2[nGameMode*5] = 1\n5. Set g_dwConfigParam3[nGameMode*10] = 0\n6. Set g_dwConfigParam4[nGameMode*5] = 0\n\nParameters:\n  nGameMode (int) - Game mode index for config array initialization (__fastcall in ECX)\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nStructure Layout:\n  Offset | Size | Field Name | Description\n  0x00   | 2    | wConfigId1 | Configuration ID (cleared to 0)\n  0x02   | 4    | dwConfigParam1 | Config parameter 1 (set to 1)\n  0x06   | 4    | dwConfigParam2 | Config parameter 2 (set to 1)\n  0x0A   | 2    | wConfigParam3 | Config parameter 3 (cleared to 0)\n  0x0C   | 4    | dwConfigParam4 | Config parameter 4 (cleared to 0)",
