      "comment": "Resets game UI state and inserts cache node during object type transitions.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate object type (1=Player, 2=Monster, 3=Object, 4=Missile, 9=Item)\n2. Check UI resource buffer element 5 - only proceed if element is null\n3. Clear object render initialized flag\n4. Get game context and retrieve inventory owner unit\n5. Set game state for the inventory owner unit\n6. Configure cache node: set dwFlags (+0x18) to 1, dwPriority (+0x1c) to 0\n7. Insert cache node into system via InsertCacheNodeWithCookie\n8. Clear UI color flag and process game state transition\n9. Reset all interaction parameters and UI state to defaults\n10. Clear selected unit/entity pointers\n11. Reset viewport and cursor positions to -1 (invalid)\n\nParameters:\n  pCacheNode (CacheNode *) - Pointer to cache node structure\n    +0x18: dwFlags - Set to 1 (enabled)\n    +0x1c: dwPriority - Set to 0 (default priority)\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Early exit if object type is not 1, 2, 3, 4, or 9\n- Early exit if UI resource buffer element 5 is non-null (resource still active)\n\nObject Type Constants:\n  1 = Player unit\n  2 = Monster/NPC\n  3 = World object\n  4 = Missile/projectile\n  9 = Item\n\nGlobals Reset:\n  g_dwObjectRenderInitialized = 0\n  g_dwUIColorFlag = 0\n  g_dwInteractionParam0 = 0\n  g_dwInteractionParam1 = 0\n  g_pGameStateConfig = NULL\n  g_dwUIFlag1 = 0\n  g_pSelectedUnit = NULL\n  g_pSelectedEntity = NULL\n  g_dwViewportX = -1 (0xFFFFFFFF)\n  g_dwUIState = -1 (0xFFFFFFFF)\n  g_dwCursorScreenX = -1 (0xFFFFFFFF)\n  g_dwCursorScreenY = -1 (0xFFFFFFFF)",
