      "comment": "Cache UI resource files to memory on first access\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if BuySellTabs file cached (g_dwBuySellTabsFileLoaded == 0)\n   - If not cached: Call Ordinal_578 to build path with s__s_ui_panel_buyselltabs\n   - Call ConcatenatePathAndWriteFile to load and cache file\n   - Store result in g_dwBuySellTabsFileLoaded\n2. Check if MiniConvert file cached (g_dwMiniConvertFileLoaded == 0)\n   - If not cached: Call Ordinal_578 to build path with s__s_ui_panel_miniconvert\n   - Call ConcatenatePathAndWriteFile to load and cache file\n   - Store result in g_dwMiniConvertFileLoaded\n3. Check if InvChar6Tab file cached (g_dwInvChar6TabFileLoaded == 0)\n   - If not cached: Call Ordinal_10227 to check some condition\n   - If result non-zero: Call GetGlobalSystemState to check state\n   - If state non-zero: Call Ordinal_578 to build path with s__s_ui_panel_invchar6tab\n   - Call ConcatenatePathAndWriteFile to load and cache file\n   - Store result in g_dwInvChar6TabFileLoaded\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Function has no return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- InvChar6Tab file only cached if Ordinal_10227 and GetGlobalSystemState both return non-zero\n- All files are 0x104 (260) bytes in buffer size during path construction\n- Files cached with data global prefix s_DATA_GLOBAL_6fbae3e4\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x104 - Buffer size for path construction (260 bytes)",
