      "instructions": ["0x48010|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbf8c90]", "0x48015|SUB|ESP, 0x104", "0x4801B|PUSH|ESI", "0x4801C|XOR|ESI, ESI", "0x4801E|PUSH|EDI", "0x4801F|CMP|EAX, ESI", "0x48021|MOV|EDI, ECX", "0x48023|JNZ|0x6fb1802d", "0x48025|CMP|dword ptr [0x6fbf8c94], ESI", "0x4802B|JZ|0x6fb1803c", "0x4802D|PUSH|ESI", "0x4802E|PUSH|ESI", "0x4802F|PUSH|ESI", "0x48030|XOR|EDX, EDX", "0x48032|MOV|ECX, 0x3"],
      "comment": "Initialize UI panel based on mode (trade or inventory)\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if UI item flag or UI state flag is set\n2. If either flag set, call FUN_6fb8d210 with parameters (3,0,0.0,0.0,0)\n3. Clear UI item flag, UI state flag, and UI mode flag to 0\n4. Branch on nPanelMode:\n   - If nPanelMode == 0: Set g_dwObjectType to 0x0A, call SetScrollWindowMode(0)\n   - If nPanelMode != 0: Clear last interaction time, set g_dwObjectType to 0x0B, call SetScrollWindowMode(3)\n5. If nPanelMode != 0 and validation error code is 0:\n   - Call Ordinal_578 to build path string into szBufferPath\n   - Call ConcatenatePathAndWriteFile with szBufferPath and flag 0\n6. Clear all UI flags (UIRefreshFlag, UIStateFlag, UIUpdateFlag, UIPanelFlag, UIVisibilityFlag)\n7. Return void\n\nParameters:\nnPanelMode (int in ECX via __fastcall): Panel mode - 0 for inventory, non-zero for trade\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Magic number 0x104: Path buffer size (260 bytes)\n- Magic number 0x0A: Object type for inventory mode\n- Magic number 0x0B: Object type for trade mode\n- Function skips file operations if validation error already present",
      "tags": ["UI_TRADE", "PARAM_1", "UI_PANEL"]
