      "comment": "Validates if current game object type is valid (Player, NPC, or Object).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load current object type from g_dwObjectType global variable\n2. Compare against 0x01 (Player type) - if match, proceed to success path\n3. Compare against 0x02 (NPC type) - if match, proceed to success path\n4. Compare against 0x03 (Object type) - if match, proceed to success path\n5. If no match found, clear EAX register and return 0 (invalid)\n6. Return 1 to indicate valid object type\n\nParameters:\n(none) - Uses global g_dwObjectType to determine object type\n\nReturns:\n1 (EAX=1) if object type is valid (matches 0x01, 0x02, or 0x03)\n0 (EAX=0) if object type is invalid or unrecognized\n\nSpecial Cases:\nObject type constants: 0x01=Player, 0x02=NPC, 0x03=Object\nUsed during game state initialization and validation",
