      "comment": "Initialize game object mode and targeting system state when called with mode 0x19.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FUN_6fb5d370 with mode 0x19 and zero parameters\n2. Test return value for success (non-zero indicates success)\n3. If successful:\n   - Set g_dwObjectType to 0xc (Object Type 12)\n   - Initialize targeting system via InitializeTargetingSystem()\n   - Clear g_dwUIMode1Flag to 0 (UI mode disabled)\n   - Clear g_fPanelStashVisibility to 0 (panel hidden)\n   - Clear g_dwGameObjectCount to 0 (reset object count)\n   - Clear g_dwInventoryItemCount to 0 (reset inventory count)\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If FUN_6fb5d370 returns 0 (failure), no initialization occurs\n- All state variables are zeroed on success\n- Magic Numbers: 0x19 = mode identifier, 0xc = object type value",
