      "comment": "Initialize character storage files (bank and trade stash)\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Reset secondary flag to 0\n2. Check if bank storage file already initialized (g_pCharacterBankStorage == NULL)\n3. If not initialized, construct bank file path by concatenating strings using Ordinal_578\n4. Call ConcatenatePathAndWriteFile with bank path (return value written to g_pCharacterBankStorage)\n5. Check if trade stash is available via Ordinal_10227 (returns 1 if enabled)\n6. If trade stash enabled, construct and initialize trade stash storage path using Ordinal_578\n7. Call ConcatenatePathAndWriteFile with trade stash path (return value written to g_pCharacterTradeStashStorage)\n8. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\n(none)\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Function only initializes storage files on first call (checks g_pCharacterBankStorage)\n- Trade stash storage only initialized if Ordinal_10227 returns non-zero\n- Buffer size is fixed at 0x104 (260 bytes)\n- Uses global flags _g_dwSecondaryFlag and g_dwSecondaryFlag\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x104 (260) - path buffer size\n\nOrdinals:\n- Ordinal_578 - String path concatenation function (constructs UI panel paths)\n- Ordinal_10227 - Trade stash availability check function",
