      "comment": "Clear character bank and trade stash storage, resetting object type if Difficulty or Difficulty+1.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Read current g_dwObjectType from global\n2. If g_dwObjectType == 0xc (Difficulty) OR 0xd (Difficulty+1):\n   - Reset g_dwObjectType to 0\n   - Call FUN_6fb5d370 (0x19, 1, 0) to clear temporary storage\n3. If g_pCharacterBankStorage != NULL:\n   - Call ReportValidationError to log error\n   - Clear g_pCharacterBankStorage = 0\n4. If g_pCharacterTradeStashStorage != NULL:\n   - Call ReportValidationError to log error\n   - Clear g_pCharacterTradeStashStorage = 0\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Only clears storage if both bank and trade stash are populated\n- Object type reset only on specific difficulty values (0xc, 0xd)",
