      "comment": "Reset guild vault UI and error state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if g_dwObjectType is 0xF (GUILD_VAULT_OPEN) or 0x10 (GUILD_VAULT_CLOSE)\n2. If matched, clear g_dwObjectType to 0 (reset state)\n3. Call FUN_6fb5d370(0x1C, 1, 0) to handle UI cleanup with code 0x1C\n4. Send packed network data with code 0x4F, subcode 0x1F to notify other clients\n5. Check g_dwGuildVaultInitialized flag for pending initialization errors\n6. If non-zero, report the error code via ReportValidationError\n7. Clear g_dwGuildVaultInitialized to 0\n\nParameters:\n(none - uses global state)\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If object type is neither 0xF nor 0x10, only performs error reporting\n- Safe to call multiple times (checks before resetting)",
