      "comment": "Processes mouse click events for UI object types 0x0F (15) and 0x10 (16).\nHandles click detection across multiple UI regions and sets appropriate flags.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if g_dwObjectType is 0x0F or 0x10, return early if not\n2. Extract mouse X coordinate from low word of pMouseEventData[3]\n3. Extract mouse Y coordinate from high word of pMouseEventData[3]\n4. Store coordinates in g_dwInteractionParam0 (X) and g_dwInteractionParam1 (Y)\n5. Call IsGameStateActive() to check game state\n6. If game state inactive, check UI Mode 2 region (close button area):\n   - X bounds: (screenWidth - UIXOffset - 0x12E) to (screenWidth - UIXOffset - 0x10E)\n   - Y bounds: (UIYOffset + screenHeight - 0x60) to (UIYOffset + screenHeight - 0x40)\n   - If in region, set g_dwUIMode2Flag = 1\n7. Check cube panel region:\n   - Y bounds: (UIYOffset + screenHeight - 0x14D) to (UIYOffset + screenHeight - 0x13C)\n   - X bounds: (UIXOffset + 0x32) to (UIXOffset + 0x7F)\n   - If in region, set g_fPanelCubeVisibility = 1\n8. Check scroll region (X: UIXOffset+0x110 to UIXOffset+0x138, Y: screenHeight-0x64 to screenHeight-0x3C):\n   - If in region, set scroll flags (g_dwUIScrollOffsetX/Y = 1, g_dwUIColorFlag = 1)\n9. Call ValidateCoordinateInBounds for boundary validation\n10. If validation returns 1, clear all UI flags and return\n11. Check Mode15 screen bounds and MinScreenX_Alt/MaxScreenX_Alt2 regions\n12. Get game context and inventory owner via INVENTORY_GetOwner\n13. If no inventory owner and click in Mode 1 region, set g_dwUIMode1Flag = 1\n14. Check Mode10 render bounds (g_pRenderModeList_10 to g_dwMaxScreenX_Mode10)\n15. For valid clicks, set pMouseEventData[6]=1, pMouseEventData[7]=0\n16. Call InitializeGameObjectProperties(4, 0, 0.0, 0.0, 0) for UI object init\n17. Call InsertCacheNodeWithCookie to register the mouse event\n\nParameters:\n  pMouseEventData - Pointer to mouse event data structure:\n    [3] = packed coordinates (low word: X, high word: Y)\n    [6] = processed flag (set to 1 when handled)\n    [7] = result code (set to 0 on success)\n\nReturns: void\n\nUI Region Constants:\n  Mode 2 close button: X offset -0x12E to -0x10E from right, Y offset -0x60 to -0x40 from bottom\n  Cube panel: X offset +0x32 to +0x7F from left, Y offset -0x14D to -0x13C from bottom\n  Scroll region: X offset +0x110 to +0x138, Y offset -0x64 to -0x3C from bottom\n  Mode 1 region: X offset -0xED to -0xD9 from right, Y offset -0x57 to -0x45 from bottom",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Act", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_1", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
