      "comment": "Initialize targeting system state and game object type.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FUN_6fb5d370 with parameters (0x1d, 0, 0) to initialize targeting\n2. Check return value for success (non-zero indicates success)\n3. If initialization successful:\n   - Set g_dwObjectType to 0x11 (OBJECT_TARGETING_MODE)\n   - Call InitializeTargetingSystem() to set up targeting subsystem\n   - Clear g_dwTargetingMode to 0\n   - Clear g_dwTargetingFlags to 0\n4. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If FUN_6fb5d370 returns 0 (failure), function skips all initialization and returns early\n- Global g_dwObjectType is set to magic value 0x11 to mark targeting mode active\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FUN_6fb5d370() - Performs core targeting initialization\n- InitializeTargetingSystem() - Sets up targeting subsystem globals",
