      "comment": "Close and cleanup Trophy Case UI panel.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if object type is 0x11 (OBJTYPE_TROPHYCASE)\n2. If true: reset object type to 0, call initialization function (0x1d, 1, 0), send close packet (0x4f, 0x24, 0, 0)\n3. Check if g_pTrophyCaseUIPanel is allocated\n4. If allocated: report validation error and deallocate panel, set pointer to NULL\n5. Return\n\nParameters:\n(none)\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Object type 0x11 indicates Trophy Case UI is active\n- Panel can be allocated independently of object type state\n- Cleanup always occurs regardless of initial object type value\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x11 - OBJTYPE_TROPHYCASE (object type identifier)\n0x1d - Initialization command parameter\n0x4f - Packet type for closing/deactivating UI\n0x24 - Packet subtype for trophy case closure",
