      "comment": "Initialize the Automap UI dialog with player icon display and slider control.\nConstructs the main dialog window and child UI elements (scrollable panel, slider, timer).\nUses SEH exception handling for cleanup of ExceptionList pointer.\nNote: Function uses 3 stack-allocated temporaries optimized away (local_4, local_c, local_10).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Save current ExceptionList pointer to pPreviousExceptionList for later restoration\n2. Check if g_pActiveDialog already initialized (skip if true)\n3. If not initialized, set up SEH exception frame\n4. Call InitializeDialogStructure to create 0x4b x 0x1e pixel dialog window\n5. Set dialog field value to 1 via SetDialogFieldValue\n6. Initialize color parameters: dwBaseColor=0x15, nColorType=4, dwColorValue=1\n7. Call Ordinal_10004 (initialize rendering/state, Storm.dll)\n8. Add primary dialog line with color settings via AddDialogLine\n9. Allocate memory for scrollable panel via Ordinal_401 (Storm.dll memory allocator)\n10. If allocation succeeds, create scrollable panel component FUN_6fb1f5f0\n11. Append scrollable panel to dialog via AppendLinkedListNode\n12. Allocate memory for slider control\n13. If allocation succeeds, initialize slider control InitializeSliderControlEx with parameters\n14. Set slider value via SetSliderControlValue(0x6fb1af30)\n15. Call slider vtable methods at +0x40 and +0x44 to configure height (0x118) and state (1)\n16. Allocate memory for player icon line\n17. If allocation succeeds, construct player icon line ConstructAutomapPlayerIconLineWrapper\n18. Append player icon line to dialog\n19. Create timer via SetTimer with 500ms interval, callback FUN_6fb1b0d0\n20. Store timer handle in g_hAutomapRefreshTimer\n21. Restore original ExceptionList from pPreviousExceptionList\n\nParameters: None\n\nReturns: void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If g_pActiveDialog != NULL, entire initialization is skipped (guard prevents reinit)\n- Memory allocation failures use Ordinal_401 which returns NULL on failure\n- All allocations are optional; partial initialization acceptable if some fail\n- SEH frame setup saves/restores FS:[0x0] for exception handling\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n- 0x4b: Dialog width in pixels\n- 0x1e: Dialog height in pixels\n- 0x1ea, 0x15e: Slider dimensions\n- 0x15: Base color value (decimal 21)\n- 0x6fb1af00: Dialog callback table/configuration\n- 0x6fb1af30: Initial slider value/configuration\n- 0x6fb1afa0: Player icon line configuration\n- 0x100: Slider max position value\n- 0x118: Slider height parameter\n- 500: Timer interval in milliseconds\n- 0xffffffff: Memory allocation flags (size=-1, flags=-1)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- InitializeDialogStructure() - Creates base dialog window\n- AddDialogLine() - Adds colored line to dialog\n- SetSliderControlValue() - Updates slider position\n- SetTimer() - Creates repeating timer callback\n- Ordinal_10004() - Initialize rendering context (Storm.dll)\n- Ordinal_401() - Memory allocator (Storm.dll)\n- ConstructAutomapPlayerIconLineWrapper() - Create player icon display\n- FUN_6fb1b0d0 - Timer callback for automap refresh",
