      "comment": "Handle click event on the automap player icon line component.\nCallback registered by ConstructAutomapPlayerIconLineWrapper in InitializeAutomapDialog.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize game object type 2 with no position/flags via InitializeGameObjectProperties\n2. Update UI state 0x1e (decimal 30) to active state 1 via ProcessUIStateChange\n3. Send network packet opcode 0x4f with data value 0x27 via SendPackedData\n4. Return 1 to indicate successful handling\n\nParameters: None (void)\n\nReturns:\n- 1: Always returns success\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n- 2: Game object type parameter (InitializeGameObjectProperties)\n- 0x1e (30): UI element/state identifier (ProcessUIStateChange)\n- 1: Active state flag (ProcessUIStateChange)\n- 0x4f (79): Network packet opcode (SendPackedData)\n- 0x27 (39): Packet data value (SendPackedData)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- InitializeAutomapDialog() - Registers this callback at 0x6fb1afa0\n- ConstructAutomapPlayerIconLineWrapper() - Creates UI component using this callback\n- InitializeGameObjectProperties() - Initializes game object state\n- ProcessUIStateChange() - Updates UI element visibility/state\n- SendPackedData() - Sends network packet to server",
