      "comment": "Close Automap UI and clean up associated resources.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Kill the automap refresh timer\n2. Reset dwObjectType flag if set to 0x12 (Automap highlight mode)\n3. Send network packet 0x4F with parameters 0x27 to inform server of state change\n4. Release scrollable panel control (call destructor via vtable, clear pointer)\n5. Release slider control (call destructor via vtable, clear pointer)\n6. Release player icon line control (call destructor via vtable, clear pointer)\n7. Close active dialog if present and null global pointer\n\nParameters:\n(none)\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- g_hAutomapRefreshTimer may be NULL (harmless to KillTimer)\n- Global pointers (pAutomapScrollablePanel, pAutomapSliderControl, etc.) checked for NULL before dereferencing\n- Each control is destructed (first dword is vtable, first function is destructor taking boolean param 1)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x12 - Automap highlight/object mode flag\n0x1E - Parameter to FUN_6fb5d370 (30 decimal)\n0x4F - Network packet command for Automap state change\n0x27 - Network packet subcommand (39 decimal)",
