      "comment": "Populates automap scrollable panel with localized item descriptions.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Clear the current panel content via callback\n2. Retrieve automap data table handle via FUN_6fb8ed80\n3. For each item entry in automap table:\n   a. Call Ordinal_11192 to extract item name and attributes into buffers\n   b. If name retrieved (index == 0), validate string is not empty\n   c. Initialize 2048-element Unicode buffer array\n   d. Format item text using Ordinal_578 with template string\n   e. Convert formatted ANSI text to Unicode via win2Unicode\n   f. Display formatted Unicode text in scroll panel via callback\n4. Continue iteration until all items processed\n\nParameters:\nNone (implicit access to g_pAutomapScrollablePanel global)\n\nReturns:\nvoid (no explicit return value; populates panel as side effect)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Empty item name results in text not displayed (break on nStringLength == -2)\n- Ordinal_11192 returns nonzero on iteration complete\n- Unicode buffer pre-initialized with default constructors (0x400 iterations)\n- Format string at 0x6fbb4084 contains template placeholders\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x400 (1024) - Unicode array element count\n0x3c - Callback offset in panel struct for clearing content\n0x30 - Callback offset in panel struct for text display\n0xe (14) - Display parameter (possible color/effect index)\n\nStructure Layout (g_pAutomapScrollablePanel):\n| Offset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description |\n|--------|------|------------|------|-------------|\n| 0x30 | 4 | pfnDisplayText | code * | Callback to display Unicode text |\n| 0x3c | 4 | pfnClearContent | code * | Callback to clear panel |\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FUN_6fb8ed80 - Retrieve automap data table handle\n- Ordinal_11192 - Extract item name/attributes from automap entry\n- Ordinal_578 - Format ANSI text with template\n- Unicode::win2Unicode - Convert ANSI to Unicode encoding",
