      "comment": "Toggles the panel NPC mode flag if expansion content is available and system is active.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call CheckExpansionMpqExists to verify expansion MPQ is present\n2. If expansion not present (EAX == 0), exit early without changes\n3. Call GetGlobalSystemState to check if system is in active state\n4. If system not active (EAX == 0), exit early without changes\n5. Toggle g_dwPanelNpcModeFlag: if currently 0, set to 1; if non-zero, set to 0\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value; modifies global state only\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Function has no effect if expansion MPQ does not exist\n- Function has no effect if global system state is inactive (0)\n- Toggle uses SETZ instruction: sets to 1 only if previous value was exactly 0\n\nGlobal State Modified:\ng_dwPanelNpcModeFlag (0x6fbf8acc) - Panel NPC interaction mode toggle\n\nDecompiler Artifacts:\nbVar1 (fExpansionExists): Decompiler SSA representation of CheckExpansionMpqExists return value\nextraout_var: Decompiler artifact from CONCAT31 merging EAX bytes - not an actual variable\nextraout_EAX: SSA representation of GetGlobalSystemState return value in EAX",
