      "comment": "Renders NPC shop inventory display with item slots and graphics.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Verify game system is initialized (GetGlobalSystemState)\n2. Locate NPC shop data via search criteria\n3. Initialize UI panel rendering structures\n4. Set up 4 inventory slot display panels with proper offsets (top-left, top-right, bottom-left, bottom-right)\n5. Add mode indicator panel (normal/snow mode)\n6. Initialize 116-char Unicode text buffer and clear inventory list\n7. Process each display entry in NPC shop table (up to boundary)\n8. For each entry: render centered text (item name/description)\n9. If item split across lines, render first line at Y-4, second at Y+4\n10. Render all equipped units/mercenaries in shop (if owner selected)\n11. Draw unit sprites with collision highlight if unit matches selection\n12. Finalize UI rendering\n\nParameters: (void)\n\nReturns: void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If game not initialized, function returns early\n- If NPC search fails or data allocation fails, shows error (0x24, mode 2)\n- Snow mode adds 1 to panel type (10 vs 11)\n- Unit sprite rendering only if unit is selected unit and meets all validity checks\n- Handles text wrapping for long item descriptions\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n- 0x7: Search criteria for NPC location\n- 0x12: Loop count for clearing 18 array elements\n- 0x3c: Unicode string length (60 chars)\n- 0x63: Unicode string length (99 chars)  \n- 0xa0: Display line height threshold\n- 0xd6: Y-coordinate calculation base (214 pixels)\n- 0xe0: Y offset calculation (224 pixels)\n- 0x100, 0x110: X offset calculations for panel positioning\n- 0x30, 0x3f: Y offset calculations for bottom panels\n- 0xfffffff20: Calculation offset for inventory slot count\n- 0x5fd: Stat lookup identifier\n- 0x800: Equipment property identifier (selected equipment)\n- 0x30ae: Equipment difficulty property\n- 0x84: NPC shop inventory list pointer offset in structure\n- 0x14: Entry size in display table (20 bytes)\n\nRelated Callers:\n- FUN_6fb5ba40 - Main shop display loop",
      "tags": ["UI_INVENTORY", "MOD_UI", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "STRUCT_ItemData", "PARAM_0", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData", "STRUCT_StatList", "PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Path", "STRUCT_Skill", "SRC_inv.cpp", "SRC_CmnItems.h", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY"]
