      "comment": "Render inventory panel graphics for character equipment slots.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize adPanelData array (18 dwords) to zeros\n2. Load unit stat from pUnit->field_0x84 (unit state/inventory)\n3. If unit exists: Query stat 3 (armor slot active) via Ordinal_10257\n4. If stat 3 inactive/missing: Render armor panel (Slot 1) at g_pPanelArmorInv+offset\n5. If unit exists: Query stat 1 (helm/glove slot) via Ordinal_10257\n6. If stat 1 inactive/missing: Render helm/glove panel (Slot 3) at g_pPanelHelmGloveInv+offset\n7. If no unit: Set dwCheckResult=0, dwWeaponType=0, fIsDualWield=false, goto armor section\n8. If unit exists: Query stat 4 (purpose unclear, result unused) via Ordinal_10257\n9. Query stat 5 (weapon type) via Ordinal_10257, store in dwWeaponType\n10. Get dual-wield state via Ordinal_10291(pUnit, dwUnitStat) - result 2=dual-wield\n11. If dwWeaponType zero: Skip to weapon panel section, render secondary slot\n12. Check if dwCheckResult nonzero: If true, return early (inventory locked/invalid)\n13. Render primary weapon/hand panel (Slot 2) at g_pPanelWeaponsInv+offset\n14. If dwWeaponType zero: Render secondary weapon slot (Slot 0) at g_pPanelWeapons2Inv+offset\n15. If dwWeaponType nonzero and NOT dual-wield: Render secondary slot (Slot 0), return\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit (UnitAny*) - Character/monster unit; pUnit[0x84] contains inventory/state field\n  \nReturns:\n  void - Renders panel graphics to screen via Ordinal_10072 calls; no return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - NULL unit (iVar1==0): Renders minimal layout (armor, helm, weapons basic)\n  - Stat query returns 0: Panel rendered as available\n  - Weapon stat==0: Single weapon mode (renders secondary slot empty)\n  - Dual-wield (Ordinal_10291 returns 2): Both weapon slots rendered\n  \nMagic Numbers:\n  0x84 - Offset from pUnit to inventory/state field\n  0x1,0x3,0x4,0x5 - Stat IDs for unit query (helm, armor, unknown, weapon type)\n  0x2 - Dual-wield indicator from Ordinal_10291\n  0xffffffff - Render color mask (full white/enabled)\n  5 - Render layer/priority value\n  18 - Panel data array size (dwords)",
      "tags": ["PARAM_1", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
    },
