      "comment": "Initialize global Unicode text buffer array.\n\nClassification: Initialization function (static initializer)\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set pointer ESI to start of g_awUnicodeTextBuffer (0x6fbf6a50)\n2. Set loop counter EDI to 0x1000 (4096 iterations)\n3. Loop: Call Unicode::_default_constructor_closure_ for current element\n4. Advance pointer by 2 bytes (sizeof Unicode character)\n5. Decrement counter and repeat until all 4096 elements initialized\n\nParameters:\n  none\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nMemory Model:\n  - Initializes g_awUnicodeTextBuffer: global array of 4096 Unicode (2-byte) elements\n  - Total buffer size: 0x2000 bytes (8192 bytes)\n  - Buffer spans addresses 0x6fbf6a50 to 0x6fbf8a50\n  - Called from static initialization table at 0x6fbae028\n\nRelated Functions:\n  - StorePlayerNameToBuffer: Copies player name to this buffer\n  - RenderRecipeScrollUI: Renders text from this buffer\n  - RenderUnicodeTextWithLineHeight: Reads from this buffer for display\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x1000 (4096) - Number of Unicode elements to initialize\n  0x2 - Size of each Unicode element in bytes",
