      "comment": "Store player name to global buffer.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Copy input player name to Unicode buffer via Unicode::strcpy\n2. Store original input pointer to global g_pszPlayerName\n3. Invoke FUN_6fb5d370 with mode 0x25 (UI update signal)\n\nParameters:\n  szPlayerName (char *) - Player name string pointer\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Function stores the input pointer (not a copy) to global\n  - Mode 0x25 triggers UI refresh on global data change\n  - Note: Contains compiler-optimized phantom variable unaff_retaddr (cannot be renamed)\n\nRelated Functions:\n  - FUN_6fb5d370() - UI update dispatcher\n  - FUN_6fb1c9d0() - Reads from g_pszPlayerName global",
