      "instructions": ["0x4C9D0|SUB|ESP, 0x48", "0x4C9D3|CALL|0x6fadb920", "0x4C9D8|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x4C9DA|JZ|0x6fb1cb33", "0x4C9E0|MOV|ECX, 0x25", "0x4C9E5|CALL|0x6fb5d340", "0x4C9EA|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x4C9EC|JZ|0x6fb1cb33", "0x4C9F2|MOV|EDX, dword ptr [0x6fbf8d0c]", "0x4C9F8|TEST|EDX, EDX", "0x4C9FA|JNZ|0x6fb1ca16", "0x4C9FC|MOV|ECX, 0x6fbb40b0", "0x4CA01|CALL|0x6fb5a050", "0x4CA06|MOV|EDX, EAX", "0x4CA08|TEST|EDX, EDX"],
      "comment": "Render recipe scroll panel with 4 item slots at varying screen positions.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check global system state enabled (GetGlobalSystemState)\n2. Request recipe scroll feature flag 0x25 (FUN_6fb5d340)\n3. Load recipe scroll UI texture if not cached (FUN_6fb5a050, g_dwRecipeScrollHandle)\n4. Initialize 18-uint UIRect configuration array to zero\n5. Set config[1]=g_dwRecipeScrollHandle, config[3]=config[2]=0\n6. Render slot 0 at (X + 0x00, Y - 0xE0, 0xffffffff) - top-left\n7. Render slot 1 at (X + 0x100, Y - 0xE0, 0xffffffff) - top-right\n8. Render slot 2 at (X + 0x00, Y - 0x30, 0xffffffff) - bottom-left\n9. Render slot 3 at (X + 0x100, Y - 0x30, 0xffffffff) - bottom-right\n10. Flush draw state (Ordinal_10127)\n11. Render screen overlay element at (0x82 - Y, g_dwRecipeScrollScreenState) (Ordinal_10117)\n12. Flush draw state final (Ordinal_10127)\n\nParameters:\nnone\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x12 (18) - UIRect array element count (4 slots * 4 fields + 2)\n0x25 - Recipe scroll feature flag\n0x05 - Draw color format/mode (5)\n0xffffffff - Color white with full alpha\n0xE0 (224) - Y offset top slots\n0x30 (48) - Y offset bottom slots\n0x100 (256) - X spacing between columns\n0x82 (130) - Base Y coordinate for overlay\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Returns early if system state disabled or feature unavailable\n- Returns early if texture load fails (FUN_6fb5a050 returns 0)\n- All 4 slots positioned relative to base screen coords adjusted by g_dwUIXOffset/g_dwUIYOffset\n- Ordinal_10127 calls used to synchronize/flush draw state between slot groups",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "STRUCT_Skill", "PARAM_0", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "UI_MENU", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
