      "comment": "Initialize screen configuration for UI panel layouts.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load panel level configuration by calling FUN_6fb5a050(s_Panel_Level)\n2. Store result in g_dwScreenConfig2 (primary panel settings)\n3. Load panel socket configuration by calling FUN_6fb5a050(s_Panel_Levelsocket)\n4. Store result in g_dwScreenConfig1 (alternate panel settings)\n5. Return\n\nParameters:\n(none)\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nNotes:\n- Loads two panel configuration strings (Panel_Level and Panel_Levelsocket)\n- FUN_6fb5a050 handles path concatenation and file loading\n- Called during initial screen/UI setup phase (InitializeScreenState)\n- Configuration values stored in global variables for later panel rendering",
