      "instructions": ["0x4DBB0|PUSH|-0x1", "0x4DBB2|PUSH|0x6fba4468", "0x4DBB7|MOV|EAX, FS:[0x0]", "0x4DBBD|PUSH|EAX", "0x4DBBE|MOV|dword ptr FS:[0x0], ESP", "0x4DBC5|SUB|ESP, 0x8", "0x4DBC8|PUSH|EBX", "0x4DBC9|PUSH|EBP", "0x4DBCA|PUSH|ESI", "0x4DBCB|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x4DBCD|PUSH|EDI", "0x4DBCE|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x14], ESI", "0x4DBD2|MOV|dword ptr [ESI], 0x6fba90fc", "0x4DBD8|LEA|EBP, [ESI + 0x8]", "0x4DBDB|XOR|EBX, EBX"],
      "comment": "Initialize a Diablo II viewport/game surface with tile data and rendering parameters.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set exception handler frame (FS:[0] stack unwinding)\n2. Initialize vtable pointer to PTR_LAB_6fba90fc (first phase)\n3. Loop 32 times (0x20): Call CallFunctionOnRange on 6 tile ranges with 2-byte stride, 200 elements each\n   - Ranges: [ESI+8], [ESI+0x328-400], [ESI+0x328], [ESI+0x328+400], [ESI+0x328+800], [ESI+0x328+0x4b0]\n   - Stride increment per iteration: 0x96e (2414 bytes)\n4. Store viewport parameters into object structure offsets (param_1-8 to offsets 0x12dc8-0x12e04)\n5. Initialize field offsets 0x12df4, 0x12df8, 0x12ddc-0x12de4, 0x12df0, 0x12e32 to zero or default values\n6. Change vtable pointer to PTR_FUN_6fba912c (second phase)\n7. Loop 32 times: Initialize word array at [ESI+0x198] with stride 0x96e\n   - Zero 7 word-indexed elements at offsets -200, 0, 200, 400, 600, 800, 1000 words\n   - Set dwords at word offsets 0x3eb=0, 0x3ed=1, 0x3e9=0\n8. Calculate viewport center and dimensions:\n   - nCenterX = nWidth + nOriginX - 0x12\n   - nCenterY = nOriginY + 0x10\n   - nScaleCount = max(1, (nHeight - 0x10) / 0x0c - 1) if nHeight >= 0x20, else 1\n9. Call Ordinal_10005 (Storm.DLL function)\n10. If Ordinal result == 2 AND fHasFilter != 0: set offset 0x12dd8 to 0x1c, else set to 0x12\n11. Restore exception handler (ExceptionList = local_c)\n12. Return this pointer\n\nParameters:\n  pSurface: void* - Pointer to viewport/surface object to initialize (ECX register)\n  nOriginX: dword - Horizontal origin coordinate\n  nOriginY: dword - Vertical origin coordinate\n  nWidth: dword - Viewport width in pixels\n  nHeight: dword - Viewport height in pixels\n  nTileCount: dword - Number of tile layers/planes\n  nPaletteId: dword - Palette color mode/index\n  nLightLevel: dword - Lighting intensity value\n  nScrollFlags: dword - Scrolling/wrapping mode flags\n  fHasFilter: byte - Filter enabled flag (0=off, non-0=on)\n\nReturns:\n  void* - Same pointer as pSurface parameter (pass-through constructor)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Magic numbers: 0x20 = 32 (loop iteration count), 0x96e = 2414 (stride per iteration)\n  - Magic numbers: 0x12dc8+ offsets = fixed object field locations\n  - Condition (nHeight >= 0x20) determines scale count calculation (division by 0x0c)\n  - Ordinal_10005 result (2 = some specific condition) controls filter size (0x1c vs 0x12)\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0x20 - 32 (loop count for initialization loops)\n  0x96e - 2414 bytes (stride increment between tile regions)\n  0x12dc8 - Object field base offset (origin X)\n  0x12dd0 - Width field offset\n  0x12dcc - Height field offset\n  0x12dd4 - Tile count field offset\n  0x12e04 - Palette ID field offset\n  0x12dd8 - Filter size field (0x12 or 0x1c based on condition)\n  0x12e26 - Constant 0x0e (14 decimal)\n  0x1c - Filter size when Ordinal_10005 returns 2 and filter enabled\n  0x12 - Filter size when Ordinal_10005 returns != 2 or filter disabled\n  0x0c - Divisor for scale count calculation (12 decimal)\n  0x10 - Offset constant (16 decimal)\n\nStructure Layout:\n  Offset    | Size | Field Name          | Type     | Description\n  ----------+------+---------------------+----------+----------------------------------------------------\n  0x0       | 4    | vtable              | void*    | Virtual method table pointer\n  0x8       | ?    | tileData1           | byte[?]  | First tile region (initialized via CallFunctionOnRange)\n  0x198     | ?    | tileData2           | ushort[] | Tile index/mode array (word stride 0x4b7)\n  0x12dc8   | 4    | originX             | dword    | Horizontal viewport origin\n  0x12dcc   | 4    | height              | dword    | Viewport height\n  0x12dd0   | 4    | width               | dword    | Viewport width\n  0x12dd4   | 4    | tileCount           | dword    | Number of tile planes\n  0x12dd8   | 4    | filterSize          | dword    | Filter kernel size (0x12/0x1c)\n  0x12ddc   | 4    | reserved1           | dword    | Reserved/padding (init to 0)\n  0x12de0   | 4    | reserved2           | dword    | Reserved/padding (init to 0)\n  0x12de4   | 4    | reserved3           | dword    | Reserved/padding (init to 0)\n  0x12de8   | 4    | reserved4           | dword    | Reserved/padding (init to 0)\n  0x12df0   | 4    | reserved5           | dword    | Reserved/padding (init to 0)\n  0x12df4   | 4    | initFlag1           | dword    | Initialization flag (set to -1/0xffffffff)\n  0x12df8   | 4    | initFlag2           | dword    | Initialization flag (set to -1/0xffffffff)\n  0x12e00   | 4    | paletteId           | dword    | Palette color index\n  0x12e04   | 4    | lightLevel          | dword    | Lighting intensity\n  0x12e08   | 2    | reserved6           | word     | Reserved (init to 0)\n  0x12e0a   | 4    | scrollFlags         | dword    | Scrolling/wrapping mode\n  0x12e0e   | 4    | initFlag3           | dword    | Initialization flag (set to 1)\n  0x12e1a   | 4    | centerX             | dword    | Calculated center X coordinate\n  0x12e1e   | 4    | centerY             | dword    | Calculated center Y coordinate\n  0x12e22   | 4    | scaleCount          | dword    | Calculated scale/zoom level\n  0x12e26   | 4    | constantVal         | dword    | Constant value 0x0e (14)\n  0x12e2a   | 4    | tileParam           | dword    | Tile parameter (param_5)\n  0x12e32   | 4    | reserved7           | dword    | Reserved (init to 0)",
