      "api_calls": ["GfxInterfaceCall84", "GfxInterfaceCall84", "GfxInterfaceCall84"],
      "instructions": ["0x4DEE0|SUB|ESP, 0x58", "0x4DEE3|XOR|EAX, EAX", "0x4DEE5|PUSH|EBX", "0x4DEE6|PUSH|EBP", "0x4DEE7|PUSH|ESI", "0x4DEE8|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x4DEEA|XOR|EBX, EBX", "0x4DEEC|PUSH|EDI", "0x4DEED|MOV|EBP, dword ptr [ESI + 0x12df0]", "0x4DEF3|MOV|BX, word ptr [ESI + 0x12e08]", "0x4DEFA|CMP|EBP, EBX", "0x4DEFC|MOV|dword ptr [ESI + 0x12e12], EAX", "0x4DF02|MOV|dword ptr [ESI + 0x12e16], EAX", "0x4DF08|MOV|dword ptr [ESI + 0x12e0e], EAX", "0x4DF0E|JGE|0x6fb1dfb9"],
      "comment": "Renders a UI scrollbar/slider control based on visible slot count and scroll position.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize scroll output fields (dwThumbStart, dwThumbEnd, nVisibleCount) to 0\n2. Load scroll index and total slot count from context structure\n3. Loop through slots starting at scroll index, checking 6 slot fields per row\n4. Each non-zero slot field adds itemHeight to accumulated height\n5. Add rowBaseHeight after each row; if height < maxHeight-20, increment visible count\n6. If all slots visible (visibleCount >= totalCount), exit early - no scrollbar needed\n7. Calculate scroll ratio using fixed-point: (visibleCount << 7) / totalCount\n8. Calculate thumb position based on scroll index position (start/middle/end)\n9. Initialize 72-byte GFX parameter buffer to zeros\n10. Set slider path resource, frame index, color parameters in buffer\n11. Render top cap segment (frame 0x10) at calculated Y position\n12. Loop: Render middle segments (frame 0x0E), incrementing Y by 12 each\n13. Render bottom cap segment (frame 0x0F) at final Y position\n14. Store final thumbStart and thumbEnd positions in context structure\n\nParameters:\nnSliderContext (ECX) - Pointer to UI slider context structure containing slot data and render params\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Results written to context at offsets 0x12E0E, 0x12E12, 0x12E16\n\nStructure Offsets:\n+0x198: Slot data array (stride 0x96E per slot row)\n+0x12DD4: Maximum render height\n+0x12DD8: Track height in pixels\n+0x12DF0: Current scroll index\n+0x12E08: Total slot count (ushort)\n+0x12E0E: Visible slot count (output)\n+0x12E12: Thumb start position (output)\n+0x12E16: Thumb end position (output)\n+0x12E1A: X coordinate for rendering\n+0x12E1E: Y base coordinate for rendering\n+0x12E26: Item height constant\n+0x12E2A: Row base height constant\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x96E (2414) - Slot row stride bytes; 0x4B7 (1207) - stride in shorts\n200/400/600/800 - Slot field offsets in shorts from row center\n0xC (12) - Y increment per scrollbar segment\n0x10/0x0E/0x0F - Top cap/middle/bottom cap frame indices\n0x12 (18) - GFX parameter array element count\n\nSpecial Cases:\nEarly exit if visibleCount >= totalCount (no scrollbar needed)\nThumb position clamped to track bounds when exceeding range",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Path", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_Skill", "STRUCT_ItemData", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
