      "comment": "Initialize a record slot with field values and configuration.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if current slot index < 0x20 (32 slots max)\n2. If valid:\n   a. Set primary field value at slot offset + 0x96a\n   b. Initialize counter at offset 0x12df8 to 0 if value is -1\n   c. For each enabled field flag (nField1-6):\n      - Call Unicode::strncpy to copy string data\n      - Clear field flag at slot-specific offset (0x196, 0x326, 0x4b6, 0x646, 0x7d6, 0x966)\n      - Increment counter at offset 0x12dfc\n   d. Set next slot's primary value:\n      - If nUseSecondary == 0: use dwSecondaryValue\n      - Otherwise: use value from offset 0x12e00\n   e. Set slot flags at offset + 0x972\n   f. Increment slot index at offset 0x12e08\n\nParameters:\n  pThis (void*) - IMPLICIT in ECX, pointer to record container\n  nField1Enable (int) - Nonzero enables field 1 processing\n  nField2Enable (int) - Nonzero enables field 2 processing\n  nField3Enable (int) - Nonzero enables field 3 processing\n  nField4Enable (int) - Nonzero enables field 4 processing\n  nField5Enable (int) - Nonzero enables field 5 processing\n  nField6Enable (int) - Nonzero enables field 6 processing\n  dwPrimaryValue (uint) - Primary value for current slot\n  dwSecondaryValue (uint) - Secondary value for next slot (if nUseSecondary=0)\n  nUseSecondary (int) - Condition: 0=use dwSecondaryValue, nonzero=use offset 0x12e00\n  dwSlotFlags (uint) - Flags to set at slot offset + 0x972\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Function silently returns if slot index >= 0x20 (no bounds error)\n  - Counter at 0x12df8 initialized to 0 only on first call (when -1)\n  - String operations called multiple times with same buffer parameters",
