      "comment": "Decrements active game timer and enforces boundary constraints on counter.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Retrieve timer counter from pUnit->timerCounter (offset 0x12df8)\n2. If counter > 0, decrement counter by 1\n3. Call visual update function FUN_6fb8d210(1, 0, 0.0, 0.0, 0) for animation state\n4. Load decremented counter value into nTempValue\n5. Compare counter against minimum bound at offset 0x12df0\n6. If counter < minimum, update minimum to equal counter (sync constraints)\n7. Load boundary range from offset 0x12e0e\n8. Calculate upper limit: range + minimum\n9. If counter >= upper limit, increment minimum to maintain valid range\n10. Return success code 1\n\nParameters:\npUnit (UnitAny *): Pointer to game unit with timer fields at fixed offsets\n\nReturns:\n1: Always returns success\n\nStructure Layout:\n| Offset  | Size | Field Name   | Type | Description\n| 0x12df8 | 4    | timerCounter | int  | Active countdown timer\n| 0x12df0 | 4    | minBound     | int  | Minimum boundary constraint\n| 0x12e0e | 4    | rangeValue   | int  | Range for upper bound calculation",
