      "comment": "Process item set bitmask properties and populate fields based on item type.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if item type is 5 (SET type)\n2. Get item extension data - error if null\n3. Check item extension type flag (offset 0x18):\n   - Type 0x01: Bitmask mode - iterate up to 6 items, check each bit in dwItemSlots\n   - Type 0x02: List mode - get count from lookup table, iterate through item array\n4. For each enabled item, call FUN_6fb20ce0 to populate item data\n\nParameters:\ndwItemSlots - IMPLICIT in ECX, bitmask of enabled item slots (one bit per item, max 6)\npItemInfo - IMPLICIT in EDX, pointer to item info structure with base+0x18 type flag\nszField1 - stack param, field name/path 1\nszField2 - stack param, field name/path 2\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x5 - Item type code for SET items\n0x18 - Offset of type flag within item extension structure\n0x01 - Type code for bitmask-based item list\n0x02 - Type code for indexed item list\n0x40 - Maximum index value (64) for indexed list lookup\n0x6fba9284 - Table of item counts indexed by dwItemSlots value\n0x6fba926c - Base address of item array",
      "tags": ["MOD_UI", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_Skill", "PARAM_4", "STRUCT_Other", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "SRC_mods.cpp", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
