      "comment": "Initializes the global Unicode string array for item attribute display.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load base address of g_awItemAttributeStrings array (0x6fbf8d65)\n2. Set loop counter to 0x28 (40 iterations)\n3. For each element, call Unicode::_default_constructor_closure_ to initialize\n4. Advance pointer by 2 bytes (sizeof(Unicode))\n5. Decrement counter and repeat until all 40 elements initialized\n6. Restore registers and return\n\nParameters: None\n\nReturns: void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Called during module initialization via function pointer table at 0x6fbae02c\n- Array spans 80 bytes total (40 elements * 2 bytes each)\n\nStructure Layout:\ng_awItemAttributeStrings is a Unicode[40] array starting at 0x6fbf8d65\nEach element is 2 bytes (wide character)\n\nRegister Usage:\nESI - Current array element pointer\nEDI - Loop counter (decrements from 0x28 to 0)",
