      "comment": "Initialize dialog for NPC talk interaction menu.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if talk dialog already exists; if yes, raise fatal error (0x734)\n2. Initialize dialog position/size variables (dwDialogX, dwDialogY) from game state\n3. If game state initialized, extract viewport coordinates from game context\n4. Calculate dialog position relative to viewport: dwDialogX -= rect.left, dwDialogY += (-0x96 - rect.top)\n5. Ensure minimum height constraint: if dwDialogY < 0x14 (20px), set to 0x14\n6. Create dialog structure with InitializeDialogStructure (position, handlers at 0x6fb225c0/0x6fb22610)\n7. Validate text list handle via FUN_6fb586b0(); if fails, raise error (0x743)\n8. Query Ordinal_10905 for count of available dialog lines\n9. Add fixed dialog line (LineId=0x15, TextColor=0, Mode=4)\n10. If current NPC has no dialog text at offset param_1*0x16 in DAT_6fbb60d4, add \"No Talk\" option (LAB_6fb22bb0)\n11. Add \"End Conversation\" option (LAB_6fb22790)\n12. Loop through all available lines: call Ordinal_10906 for each, add to dialog via AddDialogLine\n13. If g_dwGameState == 0xc9 (special state), add action option (LAB_6fb231a0)\n14. If g_dwGameState in {0x109, 0xf4, 0xf5, 0x208, 0xf6}, check current entity for \"box\" property:\n    a. Call Ordinal_10277 to get first list item from entity field at +0x84\n    b. Loop through items using Ordinal_10304; call Ordinal_10305/Ordinal_10746 to check property\n    c. If property == 0x20786f62 (\"box \" reversed), add special option (LAB_6fb23220) and break\n15. Add final \"Done\" option (LAB_6fb225c0)\n\nParameters:\nnTalkId (int) - NPC identifier used as index into DAT_6fbb60d4 dialog text table\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Initializes global DAT_6fbf8ebf (Dialog pointer) and DAT_6fbf8dd1 (current NPC id)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Raises fatal error if dialog already initialized (prevents concurrent dialogs)\n- Validates text list existence before proceeding\n- Magic constants: 0x96 (150px offset), 0x14 (20px min height), 0x20786f62 (\"box \" property code)\n- Conditional options based on game state (shopping, trading, special interactions)",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "SRC_npcmenu.cpp", "MOD_UI", "UI_DIALOG", "STRUCT_Inventory", "STRUCT_Skill", "STRUCT_ItemData", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
