      "comment": "Validate unit slot state and update validation flags.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize retry counter to 0x0A (10 attempts)\n2. Call FUN_6fb62880() to get current round configuration\n3. Load round identifier from offset +0x04\n4. Loop up to 10 times:\n   a. Decrement retry counter\n   b. Check if slot flags at [nSlotIndex+0x09] are set\n      - If YES: Call Ordinal_10918() to get random value\n      - If NO: Use 0 as random value\n   c. Store value at [nSlotIndex+0x0D]\n   d. If random value >= 2:\n      - Calculate slot offset: value * 0x0F + [nSlotIndex+0x05]\n      - Check if slot type at [offset+0x0B] matches current round OR equals 7\n      - If MATCH and [offset+0x02] != 0x00:\n        * Call Ordinal_11107(g_dwSlotDataBase, [offset+0x07], 0)\n        * Compare result with [current_random * 0x0F + [nSlotIndex+0x05] + 0x03]\n        * If MATCH:\n          - Verify [nSlotIndex+0x05] == g_aSlotValidationTable\n          - Check [g_aSlotValidationTable + current_random * 0x0F] == 0xFFFF\n          - Call Ordinal_11107(g_dwValidationMagic, 0x0C, 0x0D)\n          - If result == 1: Set [nSlotIndex+0x0D] = 2 and return SUCCESS\n   e. If retry counter == 0: Set [nSlotIndex+0x0D] = 2 and return TIMEOUT\n5. Return when validation completes\n\nParameters:\nnSlotIndex (IMPLICIT ECX) - Pointer to slot structure with validation context\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Updates validation result at [nSlotIndex+0x0D] (1=valid, 2=error/timeout)\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description\n0x00   | 4    | unknown0   | int  | Reserved\n0x04   | 4    | unknown4   | int  | Reserved\n0x05   | 4    | pSlotData  | int* | Pointer to slot data array\n0x09   | 4    | dwFlags    | uint | Slot state flags\n0x0D   | 4    | dwResult   | uint | Validation result (1=success, 2=error)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x0A - Retry limit (10 attempts)\n0x0F - Slot record stride\n0x0B - Slot type field offset\n0x02 - Slot validation flag offset\n0x07 - Slot data field offset\n0x03 - Slot value field offset\n0x05 - Slot data pointer field offset\n0x0C, 0x0D - Ordinal_11107 validation parameters\n0xFFFF - Validation magic value marker\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FUN_6fb62880() - Get current round configuration\n- Ordinal_10918() - Random number generator (RandSeed)\n- Ordinal_11107() - Cryptographic validation function (likely CRC/Hash)",
