      "comment": "Validate all active unit slots by iterating through slot array and calling validation routine.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load unit slot count from global g_dwUnitSlotCount\n2. Check if count > 0; if not, skip to marking complete and return\n3. Initialize slot pointer to g_aUnitSlots base address and loop counter to 0\n4. Loop: Call ValidateUnitSlot with current slot pointer\n5. Increment loop counter and advance pointer by 0x16 bytes to next slot\n6. Repeat loop until counter equals slot count\n7. Set validation state flag (byte at g_dwValidationState + 2) to 1\n8. Return\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If unit slot count is 0 or negative, validation is skipped but flag is still set\n- Each slot entry is 0x16 (22) bytes in size\n- Flag is set to indicate validation complete regardless of slot count\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x16 (22 decimal) - Size of each unit slot entry in array",
