      "instructions": ["0x530A0|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [0x6fbf8ebf]", "0x530A6|PUSH|ESI", "0x530A7|PUSH|EDI", "0x530A8|CALL|0x6fb00d60", "0x530AD|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [0x6fbf8dd1]", "0x530B3|LEA|EDX, [ECX + ECX*0x4]", "0x530B6|LEA|ECX, [ECX + EDX*0x2]", "0x530B9|MOV|DL, byte ptr [ECX*0x2 + 0x6fbb60d4]", "0x530C0|NEG|DL", "0x530C2|SBB|EDX, EDX", "0x530C4|ADD|EDX, 0x3", "0x530C7|MOV|EDI, EDX", "0x530C9|CMP|EAX, EDI", "0x530CB|JL|0x6fb23194", "0x530D1|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbf8e79]"],
      "comment": "Handle user selection of a dialog line from NPC talk menu.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get current dialog selection index from g_pCurrentTalkDialog via GetUnitField\n2. Calculate base offset: 3 minus 1 if NPC has text at g_aNPCDialogTextTable[g_nCurrentNPCId*0x16]\n3. Validate selection is within valid range (index >= offset) and game state initialized\n4. Find player unit via FindUnitInHashTable(g_pGameStateObject, 1)\n5. If player found, get text list handle via GetAutomapHandle\n6. Assert text list handle is valid (error 0x6DD if NULL, fatal exit)\n7. Calculate actual text index: selection - offset\n8. Get string ID from text list using GetStringIndexFromList\n9. Store selected text ID in g_wSelectedDialogTextId\n10. Re-fetch player unit for InitializeGameAfterLoad call\n11. Call InitializeGameAfterLoad(pPlayer, nTextId) to process selection\n12. Set g_bDialogSelectionMade flag byte to 1\n13. Register callback LAB_6fb22a20 via InitializeStateCallbackAndData\n14. Close dialog via CloseDialogAndCleanup\n15. Clear g_pCurrentTalkDialog pointer\n16. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\nNone (callback handler, uses global state)\n\nReturns:\nint - 1 if selection processed successfully, 0 if validation failed\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Returns 0 early if selection index less than calculated offset\n- Returns 0 early if g_dwGameStateInitialized is 0\n- Returns 0 early if player unit not found in hash table\n- Fatal exit with code -1 if text list handle is NULL\n\nGlobal State Modified:\n- g_wSelectedDialogTextId: Set to selected string ID\n- g_bDialogSelectionMade: Set to 1 on successful selection\n- g_pCurrentTalkDialog: Cleared to NULL after processing\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x16 (22): Stride for NPC dialog text table entries\n- 0x6DD (1757): Assert line number for NULL text list\n- 3: Base dialog line offset (accounts for fixed menu items)",
