      "comment": "Closes NPC interaction dialog and performs cleanup based on player interaction state.\n\nClassification: Worker function - handles NPC dialog cleanup with branching logic\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Close server socket dialog if open (g_pServerSocketDialog)\n2. Find player unit in hash table (unit type 1 = player)\n3. Check if player has active NPC interaction (offset 0x84 != 0)\n4. If active NPC interaction:\n   a. Set inventory dialog state to 3\n   b. Set game state flags to 1\n   c. Process UI state change (type 0xC)\n   d. Send packet 0x38 subcommand 2 (NPC interaction update)\n   e. Store current game context\n   f. Clear dialog state word\n   g. Return 1 (early exit)\n5. If no active NPC interaction:\n   a. Get game context and clear inventory slots if valid\n   b. Log warning if game state object changed unexpectedly\n   c. Find and clear game units linked list\n   d. Initialize pending unit inventory state if flagged\n   e. Clear pending unit flag and pointer\n   f. Find player unit again and set flag bit 0x02 at offset 0xE8\n   g. Send packet 0x30 (game shutdown notification)\n   h. Process game shutdown\n   i. Clear game state initialized flag\n   j. Process UI state change (type 0x08)\n   k. Modify word flags at unit offset 0x70 (clear bit 8)\n   l. Clear unit state and process transition\n   m. Return 1\n\nParameters: None\n\nReturns:\n  int - Always returns 1 (success)\n\nGlobals Accessed:\n  g_pServerSocketDialog (0x6fbf8ebb) - Server socket dialog pointer\n  g_pGameStateObject (0x6fbf8e75) - Game state object pointer\n  g_fInventoryDialogOpen (0x6fbf8dbb) - Inventory dialog open state\n  g_dwGameStateFlags (0x6fbf8efc) - Game state flags\n  g_pCurrentPlayerSlot (0x6fbf8f20) - Current player slot pointer\n  g_wDialogState (0x6fbf8f24) - Dialog state word\n  g_dwPendingUnitFlag (0x6fbf8f00) - Pending unit flag\n  g_pPendingUnit (0x6fbf8f04) - Pending unit pointer\n  g_dwGameStateInitialized (0x6fbf8e79) - Game state initialized flag\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x84 - Offset to dwInteractingNPC field in player unit\n  0xE8 - Offset to unit state flags\n  0x70 - Offset to word flags pointer\n  0x3A - DWORD array index for state flags (offset 0xE8 = 0x3A * 4)\n  0x21 - DWORD array index for NPC interaction (offset 0x84 = 0x21 * 4)\n  0x1C - DWORD array index for word flags ptr (offset 0x70 = 0x1C * 4)\n  0x02 - State flag bit set during cleanup\n  0x08 - Word flag bit cleared during cleanup\n  0x30 - Packet ID for game shutdown\n  0x38 - Packet ID for NPC interaction update\n  0x0C - UI state type for NPC dialog\n  0x08 - UI state type for game state\n\nCalled From: Function pointer table at 0x6fbb68c8",
