      "comment": "Close all open game interface dialogs and reset their state flags.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check g_fGameNpcIdValidation flag; if set, close dialog and clear flag\n2. Check g_dwGameNpcDialogFlags flag; if set, close dialog and clear flag\n3. Check g_dwStashDialogFlags flag; if set, close dialog and clear flag\n4. Check g_dwInventoryDialogFlags flag; if set, close dialog and clear flag\n5. Check g_dwCharacterPanelFlags flag; if set, close dialog and clear flag\n6. Check g_dwSkillTreeDialogFlags flag; if set, close dialog and clear flag\n7. Check g_dwQuestLogDialogFlags flag; if set, close dialog and clear flag\n\nParameters:\n(none)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Function always succeeds\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Each dialog flag is independently checked; partial closures possible if some fail\n- Calling CloseDialogAndCleanup on already-closed dialogs is safe (no-op)\n- Global state is atomically updated after each closure\n\nRelated Functions:\n- CloseDialogAndCleanup() - Closes individual dialog UI element\n- FUN_6fb283e0() - Caller: Game shutdown sequence\n- FUN_6fb244c0() - Caller: Menu state transition",
