      "comment": "Closes server socket dialog if active and initializes game state for new session.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if server socket dialog pointer (g_pServerSocketDialog) is non-zero\n2. If dialog active, call CloseDialogAndCleanup() to close it\n3. Clear g_pServerSocketDialog to NULL after closing\n4. Call ProcessUIStateChange(8, 1, 0) to deactivate UI element 8 (party/social panel)\n5. Call UpdateTimeoutValue() to refresh timeout with 100ms offset\n6. Call InitializeGameUIState() to reset viewport and cursor globals to invalid\n7. Set g_dwGameStateMode to 7 (game active mode)\n8. Clear g_dwUnknownState to 0\n9. Call InitializeGameDataAndProcess(g_pGameStateObject) to start game initialization\n\nParameters:\nNone (void function)\n\nReturns:\n1 - Always returns success (EAX set to 1 before RET)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Dialog cleanup only performed if g_pServerSocketDialog is non-NULL\n- UI element 8 is unconditionally deactivated regardless of dialog state\n- Function is registered as callback in UI state tables (callers FUN_6fb24890, FUN_6fb24920, FUN_6fb24950)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n8 - UI element ID for party/social panel\n1 - UI state: deactivate\n7 - Game state mode: active game session\n0x6fbf8ebb - g_pServerSocketDialog address\n0x6fbf8dbb - g_dwGameStateMode address\n0x6fbf8e81 - g_dwUnknownState address\n0x6fbf8e75 - g_pGameStateObject address",
