      "instructions": ["0x54FE0|PUSH|ECX", "0x54FE1|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [0x6fbf8ebb]", "0x54FE7|PUSH|EBX", "0x54FE8|XOR|EBX, EBX", "0x54FEA|PUSH|ESI", "0x54FEB|CMP|ECX, EBX", "0x54FED|JZ|0x6fb24ffa", "0x54FEF|CALL|0x6fb005c0", "0x54FF4|MOV|dword ptr [0x6fbf8ebb], EBX", "0x54FFA|PUSH|EDI", "0x54FFB|MOV|dword ptr [0x6fbf8dbb], EBX", "0x55001|CALL|0x6fb15c00", "0x55006|MOV|EDI, dword ptr [0x6fbf8e75]", "0x5500C|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0xc], EDI", "0x55010|CALL|0x6fb62880"],
      "comment": "Callback for closing inventory dialog and cleaning up game state.\n\nCalled when NPC inventory dialog is closed. Performs comprehensive cleanup\nof dialog resources, inventory state, and unit tracking data.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Close server socket dialog if open, clear g_pServerSocketDialog\n2. Reset g_fNpcDialogActive flag to 0\n3. Call InitializeGameUIState to reset UI\n4. Get game context and clear unit inventory slots if valid\n5. Validate game state consistency; log if g_pGameStateObject changed\n6. Find player unit in hash table\n7. If player unit found:\n   a. Clear g_adwGameUnitArray (160 bytes, stride 16)\n   b. Get inventory unit from player offset 0x84\n   c. Iterate inventory nodes, removing each unit from hash table\n   d. Call ClearInventory and ClearInventoryData on inventory unit\n8. If pending unit exists (g_dwPendingUnitFlag != 0):\n   - Call InitializeInventoryItemState for g_pPendingUnit\n9. Clear g_dwPendingUnitFlag and g_pPendingUnit\n10. Find player unit again, set state flag 0x2 at offset 0xE8\n11. Send packet 0x30 (inventory close) with unit ID\n12. Call ProcessGameShutdown\n13. Clear g_dwGameStateInitialized\n14. Call ProcessUIStateChange(8, 1, 0) for first UI transition\n15. If player unit valid:\n    - Call ModifyWordFlags on unit offset 0x1C with flag 8\n    - Call ClearUnitStateAndProcessTransition\n16. Call ProcessUIStateChange(8, 1, 0) again for final transition\n\nParameters:\n(void) - No parameters; uses global state\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Dialog may already be closed (g_pServerSocketDialog == 0)\n- Game context may be null (skips inventory slot clearing)\n- Player unit may not exist in hash table (skips inventory cleanup)\n- Inventory unit at offset 0x84 may be null (skips inventory iteration)\n- Pending unit processing conditional on g_dwPendingUnitFlag\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x84 - Offset to inventory unit pointer in player structure\n0xE8 - Offset to unit state flags (sets bit 0x2)\n0x1C - Offset to word flags in unit structure (flag 8)\n0x30 - Packet ID for inventory close notification\n0x3A - Offset to state flags (uint) in player unit\n0x21 - DWORD offset to inventory pointer (0x84 / 4)\n0x6fbf8e7d - End address for game unit array clear loop\n16 (0x10) - Stride for game unit array clear loop",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_0"]
    },
