      "comment": "Clear game status flags and notify game state of player activity\n \nAlgorithm:\n1. Reset g_dwGameStatusFlags to 0 (clear all status bits)\n2. Call SendPacketWithSubcommand to send update packet with:\n   - Subcommand 0x38 (game state update)\n   - Data from g_pGameStateObject\n   - dwUpdateFlags parameter passed to this function\n\nParameters:\ndwUpdateFlags - Status update flags passed to packet transmission (ECX register via __fastcall)\n\nReturns:\nvoid (no return value)\n\nNote: g_dwGameStatusFlags tracks active game status; clearing it here indicates \nstate transition or reset. The 0x38 subcommand appears to be a game status update\nin the packet protocol.",
