      "instructions": ["0x55650|PUSH|ECX", "0x55651|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [0x6fbf8ebb]", "0x55657|PUSH|EBX", "0x55658|XOR|EBX, EBX", "0x5565A|PUSH|ESI", "0x5565B|CMP|ECX, EBX", "0x5565D|JZ|0x6fb2566a", "0x5565F|CALL|0x6fb005c0", "0x55664|MOV|dword ptr [0x6fbf8ebb], EBX", "0x5566A|PUSH|EDI", "0x5566B|MOV|dword ptr [0x6fbf8dbb], EBX", "0x55671|CALL|0x6fb15c00", "0x55676|MOV|EDI, dword ptr [0x6fbf8e75]", "0x5567C|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0xc], EDI", "0x55680|CALL|0x6fb62880"],
      "comment": "Performs complete game session cleanup and shutdown sequence.\n\nCleans up dialog state, clears unit inventory data, removes units from hash tables,\nsends shutdown packets to server, and resets game state flags.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Close server socket dialog if open and clear g_pServerSocketDialog\n2. Reset g_fInventoryDialogOpen flag to 0\n3. Initialize game UI state via InitializeGameUIState()\n4. Save current g_pGameStateObject as nUnitId for consistency check\n5. Get game context and clear unit inventory slots if context valid\n6. Log error if g_pGameStateObject changed during operation (race condition)\n7. Find player unit in hash table by saved nUnitId\n8. If unit found:\n   a. Zero out g_adwGameUnitArray (160 bytes, stride 0x10)\n   b. Get unit's inventory pointer at offset 0x84\n   c. For each inventory node: get next node, get field, remove from hash table\n   d. Clear inventory and inventory data for unit\n9. If pending unit flag set, initialize pending unit's inventory item state\n10. Clear g_dwPendingUnitFlag and g_pPendingUnit\n11. Re-find player unit and set flag 0x02 at offset 0xE8 (marks unit for cleanup)\n12. Send packet 0x30 (shutdown notification) with unit ID\n13. Call ProcessGameShutdown() for final shutdown processing\n14. Clear g_dwGameStateInitialized flag\n15. Trigger UI state change (state 8, flag 1)\n16. If unit valid, modify word flags at offset 0x70 and clear unit state\n17. Trigger final UI state change (state 8, flag 1)\n18. Send packet 0x38 subcommand 0x4B with game state object\n\nParameters: None (void function)\n\nReturns: void\n\nDecompiler Variables (SSA temporaries):\n- nUnitId (dword): Saved g_pGameStateObject for consistency check\n- pvVar1 (void*): Game context pointer from GetGameContext()\n- pUnit_00 (UnitAny*): Cast game context for ClearUnitInventorySlots\n- piVar2 (int*): Player unit pointer from FindUnitInHashTable\n- puVar4 (undefined4*): Loop iterator for clearing g_adwGameUnitArray\n- pUnit (UnitAny_conflict*): Unit inventory pointer at offset 0x84\n- pNode (InventoryData*): Current inventory node in traversal loop\n- pIVar3 (InventoryData*): Next inventory node\n- pUnit_01 (uint*): Re-fetched player unit for flag modification\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Validates g_pGameStateObject consistency to detect race conditions\n- Handles case where server dialog is already closed\n- Handles case where no unit found in hash table\n- Handles pending unit cleanup separately from main unit\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x84: Inventory pointer offset in UnitAny structure\n- 0xE8: Unit flags offset (bit 0x02 = pending cleanup)\n- 0x70: Word flags pointer offset in UnitAny\n- 0x30: Shutdown notification packet ID\n- 0x38: Subcommand packet ID\n- 0x4B: Exit game subcommand\n- 0x10: Stride for g_adwGameUnitArray clear loop\n- 0x6fbf8e7d: End address for unit array clear",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_0"]
