      "comment": "Initialize game state including dialog flags, game state array, and UI asset paths.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Clear loading dialog initialization flags (g_fLoadingDialogInitialized, g_fLoadingDialogDisplayed)\n2. Set loading dialog timeout to current tick count via Ordinal_11111(0)\n3. Clear game state flags field (g_dwGameStateFlags = 0)\n4. Initialize 87-dword game state buffer starting at g_abGameStateFlags with zero values\n5. Allocate slot data base via Ordinal_11111(0), store in g_dwSlotDataBase\n6. Allocate validation magic via Ordinal_11111(0), store in g_dwValidationMagic\n7. Clear initialization flag at ram0x6fbf8dbb\n8. Build UI buysell panel path via FUN_6fb9a261, concatenate and store in g_pdwUIBuySellPath\n9. Build UI gold button path via FUN_6fb9a261, concatenate and store in g_pdwUIGoldButtonPath\n10. Zero initialization attempt counter (g_dwInitializationAttemptCounter = 0)\n11. Clear remaining initialization state bytes\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\nMagic numbers: 0x57 (87 dwords for game state buffer size)\nImplicit ordinal calls to allocate memory (Ordinal_11111)",
