      "comment": "Shutdown game session and close all UI dialogs during logout or game termination.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Clear game data base and validation magic values via Ordinal_11112\n2. Reset g_dwSlotDataBase and g_dwValidationMagic to zero\n3. Report any pending character creation errors stored in g_dwCharacterCreationError\n4. Report any pending server connection errors stored in g_dwServerConnectionError\n5. Invoke dialog callback if set (g_pDialogCallback) with parameter 1\n6. Close loading progress dialog and clear reference\n7. Close character selection dialog and clear reference\n8. Close server connecting flag and clear reference\n9. Close server socket dialog and clear reference\n10. Close character dialog and clear reference\n11. Close UI state dialog and clear reference\n12. Close current talk dialog and clear reference\n\nParameters:\nNone - operates on global dialog and state variables\n\nReturns:\nvoid - cleanup function with no return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- All dialog pointers checked before closure to prevent null pointer dereference\n- Error reporting occurs before dialog cleanup\n- Ordinal_11112 called twice with different global parameters (slot data base, validation magic)",
