      "instructions": ["0x56280|PUSH|ESI", "0x56281|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x56283|TEST|ESI, ESI", "0x56285|JNZ|0x6fb262a5", "0x56287|PUSH|0xf37", "0x5628C|PUSH|0x6fbb6c70", "0x56291|PUSH|0x6fbb6df8", "0x56296|CALL|0x6fb99a7a", "0x5629B|ADD|ESP, 0xc", "0x5629E|PUSH|-0x1", "0x562A0|CALL|0x6fb9a10f", "0x562A5|CMP|word ptr [ESI + 0x1], 0x3", "0x562AA|JNZ|0x6fb262ff", "0x562AC|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbf8e79]", "0x562B1|TEST|EAX, EAX"],
      "comment": "Validates game slot structure and initializes global slot state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate slot index parameter is not null; if zero, call exit handler with error code 0xf37\n2. Extract slot type from offset +1 in slot structure\n3. If slot type is 3 AND game state initialized, attempt to get active game state object\n4. If game state retrieved successfully, check if slot already initialized via g_dwSlotInitialized flag\n5. If first initialization, log notification message with code 0xf43 via Ordinal_10029\n6. Mark slot as initialized by setting g_dwSlotInitialized = 1\n7. Store slot type in g_wSlotType for later queries\n8. If game state unavailable or type mismatch, log error code 0xf4c and return\n\nParameters:\n  int nSlotIndex - Pointer to game slot structure with type field at offset +1\n\nReturns:\n  void - Initializes g_dwSlotInitialized and g_wSlotType on success\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Calls non-returning Ordinal_10023 on null slot (process exit)\n  - Expects slot type value 3 at structure offset +1\n  - Defers initialization if game state not ready\n\nGlobals Modified:\n  g_dwSlotInitialized (uint) - Set to 1 after slot validated\n  g_wSlotType (ushort) - Stores type from slot structure offset +1",
