      "comment": "Copies 0x60 bytes from global quest validation buffer to destination.\n\nClassification: Worker function - copies quest state data from global source\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load address of g_dwValidationMagic global (source buffer)\n2. Push parameters: nClearProgress=0, nBufSize=0x60, pdwDestBuffer (ECX), source ptr\n3. Call CopyQuestBuffer to perform the memcpy-like operation\n4. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\n  pdwDestBuffer (ECX) - dword * - Destination buffer to receive 0x60 bytes of quest data\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Source is always g_dwValidationMagic global at 0x6fbf8e97\n  - Buffer size is fixed at 0x60 (96) bytes\n  - nClearProgress=0 indicates copy-only, no state reset\n  - Called by CopyQuestBufferAtOffset1 which adjusts dest ptr by +1 before calling\n\nRelated Functions:\n  - CopyQuestBuffer @ 0x6fb98a4c: Underlying copy implementation\n  - CopyQuestBufferAtOffset1: Wrapper that adds +1 offset to dest\n  - GetValidationMagic: Returns the g_dwValidationMagic value\n  - InitializeGameState: Writes to g_dwValidationMagic\n  - ValidateUnitSlot: Reads g_dwValidationMagic for validation",
