      "comment": "Search array for value match.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract count from g_wSearchArrayCount (upper byte as ushort)\n2. If count is 0 or negative, return 1 (not found)\n3. Initialize loop counter to 0, pointer to g_awSearchArray\n4. Loop: compare current array element with nSearchValue\n5. If match found, return count << 8 (0 success code)\n6. Increment counter and advance pointer by 2 bytes (short size)\n7. Continue until counter >= count\n8. If no match found, return CONCAT31(count, 1) (1 = not found)\n\nParameters:\nnSearchValue (short) - Value to search for in array, passed in CX register\n\nReturns:\nint - High byte: element count; Low byte: 0 if found, 1 if not found\n\nStructure Layout:\ng_awSearchArray: Array of shorts to search through\ng_wSearchArrayCount: Count of elements in search array",
