      "comment": "Search unit slot array for matching game state value.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load max unit slot count from g_dwMaxUnitSlots\n2. Initialize counter (nSlotIndex=0) and found flag (fFound=false)\n3. If no slots exist, return 0\n4. Iterate through unit slot array (g_aUnitSlotArray):\n   - Load pointer to current slot (0x16 bytes per entry)\n   - Load game state value from g_dwGameState\n   - Compare slot value with target game state\n   - If match found: set fFound=true, break loop\n   - If no match: increment counter, advance pointer by 0x16 bytes\n5. Return slot index if found, else return 0\n\nParameters:\n(none)\n\nReturns:\n0-based slot index if game state found in array, 0 if not found or array empty\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description\n0x00   | 0x4  | value      | int  | Game state value per slot\n0x04   | 0x12 | reserved   | byte[18] | Padding/metadata\n\nRelated Functions:\n- InitializeGameLoad() - calls this function to locate game state slot\n- g_dwGameState - global target value for search\n- g_aUnitSlotArray - global array storage",
