      "comment": "Initializes and displays the server connection dialog during game load.\n\nClassification: Initialization function - sets up server connection UI state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Close existing server socket dialog if present\n2. Log a 5-byte packet (type 0x62) for network tracking\n3. Set ram0x6fbf8dbb to 10 (connection state indicator)\n4. Initialize dialog position to (0, 0)\n5. If game state is initialized:\n   a. Find player unit in hash table (unit type 1)\n   b. If player unit found:\n      - Get player unit coordinates\n      - Extract coordinate rect from game context\n      - Get field values (X, Y offsets) from game context\n      - Calculate dialog rect using SetRect\n      - Adjust Y position: subtract (0x96 + rect.top) from Y\n      - Adjust X position: subtract rect.left from X\n      - Clamp Y position to minimum of 0x14 (20)\n6. Create dialog via InitializeDialogStructure at calculated position\n7. Set 60-second timeout (GetTickCount + 60000)\n8. Clear server connection timeout counter\n9. Set dialog field value to 0\n10. Validate string ID 0xD19 (connection status message)\n11. Add dialog line with white text (color 0xF)\n\nParameters:\n  None (reads from global game state)\n\nReturns:\n  1: Always returns success (EAX = 1)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - If no player unit found, dialog positioned at (0, 0)\n  - Y position clamped to minimum 20 pixels from top\n  - Existing dialog is closed before creating new one\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x62: Packet type for server connection logging\n  0x96 (150): Vertical offset adjustment for dialog placement\n  0x14 (20): Minimum Y position for dialog\n  0xD19 (3353): String ID for connection status message\n  60000: Timeout in milliseconds (60 seconds)\n  0xF (15): White text color for dialog line\n\nGlobals Accessed:\n  g_pServerSocketDialog (0x6fbf8ebb): Current server socket dialog pointer\n  g_pGameStateObject (0x6fbf8e75): Game state object pointer\n  g_dwGameStateInitialized (0x6fbf8e79): Game initialization flag\n  g_pGameContext (0x6fbe9290): Game context for coordinate extraction\n  g_fServerConnecting (0x6fbf8eb7): Server connecting dialog pointer\n  g_dwServerStateChangeTime (0x6fbf8ea3): Timeout deadline timestamp\n  g_dwServerConnectionTimeout (0x6fbf8ea7): Connection timeout counter\n  ram0x6fbf8dbb: Connection state indicator",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_Skill", "PARAM_0", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
