      "comment": "Initialize dialog option state for a specified slot.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate state block offset: nSlotIndex * 0x27 (39 bytes per slot)\n2. Set flag field (offset 0) to 0x02 (DIALOG_OPTION_ACTIVE)\n3. Zero name length field (offset 8, word)\n4. Zero unused field (offset 16, dword)\n5. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\nnSlotIndex (int) - 0-based slot index, offset into dialog option array\n\nReturns:\nvoid - no return value\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x27 (39) - bytes per dialog option state structure\n0x02 - DIALOG_OPTION_ACTIVE flag value\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description\n0      | 4    | dwState    | uint | Dialog option state/flags\n8      | 2    | wNameLen   | word | Character name length (unused here)\n16     | 4    | dwUnused   | uint | Unused field (zeroed)",
