      "comment": "Initializes the Game Load Dialog during game state setup\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if game state is initialized; if not, reset UI state and return\n2. Allocate game state object via FUN_6fb60e10\n3. If UI dialog already exists, trigger fatal error (0xce2)\n4. Extract coordinate rectangle from game context\n5. Get viewport position (field 24/28) from game context\n6. Calculate dialog offset and enforce minimum height (0x14 pixels)\n7. Create dialog structure with calculated position and resource references\n8. Initialize Unicode string buffer (160 chars) for player name\n9. Fetch player name via FUN_6fb638b0 and copy to local buffer\n10. Convert name to lowercase using _toLowerTable lookup\n11. Populate dialog with two menu items (Game Load options)\n12. Set initial dialog line index to 1\n\nParameters: None\n\nReturns: void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If game state not initialized: performs emergency reset\n- Minimum dialog height enforced: 0x14 pixels (20 pixels)\n- Player name conversion uses character table lookup for > 0xFF\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x6fb279b0 - Dialog resource callback\n0x6fb27830 - Dialog resource 1\n0x6fb27b30 - Dialog resource 2\n0xce2 - Error code for duplicate dialog\n0x100 - Character code threshold for lowercase lookup\n0x14 - Minimum dialog height (20 pixels)\n0x96 - Dialog top position offset (-150 decimal)\n0x15 - Dialog line ID\n0xf - Dialog line height constant\n0x50 - Unicode string buffer capacity (160 chars / 2 bytes)",
      "tags": ["MOD_UI", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "STRUCT_ItemData", "PARAM_0", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData", "STRUCT_MonsterData", "PROP_LARGE", "SRC_npcmenu.cpp", "UI_DIALOG", "STRUCT_Skill"]
