      "comment": "Processes user selection in the game load dialog - handles both unit selection and game exit\n\nClassification: Callback/Handler - invoked from InitializeGameLoadDialog as menu callback\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Close existing UI dialog if present (g_pUIStateDialog cleanup)\n2. Check if game state is initialized (g_dwGameStateInitialized)\n3. If game state initialized AND player unit found:\n   a. Lookup player unit via FindUnitInHashTable with type=1\n   b. Call InitializeGameAfterLoad with unit and selected unit ID\n   c. Add selected unit ID to search history array (max 9 entries)\n   d. Initialize state callback if next target valid, else clear state flag\n   e. Send packet 0x31 (game load confirm) to server\n   f. Return early (successful unit selection path)\n4. If game state NOT initialized OR no unit found (shutdown path):\n   a. Clear state flag at 0x6fbf8dbb\n   b. Initialize game UI state\n   c. Clear unit inventory slots if game context exists\n   d. Initialize game unit arrays\n   e. Set unit flag +0xE8 bit 1 (0x02) to mark pending shutdown\n   f. Send packet 0x30 (game exit) to server\n   g. Process game shutdown\n   h. Clear game state initialized flag\n   i. Trigger UI state change (state 8)\n   j. Modify unit word flags and clear unit state\n\nParameters: None (callback signature)\n\nReturns: int - Always returns 1 (EAX = 1 at both exit points)\n\nGlobals Accessed:\n- g_pUIStateDialog (0x6fbf8ec7) - Current UI dialog pointer\n- g_dwGameStateInitialized (0x6fbf8e79) - Game state initialization flag\n- g_pGameStateObject (0x6fbf8e75) - Game state object ID/handle\n- g_wSelectedUnitId (0x6fbf8dc7) - Currently selected unit ID (word)\n- g_wSearchArrayCount (0x6fbf8efa) - Search history count (max 9)\n- g_awSearchArray (0x6fbf8ee6) - Search history array of unit IDs\n- g_wNextTargetUnitId (0x6fbf8dc9) - Next target unit ID (-1 if none)\n- g_abGameStateFlags+1 (0x6fbf8db9) - Game state flags byte\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x31 - Packet type: Game load confirm (unit selection)\n0x30 - Packet type: Game exit request\n0xE8 - Unit struct offset to flags dword\n0x70 - Unit struct offset to word flags pointer\n0x02 - Unit flag bit: pending shutdown marker\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Search history capped at 9 entries (index < 9)\n- Next target ID of -1 (0xFFFF) indicates no target\n- State callback registered at LAB_6fb26e20 when target valid",
      "tags": ["PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_0"]
    },
