      "instructions": ["0x58280|PUSH|ECX", "0x58281|PUSH|EBX", "0x58282|PUSH|ESI", "0x58283|XOR|EBX, EBX", "0x58285|PUSH|EDI", "0x58286|PUSH|EBX", "0x58287|MOV|EDX, 0x1", "0x5828C|MOV|ECX, 0xc", "0x58291|CALL|0x6fb5d370", "0x58296|MOV|dword ptr [0x6fbf8dbb], EBX", "0x5829C|CALL|0x6fb15c00", "0x582A1|MOV|EDI, dword ptr [0x6fbf8e75]", "0x582A7|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0xc], EDI", "0x582AB|CALL|0x6fb62880", "0x582B0|TEST|EAX, EAX"],
      "comment": "Manages game state transition: initializes UI, clears game units, processes entity state changes, and updates player presence.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Save current game state object (g_pGameStateObject)\n2. Initialize game UI display (call InitializeGameUIState)\n3. Verify game state didn't change during initialization - error if mismatch\n4. Retrieve player unit data pointer using FUN_6fb60e10\n5. If player unit exists: clear entire game unit array [0x6fbf8ddd..0x6fbf8e7d]\n6. Get first unit node from player data[0x84] offset\n7. Iterate all linked unit nodes: call Ordinal_10277 (GetFirstUnit), Ordinal_10304 (GetNextUnit), Ordinal_10305 (GetUnitData)\n8. For each unit node with valid data: call FUN_6fb60ff0(data[8], data[0]) - likely unit initialization\n9. Clean up unit node list: call Ordinal_10279, Ordinal_10251\n10. If pending unit flag set: deactivate pending unit via FUN_6fb8d060\n11. Clear pending unit globals (g_dwPendingUnitFlag, g_pPendingUnit)\n12. Set player unit flag [0xe8] |= 0x02 (mark as active state)\n13. Send state change packet (0x30=GameStateUpdate) to server\n14. Call FUN_6fb58710 - likely update game logic/timers\n15. Clear game initialization flag (g_dwGameStateInitialized = 0)\n16. Finalize UI state: call FUN_6fb796e0, FUN_6fb86790\n\nParameters:\nNone - operates on global game state (g_pGameStateObject)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - modifies globals, returns nothing\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Game state mismatch detected during initialization triggers error log\n- Missing player unit causes early exit (steps 5-9 skipped)\n- No pending unit skips step 10\n- Function toggles multiple global state flags for game readiness",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_0"]
    },
