      "api_calls": ["CalculateEquipmentRepairCost", "IsItemNormalQuality", "IsItemNormalQuality", "GetItemQualityStatByte", "ItemCanHaveSockets", "GetItemTotalSocketCount", "GetTotalStatValue", "GetItemQualityLevelByte", "GetTotalStatValue", "GetItemMaxDurability", "...+14 more"],
      "instructions": ["0x58680|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbf8e79]", "0x58685|PUSH|EBX", "0x58686|PUSH|EBP", "0x58687|PUSH|ESI", "0x58688|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x5868A|PUSH|EDI", "0x5868B|MOV|ESI, EDX", "0x5868D|MOV|EBP, ECX", "0x5868F|MOV|EBX, 0x1", "0x58694|JZ|0x6fb286a5", "0x58696|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [0x6fbf8e75]", "0x5869C|MOV|EDX, EBX", "0x5869E|CALL|0x6fb60e10", "0x586A3|JMP|0x6fb286a7", "0x586A5|XOR|EAX, EAX"],
      "comment": "Process player interaction with a game unit (NPC, monster, object).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Retrieve game state pointer from g_pGameStateObject\n2. If bInitialize (param_8) is set:\n   - Validate game state is active\n   - Get current game state\n   - Verify nMonsterMode is initialized\n   - Initialize unit with slot data and frame count\n   - Store nParam4/nParam5 in global state\n   - Set g_dwUnknownState = 3\n   - Trigger unit validation\n   - Return 1 (success)\n3. Otherwise, process normal interaction:\n   - Check nMonsterMode state via Ordinal_10751\n   - If state == 4, return 0 (invalid)\n   - If bForceAction, verify 500ms cooldown\n   - Store parameters in global state\n   - Process based on nInteractionMode (1 = action, other = default)\n   - Validate unit type via class ID (0xfd, 0x9a, 0xb2, 0xfe, 0x101, 0x1ff)\n   - Check monster validity and properties\n   - Determine slot offset and flags\n   - Set state to 1 or 2 based on interaction type\n4. Store interaction data in globals\n5. Call ValidateUnitSelection and FUN_6fb28b20\n6. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n- pUnit (ECX): Unit pointer\n- nMonsterMode (EDX): Monster/entity mode value\n- nInteractionMode (Stack[0x4]): Interaction type (1=action, other=default)\n- nParam4 (Stack[0x8]): Additional parameter 4\n- nParam5 (Stack[0xc]): Additional parameter 5\n- dwInitDelay (Stack[0x10]): Initialization delay in ms\n- bForceAction (Stack[0x14]): Force interaction if nonzero\n- bInitialize (Stack[0x18]): Initialize unit mode if nonzero\n\nReturns:\n- 0: Interaction failed (invalid state, mode, or unit type)\n- 1: Interaction succeeded\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- When bInitialize=1, bypasses normal validation and forces initialization\n- Class ID validation: accepts 0xfd (player), 0x9a/0xb2 (specific types), 0xfe/0x101/0x1ff (high types), 0x93/0x94/0xb1/0xc7/0xca/0xfc/0xf4-0xf6 (monsters)\n- Monster type requires additional property checks (active state, life > 0, intelligence >= 72)\n- Cooldown check: if bForceAction=1, requires >500ms since last init\n- State values: 1=default, 2=action, 3=initialize, 4=special",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "PARAM_8", "SRC_npcmenu.cpp", "MOD_UI", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "STRUCT_Skill", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
    },
