      "instructions": ["0x58EE0|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbf8ee2]", "0x58EE5|PUSH|EBX", "0x58EE6|XOR|EBX, EBX", "0x58EE8|CMP|EAX, EBX", "0x58EEA|JZ|0x6fb28fba", "0x58EF0|CMP|byte ptr [0x6fbf8ed5], 0x1", "0x58EF7|JNZ|0x6fb28fba", "0x58EFD|CMP|ECX, dword ptr [0x6fbf8eda]", "0x58F03|JNZ|0x6fb28fba", "0x58F09|CALL|dword ptr [0x6fba6098]", "0x58F0F|MOV|EDX, dword ptr [0x6fbf8d59]", "0x58F15|MOV|ECX, EAX", "0x58F17|SUB|ECX, EDX", "0x58F19|CMP|ECX, 0x3e8", "0x58F1F|JBE|0x6fb28f26"],
      "comment": "Validate game state flags and initialize server connection parameters based on elapsed time and retry count.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if g_dwGameStatusFlags is set and g_byNetValidationFlag == 0x01 and dwGameState matches g_dwValidationParameter\n2. If pre-checks fail, return immediately (function exit point)\n3. Get current tick count via GetTickCount()\n4. Calculate elapsed time: (current_ticks - g_dwLastInitializationTime)\n5. If elapsed_time < 0x3E9 (1001ms):\n   - Cap retry count: min(g_dwInitializationAttemptCount, 10)\n   - Calculate timeout: current_ticks + ((retry_count*5 + 0x96) * 100)\n6. Else (elapsed time >= 1001ms):\n   - Calculate timeout: current_ticks + 100\n7. Clear g_dwGameStatusFlags to 0\n8. If g_byInitAttemptCounter == 0, call Ordinal_10029 (D2Common.LogEvent) with debug strings and size 0x1200\n9. Clear g_byInitAttemptCounter to 0\n10. Clear g_dwNetworkStateFlag to 0\n11. Call GetCurrentServerPort() to check connection\n12. If server port == 0 (no connection):\n    a. If g_fServerConnecting != 0, call CloseDialogAndCleanup() and reset flag\n    b. Set state variable (ram0x6fbf8dbb) to 0x03\n    c. Call InitializeObjectTypeArray()\n    d. Call ProcessObjectTypeAndValidateViewport()\n    e. Call ClearUnitSelectionState()\n\nParameters:\ndwGameState (ECX): Game state parameter checked against g_dwValidationParameter to gate function execution\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Function performs state initialization side-effects without return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Retry backoff calculation uses exponential scaling: (retry*5 + 150) * 100 milliseconds\n- Magic value 0x3E9 (1001) is timeout threshold in milliseconds\n- Ordinal_10029 = D2Common.LogEvent - writes debug event log with file path and buffer size (0x1200)\n- String parameters: error message path and source file location path\n- Multiple global flags cleared and reset during initialization sequence\n\nGlobal References:\ng_dwGameStatusFlags - Game state control flag\ng_byNetValidationFlag - Network validation enable flag (checked for 0x01)\ng_dwValidationParameter - Expected game state parameter\ng_dwLastInitializationTime - Previous initialization timestamp for elapsed calculation\ng_dwInitializationAttemptCount - Current retry attempt count (capped at 10)\ng_dwServerConnectionTimeout - Calculated timeout value based on retry backoff\ng_byInitAttemptCounter - Initialization counter (checked and cleared)\ng_dwNetworkStateFlag - Network state tracking variable (cleared)\ng_fServerConnecting - Server connection in-progress flag\nram0x6fbf8dbb - State variable set to 0x03 on server disconnect",
      "tags": ["SRC_npcmenu.cpp", "MOD_UI", "PARAM_1"]
    },
