      "instructions": ["0x59BD0|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbf8eaf]", "0x59BD5|SUB|ESP, 0x1a4", "0x59BDB|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x59BDD|PUSH|EBP", "0x59BDE|PUSH|ESI", "0x59BDF|PUSH|EDI", "0x59BE0|JZ|0x6fb29c00", "0x59BE2|PUSH|0x147a", "0x59BE7|PUSH|0x6fbb6c70", "0x59BEC|PUSH|0x6fbb6f78", "0x59BF1|CALL|0x6fb99a7a", "0x59BF6|ADD|ESP, 0xc", "0x59BF9|PUSH|-0x1", "0x59BFB|CALL|0x6fb9a10f", "0x59C00|PUSH|0x1"],
      "comment": "Initialize dialog for displaying item attributes and properties in game UI\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if loading progress dialog exists (g_pLoadingProgressDialog) - if so, fatal error\n   - Call Ordinal_10023 (Storm debug/assert output)\n   - Call FUN_6fb9a10f (exit with code -1)\n2. Initialize dialog parameters with defaults (11 params total)\n3. Query screen dimensions:\n   - Call FUN_6fb8f690() to get screen width\n   - Call FUN_6fb8f680() to get screen height\n4. Create Dialog structure via InitializeDialogStructure()\n5. Set dialog field value to 1 via SetDialogFieldValue()\n6. Switch on g_dwUnknownState (1-5) to determine dialog type:\n   - States 1-2: Set base line parameters (nLineType=4, dwLineEnabled=1, dwLineX=0, dwLineCount=0x15)\n   - State 3-4: Same with dwFlags=1\n   - State 5: Same without dwFlags assignment\n   - Each case calls Ordinal_10004 (unknown init)\n7. Check g_byInitAttemptCounter==0 - if so, trigger error via Ordinal_10029\n8. Load item data via FUN_6fb60e10(g_nInteractionData, 4)\n9. If item found (pItemData!=NULL):\n   - Initialize local_180 unicode buffer (384 elements)\n   - Load game configuration to pbConfigBuffer via LoadGameConfiguration(0xbf)\n   - Find newline (0x0a) in buffer, truncate at that point\n   - Add dialog line (ID 0xf)\n   - Build item tooltip via BuildItemTooltipText()\n   - Format tooltip string via wsprintfA() and win2Unicode()\n   - Add formatted lines to dialog\n   - Final: Add OK (0xd10) and Cancel (0xd11) lines\n\nParameters: None (void function)\n\nReturns: void (no return value, modifies global g_pLoadingProgressDialog)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If g_pLoadingProgressDialog already exists: fatal error (call Ordinal_10023 -> FUN_6fb9a10f)\n- If g_dwUnknownState not in range 1-5: fatal error with default case (bad state)\n- If g_byInitAttemptCounter!=0: skip error path, continue\n- If item not found: skip all item-specific setup, exit early\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x147a: Line number in source file (assertion check)\n- 0x14af: Line number for invalid state error\n- 0x14b7: Line number for init counter check\n- 0xbf: Config ID for item info (191 decimal)\n- 0xc0: Loop counter for unicode buffer init (192/2 = 96 iterations)\n- 0xa: Newline character code (10 decimal - line break)\n- 0x15: Base dialog line ID (21 decimal)\n- 0xf: Formatted dialog line ID (15 decimal)\n- 0xd10-0xd18: Dialog line IDs for menu items/buttons (3344-3352 decimal)\n- 0x28: Max tooltip buffer size (40 decimal)\n- 0x4: Item lookup offset (4 bytes)",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "SRC_npcmenu.cpp", "MOD_UI", "UI_DIALOG", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "STRUCT_Skill", "PARAM_0", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
