      "instructions": ["0x5A130|TEST|ECX, ECX", "0x5A132|JZ|0x6fb2a169", "0x5A134|XOR|EDX, EDX", "0x5A136|MOV|EAX, 0x6fbf8ddd", "0x5A13B|CMP|dword ptr [EAX], 0x0", "0x5A13E|JZ|0x6fb2a14c", "0x5A140|ADD|EAX, 0x10", "0x5A143|INC|EDX", "0x5A144|CMP|EAX, 0x6fbf8e7d", "0x5A149|JL|0x6fb2a13b", "0x5A14B|RET|", "0x5A14C|MOV|AX, word ptr [ECX + 0x1]", "0x5A150|SHL|EDX, 0x4", "0x5A153|ADD|EDX, 0x6fbf8dd5", "0x5A159|MOV|word ptr [EDX], AX"],
      "comment": "Registers a resource descriptor in the global resource lookup table.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Return immediately if input descriptor pointer is NULL\n2. Initialize slot index counter to 0 and pointer to active flags array\n3. Loop through resource table slots checking active flag (g_adwGameUnitArray)\n4. If slot is occupied (flag != 0), advance to next slot (stride 0x10)\n5. Increment slot index and check if past table end (0x6fbf8e7d)\n6. If table full (all 10 slots occupied), return without registering\n7. When empty slot found, copy resource flags (word at input+1) to slot\n8. Copy resource data pointer (dword at input+3) to slot+4\n9. Mark slot as active by setting flag to 1\n\nParameters:\n  pbResourceDescriptor (ECX) - Pointer to packed 7-byte resource descriptor:\n    Offset +1: ushort wResourceFlags\n    Offset +3: uint dwResourceDataPtr\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value; registration success indicated by slot allocation\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - NULL input pointer causes immediate return (no registration)\n  - Table full (10 slots occupied) causes silent return without registration\n  - Input structure uses packed offsets (+1, +3) not aligned to type boundaries\n\nStructure Layout (Resource Table Entry, 16 bytes stride):\n  Offset  Size  Field              Type   Description\n  0x00    2     wResourceFlags     ushort Resource flags from descriptor\n  0x04    4     dwResourceDataPtr  uint   Pointer to resource data\n  0x08    4     dwSlotActive       uint   1 if slot occupied, 0 if free\n  0x0C    4     (padding)          -      Unused alignment padding\n\nGlobal Data:\n  g_aResourceLookupTable (0x6fbf8dd5) - Base of 10-entry resource table\n  g_adwGameUnitArray (0x6fbf8ddd) - Active flags at offset +8 in each entry",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_1", "PROP_LEAF"]
