      "comment": "Searches resource lookup table for matching ID and opens hireling dialog\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize pointer to start of g_aResourceLookupTable\n2. Loop: compare current table entry with nResourceId parameter\n3. If match found, break loop\n4. Advance pointer by 0x10 bytes (8 shorts per entry)\n5. Continue while pointer < table boundary (0x6fbf8e75)\n6. Call OpenHirelingDialog() to display UI\n\nParameters:\n- nResourceId (CX): Resource ID to search for in table\n\nReturns:\n- void (function always succeeds)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Table lookup is linear search with 0x10 byte stride\n- OpenHirelingDialog() called regardless of search result\n- No error handling if ID not found",
