      "comment": "Callback function passed to IterateMissileHashTable to check if a missile matches specific criteria.\nSets g_fMissileFoundFlag to TRUE if missile type is 0x13E and mode is 2.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if missile type (offset +4) equals 0x13E\n2. If not, exit without setting flag\n3. Check if missile mode (offset +0xC) equals 2\n4. If not, exit without setting flag\n5. Set g_fMissileFoundFlag = 1 to indicate match found\n\nParameters:\n  pMissile - int * - Pointer to missile structure passed by IterateMissileHashTable\n    [+0x04] dwType - Missile type ID, compared against 0x13E\n    [+0x0C] dwMode - Missile mode, compared against 2\n\nReturns: void (result communicated via global flag g_fMissileFoundFlag)\n\nCaller Context:\n  Called from FUN_6fb2a2e0 via IterateMissileHashTable(0x6fb2a2c0) to find\n  missiles of type 0x13E in mode 2 during unit interaction handling.\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x13E (318) - Specific missile type being searched for\n  0x2 - Active missile mode indicating the missile is in flight",
      "tags": ["PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_1", "PROP_LEAF", "PROP_SMALL"]
