      "instructions": ["0x5A2E0|XOR|EDX, EDX", "0x5A2E2|PUSH|ESI", "0x5A2E3|MOV|DL, byte ptr [ECX + 0x1]", "0x5A2E6|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ECX + 0x2]", "0x5A2E9|CALL|0x6fb60e10", "0x5A2EE|MOV|ESI, EAX", "0x5A2F0|CMP|dword ptr [ESI + 0x4], 0x216", "0x5A2F7|JNZ|0x6fb2a32f", "0x5A2F9|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESI + 0x70]", "0x5A2FC|CALL|0x6fb796c0", "0x5A301|MOV|ECX, EAX", "0x5A303|CALL|0x6fb79700", "0x5A308|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [EAX]", "0x5A30A|MOV|EDX, ESI", "0x5A30C|PUSH|0x0"],
      "comment": "Processes a unit reference event by looking up the unit and performing type-specific actions.\n\nThis handler dispatches unit events based on unit type. For waypoints (0x216), it initializes\ngame object properties with cooldown state. For items (0x14b), it shows an overlay and \noptionally triggers missile iteration for trade validation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract unit ID from pUnitRef+2 and unit type from pUnitRef+1\n2. Look up unit in hash table using FindUnitInHashTable\n3. If unit type is 0x216 (waypoint):\n   a. Get spell cooldown state from unit offset 0x70\n   b. Calculate structure field offset from cooldown index\n   c. If field value is -1, call InitializeGameObjectProperties with 0x11ff\n   d. Otherwise call InitializeGameObjectProperties with 0x11fb\n   e. Return early\n4. If unit is NULL, return\n5. Get player unit from game state (if initialized)\n6. If unit equals player unit, return (skip self-interactions)\n7. Call InitializeOverlayData with overlay type 0x48, mode 3\n8. If unit type is not 0x14b (item), return\n9. Re-check if player unit exists, return if found\n10. If g_dwSlotDataBase is NULL, return\n11. Check trade flag at type group 0xc, index 8 (trade active flag)\n12. If flag set, return\n13. Check trade flag at type group 0xc, index 1 (trade pending flag)\n14. If flag set, return\n15. Clear g_fMissileFoundFlag and iterate missile hash table with callback\n16. If no missile found, call InitializeGameObjectProperties with 0xf8f\n\nParameters:\n- pUnitRef (int *): Pointer to unit reference structure\n  - Offset +1: Unit type (byte)\n  - Offset +2: Unit ID (dword)\n\nReturns: void\n\nVariable Notes (SSA/Phantom):\n- bVar1 (fTradeFlag): bool - Result from IsNpcTradeFlagSet calls\n- piVar2 (pPlayerOrCooldownResult): int* - Reused for cooldown field ptr and player unit ptr\n- extraout_var, extraout_var_00: Phantom undefined3 from CONCAT31 - decompiler artifact\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x216: Waypoint unit type\n- 0x14b: Item unit type\n- 0x11ff: Game object property ID for cooldown inactive\n- 0x11fb: Game object property ID for cooldown active\n- 0xf8f: Game object property ID for item interaction\n- 0x48: Overlay type for item highlight\n- 0x70: Offset to cooldown buffer in unit structure\n- 0x1c: Array index (pUnit[0x1c]) for cooldown buffer pointer\n- 0xc: NPC trade flag type group\n- 8: Trade active flag index\n- 1: Trade pending flag index\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Self-interaction prevention: Skips if target unit equals player unit\n- Trade state checks: Prevents action if NPC trade is active or pending\n- Missile iteration: Uses callback to validate missile state before final action",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_1"]
    },
