      "comment": "Checks if any dialog window is currently active in the game UI.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Test g_pLoadingProgressDialog - if non-zero, dialog is active\n2. Test g_pCharacterSelectionDialog - if non-zero, dialog is active\n3. Test g_fServerConnecting flag - if non-zero, connection dialog active\n4. Test g_pServerSocketDialog - if non-zero, dialog is active\n5. Test g_pCurrentTalkDialog - if non-zero, dialog is active\n6. Test g_pCharacterDialogState - if non-zero, dialog is active\n7. Test g_pUIStateDialog - if non-zero, dialog is active\n8. If all dialogs are inactive (NULL/0), return 0\n9. Otherwise return 1 (at least one dialog active)\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\n0 - No dialogs are active\n1 - At least one dialog is active",
