      "instructions": ["0x5A640|CMP|CX, 0xffff", "0x5A645|MOV|word ptr [0x6fbb4d04], CX", "0x5A64C|MOV|dword ptr [0x6fbf8f1c], EDX", "0x5A652|JNZ|0x6fb2a690", "0x5A654|XOR|EDX, EDX", "0x5A656|MOV|ECX, 0xb", "0x5A65B|CALL|0x6fb280d0", "0x5A660|XOR|EDX, EDX", "0x5A662|MOV|ECX, 0x8", "0x5A667|CALL|0x6fb280d0", "0x5A66C|XOR|EDX, EDX", "0x5A66E|MOV|ECX, 0x18", "0x5A673|CALL|0x6fb280d0", "0x5A678|XOR|EDX, EDX", "0x5A67A|MOV|ECX, 0x15"],
      "comment": "Configure dialog options based on difficulty mode and quest progress.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Store difficulty mode to g_nGameDifficultyFlag (word at 0x6fbb4d04)\n2. Store quest progress to g_dwQuestProgressValue (dword at 0x6fbf8f1c)\n3. If difficulty mode is -1 (all modes):\n   - Add dialog option 0x0B (Quest Option A)\n   - Add dialog option 0x08 (Quest Option B)\n   - Add dialog option 0x18 (Quest Option C)\n   - Add dialog option 0x15 (Quest Option D)\n   - Add dialog option 0x2B (Quest Option E)\n4. Otherwise: return (no options added)\n\nParameters:\n- nDifficultyMode (short): Difficulty selection flag; -1 = show all options\n- dwQuestProgress (uint): Quest completion state value\n\nReturns:\n- void: Configures global dialog state as side effect\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Only adds dialog options when nDifficultyMode == -1 (all difficulty modes)\n- All five option IDs (0x0B, 0x08, 0x18, 0x15, 0x2B) configured in single run\n- Globals store current difficulty and quest state for subsequent dialog operations\n\nRelated Functions:\n- AddDialogOption() - Registers each option with the dialog system",
