      "instructions": ["0x5A8B0|PUSH|ECX", "0x5A8B1|PUSH|EBX", "0x5A8B2|PUSH|EBP", "0x5A8B3|PUSH|ESI", "0x5A8B4|PUSH|EDI", "0x5A8B5|MOV|ECX, 0xd", "0x5A8BA|CALL|0x6fb99a02", "0x5A8BF|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x10], EAX", "0x5A8C3|XOR|EBX, EBX", "0x5A8C5|MOV|ESI, 0x6fbb7472", "0x5A8CA|MOV|CX, word ptr [ESI + -0xa]", "0x5A8CE|CALL|0x6fb9981c", "0x5A8D3|MOV|ECX, EAX", "0x5A8D5|CALL|0x6fb999fc", "0x5A8DA|MOV|EDI, dword ptr [0x6fbae0e4]"],
      "comment": "Calculate and update menu panel UI positioning for all registered panels.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize panel traversal with g_aMenuPanels start pointer\n2. Initialize loop counter to 0\n3. Loop while panel pointer < g_aMenuPanelsEnd:\n   a. Lock game viewport/rendering (Ordinal_10004)\n   b. Get current screen width via Ordinal_10121\n   c. Retrieve global viewport height from g_dwViewportHeight\n   d. Calculate available panel width: (g_dwScreenWidth - 0x26c) / 2\n   e. Calculate equal panel segment width: available_width / 3\n   f. Calculate panel horizontal center based on segment: segment_x + segment_width/2\n   g. Calculate panel X position: center_x + (segment_width * loop_counter) - half_width - 10\n   h. Calculate panel right edge: center_x + segment_width * loop_counter + half_width + 10\n   i. Calculate vertical center: (viewport_height - 0x1a4) / 2\n   j. Set panel field at offset 0x00: left edge X coordinate\n   k. Set panel field at offset 0x04: right edge X coordinate\n   l. Set panel field at offset 0x08: top edge Y coordinate (center + 0x149)\n   m. Set panel field at offset 0x0c: bottom edge Y coordinate (center + 0x16f)\n   n. Move to next panel (offset += 0x1a bytes)\n   o. Increment loop counter\n4. Unlock rendering with Ordinal_10127\n5. Request UI redraw via FUN_6fb2a970(0)\n\nParameters:\n(none) - Function uses global game state variables\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\nMagic number 0x26c: Fixed padding/border width in pixels\nMagic number 0x1a4: Fixed vertical offset for panel centering\nMagic number 0x149: Top panel edge Y offset from center\nMagic number 0x16f: Bottom panel edge Y offset from center\nMagic number 0x1a: Panel structure size (bytes)\nAssumption: g_aMenuPanels contains at least one panel; g_dwScreenWidth and g_dwViewportHeight properly initialized",
      "tags": ["PARAM_0"]
    },
