      "instructions": ["0x5C020|CALL|0x6fadb800", "0x5C025|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x5C027|JZ|0x6fb2c037", "0x5C029|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x4]", "0x5C02D|MOV|dword ptr [EAX + 0x18], 0x0", "0x5C034|RET|0x4", "0x5C037|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbb74bc]", "0x5C03C|PUSH|ESI", "0x5C03D|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [ESP + 0x8]", "0x5C041|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x5C043|JZ|0x6fb2c07d", "0x5C045|TEST|dword ptr [ESI + 0xc], 0x40000000", "0x5C04C|JNZ|0x6fb2c087", "0x5C04E|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbf8f68]", "0x5C053|MOV|EDX, dword ptr [0x6fbb74b8]"],
      "comment": "Handles UI menu widget activation with conditional initialization and key binding cleanup.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if game system is enabled via IsGameSystemEnabled()\n2. If enabled: Set widget's active flag (offset +0x18) to 0 (inactive) and return\n3. If not enabled, check g_dwUIMenuInitialized flag:\n   a. If 0: Set flag to 1 (first-time initialization)\n   b. If non-zero and widget flag bit 0x40000000 not set in offset +0xC:\n      - Clear key bindings by type using config pointer and menu state\n      - Initialize game object properties with category 2\n4. Set widget active flag (offset +0x18) to 1 (active)\n5. Clear widget secondary flag (offset +0x1C) to 0\n6. Insert widget into cache via InsertCacheNodeWithCookie\n\nParameters:\n  pWidget (dword *) - Pointer to UI menu widget structure\n\nWidget Structure Layout (partial):\nOffset  Size  Field             Description\n------  ----  ----------------  -----------\n0x0C    4     dwWidgetFlags     Widget state flags (bit 0x40000000 = skip cleanup)\n0x18    4     dwActiveFlag      Widget activation state (0=inactive, 1=active)\n0x1C    4     dwSecondaryFlag   Secondary state flag (cleared on activation)\n\nReturns:\n  void - Widget state modified in place\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Early exit if game system is enabled (widget set inactive)\n  - First activation initializes g_dwUIMenuInitialized flag\n  - Key binding cleanup skipped if widget has 0x40000000 flag set\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0x40000000 - Widget flag indicating skip key binding cleanup\n  0x18 (24) - Offset to active flag in widget structure\n  0x1C (28) - Offset to secondary flag in widget structure\n  0x0C (12) - Offset to widget flags field",
