      "api_count": 5,
      "api_calls": ["GetInitFlag", "GetInitFlag", "GetInitFlag", "GetInitFlag", "InsertCacheNodeWithCookie"],
      "instructions": ["0x5C130|CALL|0x6fadb800", "0x5C135|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x5C137|JZ|0x6fb2c147", "0x5C139|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x4]", "0x5C13D|MOV|dword ptr [EAX + 0x18], 0x0", "0x5C144|RET|0x4", "0x5C147|PUSH|EBX", "0x5C148|PUSH|ESI", "0x5C149|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [ESP + 0xc]", "0x5C14D|PUSH|EDI", "0x5C14E|XOR|EDI, EDI", "0x5C150|PUSH|0x6", "0x5C152|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [ESI + 0xc]", "0x5C155|MOV|DI, word ptr [ESI + 0xc]", "0x5C159|SHR|EBX, 0x10"],
      "comment": "Initialize menu panel UI based on incoming message data and remote session state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if game system is enabled via IsGameSystemEnabled()\n2. If enabled, set message result field to 0 and return early (bypass menu init)\n3. Extract click coordinates from message data (low word = X, high word = Y at offset 0xc)\n4. Call GetInitFlag() for initialization state\n5. Process 6 menu panel entries from g_aMenuPanelsEnd array via ProcessMessageArray()\n6. Check remote session support via IsRemoteSessionSupported()\n7. If remote session supported, process 1 panel from g_aRemoteSessionSupportedPanels\n8. Check valid remote desktop session via IsValidRemoteDesktopSession()\n9. If valid desktop session, process 1 panel from g_aRemoteDesktopPanels\n10. Check active remote session via IsRemoteSessionActive()\n11. If remote session active, process 1 panel from g_aRemoteSessionActivePanels\n12. Call ProcessRemoteSessionMessageState() to update session state\n13. Reset g_dwRemoteSessionMode to 0\n14. Set g_pAutomapRenderCache to 1 (enable rendering)\n15. Dispatch click to ProcessMenuInputClick() with extracted coordinates\n16. Set message result field (offset 0x18) to 1 indicating success\n17. Clear message cookie field (offset 0x1c) to 0\n18. Insert message into cache via InsertCacheNodeWithCookie()\n\nParameters:\nuint * pMessageData - Pointer to message structure containing:\n  Offset 0x0c: uint  - Packed coordinates (LOWORD=X, HIWORD=Y)\n  Offset 0x18: uint  - Result field (set to 0 on bypass, 1 on success)\n  Offset 0x1c: uint  - Cookie field (cleared to 0)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Results stored in message structure fields\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Early exit when IsGameSystemEnabled() returns non-zero (game system active)\n- Remote session panels only processed when corresponding session checks pass\n- Coordinate extraction uses bit manipulation: X = word, Y = dword >> 16\n\nRelated Functions:\n- IsGameSystemEnabled: Check if game system currently active\n- ProcessMessageArray: Process array of menu panel entries\n- ProcessMenuInputClick: Handle click input dispatch to menu regions\n- InsertCacheNodeWithCookie: Cache the processed message\n\nGlobal State Modified:\n- g_dwRemoteSessionMode: Set to 0\n- g_pAutomapRenderCache: Set to 1",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
