      "instructions": ["0x5C200|PUSH|ECX", "0x5C201|CALL|0x6fadb800", "0x5C206|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x5C208|JZ|0x6fb2c219", "0x5C20A|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x8]", "0x5C20E|MOV|dword ptr [EAX + 0x18], 0x0", "0x5C215|POP|ECX", "0x5C216|RET|0x4", "0x5C219|PUSH|ESI", "0x5C21A|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [ESP + 0xc]", "0x5C21E|PUSH|EDI", "0x5C21F|XOR|EDI, EDI", "0x5C221|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESI + 0xc]", "0x5C224|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x8], EDI", "0x5C228|TEST|EAX, 0x40000000"],
      "comment": "Processes keyboard input messages for menu navigation and control.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if game system is enabled via IsGameSystemEnabled(); if so, mark message as unhandled and return early\n2. Initialize bound key code storage to zero\n3. Check message flags at offset +0xC for 0x40000000 flag; if set, skip to finalization\n4. Check if key code at offset +0x8 equals 0x1B (ESC key):\n   a. If ESC: Close 6 menu panels via ProcessMessageArray using g_aMenuPanelsEnd\n   b. Check remote session states and close additional panels if active\n   c. Clear g_dwRemoteSessionMode and call InitializeGameObjectProperties(1,...)\n   d. Set g_dwUIMenuInitialized to 0\n5. If not ESC key:\n   a. Call RegisterKeyboardBinding with current config, menu mask, and key code\n   b. If binding found: close menu panels same as ESC path but with InitializeGameObjectProperties(2,...)\n   c. For Enter (0xD), Delete (0x2E), Backspace (0x8), Space (0x20): set g_dwUIMenuInitialized to 0\n   d. Otherwise: set g_dwUIMenuInitialized to 1\n6. If bound key code was populated, store it in g_wLastBoundKeyCode and update g_dwLastRenderTick\n7. Mark message as handled (offset +0x18 = 1, offset +0x1C = 0)\n8. Insert message into cache via InsertCacheNodeWithCookie\n\nParameters:\n  pMessage - Pointer to message structure containing:\n             +0x08: Virtual key code (uint)\n             +0x0C: Message flags (uint) - 0x40000000 indicates skip processing\n             +0x18: Handled flag (uint) - set to 1 when processed\n             +0x1C: Result code (uint) - set to 0 on completion\n\nReturns:\n  void - Message handling status communicated via pMessage fields\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - ESC key (0x1B) triggers immediate menu close without binding check\n  - Key repeat flag 0x40000000 causes skip to finalization\n  - Special keys (Enter/Delete/Backspace/Space) clear UI menu initialized state\n  - Remote session panels only closed if respective session check returns true\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x1B - VK_ESCAPE\n  0x0D - VK_RETURN\n  0x2E - VK_DELETE\n  0x08 - VK_BACK\n  0x20 - VK_SPACE\n  0x40000000 - Key repeat/previous state flag (bit 30 of lParam)",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
    },
