      "comment": "Processes UI menu keyboard binding requests and handles remote session message arrays.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if game system is enabled - if so, mark message as not processed (offset +0x18 = 0) and return early\n2. Initialize local key code output array to zero\n3. If UI menu not yet initialized (g_dwUIMenuInitialized == 0), set initialization flag to 1 and skip binding logic\n4. Otherwise, call RegisterKeyboardBinding with configuration data pointer, hit region mask, and key code from message context\n5. If binding succeeds (result != 0):\n   a. Get init flag and process 6 menu panel messages from g_aMenuPanelsEnd\n   b. If IsRemoteSessionSupported returns true, process 1 message from g_aRemoteSessionSupportedPanels\n   c. If IsValidRemoteDesktopSession returns true, process 1 message from g_aRemoteDesktopPanels\n   d. If IsRemoteSessionActive returns true, process 1 message from g_aRemoteSessionActivePanels\n   e. Call ProcessRemoteSessionMessageState to finalize remote session handling\n   f. Reset g_dwRemoteSessionMode to 0\n   g. Initialize game object properties with type 2\n6. If key code output is non-zero, save to g_wLastBoundKeyCode and record tick count\n7. Mark message as processed (offset +0x18 = 1, offset +0x1c = 0)\n8. Insert message context into cache via InsertCacheNodeWithCookie\n\nParameters:\n  pMsgContext - Pointer to message context structure (passed as uint, used as pointer)\n    +0x08: ushort wKeyCode - Key code from input message\n    +0x18: uint dwProcessed - Set to 1 on success, 0 on early exit\n    +0x1c: uint dwErrorCode - Set to 0 on completion\n\nReturns:\n  void - Results stored in message context structure\n\nGlobals Used:\n  g_dwUIMenuInitialized (0x6fbb74bc) - First-run initialization flag\n  g_pConfigurationDataPointer (0x6fbb7464) - Base pointer to configuration data array\n  g_dwUIMenuStateFlags (0x6fbf8f68) - Index multiplier for configuration lookup\n  g_dwMenuHitRegionMask (0x6fbb74b8) - Bitmask for menu hit region detection\n  g_dwRemoteSessionMode (0x6fbf8f70) - Remote session mode flag, reset to 0\n  g_wLastBoundKeyCode (0x6fbf8f7c) - Cached last bound key code\n  g_dwLastRenderTick (0x6fbf8f80) - Tick count when key was bound\n\nDecompiler Artifacts:\n  extraout_var, extraout_var_00 (undefined3) - Phantom variables from CONCAT31 operations.\n  These represent upper bytes of EAX when decompiler widens bool return to 32-bit.\n  Not real variables - decompiler artifact from IsRemoteSessionSupported/IsRemoteSessionActive.\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Early exit if IsGameSystemEnabled returns non-zero\n  - First-time initialization sets flag without processing bindings\n  - Remote session panel messages only processed if respective conditions are true",
