      "comment": "Processes mouse scroll wheel input for menu navigation and keyboard binding.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call IsGameSystemEnabled to check if game system is active\n2. If game system enabled, mark message as unprocessed (offset 0x18=0) and return early\n3. Extract Y coordinate from message data (pMessage[2] >> 16) as signed short\n4. Divide Y coordinate by 120 (0x78) to calculate scroll delta direction\n5. If scroll delta is zero, skip keyboard binding processing\n6. Call RegisterKeyboardBinding with:\n   - nActionId from g_pConfigurationDataPointer indexed by g_dwUIMenuStateFlags\n   - nSecondaryActionId from g_dwMenuHitRegionMask\n   - wKeyCode: 0x103 for scroll up, 0x104 for scroll down\n   - Output pointer for error code\n7. If RegisterKeyboardBinding returns non-zero (success):\n   a. Process 6 menu panel messages via ProcessMessageArray with g_aMenuPanelsEnd\n   b. If IsRemoteSessionSupported returns true, process 1 remote session panel message\n   c. If IsValidRemoteDesktopSession returns true, process 1 remote desktop panel message\n   d. If IsRemoteSessionActive returns true, process 1 remote session active message\n   e. Call ProcessRemoteSessionMessageState to finalize state\n   f. Clear g_dwRemoteSessionMode to 0\n8. If RegisterKeyboardBinding failed but error code (output param) is non-zero:\n   a. Store error code in g_wLastBoundKeyCode\n   b. Update g_dwLastRenderTick with current tick count\n9. Mark message as processed (pMessage[6]=1)\n10. Clear message result (pMessage[7]=0)\n11. Call InsertCacheNodeWithCookie to add message to processing cache\n\nParameters:\npMessage - Pointer to message structure containing:\n  Offset 0x00: Message type\n  Offset 0x04: wParam (message parameter)\n  Offset 0x08: lParam containing Y coordinate in high word\n  Offset 0x18: Processed flag (0=unprocessed, 1=processed)\n  Offset 0x1c: Result value\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value, results stored in message structure\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x78 (120) - Wheel delta divisor (WHEEL_DELTA standard Windows value)\n0x103 - Key code for scroll up binding\n0x104 - Key code for scroll down binding\n0x18 - Offset to processed flag in message structure\n0x1c - Offset to result value in message structure\n6 - Number of menu panel messages to process\n1 - Number of session-specific messages to process",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
