      "comment": "Clear all accumulated validation errors and zero-initialize data buffer.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check each error code global (g_dwInventoryError through g_dwAnimationError)\n2. If error code != 0, call ReportValidationError with the error code\n3. Clear error code to 0 after reporting\n4. Repeat for all 17 error code globals\n5. Initialize g_adwInitializeBuffer by clearing 12 consecutive dwords to 0x00000000\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Always succeeds\n\nSpecial Cases:\nFunction only clears non-zero error codes; zero codes are skipped\nLoop unrolled for each error code (no conditional loop iteration)\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x0c (12) - Number of dwords to zero in buffer initialization",
