      "instructions": ["0x5CBC0|SUB|ESP, 0x48", "0x5CBC3|MOV|ECX, 0x12", "0x5CBC8|XOR|EAX, EAX", "0x5CBCA|PUSH|ESI", "0x5CBCB|PUSH|EDI", "0x5CBCC|LEA|EDI, [ESP + 0x8]", "0x5CBD0|XOR|ESI, ESI", "0x5CBD2|STOSD.REP|ES:EDI", "0x5CBD4|XOR|EDI, EDI", "0x5CBD6|CALL|0x6fae0f40", "0x5CBDB|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x5CBDD|JZ|0x6fb2cc8b", "0x5CBE3|MOV|ECX, 0x19", "0x5CBE8|CALL|0x6fb5d340", "0x5CBED|TEST|EAX, EAX"],
      "comment": "Process player event trigger - checks conditions and dispatches draw event if applicable.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize local 72-byte event parameter array (18 dwords)\n2. Call CheckPlayersForCondition() to check if players meet trigger criteria\n3. If no players match, return immediately\n4. Query player condition status with multiple checks via FUN_6fb5d340:\n   - Check for condition code 0x19 (Condition A)\n   - If absent, check code 0x0C (Condition B)\n   - If absent, check code 0x18 (Condition C)\n   - If absent, check codes 0x01 and 0x04 (Conditions D and E)\n5. If ANY of above conditions found, set nEventFound = 1\n6. Query final condition 0x17 with FUN_6fb5d340\n7. If condition found, call FUN_6fb596a0() for cleanup; if returns 0, exit\n8. If nEventFound == 0:\n   - Load resource ID from g_dwEventResourceId into event array[1]\n   - Copy nEventFound flags to event array[2] and array[3]\n   - Query condition 0x0A with FUN_6fb5d340\n   - If condition found, set nYOffset = 0x46 (70 decimal)\n   - Call Ordinal_10072 to dispatch draw event with computed Y offset\n9. Return\n\nParameters:\n(none - void function)\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Function uses 0x3A (58 decimal) as horizontal margin for screen width calculation\n- Y-coordinate adjusted with 0x2D (45 decimal) offset\n- Condition codes are checked in specific order; early match triggers flag set\n- Multiple condition codes can be active; only first match matters for flag\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x12 = 18 (array element count)\n0x19 = Condition code A\n0x0C = Condition code B\n0x18 = Condition code C\n0x01 = Condition code D\n0x04 = Condition code E\n0x17 = Condition code F (trigger final check)\n0x0A = Condition code G (determines Y offset)\n0x46 = 70 (decimal) - Y offset value\n0x2D = 45 (decimal) - Y position adjustment\n0x3A = 58 (decimal) - Screen width margin\n\nRelated Functions:\n- CheckPlayersForCondition() - Validates preconditions for event\n- FUN_6fb5d340() - Query player condition codes\n- FUN_6fb596a0() - Cleanup/post-processing handler\n- Ordinal_10072() - Dispatch draw/display event to UI layer",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_0", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
    },
