      "comment": "Render item stat comparison bar on UI panel\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get current animation frame timestamp via GetGameTick\n2. Query animation panel update frame count\n3. Retrieve item stat value (calls Ordinal_10565 = D2Common.GetItemStat)\n4. If stat exists: calculate display width as (frameCount * 0x50) / statValue\n5. Initialize 18-dword render buffer (local_48) to 0, set error type flags\n6. Get elapsed time, query tooltip visibility via Ordinal_10487\n7. If tooltip active: calculate stat bar progression percentage from elapsed time\n8. Validate progressive bar width <= 0x50 pixels max\n9. If progression < display width: query resolution mode, calculate X offset based on mode\n10. Render comparison bar (old value) via Ordinal_10074 \n11. Render error bar via Ordinal_10072 with NPC stat value\n12. Clear tooltip and return\n\nParameters:\n(void) - No parameters; uses global state for panel data\n\nReturns:\n(void) - No return value; rendering side-effects only\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x50 - Maximum bar width (80 pixels)\n0x6a - Panel widget type ID\n0x1a - Elapsed time query parameter (26 ms)\n0x70, 0x6f, 0x6e - X-axis offset calculations based on screen width\n0xd, 0x9 - Y-axis offset calculations based on screen height\n0x12 - Loop count (18 dwords for 72-byte buffer)\n\nRelated Callees:\n- GetGameTick (via FUN_6fb62880) - Current animation frame\n- UpdatePanelAnimationFrameWithValidation - Panel animation state\n- Ordinal_10565 (D2Common.GetItemStat) - Query item stat value\n- Ordinal_10487 (D2Fog.IsTooltipActive) - Check tooltip visibility\n- Ordinal_10519 (D2Fog.GetElapsedTime) - Elapsed milliseconds\n- Ordinal_10003 (D2Fog.GetScreenResolution) - Query resolution mode\n- Ordinal_10074 (D2Fog.DrawBar) - Render colored stat bar\n- Ordinal_10072 (D2Fog.DrawText) - Render stat label text",
