      "instructions": ["0x5E600|SUB|ESP, 0xd4", "0x5E606|PUSH|EBX", "0x5E607|PUSH|EBP", "0x5E608|PUSH|ESI", "0x5E609|PUSH|EDI", "0x5E60A|CALL|0x6fb62880", "0x5E60F|MOV|ECX, 0xa", "0x5E614|MOV|EBX, EAX", "0x5E616|CALL|0x6fb2d8e0", "0x5E61B|MOV|EDI, EAX", "0x5E61D|PUSH|EBX", "0x5E61E|CALL|0x6fb98734", "0x5E623|MOV|EBP, EAX", "0x5E625|MOV|AL, [0x6fbf9064]", "0x5E62A|TEST|AL, AL"],
      "comment": "Render interactive slider control panel for game settings/status display.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Retrieve current panel ID and animation frame timing (FUN_6fb62880, UpdatePanelAnimationFrameWithValidation)\n2. Query panel height from external module (Ordinal_10566)\n3. Initialize slider color to RGB(0xFF,0x00,0x00) red if not already set (Ordinal_10034)\n4. Calculate effective panel width: if (height + 5 < frame_time) use frame_time, else check module status\n5. Clamp width to valid range: 0 to (frame_time * 0x66 / height), minimum 0x19\n6. Draw slider bar at screen position (center_x - 0x7f, bottom_y - 0x1b) with width and color\n7. Query current mouse/cursor position (FUN_6fb8f680, FUN_6fb8f690)\n8. Calculate animation progress: (frame_time >> 8) and (height >> 8)\n9. Set animation state to 0 or 3 based on progress threshold and module validation\n10. Initialize 200-char Unicode buffer for display text\n11. Validate mouse cursor within slider bounds horizontally (center_x ± 0x7f) and vertically (bottom_y ± ~0x12)\n12. If within bounds, format display text with GetStringResource and render via display callback\n13. Call status update function with animation frame count\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Updates UI panel state and renders graphics to screen buffer\n\nParameters:\nNone - Uses global panel handle, animation state, screen dimensions\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Panel width < 5 handled by clamping to zero\n- Division by zero protected by < 1 range check before division\n- Uninitialized color state handled by explicit RGB initialization\n- Mouse position validation uses signed integer comparisons after scaling\n- Note: Function contains 9 stack-allocated temporaries (uVar5, uVar6, iVar2, uVar1, uVar4, iVar3) optimized away by compiler\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xFF, 0xF4, 0xC0, 0x4C: RGB color component values for slider appearance\n- 0x10: Panel dimension constant used in calculations\n- 0x66: Animation factor constant for width calculation\n- 0x19: Minimum slider width threshold\n- 0x7F: Horizontal offset from screen center\n- 0x1B, 0x9, 0x12: Vertical positioning offsets\n- 0x34: Y-offset for status message display\n- 0x88: Module validation flag/status code\n- 0xC8, 0x64: Buffer/iteration constants (200 bytes, 100 iterations for Unicode array)",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "STRUCT_Skill", "PARAM_0", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
