      "comment": "Initialize and build item tooltip display buffers for game UI rendering.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize three Unicode character buffers (local_1fe: 256 elements, aUStack_5fe: 128 elements, aUStack_4fe: 384 elements)\n2. Clear buffers with memset pattern and call Unicode default constructors on each element\n3. Call LoadGameConfiguration to retrieve current game state\n4. Check if game state (g_pCurrentGameState) and inventory (g_pCurrentInventory) are valid\n5. If valid, retrieve owner inventory via Ordinal_10600 and validate item container exists\n6. If validation fails, abort with fatal error (Ordinal_10023, FUN_6fb9a10f)\n7. Load base item configuration and process formatting via ProcessUnicodeLineFormatting\n8. Build item tooltip text via FUN_6fb5a3a0 for both 3-part and base configurations\n9. Concatenate strings using Unicode::strcpy and Unicode::strcat\n10. If item slot (g_nSelectedItemSlot) and display window (g_hDisplayWindow) are valid (>= 0):\n    a. Prepare tooltip information via FUN_6fb5a350\n    b. Validate object type via IsObjectTypeValid\n    c. If valid, build item description via BuildItemTooltipText\n    d. If description generated (dwResult != 0 && sDescLength != 0), concatenate additional strings\n11. Request display update via Ordinal_10129\n\nParameters:\nNone (uses global variables: g_pCurrentGameState, g_pCurrentInventory, g_dwGameState, g_dwInventoryFlags, g_dwMinItemLevel, g_nSelectedItemSlot, g_hDisplayWindow, unaff_EDI, unaff_ESI)\n\nReturns:\nNone (void function)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Function allocates large stack buffers (total 2096 bytes for Unicode arrays)\n- Unaffected registers (unaff_EDI, unaff_ESI) indicate register parameters passed implicitly\n- Uses D2Common Ordinal calls for game object validation and synchronization\n- String operations use Unicode library functions (strcpy, strcat)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x7f - Loop counter for 256 Unicode element initialization (size check: 0x7f + 1 = 0x80 = 128 UTF-16 units = 256 bytes)\n0xff - Second loop counter for 256 elements (0xff + 1 = 0x100 = 256 elements)\n0x3f - Loop counter for 128 elements (0x3f + 1 = 0x40 = 64 UTF-16 units = 128 bytes)\n0x7f - Loop counter for 128 elements\n0xbf - Loop counter for 384 elements (0xbf + 1 = 0xc0 = 192 UTF-16 units = 384 bytes)\n0x17f - Loop counter for 384 elements (0x17f + 1 = 0x180 = 384 elements)\n0x84 - Offset into game state for player inventory pointer\n0x1f - Loop counter for 64 elements (0x1f + 1 = 0x20 = 32 UTF-16 units = 64 bytes)\n0x3f - Loop counter for 64 elements\n0x200 - Formatting code for ProcessUnicodeLineFormatting\n0x40 - Max description length for BuildItemTooltipText\n1 - Format parameter for BuildItemTooltipText (item details format)\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description\n  -0x1fe | 512  | local_1fe | ushort[256] | Main tooltip text buffer (UTF-16 Unicode)\n  -0x200 | 2    | sTooltipCount | short | Tooltip state counter\n  -0x5fe | 508  | aUStack_5fe | ushort[254] | Secondary format buffer\n  -0x600 | 2    | sItemLength | short | Item name/stat length\n  -0x4fe | 1532 | aUStack_4fe | ushort[766] | Extended description buffer\n  [stack] | 4   | dwResult | uint | BuildItemTooltipText result\n  [stack] | 4   | iLoopCount | int | Loop counter (optimization reused)",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "MOD_UI", "SRC_panel.cpp", "PARAM_0", "STRUCT_Other", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY"]
