      "comment": "Updates the screen animation timer by retrieving current animation ID and resetting counter.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Retrieve current animation ID via FUN_6fb634e0()\n2. If animation ID is valid (non-zero):\n   a. Translate animation ID via Ordinal_10057 (D2Common ordinal)\n   b. Compare with previously stored animation ID (g_dwCurrentScreenAnimId)\n   c. If different, reset counter to 0x3c (60 decimal) and store new ID\n3. Return\n\nParameters:\n(none)\n\nReturns:\n(void) - updates globals g_dwCurrentScreenAnimId and g_dwScreenAnimUpdateCounter\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If FUN_6fb634e0() returns 0 (no animation), function exits without updating globals\n- Magic number 0x3c = 60 decimal (likely animation frame reset counter)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FUN_6fb634e0() - Retrieves current animation ID\n- Ordinal_10057 - D2Common animation ID translator\n- RenderMainGameScreen() - Caller, main render loop",
