      "instructions": ["0x5F8F0|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [0x6fbdc018]", "0x5F8F6|SUB|ESP, 0x118", "0x5F8FC|LEA|EAX, [ESP + 0x10]", "0x5F900|PUSH|EBX", "0x5F901|PUSH|EBP", "0x5F902|PUSH|ESI", "0x5F903|MOV|EBX, EDX", "0x5F905|MOV|EDX, dword ptr [0x6fbb7548]", "0x5F90B|PUSH|EDI", "0x5F90C|PUSH|EAX", "0x5F90D|PUSH|ECX", "0x5F90E|PUSH|EDX", "0x5F90F|CALL|0x6fb98aa6", "0x5F914|XOR|EDI, EDI", "0x5F916|MOV|AL, byte ptr [ESP + 0x24]"],
      "comment": "Validates viewport coordinates against game bounds and sends packet with position or visibility data.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call Ordinal_10638 to fetch viewport bounds into local_108\n2. Check if slot count (local_104) is zero - exit if empty\n3. Loop through up to N slots: Call Ordinal_10639 with each index\n4. Validate coordinates: param_3 (X) and param_4 (Y) must be within [min,max] bounds\n5. When valid slot found, retrieve both new and previous unit pointers via Ordinal_10262 and Ordinal_10271\n6. Validate game mode (FUN_6fb8f780 != 6)\n7. Check unit existence and validity (Ordinal_10768)\n8. Send packet: type 0x24 (only previous), 0x23 (only new), or 0x25 (both)\n9. Call FUN_6fb6bc10 to get rendering context, update camera/viewport with FUN_6fb8d210\n\nParameters:\n  dwGameMode (ECX): Game mode identifier\n  dwGraphicsMode (EDX): Graphics quality flag\n  nX: Viewport X coordinate to validate\n  nY: Viewport Y coordinate to validate\n\nReturns: void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - If no valid slot exists (all iterations exhausted), returns early\n  - If coordinate validation fails for all slots, returns early\n  - If game mode is 0x6, returns early\n  - uVar4 & 0xffff masks Y coordinate to 16-bit value for packet\n  - FUN_6fb6e180 return value indicates unit validity\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x24: Packet type for previous-only visibility\n  0x23: Packet type for new-only visibility\n  0x25: Packet type for both units visible\n  0x6: Game mode check (disable condition)\n  0xffff: Y coordinate mask to 16 bits\n  0x8: Field offset for unit data values (puVar1[2], puVar2[2])\n\nRelated Functions:\n  - Ordinal_10638: Fetch viewport bounds\n  - Ordinal_10639: Iterate viewport slots\n  - Ordinal_10262: Get previous unit pointer\n  - Ordinal_10271: Get new unit pointer by index\n  - FUN_6fb8f780: Get game mode status\n  - FUN_6fb6e180: Validate unit structure\n  - FUN_6fb6e120: Cleanup unit reference\n  - FUN_6fb6bc10: Get rendering/camera context\n  - FUN_6fb8d210: Update viewport camera position",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_4", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
