      "comment": "HandleMinimapClickEvent - Processes mouse click events on minimap/viewport area\n\nClassification: Callback/Handler - invoked by input system for mouse clicks\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if post-game render mode is disabled (g_dwPostGameRenderMode == 0)\n2. If disabled, call IsGameSystemEnabled() - if returns non-zero, early exit setting result to 0\n3. Call IsGameInMenuState() - if in menu state, early exit setting result to 0\n4. Extract click coordinates from pClickEvent:\n   - X coordinate = lower 16 bits of [pClickEvent + 0xc]\n   - Y coordinate = upper 16 bits of [pClickEvent + 0xc] (shifted right 16)\n5. Get game context via GetGameContext()\n6. Check IsTargetingEnabled() - if targeting active, early exit\n7. If g_dwGameActive != 0:\n   a. Call ValidateCoordinateInBounds(pClickEvent) to verify click bounds\n   b. If valid, get UI resource 0x1f via GetUIResourceByIdWithValidation()\n   c. If resource valid, set result flags [+0x18]=1, [+0x1c]=0\n   d. Call HandleViewportClick with game context, viewport param, X, Y coordinates\n   e. Return\n   f. If bounds invalid, check UI resource 0x1f\n   g. If resource valid, reset state flags and return\n   h. Otherwise reset all game state flags to 0\n8. If g_dwGameActive == 0 (minimap click path):\n   a. Calculate minimap bounds:\n      - X range: [screenWidth/2 + 0x17, screenWidth/2 + 0x91]\n      - Y range: [screenHeight - 0x27, screenHeight - 10]\n   b. If click within minimap bounds:\n      - Check UI resource buffer element 9 via GetUIResourceBufferElement()\n      - If element 0 (not blocking), set g_dwGameActive=1, g_dwGameStateFlag=1\n      - Call HandleViewportClick with coordinates\n      - Set result [+0x18]=1, [+0x1c]=0\n   c. If outside bounds, set [+0x18]=0, g_dwMonsterVisible=0\n\nParameters:\n  pClickEvent (dword) - Pointer to click event structure\n    +0x0c: Packed coordinates (low word=X, high word=Y)\n    +0x18: Result/handled flag (set to 1 if processed, 0 otherwise)\n    +0x1c: Secondary result flag (set to 0 when handled)\n\nReturns: void (results written to pClickEvent structure)\n\nGlobal Variables Accessed:\n  g_dwPostGameRenderMode (0x6fbe926c) - Post-game render state flag\n  g_dwGameActive (0x6fbf9020) - Game active state\n  g_dwGameStateFlag (0x6fbf9024) - Game state flag\n  g_dwMonsterVisible (0x6fbf901c) - Monster visibility flag\n  g_dwScreenWidth (0x6fbae0e4) - Screen width for bounds calculation\n  g_dwScreenHeight (0x6fbae0e8) - Screen height for bounds calculation\n\nMinimap Region Calculation:\n  Left edge:   screenWidth/2 + 23 (0x17)\n  Right edge:  screenWidth/2 + 145 (0x91)\n  Top edge:    screenHeight - 39 (0x27)\n  Bottom edge: screenHeight - 10 (0x0a)\n  Width: 122 pixels, Height: 29 pixels",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
