      "api_calls": ["CopyBeltItemStats", "GetBoxStatsByProperty", "INVENTORY_GetOwner", "GetInventorySlotValue", "UNITS_GetOwnerGuid", "GetBoxStatsByProperty"],
      "instructions": ["0x5FBB0|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [0x6fbdc018]", "0x5FBB6|SUB|ESP, 0x118", "0x5FBBC|LEA|EAX, [ESP + 0x10]", "0x5FBC0|PUSH|EBX", "0x5FBC1|PUSH|EBP", "0x5FBC2|PUSH|ESI", "0x5FBC3|MOV|EBX, EDX", "0x5FBC5|MOV|EDX, dword ptr [0x6fbb7548]", "0x5FBCB|PUSH|EDI", "0x5FBCC|PUSH|EAX", "0x5FBCD|PUSH|ECX", "0x5FBCE|PUSH|EDX", "0x5FBCF|CALL|0x6fb98aa6", "0x5FBD4|XOR|ESI, ESI", "0x5FBD6|MOV|AL, byte ptr [ESP + 0x24]"],
      "comment": "Processes viewport click events to select units/monsters in the current game view.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Query renderer for current viewport slot boundaries (Ordinal_10638)\n2. Iterate through available slots checking if click coordinates fall within slot bounds\n3. For matching slot: retrieve unit/monster data via ordinal calls\n4. Validate game state (not in skill/quest dialogs via FUN_6fb8f780)\n5. If unit found: store as selected unit, update global selection state\n6. Else if no unit: clear selection and set monster visibility flags\n\nParameters:\n  dwGameMode (ECX): Game mode/graphics quality identifier\n  dwUnitIndex (EDX): Unit/monster index in current context\n  nClickX (Stack+0x4): X coordinate of viewport click (1-based)\n  nClickY (Stack+0x8): Y coordinate of viewport click (1-based)\n\nReturns:\n  void: Updates global selection state (g_pSelectedUnitData, g_dwSelectedMonsterIndex, etc)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - If slot count is 0 (bySlotCount=0): Function exits immediately\n  - If no slot found within bounds: Returns without changing selection\n  - If game state is 6 or 8 (skill/quest dialogs): Function returns without selection\n  \nMagic Numbers:\n  0x80, 0xff: Slot count bit mask for valid slots\n  0x0e: Offset added to slot minimum for item slot calculation\n  0x6: Game state indicating skill dialog active\n  0x8: Game state indicating quest dialog active\n\nGlobal Data Modified:\n  g_pSelectedUnitData (0x6fbf9034): Pointer to selected unit\n  g_dwSelectedMonsterIndex (0x6fbb7550): Index of selected monster\n  g_dwMonsterVisible (0x6fbf901c): Monster visibility flag\n  g_pdwCurrentUnit (0x6fbf9030): Pointer to current unit\n  g_nSelectedItemSlot (0x6fbb7554): Selected slot index + 0x0e\n  g_hDisplayWindow (0x6fbb7558): Display window handle",
      "tags": ["PARAM_4", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
