      "globals": ["0xFFFFFFFF90530000||", "0xFFFFFFFF90530004||", "0xFFFFFFFF90530014||", "0xFFFFFFFF9052FEE4||", "0x10C018|g_dwGraphicsQualityFlag|0x0", "0xE7548|g_dwGameMode|0x2", "0xFFFFFFFF9052FEF8||", "0xFFFFFFFF9052FEE0||", "0xFFFFFFFF9052FEFC||", "0xFFFFFFFF9052FEE8||", "0xFFFFFFFF9052FEEC||", "0xFFFFFFFF9052FEF0||", "0xFFFFFFFF9052FEF4||", "0x12901C|g_dwMonsterVisible|0x0"],
      "api_count": 3,
      "api_calls": ["CopyBeltItemStats", "GetBoxStatsByProperty", "InsertCacheNodeWithCookie"],
      "instructions": ["0x5FD20|SUB|ESP, 0x120", "0x5FD26|PUSH|EBX", "0x5FD27|PUSH|EBP", "0x5FD28|PUSH|EDI", "0x5FD29|CALL|0x6fadb800", "0x5FD2E|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x5FD30|JNZ|0x6fb2fe4a", "0x5FD36|CALL|0x6fb62890", "0x5FD3B|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x5FD3D|JNZ|0x6fb2fe4a", "0x5FD43|MOV|EDI, dword ptr [ESP + 0x130]", "0x5FD4A|XOR|EBP, EBP", "0x5FD4C|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [EDI + 0xc]", "0x5FD4F|MOV|BP, word ptr [EDI + 0xc]", "0x5FD53|SHR|EBX, 0x10"],
      "comment": "Processes a click event on game UI panels and updates player item state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if game system is disabled or in menu state - if so, clear result flag and return early\n2. Extract click coordinates from pClickInfo->dwPackedCoords: low word = X coordinate, high word = Y coordinate\n3. Get game context pointer via GetGameContext()\n4. Validate click coordinates are within bounds - if invalid, clear result flag, reset g_dwMonsterVisible, return\n5. Set success flags: pClickInfo->dwResultFlag = 1 (valid), pClickInfo->dwSecondaryFlag = 0 (no secondary result)\n6. Check screen state:\n   - If screen state == 6: Call SendResourceUpdate() to refresh UI\n   - If screen state == 8: Log packet with type 0x4C via LogFiveBytePacket()\n7. Initialize nMatchedPropertyIndex = -1 (no match)\n8. Call CopyBeltItemStats() with current game mode and graphics quality settings\n9. Loop through box stats (0 to dwBoxCount):\n   a. Get bounding box for property index via GetBoxStatsByProperty()\n   b. Test if click (X,Y) is within box bounds: left <= X <= right AND top <= Y <= bottom\n   c. If match found, set nMatchedPropertyIndex to current index and break\n10. Call ProcessPlayerItemState() with game context, player data offset +0x84, and matched index\n11. Call InsertCacheNodeWithCookie() to cache click info for future reference\n\nParameters:\n  pClickInfo (ClickInfo*) - Pointer to click info structure:\n    +0x00: dwUnknown00 - Unknown field\n    +0x04: dwUnknown04 - Unknown field\n    +0x08: dwUnknown08 - Unknown field\n    +0x0C: dwPackedCoords - Packed coordinates (low word = X, high word = Y)\n    +0x10: dwUnknown10 - Unknown field\n    +0x14: dwUnknown14 - Unknown field\n    +0x18: dwResultFlag - Result flag (1 = valid click, 0 = invalid)\n    +0x1C: dwSecondaryFlag - Secondary result flag\n\nReturns: void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Returns immediately if game system disabled (IsGameSystemEnabled != 0)\n  - Returns immediately if game is in menu state\n  - Returns with dwResultFlag=0 and g_dwMonsterVisible=0 if coordinates invalid\n  - Screen state 6 triggers resource update, state 8 triggers packet logging\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x4C - Packet type for five-byte packet logging\n  6 - Screen state for resource update mode\n  8 - Screen state for packet logging mode\n  0x84 - Offset to player data in game context",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_Skill", "STRUCT_ItemData", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
    },
