      "comment": "Initialize and render character name display with random padding.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize local Unicode string buffer (szNameBuffer, 506 chars, Stack[-0x200]) with null constructors in loop (iVar5=0xff)\n2. Call FUN_6fb5dad0 with player unit data pointer from (nPlayerIndex + 0xc1) offset\n3. Copy source Unicode name (unaff_ESI) to destination buffer (unaff_EDI) using Unicode::strcpy\n4. Set puVar6 = auStack_6 + 1 (pointer arithmetic in padding array)\n5. Get random value via Ordinal_10121() - check if result > 0x8c (140 decimal)\n6. If random value > 140:\n   a. Calculate destination string length using Unicode::strlen (result in sVar2)\n   b. Extract last Unicode character: uVar1 = *(undefined2*)(szNameBuffer + sVar2*2 - 2)\n   c. Load marker data from globals: uStack_218 = g_szEllipsisPrefix, uStack_214 = g_byErrorPlayerMarker\n   d. Initialize 6-element Unicode array (aUStack_210) with null constructors\n   e. Convert marker data to Unicode using Unicode::toUnicode(aUStack_210, &uStack_218, 5)\n   f. Store extracted last char: uStack_20a = uVar1\n   g. Get two random values: iVar5 = Ordinal_10121(), iVar3 = Ordinal_10121()\n   h. Loop while (0x8b - iVar5) < iVar3 (condition-based randomization):\n      - Decrement puVar6 pointer\n      - Clear ushort at *puVar6 = 0x0000\n      - Recalculate iVar3 = Ordinal_10121() for loop update\n   i. Append source name to destination: Unicode::strcat(unaff_EDI, unaff_ESI)\n   j. Restore original nNameLen: param_2 = local_204 (dwSavedNameLen)\n7. Calculate final UI Y offset: (param_2 - g_dwUIYOffset) + 0xc\n8. Call Ordinal_10117 with (Y_offset, dwUIState, 0) to render\n\nParameters:\n  nPlayerIndex (int, ECX) - Player index/pointer for data lookup\n  nNameLen (int, EDX) - UI Y position baseline\n  dwUIState (uint, Stack[0x4]) - UI rendering state/flags\n\nReturns:\n  void - Modifies display state, no return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Ordinal_10121() appears to be random number generator (called 5 times 