      "comment": "ProcessUISlotClickInput - Handles mouse click detection for UI slot panel regions.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get current mouse X coordinate via GetCurrentResourceID\n2. Get player node list head, skip to second node for iteration\n3. Cache linked list head from g_pLinkedListHead\n4. Get game context pointer for room validation\n5. Get current mouse coordinates (X via GetCurrentResourceID, Y via GetResourceFlags)\n6. Check if click is within primary button region:\n   - X range: [g_dwUIXOffset + 0x116, g_dwUIXOffset + 0x136] (32-pixel width)\n   - Y range: [0x185 - g_dwUIYOffset, 0x1a5 - g_dwUIYOffset] (32-pixel height)\n7. If in primary region: set g_bHardcoreFlagEnabled=1, mark cookie as handled, insert cache node, return\n8. If mouse X >= screen_width/2: mark cookie as unhandled (offset 0x18=0), early return\n9. Begin outer loop over linked list nodes:\n   a. If list head is null, jump to handled exit\n   b. Initialize slot index to 0, point to slot array at offset 0x14\n10. Inner loop over 5 slots (stride 0x20 = 32 bytes per slot):\n    a. Load slot type from offset -0x14 (slot[0])\n    b. Load slot Y from offset -0xC (slot[2])\n    c. Load slot X from offset -0x10 (slot[1])\n11. If slot type == 0 (small slot, 20x20 pixels):\n    - Check hit: X in [slotX + UIXOffset, slotX + UIXOffset + 0x14]\n    - Check hit: Y in [slotY - UIYOffset - 0x14, slotY - UIYOffset]\n    - If hit and slot[5]==1: validate player level >= 9, validate room/DRLG\n    - If slot[8]==0: update slot state, set g_bSlotInteractionFlag, goto handled exit\n12. If slot type != 0 (large slot, 53x20 pixels):\n    - Check hit: X in [slotX + UIXOffset, slotX + UIXOffset + 0x35]\n    - Check hit: Y in [slotY - UIYOffset - 0x14, slotY - UIYOffset]\n    - If hit: update slot state based on slot[6], set flags, insert cache, return\n13. Increment slot index, advance pointer by 0x20, loop until index >= 5\n14. Follow next pointer at offset 0xCD, advance player node iterator\n15. Repeat outer loop indefinitely until handled or early return\n\nParameters:\n  dwCookie - uint: Cookie value passed to InsertCacheNodeWithCookie, also used as\n             base pointer for result storage (offset +0x18 = handled flag,\n             offset +0x1C = secondary flag)\n\nReturns:\n  void - Results stored via dwCookie pointer offsets\n\nGlobals Accessed:\n  g_pLinkedListHead (0x6fbf9094) - Linked list of slot array containers\n  g_dwUIXOffset (0x6fbfd7fc) - UI panel X offset for coordinate adjustment\n  g_dwUIYOffset (0x6fbfd800) - UI panel Y offset for coordinate adjustment\n  g_dwScreenWidth (0x6fbae0e4) - Screen width for left-half check\n  g_bHardcoreFlagEnabled (0x6fbf90b0) - Set to 1 when primary button clicked\n  g_bSlotInteractionFlag (0x6fbf90b8) - Set to 1 when slot interaction detected\n\nSlot Structure (32 bytes, 5 per container):\n  Offset  Size  Field        Description\n  0x00    4     dwType       0=small(20px), else=large(53px)\n  0x04    4     nPosX        X position before UI offset\n  0x08    4     nPosY        Y position before UI offset\n  0x0C    4     nValue       Incremented and stored at slot+0x10\n  0x10    4     nState       State value set on interaction\n  0x14    4     dwFlag1      Checked for value 1 (level check)\n  0x18    4     dwFlag2      Checked != 1 for state update\n  0x1C    4     bActive      Set to 1 on interaction\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Level check: If slot flag1==1, player level must be >= 9\n  - Room validation: If flag1==1, unit room must exist and pass DRLG subtype check\n  - Left-half only: Slot processing only occurs if mouse X < screen_width/2",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
    },
