      "comment": "Initialize party UI panel frames and asset pointers\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load character select class frame (party menu) via FUN_6fb5a050\n2. Store result in g_dwCharacterSelectClassFrame2\n3. Load character select class button frame (party buttons) via FUN_6fb5a050\n4. Store result in g_dwCharacterSelectClassFrame\n5. Load party box panel frame (party boxes) via FUN_6fb5a050\n6. Store result in g_pPlayerSlotDefaults\n7. Load inventory gold button frame via FUN_6fb5a050\n8. Store result in g_dwInvGoldButtonFrame\n9. Load party bar frame (party bar) via FUN_6fb5a050\n10. Store result in g_dwUIAssetId\n11. Load final asset frame and store in g_dwUIAssetId (last assignment)\n12. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\n(none)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value. All results stored in global frame pointers.\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Each frame pointer is loaded sequentially using a single asset loader function (FUN_6fb5a050)\n- Last assignment to g_dwUIAssetId overwrites previous value\n- All UI assets are initialized during startup sequence\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x6fbb789c - Resource ID for character select class frame (party menu)\n0x6fbb7888 - Resource ID for character select class buttons\n0x6fbb7878 - Resource ID for party boxes panel\n0x6fbb7864 - Resource ID for inventory gold button\n0x6fbb7854 - Resource ID for party bar frame",
