      "comment": "Validates and clears all UI character select class frame handles.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load g_dwCharacterSelectClassFrame2 - check if non-zero\n2. If set, call ReportValidationError() to report handle leak\n3. Clear g_dwCharacterSelectClassFrame2 to zero\n4. Load g_dwCharacterSelectClassFrame - check if non-zero\n5. If set, call ReportValidationError() to report handle leak\n6. Clear g_dwCharacterSelectClassFrame to zero\n7. Load g_pPlayerSlotDefaults (pointer) - check if non-zero\n8. If set, call ReportValidationError() to report leaked pointer\n9. Clear g_pPlayerSlotDefaults to NULL\n10. Load g_dwCharacterSelectClassFrame3 - check if non-zero\n11. If set, call ReportValidationError() to report handle leak\n12. Clear g_dwCharacterSelectClassFrame3 to zero\n13. Load g_dwUIAssetId - check if non-zero\n14. If set, call ReportValidationError() to report handle leak\n15. Clear g_dwUIAssetId to zero\n\nParameters:\n(void) - No parameters\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Function validates leaks and clears all handles/pointers; void return",
