      "comment": "Initialize slot configuration for a character inventory slot. Validates slot index,\nlocates slot metadata, validates dependencies, and populates slot header structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize slot structure fields to default values (frame indices 0xe8c, flags 0)\n2. Locate slot record by matching character type against g_apnSlotIndices table\n3. Calculate offset into slot property tables (iVar15 = nSlotIndex * 0x10)\n4. Extract slot configuration byte and disabled state from g_abySlotFlags, g_abySlotAlt\n5. Retrieve slot data base pointer via GetSlotDataBase() - D2Common ordinal\n6. Retrieve validation magic via GetValidationMagic() - D2Common ordinal\n7. Validate slot record exists (pointer at [dwOffset + 0x6fbb80f4])\n8. If no record: set error code 2, return\n9. Query slot properties via Ordinal_11107 (D2Common GetUnitStat):\n   - iVar6 = property 0x00 (base property)\n   - iVar7 = property 0x0d (secondary property)\n   - uVar8 = property 0x01 (item count)\n10. Apply slot selection logic based on:\n    - psVar1 (slot record table) address comparison\n    - iVar6, iVar7 validation results\n    - Character type matching\n    - Item presence checks\n11. Set result code: 0=OK, 1=warn, 2=error, 3=pending\n12. Populate slot structure with frame indices and status flags\n13. Return with result status in [nSlotIndex + 0x266]\n\nParameters:\n- nSlotIndex (ECX): slot identifier/type being configured\n\nReturns:\n- Populates input structure at nSlotIndex with:\n  [+0x261] = bySlotType (slot classification)\n  [+0x262] = bySlotDisabled flag\n  [+0x265] = bySlotState (current slot state)\n  [+0x266] = dwStatus (result code: 0/1/3=success, 2=error)\n  [+0x5] = wFrameIndex (animation frame index)\n  [+0x25f] = wAltFrameIndex (alternate frame)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xe8c = default frame index (300 decimal)\n- 0xe8d = alt frame for empty slots (301 decimal)\n- 0xe91 = offline frame (2321 decimal)\n- 0xe92 = online frame (2322 decimal)\n- 0x6fbb80fc = slot index table base\n- 0x6fbb838b = end of slot index table (validates bounds)\n- 0x12c = stack buffer size for Unicode strings (300 bytes)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- GetSlotDataBase (D2Common) - retrieves slot record database\n- GetValidationMagic (D2Common) - retrieves magic for validation\n- Ordinal_11107 (D2Common.GetUnitStat) - queries unit properties\n- Ordinal_10004 (D2Common.InitUnicode) - initializes Unicode buffer\n- toUnicode, Unicode::strncpy, Unicode::sprintf - string operations\n- FUN_6fb9a261, FUN_6fb9a10f (D2Client internal helpers)",
      "tags": ["SRC_QuestLog.cpp", "MOD_UI", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "UI_QUEST", "STRUCT_PlayerData", "STRUCT_MonsterData", "PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Path", "STRUCT_Skill", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY"]
