      "comment": "Initialize quest panel UI resource files\nLoad UI resource files (quest background, tabs, sockets, done indicator, inventory panel, quest history) if not already cached. Only loads if video initialization is disabled (offline mode check). Supports quest expansion variant through Ordinal_10227 check.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if video system initialized via IsVideoInitializationEnabled() - exit if initialized\n2. For each of 6 UI resource status flags (g_dwGameStatus1-6):\n   a. Check if resource already loaded (status == 0)\n   b. Build resource path via FUN_6fb9a261(szPathBuffer, szResourcePath)\n   c. Write path to file via ConcatenatePathAndWriteFile(szPathBuffer, 0)\n   d. Store result in status flag\n3. Special case for quest tabs (g_dwGameStatus2): check Ordinal_10227() and GetGlobalSystemState() to select standard or expansion variant path\n\nParameters:\n(none)\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Quest tabs selection (g_dwGameStatus2) depends on expansion check: standard tabs if Ordinal_10227==0 or GetGlobalSystemState==0, otherwise expanded tabs\n- All paths built into stack buffer (260 bytes, szPathBuffer)\n- Resource paths stored in read-only string data section (s__s_ui_menu_* labels)\n\nResources Loaded:\n1. Quest background: s__s_ui_menu_questbackground_6fbb8570 -> g_dwGameStatus1\n2. Quest tabs (standard/expansion): s__s_ui_menu_questtabs_6fbb8540 or s__s_ui_menu_expquesttabs_6fbb8558 -> g_dwGameStatus2\n3. Quest sockets: s__s_ui_menu_questsockets_6fbb8528 -> g_dwGameStatus3\n4. Quest done: s__s_ui_menu_questdone_6fbb8510 -> g_dwGameStatus4\n5. Inventory panel: s__s_ui_menu_invps_6fbb84fc -> g_dwGameStatus5\n6. Quest history: s__s_ui_menu_questlast_6fbb84e4 -> g_dwGameStatus6",
      "tags": ["UI_INVENTORY", "PARAM_0", "UI_MENU", "UI_QUEST"]
