      "instructions": ["0x64380|PUSH|ESI", "0x64381|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x64383|CMP|ESI, 0x5", "0x64386|JL|0x6fb3438a", "0x64388|XOR|ESI, ESI", "0x6438A|LEA|EAX, [ESI + -0x1]", "0x6438D|CMP|EAX, 0x3", "0x64390|JA|0x6fb34473", "0x64396|JMP|dword ptr [EAX*0x4 + 0x6fb344a8]", "0x6439D|PUSH|0x0", "0x6439F|PUSH|0xf", "0x643A1|CALL|0x6fb2a190", "0x643A6|PUSH|EAX", "0x643A7|CALL|0x6fb988a8", "0x643AC|TEST|EAX, EAX"],
      "comment": "Initialize game slots with type validation and clear array memory.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Clamp nSlotIndex to valid range [0, 4]: if nSlotIndex > 5, set to 0\n2. Switch on clamped index (EAX = nSlotIndex - 1):\n   - Case 0 (index 1): Validate slot type 0x07, if fail skip; validate 0x0F\n   - Case 1 (index 2): Validate 0x0F, 0x17 sequentially\n   - Case 2 (index 3): Validate 0x17, 0x0F, 0x07 sequentially\n   - Case 3 (index 4): Validate 0x1A, 0x17, 0x0F, 0x07 sequentially\n   - Default: Jump to finalization\n3. For each validation: call GetSlotDataBase() to get slot pointer, call Ordinal_11107(pSlot, dwSlotType, 0)\n4. If validation returns non-zero (error), skip to next validation\n5. If all validations pass, set nSlotIndex to 0; else continue to next case\n6. Set g_dwGameValue1 = 0xFFFFFFFF\n7. Initialize puSlotArray = &g_aSlotDataArray\n8. Loop: Clear 6 dwords before each element until puSlotArray >= g_dwSlotArraySize\n9. Return\n\nParameters:\n- nSlotIndex (ECX): Slot index to initialize (0-4; values > 4 clamped to 0)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Input validation via clamping: [0, 4] with default 0\n- Cascading slot validation (multiple types per index)\n- Ordinal_11107: Ghidra unknown ordinal - likely slot validation function\n- Array clearing: 6 dwords (24 bytes) per iteration from base\n- g_dwSlotArraySize acts as array end boundary marker\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x07, 0x0F, 0x17, 0x1A: Slot type IDs\n- 0xFFFFFFFF: Sentinel value for g_dwGameValue1\n- 0x5 (5): Upper bound for index clamping\n- -0x18 (-24): 6 dwords offset for array clearing",
