      "api_calls": ["FogAssert", "GetGameState", "InsertCacheNodeWithCookie"],
      "instructions": ["0x644C0|MOV|DL, byte ptr [0x6fbf90f2]", "0x644C6|PUSH|EBX", "0x644C7|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x8]", "0x644CB|PUSH|EBP", "0x644CC|MOV|EBP, dword ptr [0x6fbfd7fc]", "0x644D2|XOR|ECX, ECX", "0x644D4|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [EBX + 0xc]", "0x644D7|MOV|CX, word ptr [EBX + 0xc]", "0x644DB|PUSH|ESI", "0x644DC|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [0x6fbfd800]", "0x644E2|SHR|EAX, 0x10", "0x644E5|SUB|ECX, EBP", "0x644E7|ADD|EAX, ESI", "0x644E9|TEST|DL, DL", "0x644EB|PUSH|EDI"],
      "comment": "Handles mouse button release events on the Quest Log UI panel.\n\nUI Callback - Registered at runtime for mouse up events.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract mouse X/Y coordinates from event structure at offset 0x0C\n2. Adjust coordinates relative to UI offset (X - g_dwUIXOffset, Y + g_dwUIYOffset)\n3. Check g_bGameInitFlag2 - if set and click in OK button region (0x116-0x139, 0x188-0x1A9), call InitializeGameMode(0)\n4. Check g_bGameInitFlag5 - if set, skip slot/difficulty processing\n5. If g_dwGameValue1 == -1 (no active selection):\n   a. If g_bGameInitFlag4 set and click in difficulty region (0xE6-0x103, 0x187-0x1A7)\n   b. Search quest slot array for matching menu state\n   c. Get difficulty value from slot data (stride 0x26A)\n   d. Skip invalid difficulties (0xE8C, 0xE8D)\n   e. Call InitializeGameState with difficulty, set callback FUN_6fb34720\n6. Else if slot selected:\n   a. Assert slot count <= 6\n   b. Loop through button bounds array (stride 0x10, 4 ints per entry)\n   c. Check if click within bounds: X in [base, base+0x38), Y in [base, base+0x34)\n   d. If slot matches g_dwGameValue1, update menu state\n7. Reset all game state flags to initial values\n8. If click in left half of screen and below belt region:\n   a. Call Ordinal_10005 to get expansion state\n   b. Check Y against screen height (minus 0x2F for expansion, 0x31 otherwise)\n   c. Call ClearTargetingState\n   d. Mark event as handled (offset 0x18=1, 0x1C=0)\n   e. Insert into cache via InsertCacheNodeWithCookie\n\nParameters:\npMouseEvent - Pointer to mouse event structure:\n  +0x0C: packed X (low word) and Y (high word) coordinates\n  +0x18: handled flag (set to 1 when processed)\n  +0x1C: result code (set to 0)\n\nReturns: void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Asserts if g_dwSlotCount > 6 (max supported slots)\n- Difficulty values 0xE8C and 0xE8D are skipped (invalid/locked)\n- Expansion mode uses different Y threshold (0x2F vs 0x31)\n\nStructure Layout (Quest Slot Entry, stride 0x26A):\nOffset  Size  Field        Description\n0x00    2     nDifficulty  Difficulty value for this slot\n0x02    1     byMenuState  Menu state identifier at +0x02 (accessed as +0x26A offset)\n\nButton Bounds Array (stride 0x10):\nOffset  Size  Field   Description\n0x00    4     nMinX   Left bound\n0x04    4     nMinY   Top bound (accessed as *piVar4)\n(Width: 0x38, Height: 0x34)\n\nUI Regions:\n- OK Button: X 0x116-0x139, Y 0x188-0x1A9\n- Difficulty Select: X 0xE6-0x103, Y 0x187-0x1A7",
      "tags": ["SRC_QuestLog.cpp", "PROP_LARGE", "MOD_UI", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "UI_QUEST", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
