      "comment": "Initialize cache object fields and optionally reset game mode state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set pCacheObject->dwField18 = 1 (mark as initialized)\n2. Set pCacheObject->dwField1C = 0 (clear secondary field)\n3. Insert cache object via InsertCacheNodeWithCookie\n4. If g_dwGameModeFlag == 2 (game mode active):\n   a. Clear g_dwGameModeFlag to 0\n   b. Clear g_bGameInitFlag3 to 0\n   c. Clear g_bGameInitFlag5 to 0\n5. Call ClearValidationErrors to reset error states\n6. Call ProcessUIStateChange(0xF, 1, 1) to update UI state\n7. Store GetTickCount() result in g_dwGameSettings\n\nParameters:\npCacheObject (Stack[0x4]) - Pointer to cache object structure with fields at +0x18 and +0x1C\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Game mode reset only occurs when g_dwGameModeFlag == 2\n- No callers detected - may be invoked via function pointer or exported\n\nClassification:\nInitialization function - sets up cache object and resets game state flags",
