      "comment": "Initialize and process game mode state transitions and resource loading.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if game mode is idle (0x00) - perform throttled initialization every 250ms\n2. If game mode is active (0x01) - reset to idle and continue with resource check\n3. If game mode is shutdown (0x02) - reset flags and return early\n4. Check if video initialization is enabled; return early if disabled\n5. Call FUN_6fb5d370 to process resources with mode parameter 0x0F\n6. On success (result == 1), initialize game resources:\n   - Execute FUN_6fb33ee0 to prepare game state\n   - Set game mode to loading (0x02)\n   - Query resource availability via FUN_6fb62880\n   - Chain three D2Common ordinal calls: GetUnitStat -> GetUnitPath -> ApplyStat\n   - Store combined stat result or zero\n   - Call FUN_6fb34380 with final stat value\n   - Process menu configuration state\n   - Query and increment system counters\n\nParameters:\n  nGameModeParam: int - Game initialization parameter (passed to FUN_6fb5d370)\n\nReturns:\n  void - Side effects: updates g_dwGameModeFlag, g_bGameInitFlag3, g_bGameInitFlag5, g_pValidationErrorConfig\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Game mode 2 (shutdown): Full reset of initialization flags and early exit\n  - Video init disabled: Skips all resource loading\n  - Resource query timeout: Returns before processing if elapsed time < 250ms\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0xfa (250ms): Throttle interval for idle mode checks\n  0x0f, 0x00, 0x01, 0x02: Game mode state values (resource param, idle, active, loading)\n  0x01: Success return code from FUN_6fb5d370\n\nOrdinals Referenced:\n  Ordinal_10342: D2Common.GetUnitStat\n  Ordinal_10057: D2Common.GetUnitPath  \n  Ordinal_10001: D2Common.ApplyStat",
