      "instructions": ["0x648B0|PUSH|ESI", "0x648B1|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x648B3|PUSH|EDI", "0x648B4|MOV|ECX, 0xa", "0x648B9|MOV|EDI, 0x6fbf9195", "0x648BE|MOVSD.REP|ES:EDI, ESI", "0x648C0|MOVSW|ES:EDI, ESI", "0x648C2|MOV|byte ptr [0x6fbf90f0], 0x0", "0x648C9|CALL|0x6fad1c00", "0x648CE|TEST|AL, AL", "0x648D0|POP|EDI", "0x648D1|POP|ESI", "0x648D2|JNZ|0x6fb348f2", "0x648D4|CMP|dword ptr [0x6fbf90d8], 0x2", "0x648DB|JNZ|0x6fb348e2"],
      "comment": "Copy game slot data to global buffer and initialize game state flags.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set EDI to global game slot data buffer (g_aGameSlotData @ 0x6fbf9195)\n2. Set ECX = 0x0A (10) for loop counter\n3. Loop 10 times: Copy dword from [ESI] to [EDI] using REP MOVSD\n4. Copy 2 additional words from source to buffer using MOVSW for trailing data\n5. Write 0x00 to g_bGameInitFlag3 (clear game initialization flag)\n6. Call IsVideoInitializationEnabled() to check video state\n7. Test return value: if zero (video disabled), continue; else skip to end\n8. If video disabled, check if g_dwGameModeFlag == 0x02\n9. If mode equals 2, call LoadUIResourcesForQuestPanel() to load quest UI\n10. Call ProcessMenuConfigurationState with g_dwSlotArraySize and mode=1\n11. Return from function\n\nParameters:\n- pdwSlotSource (ECX, dword *): Pointer to source game slot data (12 bytes)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value, modifies global state only\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Only loads quest panel UI when game mode = 2 and video is enabled\n- Video initialization check determines whether additional init path executes\n- Function always clears initialization flag regardless of video state\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x0A: Loop count for REP MOVSD (10 dwords = 40 bytes)\n- 0x02: Game mode flag value triggering quest panel load\n- 0x01: Mode parameter constant for ProcessMenuConfigurationState\n- 0x00: Clear value for initialization flag, also video disabled return value",
      "tags": ["PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_1"]
