      "instructions": ["0x64900|XOR|EAX, EAX", "0x64902|MOV|AX, word ptr [ECX + 0x1]", "0x64906|DEC|EAX", "0x64907|JNZ|0x6fb3492b", "0x64909|XOR|EAX, EAX", "0x6490B|XOR|EDX, EDX", "0x6490D|MOV|AX, word ptr [ECX + 0x3]", "0x64911|MOV|[0x6fbf90e4], EAX", "0x64916|MOV|DX, word ptr [ECX + 0x5]", "0x6491A|XOR|EAX, EAX", "0x6491C|MOV|dword ptr [0x6fbf90e8], EDX", "0x64922|MOV|AX, word ptr [ECX + 0x7]", "0x64926|MOV|[0x6fbf90ec], EAX", "0x6492B|RET|"],
      "comment": "Extracts configuration data from a header structure if the type field matches expected value.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load the type field (short) at offset +1 from the header structure\n2. Compare type field with value 1\n3. If type field does not equal 1, exit early without modifying globals\n4. If type field equals 1, load ushort value at offset +3 and store as dword to g_dwConfigValue1\n5. Load ushort value at offset +5 and store as dword to g_dwConfigValue2\n6. Load ushort value at offset +7 and store as dword to g_dwConfigValue3\n7. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\npnHeader (int *): Pointer to header structure containing configuration data at specific byte\noffsets. Structure layout: offset +1 is type field (short), offset +3 is first value (ushort),\noffset +5 is second value (ushort), offset +7 is third value (ushort).\n\nReturns:\nvoid. Global variables g_dwConfigValue1, g_dwConfigValue2, g_dwConfigValue3 are conditionally \nupdated with configuration values if type field matches.\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If type field at offset +1 is not exactly 1, function returns without modifying any global state\n- Values at offsets +3, +5, +7 are truncated from ushort (16-bit) to dword (32-bit) by zero-extension\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset | Size | Field Name | Type   | Description\n0      | 2    | reserved   | short  | Reserved/unused field\n1      | 2    | wType      | ushort | Type identifier (must equal 1 to trigger extraction)\n3      | 2    | wValue1    | ushort | First configuration value\n5      | 2    | wValue2    | ushort | Second configuration value\n7      | 2    | wValue3    | ushort | Third configuration value",
      "tags": ["PARAM_1", "PROP_LEAF", "PROP_SMALL"]
    },
