      "api_count": 1,
      "api_calls": ["SetBitInArray2D"],
      "instructions": ["0x64930|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbfa095]", "0x64935|PUSH|EDI", "0x64936|CMP|EAX, 0x5", "0x64939|JGE|0x6fb34981", "0x6493B|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbf90e0]", "0x64940|XOR|EDI, EDI", "0x64942|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x64944|JLE|0x6fb34981", "0x64946|PUSH|ESI", "0x64947|MOV|ESI, 0x6fbf91ea", "0x6494C|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESI + 0x265]", "0x64952|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x64954|JNZ|0x6fb34970", "0x64956|CALL|0x6fb2a190", "0x6495B|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESI]"],
      "comment": "Initialize game slots and clear game state flags.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if slot array size is less than 5 AND slot count > 0\n2. If condition met, iterate through all active slots (0 to g_dwSlotCount)\n3. For each slot, check if validation flag (offset +0x265) is 0 (not validated)\n4. If slot invalid, retrieve base slot data via GetSlotDataBase()\n5. Call Ordinal_11108 (D2Common.CopyUnitData) to copy 0xC bytes from slot to base data\n6. Call LogEventData with event code 0x58 and slot identifier\n7. Advance to next slot (stride +0x26A bytes)\n8. After slot processing, clear 3 game initialization/mode flags:\n   - g_bGameInitFlag3 = 0 (Game initialization flag 3)\n   - g_dwGameModeFlag = 0 (Current game mode/state flag)\n   - g_bGameInitFlag5 = 0 (Game initialization flag 5)\n9. Call ClearValidationErrors() to reset error state\n10. Return to caller\n\nOrdinals Referenced:\n- Ordinal_11108 = D2Common.CopyUnitData - Copy typed data between structures (0xC bytes)\n\nParameters:\nNone (void function, operates on global state)\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Skips processing if slot array size >= 5 (capacity threshold)\n- Skips if slot count <= 0 (no slots available)\n- Only processes slots with validation flag clear (0x00)\n- Stride between slots is 0x26A bytes (618 bytes total)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x05 - Slot array capacity threshold for processing\n0x265 - Offset to slot validation flag within slot structure  \n0x26A - Stride/size of each slot entry (618 bytes)\n0x0C - Data copy size for GetSlotDataBase() transfer\n0x58 - Event code for LogEventData (slot initialization event)",
