      "api_calls": ["ValidateStringId", "ValidateStringId", "IsNpcTradeFlagSet", "IsNpcTradeFlagSet", "QueueLogMessage"],
      "instructions": ["0x64FB0|PUSH|ESI", "0x64FB1|MOV|ESI, EDX", "0x64FB3|TEST|ESI, ESI", "0x64FB5|PUSH|EDI", "0x64FB6|JZ|0x6fb3515e", "0x64FBC|MOV|AL, byte ptr [ESI + 0x2]", "0x64FBF|TEST|AL, 0x1", "0x64FC1|JZ|0x6fb35051", "0x64FC7|XOR|EAX, EAX", "0x64FC9|MOV|AL, byte ptr [ESI + 0x1]", "0x64FCC|ADD|EAX, -0x3", "0x64FCF|CMP|EAX, 0x1e", "0x64FD2|JA|0x6fb35314", "0x64FD8|XOR|ECX, ECX", "0x64FDA|MOV|CL, byte ptr [EAX + 0x6fb35338]"],
      "comment": "Main game command packet dispatcher that processes UI state commands.\n\nClassification: Worker function - central dispatcher called from packet handlers.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Save current config value (g_dwConfigValue1) for potential restoration\n2. Validate packet pointer is non-null\n3. Extract packet flags from pbPacketData[2]\n4. If flag bit 0 (0x01) set - process primary commands:\n   - Type 0x03: Validate string 0xE7C, create slot object\n   - Type 0x04: Process unit hash table with callback 1\n   - Type 0x0A: Initialize render state\n   - Type 0x0D: Initialize monster region stats (id=0xD3)\n   - Type 0x0F: Validate string 0xE7E, create slot object\n   - Type 0x17: Enable game system flag\n   - Type 0x21: Initialize game object properties (id=0xED)\n5. If flag bit 1 (0x02) set - process secondary commands:\n   - Type 0x04: Init game object (id=0xF1)\n   - Type 0x08/0x0F/0x12/0x16/0x23: Init game object (id=7)\n   - Type 0x17: Check global system state, enable video skip or init video\n   - Type 0x20: Init game object (id=0xD9)\n   - Type 0x21: Init game object (id=0xF3)\n   - Type 0x24: Set video id to 1\n6. If flags == 0x10 - process tertiary commands:\n   - Type 0x0A: Init game objects (ids=0x998, 0x9AA)\n   - Type 0x21: Get item damage value, init game object with result\n7. If flag bit 5 (0x20) set - process slot/config commands:\n   - Type 0x20: Set g_dwConfigValue3 from packet[4]\n   - Type 0x21: Process unit hash table with callback 2\n   - Other: Check NPC trade flags, update slot data table\n8. Default path: Restore config, handle game mode flag:\n   - If mode==0: Process UI state change (id=0x11), find matching slot, update menu\n   - If mode!=0: Get UI resource 0xF, find matching slot, update slot status\n\nParameters:\n  dwMode (ECX) - Processing mode (typically 1 from thunk wrapper)\n  pbPacketData (EDX) - Pointer to command packet structure:\n    +0x00: Unknown\n    +0x01: Command type byte\n    +0x02: Flags byte (bit 0=primary, bit 1=secondary, bit 5=slot cmd)\n    +0x03: Status/data byte\n    +0x04: Additional data byte\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Null packet pointer jumps to default config restoration path\n  - Status values > 0x0D trigger error logging via QueueLogMessage\n  - Slot index -1 indicates no matching slot found\n  - Timer offset of 0 is normalized to 1\n\nGlobal Data:\n  g_dwConfigValue1 (0x6fbf90e4) - Configuration value, may be set to 0x29A on overflow\n  g_dwConfigValue3 (0x6fbf90ec) - Secondary config, set from packet[4]\n  g_dwGameModeFlag (0x6fbf90d8) - Game mode flag (0/1)\n  g_apSlotIdTable (0x6fbb80f8) - Array of slot IDs, stride 0x10\n  g_aGameSlotData (0x6fbf9195) - Slot data array\n  g_adMenuState (0x6fbf90c0) - Menu state array\n  g_dwCurrentMenuState (0x6fbf90f9) - Current menu state\n  g_bGameInitFlag5 (0x6fbf90f3) - Game init flag\n  g_dwSlotArraySize (0x6fbfa095) - Slot array size\n\nRelated Functions:\n  ProcessGameCommandPacketMode1 - Thunk that calls this with dwMode=1",
