      "comment": "Clears flag bit 1 (0x02) from unit flags field if unit type is 0x20f (527).\n\nClassification: Callback/Handler - Called via ProcessUnitHashTableWithCallback\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if unit type at offset +0x4 equals 0x20f (527)\n2. If match, clear bit 1 (0x02) in flags field at offset +0xe8\n3. Return\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit (ECX) - UnitAny* pointer to unit being processed\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value\n\nCaller Context:\n  Called from ProcessGameCommandPacket when processing command 0x21 with flag 0x20 set.\n  ProcessUnitHashTableWithCallback iterates all units and calls this function for each.\n\nStructure Offsets:\n  +0x04: dwTxtFileNo - Unit type/class ID (compared against 0x20f)\n  +0xe8: dwFlags - Unit state flags (bit 1 cleared if type matches)\n\nFlag Bits at +0xe8:\n  0x02 (bit 1): Unknown flag - cleared for unit type 0x20f",
