      "comment": "Initialize menu state variables to -1 (0xffffffff), marking all menu states as uninitialized.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set EAX to -1 (0xffffffff) using OR EAX, 0xffffffff\n2. Write 0xffffffff to g_adMenuState (0x6fbf90c0)\n3. Write 0xffffffff to g_adMenuState2 (0x6fbf90c4)\n4. Write 0xffffffff to g_adMenuState3 (0x6fbf90c8)\n5. Write 0xffffffff to g_adMenuState4 (0x6fbf90cc)\n6. Write 0xffffffff to g_adMenuState5 (0x6fbf90d0)\n7. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\n(none)\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nGlobal Variables Modified:\n- g_adMenuState @ 0x6fbf90c0 = 0xffffffff\n- g_adMenuState2 @ 0x6fbf90c4 = 0xffffffff\n- g_adMenuState3 @ 0x6fbf90c8 = 0xffffffff\n- g_adMenuState4 @ 0x6fbf90cc = 0xffffffff\n- g_adMenuState5 @ 0x6fbf90d0 = 0xffffffff\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Called during InitializeGameUIState as part of UI initialization sequence\n- Value 0xffffffff (-1) indicates menu state is not yet set/invalid\n- All five menu state variables are reset together atomically\n\nRelated Functions:\n- InitializeGameUIState() - Main initialization routine that calls this function\n- ResetGameStateAndValidationErrors() - Called before this in initialization sequence",
