      "instructions": ["0x65CF0|SUB|ESP, 0x8", "0x65CF3|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ECX + 0x120]", "0x65CF9|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x4], 0x0", "0x65D01|DEC|EAX", "0x65D02|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ECX + 0x124]", "0x65D08|MOV|dword ptr [ESP], EAX", "0x65D0C|PUSH|ESI", "0x65D0D|FILD|qword ptr [ESP + 0x4]", "0x65D11|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x4], ECX", "0x65D15|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x8], 0x0", "0x65D1D|FDIVR|float ptr [0x6fba938c]", "0x65D23|FIMUL|dword ptr [ESP + 0x4]", "0x65D27|FADD|float ptr [0x6fba9388]", "0x65D2D|CALL|0x6fb9a480", "0x65D32|MOV|ESI, EAX"],
      "comment": "Calculates and saves the gamma setting to the Windows registry.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Read raw slider value from config structure at offset 0x120 (nMaxGamma - 1)\n2. Read max gamma divisor from config structure at offset 0x124\n3. Build 64-bit integer from slider value for FPU conversion\n4. Calculate normalized gamma: (sliderValue / 200.0) * maxDivisor + 55.0\n   - 200.0 at 0x6fba938c is the gamma range divisor constant\n   - 55.0 at 0x6fba9388 is the gamma base offset constant\n5. Convert floating-point result to integer via __ftol\n6. Save gamma value to registry: HKCU\\Software\\Blizzard Entertainment\\Diablo II\\Gamma\n7. Apply gamma to DirectDraw via Ordinal_10018 (D2Gfx.SetGamma)\n\nParameters:\npGammaConfig (ECX, IMPLICIT): void* - Pointer to gamma configuration structure\n    +0x120: DWORD nMaxGamma - Maximum gamma slider position + 1\n    +0x124: DWORD nGammaDivisor - Divisor for gamma calculation\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Function is referenced from function pointer tables at 0x6fbbf39c and 0x6fbc1e34\n- Companion function InitializeGammaSetting (FUN_6fb35d60) reads from registry\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 200.0 (0x6fba938c): Gamma range divisor for slider normalization\n- 55.0 (0x6fba9388): Gamma base offset (minimum gamma value)",
