      "instructions": ["0x65D60|SUB|ESP, 0xc", "0x65D63|PUSH|ESI", "0x65D64|PUSH|EDI", "0x65D65|LEA|EAX, [ESP + 0x8]", "0x65D69|XOR|EDI, EDI", "0x65D6B|PUSH|EAX", "0x65D6C|PUSH|EDI", "0x65D6D|PUSH|0x6fbc5290", "0x65D72|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x65D74|PUSH|0x6fbae148", "0x65D79|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x18], 0x9b", "0x65D81|CALL|0x6fb99c5a", "0x65D86|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESI + 0x120]", "0x65D8C|MOV|EDX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x8]", "0x65D90|DEC|ECX"],
      "comment": "Initializes gamma display setting from registry and synchronizes with graphics system.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set default gamma value to 155 (0x9b)\n2. Query registry for stored gamma value under \"Diablo II\\Gamma\"\n3. Calculate scaled gamma: (maxGammaLevels - 1) * (gammaValue - 54) * 0.005\n4. Convert float result to integer via __ftol\n5. Store calculated gamma index at pDisplayConfig+0x124\n6. Call Ordinal_10019 (D2GFX.GetGammaValue) to check graphics system state\n7. If graphics system active (non-zero return):\n   a. Read stored gamma index from pDisplayConfig+0x124\n   b. Calculate registry value: 55.0 + (storedIndex / 200.0) * (maxGammaLevels - 1)\n   c. Convert to integer and save to registry\n   d. Apply gamma via CallOrdinal10018Wrapper (D2GFX.SetGamma)\n\nParameters:\n  pDisplayConfig (ECX): Pointer to display configuration structure\n    +0x120: Maximum gamma levels count\n    +0x124: Current gamma index (written by this function)\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSSA Temporaries (decompiler artifacts):\n  lVar1 (llFtolResult): Return value from __ftol - 64-bit integer result\n  uStack_4 (dwQwordHighPart): High DWORD of 64-bit qword for FILD instruction\n  extraout_EAX: Return value from Ordinal_10019 (graphics ready flag)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x9b (155): Default gamma registry value\n  0x36 (54): Gamma base offset for scaling calculation\n  0.005: Gamma scale factor (g_flGammaScaleFactor)\n  200.0: Gamma level divisor (g_flGammaMaxLevel)\n  55.0: Gamma base offset for reverse calculation (g_flGammaBaseOffset)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - If Ordinal_10019 returns 0, registry is not updated (graphics not ready)\n  - Gamma calculation uses floating point with truncation via __ftol",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_Control"]
