      "comment": "Apply and persist automap fade mode setting with validation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate fade mode value at offset 0x124: if value > 4, reset to 0\n2. Load validated fade mode value from structure field\n3. Call SetAutomapFadeMode() to apply setting internally\n4. Call Ordinal_426 (Storm.INIWriteString) to persist setting to INI file\n5. Return after successful persistence\n\nParameters:\npAutomapState (AutomapState *) - Pointer to automap state structure containing fade mode at offset +0x124\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Always succeeds; invalid fade mode values are clamped to valid range [0,4]\n\nSpecial Cases:\nFade mode must be in range [0, 4]; any value greater than 4 is automatically reset to 0.\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x124 - Offset of fade mode setting within AutomapState structure\n0x4 - Maximum valid fade mode value (supports 5 modes: 0=Off, 1=Low, 2=Med, 3=High, 4=Max)",
