      "comment": "Advances to the next active panel in circular panel list and initializes context.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Increment g_nCurrentPanelIndex by 1\n2. If index exceeds panel count - 1, wrap to 0 (circular list)\n3. Calculate panel data address: g_pPanelDataBase + index * 0x550\n4. Check if panel slot is valid (offset 0x0 != -1)\n5. If slot valid, check callback at offset 0x110\n6. If callback exists, call it - if returns 0, continue search\n7. Once valid active panel found, call InitializeGameObjectProperties(1, 0, 0.0, 0.0, 0)\n8. Set context offset 0x18 to 1 (active state)\n9. Set context offset 0x1c to 0 (reset state)\n10. Insert context into cache via InsertCacheNodeWithCookie\n\nParameters:\n  pPanelContext (dword *) - Pointer to panel context structure; fields at\n    +0x18 set to 1 (active), +0x1c set to 0 (reset)\n\nReturns:\n  void - Panel context modified in place\n\nLocal Variables (SSA temporaries):\n  piVar1 (pPanelData) - int * to current panel data entry at g_pPanelDataBase + index * 0x550\n  iVar2 (nCallbackResult) - int result from validation callback\n\nPanel Data Structure (stride 0x550 = 1360 bytes):\n  Offset  Size  Field                Description\n  0x000   4     nSlotId              Panel slot ID (-1 = unused)\n  0x110   4     pfnValidationCallback Function pointer called to validate panel\n\nGlobals:\n  g_nCurrentPanelIndex (0x6fbfa158) - Current panel index in circular list\n  g_nPanelCount (0x6fbfa15c) - Pointer to panel count value\n  g_pPanelDataBase (0x6fbfa160) - Base address of panel data array\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Circular wraparound: index resets to 0 when exceeding count - 1\n  - Skip invalid slots: panels with slot ID -1 are skipped\n  - Callback validation: if callback at +0x110 exists and returns 0, panel skipped",
