      "api_calls": ["FogAssert", "FogAssert", "FogAssert"],
      "instructions": ["0x66BE0|SUB|ESP, 0x8", "0x66BE3|PUSH|EBX", "0x66BE4|PUSH|ESI", "0x66BE5|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x66BE7|PUSH|EDI", "0x66BE8|TEST|ESI, ESI", "0x66BEA|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x10], ESI", "0x66BEE|JNZ|0x6fb36c0e", "0x66BF0|PUSH|0x5a5", "0x66BF5|PUSH|0x6fbc5340", "0x66BFA|PUSH|0x6fbc5334", "0x66BFF|CALL|0x6fb99a7a", "0x66C04|ADD|ESP, 0xc", "0x66C07|PUSH|-0x1", "0x66C09|CALL|0x6fb9a10f"],
      "comment": "Validates menu item error codes and counts within a menu structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if pItemCount is NULL → abort with error 0x5a5\n2. Check if nMenuBase is non-zero → proceed, else abort with error 0x5a6\n3. Iterate through menu slots from 0 to pItemCount[0]:\n   4. Get current menu node (pMenuNode) at offset 0x120 + (nSlotIndex * 0x550)\n   5. Check pMenuNode[0x107] (error field) → clear if set\n   6. If pMenuNode[-0x48] == 1 (item type flag):\n      7. Get pMenuNode[0] (dwItemCount) → validate in range [1,4]\n      8. If invalid → abort with error 0x5c3\n      9. Iterate through dwItemCount items:\n         10. Check pMenuNode[0x108 + dwItemIndex] (item error) → clear if set\n         11. Increment dwItemIndex, proceed to next item\n   12. Increment nSlotIndex, proceed to next slot\n13. Return\n\nParameters:\npItemCount (int *): Pointer to count of menu slots to validate (IMPLICIT in ECX)\nnMenuBase (int): Base address of menu structure (IMPLICIT in EDX)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - never returns on error (calls FUN_6fb9a10f(-1) which terminates)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- NULL pItemCount → assertion failure (0x5a5)\n- NULL nMenuBase → assertion failure (0x5a6)\n- Item count outside [1,4] → assertion failure (0x5c3)\n- Error codes in pMenuNode[0x107] and pMenuNode[0x108+] are cleared after validation\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x120: Offset of first menu node from base\n0x550: Size of each menu node structure\n0x107: Error field offset within menu node\n0x108: Start of item error array within menu node\n-0x48: Type flag field offset (0x550 - 0x108 = 0x448, -0x48 relative to node pointer)\n\nStructure Layout (MenuItem node):\nOffset | Size | Field Name      | Type   | Description\n0x000  | 4    | dwItemCount     | uint   | Number of items (1-4)\n0x107  | 4    | dwMenuError     | uint   | Menu error code\n0x108  | 16   | dwItemErrors    | uint[4]| Error codes for each item slot\n0x41C  | 4    | dwItemNodeData  | uint   | Item data pointer (validated)\n0x4D8  | 4    | dwItemType      | uint   | Type flag (1 = item menu)",
