      "comment": "Initialize all UI panels and clear accumulated validation errors.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Reset panel count to 0 and clear panel array pointer\n2. Initialize 6 panel configuration arrays via ProcessPanelValidationStatus()\n3. Check first validation error accumulator and report if non-zero, then clear\n4. Check second validation error accumulator and report if non-zero, then clear\n5. Check third validation error accumulator and report if non-zero, then clear\n\nParameters:\n(void)\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Three separate validation error accumulators suggest parallel validation processing\n- Panel initialization order is consistent across 6 array pairs\n- Each error is reported exactly once then cleared to prevent duplicate reporting",
