      "comment": "Processes UI state transitions for specified UI element or all UI elements.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Query current state of UI element 9 (game state UI)\n2. If state exists, update it to state 1 (active)\n3. If nUIIndex != 0, iterate through UI state table at [0x6fbb8628..0x6fbb87f0]\n4. For each non-null entry in table, call state update handler with state 0 (inactive)\n\nParameters:\nnUIIndex - If 0, only update element 9; if non-zero, update all elements in table\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x9 (9) - Game state UI element index\n- 0x1 (1) - Active state for FUN_6fb5d370\n- 0x0 (0) - Inactive state for FUN_6fb5d370\n- 0x6fbb8628 - Start of UI state table\n- 0x6fbb87f0 - End of UI state table\n- Stride: 12 bytes (0xC) per table entry\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FUN_6fb5d340(9) - Queries game state UI existence\n- FUN_6fb5d370() - Processes state transitions for UI elements",
