      "instructions": ["0x677E0|MOV|EDX, ECX", "0x677E2|SUB|ESP, 0x48", "0x677E5|TEST|EDX, EDX", "0x677E7|JZ|0x6fb378c3", "0x677ED|PUSH|EDI", "0x677EE|MOV|ECX, 0x12", "0x677F3|XOR|EAX, EAX", "0x677F5|LEA|EDI, [ESP + 0x4]", "0x677F9|STOSD.REP|ES:EDI", "0x677FB|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbfa188]", "0x67800|POP|EDI", "0x67801|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x4], EAX", "0x67805|MOV|EAX, EDX", "0x67807|DEC|EAX", "0x67808|JZ|0x6fb3789a"],
      "comment": "Render game message panel with specified type and position on screen.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if nPanelType is 0 (early exit)\n2. Initialize 18-element message buffer array to zero\n3. Set buffer[1] to icon resource ID from g_dwMessagePanelIconId\n4. Branch on nPanelType:\n   - Type 1: Render left-aligned panel at (width/2 - 205, height - 47)\n   - Type 2: Render centered panel at conditional x-position (width/2 - 84 or -74), y = height - 47\n   - Type 3: Render right-aligned panel at conditional x-position (width/2 + 35 or +56), y = height - 47\n5. Call Ordinal_10072 (Storm.DrawText) to render text in buffer at calculated position\n\nParameters:\nnPanelType (int) - Message panel type: 0=hide, 1=left, 2=center, 3=right\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value; renders directly to screen\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Type 0 returns early without rendering\n- Type 2 and 3 check g_dwExtendedPanelMode flag to adjust x-offset by 10-15 pixels\n- All non-zero types render at same y-coordinate (height - 47)\n- Color hardcoded to 0xFFFFFFFF (white), font size 5 pixels\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x12 (18) - Message buffer element count\n0x2F (47) - Y-offset from screen bottom\n0xCD (205), 0x54 (84), 0x4A (74), 0x23 (35), 0x38 (56) - X-position offsets from center\n0xFFFFFFFF - White text color (ARGB)\n0x5 (5) - Font size in pixels",
      "tags": ["PARAM_1"]
