      "comment": "Initialize UI element panel state and clear element configuration.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call GetCurrentServerPort() to determine connection state\n2. If port is 0 (no server), load minipanel_s config resource via FUN_6fb5a050()\n3. If port is non-zero, load minipanel config resource via FUN_6fb5a050()\n4. Store icon resource ID in g_dwMessagePanelIconId\n5. Set g_dwExtendedPanelMode: 1 if port=0, 0 if port!=0\n6. Load minipanelbtn config resource via FUN_6fb5a050()\n7. Store button resource ID in g_pUIElementConfigTable\n8. Set nElementCount to 8 if extended mode, else 7\n9. Iterate from nElementCount to 0, clearing g_adwUIElementState array\n10. Return\n\nParameters:\n(none)\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If nElementCount <= 0, array clearing loop skipped\n- Uses REP STOSD for bulk zero initialization\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x0 - No server port (connection inactive)\n0x7 - Element count for normal mode\n0x8 - Element count for extended mode",
