      "comment": "Read resolution configuration from INI and configure graphics mode accordingly.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Query resolution setting from Diablo II.ini using Ordinal_423 (Fog.dll - GetPrivateProfileIntA)\n2. Initialize graphics mode to 0 (default)\n3. If resolution value equals 1, set graphics mode to 2 (higher resolution)\n4. Apply graphics mode configuration by calling SetGraphicsModeConfiguration\n\nParameters:\nvoid - No parameters\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\nResolution value of 1 maps to graphics mode 2. Other values default to mode 0.\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x6fbae148 - Address of \"Diablo II\" string (INI section name)\n0x6fbc5278 - Address of \"Resolution\" string (INI key name)\n0x0 - Default value for GetPrivateProfileIntA if key not found\n0x2 - Graphics mode value for resolution setting 1\n0x1 - Resolution setting threshold value",
