      "instructions": ["0x69890|SUB|ESP, 0x8", "0x69893|PUSH|EBX", "0x69894|PUSH|EBP", "0x69895|PUSH|ESI", "0x69896|MOV|ESI, EDX", "0x69898|PUSH|EDI", "0x69899|MOV|EDI, dword ptr [ESP + 0x1c]", "0x6989D|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESI]", "0x6989F|PUSH|EDI", "0x698A0|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x14], ECX", "0x698A4|PUSH|EAX", "0x698A5|CALL|0x6fb98ab8", "0x698AA|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESI]", "0x698AC|MOV|EBP, EAX", "0x698AE|PUSH|EDI"],
      "comment": "Calculates monster damage range with mastery skill bonuses and renders it.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get monster max and min base damage using GetMonsterMaxDamage/GetMonsterMinDamage\n2. Extract weapon type byte from pMonsterData[0x129]\n3. Calculate base min damage range: (pMonsterData[0x51] + pMonsterData[0x4b] + maxDmg + minDmg) << shift * 0x4B >> 8\n4. Calculate base max damage range: (pMonsterData[0x52] + pMonsterData[0x4c] + maxDmg + minDmg) << shift * 0x4B >> 8\n5. Get game context and check if unit type is player (field_4 == 1)\n6. Check Sword Mastery state (0x47): if active and weapon type matches (0x01), apply skill bonus percentage\n7. Check Axe Mastery state (0x48): if active and weapon type matches (0x02), apply skill bonus percentage  \n8. If weapon type != 0, get item inventory size and adjust dimensions for additional damage\n9. Call DrawRangeText to render final min-max damage range\n\nParameters:\npLookupTable (dword * ECX) - Pointer to lookup table for item size calculations\npMonsterData (int * EDX) - Pointer to monster data structure with damage stats\ndwDifficultyLevel (dword Stack[0x4]) - Game difficulty level for damage scaling\nnXOffset (int Stack[0x8]) - Horizontal offset for text rendering\nnYOffset (int Stack[0xc]) - Vertical offset for text rendering\nnWidth (int Stack[0x10]) - Available width for text centering\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Renders damage range text directly to screen\n\nMonster Data Structure Offsets:\n0x128 - Damage shift amount (byte, masked to 5 bits)\n0x129 - Weapon type byte (0x01=sword, 0x02=axe)\n0x12C - Min damage modifier 1\n0x130 - Max damage modifier 1\n0x144 - Min damage modifier 2\n0x148 - Max damage modifier 2\n0xD4 - Weapon type check byte at pMonsterData[0x35]\n\nSkill IDs:\n0x3D (61) - Sword Mastery skill\n0x3F (63) - Axe Mastery skill\n\nState Flags:\n0x47 - Sword Mastery active state\n0x48 - Axe Mastery active state\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x4B (75) - Damage scaling factor (75/256 = ~29% modifier)\n0x100 (256) - Division factor via right shift 8",
      "tags": ["PARAM_6", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_Skill", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
    },
