      "comment": "Initializes slot resource by retrieving stat value and setting output parameters.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get current game state object via FUN_6fb62880\n2. Dereference offset 0x84 within state object \n3. Call Ordinal_10258 (D2Common.GetUnitStat) with dereferenced value to obtain stat\n4. Initialize first output parameter to zero\n5. Initialize second output parameter to zero\n6. Call FUN_6fb39c10 with output parameters, stat value, implicit this pointer, and slot ID\n\nParameters:\nnSlotId: Slot or resource identifier\npOutValue1: Pointer to first output value (initialized to 0)\npOutValue2: Pointer to second output value (initialized to 0)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Sets output parameters via pointers\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Implicit this parameter passed via ECX register (__thiscall convention)\n- Both output parameters unconditionally initialized to zero before processing",
