      "instructions": ["0x69C10|PUSH|ECX", "0x69C11|PUSH|EBX", "0x69C12|PUSH|EBP", "0x69C13|PUSH|ESI", "0x69C14|PUSH|EDI", "0x69C15|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x10], EDX", "0x69C19|MOV|EBP, ECX", "0x69C1B|CALL|0x6fb62880", "0x69C20|MOV|ESI, EAX", "0x69C22|PUSH|ESI", "0x69C23|CALL|0x6fb98af4", "0x69C28|MOV|dword ptr [EBP], EAX", "0x69C2B|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x24]", "0x69C2F|TEST|EBX, EBX", "0x69C31|JNZ|0x6fb39c4a"],
      "comment": "Calculates modified resource cost for skill execution based on unit stats and configurations.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Retrieve current unit context and base resource cost\n2. Validate param_6 is non-zero (error if zero, logs to g_szSkillHandleError)\n3. Determine skill resource type: if nSkillId is zero, fetch from unit offset 0x84\n4. Check if skill type equals 0x26 (resource type marker); if match, zero both outputs and jump to LAB_6fb39c80\n5. Calculate base modifier: Ordinal_11023(unit, 0, skillId, 0, param_6, 1) returns base\n6. Add stat value: Ordinal_10520(unit, 0x77) retrieves additional stat modifier\n7. Fetch config data: Ordinal_10966() retrieves global config structure\n8. Add scaling from config: multiply (nParam5 - 1) by config[0x124], add config[0x120]\n9. Check config validity and byte at offset 0xeb; if set, add Ordinal_10519(unit, 0x145) bonus\n10. Percentage calculation: (*pOutValue * total_modifier) / 100 + *pOutValue\n11. Reset pOutModifier to 0x00\n12. Check Ordinal_10537(unit) - if non-zero, set pOutModifier = 0x03\n13. Check Ordinal_10544(unit) - if non-zero, set pOutModifier = 0x01\n\nParameters:\n- pOutValue (int *, ECX): Pointer to output value; initialized with base resource cost from Ordinal_10432\n- pOutModifier (uint *, EDX): Pointer to output modifier flags (0x00=normal, 0x01=special, 0x03=bonus)\n- nSkillId (uint, [ESP+0x4]): Skill identifier to calculate for\n- nAnotherParam (uint, [ESP+0x8]): Additional configuration parameter\n- nParam5 (int, [ESP+0xc]): Scaling factor for stat multiplier\n- nParam6 (int, [ESP+0x10]): Validation flag (must be non-zero)\n- nParam7 (int, [ESP+0x14]): Optional resource type override\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value, modifications made through pointers)\n- Side effect: pOutValue contains final calculated cost, pOutModifier contains status flag\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If nSkillId == 0x26: both outputs zeroed, function returns early\n- If nParam6 == 0: logs error via Ordinal_10025 but continues execution\n- If nParam7 == 0: attempts to fetch skill type from unit[0x84]\n- Config byte at offset 0xeb acts as enable flag for bonus calculation\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x26: Skill resource type marker\n- 0x84: Offset in unit structure for default skill resource type\n- 0x77: Stat identifier for additional modifier lookup\n- 0x124: Offset in config structure for scaling multiplier\n- 0x120: Offset in config structure for base scaling value\n- 0xeb: Offset in config structure for bonus enable flag\n- 0x145: Stat identifier for bonus calculation\n- 100: Divisor for percentage-based modification calculation\n- 0x01: Modifier flag for special state\n- 0x03: Modifier flag for bonus state",
      "tags": ["PARAM_7", "MOD_UI", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "UI_SKILLS", "SRC_SkillDesc.cpp", "TBL_skilldesc", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
