      "instructions": ["0x69E70|SUB|ESP, 0x10", "0x69E73|PUSH|ESI", "0x69E74|PUSH|EDI", "0x69E75|MOV|ESI, EDX", "0x69E77|MOV|EDI, ECX", "0x69E79|CALL|0x6fb62880", "0x69E7E|PUSH|EAX", "0x69E7F|CALL|0x6fb983fe", "0x69E84|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x69E86|JZ|0x6fb39eb8", "0x69E88|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x28]", "0x69E8C|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x24]", "0x69E90|MOV|EDX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x20]", "0x69E94|PUSH|0x1", "0x69E96|PUSH|EAX"],
      "comment": "Draw item damage or stat range text for inventory UI display.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get current game context (player unit)\n2. Check if unit is in weapon animation mode via IsUnitWeaponAnimMode\n3. If weapon anim mode active:\n   - Delegate to DrawDamageRangeText with FUN_6fb39f90 callback\n   - Pass through text position (nTextX, nTextY) and color\n   - Early return\n4. Initialize rendering coordinates and display mode to zero\n5. Call CalcImageCoordinates to compute base X/Y and display mode from item data\n6. Read zoom factor from pItemData at offset 0x129 (byte value)\n7. If zoom factor non-zero:\n   - Call GetItemInventorySize to get grid dimensions\n   - Call CalculateAdjustedDimensions to apply scaling\n   - Apply zoom factor to X: nRenderX += (nScaleFactor * zoom + rounding) >> 3\n   - Apply zoom factor to Y: nRenderY += (nAdjustedHeight * zoom + rounding) >> 3\n   - Division by 8 converts pixel dimensions to grid cells\n8. Call DrawRangeText with final coordinates and text params\n\nParameters:\npdwDamageFlags (ECX) - Damage/skill flags pointer, passed to inventory size calc\npItemData (EDX) - Item structure pointer, contains zoom at 0x129\nnScaleFactor - Scale/dimension parameter for coordinate calculations\nnTextX - Horizontal text position\nnTextY - Vertical text position\nnTextColor - Text color value\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Weapon animation mode bypasses normal coordinate calculation\n- Zero zoom factor at 0x129 skips inventory size adjustments\n- Rounding uses signed arithmetic: (val >> 31) & 7 handles negative cases\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x129: Zoom factor byte offset in item structure\n- 0x1f: Bit mask for sign extension (31)\n- 7: Rounding mask (2^3 - 1) for divide by 8\n- 3: Shift amount for divide by 8\n\nCallees:\n- GetGameContext: Get current player unit\n- IsUnitWeaponAnimMode: Check weapon animation state\n- DrawDamageRangeText: Alternate rendering path for weapon mode\n- CalcImageCoordinates: Calculate base rendering coordinates\n- GetItemInventorySize: Get item grid dimensions\n- CalculateAdjustedDimensions: Apply dimension scaling\n- DrawRangeText: Final text rendering call",
      "tags": ["PARAM_6", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_ItemData", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
    },
