      "instructions": ["0x6A340|SUB|ESP, 0xc", "0x6A343|PUSH|EBX", "0x6A344|PUSH|EBP", "0x6A345|PUSH|ESI", "0x6A346|MOV|EBP, EDX", "0x6A348|PUSH|EDI", "0x6A349|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x10], ECX", "0x6A34D|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x14], EBP", "0x6A351|CALL|0x6fb62880", "0x6A356|MOV|EBX, EAX", "0x6A358|PUSH|EBX", "0x6A359|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x1c], EBX", "0x6A35D|CALL|0x6fb983fe", "0x6A362|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x6A364|JZ|0x6fb3a486"],
      "comment": "Validates game object state change and executes callback with result handling.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get current game object context via FUN_6fb62880\n2. Check if object state is valid (Ordinal_10462 - context validation)\n3. If valid, retrieve state flags from object+0x84 offset\n4. Extract state flag #4 and #5 via Ordinal_10257\n5. Validate both flags are accessible via Ordinal_10839\n6. Check if flags equal 0x26 (VALID_STATE constant) via Ordinal_10751\n7. If both flags valid and not 0x26, call FUN_6fb3a4a0 for processing\n8. If processing result valid, invoke callback pfnCallback with processed result\n9. Call FUN_6fb3a550 for state finaliation\n10. If finalization valid, invoke callback again with finalization result\n11. On any validation failure, invoke callback with 0x0 (NULL result)\n12. Return 1 on success, 0 on early validation failure\n\nParameters:\n- pdwOutVal1: Output pointer for result value 1 (ECX register)\n- pdwOutVal2: Output pointer for result value 2 (EDX register)\n- nEventId: Event/operation identifier\n- pdwOutVal3: Output pointer for intermediate state\n- pdwOutVal4: Output pointer for intermediate state\n- nParam1: Processing parameter\n- nParam2: Processing parameter\n- pfnCallback: Callback function pointer (code *) - receives (nParam, nArg1, nArg2, nParam2, nResult)\n- nCallbackArg1: First callback argument (typically callback context)\n- nCallbackArg2: Second callback argument (callback auxiliary data)\n\nReturns:\n- 1: Processing completed (callback invoked, output values set)\n- 0: Validation failed early (callback invoked with NULL, no output)\n\nOrdinals Used:\n- Ordinal_10462: Context validation check\n- Ordinal_10257: State flag extraction by index\n- Ordinal_10839: Flag accessibility/validity check\n- Ordinal_10751: Flag value query\n\nCallee Functions:\n- FUN_6fb62880: Get current game context\n- FUN_6fb3a4a0: Process state change (ActivateSecondaryWeaponSlot)\n- FUN_6fb3a550: Finalize state (ProcessPlayerInventoryState)",
