      "instructions": ["0x6A6D0|SUB|ESP, 0x10", "0x6A6D3|PUSH|ESI", "0x6A6D4|PUSH|EDI", "0x6A6D5|MOV|EDI, ECX", "0x6A6D7|MOV|ESI, EDX", "0x6A6D9|LEA|EAX, [ESP + 0x10]", "0x6A6DD|LEA|ECX, [ESP + 0xc]", "0x6A6E1|PUSH|EAX", "0x6A6E2|LEA|EDX, [ESP + 0xc]", "0x6A6E6|PUSH|ECX", "0x6A6E7|PUSH|EDX", "0x6A6E8|MOV|EDX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x28]", "0x6A6EC|MOV|ECX, ESI", "0x6A6EE|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x14], 0x0", "0x6A6F6|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x18], 0x0"],
      "comment": "Displays scaled weapon damage range text at specified screen coordinates.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize output values (nScaledMinDamage=0, nScaledMaxDamage=0, dwColorMode=0)\n2. Call CalcImageCoordinates to get base display coordinates and color mode\n3. Read damage scale factor byte from pImageData + 0x129\n4. Call CalculateWeaponDamage with dwMastery to get base min/max damage values\n5. Scale min damage: nScaledMinDamage += (nMinDamage * byScaleFactor + rounding) / 8\n6. Scale max damage: nScaledMaxDamage += (nMaxDamage * byScaleFactor + rounding) / 8\n7. Call DrawRangeText to render formatted damage range at calculated position\n\nParameters:\n  dwMastery (dword ECX) - Weapon mastery level for damage calculation\n  pImageData (int * EDX) - Image/entity data structure with scale factor at +0x129\n  nXOffset (int Stack[0x4]) - Initial X offset, reused for min damage output\n  nYOffset (int Stack[0x8]) - Vertical offset for text positioning\n  nWidth (int Stack[0xc]) - Width constraint for text centering\n  nColorCode (int Stack[0x10]) - UI color code for text rendering\n\nReturns:\n  void - Renders damage text directly to screen\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Scale factor at offset +0x129 is single byte (0-255)\n  - Division by 8 uses signed arithmetic with rounding adjustment\n  - Rounding formula: (value + (value >> 31 & 7)) >> 3 handles negative values\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x129 - Offset to damage scale factor byte in pImageData structure\n  0x7 (7) - Rounding mask for signed division by 8\n  0x3 (3) - Right shift amount for division by 8\n  0x1f - Sign bit position for rounding adjustment",
