      "comment": "Wrapper for ValidateAndProcessStateChange with CalculateSkillResourceValue callback.\n\nClassification: Thunk/Wrapper - wraps single function with preset callback\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call ValidateAndProcessStateChange with CalculateSkillResourceValue as callback\n2. Copy temporary output values (pdwTempVal1, pdwTempVal2) to primary outputs (pdwOutVal1, pdwOutVal2)\n3. Clear temporary values to zero\n\nParameters:\n- this (ECX): Context parameter passed to ValidateAndProcessStateChange as nParam2\n- nCallbackArg2: Callback argument passed to ValidateAndProcessStateChange\n- pdwOutVal1: Output pointer - receives value from pdwTempVal1 after processing\n- pdwOutVal2: Output pointer - receives value from pdwTempVal2 after processing\n- pdwTempVal1: Temp output pointer - receives intermediate result, cleared after copy\n- pdwTempVal2: Temp output pointer - receives intermediate result, cleared after copy\n\nReturns: void\n\nCallee Functions:\n- ValidateAndProcessStateChange (0x6fb3a340): Main state validation and callback invocation\n- CalculateSkillResourceValue (0x6fb39c10): Callback passed to process skill resource values\n\nNote: No callers found - may be orphaned or called via function pointer table.",
