      "comment": "Display damage range text for a unit's equipped weapon(s)\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get current weapon/inventory state (GetEquipmentData)\n2. Check if unit can carry two weapons - abort if not dual-wielding capable\n3. Determine weapon class from unit item type\n4. Query minimum/maximum damage values for the weapon\n5. Render damage range text at specified screen coordinates\n\nParameters:\ndwUnit - Unit ID whose damage will be displayed\npScreenPos - Pointer to screen position array [x, y, width, height]\nnX - Horizontal offset for damage text\nnY - Vertical offset for damage text\nnScreenWidth - Viewport width in pixels\nnScreenHeight - Viewport height in pixels\n\nReturns: void (draws text directly to screen)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- GetEquipmentData() - Retrieves item/weapon info\n- DrawDamageRangeText() - Renders text to viewport",
