      "instructions": ["0x6ADB0|SUB|ESP, 0xc", "0x6ADB3|PUSH|ESI", "0x6ADB4|PUSH|EDI", "0x6ADB5|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x6ADB7|PUSH|0x0", "0x6ADB9|PUSH|0x0", "0x6ADBB|PUSH|ESI", "0x6ADBC|PUSH|0x0", "0x6ADBE|LEA|EAX, [ESP + 0x20]", "0x6ADC2|PUSH|0x0", "0x6ADC4|PUSH|EAX", "0x6ADC5|LEA|EDX, [ESP + 0x20]", "0x6ADC9|LEA|ECX, [ESP + 0x24]", "0x6ADCD|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x28], 0x0", "0x6ADD5|CALL|0x6fb391c0"],
      "comment": "Draw item inventory dimensions modified by skill percentage bonus.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize color code to 0 (default style)\n2. Call GetItemInventorySize to get base item width/height from skill context\n3. Get skill TXT ID via GetSkillsTxtId\n4. Get skill modifier percentage via GetMonsterResurrectMode (returns percentage bonus)\n5. Apply percentage modifier to width: nItemWidth += (nModifier * nItemWidth) / 100\n6. Apply percentage modifier to height: nItemHeight += (nModifier * nItemHeight) / 100\n7. Call CalculateAdjustedDimensions for damage/resistance adjustments\n8. Draw range text displaying modified dimensions at specified coordinates\n\nParameters:\nthis (Skill * in ECX) - Skill structure pointer used for dimension lookup\ndwUnused (dword) - Unused parameter (reserved/padding)\nnXOffset (int) - Horizontal screen offset for text rendering\nnYOffset (int) - Vertical screen offset for text rendering\nnWidth (int) - Available width for centering calculation\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Renders text directly to screen\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- GetMonsterResurrectMode returns percentage (e.g., 50 = +50% size bonus)\n- Division by 100 applies percentage scaling to base dimensions\n- Magic constant 0x51eb851f in disassembly is fixed-point division by 100\n\nOrdinal Functions:\n- GetSkillsTxtId: Get skill TXT record ID from Skill pointer\n- GetMonsterResurrectMode: Get skill-based modifier percentage",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
