      "api_count": 17,
      "api_calls": ["GetInventoryWeaponItem", "GetItemStatsTableOffset", "GetUnitSkillById", "GetUnitStateFlag", "GetSkillLevel", "GetMinionStatSum", "GetMonsterMaxHP", "GetMonsterLevelScaledValue", "GetItemTypeChar", "GetTotalStatValue", "...+7 more"],
      "instructions": ["0x6AE70|SUB|ESP, 0xc", "0x6AE73|PUSH|ESI", "0x6AE74|CALL|0x6fb62880", "0x6AE79|MOV|ESI, EAX", "0x6AE7B|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x4], 0x0", "0x6AE83|LEA|EAX, [ESP + 0x4]", "0x6AE87|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESI + 0x84]", "0x6AE8D|PUSH|EAX", "0x6AE8E|PUSH|ECX", "0x6AE8F|CALL|0x6fb986ec", "0x6AE94|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x6AE96|JZ|0x6fb3b01c", "0x6AE9C|MOV|EDX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x4]", "0x6AEA0|PUSH|EBX", "0x6AEA1|PUSH|EBP"],
      "comment": "DrawWeaponDamageRange - Calculates and displays weapon damage range for the player.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get player unit from game context\n2. Get equipped weapon from inventory slot 0x84\n3. If no weapon, exit early\n4. Get item stats table offset for the weapon\n5. Extract min/max damage percentages from stats table (offsets +2, +3)\n6. Check if player has Fury skill (0x75) with state flag 0x65 active\n7. If Fury active, add skill-based minion stat bonuses to damage percentages\n8. Get monster level scaled damage value (stat 0x61)\n9. Apply strength bonus (stat 0) scaled by item type char\n10. Apply dexterity bonus (stat 2) scaled by item max stack\n11. Add enhanced damage bonus (stat 0x19)\n12. Get min damage (stat 0x12) and max damage (stat 0x11) bonuses\n13. Check HasActiveStateFlags for color code 3 (red)\n14. Check IsUnitSelectable for color code 1 (white)\n15. Calculate final min damage: (baseDmg + enhDmg) * minPct / 100 + minBonus + minPct\n16. Calculate final max damage: (baseDmg + enhDmg) * maxPct / 100 + maxBonus + maxPct\n17. Call DrawRangeText with calculated min/max and color code\n\nParameters:\n- param_1 (nMonsterLevel): Monster level for damage scaling\n- param_2 (nScreenX): Screen X coordinate for text display\n- param_3 (nScreenY): Screen Y coordinate for text display\n- param_4 (nUnused): Unused parameter\n\nReturns: void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x75: Fury skill ID\n- 0x65: Fury state flag\n- 0x61: Monster level scaled damage stat\n- 0x19 (25): Enhanced damage stat\n- 0x12 (18): Minimum damage stat\n- 0x11 (17): Maximum damage stat\n- 0x84: Inventory weapon slot offset\n- 100: Percentage divisor for damage calculation\n\nColor Codes:\n- 1: White (normal, unit selectable)\n- 3: Red (active state flags present)",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_Skill", "PARAM_4", "STRUCT_ItemData", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
    },
