      "instructions": ["0x6B160|SUB|ESP, 0xc", "0x6B163|PUSH|ESI", "0x6B164|PUSH|EDI", "0x6B165|MOV|EDI, EDX", "0x6B167|CALL|0x6fb62880", "0x6B16C|MOV|ESI, EAX", "0x6B16E|CALL|0x6fadb920", "0x6B173|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x6B175|JZ|0x6fb3b20c", "0x6B17B|XOR|EAX, EAX", "0x6B17D|LEA|ECX, [ESP + 0xc]", "0x6B181|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x8], EAX", "0x6B185|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0xc], EAX", "0x6B189|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x10], EAX", "0x6B18D|LEA|EAX, [ESP + 0x10]"],
      "comment": "Draws damage range text for missile attacks or armor-based calculations.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get game context (player unit) and check global system state\n2. If system state non-zero (melee/armor mode):\n   a. Initialize damage values and color flags to 0\n   b. Calculate image coordinates from coordinate table\n   c. Get armor bonus stat from unit\n   d. Apply percentage bonus: value = value + (value * bonus) / 100\n   e. Draw range text with calculated min/max and color\n3. If system state zero (missile mode):\n   a. Get missile template record for missile ID 0x280 (640)\n   b. Extract base min damage from template offset 0x94\n   c. Extract base max damage from template offset 0x98\n   d. Get enhanced damage percentage (stat 0x19 = 25)\n   e. Get missile damage value for skill level\n   f. Add missile damage to base values\n   g. Apply enhanced damage: final = base + (base * pct) / 100\n   h. Draw range text with no color flags (0)\n\nParameters:\ndwUnused (ECX) - Unused parameter (passed but not referenced)\npnCoordTable (EDX) - Pointer to coordinate lookup table\nnSkillLevel - Skill level for damage calculation\nnBaseX - Base X position for text display\nnBaseY - Base Y position for text display\nnColor - Text color value\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x280 (640) - Missile template ID\n0x94 - Offset for minimum damage in missile template\n0x98 - Offset for maximum damage in missile template\n0x19 (25) - Enhanced damage stat ID\n100 - Percentage divisor\n\nCallers:\nNo direct callers found (possibly called via function pointer)\n\nCallees:\nGetGameContext, GetGlobalSystemState, CalcImageCoordinates,\nGetUnitArmorBonusFromStat, GetMissileTemplateRecord, GetTotalStatValue,\nGetMissileDamageValue, DrawRangeText",
