      "instructions": ["0x6BCC0|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x4]", "0x6BCC4|SUB|ESP, 0x60", "0x6BCC7|MOV|EDX, dword ptr [EAX + 0xf0]", "0x6BCCD|PUSH|EBX", "0x6BCCE|PUSH|EBP", "0x6BCCF|PUSH|ESI", "0x6BCD0|PUSH|EDI", "0x6BCD1|MOV|EDI, ECX", "0x6BCD3|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [EAX + 0xf4]", "0x6BCD9|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x78]", "0x6BCDD|PUSH|ECX", "0x6BCDE|PUSH|EDX", "0x6BCDF|PUSH|EAX", "0x6BCE0|CALL|0x6fb98b18", "0x6BCE5|MOV|EBP, EAX"],
      "comment": "Formats a level-scaled stat value and appends localized text to the destination Unicode string.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate scaled value using CalculateScaledValue with character level and min/max values from descriptor offsets +0xF0/+0xF4\n2. Initialize 64-element Unicode buffer by calling default constructor 32 times (2 bytes per element)\n3. If scaled value is 0, return 0 (no text appended)\n4. Format scaled value as decimal string using wsprintfA with \"%d\" format\n5. Convert ANSI string to Unicode using toUnicode (max 32 chars)\n6. Append converted value to destination string via strcat (ECX=dest, EDX=src)\n7. Validate and retrieve localized string 0x10B4\n8. Append localized string to destination\n9. Validate and retrieve localized string 0x0F9E\n10. Append localized string to destination\n11. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n  IMPLICIT ECX: Unicode* - destination string to append formatted text\n  pStatDescriptor: Pointer to stat descriptor structure containing:\n    +0xF0: int - minimum value for scaling\n    +0xF4: int - maximum value for scaling\n  nCharacterLevel: Character level for value scaling calculation\n\nReturns:\n  int - 0 if scaled value is 0 (nothing appended), 1 on success\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Early return with 0 if calculated scaled value is 0\n  - String IDs 0x10B4 and 0x0F9E are localization table indices for stat suffix text\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x20 (32) - Unicode buffer size and loop count\n  0xF0 - Offset to min value in stat descriptor\n  0xF4 - Offset to max value in stat descriptor\n  0x10B4 - Localized string ID for stat text separator\n  0x0F9E - Localized string ID for stat text suffix",
