      "instructions": ["0x6BE30|SUB|ESP, 0x68", "0x6BE33|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x74]", "0x6BE37|PUSH|EBX", "0x6BE38|PUSH|EBP", "0x6BE39|MOV|EBP, dword ptr [ESP + 0x74]", "0x6BE3D|PUSH|ESI", "0x6BE3E|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [ESP + 0x7c]", "0x6BE42|PUSH|EDI", "0x6BE43|PUSH|EAX", "0x6BE44|MOV|EBX, EDX", "0x6BE46|MOV|EDI, ECX", "0x6BE48|PUSH|ESI", "0x6BE49|PUSH|EBP", "0x6BE4A|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x20], EBX", "0x6BE4E|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x1c], EDI"],
      "comment": "Format monster damage display string with Holy Freeze/Holy Shock buff bonuses.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString to initialize output with base formatting\n2. Get monster max damage via GetMonsterMaxDamage(nMonsterId, nMonsterLevel)\n3. Load min/max damage deltas from pStatConfig offsets 0x144 and 0x148\n4. If any damage values non-zero:\n   a. Apply bit shift scaling: (value << shift) >> 8 using pStatConfig[0x128]\n   b. For monster IDs 0x14, 0x31, 0x35: force min damage to 1\n   c. Check Holy Freeze buff (state 0x47) on player unit:\n      - If active and config flag at 0xd4 == 0x01, apply skill 0x3d bonus\n      - Bonus = (skillLevel * damage) / 100 added to both min/max\n   d. Check Holy Shock buff (state 0x48) on player unit:\n      - If active and config flag at 0xd4 == 0x02, apply skill 0x3f bonus\n      - Bonus = (skillLevel * damage) / 100 added to both min/max\n   e. Format final damage range with FormatLocalizationString\n5. Call FormatResourceStatString for additional stat formatting\n6. Get skill ID via GetMonsterSkillId and format skill string if non-zero\n7. Initialize Unicode buffer and append skill-related localized strings\n\nParameters:\n  pOutput (ECX): Output buffer for formatted Unicode string\n  nMonsterId (EDX): Monster type identifier for damage lookup\n  pStatConfig (Stack+0x4): Stat configuration structure pointer:\n    +0xd4: Buff type flag (0x01=Holy Freeze, 0x02=Holy Shock)\n    +0x128: Bit shift amount for damage scaling\n    +0x140: Display format flag\n    +0x144: Min damage delta\n    +0x148: Max damage delta\n  nMonsterLevel (Stack+0x8): Monster level for damage calculation\n  nParam5 (Stack+0xc): Additional formatting parameter\n\nReturns:\n  void - Output written to pOutput buffer\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x14, 0x31, 0x35: Monster IDs that force minimum damage to 1\n  0x47: Holy Freeze state flag\n  0x48: Holy Shock state flag\n  0x3d: Holy Freeze skill ID (61)\n  0x3f: Holy Shock skill ID (63)\n  0x10e6, 0x10e7, 0xf9e: Localization string IDs for skill formatting",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
