      "instructions": ["0x6C320|SUB|ESP, 0x68", "0x6C323|PUSH|EBX", "0x6C324|PUSH|EBP", "0x6C325|PUSH|ESI", "0x6C326|PUSH|EDI", "0x6C327|MOV|ESI, EDX", "0x6C329|MOV|EBP, ECX", "0x6C32B|PUSH|0xe6", "0x6C330|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x18], ESI", "0x6C334|CALL|0x6fb9836e", "0x6C339|MOV|EDX, ESI", "0x6C33B|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x80]", "0x6C342|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x7c]", "0x6C346|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x10], EAX", "0x6C34A|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x84]"],
      "comment": "Calculate attribute modifier values applying condition-based percentage adjustments.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Query attribute values from game state (pGameObject at offset 0xac, 0xb0)\n2. Apply bit shift based state configuration (offset 0x8c)\n3. Multiply by 0x4b and normalize (>> 8) to compute base attribute values\n4. Query game state flags (pGameContext structure check at offset 0x4)\n5. If flags set: apply percentage bonus from modifier table (0x3d, 0x3f)\n6. Calculate bonus: (percentage * value) / 100\n7. Apply secondary conditions based on nAttrType (0x14, 0x31, 0x35 special)\n8. Check context flags at offset 0xd4 (values 0x01, 0x02)\n9. Apply additional percentage modifiers if context matched\n10. Return final computed modifier value\n\nParameters:\n  pGameObject (void *) - Game state object containing attribute data at offsets 0xac, 0xb0, 0x8c\n  nAttrType (int) - Attribute type code (0x14, 0x31, 0x35 have special handling)\n  pGameContext (void *) - Context object with flags at offsets 0x4, 0xd4, 0x140, 0x144, 0x148, 0x128\n  nBaseValue (int) - Initial base value for calculations\n  nModifierIndex (int) - Index selecting which modifier tables to apply\n\nReturns:\n  uint - Final calculated modifier value (0x1 on success)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - If context[0x4] != 1, skip modifier table lookups\n  - Special attribute types (0x14, 0x31, 0x35) force primary value to 1\n  - Context flag 0x01 applies 0x3d modifier; 0x02 applies 0x3f modifier\n  - Bit shifts use offset 0x8c value masked with 0x1f for bit width\n  - Division by 100 uses fixed-point multiplication (0x51eb851f) with SAR/SHR normalization\n\nStructure Layout:\n  pGameObject at [ECX]:\n    Offset | Size | Field    | Type | Description\n    0xac   | 4    | dwValue1 | uint | Primary attribute value\n    0xb0   | 4    | dwValue2 | uint | Secondary attribute value\n    0x8c   | 1    | byShift  | byte | Shift amount for bit operations\n  pGameContext at [Stack+0x4]:\n    Offset | Size | Field       | Type | Description\n    0x4    | 4    | dwFlags     | uint | Feature flags (1 = enable modifiers)\n    0x128  | 1    | byShift     | byte | Secondary shift amount\n    0xd4   | 1    | byCondType  | byte | Condition type (0x01, 0x02)\n    0x140  | 1    | byAdjust    | byte | Adjustment parameter\n    0x144  | 4    | dwOffset1   | uint | Offset value 1\n    0x148  | 4    | dwOffset2   | uint | Offset value 2",
