      "comment": "Formats a monster skill description for UI display.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString to format the base localized string with parameters\n2. Get the monster's skill ID for the given slot via GetMonsterSkillId\n3. Format the skill resource string using FormatResourceString with suffix type 0\n\nParameters:\n- nIndex (dword, ECX): Resource index for localization string lookup\n- nMonsterId (int, EDX): Monster type ID for skill lookup\n- nParam3 (int, Stack+0x4): Configuration structure pointer passed to localization\n- nSkillSlot (int, Stack+0x8): Skill slot index (0-based) for monster skill lookup\n- nParam5 (int, Stack+0xC): Alternate format parameter for localization\n\nReturns:\n- 1 (always) - Success indicator\n\nClassification: Wrapper/Thunk - Combines localization and skill formatting\n\nCallees:\n- FormatLocalizationString: Formats base localized string\n- GetMonsterSkillId: Retrieves skill ID for monster at slot\n- FormatResourceString: Formats skill resource with duration/value",
