      "instructions": ["0x6C840|PUSH|ECX", "0x6C841|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x10]", "0x6C845|PUSH|EBX", "0x6C846|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [ESP + 0xc]", "0x6C84A|PUSH|EBP", "0x6C84B|PUSH|ESI", "0x6C84C|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [ESP + 0x18]", "0x6C850|PUSH|EDI", "0x6C851|PUSH|EAX", "0x6C852|MOV|EDI, ECX", "0x6C854|PUSH|ESI", "0x6C855|MOV|EBP, EDX", "0x6C857|PUSH|EBX", "0x6C858|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x1c], EDI", "0x6C85C|CALL|0x6fb38bf0"],
      "comment": "Apply damage modifiers to displayed coordinates based on game state and spell effects.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Format localization string with initial parameters (buffer, type, object, mod value)\n2. Get resource array multiplier via Ordinal_11046\n3. Calculate offset into object buffer: multiplier * (nModValue - 1) + base_offset\n4. Format resource string at calculated offset\n5. Get adjustment factor via Ordinal_11045\n6. Load base X/Y adjustments from game object (offsets 0x144, 0x148)\n7. Add adjustment factor to both coordinates\n8. Check if any value non-zero; if all zero, return success\n9. Apply coordinate shift: (coord << shift_bits) >> 8, where shift_bits from offset 0x128\n10. Override to 1 if resource type is 0x14, 0x31, or 0x35 (special types)\n11. For first modifier (0x47): Get game state, check flag, query 0x3d percentage, apply adjustment\n12. For second modifier (0x48): Get game state, check flag, query 0x3f percentage, apply adjustment\n13. Format final string with modified coordinates and alpha value (offset 0x140)\n14. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n- pszBuffer (void*): Output buffer for formatted display string\n- nResourceType (int): Resource/attack type identifier\n- pGameObject (void*): Pointer to game object structure containing state and adjustment values\n- nModValue (int): Resource count or modification multiplier\n- nUnused (int): Unused parameter\n\nReturns:\n- 1: Always returns success (operation never fails)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- NULL object pointer bypasses object-specific modifier checks but continues processing\n- All-zero adjustments skip coordinate modification entirely\n- Shift amount clamped to 31 bits maximum via mask 0x1f",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
