      "comment": "Formats extended monster statistics for tooltip display with player-scaled modifiers.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString to initialize base localization output\n2. If more than 1 player (nNumPlayers > 1):\n   a. Calculate additional players factor (nNumPlayers - 1)\n   b. Format Physical Resistance modifier from offset 0xF8 scaled by player count\n      - Use \"+%d\" format if positive, \"%d\" if negative\n      - Append localized strings 0x10BB, 0x10B3, 0xF9E\n   c. Format Magic Resistance modifier from offset 0xFC scaled by player count\n      - Append localized strings 0x10B2, 0x10B3, 0xF9E\n   d. Format Fire Resistance modifier from offset 0xF4 scaled by player count\n      - Append localized strings 0x10A0, 0x10B3, 0xF9E\n3. Calculate Experience modifier:\n   a. Get base experience factor from offset 0xF0\n   b. Get frame index via GetVideoFrameCount()\n   c. Get monster init stats for ID 0x165\n   d. Average values from offsets 0x174 and 0x180 indexed by frame\n   e. Scale by experience factor and player count / 100\n   f. If non-zero, format and append with localized strings 0x10C6, 0xF9E\n\nParameters:\n  pOutputString (ECX): Unicode output buffer for formatted stats\n  nMonsterId (EDX): Monster type identifier\n  pMonsterStats (Stack+0x4): Pointer to monster stats structure with resistance modifiers\n  nNumPlayers (Stack+0x8): Number of players affecting stat scaling\n  pFormatString (Stack+0xC): Format string for localization\n\nReturns: void (output via pOutputString)\n\nMonster Stats Structure Offsets:\n  +0xF0: Experience modifier base (int)\n  +0xF4: Fire resistance modifier per player (int)\n  +0xF8: Physical resistance modifier per player (int)\n  +0xFC: Magic resistance modifier per player (int)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x10BB - Physical resistance label string ID\n  0x10B2 - Magic resistance label string ID\n  0x10A0 - Fire resistance label string ID\n  0x10B3 - Separator/suffix string ID\n  0xF9E  - Newline/terminator string ID\n  0x10C6 - Experience modifier label string ID\n  0x165  - Monster init stats lookup ID\n  0x20   - Unicode buffer size (32 characters)\n\nCalled Functions:\n  FormatLocalizationString - Base localization formatting\n  GetVideoFrameCount - Get current frame index for stat lookup\n  GetMonsterInitStatsPtr - Get monster initialization data\n  ValidateStringId - Validate and retrieve localization string\n  wsprintfA - Format integer to ANSI string\n  Unicode::toUnicode - Convert ANSI to Unicode\n  Unicode::strcat - Concatenate Unicode strings",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_Room1", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
