      "api_count": 12,
      "api_calls": ["GetMonsterMaxDamage", "GetUnitStateFlag", "GetUnitSkillById", "GetSkillLevel", "GetMonsterSkillId", "GetUnitStateFlag", "GetUnitSkillById", "GetSkillLevel", "GetMonsterSkillId", "GetMonsterLevelScaledValue", "...+2 more"],
      "instructions": ["0x6CD10|SUB|ESP, 0x68", "0x6CD13|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x74]", "0x6CD17|PUSH|EBX", "0x6CD18|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x70]", "0x6CD1C|PUSH|EBP", "0x6CD1D|PUSH|ESI", "0x6CD1E|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [ESP + 0x7c]", "0x6CD22|PUSH|EDI", "0x6CD23|PUSH|EAX", "0x6CD24|MOV|EBP, EDX", "0x6CD26|MOV|EDI, ECX", "0x6CD28|PUSH|ESI", "0x6CD29|PUSH|EBX", "0x6CD2A|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x20], EBP", "0x6CD2E|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x1c], EDI"],
      "comment": "Formats monster damage stats with aura bonus calculations for UI display.\n\nCalculates base damage from skill descriptor, applies Concentration (0x47) and\nFanaticism (0x48) aura bonuses when active, then formats the result for display.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString with initial parameters\n2. Get base damage via GetMonsterMaxDamage(nSkillId, nMonsterLevel)\n3. Calculate min damage = pSkillDesc->field_144 + baseDamage\n4. Calculate max damage = pSkillDesc->field_148 + baseDamage\n5. If any damage value non-zero:\n   a. Scale damage by shift factor at pSkillDesc+0x128 then divide by 256\n   b. For special skills (0x14, 0x31, 0x35), set min damage to 1\n   c. Check Concentration aura (state 0x47):\n      - Get skill 0x3d level and bonus percent\n      - Apply percent bonus: damage += (bonus * damage) / 100\n   d. Check Fanaticism aura (state 0x48):\n      - Get skill 0x3f level and bonus percent  \n      - Apply percent bonus: damage += (bonus * damage) / 100\n   e. Call FormatLocalizationString with final min/max damage\n6. Get level-scaled value via GetMonsterLevelScaledValue\n7. Initialize Unicode buffer (32 elements)\n8. If scaled value non-zero:\n   a. Format as ANSI using wsprintfA with \"%d\" format\n   b. Convert to Unicode\n   c. Append localization strings 0x10a7 and 0xf9e\n\nParameters:\n  pOutputBuffer - Output buffer for formatted string (ECX, __fastcall)\n  nSkillId - Skill identifier, special handling for 0x14/0x31/0x35 (EDX)\n  pSkillDesc - Pointer to skill descriptor structure with damage fields\n  nMonsterLevel - Monster level for damage scaling\n  nUnused - Unused parameter (always 0)\n\nReturns:\n  1 - Always returns success\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Skills 0x14, 0x31, 0x35 force minimum damage to 1\n  - Concentration aura (state 0x47) applies when pSkillDesc->field_d4 == 1\n  - Fanaticism aura (state 0x48) applies when pSkillDesc->field_d4 == 2\n  - If pSkillDesc is NULL, both aura bonuses can apply\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x47 - STATE_CONCENTRATION (Concentration aura active)\n  0x48 - STATE_FANATICISM (Fanaticism aura active)\n  0x3d - SKILL_CONCENTRATION (61)\n  0x3f - SKILL_FANATICISM (63)\n  0x14 - Special skill ID (20)\n  0x31 - Special skill ID (49)\n  0x35 - Special skill ID (53)\n  0x10a7 - Localization string ID for damage display\n  0xf9e - Localization string ID for damage display\n  0x51eb851f - Magic constant for divide by 100 optimization\n\nSkill Descriptor Offsets:\n  +0x128 - Damage scale shift factor (byte)\n  +0x140 - Display format flag (byte)\n  +0x144 - Min damage modifier (int)\n  +0x148 - Max damage modifier (int)\n  +0xd4 - Aura type flag (1=Concentration, 2=Fanaticism)",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
    },
