      "instructions": ["0x6CF20|SUB|ESP, 0x68", "0x6CF23|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x74]", "0x6CF27|PUSH|EBX", "0x6CF28|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x70]", "0x6CF2C|PUSH|EBP", "0x6CF2D|PUSH|ESI", "0x6CF2E|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [ESP + 0x7c]", "0x6CF32|PUSH|EDI", "0x6CF33|PUSH|EAX", "0x6CF34|MOV|EBP, EDX", "0x6CF36|MOV|EDI, ECX", "0x6CF38|PUSH|ESI", "0x6CF39|PUSH|EBX", "0x6CF3A|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x20], EBP", "0x6CF3E|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x1c], EDI"],
      "comment": "Formats monster damage text with Concentration and Fanaticism aura bonuses applied.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString with initial damage parameters\n2. Get base monster max damage via GetMonsterMaxDamage(nSkillId, nMonsterLevel)\n3. Compute min/max damage from skill descriptor offsets +0x144/+0x148\n4. Scale damage values using shift factor from pSkillDesc+0x128\n5. For skill IDs 0x14, 0x31, 0x35 (trap-type skills), force min damage to 1\n6. Get game context and check if unit type == 1 (player)\n7. Check for Concentration Aura (state 0x47, skill 0x3D):\n   - If active and skill descriptor type == 1, apply percentage bonus\n   - Get skill level, compute bonus as (bonus * damage) / 100\n8. Check for Fanaticism Aura (state 0x48, skill 0x3F):\n   - If active and skill descriptor type == 2, apply percentage bonus\n9. Format final damage string with FormatLocalizationString\n10. Initialize Unicode buffer array (32 wchar_t elements)\n11. If skill has monster skill ID, format and append localization strings:\n    - String 0x10E6: Damage type separator\n    - String 0x10B7: Damage range format\n    - String 0x0F9E: Damage suffix\n\nParameters:\n  wszOutputBuffer (ECX): Output wide string buffer for formatted damage text\n  nSkillId (EDX): Skill ID to format damage for\n  pSkillDesc (Stack+0x04): Pointer to skill descriptor structure\n  nMonsterLevel (Stack+0x08): Monster level for damage calculation\n  nSkillLevel (Stack+0x0C): Skill level for damage scaling\n  IMPLICIT unaff_ESI: Unicode string source pointer (preserved register)\n  IMPLICIT unaff_EDI: Unicode string destination pointer (preserved register)\n\nReturns:\n  void - Output written to wszOutputBuffer\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Skills 0x14 (Fire Blast), 0x31 (Lightning Sentry), 0x35 (Death Sentry) force min=1\n  - Concentration Aura only applies when skill descriptor byte at +0xD4 == 1\n  - Fanaticism Aura only applies when skill descriptor byte at +0xD4 == 2\n\nSkill Descriptor Offsets:\n  +0x128: Shift factor for damage scaling (byte, masked to 5 bits)\n  +0x140: Damage type indicator (byte)\n  +0x144: Base minimum damage addition (int)\n  +0x148: Base maximum damage addition (int)\n  +0x0D4: Aura application type (1=Concentration, 2=Fanaticism)\n\nState Flags:\n  0x47 = STATE_CONCENTRATION - Concentration Aura active\n  0x48 = STATE_FANATICISM - Fanaticism Aura active\n\nString IDs:\n  0x10E6 = Damage type prefix\n  0x10B7 = Damage range format  \n  0x0F9E = Damage suffix",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
