      "instructions": ["0x6D140|SUB|ESP, 0x60", "0x6D143|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x6c]", "0x6D147|PUSH|EBX", "0x6D148|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x68]", "0x6D14C|PUSH|EBP", "0x6D14D|MOV|EBP, dword ptr [ESP + 0x70]", "0x6D151|PUSH|ESI", "0x6D152|PUSH|EDI", "0x6D153|PUSH|EAX", "0x6D154|PUSH|EBP", "0x6D155|MOV|EDI, EDX", "0x6D157|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x6D159|PUSH|EBX", "0x6D15A|CALL|0x6fb38bf0", "0x6D15F|PUSH|EDI"],
      "comment": "Formats monster stat modifier strings for tooltip display.\n\nAppends three possible modifier stats to the output buffer:\n1. Experience bonus/penalty (based on pMonsterData offset 0x104)\n2. Level modifier stat (type 0x13)\n3. Skill modifier stat (type 0x13)\n\nEach modifier section:\n- Formats value with sign (+/-) using wsprintfA\n- Converts ANSI to Unicode\n- Concatenates localization strings for label and value\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString to get initial formatted count\n2. Calculate experience difference = pMonsterData[0x104] - GetMonsterExperienceByLevel()\n3. Initialize Unicode buffer (64 elements, 32 iterations of 2-byte init)\n4. If experience diff != 0:\n   a. Format with \"%d\" to ANSI buffer\n   b. Convert to Unicode\n   c. Append string ID 0x10df (experience label)\n   d. Append formatted value\n   e. Append string ID 0x10b3 (separator)\n   f. Append string ID 0xf9e (newline/terminator)\n5. Get level modifier via GetMonsterLevelStat(0x13, nMonsterLevel)\n6. Re-initialize Unicode buffer\n7. If level mod != 0:\n   a. Use \"+%d\" format if positive, \"%d\" if negative\n   b. Format and convert to Unicode\n   c. Append string ID 0x10b2 (level label)\n   d. Append value, separator, terminator\n8. Accumulate modifier count\n9. Get skill modifier via GetMonsterSkillId(0x13, nMonsterLevel)\n10. Re-initialize Unicode buffer\n11. If skill mod != 0:\n    a. Format with sign prefix\n    b. Append string ID 0x10a0 (skill label)\n    c. Append value, separator, terminator\n12. Return total modifier line count\n\nParameters:\n  pOutputBuffer (ECX): Unicode buffer to append formatted strings\n  nAreaLevel (EDX): Current area/difficulty level\n  pMonsterData (Stack+0x4): Pointer to monster data structure\n    - Offset 0x104: Base experience value\n  nMonsterLevel (Stack+0x8): Monster level for stat lookups\n  nModifierParam (Stack+0xC): Additional modifier parameter\n\nReturns:\n  int - Total count of modifier lines appended (0-3)\n\nString IDs:\n  0x10df - Experience modifier label\n  0x10b2 - Level modifier label\n  0x10b3 - Separator string\n  0x10a0 - Skill modifier label\n  0xf9e  - Line terminator\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x13   - Stat type constant for level/skill modifiers\n  0x20   - Unicode buffer size (32 iterations)\n  0x104  - Monster data experience offset",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_Room1", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control"]
