      "instructions": ["0x6D540|SUB|ESP, 0x60", "0x6D543|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x6c]", "0x6D547|PUSH|EBX", "0x6D548|PUSH|EBP", "0x6D549|PUSH|ESI", "0x6D54A|PUSH|EDI", "0x6D54B|MOV|EDI, dword ptr [ESP + 0x78]", "0x6D54F|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x6D551|PUSH|EAX", "0x6D552|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x78]", "0x6D556|PUSH|EDI", "0x6D557|PUSH|ECX", "0x6D558|MOV|ECX, ESI", "0x6D55A|CALL|0x6fb38bf0", "0x6D55F|PUSH|EDI"],
      "comment": "Format monster level bonus string with +/- prefix for display.\n\nWorker function that extends base localization formatting with a monster level\nbonus value. Called after FormatLocalizationString to append scaled bonus\ninformation to the output string.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString with all parameters to get base formatted result\n2. Call GetMonsterLevelScaledValue(0x16, nMonsterLevel) to get level-scaled bonus\n3. Initialize 64-element Unicode buffer (32 iterations, 2 bytes each)\n4. If scaled bonus is 0, return base result unchanged (no bonus to display)\n5. Select format string based on bonus sign:\n   - Negative: g_szLocalizationConfig (\"%d\" at 0x6fbb0de4)\n   - Positive: g_szResourceFormatPlus (\"+%d\" at 0x6fbc6358)\n6. Format scaled bonus value to ANSI string using wsprintfA\n7. Convert ANSI to Unicode via toUnicode into local buffer\n8. Append localized strings via strcat (string IDs 0x10a0, 0x10b3, 0xf9e)\n9. Return base result + 1 indicating bonus was appended\n\nParameters:\n- dwStringIndex (dword, ECX): String index for base localization lookup\n- nFormatMode (int, EDX): Format mode selector for FormatLocalizationString\n- nStructParam (int, stack+4): Structure parameter for formatting\n- nMonsterLevel (int, stack+8): Monster level used for bonus scaling (0x16=22)\n- nExtraParam (int, stack+c): Additional parameter passed to base formatter\n\nIMPLICIT: ESI, EDI contain source/destination Unicode string pointers from caller\n\nReturns:\n- Base format result (dwFormatResult) if no bonus to append (scaled value = 0)\n- Base format result + 1 if bonus string was appended successfully\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x16: Monster stat index for GetMonsterLevelScaledValue (decimal 22)\n- 0x20: Loop count (32) for initializing 64-byte Unicode buffer\n- 0x10a0: String ID for first localized suffix\n- 0x10b3: String ID for second localized suffix  \n- 0xf9e: String ID for final localized suffix\n\nString Formats:\n- g_szResourceFormatPlus at 0x6fbc6358: \"+%d\" for positive bonuses\n- g_szLocalizationConfig at 0x6fbb0de4: \"%d\" for negative bonuses",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control"]
    },
