      "instructions": ["0x6D630|SUB|ESP, 0x60", "0x6D633|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x6c]", "0x6D637|PUSH|EBX", "0x6D638|PUSH|EBP", "0x6D639|PUSH|ESI", "0x6D63A|PUSH|EDI", "0x6D63B|MOV|EDI, dword ptr [ESP + 0x78]", "0x6D63F|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x6D641|PUSH|EAX", "0x6D642|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x78]", "0x6D646|PUSH|EDI", "0x6D647|PUSH|ECX", "0x6D648|MOV|ECX, ESI", "0x6D64A|CALL|0x6fb38bf0", "0x6D64F|PUSH|EDI"],
      "comment": "FormatMonsterExpBonusString - Formats experience bonus display strings for monster level tooltips\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString with passed parameters to get base line count\n2. Query scaled experience bonus via GetMonsterLevelScaledValue(10, nMonsterLevel)\n3. Initialize 64-element Unicode buffer for string construction\n4. If scaled bonus is non-zero:\n   a. Select format string: \"+%d\" for positive, \"%d\" for negative\n   b. Format numeric bonus into ANSI buffer\n   c. Convert to Unicode\n   d. Concatenate localized strings: StringId 0x10a0 (scaled exp label), formatted value,\n      StringId 0x10b3 (exp string), StringId 0x10da (per level), StringId 0xf9e (separator)\n   e. Increment line count\n5. Query base experience stat via GetMonsterLevelStat(10, nMonsterLevel)\n6. Re-initialize Unicode buffer\n7. If stat bonus is non-zero:\n   a. Select format string: \"+%d\" for positive, \"%d\" for negative\n   b. Format numeric bonus into ANSI buffer\n   c. Convert to Unicode\n   d. Concatenate localized strings: StringId 0x10b2 (stat exp label), formatted value,\n      StringId 0x10b3 (exp string), StringId 0x10da (per level), StringId 0xf9e (separator)\n   e. Increment line count\n8. Return total line count (base + scaled bonus line + stat bonus line)\n\nParameters:\n  dwStringIndex (ECX) - Base localization string ID for formatting\n  nFormatMode (EDX) - Format mode passed to FormatLocalizationString\n  nStructParam - Structure parameter for formatting context\n  nMonsterLevel - Monster level used to query experience bonuses\n  nExtraParam - Additional parameter passed to FormatLocalizationString\n  IMPLICIT unaff_ESI - Source Unicode string pointer for strcat operations\n  IMPLICIT unaff_EDI - Destination Unicode string pointer for strcat operations\n\nReturns:\n  int - Total number of lines formatted (base lines + 0-2 bonus lines)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  10 (0x0A) - Stat ID for experience bonus queries\n  0x20 (32) - Unicode buffer element count\n  0x10a0 - String ID for scaled experience bonus label\n  0x10b2 - String ID for stat experience bonus label\n  0x10b3 - String ID for experience string\n  0x10da - String ID for \"per level\" suffix\n  0xf9e - String ID for line separator\n  0x6fbc6358 - g_szResourceFormatPlus \"+%d\" format string\n  0x6fbb0de4 - g_szLocalizationConfig \"%d\" format string\n\nNotes:\n  Function handles both scaled and base experience bonuses from monster level tables.\n  Each bonus type (scaled, stat) adds one line if non-zero.\n  Negative values use plain \"%d\" format, positive use \"+%d\" prefix.",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control"]
