      "comment": "Formats a monster's skill ID as a localized string value.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Preserve pszOutputBuffer (ECX) in ESI for use by FormatAndAppendStringValue\n2. Call GetMonsterSkillId(nMonsterId, nSkillSlot) to retrieve skill ID\n3. Pass skill ID to FormatAndAppendStringValue which formats and appends to output buffer\n4. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\npszOutputBuffer (char *): IMPLICIT via ESI - destination buffer for formatted string (passed to FormatAndAppendStringValue via register preservation)\nnMonsterId (int): Monster identifier to look up skill for\npszSourceBuffer (char *): IMPLICIT via ESI preservation - source buffer pointer\nnSkillSlot (int): Skill slot index (0-based) to retrieve\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Function pointer table entry at 0x6fbc5824\n- Part of stat/skill display formatting system\n- ESI preserved across calls for implicit buffer parameters",
