      "instructions": ["0x6F990|SUB|ESP, 0x68", "0x6F993|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x74]", "0x6F997|PUSH|EBX", "0x6F998|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x70]", "0x6F99C|PUSH|EBP", "0x6F99D|PUSH|ESI", "0x6F99E|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [ESP + 0x7c]", "0x6F9A2|PUSH|EDI", "0x6F9A3|PUSH|EAX", "0x6F9A4|MOV|EBP, EDX", "0x6F9A6|MOV|EDI, ECX", "0x6F9A8|PUSH|ESI", "0x6F9A9|PUSH|EBX", "0x6F9AA|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x20], EBP", "0x6F9AE|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x1c], EDI"],
      "comment": "Formats monster damage statistics with skill-based damage modifiers for UI display.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString with initial parameters for base formatting\n2. Get base monster max damage via GetMonsterMaxDamage(nMonsterId, nMonsterLevel)\n3. Calculate min/max damage from MonsterData offsets 0x144/0x148 plus base damage\n4. If any damage values are non-zero:\n   a. Apply damage scaling: shift left by MonsterData[0x128] bits, then right by 8\n   b. For special monster types (0x14, 0x31, 0x35), set minimum to 1\n   c. Check for Conviction aura (state 0x47): apply skill 0x3D bonus percentage\n   d. Check for Amplify Damage (state 0x48): apply skill 0x3F bonus percentage\n   e. Format final damage range with FormatLocalizationString\n5. Get level-scaled value and format resource string\n6. Get monster skill ID and if non-zero:\n   a. Format skill ID using wsprintfA with g_szFmtDecimal format string\n   b. Convert to Unicode and append localization strings (0x10BB, 0x10B3, 0xF9E)\n\nParameters:\n  pOutputBuffer (ECX): Unicode output buffer for formatted damage string\n  nMonsterId (EDX): Monster type identifier (checked for 0x14/0x31/0x35 special cases)\n  pMonsterData (Stack+0x4): Pointer to monster data structure with damage bonuses\n  nMonsterLevel (Stack+0x8): Monster level for damage scaling\n  nParam5 (Stack+0xC): Additional formatting parameter\n\nReturns: void (output written to pOutputBuffer)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Monster IDs 0x14, 0x31, 0x35 force minimum damage to 1\n- State 0x47 (Conviction): Requires MonsterData[0xD4] == 0x01 or pMonsterData == NULL\n- State 0x48 (Amplify Damage): Requires MonsterData[0xD4] == 0x02 or pMonsterData == NULL\n\nMonsterData Structure Offsets:\nOffset  Size  Field              Description\n0x128   1     byDamageShift      Damage scaling shift amount (masked to 5 bits)\n0x140   1     byDisplayFlags     Display format flags\n0x144   4     nMinDamageBonus    Minimum damage bonus value\n0x148   4     nMaxDamageBonus    Maximum damage bonus value\n0xD4    1     byElementType      Elemental type (0x01=Lightning, 0x02=Fire)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x47: STATE_CONVICTION aura state flag\n- 0x48: STATE_AMPLIFYDAMAGE state flag\n- 0x3D: SKILL_CONVICTION (Paladin aura)\n- 0x3F: SKILL_AMPLIFYDAMAGE (Necromancer curse)\n- 0x51eb851f: Fixed-point multiplier for division by 100 (percentage calculation)\n- 0x10BB, 0x10B3, 0xF9E: Localization string IDs for skill effect formatting",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
