      "comment": "Formats monster resurrection bonus modifier for UI display.\n\nRetrieves resurrection mode bonus for monster index 0x42 (66), formats as signed \ninteger string with optional plus sign, then concatenates multiple localized \nstring components for final display text.\n\nClassification: Worker function - formatting helper for monster stat display\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call GetMonsterResurrectMode(0x42) to get resurrection bonus modifier\n2. Initialize 32-element Unicode buffer array with default constructors\n3. If resurrection mode is 0, return 0 (no bonus to display)\n4. Select format string: \"+%d\" if positive, \"%d\" if negative\n5. Format integer value into ANSI buffer using wsprintfA\n6. Convert ANSI buffer to Unicode with toUnicode (max 32 chars)\n7. Retrieve localized string 0x10C1 via ValidateStringId\n8. Concatenate validated string to destination twice\n9. Retrieve localized string 0x10B3 via ValidateStringId\n10. Concatenate validated string to destination\n11. Retrieve localized string 0x10F9E via ValidateStringId\n12. Concatenate validated string to destination\n13. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n  IMPLICIT ECX - pDestString: Destination Unicode string buffer for output\n  IMPLICIT ESI - pSrcString: Source string reference for concatenation\n  Stack (12 bytes cleaned via RET 0xC) - Three stack parameters passed to callees\n\nReturns:\n  int - 0 if resurrection mode is 0 (nothing to format), 1 on success\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Returns early with 0 if resurrection modifier is zero (no display needed)\n  - Negative values formatted without plus sign, positive values get \"+\" prefix\n  - Monster index 0x42 is hardcoded (Uber Diablo resurrection bonus?)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x42 (66)    - Monster table index for resurrection mode lookup\n  0x20 (32)    - Loop count and max Unicode buffer length\n  0x10C1       - Localized string ID (resurrection label prefix?)\n  0x10B3       - Localized string ID (resurrection stat separator?)\n  0xF9E        - Localized string ID (resurrection label suffix?)\n\nString Format Reference:\n  g_szResourceFormatPlus (0x6fbc6358) = \"+%d\" - positive value format\n  g_szLocalizationConfig (0x6fbb0de4) = \"%d\"  - negative value format",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_0", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control"]
