      "instructions": ["0x70330|SUB|ESP, 0x68", "0x70333|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x74]", "0x70337|PUSH|EBX", "0x70338|PUSH|EBP", "0x70339|MOV|EBP, dword ptr [ESP + 0x74]", "0x7033D|PUSH|ESI", "0x7033E|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [ESP + 0x7c]", "0x70342|PUSH|EDI", "0x70343|PUSH|EAX", "0x70344|MOV|EBX, EDX", "0x70346|MOV|EDI, ECX", "0x70348|PUSH|ESI", "0x70349|PUSH|EBP", "0x7034A|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x20], EBX", "0x7034E|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x1c], EDI"],
      "comment": "Calculates monster damage range with player skill buff modifiers applied.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Format initial localization string with monster parameters\n2. Get base monster max damage for given level\n3. Calculate min/max damage from monster data offsets +0x144 and +0x148\n4. Apply shift modifier from offset +0x128, divide by 256 (right shift 8)\n5. Special case: For undead monsters (0x14, 0x31, 0x35), set min damage to 1\n6. Get game context and check if unit type is player (field_4 == 1)\n7. Check Venom state flag (0x47) - if active and element matches (0x01):\n   a. Get Venom skill (0x3D) and its level\n   b. Calculate bonus percentage from skill\n   c. Apply bonus: damage += (bonus * damage) / 100\n8. Check Blade Shield state flag (0x48) - if active and element matches (0x02):\n   a. Get Blade Shield skill (0x3F) and its level\n   b. Calculate bonus percentage from skill\n   c. Apply bonus: damage += (bonus * damage) / 100\n9. Format final damage range with element type from offset +0x140\n10. Get monster skill ID for additional skill text\n11. Initialize 64-element Unicode buffer\n12. If no additional skill, return sum of format results\n13. Format skill ID to string, convert to Unicode\n14. Append skill text with separators (0x10b8, 0xf9e)\n15. Return sum of format results plus 1\n\nParameters:\n- pOutputBuffer (void*): Output buffer for formatted string (ECX)\n- nMonsterId (int): Monster type identifier (EDX)\n- pMonsterData (void*): Pointer to monster data structure with damage values\n- nLevel (int): Monster/skill level for damage calculation\n- nFlags (int): Additional formatting flags\n\nReturns:\n- int: Sum of format operation results (character count or status)\n\nMonster Data Structure Offsets:\n- +0x128: Shift amount for damage scaling (byte)\n- +0x140: Element type indicator (byte)\n- +0x144: Minimum damage modifier (int)\n- +0x148: Maximum damage modifier (int)\n- +0xd4: Element type for buff check (byte)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x14, 0x31, 0x35: Undead monster type IDs\n- 0x3D (61): Venom skill ID\n- 0x3F (63): Blade Shield skill ID\n- 0x47 (71): Venom state flag\n- 0x48 (72): Blade Shield state flag\n- 0x10b8: Localization string ID (skill separator)\n- 0xf9e: Localization string ID (skill separator)",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
