      "comment": "Formats a localization string with a numeric format code appended.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString with all parameters to format base string\n2. Initialize 64-element Unicode buffer (32 iterations, 2 bytes each)\n3. If nFormatCode == 1:\n   a. Format string \"1\" using wsprintfA with g_szLocalizationConfig format\n   b. Convert ANSI result to Unicode via toUnicode\n   c. Append to destination string, use string ID 0x10fb\n4. Else (nFormatCode != 1):\n   a. If nFormatCode == 0: return early with success (1)\n   b. Format nFormatCode value using wsprintfA with g_szLocalizationConfig\n   c. Convert ANSI result to Unicode via toUnicode\n   d. Append to destination string, use string ID 0x10c8\n5. Call ValidateStringId with selected string ID\n6. Call strcat function pointer (append localized string)\n7. Call ValidateStringId(0xf9e) for delimiter/suffix\n8. Call strcat function pointer again\n9. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n- pDestString (dword, ECX): Destination Unicode string object pointer\n- nUnused (int, EDX): Unused parameter passed through to FormatLocalizationString\n- nLocaleParam (int, Stack+0x4): Locale parameter passed to FormatLocalizationString\n- nFormatCode (int, Stack+0x8): Format code - 0=skip, 1=fixed, other=dynamic value\n- nExtraParam (int, Stack+0xc): Extra parameter passed to FormatLocalizationString\n\nReturns:\n- 1: Success (always, except early return on nFormatCode==0)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- nFormatCode == 0: Early return without appending format code\n- nFormatCode == 1: Uses string ID 0x10fb (fixed format)\n- nFormatCode > 1: Uses string ID 0x10c8 (dynamic format)\n- unaff_ESI/unaff_EDI: Phantom registers from caller context (strcat source/dest)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x20 (32): Loop iterations for Unicode buffer init (64 elements / 2)\n- 0x10fb: String ID for fixed format code \"1\"\n- 0x10c8: String ID for dynamic format codes\n- 0xf9e: String ID for delimiter/suffix string\n- 0x60: Stack frame size (96 bytes)\n\nCalling Convention: __fastcall (ECX=pDestString, EDX=nUnused, stack params)",
