      "instructions": ["0x70CB0|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0xc]", "0x70CB4|SUB|ESP, 0x60", "0x70CB7|PUSH|EBX", "0x70CB8|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x6c]", "0x70CBC|PUSH|EBP", "0x70CBD|PUSH|ESI", "0x70CBE|PUSH|EDI", "0x70CBF|MOV|EDI, ECX", "0x70CC1|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x74]", "0x70CC5|PUSH|EAX", "0x70CC6|PUSH|EBX", "0x70CC7|PUSH|ECX", "0x70CC8|MOV|ESI, EDX", "0x70CCA|MOV|ECX, EDI", "0x70CCC|CALL|0x6fb38bf0"],
      "comment": "Formats radius damage text with localized yard measurement.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString to initialize string formatting context\n2. Call GetMonsterLevelScaledValue to get damage radius based on monster level\n3. Initialize 32-element Unicode buffer (64 wchar_t elements)\n4. Calculate display value: scaledValue = (monsterScaledValue * 10) / 3\n5. Extract integer part: nWholePart = scaledValue / 10\n6. Extract fractional part: nFractionalPart = scaledValue % 10\n7. Clamp nWholePart to minimum of 1\n8. If fractional part is zero: format as integer (e.g., \"5\")\n9. Else: format with decimal point (e.g., \"5.3\")\n10. Convert ANSI formatted string to Unicode\n11. Append localized prefix string (0x10ae)\n12. Append formatted radius number\n13. Select singular (0x10c0) or plural (0x10b6) yards string based on nWholePart\n14. Append yards string\n15. Append suffix string (0x0f9e)\n16. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n- pOutputBuffer (dword, ECX): Pointer to output Unicode buffer\n- nMonsterIndex (int, EDX): Monster index for level lookup\n- nLevel (int, Stack+0x4): Character level for scaling\n- nUnused (int, Stack+0x8): Unused parameter passed to sub-functions\n- nUnused2 (int, Stack+0xc): Unused parameter passed to sub-functions\n\nReturns:\n- 1: Always returns success\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x20 (32): Unicode buffer element count (64 wchar_t)\n- 10, 3: Scaling factors for radius conversion (multiply by 10/3)\n- 0x10ae: Localized string ID for radius prefix\n- 0x10b6: Localized string ID for plural \"yards\"\n- 0x10c0: Localized string ID for singular \"yard\"\n- 0x0f9e: Localized string ID for suffix\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- nWholePart clamped to minimum 1 to avoid displaying \"0 yards\"\n- Singular vs plural yard string selected by nWholePart == 1",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
    },
