      "comment": "Format monster stat tooltip by combining multiple localized string components.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString() with resource index, monster type, config, and level\n2. Call GetMonsterSkillId() to retrieve skill ID based on monster type and level\n3. Format skill ID using FormatAndAppendStringValue() and add to line count\n4. Call GetMonsterLevelScaledValue() to get level-scaled stat value\n5. Format scaled value with FormatResourceString() and add to line count\n6. Call GetMonsterLeveledStat() to retrieve final leveled stat value\n7. Initialize Unicode buffer (64 elements) with default constructors\n8. If leveled stat is 0, return total line count (early exit)\n9. Format leveled stat as ANSI string using \"%d\" format\n10. Convert ANSI to Unicode via toUnicode()\n11. Concatenate formatted Unicode to output buffer\n12. Load string resource 0x10d5 via ValidateStringId()\n13. Concatenate resource string to output\n14. Load string resource 0xf9e via ValidateStringId()\n15. Concatenate final resource string to output\n16. Return line count + 1\n\nParameters:\ndwResourceIndex (dword, ECX): Base resource index for localization lookup\nnMonsterType (int, EDX): Monster type identifier for stat retrieval\nnMonsterConfig (int, Stack+0x4): Monster configuration value\nnMonsterLevel (int, Stack+0x8): Monster level for scaled stat calculations\nnParam5 (int, Stack+0xc): Additional parameter passed to FormatLocalizationString\nIMPLICIT ESI (lpszSource): Source string pointer for concatenation\nIMPLICIT EDI (lpszDest): Destination buffer pointer for output\n\nReturns:\nint - Total line count of formatted tooltip components\nReturns early with partial count if GetMonsterLeveledStat returns 0\nReturns line count + 1 if full formatting path completed\n\nSpecial Cases:\nEarly return at step 8 if leveled stat is 0\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x20 (32): Unicode buffer element count\n0x10d5: String resource ID (unit/suffix label)\n0xf9e: String resource ID (separator/terminator)\n0x10ae: Resource ID passed to FormatAndAppendStringValue\n0x10b0: Resource ID passed to FormatResourceString",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
