      "instructions": ["0x71110|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0xc]", "0x71114|SUB|ESP, 0x60", "0x71117|PUSH|EBX", "0x71118|PUSH|ESI", "0x71119|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [ESP + 0x6c]", "0x7111D|PUSH|EDI", "0x7111E|MOV|EDI, dword ptr [ESP + 0x74]", "0x71122|PUSH|EAX", "0x71123|PUSH|EDI", "0x71124|MOV|EBX, ECX", "0x71126|PUSH|ESI", "0x71127|CALL|0x6fb38bf0", "0x7112C|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESI + 0xf4]", "0x71132|MOV|EDX, 0x10b0", "0x71137|PUSH|0x0"],
      "comment": "Formats a monster stat bonus string based on difficulty and game data.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString with input parameters\n2. Call FormatResourceString with monster data offset +0xf4 (string ID)\n3. Read level bonus from monster data offset +0xf0\n4. Get current video frame index via GetVideoFrameCount\n5. Get monster init stats pointer for stat ID 0x158\n6. If stats pointer valid:\n   a. Read base values from offset +0x180 and +0x174 (indexed by frame)\n   b. Calculate average: (max + min) / 2\n   c. Scale by level bonus and difficulty: bonus + (bonus * levelBonus * (difficulty-1)) / 100\n7. If calculated bonus non-zero:\n   a. Initialize 32-entry Unicode array via default constructor loop\n   b. Format bonus as decimal string using wsprintfA with g_szFmtDecimal format\n   c. Convert ANSI to Unicode via toUnicode\n   d. Validate string ID 0x10C6, concatenate result twice\n   e. Validate string ID 0x0F9E, concatenate result\n8. Return 1 (always succeeds)\n\nParameters:\n  pDestBuffer (ECX): Destination buffer for formatted string\n  nStringId (EDX): Base string identifier\n  nMonsterDataPtr: Pointer to monster data structure\n    +0xF0: Level bonus multiplier\n    +0xF4: Resource string ID\n  nDifficulty: Game difficulty level (1-based)\n  nUnused: Unused parameter (stack cleanup)\n  IMPLICIT unaff_EBP: Destination for strcat operations\n  IMPLICIT unaff_EDI: Source string for strcat operations\n\nReturns:\n  Always returns 1\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Returns early (with 1) if monster stats pointer is NULL\n- Returns early (with 1) if calculated stat bonus is zero\n\nString IDs:\n- 0x10B0: Used in FormatResourceString\n- 0x10C6: Separator/prefix string validated before concatenation\n- 0x0F9E: Suffix string validated before final concatenation",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_Skill", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
