      "comment": "Format monster experience and stat modifier values as localized Unicode strings.\n\nClassification: Worker function - formats and appends localized numeric stats to output buffer.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Save nMonsterStatsPtr for later use\n2. Call FormatLocalizationString with all parameters (base formatting)\n3. Call GetMonsterExperienceByLevel(nLevel, nMonsterIndex) to get experience value\n4. Initialize 64-element Unicode buffer (loop 32 times, 2 bytes each)\n5. If experience value is non-zero:\n   a. Select format string: \"+%d\" for positive, \"%d\" for negative\n   b. Format experience value using wsprintfA\n   c. Convert ANSI to Unicode via toUnicode\n   d. Append localized strings: ValidateStringId(0x10f7), strcat x2\n   e. Append separator: ValidateStringId(0x10b3), strcat\n   f. Append delimiter: ValidateStringId(0xf9e), strcat\n6. Re-initialize Unicode buffer (loop 32 times)\n7. Calculate modifier: nModifierValue = nMonsterStatsPtr[0xf0] * nLevel\n8. If modifier value is non-zero:\n   a. Select format string: \"+%d\" for positive, \"%d\" for negative\n   b. Format modifier value using wsprintfA\n   c. Convert ANSI to Unicode via toUnicode\n   d. Append localized strings: ValidateStringId(0x10c6), strcat x2\n   e. Append separator: ValidateStringId(0x10b3), strcat\n   f. Append delimiter: ValidateStringId(0xf9e), strcat\n9. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n- pOutputBuffer (ECX): Pointer to Unicode output string buffer\n- nMonsterIndex (EDX): Monster type/class index for experience lookup\n- nMonsterStatsPtr (Stack+0x4): Pointer to monster stats structure\n  - Offset 0xf0: modifier multiplier value\n- nLevel (Stack+0x8): Monster level for experience and modifier calculation\n- nUnused (Stack+0xc): Unused parameter passed to FormatLocalizationString\n\nReturns:\n- 1: Always returns success (no failure path)\n\nImplicit Registers:\n- ESI: Source string pointer for Unicode::strcat operations\n- EDI: Contains strcat function pointer loaded from [