      "instructions": ["0x71740|PUSH|ECX", "0x71741|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x10]", "0x71745|PUSH|EBX", "0x71746|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [ESP + 0xc]", "0x7174A|PUSH|EBP", "0x7174B|PUSH|ESI", "0x7174C|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [ESP + 0x18]", "0x71750|PUSH|EAX", "0x71751|PUSH|ESI", "0x71752|MOV|EBP, EDX", "0x71754|PUSH|EBX", "0x71755|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x18], ECX", "0x71759|CALL|0x6fb38bf0", "0x7175E|PUSH|ESI", "0x7175F|PUSH|EBP"],
      "comment": "Calculates monster damage with skill descriptor bonuses and aura modifiers.\n\nFormats monster damage values for UI display, applying Concentration and Fanaticism\naura bonuses when the player has those auras active.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString with initial parameters\n2. Get base damage via GetMonsterMaxDamage(nMonsterId, nDifficultyLevel)\n3. Calculate min damage: pSkillDescriptor->field_144 + baseDamage\n4. Calculate max damage: pSkillDescriptor->field_148 + baseDamage\n5. If all damage values are zero, return early (no damage to display)\n6. Scale both damage values: (value << shiftFactor) >> 8\n   - shiftFactor from pSkillDescriptor+0x128 (byte, masked with 0x1F)\n7. For special monster IDs (0x14, 0x31, 0x35), set min damage to 1\n8. Get game context and check if unit is player (field_4 == 1)\n9. If player has Concentration aura (state 0x47):\n   a. Verify aura type flag at pSkillDescriptor+0xd4 == 1 (or pSkillDescriptor NULL)\n   b. Get Concentration skill (0x3d) level via GetUnitSkillById/GetSkillLevel\n   c. Get bonus percent via GetMonsterSkillId\n   d. Apply bonus: damage += (bonusPercent * damage) / 100\n10. If player has Fanaticism aura (state 0x48):\n    a. Verify aura type flag at pSkillDescriptor+0xd4 == 2 (or pSkillDescriptor NULL)\n    b. Get Fanaticism skill (0x3f) level via GetUnitSkillById/GetSkillLevel\n    c. Get bonus percent via GetMonsterSkillId\n    d. Apply bonus: damage += (bonusPercent * damage) / 100\n11. Call FormatLocalizationString with final min/max damage values\n\nParameters:\n  pOutputBuffer (void *) - Output buffer for formatted damage string [ECX]\n  nMonsterId (int) - Monster/skill identifier [EDX]\n                     Special handling for: 0x14 (20), 0x31 (49), 0x35 (53)\n  pSkillDescriptor (byte *) - Pointer to skill descriptor structure [Stack+0x4]\n                              NULL permitted (bypasses aura type check)\n  nDifficultyLevel (int) - Difficulty level for damage scaling [Stack+0x8]\n  nDisplayMode (int) - Display mode parameter [Stack+0xC]\n\nReturns:\n  1 - Always returns success\n\nSkill Descriptor Structure Offsets:\n  Offset  Size  Field             Description\n  0x128   1     bDamageShift      Damage scaling shift factor (masked & 0x1F)\n  0x140   1     bDisplayFormat    Display format flag passed to localization\n  0x144   4     nMinDamageMod     Minimum damage modifier (added to base)\n  0x148   4     nMaxDamageMod     Maximum damage modifier (added to base)\n  0xd4    1     bAuraType         Aura type flag: 1=Concentration, 2=Fanaticism\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x14, 0x31, 0x35 - Special monster IDs that force min damage to 1\n  0x47 - STATE_CONCENTRATION (unit state flag)\n  0x48 - STATE_FANATICISM (unit state flag)\n  0x3d - SKILL_CONCENTRATION (61 decimal)\n  0x3f - SKILL_FANATICISM (63 decimal)\n  0x51eb851f - Magic multiplier for divide-by-100 optimization\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - If pSkillDescriptor is NULL, both aura bonuses can apply (bypasses type check)\n  - Division by 100 uses multiply-by-magic-constant optimization\n  - Damage values are signed integers; shift operation preserves sign",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
    },
