      "comment": "Formats monster stat tooltip text with level-scaled damage values.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString with initial parameters to set base tooltip text\n2. Get monster init stats pointer for monster type 0x124 (fire damage)\n3. Get current video frame count as animation frame index (0-255)\n4. Read base min damage from stats[0x22c + frameIndex*4]\n5. Read base max damage from stats[0x238 + frameIndex*4]\n6. Calculate level-scaled damage modifier via GetMonsterLevelScaledValue\n7. Calculate scaled min: baseDamage + (scaledValue * baseDamage) / 100\n8. Calculate scaled max: baseDamage + (scaledValue * baseDamage) / 100\n9. Call FormatLocalizationString with scaled damage values\n10. Calculate damage bonus from pMonsterStats fields at 0xf0/0xf4\n11. Initialize Unicode buffer array (32 wchar_t elements)\n12. If damage bonus is non-zero, format and concatenate localized strings\n\nParameters:\n  lpwszDestBuffer (ECX) - Destination wide string buffer for formatted tooltip\n  nMonsterIndex (EDX) - Monster type index for stat lookup\n  pMonsterStats (Stack+0x4) - Pointer to monster stats structure\n  nMonsterLevel (Stack+0x8) - Monster level for damage scaling\n  nFormatFlags (Stack+0xc) - Format flags for localization\n\nReturns:\n  void - Results written to lpwszDestBuffer\n\nString IDs:\n  0x10c4 - Damage prefix string\n  0x1104 - Damage type string\n  0x0f9e - Damage suffix string\n\nStructure Offsets (pMonsterStats):\n  +0xf0 - Min damage bonus (int)\n  +0xf4 - Max damage bonus (int)\n\nStructure Offsets (MonsterInitStats 0x124):\n  +0x22c - Base min damage array[frame]\n  +0x238 - Base max damage array[frame]",
