      "comment": "Appends localized count suffix string to destination Unicode buffer.\n\nFormats a numeric count value and appends appropriate localized suffix text\nbased on singular (count=1) vs plural (count>1) grammar rules.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString to format the base localization string\n2. Initialize 64-element Unicode buffer (32 iterations, 2 bytes each)\n3. If nCount == 1 (singular):\n   a. Format \"1\" to ANSI string via wsprintfA with g_szFmtDecimal (\"%d\")\n   b. Convert ANSI to Unicode via toUnicode\n   c. Append buffer via strcat\n   d. Set wSuffixStringId = 0x1105 (singular suffix string)\n4. Else if nCount == 0:\n   a. Return early with 1 (no suffix needed)\n5. Else (nCount > 1, plural):\n   a. Format count to ANSI string via wsprintfA with g_szFmtDecimal\n   b. Convert ANSI to Unicode via toUnicode\n   c. Append buffer via strcat\n   d. Set wSuffixStringId = 0x1106 (plural suffix string)\n6. Call ValidateStringId(wSuffixStringId) for grammar suffix\n7. Append via strcat function pointer\n8. Call ValidateStringId(0x0F9E) for closing suffix\n9. Append via strcat function pointer\n10. Return 1\n\nParameters:\n  pDestBuffer (ECX) - Destination Unicode buffer to append suffix to\n  nUnused1 (EDX) - Passed to FormatLocalizationString (purpose unknown)\n  nUnused2 (Stack+0x4) - Passed to FormatLocalizationString (purpose unknown)\n  nCount (Stack+0x8) - Count value determining singular/plural suffix\n  nUnused3 (Stack+0xC) - Passed to FormatLocalizationString (purpose unknown)\n\nReturns:\n  1 - Always returns success\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x1105 - String ID for singular count suffix\n  0x1106 - String ID for plural count suffix\n  0x0F9E - String ID for closing suffix text\n  0x20 (32) - Loop count for Unicode buffer initialization (32*2=64 bytes)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - nCount == 0: Returns early without appending any suffix\n  - nCount == 1: Uses singular string ID 0x1105\n  - nCount > 1: Uses plural string ID 0x1106",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_UnitAny"]
    },
