      "comment": "Appends Find Item skill bonus percentage text to a Unicode tooltip buffer.\n\nClassification: Worker function - builds tooltip text for Find Item skill bonus\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize skill level to 0\n2. Get player unit via GetGameContext()\n3. If player exists, get Find Item skill (0x4F) and its level\n4. Get monster skill bonus modifier from monster data field 0xF0\n5. Get current video frame index for animation\n6. Get monster init stats pointer for stat type 0x122 (item find)\n7. If stats exist:\n   a. Average two stat values at offsets 0x174 and 0x180 indexed by frame\n   b. Calculate bonus: base + (base * monsterBonus * skillLevel) / 100\n   c. If bonus > 0:\n      - Initialize 64-character Unicode buffer\n      - Format bonus as ANSI string using g_szFmtInteger (\"%d\")\n      - Convert to Unicode\n      - Append localized prefix string (0x10C6)\n      - Append formatted bonus value\n      - Append localized suffix string (0xF9E)\n8. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n  this (ECX) - IMPLICIT: Pointer to Unicode tooltip buffer to append text to\n\nReturns:\n  int - Always returns 1\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Early exit if no player unit exists\n- Early exit if Find Item skill not found\n- Early exit if monster init stats pointer is null\n- Early exit if calculated bonus is 0\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x4F - Find Item skill ID (79 decimal)\n  0x122 - Monster stat type for item find percentage (290 decimal)\n  0x10C6 - String ID for Find Item bonus prefix text (4294 decimal)\n  0xF9E - String ID for Find Item bonus suffix text (3998 decimal)\n  0x174 - Offset to min stat value array in monster stats\n  0x180 - Offset to max stat value array in monster stats\n  0x20 - Unicode buffer size (32 characters)\n\nStructure Access:\n  MonsterInitStats + 0x174 + (frameIndex * 4) - Min stat value for frame\n  MonsterInitStats + 0x180 + (frameIndex * 4) - Max stat value for frame",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control"]
