      "comment": "Formats monster level-based damage statistics tooltip text.\n\nClassification: Worker function - formats localized tooltip strings for monster stat display.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString with initial string ID and monster stats parameters\n2. Get monster init stats pointer for type 0x122 (monster difficulty data)\n3. Get current video frame count as damage table index (byFrameIndex)\n4. Read min damage base from stats table at offset +0x22c (indexed by frame)\n5. Read max damage base from stats table at offset +0x238 (indexed by frame)\n6. Calculate level multiplier: (nMonsterLevel - 1) * pMonsterStats->dwLevelScaling (+0xfc)\n7. Scale min damage: (levelMultiplier * minBase) / 100 + minBase\n8. Scale max damage: (levelMultiplier * maxBase) / 100 + maxBase\n9. Format damage range with string ID 0x10a0\n10. Calculate scaled damage bonus via CalculateScaledValue using offsets +0xf0 and +0xf4\n11. Initialize 64-element Unicode buffer (32 iterations, 2 bytes each)\n12. If scaled damage is non-zero:\n    a. Format numeric value with wsprintfA using \"%d\" format\n    b. Convert ANSI to Unicode (32 chars max)\n    c. Append string 0x10ee (prefix text)\n    d. Append Unicode buffer (numeric value)\n    e. Append string 0x10ef (middle text)\n    f. Append string 0xf9e (suffix text)\n13. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n  pOutputBuffer (ECX) - Pointer to Unicode output buffer for formatted text\n  nStringId (EDX) - Base localization string ID for initial format\n  pMonsterStats (Stack+4) - Pointer to monster stats structure\n    +0xf0: Min damage scaling parameter\n    +0xf4: Max damage scaling parameter\n    +0xfc: Level scaling factor (percentage per level)\n  nMonsterLevel (Stack+8) - Monster's current level for stat calculation\n  nParam5 (Stack+C) - Additional format parameter passed to localization\n\nReturns: 1 on completion\n\nString IDs Used:\n  0x10a0 - Damage range format string\n  0x10ee - Damage bonus prefix\n  0x10ef - Damage bonus middle separator\n  0xf9e - Damage bonus suffix\n\nCalled Functions:\n  FormatLocalizationString - Format localized text\n  GetMonsterInitStatsPtr(0x122) - Get difficulty-based monster stats\n  GetVideoFrameCount - Get frame index for damage table lookup\n  CalculateScaledValue - Calculate level-scaled stat value\n  wsprintfA - Format integer to ANSI string\n  Unicode::toUnicode - Convert ANSI to Unicode\n  ValidateStringId - Validate and get localized string\n  Unicode::strcat - Concatenate Unicode strings",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_Skill", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
    },
