      "comment": "Format monster level bonus and skill information for tooltip display.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get scaled level value via GetMonsterLevelScaledValue(nMonsterIndex, nLevel)\n2. Initialize Unicode output array (64 wide chars) via constructor loop\n3. If scaled value is 0, set result to 0 and skip to step 9\n4. If scaled value < 0, use \"%d\" format string (g_szLocalizationConfig)\n5. If scaled value >= 0, use \"+%d\" format string (g_szResourceFormatPlus)\n6. Format scaled value to ANSI string via wsprintfA\n7. Convert ANSI to Unicode via toUnicode()\n8. Append localized strings: resource ID 0x10a0 (stat name), formatted value,\n   resource ID 0x10b3 (separator), resource ID 0xf9e (suffix); set result to 1\n9. Get monster skill ID via GetMonsterSkillId(nMonsterIndex, nLevel)\n10. Format skill ID and append to buffer via FormatAndAppendStringValue\n11. Return sum of level bonus result (0 or 1) plus skill format result\n\nParameters:\npOutputBuffer (Unicode *, ECX): Destination Unicode buffer for formatted tooltip\nnMonsterIndex (int, EDX): Monster data table index\nnUnused (int, Stack+0x4): Unused parameter (reserved)\nnLevel (int, Stack+0x8): Monster level for scaling calculations\nIMPLICIT ESI: Source string pointer for strcat operations\nIMPLICIT EDI: Destination string pointer for strcat operations\n\nReturns:\nint: Combined result count (0-2) indicating how many sections were formatted\n\nString IDs:\n0x10a0: Stat name prefix\n0x10b3: Separator between stat and skill\n0xf9e: Closing suffix\n\nFormat Strings:\ng_szResourceFormatPlus (0x6fbc6358): \"+%d\" for positive values\ng_szLocalizationConfig (0x6fbb0de4): \"%d\" for negative values",
