      "comment": "Format a skill bonus string based on skill type and scaled value.\n\nClassification: Worker function - formats skill-related strings for monster/character tooltips\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Map nSkillType to string ID via switch:\n   - 100 (0x64): wStringId = 0x10d1\n   - 105 (0x69): wStringId = 0x10d2\n   - 110 (0x6e): wStringId = 0x10d3\n   - 125 (0x7d): wStringId = 0x110f\n   - default: return 0 (unsupported skill type)\n2. Calculate scaled value using CalculateScaledValue(nLevel, pSkillDesc->field_0xF8, pSkillDesc->field_0xFC)\n3. Initialize 64-wchar Unicode buffer with default constructor (loop 32 iterations)\n4. If scaled value is zero, set result to 0\n5. If scaled value non-zero:\n   a. Select format string: \"+%d\" if positive, \"%d\" if negative\n   b. Format value to ANSI buffer via wsprintfA\n   c. Convert ANSI to Unicode via toUnicode\n   d. Concatenate localized strings (IDs: wStringId, 0x10b3, 0xf9e) to output\n   e. Set result to 1\n6. Call GetMonsterSkillId(nSkillType, nLevel) to get monster skill ID\n7. Call FormatAndAppendStringValue with monster skill ID\n8. Return sum of results from steps 4/5 and step 7\n\nParameters:\npOutputBuffer (void*, ECX): Destination Unicode string buffer for formatted output\nnSkillType (int, EDX): Skill type code determining string ID mapping\npSkillDesc (void*, Stack+0x4): Pointer to skill descriptor with scaling values at offsets 0xF8 and 0xFC\nnLevel (int, Stack+0x8): Character/skill level for scaled value calculation\nIMPLICIT ESI: Unicode strcat source pointer (preserved from caller)\nIMPLICIT EBP: Unicode strcat dest pointer (preserved from caller)\n\nReturns:\nint: Combined result count (0 if unsupported skill type, otherwise sum of formatting results)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Returns 0 immediately if nSkillType not in {100, 105, 110, 125}\n- Scaled value of 0 skips string formatting but still processes monster skill ID\n\nString IDs:\n0x10d1, 0x10d2, 0x10d3, 0x110f: Skill type specific localized strings\n0x10b3: Common skill bonus separator\n0xf9e: Common skill bonus suffix\n\nStructure Layout (pSkillDesc):\nOffset  Size  Field       Type  Description\n0xF8    4     nMinValue   int   Minimum scaling value for CalculateScaledValue\n0xFC    4     nMaxValue   int   Maximum scaling value for CalculateScaledValue",
