      "instructions": ["0x72F70|SUB|ESP, 0x64", "0x72F73|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x70]", "0x72F77|PUSH|EBX", "0x72F78|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x70]", "0x72F7C|PUSH|EBP", "0x72F7D|PUSH|ESI", "0x72F7E|PUSH|EDI", "0x72F7F|MOV|EDI, dword ptr [ESP + 0x78]", "0x72F83|PUSH|EAX", "0x72F84|MOV|EBP, EDX", "0x72F86|PUSH|EBX", "0x72F87|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x72F89|PUSH|EDI", "0x72F8A|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x1c], EBP", "0x72F8E|CALL|0x6fb38bf0"],
      "comment": "Formats monster level statistics for display in the UI.\n\nBuilds a localized Unicode string containing up to three stat sections:\n1. Base level from config (clamped to max level)\n2. Scaled value modifier (with +/- prefix)\n3. Level stat modifier (with +/- prefix)\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString to get base format count\n2. Calculate effective level: config[0x100] + levelIndex - 1, clamped to config[0x104]\n3. Initialize Unicode buffer (32 elements) via constructor loop\n4. If effective level != 0:\n   a. Format level as decimal string using wsprintfA\n   b. Convert ANSI to Unicode\n   c. Append localized strings 0x10a7, 0xf9e via ValidateStringId/strcat\n5. Get scaled value via GetMonsterLevelScaledValue\n6. Re-initialize Unicode buffer\n7. If scaled value != 0:\n   a. Format with \"+%d\" or \"%d\" based on sign\n   b. Convert to Unicode and append strings 0x10a0, 0x10b3, 0xf9e\n8. Accumulate section count\n9. Get level stat via GetMonsterLevelStat\n10. Re-initialize Unicode buffer\n11. If level stat != 0:\n    a. Format with \"+%d\" or \"%d\" based on sign\n    b. Convert to Unicode and append strings 0x10ba, 0x10b3, 0xf9e\n12. Return total section count\n\nParameters:\n  pOutputBuffer (ECX) - Unicode output buffer for concatenation\n  nMonsterLevel (EDX) - Monster level for stat calculations\n  pLevelConfig (Stack+4) - Pointer to level configuration structure\n    +0x100: Base level value\n    +0x104: Maximum level cap\n  nLevelIndex (Stack+8) - Level index offset\n  nStatId (Stack+C) - Stat identifier for lookup\n\nReturns:\n  int - Count of stat sections added (0-3)\n\nString IDs Used:\n  0x10a7 - Level label\n  0xf9e  - Section separator (newline)\n  0x10a0 - Scaled value label\n  0x10b3 - Per level suffix\n  0x10ba - Level stat label\n\nImplicit Register Usage:\n  ESI - Source string pointer for strcat operations\n  EDI - Unicode strcat function pointer cached at 0x6fba5c40",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_Room1", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
