      "comment": "Appends monster level stat modifiers to tooltip Unicode buffer.\n\nFormats and concatenates localized strings showing monster difficulty stat bonuses.\nRetrieves base stat and scaled value for given monster index and level, formatting\neach as signed integer with +/- prefix via localized format strings.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString to initialize output buffer with base text\n2. Get monster level stat bonus via GetMonsterLevelStat(nMonsterIndex, nLevel)\n3. Initialize 64-element Unicode buffer with default constructors\n4. If stat bonus is non-zero:\n   a. Select format string: g_szResourceFormatPlus (\"+%d\") if positive,\n      g_szLocalizationConfig (\"%d\") if negative\n   b. Format stat value to ANSI buffer via wsprintfA\n   c. Convert ANSI to Unicode via toUnicode\n   d. Append localized strings 0x10b2, buffer, 0x10b3, 0xf9e to output\n5. Get monster scaled value via GetMonsterLevelScaledValue(nMonsterIndex, nLevel)\n6. Re-initialize Unicode buffer with default constructors\n7. If scaled value is non-zero:\n   a. Select format string based on sign\n   b. Format and convert to Unicode\n   c. Append localized strings 0x10a0, buffer, 0x10b3, 0xf9e to output\n8. Return\n\nParameters:\n  pOutputBuffer (ECX) - Unicode buffer to append formatted stats to\n  nMonsterIndex (EDX) - Monster type index for stat lookup\n  nParam3 (Stack+0x4) - Passed to FormatLocalizationString\n  nLevel (Stack+0x8) - Monster level for stat calculation\n  nParam5 (Stack+0xC) - Passed to FormatLocalizationString\n\nReturns: void\n\nString IDs:\n  0x10b2 - Stat bonus label prefix\n  0x10b3 - Stat value suffix/separator\n  0x10a0 - Scaled value label prefix  \n  0x0f9e - End/newline marker\n\nGlobals:\n  g_pfnUnicodeStrcat (0x6fba5c40) - Unicode string concatenation function\n  g_pfnUnicodeDefaultCtor (0x6fba5c30) - Unicode default constructor\n  g_pfnUnicodeToUnicode (0x6fba5c34) - ANSI to Unicode conversion\n  g_szResourceFormatPlus (0x6fbc6358) - \"+%d\" format string\n  g_szLocalizationConfig (0x6fbb0de4) - \"%d\" format string",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
