      "instructions": ["0x73340|SUB|ESP, 0x64", "0x73343|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x6c]", "0x73347|PUSH|EBX", "0x73348|PUSH|EBP", "0x73349|PUSH|ESI", "0x7334A|PUSH|EDI", "0x7334B|PUSH|EAX", "0x7334C|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x7334E|PUSH|EDX", "0x7334F|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x18], EDX", "0x73353|CALL|0x6fb9851e", "0x73358|MOV|EBP, EAX", "0x7335A|LEA|EDI, [ESP + 0x34]", "0x7335E|MOV|EBX, 0x20", "0x73363|MOV|ECX, EDI"],
      "comment": "Build tooltip string for monster level-scaled stat bonus and skill bonus.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call GetMonsterLevelScaledValue(nMonsterIndex, nLevel) to get scaled stat value\n2. Initialize 64-wchar Unicode buffer by calling default_constructor_closure 32 times\n3. If scaled value is zero, skip stat formatting (nScaledValue = 0)\n4. If scaled value is negative, use \"%d\" format string (g_szLocalizationConfig)\n5. If scaled value is positive, use \"+%d\" format string (g_szResourceFormatPlus)\n6. Format value into ANSI buffer via wsprintfA, convert to Unicode via toUnicode\n7. Append string resource 0x10b2 (stat label prefix)\n8. Append formatted value to output buffer twice\n9. Append string resource 0x10b3 (stat label middle)\n10. Append string resource 0xf9e (newline/separator)\n11. Set nScaledValue = 1 to indicate stat was formatted\n12. Call GetMonsterSkillId(nMonsterIndex, nLevel) to get skill ID\n13. Call FormatAndAppendStringValue(dwSkillId) to format skill bonus string\n14. Return sum of skill bonus count and scaled value indicator\n\nParameters:\nwszOutputBuffer (wchar_t* in ECX): Unicode output buffer pointer for tooltip text\nnMonsterIndex (int in EDX): Monster data index for table lookup\nnUnused (int at Stack+4): Unused parameter (reserved)\nnLevel (int at Stack+8): Monster level for scaling calculation\nIMPLICIT ESI: Source string pointer (preserved from caller)\nIMPLICIT EDI: Destination string pointer (preserved from caller)\n\nReturns:\nint: Total count of formatted entries (0-2). 1 if only skill bonus formatted,\n     1 if only level stat formatted, 2 if both formatted, 0 if neither.\n\nString Resources:\n0x10b2 - Stat label prefix\n0x10b3 - Stat label middle/separator\n0xf9e  - Newline/line separator\n0x10ae - Used in FormatAndAppendStringValue for skill formatting\n\nFormat Strings:\ng_szResourceFormatPlus (0x6fbc6358): \"+%d\" - positive value format\ng_szLocalizationConfig (0x6fbb0de4): \"%d\" - negative/zero value format\n\nDecompiler Notes:\n- lpszSourceString, lpszDestString: Implicit register parameters preserved from caller\n- nScaledValue: Reused as formatted indicator (0 or 1) at end\n- nLoopCounter: Loop counter for Unicode initialization (32 iterations)\n- pUnicodeIter: Unicode buffer iterator pointer\n- dwSkillBonusCount: Result from FormatAndAppendStringValue",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_4", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
