      "comment": "Appends monster stat bonuses (level-scaled value and resurrection mode) to tooltip string.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString with all parameters to format base tooltip text\n2. Get level-scaled stat value via GetMonsterLevelScaledValue(nMonsterIndex, nLevel)\n3. Initialize 64-element Unicode buffer by calling default constructor 32 times (128 bytes)\n4. If level-scaled value is zero, skip level bonus section\n5. If level-scaled value is negative, use \"%d\" format; if positive, use \"+%d\" format\n6. Format the value to ANSI string, convert to Unicode\n7. Append localized strings: StringId 0x10a0, the formatted value, StringId 0x10b3, StringId 0xf9e\n8. Set level bonus count to 1\n9. Get resurrection mode via GetMonsterResurrectMode(nMonsterIndex)\n10. Re-initialize Unicode buffer (32 iterations)\n11. If resurrection mode is zero, return base result + level bonus count\n12. Format resurrection mode with \"%d\" format, convert to Unicode\n13. Append localized strings: StringId 0x10ea, the formatted value, StringId 0x10b3, StringId 0xf9e\n14. Return base result + level bonus count + 1\n\nParameters:\n  pOutputBuffer (ECX) - Unicode buffer to append formatted tooltip text\n  nMonsterIndex (EDX) - Monster type index for stat lookups\n  nLocalizationParam (Stack+0x4) - Localization parameter passed to FormatLocalizationString\n  nLevel (Stack+0x8) - Monster level for scaled value calculation\n  nParam5 (Stack+0xc) - Additional parameter for FormatLocalizationString\n\nReturns:\n  int - Total count: FormatLocalizationString result + level bonus (0 or 1) + resurrect bonus (0 or 1)\n\nString IDs:\n  0x10a0 - Level bonus prefix string\n  0x10b3 - Separator/delimiter string\n  0xf9e  - Suffix/terminator string\n  0x10ea - Resurrection mode prefix string\n\nGlobals Referenced:\n  g_szResourceFormatPlus @ 0x6fbc6358 - \"+%d\" format for positive values\n  g_szLocalizationConfig @ 0x6fbb0de4 - \"%d\" format for negative/resurrect values\n  g_pfnUn