      "instructions": ["0x741B0|SUB|ESP, 0x60", "0x741B3|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x6c]", "0x741B7|PUSH|EBX", "0x741B8|PUSH|EBP", "0x741B9|PUSH|ESI", "0x741BA|PUSH|EDI", "0x741BB|MOV|EDI, dword ptr [ESP + 0x78]", "0x741BF|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x741C1|PUSH|EAX", "0x741C2|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x78]", "0x741C6|PUSH|EDI", "0x741C7|PUSH|ECX", "0x741C8|MOV|EBX, EDX", "0x741CA|MOV|ECX, ESI", "0x741CC|CALL|0x6fb38bf0"],
      "comment": "Builds a monster skill tooltip with damage, level-scaled values, and stat information.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Format base localization string via FormatLocalizationString with monster/skill params\n2. Get monster scaled damage via GetMonsterScaledDamage(pFormatBuffer, nMonsterId)\n3. Initialize 64-element Unicode buffer for temporary string storage\n4. If scaled damage != 0:\n   a. Format damage with \"+%d\" (positive) or \"%d\" (negative) format string\n   b. Convert ANSI to Unicode via toUnicode\n   c. Append string 0x110B (damage label), value, 0x10B3 (separator), 0x0F9E (newline)\n5. Get monster level-scaled value via GetMonsterLevelScaledValue(nMonsterId, pFormatBuffer)\n6. Re-initialize Unicode buffer for second stat display\n7. If level-scaled value != 0:\n   a. Format value with \"+%d\" (positive) or \"%d\" (negative) format string\n   b. Convert ANSI to Unicode via toUnicode  \n   c. Append string 0x10BB (level label), value, 0x10B3 (separator), 0x0F9E (newline)\n8. Get monster skill ID via GetMonsterSkillId(nMonsterId, nSkillSlot)\n9. Format skill resource string via FormatResourceString(skillId, 0)\n10. Get game context (current player unit) via GetGameContext()\n11. Get minion stat sum via GetMinionStatSum(nMonsterId, pUnit, nSkillSlot)\n12. Get monster max HP via GetMonsterMaxHP(nMonsterId, pUnit, nSkillSlot)\n13. Build resource tooltip via BuildResourceTooltipString(minionSum, maxHP, 1, 1)\n\nParameters:\n- pDestBuffer (ECX, dword): Destination Unicode buffer for tooltip output\n- nMonsterId (EDX, int): Monster type/class ID for stat lookups\n- nSkillSlot (Stack+0x4, int): Skill slot index for skill/stat queries\n- pFormatBuffer (Stack+0x8, Unicode *): Format buffer or level parameter\n- nFormatParam (Stack+0xC, int): Additional format parameter for localization\n\nReturns:\n- void (implicitly returns via caller's EAX handling)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Damage value of 0 skips damage section entirely\n- Level-scaled value of 0 skips level section entirely\n- Uses same Unicode buffer for both stat sections (re-initialized between uses)\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n- 0x20 (32): Loop count for Unicode buffer initialization (64 elements, incremented by 2)\n- 0x110B (4363): Localized string ID for damage label/prefix\n- 0x10BB (4283): Localized string ID for level-scaled value label\n- 0x10B3 (4275): Localized string ID for stat separator\n- 0x0F9E (3998): Localized string ID for line terminator/newline\n- 0x6fbc6358: g_szResourceFormatPlus = \"+%d\" format string\n- 0x6fbb0de4: g_szLocalizationConfig = \"%d\" format string\n\nCalling Convention:\n- __fastcall: pDestBuffer in ECX, nMonsterId in EDX, 3 stack params\n- Stack cleanup: RET 0xC (3 dword parameters)",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
