      "instructions": ["0x745B0|SUB|ESP, 0x68", "0x745B3|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x70]", "0x745B7|PUSH|EBX", "0x745B8|PUSH|EBP", "0x745B9|PUSH|ESI", "0x745BA|PUSH|EDI", "0x745BB|MOV|EBP, EDX", "0x745BD|MOV|EDI, ECX", "0x745BF|PUSH|EAX", "0x745C0|PUSH|EBP", "0x745C1|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x1c], EBP", "0x745C5|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x18], EDI", "0x745C9|CALL|0x6fb98ab8", "0x745CE|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x7c]", "0x745D2|MOV|EDX, dword ptr [EBX + 0x144]"],
      "comment": "Builds monster damage tooltip text with Concentration and Fanaticism aura bonuses.\n\nCalculates damage values from skill descriptor, applies aura percentage bonuses\nwhen player has active Concentration (state 0x47) or Fanaticism (state 0x48),\nand formats the result for UI display including level-scaled bonus values.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get base damage via GetMonsterMaxDamage(nStatId, nMonsterLevel)\n2. Add min/max modifiers from pSkillDesc+0x144/0x148\n3. If any damage value non-zero:\n   a. Scale damage: (value << shift_factor) >> 8 using pSkillDesc[0x128]\n   b. For special skills (0x14, 0x31, 0x35), force min damage to 1\n   c. Apply Concentration aura bonus if active (state 0x47, skill 0x3D):\n      - Check pSkillDesc[0xd4] == 1 or pSkillDesc == NULL\n      - Get bonus percent and apply: damage += (bonus * damage) / 100\n   d. Apply Fanaticism aura bonus if active (state 0x48, skill 0x3F):\n      - Check pSkillDesc[0xd4] == 2 or pSkillDesc == NULL\n      - Get bonus percent and apply: damage += (bonus * damage) / 100\n   e. Format damage range via FormatLocalizationString\n4. Get level-scaled value via GetMonsterLevelScaledValue\n5. Initialize Unicode buffer (32 elements, 64 bytes)\n6. If scaled value non-zero:\n   a. Format as \"+%d\" or \"%d\" based on sign\n   b. Convert to Unicode and append localization strings (0x10a0, 0x571c, 0xf9e)\n7. Get skill bonus via GetMonsterSkillId and append via FormatAndAppendStringValue\n8. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n  pOutputBuffer (ECX) - Unicode string buffer for output\n  nStatId (EDX) - Stat/skill identifier; 0x14/0x31/0x35 = special handling\n  pSkillDesc (stack) - Skill descriptor structure pointer\n  nMonsterLevel (stack) - Monster level for damage scaling\n\nReturns:\n  1 - Always returns success\n\nSkill Descriptor Offsets:\n  +0x128 - Damage scale shift factor (byte, masked with 0x1F)\n  +0x140 - Display format flag (byte)\n  +0x144 - Min damage modifier (int)\n  +0x148 - Max damage modifier (int)\n  +0xd4 - Aura type flag (1=Concentration, 2=Fanaticism)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x47 - STATE_CONCENTRATION (player has Concentration aura active)\n  0x48 - STATE_FANATICISM (player has Fanaticism aura active)\n  0x3D (61) - SKILL_CONCENTRATION\n  0x3F (63) - SKILL_FANATICISM\n  0x14 (20), 0x31 (49), 0x35 (53) - Special skill IDs (force min=1)\n  0x10a0, 0x571c, 0xf9e - Localization string IDs for tooltip formatting\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Skills 0x14, 0x31, 0x35 force minimum damage to 1\n  - If pSkillDesc is NULL, both aura bonuses can apply\n  - Negative scaled values use \"%d\" format, positive use \"+%d\"",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_4", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
