      "instructions": ["0x74AC0|SUB|ESP, 0x64", "0x74AC3|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x70]", "0x74AC7|PUSH|EBX", "0x74AC8|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x70]", "0x74ACC|PUSH|EBP", "0x74ACD|PUSH|ESI", "0x74ACE|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x74AD0|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x74]", "0x74AD4|PUSH|EDI", "0x74AD5|PUSH|EAX", "0x74AD6|PUSH|EBX", "0x74AD7|MOV|EDI, EDX", "0x74AD9|PUSH|ECX", "0x74ADA|MOV|ECX, ESI", "0x74ADC|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x1c], EDI"],
      "comment": "Appends monster stat bonus information to a tooltip Unicode buffer.\nFormats and appends three types of monster stat bonuses: level stat, scaled stat, and leveled stat.\nEach non-zero stat is formatted with localization strings and concatenated to the destination buffer.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString to prepare initial tooltip text\n2. Get monster level stat via GetMonsterLevelStat(nMonsterRow, nAreaLevel)\n3. Initialize 64-character Unicode buffer awcStatBuffer\n4. If level stat != 0:\n   a. Format stat value with \"+%d\" (positive) or \"%d\" (negative) via wsprintfA\n   b. Convert formatted string to Unicode via toUnicode\n   c. Append localized strings: ValidateStringId(0x10B2), append buffer, ValidateStringId(0x10B3), ValidateStringId(0x0F9E)\n5. Calculate scaled stat via CalculateScaledValue(nAreaLevel, nMonsterDataPtr+0xF8, nMonsterDataPtr+0xFC)\n6. Re-initialize awcStatBuffer\n7. If scaled stat != 0:\n   a. Format and convert to Unicode (same as step 4)\n   b. Append localized strings: ValidateStringId(0x1107), buffer, ValidateStringId(0x10B3), ValidateStringId(0x0F9E)\n8. Get monster leveled stat via GetMonsterLeveledStat(nMonsterRow, nAreaLevel)\n9. Re-initialize awcStatBuffer\n10. If leveled stat != 0:\n    a. Format and convert to Unicode (same as step 4)\n    b. Append localized strings: ValidateStringId(0x10A0), buffer, ValidateStringId(0x10B3), ValidateStringId(0x0F9E)\n11. Get monster skill ID via GetMonsterSkillId(nMonsterRow, nAreaLevel)\n12. Call FormatAndAppendStringValue to append skill info\n\nParameters:\n  pDestBuffer (ECX) - Unicode * - Destination buffer for tooltip text\n  nMonsterRow (EDX) - int - Monster data table row index\n  nMonsterDataPtr (Stack+0x4) - int - Pointer to monster stats structure (fields at +0xF8, +0xFC)\n  nAreaLevel (Stack+0x8) - int - Current area/difficulty level\n  nMonsterLevel (Stack+0xC) - int - Monster's actual level\n  IMPLICIT unaff_ESI - char * - Source string pointer for concatenation\n  IMPLICIT unaff_EDI - char * - Destination string pointer for concatenation\n\nReturns: void (always succeeds, appends formatted text to pDestBuffer)\n\nString IDs:\n  0x10B2 - Level stat label\n  0x10B3 - Stat separator/suffix\n  0x0F9E - Line terminator\n  0x1107 - Scaled stat label\n  0x10A0 - Leveled stat label\n  0x10AE - Skill bonus label (used in FormatAndAppendStringValue)\n\nStructure Layout (nMonsterDataPtr):\n  Offset  Size  Field          Description\n  0xF8    4     nMinScaleStat  Minimum scaled stat value\n  0xFC    4     nMaxScaleStat  Maximum scaled stat value",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_Room1", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
