      "api_calls": ["GetMonsterLeveledStat", "ValidateStringId", "ValidateStringId", "ValidateStringId", "CalculateScaledValue", "ValidateStringId", "ValidateStringId", "ValidateStringId", "GetMonsterSkillId"],
      "instructions": ["0x74E70|SUB|ESP, 0x64", "0x74E73|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x6c]", "0x74E77|PUSH|EBX", "0x74E78|PUSH|EBP", "0x74E79|PUSH|ESI", "0x74E7A|PUSH|EDI", "0x74E7B|PUSH|EAX", "0x74E7C|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x74E7E|PUSH|EDX", "0x74E7F|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x18], EDX", "0x74E83|CALL|0x6fb98626", "0x74E88|MOV|EBX, EAX", "0x74E8A|LEA|EDI, [ESP + 0x34]", "0x74E8E|MOV|EBP, 0x20", "0x74E93|MOV|ECX, EDI"],
      "comment": "Formats monster stat description text for display with localization.\n\nRetrieves and formats monster leveled stat and scaled damage values into\nlocalized Unicode strings, then appends skill information.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get monster leveled stat via GetMonsterLeveledStat(nMonsterId, nStatIndex)\n2. Initialize 32-element Unicode buffer local_40 with default constructors\n3. If leveled stat is non-zero:\n   a. Format stat value to ANSI string using \"%d\" format\n   b. Convert ANSI to Unicode in local_40\n   c. Append localized strings for stat display (string IDs 0x1108, 0x1109, 0x0F9E)\n4. Calculate scaled value from pStatRecord offsets +0xF8 and +0xFC\n5. Re-initialize Unicode buffer for second stat\n6. If scaled value is non-zero:\n   a. Format scaled value to ANSI string using \"%d\" format\n   b. Convert ANSI to Unicode\n   c. Append localized strings for damage display (string IDs 0x110A, 0x10B3, 0x0F9E)\n7. Get monster skill ID via GetMonsterSkillId(nMonsterId, nStatIndex)\n8. Format and append skill value via FormatAndAppendStringValue\n9. Return 1 (always succeeds)\n\nParameters:\n  wszDestBuffer (ECX): Pointer to destination Unicode buffer for output\n  nMonsterId (EDX): Monster identifier for stat lookup\n  pStatRecord (Stack+0x4): Pointer to stat record structure\n    +0xF8: Base damage value (int)\n    +0xFC: Damage scale factor (int)\n  nStatIndex (Stack+0x8): Index of stat to format\n  IMPLICIT ESI: Preserved, used as destination buffer pointer in strcat calls\n  IMPLICIT EDI: Function pointer to Unicode::strcat (loaded from 0x6FBA5C40)\n\nReturns:\n  int: Always returns 1 (success)\n\nLocal Variables:\n  iVar1 (EBX): Leveled stat value or scaled value result\n  iVar2 (EBP): Loop counter for buffer initialization (32 iterations)\n  pUVar3 (EDI/EBX): Unicode buffer iterator pointer\n  aCStack_60: 32-byte ANSI buffer for wsprintfA output\n  local_40: 64-element Unicode array for intermediate string storage\n\nString IDs:\n  0x1108: Stat label prefix\n  0x1109: Stat label suffix/separator\n  0x110A: Damage label prefix  \n  0x10B3: Damage label suffix\n  0x0F9E: Common suffix/newline (used in both sections)\n  0x10AE: Skill description label (passed to FormatAndAppendStringValue)",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_4", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
