      "comment": "Formats compound monster stat display by combining three formatted string components.\n\nClassification: Worker function - Aggregates multiple formatting operations for monster UI display.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString with all 5 parameters to format base localization text\n2. Set suffix mode to 0 (standard format)\n3. Call GetMonsterLeveledStat with monster index and level to get scaled stat value\n4. Call FormatResourceString with leveled stat and suffix mode (resource ID 0x10D9)\n5. Call GetMonsterLevelScaledValue with monster index and level to get secondary scaled value\n6. Call FormatAndAppendStringValue with scaled value (resource ID 0x10D8)\n7. Sum all three formatting results and return total\n\nParameters:\n- pOutputBuffer (dword, ECX): Pointer to output Unicode string buffer\n- nMonsterIndex (int, EDX): Monster type index for stat lookup\n- nStatType (int, Stack+0x4): Stat type identifier for localization selection\n- nMonsterLevel (int, Stack+0x8): Monster level for scaling calculations\n- nDisplayMode (int, Stack+0xC): Display formatting mode flag\n\nReturns:\n- int: Sum of character counts/status codes from three formatting operations\n\nCallees:\n- FormatLocalizationString (0x6fb38bf0): Formats base localization string\n- GetMonsterLeveledStat (0x6fb98626): Gets level-scaled monster stat value\n- FormatResourceString (0x6fb3b570): Formats resource string with ID 0x10D9\n- GetMonsterLevelScaledValue (0x6fb9851e): Gets secondary scaled value\n- FormatAndAppendStringValue (0x6fb3ba00): Formats and appends with ID 0x10D8\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x10D9: Resource string ID for leveled stat display\n- 0x10D8: Resource string ID for scaled value display\n- 0x0: Standard suffix mode (no suffix)",
