      "comment": "BuildItemAttributeBonusText - Formats item attribute stat bonuses as localized Unicode text\n\nClassification: Worker function - called from item tooltip/description system\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize local 64-character Unicode buffer by calling default constructor 32 times\n2. Calculate primary stat value from ItemRecord fields:\n   - offset 0xDC = shift amount (byte-masked to 0x1F)\n   - offset 0xE0 = base value to shift\n   - Formula: (baseValue << shiftAmount << 1) >> 8 = scaled percentage\n3. If primary stat non-zero:\n   a. Format stat as ANSI string using \"%d\" format (g_szLocalizationConfig)\n   b. Convert ANSI to Unicode (32 characters)\n   c. Append localized string 0x109F (stat name label)\n   d. Append formatted value to output\n   e. Append localized string 0x0F9E (separator/suffix)\n4. Calculate secondary bonus:\n   - nBonusValue = ItemRecord[0x124] * (nBonusIndex - 1) + ItemRecord[0x120]\n5. If secondary bonus non-zero:\n   a. Reinitialize Unicode buffer\n   b. Choose format based on sign: \"+%d\" for positive, \"%d\" for negative\n   c. Format and convert to Unicode\n   d. Append localized strings: 0x10A6 (bonus type), value, 0x10B3 (units), 0x0F9E (suffix)\n6. Return 1 (always succeeds)\n\nParameters:\n  pItemRecord (int) - Pointer to ItemRecord structure\n    - [+0xDC] = dwShiftAmount - bit shift for stat scaling\n    - [+0xE0] = dwStatBaseValue - base stat value to scale  \n    - [+0x120] = nBonusBase - base bonus value\n    - [+0x124] = nBonusMultiplier - per-index multiplier\n  nBonusIndex (int) - Index of bonus slot (1-based, subtracted by 1)\n  IMPLICIT ECX - pDestUnicode (Unicode*) - destination string\n  IMPLICIT ESI - pstrTemp (char*) - temp string pointer\n  IMPLICIT EDI - pstrDest (char*) - destination char pointer\n\nReturns:\n  int - Always returns 1\n\nString IDs Used:\n  0x109F - Primary stat name label\n  0x0F9E - Separator/suffix (newline or space)\n  0x10A6 - Secondary bonus type label\n  0x10B3 - Bonus units label\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - If primary stat is zero, skips first section\n  - If secondary bonus is zero, skips second section\n  - Negative bonuses use plain \"%d\", positive use \"+%d\" format\n\nCalled By: Item tooltip/description formatting system (data reference at 0x6fbc5d70)",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_2", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control"]
    },
