      "comment": "Format extended monster skill description with localization, skill value, and resource strings.\n\nClassification: Worker function - Orchestrates three formatting operations\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString with all parameters to format base localized text\n2. Call GetMonsterSkillId(nMonsterId, nMonsterLevel) to get skill identifier\n3. Call FormatAndAppendStringValue with skill ID to format skill value string (resource 0x10ae)\n4. Set nSuffixType = 0 for standard suffix formatting\n5. Call GetMonsterLevelScaledValue(nMonsterId, nMonsterLevel) to get level-scaled resource ID\n6. Call FormatResourceString(nResourceId, 0) to format resource string (resource 0x10b0)\n7. Return sum of all three formatted string lengths\n\nParameters:\n- nStringIndex (dword, ECX): Resource/localization string index for base formatting\n- nMonsterId (int, EDX): Monster type identifier for skill and level lookups\n- nSkillSlot (int, Stack+0x4): Skill slot index passed to localization\n- nMonsterLevel (int, Stack+0x8): Monster level for skill ID and scaled value lookups\n- nFormatParam (int, Stack+0xC): Alternate format parameter for localization\n\nReturns:\n- dword: Combined length of all formatted strings (dwLocalizationLen + dwSkillStringLen + dwResourceLen)\n\nSSA Temporaries (compiler-generated, cannot rename):\n- dVar1: Result from FormatLocalizationString (dwLocalizationLen)\n- dVar2: Result from FormatAndAppendStringValue (dwSkillStringLen)\n- uVar3: Result from FormatResourceString (dwResourceLen)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x10ae: Resource ID passed to FormatAndAppendStringValue\n- 0x10b0: Resource ID passed to FormatResourceString\n\nCallees:\n- FormatLocalizationString: Formats base localized string with all 5 parameters\n- GetMonsterSkillId: Retrieves skill ID for monster at given level/slot\n- FormatAndAppendStringValue: Formats skill value and appends to output buffer\n- GetMonsterLevelScaledValue: Gets level-scaled value for resource formatting\n-