      "comment": "Append monster level and skill bonus strings to tooltip buffer.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString to format base string with initial parameters\n2. Get monster level stat via GetMonsterLevelStat(nMonsterIndex, nDifficultyLevel)\n3. Initialize 64-element Unicode buffer (128 bytes)\n4. If level stat is non-zero:\n   a. Select format string: \"+%d\" (positive) or \"%d\" (negative/zero)\n   b. Format level stat value to ANSI buffer via wsprintfA\n   c. Convert ANSI to Unicode via toUnicode\n   d. Append string ID 0x10b2, Unicode value, 0x10b3, 0xf9e via strcat\n   e. Set level bonus count to 1\n5. Get monster skill ID via GetMonsterSkillId(nMonsterIndex, nDifficultyLevel)\n6. Re-initialize Unicode buffer (32 elements)\n7. If skill ID is non-zero:\n   a. Select format string: \"+%d\" (positive) or \"%d\" (negative/zero)\n   b. Format skill ID value to ANSI buffer via wsprintfA\n   c. Convert ANSI to Unicode via toUnicode\n   d. Append string ID 0x10a0, Unicode value, 0x10b3, 0xf9e via strcat\n   e. Add 1 to bonus count\n8. Return total: dwFormattedCount + nLevelStat + skill bonus (0 or 1)\n\nParameters:\n- pUnicodeBuffer (dword, ECX): Pointer to destination Unicode string buffer\n- nMonsterIndex (int, EDX): Monster type index for stat lookup\n- nParam3 (int, Stack+0x4): Configuration structure pointer passed to FormatLocalizationString\n- nDifficultyLevel (int, Stack+0x8): Game difficulty level for stat scaling\n- nStringIndex (int, Stack+0xC): String pool index passed to FormatLocalizationString\n- IMPLICIT unaff_ESI: Source Unicode string for strcat operations\n- IMPLICIT unaff_EDI: Destination Unicode string for strcat operations\n\nReturns:\n- int: Total count of formatted bonus items (0-2+: base + level + skill)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x20 (32): Unicode buffer initialization loop count (64 elements × 2 bytes)\n- 0x10b2: String ID for level stat prefix/label\n- 0x10b3: String ID for stat separator/suffix\n- 0xf9e: String ID for line terminator/newline\n- 0x10a0: String ID for skill bonus prefix/label\n\nGlobal References:\n- g_szResourceFormatPlus (0x6fbc6358): \"+%d\" format string for positive values\n- g_szLocalizationConfig (0x6fbb0de4): \"%d\" format string for negative/zero values",
