      "api_calls": ["CalculateScaledValue", "GetMonsterSkillId", "ValidateStringId", "ValidateStringId", "ValidateStringId", "GetMonsterLevelStat", "ValidateStringId", "ValidateStringId", "ValidateStringId"],
      "instructions": ["0x76AA0|SUB|ESP, 0x60", "0x76AA3|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x6c]", "0x76AA7|PUSH|EBX", "0x76AA8|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x6c]", "0x76AAC|PUSH|EBP", "0x76AAD|PUSH|ESI", "0x76AAE|PUSH|EDI", "0x76AAF|MOV|EDI, dword ptr [ESP + 0x74]", "0x76AB3|PUSH|EAX", "0x76AB4|PUSH|EBX", "0x76AB5|MOV|EBP, EDX", "0x76AB7|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x76AB9|PUSH|EDI", "0x76ABA|CALL|0x6fb38bf0", "0x76ABF|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [EDI + 0xfc]"],
      "comment": "Formats monster skill ID and level stat bonuses into tooltip text.\n\nBuilds formatted tooltip strings for displaying monster skill and level bonuses in the UI.\nAppends localized strings for skill bonuses (string IDs 0x10c3, 0x10b3, 0xf9e) and level stat \nbonuses (string IDs 0x10a6, 0x10b3, 0xf9e) with appropriate sign formatting (+%d or %d).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString to format base text into output buffer\n2. Calculate scaled value from stat record offsets 0xf8 and 0xfc (range delta)\n3. Format resource string with adjusted stat value\n4. Get monster skill ID bonus via GetMonsterSkillId\n5. Initialize Unicode buffer (32 wchar_t entries = 64 bytes)\n6. If skill ID bonus is non-zero:\n   a. Select format string: \"+%d\" for positive, \"%d\" for negative\n   b. Format skill ID as ANSI, convert to Unicode\n   c. Append localized strings: 0x10c3, bonus value, 0x10b3, 0xf9e\n   d. Set skill bonus count = 1\n7. Accumulate total = localization result + resource value + skill count\n8. Get monster level stat bonus via GetMonsterLevelStat\n9. Re-initialize Unicode buffer\n10. If level stat bonus is non-zero:\n    a. Select format string based on sign\n    b. Format and convert to Unicode\n    c. Append localized strings: 0x10a6, bonus value, 0x10b3, 0xf9e\n    d. Increment total by 1\n11. Return total count of formatted elements\n\nParameters:\n  pOutputBuffer (ECX): Destination buffer for formatted text\n  pUnitData (EDX): Unit data structure containing monster info\n  pStatRecord (Stack+0x4): Stat record pointer, fields at +0xf8 and +0xfc used\n  nStatIndex (Stack+0x8): Stat index for skill/level lookups\n  nBonusFlags (Stack+0xc): Bonus flags passed to FormatLocalizationString\n\nReturns:\n  int - Count of formatted tooltip elements (sum of localization, resource, skill, level)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Returns early with partial count if skill ID bonus is 0\n  - Returns without level bonus section if level stat is 0\n  - Sign-sensitive formatting: positive values get \"+\" prefix\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x10c3 - Skill bonus header localization string ID\n  0x10b3 - Separator localization string ID  \n  0xf9e  - Suffix localization string ID\n  0x10a6 - Level stat header localization string ID\n  0x20   - Unicode buffer size (32 wchar_t = 64 bytes)\n  0xf8   - Stat record offset for base value\n  0xfc   - Stat record offset for max value",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
    },
