      "comment": "Formats a combined localized string for monster skill display.\n\nThis wrapper function combines localization formatting with monster skill resource\nstring formatting. It retrieves the skill ID for a monster's skill slot and formats\nboth the localization string and the skill resource string, returning their combined length.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString with all parameters to format base localized text\n2. Store result in EBP for later addition\n3. Call GetMonsterSkillId with monster ID and skill slot to get skill resource ID\n4. Call FormatResourceString with skill ID and suffix type 0 (no suffix)\n5. Return sum of both formatting results (combined string length/offset)\n\nParameters:\n  dwLocaleIndex (ECX) - Locale/format index for localization lookup\n  nMonsterId (EDX) - Monster type identifier for skill lookup\n  nParam3 (Stack+0x4) - Passed to FormatLocalizationString\n  nSkillSlot (Stack+0x8) - Monster skill slot index (0-7 typically)\n  nParam5 (Stack+0xc) - Passed to FormatLocalizationString\n\nReturns:\n  uint - Combined length/offset from both formatting operations\n\nCallees:\n  FormatLocalizationString (0x6fb38bf0) - Formats base localization text\n  GetMonsterSkillId (0x6fb984e8) - Retrieves skill ID for monster's skill slot\n  FormatResourceString (0x6fb3b570) - Formats skill resource string with suffix type",
      "tags": ["PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_Control"]
    },
