      "global_count": 14,
      "globals": ["0xFFFFFFFF9053000C||", "0xFFFFFFFF90530008||", "0xFFFFFFFF90530004||", "0xFFFFFFFF9052FF9C||", "0xFFFFFFFF90530000||", "0xFFFFFFFF9053001C||", "0xFFFFFFFF9052FFC0||", "0xFFFFFFFF90530014||", "0xD5C30|g_pfnUnicodeDefaultCtor|000dd47a", "0xFFFFFFFF90530018||", "0xE0DE4|g_szLocalizationConfig|0x25", "0xD6210|PTR_wsprintfA_6fba6210|000ddb0c", "0xD5C34|g_pfnUnicodeToUnicode|000dd490", "0xD5C40|g_pfnUnicodeStrcat|000dd4e0"],
      "api_count": 5,
      "api_calls": ["GetMonsterTreasureClass", "GetMonsterMaxDamage", "GetMonsterInitStatsPtr", "ValidateStringId", "ValidateStringId"],
      "instructions": ["0x76F60|SUB|ESP, 0x64", "0x76F63|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x70]", "0x76F67|PUSH|EBX", "0x76F68|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x70]", "0x76F6C|PUSH|EBP", "0x76F6D|PUSH|ESI", "0x76F6E|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [ESP + 0x74]", "0x76F72|PUSH|EDI", "0x76F73|PUSH|EAX", "0x76F74|PUSH|EBX", "0x76F75|PUSH|ESI", "0x76F76|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x1c], ECX", "0x76F7A|CALL|0x6fb38bf0", "0x76F7F|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESI]", "0x76F81|PUSH|EBX"],
      "comment": "Formats monster experience bonus tooltip with scaled damage and exp values.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString with initial parameters\n2. Get monster treasure class via GetMonsterTreasureClass\n3. Calculate scaled resource ID: treasureClass * difficulty + pMonsterStats[0x56]\n4. Get monster max damage via GetMonsterMaxDamage\n5. Read damage modifiers from pMonsterStats[0x51] and [0x52]\n6. Read shift amount from pMonsterStats[0x4a] (byte)\n7. Call FormatResourceString with scaled resource ID\n8. Calculate min/max damage: (modifier + maxDamage) << shift * resourceId >> 8\n9. Call FormatLocalizationString with calculated damage range\n10. Read level modifier from pMonsterStats[0x3e]\n11. Get video frame count (difficulty tier index)\n12. Get monster init stats pointer for stat 0x1a9 (425 - experience)\n13. If stats pointer valid, calculate base exp from stats[0x174] and [0x180]\n14. Apply level scaling: baseExp + (baseExp * levelMod * (difficulty-1)) / 100\n15. If exp bonus non-zero, initialize Unicode buffer (32 elements)\n16. Format exp value to ANSI string via wsprintfA\n17. Convert ANSI to Unicode via toUnicode\n18. Append localized strings (0x10c6, 0xf9e) to output\n\nParameters:\n  pOutputBuffer (ECX): void* - Output buffer for formatted tooltip text\n  nFormatParam (EDX): int - Format parameter passed to localization\n  pMonsterStats (Stack+4): int* - Pointer to monster stats structure\n  nDifficulty (Stack+8): int - Game difficulty level (1-3)\n  nUnused (Stack+C): int - Unused parameter\n\nReturns:\n  int - Always returns 1\n\nMonster Stats Structure Offsets:\n  Offset   Size  Field\n  0x00     4     Monster type ID (passed to GetMonsterTreasureClass)\n  0x3E     4     Level modifier for exp scaling\n  0x4A     1     Damage shift amount (byte)\n  0x51     4     Min damage modifier\n  0x52     4     Max damage modifier\n  0x56     4     Base resource ID offset\n  0x144    4     Min damage base value\n  0x148    4     Max damage base value\n  0x158    4     Treasure class offset\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x1a9 (425) - Monster experience stat ID\n  0x10c6 (4294) - Localization string ID for exp label\n  0xf9e (3998) - Localization string ID for exp suffix\n  0x174 (372) - Offset to min exp in init stats\n  0x180 (384) - Offset to max exp in init stats",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
