      "api_calls": ["GetUnitSkillById", "GetSkillLevel", "GetMonsterSkillId", "GetMonsterInitStatsPtr", "ValidateStringId", "GetMonsterInitStatsPtr", "ValidateStringId", "GetMonsterInitStatsPtr", "ValidateStringId", "ValidateStringId"],
      "instructions": ["0x773F0|SUB|ESP, 0x60", "0x773F3|PUSH|EBX", "0x773F4|PUSH|EBP", "0x773F5|PUSH|ESI", "0x773F6|PUSH|EDI", "0x773F7|MOV|EBP, EDX", "0x773F9|MOV|EBX, ECX", "0x773FB|CALL|0x6fb62880", "0x77400|MOV|ESI, EAX", "0x77402|MOV|EDX, 0xed", "0x77407|PUSH|-0x1", "0x77409|MOV|ECX, ESI", "0x7740B|CALL|0x6fb98230", "0x77410|PUSH|0x1", "0x77412|PUSH|EAX"],
      "comment": "Appends aura skill duration text to a localized tooltip string.\n\nHandles three specific aura skills: Holy Freeze (0xED), Prayer (0xE3), and \nRedemption (0xF7). Calculates duration based on monster init stats and skill \nlevel bonus, then appends formatted duration string to the destination buffer.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get game context (current player unit)\n2. Get Holy Freeze skill (0xED) from unit and retrieve its level\n3. Calculate skill bonus modifier from GetMonsterSkillId if skill level > 0\n4. Call FormatLocalizationString to format base tooltip text\n5. Switch on nSkillId:\n   - 0xED (Holy Freeze): Use monster init stats 0x1A5\n   - 0xE3 (Prayer): Use monster init stats 0x1A4\n   - 0xF7 (Redemption): Use monster init stats 0x1AC\n   - Other: Return early with no duration appended\n6. Get video frame count for stat lookup index\n7. Retrieve monster init stats pointer for the skill type\n8. Calculate base duration: (stats[0x180 + frame*4] + stats[0x174 + frame*4]) / 2\n9. Apply skill level bonus: duration += (duration * skillBonus) / 100\n10. If duration is zero, return early\n11. Initialize Unicode buffer array (64 elements)\n12. Format duration value to ANSI string using \"%d\" format\n13. Convert ANSI string to Unicode\n14. Append localized duration label (string 0x10C6)\n15. Append formatted duration string\n16. Append localized units label (string 0x0F9E - likely \"seconds\")\n\nParameters:\n  pDestBuffer (ECX) - Unicode * - Destination buffer for tooltip text\n  nSkillId (EDX) - int - Skill ID (0xED=Holy Freeze, 0xE3=Prayer, 0xF7=Redemption)\n  nSkillLevel - int - Skill level (passed to FormatLocalizationString)\n  nUnused1 - int - Passed through to FormatLocalizationString\n  nUnused2 - int - Passed through to FormatLocalizationString\n\nReturns:\n  int - Always returns 1\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0xED (237) - Holy Freeze skill ID\n  0xE3 (227) - Prayer skill ID  \n  0xF7 (247) - Redemption skill ID\n  0x1A5 (421) - Monster init stats index for Holy Freeze duration\n  0x1A4 (420) - Monster init stats index for Prayer duration\n  0x1AC (428) - Monster init stats index for Redemption duration\n  0x10C6 (4294) - String ID for duration label\n  0x0F9E (3998) - String ID for units label (seconds)\n  0x174 - Offset to duration min array in monster init stats\n  0x180 - Offset to duration max array in monster init stats\n  0x20 (32) - Buffer element count for initialization loop",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_Room1", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control"]
    },
