      "instructions": ["0x776A0|SUB|ESP, 0x68", "0x776A3|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x70]", "0x776A7|PUSH|EBX", "0x776A8|PUSH|EBP", "0x776A9|PUSH|ESI", "0x776AA|PUSH|EDI", "0x776AB|PUSH|EAX", "0x776AC|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x776AE|PUSH|EDX", "0x776AF|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x1c], EDX", "0x776B3|CALL|0x6fb98626", "0x776B8|MOV|EBX, EAX", "0x776BA|LEA|EDI, [ESP + 0x38]", "0x776BE|MOV|EBP, 0x20", "0x776C3|MOV|ECX, EDI"],
      "comment": "Builds tooltip text displaying monster level bonus, skill bonus, and capped level stats.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get monster's leveled stat value via GetMonsterLeveledStat(nMonsterIndex, nLevel)\n2. Initialize 64-char Unicode buffer with default constructors\n3. If leveled stat is non-zero:\n   a. Select format string (\"+%d\" for positive, \"%d\" for negative)\n   b. Format stat value to ANSI, convert to Unicode\n   c. Append string ID 0x10b1 (level stat label)\n   d. Append formatted value, then string ID 0x10b3 (separator)\n   e. Append newline string ID 0xf9e\n4. Get monster's skill ID via GetMonsterSkillId(nMonsterIndex, nLevel)\n5. Re-initialize Unicode buffer\n6. If skill ID is non-zero:\n   a. Select format string based on sign\n   b. Format and convert to Unicode\n   c. Append string ID 0x10b2 (skill bonus label)\n   d. Append formatted value, separator 0x10b3, newline 0xf9e\n7. Append string ID 0x550d (additional stat label)\n8. Append newline string ID 0xf9e\n9. Cap nLevel to pMonsterData[0x3e] (max level limit at offset 0xf8)\n10. If capped level is non-zero:\n    a. Format capped level value to Unicode\n    b. Append string ID 0x570a (capped level label)\n    c. Append formatted value and newline\n11. Call CalcViewportCoordinates for rendering\n\nParameters:\n  dwDisplayContext (ECX) - Display/render context handle\n  nMonsterIndex (EDX) - Monster type index for stat lookup\n  pMonsterData (Stack+0x4) - Monster data structure pointer\n    [0xf8] = Maximum level cap value\n  nLevel (Stack+0x8) - Current level for stat calculation\n\nReturns:\n  void (tooltip built via Unicode::strcat to external buffers)\n\nString IDs:\n  0x10b1 - Monster leveled stat label\n  0x10b2 - Monster skill bonus label\n  0x10b3 - Separator/delimiter string\n  0xf9e - Newline string\n  0x550d - Additional stat category label\n  0x570a - Capped level display label\n\nFormat Strings:\n  g_szResourceFormatPlus (0x6fbc6358) = \"+%d\" - positive stat display\n  g_szLocalizationConfig (0x6fbb0de4) = \"%d\" - negative/neutral stat display",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_4", "STRUCT_Room1", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
