      "comment": "Calculate viewport-adjusted display coordinates with color adjustment.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize 64-element Unicode string array (32 wide chars per element)\n2. Fetch base color offset from Ordinal_11044(dwParam2, dwFlags)\n3. Load viewport structure shift/scale factor from pViewport[0x128]\n4. Load base X coordinate from pViewport[0x12c] and Y from pViewport[0x130]\n5. Apply bit shift: baseX <<= shift_factor, baseY <<= shift_factor\n6. Arithmetic right shift by 8 bits: (baseX >> 8), (baseY >> 8)\n7. Check if viewport mode is active via FUN_6fb62880()\n8. If active, query viewport palette with Ordinal_10949(0xffffffff)\n9. If palette valid, apply palette color with Ordinal_10968()\n10. Get color adjustment value from Ordinal_10996(0xf7, paletteId)\n11. Calculate adjusted coordinates: ((colorAdj * Y) / 100) + Y, ((colorAdj * X) / 100) + X\n12. Format coordinates to ANSI string via wsprintfA(\"%d,%d\")\n13. Convert ANSI string to Unicode format via toUnicode()\n14. Concatenate output strings and finalize with Ordinal_10004()\n15. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n  dwParam1 (ECX) - Display object/render context handle (implicit __fastcall)\n  dwParam2 (EDX) - Coordinate or mode value (implicit __fastcall)\n  pViewport (Stack[0x4]) - Pointer to viewport configuration structure with offsets:\n    [0x128] = shift/scale factor (byte, mask 0x1f)\n    [0x12c] = base X coordinate (dword at offset 0x12c, dword at offset 0x300)\n    [0x130] = base Y coordinate (dword)\n    [0x300] = additional coordinate data\n  dwFlags (Stack[0x8]) - Flags or palette ID selector\n\nReturns:\n  int = 1 (success)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x20 (32) - Width of Unicode string array (64 chars = 32 Unicode elements)\n  0x128 - Viewport shift/scale factor field offset\n  0x12c - Base X coordinate field offset\n  0x130 - Base Y coordinate field offset\n  0x300 - Alternate X coordinate offset\n  0x100 (256) - Divisor for coordinate scaling\n  0xf7 - Color adjustment query value\n  0x1f - Bit mask for shift factor extraction\n\nStructure Layout (pViewport):\nOffset | Size | Field Name        | Type   | Description\n0x128  | 1    | shift_factor      | byte   | Bit shift amount (masked 0x1f)\n0x12c  | 4    | base_x_coord      | uint   | Base X coordinate for calculation\n0x130  | 4    | base_y_coord      | uint   | Base Y coordinate for calculation\n0x300  | 4    | alt_x_coord       | uint   | Alternative X coordinate source",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_4", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
