      "instructions": ["0x779F0|SUB|ESP, 0x68", "0x779F3|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x70]", "0x779F7|PUSH|EBX", "0x779F8|PUSH|EBP", "0x779F9|PUSH|ESI", "0x779FA|PUSH|EDI", "0x779FB|PUSH|EAX", "0x779FC|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x779FE|PUSH|EDX", "0x779FF|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x1c], EDX", "0x77A03|CALL|0x6fb984e8", "0x77A08|MOV|EBX, EAX", "0x77A0A|LEA|EDI, [ESP + 0x38]", "0x77A0E|MOV|EBP, 0x20", "0x77A13|MOV|ECX, EDI"],
      "comment": "Formats monster skill information for UI display as Unicode string.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Retrieve monster skill ID via GetMonsterSkillId(dwMonsterId, dwSkillSlot)\n2. Initialize 64-element Unicode buffer by calling default constructor 32 times\n3. If skill ID is non-zero:\n   a. Select format string: szFmtDecimalPlus (+%d) if positive, szFmtDecimal (%d) if negative\n   b. Format skill ID to ANSI string using wsprintfA\n   c. Convert ANSI to Unicode using toUnicode (max 32 chars)\n   d. Append localized strings: 0x10c6 (skill name), 0x10b3 (separator), 0xf9e (newline)\n4. Always append: 0x550d (damage header) and 0xf9e (newline)\n5. Clamp dwSkillSlot to pMonsterData[0x3e] (max slots) if larger\n6. Re-initialize Unicode buffer for second formatting pass\n7. If clamped slot is non-zero:\n   a. Format slot value with szFmtDecimal (%d)\n   b. Convert to Unicode\n   c. Append: 0x570a (slot label) and 0xf9e (newline)\n8. Call CalcViewportCoordinates for final coordinate formatting\n9. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n  dwRenderContext (ECX) - Render context or display object handle\n  dwMonsterId (EDX) - Monster type ID for skill lookup\n  pMonsterData (Stack[0x4]) - Pointer to monster data structure\n    [0x3e] = max skill slots (dword at offset 0xF8)\n  dwSkillSlot (Stack[0x8]) - Skill slot index to format\n\nReturns:\n  int - Always returns 1 (success)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x10c6 - Localized string ID for skill name\n  0x10b3 - Localized string ID for separator\n  0xf9e  - Localized string ID for newline/line break\n  0x550d - Localized string ID for damage section header\n  0x570a - Localized string ID for skill slot label\n  0x20 (32) - Loop count for Unicode buffer initialization\n  0x3e (62) - dword index for max slots field (offset 0xF8)\n\nStructure Layout (pMonsterData):\n  Offset | Size | Field          | Type  | Description\n  0xF8   | 4    | dwMaxSkillSlots| dword | Maximum skill slots for monster",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_4", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
