      "instructions": ["0x77DA0|SUB|ESP, 0x68", "0x77DA3|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x74]", "0x77DA7|PUSH|EBX", "0x77DA8|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x70]", "0x77DAC|PUSH|EBP", "0x77DAD|PUSH|ESI", "0x77DAE|PUSH|EDI", "0x77DAF|MOV|EDI, dword ptr [ESP + 0x80]", "0x77DB6|PUSH|EAX", "0x77DB7|MOV|EBP, EDX", "0x77DB9|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x77DBB|PUSH|EDI", "0x77DBC|PUSH|EBX", "0x77DBD|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x20], EBP", "0x77DC1|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x1c], ESI"],
      "comment": "Formats monster damage tooltip with skill bonus calculations.\n\nWorker function that builds damage display strings including level stat modifiers\nand applies damage bonuses from player aura skills (Concentration, Fanaticism).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString with initial parameters\n2. Get monster level stat via GetMonsterLevelStat(nStatId, nMonsterClass)\n3. Initialize Unicode buffer (32 elements, 64 bytes total)\n4. If level stat non-zero:\n   a. Select format string: g_szResourceFormatPlus (\"+%d\") if positive, g_szLocalizationConfig (\"%d\") if negative\n   b. Format level stat to ANSI buffer via wsprintfA\n   c. Convert to Unicode via toUnicode\n   d. Append localization strings 0x10b2, 0x10b3, 0xf9e via strcat\n5. Get monster max damage via GetMonsterMaxDamage(nStatId, nMonsterClass)\n6. Calculate base damage: nMinDamage = pStatDesc+0x144, nMaxDamage = pStatDesc+0x148\n7. Apply bit shift scaling: (damage << (pStatDesc+0x128 & 0x1F)) >> 8\n8. Special case: If nStatId is 0x14, 0x31, or 0x35, set min damage to 1\n9. Check Concentration aura (skill 0x3D, state 0x47):\n   a. If player has state and pStatDesc+0xD4 == 1, apply percentage bonus\n   b. Bonus = (skillLevel * damage) / 100\n10. Check Fanaticism aura (skill 0x3F, state 0x48):\n    a. If player has state and pStatDesc+0xD4 == 2, apply percentage bonus\n    b. Bonus = (skillLevel * damage) / 100\n11. Format final damage values via FormatLocalizationString\n12. Call FormatResourceStatString for additional formatting\n\nParameters:\n  pOutputBuffer (ECX): Output Unicode buffer for formatted string\n  nStatId (EDX): Stat identifier (0x14=fire, 0x31=lightning, 0x35=magic)\n  pStatDesc (Stack+0x4): Pointer to stat descriptor structure\n  nMonsterClass (Stack+0x8): Monster class/type identifier\n  nDifficultyLevel (Stack+0xC): Game difficulty level\n\nReturns:\n  void - Output written to pOutputBuffer\n\nStructure Layout (pStatDesc):\n  Offset  Size  Field              Description\n  0x0D4   1     byDamageType       Damage type (1=physical, 2=elemental)\n  0x128   1     byShiftAmount      Bit shift for damage scaling\n  0x140   1     byStatFlags        Stat display flags\n  0x144   4     nMinDamageBase     Base minimum damage\n  0x148   4     nMaxDamageBase     Base maximum damage\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x14 (20): Fire damage stat ID\n  0x31 (49): Lightning damage stat ID  \n  0x35 (53): Magic damage stat ID\n  0x3D (61): Concentration skill ID\n  0x3F (63): Fanaticism skill ID\n  0x47 (71): Concentration state flag\n  0x48 (72): Fanaticism state flag\n  0x10B2: Localization string ID (level stat prefix)\n  0x10B3: Localization string ID (level stat suffix)\n  0x0F9E: Localization string ID (damage separator)",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
