      "instructions": ["0x78050|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0xc]", "0x78054|SUB|ESP, 0x60", "0x78057|PUSH|EBX", "0x78058|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x6c]", "0x7805C|PUSH|EBP", "0x7805D|PUSH|ESI", "0x7805E|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x78060|PUSH|EDI", "0x78061|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x74]", "0x78065|PUSH|EAX", "0x78066|PUSH|EBX", "0x78067|PUSH|ECX", "0x78068|MOV|EDI, EDX", "0x7806A|MOV|ECX, ESI", "0x7806C|CALL|0x6fb38bf0"],
      "comment": "Formats monster damage and life statistics for tooltip display.\n\nAppends scaled damage value and life bonus to the output Unicode buffer using\nlocalized string formatting. Damage is scaled by area level and monster class.\nLife bonus is calculated from monster init stats at index 0x1AB, averaged between\ntwo stat arrays and scaled by area level and a per-level multiplier from the\nmonster stats record.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString with all parameters for base formatting\n2. Get scaled damage via GetMonsterScaledDamage(nAreaLevel, nMonsterClassId)\n3. Initialize 64-element Unicode buffer with default constructors\n4. If scaled damage > 0:\n   a. Format damage as decimal string via wsprintfA with \"%d\" format\n   b. Convert ASCII to Unicode via toUnicode\n   c. Validate and append string ID 0x10F6 (damage label)\n   d. Append formatted damage value\n   e. Validate and append string ID 0x10B3 (separator)\n   f. Validate and append string ID 0x0F9E (newline/suffix)\n5. Read per-level life multiplier from nMonsterStatsRecord+0xF8\n6. Get video frame count for stat array indexing\n7. Get monster init stats pointer for index 0x1AB\n8. If stats pointer valid:\n   a. Average stats from offset 0x180 and 0x174 arrays (indexed by frame count)\n   b. Scale by: nLifeBonus += (nLifeBonus * nPerLevelMult * (nAreaLevel-1)) / 100\n   c. If calculated life bonus > 0:\n      - Re-initialize Unicode buffer\n      - Format and convert life bonus to Unicode\n      - Validate and append string ID 0x10C6 (life label)\n      - Append formatted life value\n      - Validate and append string ID 0x0F9E (newline/suffix)\n9. Return 1 (always succeeds)\n\nParameters:\n  pOutputBuffer (ECX): Pointer to Unicode output buffer for appending stats\n  nMonsterClassId (EDX): Monster class identifier for stat lookup\n  nMonsterStatsRecord (Stack+0x4): Monster stats record address\n    - Offset 0xF8: Per-level life multiplier (int)\n  nAreaLevel (Stack+0x8): Current area level for scaling calculations\n  nDifficultyLevel (Stack+0xC): Game difficulty level\n\nReturns:\n  Always returns 1\n\nString IDs:\n  0x10F6 - Damage label prefix\n  0x10B3 - Separator string\n  0x0F9E - Newline or suffix string\n  0x10C6 - Life bonus label prefix\n\nCalled Functions:\n  FormatLocalizationString - Base localization formatting\n  GetMonsterScaledDamage - Retrieves level-scaled monster damage\n  GetVideoFrameCount - Gets current video frame for stat indexing\n  GetMonsterInitStatsPtr(0x1AB) - Gets monster init stats at index 427",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control"]
    },
