      "comment": "Formats minion stat bonuses for tooltip display\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Save pMinionStatsRecord to local variable for later use\n2. Call GetGameContext() to get current unit pointer (pGameUnit)\n3. Initialize Unicode buffer local_40[64] with default constructors (32 iterations)\n4. Read stat modifier value from [pMinionStatsRecord + 0xf0]\n5. If stat modifier is non-zero:\n   a. Select format string: \"%d\" for negative, \"+%d\" for positive values\n   b. Format the stat value using wsprintfA into aCStack_60\n   c. Convert formatted ANSI string to Unicode via toUnicode()\n   d. Append localized strings: StringId 0x10e5, stat value, 0x10b3, 0xf9e\n6. Call GetMinionExperience(pGameUnit) to get base experience\n7. Add experience modifier from [pMinionStatsRecord + 0xf4] to base experience\n8. Re-initialize Unicode buffer local_40[64] with default constructors\n9. If total experience bonus is non-zero:\n   a. Select format string based on sign (same as step 5a)\n   b. Format experience value to Unicode\n   c. Append localized strings: StringId 0x10c6, exp value, 0x10b3, 0xf9e\n10. Get monster stat bonus via GetUnitMonsterStatBonus(pGameUnit)\n11. Call FormatResourceString(nStatBonus, 0) for final formatting\n12. Return true (always succeeds)\n\nParameters:\n- this (void *): IMPLICIT via ECX - Tooltip builder context object\n- pMinionStatsRecord (int): Pointer to minion stats structure containing:\n  - [+0xf0]: Stat modifier value (int)\n  - [+0xf4]: Experience modifier value (int)\n\nReturns:\n- bool: Always returns true (1)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Callback function (no direct callers - invoked via function pointer)\n- Uses unaff_ESI/unaff_EDI as implicit string concatenation parameters\n- Both stat and experience sections skip formatting if value is zero\n- Format strings: \"+%d\" (0x6fbc6358) for positive, \"%d\" (0x6fbb0de4) for negative\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n- 0x20 (32): Unicode buffer initialization loop count\n- 0xf0 (240): Offset to stat modifier in minion stats structure\n- 0xf4 (244): Offset to experience modifier in minion stats structure\n- 0x10e5 (4325): String ID for stat bonus label\n- 0x10c6 (4294): String ID for experience bonus label\n- 0x10b3 (4275): String ID for separator/suffix\n- 0xf9e (3998): String ID for line terminator\n- 0x10b0 (4272): String ID used in FormatResourceString call",
