      "comment": "Formats monster statistics bonuses (level, skill, experience) for tooltip display.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get game context (UnitAny pointer for player/minion)\n2. Call FormatLocalizationString to prepare base localization output\n3. Get level-scaled bonus value from GetMonsterLevelScaledValue(nMonsterRowIndex, nDifficultyLevel)\n4. Initialize 64-element Unicode buffer (128 bytes)\n5. If level-scaled value is non-zero:\n   a. Select format string: \"+%d\" for positive, \"%d\" for negative\n   b. Format value to ANSI string, convert to Unicode\n   c. Append string ID 0x10b1 (level bonus label)\n   d. Append formatted value and separators (0x10b3, 0xf9e)\n6. Get skill ID bonus from GetMonsterSkillId(nMonsterRowIndex, nDifficultyLevel)\n7. Re-initialize Unicode buffer\n8. If skill bonus is non-zero:\n   a. Format with sign prefix\n   b. Append string ID 0x10a0 (skill bonus label)\n   c. Append formatted value and separators\n9. Get experience bonus from GetMonsterLeveledStat + GetMinionExperience\n10. Re-initialize Unicode buffer\n11. If experience bonus is non-zero:\n    a. Format with sign prefix\n    b. Append string ID 0x10c6 (experience bonus label)\n    c. Append formatted value and separators\n12. Return 1\n\nParameters:\n- nStringId (dword, ECX): Base string ID for localization\n- nMonsterRowIndex (int, EDX): Monster table row index\n- nParam3 (int, Stack+0x4): Additional localization parameter\n- nDifficultyLevel (int, Stack+0x8): Difficulty level (0=Normal, 1=Nightmare, 2=Hell)\n- nParam5 (int, Stack+0xC): Additional localization parameter\n- IMPLICIT unaff_ESI: Source string pointer for strcat\n- IMPLICIT unaff_EDI: Destination Unicode buffer pointer for strcat\n\nReturns:\n- 1 always (success)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x10b1: String ID for level bonus label\n- 0x10a0: String ID for skill bonus label  \n- 0x10c6: String ID for experience bonus label\n- 0x10b3: String ID for separator\n- 0xf9e: String ID for suffix/newline\n- 0x20: Loop count for 64-element Unicode buffer initialization\n- 0x6fbc6358: Format string \"+%d\" (positive values)\n- 0x6fbb0de4: Format string \"%d\" (negative values)\n\nClassification: Worker function - formats monster bonus stats for tooltip display",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_Room1", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
