      "instructions": ["0x79850|PUSH|ECX", "0x79851|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x10]", "0x79855|PUSH|EBX", "0x79856|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [ESP + 0xc]", "0x7985A|PUSH|EBP", "0x7985B|PUSH|ESI", "0x7985C|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [ESP + 0x18]", "0x79860|PUSH|EDI", "0x79861|PUSH|EAX", "0x79862|MOV|EDI, ECX", "0x79864|PUSH|ESI", "0x79865|MOV|EBP, EDX", "0x79867|PUSH|EBX", "0x79868|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x1c], EDI", "0x7986C|CALL|0x6fb38bf0"],
      "comment": "Adjust sprite screen coordinates with perspective shift and conditional modifier application.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Format initial sprite coordinates using szBuffer, nSpriteType, and scale values via FormatLocalizationString\n2. Fetch perspective/zoom configuration via Ordinal_10589(0x1cd) or abort with fatal error if unavailable\n3. Calculate base displacement: (config[0xc] * nScaleX) + config[0x8]\n4. Format displacement resource via FormatResourceString with address 0x10b0\n5. Query dimension offset via Ordinal_11045(nSpriteType, nScaleX)\n6. Load entity X/Y offsets from nEntityData[0x144] and nEntityData[0x148], add dimension offset\n7. If any offset non-zero: apply perspective shift using entity bit-shift value nEntityData[0x128]\n8. Check sprite type against special cases 0x14, 0x31, 0x35 - if match force adjustment to 1\n9. For modifier pass 1 (flag 0x47):\n   a. Get screen context via FUN_6fb62880\n   b. Check if context valid (offset +0x4 == 1)\n   c. Query modifier state via Ordinal_10487(context, 0x47)\n   d. If active and entity matches condition: apply modifier chain Ordinal_10949/10968/10996\n10. For modifier pass 2 (flag 0x48): repeat with flag value 0x48\n11. Format final coordinates via FormatLocalizationString with adjusted X/Y and palette index\n12. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\nszBuffer (ECX): Destination char buffer for formatted coordinate strings\nnSpriteType (EDX): Sprite animation type identifier (checked vs 0x14, 0x31, 0x35)\nnEntityData (Stack[0x4]): Entity/sprite structure containing offsets and config at [0x144], [0x148], [0x128], [0x140], [0xd4]\nnScaleX (Stack[0x8]): Horizontal scale/dimension multiplier\nnScaleY (Stack[0xc]): Vertical scale/dimension multiplier (unused)\n\nReturns:\n1 = Always returns success after formatting and applying modifiers\n\nSpecial Cases:\nConfig unavailable: calls FUN_6fb9a10f(-1) for fatal abort\nEmpty offsets: skips all modifier calculation\nMagic constants: 0x3d and 0x3f used with Ordinal_10996\nDivision approximation: 0x51eb851f used for /100 scaling in IMUL sequences",
      "tags": ["MOD_UI", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "UI_SKILLS", "SRC_SkillDesc.cpp", "PARAM_5", "TBL_skilldesc", "STRUCT_Other", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
