      "api_calls": ["GetMonsterSkillId", "GetMonsterLevelScaledValue", "ValidateStringId", "ValidateStringId", "ValidateStringId", "GetMonsterLeveledStat", "ValidateStringId", "ValidateStringId", "ValidateStringId", "GetMonsterInitStatsPtr", "...+2 more"],
      "instructions": ["0x79AE0|SUB|ESP, 0x60", "0x79AE3|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x6c]", "0x79AE7|PUSH|EBX", "0x79AE8|PUSH|EBP", "0x79AE9|PUSH|ESI", "0x79AEA|PUSH|EDI", "0x79AEB|MOV|EDI, dword ptr [ESP + 0x78]", "0x79AEF|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x79AF1|PUSH|EAX", "0x79AF2|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x78]", "0x79AF6|PUSH|EDI", "0x79AF7|PUSH|ECX", "0x79AF8|MOV|EBP, EDX", "0x79AFA|MOV|ECX, ESI", "0x79AFC|CALL|0x6fb38bf0"],
      "comment": "Formats monster skill and stat tooltip text with localized strings.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString to initialize base tooltip context\n2. Get monster skill ID for skill slot 0x129 and append formatted value (string ID 0x10ae)\n3. Get monster level-scaled value using GetMonsterLevelScaledValue\n4. Initialize 32-character Unicode buffer to zeros via constructor loop\n5. If scaled value non-zero: format with +%d or %d based on sign\n6. Append localized strings: 0x10b2 (label), value, 0x10b3 (separator), 0xf9e (newline)\n7. Get monster leveled stat using GetMonsterLeveledStat\n8. Re-initialize Unicode buffer and format leveled stat if non-zero\n9. Append localized strings: 0x10a0 (label), value, 0x10b3 (separator), 0xf9e (newline)\n10. Read difficulty modifier from pMonsterStats offset +0xf0\n11. Get video frame count for animation index selection\n12. Get monster init stats ptr for monster 0x1a7 (corpse explosion)\n13. Calculate fire damage = (MinDamage[frameIdx] + MaxDamage[frameIdx]) / 2\n14. Apply difficulty scaling: damage += (damage * difficulty * (level-1)) / 100\n15. If fire damage non-zero: format and append with string ID 0x10c6, value, 0xf9e\n16. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\npTooltipContext (ECX): Tooltip output context for Unicode string concatenation\nnMonsterIndex (EDX): Monster type index for stat lookup functions\nnMonsterStatsPtr (stack+0x4): Pointer to monster stats structure, offset +0xf0 contains difficulty modifier\nnMonsterLevel (stack+0x8): Monster level for scaling calculations (1-based)\nnParam5 (stack+0xc): Additional parameter passed through to FormatLocalizationString\n\nReturns:\nint: Always returns 1 (EAX) indicating success\n\nString IDs:\n0x10ae - Skill value format string\n0x10b2 - Level-scaled stat label\n0x10b3 - Stat value separator\n0xf9e - Line terminator/newline\n0x10a0 - Leveled stat label\n0x10c6 - Fire damage label\n\nFormat Strings:\n0x6fbc6358: \"+%d\" - positive value format\n0x6fbb0de4: \"%d\" - negative/plain value format\n\nMonster ID 0x1a7 References:\nOffset 0x174 + frameIdx*4 = Min fire damage array\nOffset 0x180 + frameIdx*4 = Max fire damage array",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_Room1", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control"]
