      "comment": "Retrieves a configuration value and formats it for display.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call Ordinal_10589 (D2Common.GetUnitStat or similar config accessor) with 0x182 to retrieve configuration data structure\n2. Load dword at offset 0x78 from returned structure (config value field)\n3. Call FormatAndAppendStringValue with the config value to format for display\n4. Return success (1)\n\nParameters:\n(implicit) This pointer or context in ECX\n\nReturns:\n1 - Success, formatted value appended\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Ordinal_10589 returns pointer to internal config structure\n- Offset 0x78 is a dword field containing the value to format\n- 0x182 is magic number identifying which config property to retrieve",
