      "comment": "FormatMonsterSkillStatsTooltip - Formats monster skill and level bonus stats for tooltip display\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get monster level stat via GetMonsterLevelStat(nMonsterData, nSkillSlot)\n2. Get monster skill ID via GetMonsterSkillId(nMonsterData, nSkillSlot)\n3. Format base localization string via FormatLocalizationString\n4. If level stat non-zero, format with +/- sign and append:\n   - String ID 0x10b2 (level stat label)\n   - Formatted value\n   - String ID 0x10b3 (level stat suffix)\n   - String ID 0xf9e (newline/separator)\n5. If skill ID * 2 non-zero, format and append:\n   - String ID 0x5714 (skill damage label)\n   - Formatted doubled value\n   - String ID 0x5718 (skill damage suffix)\n   - String ID 0xf9e (separator)\n6. If skill ID non-zero, format and append:\n   - String ID 0x5713 (attack rating label)\n   - Formatted skill ID\n   - String ID 0x5718 (suffix)\n   - String ID 0xf9e (separator)\n7. If skill ID non-zero again, format and append:\n   - String ID 0x5712 (defense label)\n   - Formatted skill ID\n   - String ID 0x5717 (defense suffix)\n   - String ID 0xf9e (separator)\n\nParameters:\n  pDestBuffer (ECX) - Unicode destination buffer for formatted tooltip\n  nMonsterData (EDX) - Monster data structure/pointer\n  nSkillIndex (Stack+4) - Skill index for lookup\n  nSkillSlot (Stack+8) - Skill slot used for GetMonsterLevelStat/GetMonsterSkillId\n  nDisplayFlags (Stack+C) - Display flags for localization\n\nReturns: void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x10b2 - Level bonus label string ID\n  0x10b3 - Level bonus suffix string ID\n  0x5712 - Defense bonus label string ID\n  0x5713 - Attack rating bonus label string ID\n  0x5714 - Skill damage bonus label string ID\n  0x5717 - Defense suffix string ID\n  0x5718 - Skill bonus suffix string ID\n  0xf9e - Line separator/newline string ID\n  0x20 - Unicode buffer size (32 characters)\n\nFormat Strings:\n  g_szResourceFormatPlus (0x6fbc6358) - \"+%d\" for positive values\n  g_szLocalizationConfig (0x6fbb0de4) - \"%d\" for negative values",
