      "comment": "Formats missile skill damage tooltip with level bonuses and aura amplification.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get monster level stat bonus and format initial localization string\n2. Initialize 64-char Unicode buffer for intermediate formatting\n3. If level stat non-zero, format with +/- prefix and append to tooltip\n4. Get monster max damage and combine with missile record offsets 0x144/0x148\n5. Apply damage shift scaling from missile record offset 0x128\n6. Force min damage to 1 for specific missile IDs (0x14, 0x31, 0x35)\n7. If player has Conviction (state 0x47), apply skill 0x3D damage bonus percent\n8. If player has Lower Resist (state 0x48), apply skill 0x3F damage bonus percent\n9. Format and append damage range to output buffer\n10. Get missile template 0x22D and format resource string with stats\n11. Repeat damage calculation for secondary damage display\n\nParameters:\n  pOutputBuffer (ECX) - Unicode output buffer for formatted tooltip\n  nMissileId (EDX) - Missile type ID for damage lookups\n  pMissileRecord (stack) - Pointer to MissileRecord structure\n  nMonsterLevelId (stack) - Monster level ID for stat scaling\n  nDifficultyMode (stack) - Game difficulty mode\n\nReturns: void (writes to pOutputBuffer)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x47 - STATE_CONVICTION aura\n  0x48 - STATE_LOWER_RESIST curse\n  0x3D - Conviction skill ID\n  0x3F - Lower Resist skill ID\n  0x14, 0x31, 0x35 - Missile IDs forcing min damage to 1\n  0x22D (557) - Missile template ID\n  0x572A, 0x5714, 0x5713, 0x5712 - Localization string IDs",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
