      "comment": "Appends monster level stat and skill ID bonus/penalty to tooltip string.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString to format base tooltip\n2. Get monster level stat via GetMonsterLevelStat\n3. If level stat non-zero, format with +/-prefix and append string IDs 0x10b2, 0x10b3, 0xf9e\n4. Get monster skill ID via GetMonsterSkillId\n5. If skill ID non-zero, format with +/-prefix and append string IDs 0x5515, 0x10b3, 0xf9e\n6. Return 1\n\nParameters:\n  pOutString (ECX) - Output Unicode string buffer (IMPLICIT)\n  nMonsterClassId (EDX) - Monster class ID (IMPLICIT)\n  nStatParam - Stat parameter for lookup\n  nDifficultyLevel - Game difficulty level\n  nMonsterMode - Monster mode/state\n\nReturns: Always 1\n\nImplicit Registers:\n  ESI - Used as strcat source string (phantom unaff_ESI)\n  EDI - Used as strcat function pointer (phantom unaff_EDI)",
