      "comment": "Formats monster damage tooltip with level bonuses and aura damage modifiers.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get monster level stat bonus via GetMonsterLevelStat\n2. Format base localization string for the stat\n3. If level bonus exists, append formatted +/- value string\n4. Get monster max damage and apply scaling from nMonsterStats offsets\n5. Check player for Fanaticism aura (state 0x47) - applies Might skill (0x3d) damage bonus\n6. Check player for Concentration aura (state 0x48) - applies Blessed Aim skill (0x3f) damage bonus\n7. Format attribute values 0x22E and 0x22F\n8. Repeat damage calculation and aura checks for secondary stat display\n\nParameters:\n  pOutput - Unicode buffer to append formatted tooltip text (IMPLICIT: ECX)\n  nStatId - Stat type identifier (IMPLICIT: EDX) (0x14=lightning, 0x31=fire, 0x35=cold)\n  nMonsterStats - Pointer cast to int for monster stats structure\n  dwMonsterFlags - Monster flags passed to damage/level functions\n  nStringId - Localization string ID for formatting\n\nReturns:\n  void - Results written to pOutput buffer\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - nStatId 0x14, 0x31, 0x35: Forces minimum damage to 1\n  - State 0x47 (Fanaticism): Applies Might (0x3d) skill damage percentage bonus\n  - State 0x48 (Concentration): Applies Blessed Aim (0x3f) skill damage percentage bonus\n  - Aura bonuses only apply when nMonsterStats->+0xd4 matches expected aura type (1 or 2)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  - 0x10B2, 0x10B3, 0xF9E: Localization string IDs for level bonus display\n  - 0x5712, 0x5727: Attribute description string IDs\n  - 0x22E, 0x22F: Attribute IDs for FormatAttributeValue",
