      "comment": "BuildMonsterStatDisplayString - Builds formatted display string for monster stat tooltips.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString to initialize output buffer with base format\n2. Get monster level stat via GetMonsterLevelStat\n3. If level stat exists, format with +/- prefix and append string IDs 0x10b2, 0x10b3, 0xf9e\n4. Get monster skill ID via GetMonsterSkillId\n5. If skill ID exists, format with +/- prefix and append string IDs 0x5515, 0x10b3, 0xf9e\n6. Determine damage tier based on nSkillIndex (tier 1 if <6, tier 2 if 6-11, tier 3 if >=12)\n7. Append damage tier info with string IDs 0x5509 (tier 1) or 0x550a (tier 2/3)\n\nParameters:\n  pOutputBuffer - Unicode output buffer for formatted tooltip string\n  nUnitId - Monster unit identifier\n  nFormatParam - Format parameter passed to FormatLocalizationString\n  nSkillIndex - Skill index determining damage tier\n  nDamageTier - Initial damage tier value (overwritten by function)\n\nReturns: void (output written to pOutputBuffer)",
