      "comment": "FormatMonsterSkillBonus - Formats and appends monster skill bonus text to a localized string.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString to format base localization string\n2. Get monster skill ID via GetMonsterSkillId(nMonsterId, nSkillSlot)\n3. Initialize Unicode buffer (64 elements)\n4. If skill ID is non-zero:\n   a. Format skill value with sign prefix (+ or -)\n   b. Convert to Unicode\n   c. Append skill header (0x572a), separator (0x10b3), and suffix (0xf9e) strings\n\nParameters:\n  nIndex - Localization string index passed to FormatLocalizationString\n  nMonsterId - Monster type ID for skill lookup\n  nParam3 - Additional formatting parameter\n  nSkillSlot - Skill slot index for skill lookup\n  nParam5 - Additional formatting parameter\n\nReturns: void (output via unaff_EDI/unaff_ESI registers)",
