      "comment": "FormatMonsterStatTooltip - Formats monster stat tooltip with level and skill information.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FormatLocalizationString to initialize tooltip buffer\n2. Get monster level stat and format with +/- prefix if non-zero\n3. Append level stat text using localized string IDs (0x10b2, 0x10b3, 0xf9e)\n4. Get monster skill ID and format with +/- prefix if non-zero\n5. Append skill text using localized string IDs (0x10a0, 0x10b3, 0xf9e)\n\nParameters:\n  pTooltipBuffer - Output buffer for formatted tooltip text\n  nMonsterId - Monster type identifier\n  nUnused - Unused parameter (passed through to FormatLocalizationString)\n  nMonsterStatIndex - Index of monster stat to display\n  nParam5 - Additional parameter for FormatLocalizationString\n\nReturns: void",
