      "comment": "BuildLocalizedConfigString - Builds a localized configuration display string\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract config field from offset 0xF8 of input structure\n2. Initialize 64-char Unicode buffer with constructor closures\n3. Format config value as decimal string via g_szLocalizationConfig (\"%d\")\n4. Convert ANSI to Unicode via Unicode::toUnicode()\n5. Concatenate with localized strings 0x1110 and 0xf9e from string table\n\nParameters:\n- dwConfigValue: Pointer to config structure containing value at offset 0xF8\n\nReturns: void (result stored in global Unicode buffer via unaff_EDI/ESI)\n\nNotes:\n- Uses D2Lang.dll ValidateStringId (ordinal 10056) for string table lookup\n- String IDs 0x1110 and 0xf9e are localization keys from .tbl files\n- Called from 3 locations (xrefs at 0x6fbc5744, 0x6fbc5f0c, 0x6fbc614c)\n- Unaffected registers EDI/ESI indicate missing calling convention context",
