      "comment": "BuildMonsterTooltipText - Builds localized tooltip text strings for monster display.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get stat value from monster at offset 0xf0\n2. If stat value exists, format it with localization strings (0x570b, 0x570c, 0xf9e)\n3. Get monster data record at index 0x138\n4. Format coordinate range from monster data (offsets 0xf0, 0xf4)\n5. Append coordinate info using localization strings (0x10a0, 0x10cc, 0xf9e)\n\nParameters:\n  pMonster - Pointer to monster structure containing stat data at offset 0xf0\n\nReturns: void (builds text into Unicode buffers)",
