      "comment": "FormatSkillDamageTooltipText - Formats damage text for skill tooltips with aura bonuses.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Format base localization strings for the skill\n2. Get monster data record for skill 0x138 (Corpse Explosion)\n3. Calculate damage multiplier as (levelScaledValue * 10 / 3), display as decimal\n4. Format damage value using integer or decimal format strings\n5. Get monster max damage and add skill data damage modifiers\n6. Apply shift from skill data byte at offset 0x128\n7. Check for special skill IDs (0x14, 0x31, 0x35) that force min damage to 1\n8. Apply Concentration aura (0x3d) bonus if active and applicable\n9. Apply Fanaticism aura (0x3f) bonus if active and applicable\n10. Format final damage range using localization string\n\nParameters:\n  pOutputBuffer - Destination buffer for formatted tooltip text\n  nSkillId - Skill ID being displayed\n  pSkillData - Pointer to skill data structure with damage modifiers\n  nMonsterLevel - Monster level for damage scaling\n  nUnused - Unused parameter (passed through to FormatLocalizationString)\n\nReturns: void (output written to pOutputBuffer)",
