      "comment": "Formats resource stat localization text with skill descriptions.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Query resource ID from stat table using Ordinal_11033\n2. Extract stat values from pStatTable at offsets +0x100, +0x104\n3. Initialize Unicode array (64 elements) to zero via loop\n4. If resource stat is non-zero:\n   a. Format ANSI sprintf using g_szLocalizationConfig template\n   b. Convert ANSI to Unicode via toUnicode function\n   c. Call Ordinal_10004 three times before strcat operations\n   d. Append skill descriptions for IDs 0x1100, 0x10b3, 0xf9e\n5. Call FormatResourceStatString to finalize\n6. Return 1\n\nParameters:\n  pDest (Unicode*) - Destination Unicode buffer\n  pSource (Unicode*) - Source Unicode buffer\n  pStatTable (StatTable*) - Stat table with values at +0x100, +0x104\n  dwResourceId (dword) - Resource ID identifier\n\nReturns:\n  1 - Success",
