      "comment": "FormatMonsterStatsTooltip - Formats monster statistics for tooltip display.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Formats initial localization string with monster class data\n2. Gets monster skill ID and formats as resource string\n3. Calculates treasure class modifier using difficulty level\n4. Gets max damage and combines with monster stat offsets (0x4a, 0x51, 0x52, 0x56)\n5. Formats final damage range output scaled by treasure class\n\nParameters:\n  pOutputBuffer - Buffer to receive formatted string\n  nMonsterClassId - Monster class identifier\n  pMonsterStats - Pointer to monster statistics structure\n  nDifficultyLevel - Current game difficulty level\n  nUnused - Unused parameter (always 0 or passed through)\n\nReturns: void",
