      "comment": "FormatMonsterStatBonusesTooltip - Formats monster stat bonuses for UI tooltip display.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calls FormatLocalizationString with base parameters\n2. If monster has multiple levels (nLevelCount > 1), calculates level-based bonuses:\n   - Experience bonus from GetMonsterExperienceByLevel\n   - Damage/attack rating bonuses from monster data offsets 0xF0/0xF4\n3. Gets monster init stats for type 0x1A2 (418) to calculate defense values\n4. Formats each bonus value with +/- sign using localized format strings\n5. Concatenates bonus strings with separator characters\n\nParameters:\n  pOutputBuffer - Output buffer for formatted tooltip text\n  nMonsterLevel - Monster's level for calculations\n  pMonsterData - Pointer to monster data structure\n  nLevelCount - Number of levels (scaling factor)\n  nStringParam - String parameter for localization\n\nReturns: void (modifies output buffer)",
