      "comment": "Render quest mode skill panel UI with skill text based on current skill slot.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Render three common skill text lines centered on screen\n2. Check current skill slot value (0=Warrior, 1=Rogue, 2=Sorceress, 3=Druid, 4=Necromancer, 5=Paladin, 6=Barbarian)\n3. If slot 0 (Warrior): Render 10 skill text lines with different vertical offsets\n4. Else if slot 3 (Druid): Render 6 skill text lines (subset)\n5. Else if slot 2 (Sorceress): Render 6 skill text lines (different offsets than Druid)\n6. Else if slot 4 (Necromancer): Render 2 text lines, then render 3 skill panels with FUN_6fb4fd50\n7. Else if slot 1 (Rogue): Render 6 skill panels with FUN_6fb4fd50 with various offsets\n8. Else if slot 6 (Barbarian): Render 5 skill panels with FUN_6fb4fd50\n9. Else if slot 5 (Paladin): Render 4 skill panels with FUN_6fb4fd50\n\nParameters: None (uses global variables g_byCurrentSkillSlot, g_dwUIXOffset, g_dwUIYOffset, g_dwScreenHeight, g_dwBackBufferHeight)\n\nReturns: void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x5a (-90) - Horizontal padding from right edge\n0x1c7 (-455) - Warrior skill text vertical offset 1\n0x1bb (-443) - Warrior skill text vertical offset 2\n0x1af (-431) - Warrior skill text vertical offset 3\n0x14a (-330) - Warrior skill text vertical offset 4\n0x13e (-318) - Warrior skill text vertical offset 5\n0x132 (-306) - Warrior skill text vertical offset 6\n0xde (-222) - Warrior skill text vertical offset 7\n0xd2 (-210) - Warrior skill text vertical offset 8\n0xc6 (-198) - Warrior skill text vertical offset 9\n0x79 (-121) - Warrior skill text vertical offset 10\n0x6d (-109) - Warrior skill text vertical offset 11\n0x61 (-97) - Warrior skill text vertical offset 12\n0x144 (-324) - Druid/Sorceress/Necromancer skill text vertical offset 1\n0x138 (-312) - Druid/Sorceress/Necromancer skill text vertical offset 2\n0xcc (-204) - Druid skill text vertical offset 4\n0x6e (-110) - Druid skill text vertical offset 5\n0x62 (-98) - Druid skill text vertical offset 6\n0xd8 (-216) - Sorceress/Necromancer skill text vertical offset\n0xd2 (-210) - Sorceress skill text vertical offset 3\n0xc6 (-198) - Sorceress skill text vertical offset 4\n0x68 (-104) - Sorceress skill text vertical offset 6\n0x96 (-150) - Barbarian panel offset 1\n0xa2 (-158) - Barbarian/Rogue/Paladin panel offset\n0x108 (-264) - Rogue/Paladin panel offset 3\n0x114 (-276) - All classes panel offset\n0x172 (-370) - All classes panel offset\n0x17e (-382) - Necromancer panel offset 3\n0x9c (-156) - Rogue panel offset 1\n0xa8 (-168) - Rogue panel offset 2",
