      "comment": "HandleQuestUIClick - Processes mouse clicks on the quest UI panel.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract X/Y click coordinates from event structure\n2. Validate coordinates are within screen bounds\n3. If skill UI rendered, check for quest button clicks in the right panel\n4. Detect which quest act tab (1-3) was clicked based on Y position\n5. Detect which quest row/column was clicked and send packet to server\n6. Update quest mode state and refresh UI if selection changed\n\nParameters:\n  pClickEvent - Pointer to click event structure containing X/Y coords at offset 0x0C\n\nReturns: void (updates quest UI state via globals)",
