      "comment": "Clear all active object state flags\nIterates through the object state array and clears any active (value=1) flags to inactive (value=0).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize pointer to start of g_adObjectState array (address 0x6fbfc83c)\n2. Check current dword value: if equals 1, set to 0 (clear active flag)\n3. Advance pointer to next dword (add 4 bytes)\n4. Loop until reaching array boundary (0x6fbfc8b4)\n5. Return\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid (no return value)\n\nSpecial Cases:\nArray size: (0x6fbfc8b4 - 0x6fbfc83c) / 4 = 124 dwords\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x1: Active flag value\n- 0x0: Inactive flag value\n- 0x4: Dword increment (4 bytes per element)\n- 0x6fbfc83c: Start address of g_adObjectState array\n- 0x6fbfc8b4: End boundary of array (exclusive)",
