      "comment": "Validate all skill slot error codes and report any issues encountered.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if global main window render target pointer is non-null\n2. If set, call ReportValidationError and clear g_pMainWindowRenderTarget\n3. Calculate current skill slot address: g_aSkillSlots + (g_byCurrentSkillSlot * 0x22)\n4. Load error code from current slot and test for non-zero\n5. If current slot contains error, call ReportValidationError and zero the slot\n6. Initialize ESI to base of skill slots array (0x6fbc65b0)\n7. Loop through all slots with stride 0x22 until reaching end address 0x6fbc669e\n8. For each slot: test value, if non-zero call ReportValidationError and clear\n9. Continue until all slots validated\n10. Return with ESI/stack cleanup\n\nParameters:\nNone (implicit: uses g_pMainWindowRenderTarget, g_byCurrentSkillSlot, g_aSkillSlots)\n\nReturns:\nvoid (validation performed via side effects on globals)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x22 - skill slot element size in bytes\n0x6fbc65b0 - base address of skill slots array g_aSkillSlots\n0x6fbc669e - end boundary for skill array iteration",
      "tags": ["PARAM_0"]
