      "comment": "Initialize skill UI state and render buffers\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Clear g_abSkillUIStateBuffer (241 DWORDs + 1 BYTE = 0xf1 DWORDs + 1 BYTE)\n2. Initialize g_adSkillUIRenderTargets with 0xFFFFFFFF (60 DWORDs)\n3. Call FUN_6fb52580 (skill UI setup)\n4. Call FUN_6fb52a10(0) (initialize component with flag 0)\n5. Call FUN_6fb52f20 (render initialization)\n6. Jump to FUN_6fb53380 (additional initialization chain)\n\nParameters:\n(none)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Initializes global UI buffers, no return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Clears 0xf1 DWORDs (241) then 1 additional BYTE in state buffer\n- Fills render targets with 0xFFFFFFFF (invalid/empty marker)\n- Function uses tail call to FUN_6fb53380 (JMP instead of CALL)",
