      "comment": "Initialize and populate skill UI slot display panels with 5 character skill slots.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if game is active (g_dwGameState != 0), exit if inactive\n2. Call FUN_6fb62880 to get current skill handle\n3. Initialize UI coordinate arrays to 0x50 (80 decimal) for 5 slot positions\n4. Clear skill UI slot counter and reset screen Y offset mask\n5. Loop through 5 skill slot indices (0-4):\n   a. Call Ordinal_10320 to get skill data for current slot\n   b. If skill exists, retrieve skill details via Ordinal_10947 and Ordinal_10966\n   c. Validate skill eligibility: check empty status, exclude class types 1 and 5\n   d. Call Ordinal_10955 to extract skill properties into local_8/local_c\n   e. Determine color code via Ordinal_10964 and Ordinal_10963\n   f. Handle screen Y coordinate adjustment when slot >= 4 (vertical scrolling)\n   g. Call ConfigureKeyBindingDisplay to populate UI with skill info\n   h. Store position, Y coordinate, and render data in global UI arrays\n   i. Update slot counter and increment position by 0x30 pixels\n   j. Increment slot index for next iteration\n\nParameters: (none)\n\nReturns: void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Screen Y adjustment only occurs when dwMaxY exceeds prior values\n- Slot type 1 and 5 are excluded from processing\n- Only processes 5 slots maximum per loop iteration\n- Return value from Ordinal_10964 == 6 yields color 0x02, else yields 0x04\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x50 (80): Initial X position for each slot display\n- 0x30 (48): Pixel spacing between consecutive slots\n- 0x56 (86): Screen height offset from display top\n- 0xffffff00: Bitmask to clear lower byte of slot counter\n- 0xd8 (216): Offset in slot data for first validation flag\n- 0xec (236): Offset in slot data for second validation flag\n- 0xd4 (212): Offset for slot comparison field\n- 0x35 (53): Offset for slot class field\n- 0xff: Bitmask for slot index extraction\n\nRelated Functions:\n- ConfigureKeyBindingDisplay: Render skill binding UI at po