      "comment": "Handles skill button click events and updates client skill state\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Iterate through all available skill slots (array from 0x6fbfc920 to 0x6fbfca10)\n2. For each slot, read cursor position via FUN_6fb8f680() and FUN_6fb8f690()\n3. Verify cursor is within skill panel bounds:\n   - Check X coordinate within [base_x, base_x + 0x30]\n   - Check Y coordinate within [base_y - 0x30, base_y]\n4. If cursor over current skill (param_1):\n   - Clear any previously selected skill in that slot (set to -1)\n   - Send unselect packet (0x51) with skill index 0xffff\n5. Set new skill state based on game state (0x6fbfce18):\n   - If game state == 0: set skill state to 0\n   - Otherwise: set skill state to 1\n6. Read skill icon ID from slot offset 0x1e0 and store in skill array\n7. Read skill cooldown from slot offset 0x2d0 and store in cooldown array\n8. Send select packet (0x51) with skill ID and state flag (0x8000 if state != 0)\n9. Check for skill conflicts: iterate slots 0-0xffff\n10. If another slot has same skill ID and cooldown:\n    - Mark conflicting slot as inactive (set arrays to -1)\n    - Send conflict clear packet (0x51) with 0xffff\n11. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\nIMPLICIT ECX (ECX) - nSkillIndex - Zero-based skill slot index (0-0xffff)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Magic number 0x51: Server packet type for skill changes\n- Packet format: (nSkillIndex << 16) | nSkillIconId for select, 0xffff for unselect\n- Conflict resolution: Deselects duplicate skills in same category/cooldown\n- State flag 0x8000 added when game state != 0\n- Note: Function uses SSA temporaries (iVar1-4, uVar5, bVar6) optimized away in decompilation\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset | Size | Field Name           | Type     | Description\n0x00   | 4    | baseX                | int      | Skill panel X coordinate\n0x78   | 4    | skillIconId          | int      | Icon ID from offset 0x1e0\n0xf0   | 4    | baseY                | int      | Skill panel Y coordinate\n0x1e0  | 4    | skillIconId          | int      | Icon ID value\n0x2d0  | 4    | skillCooldown        | int      | Cooldown value",
      "tags": ["PARAM_1"]
    },
