      "comment": "Initialize Spinner UI object instance\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Setup SEH exception handling frame\n2. Set virtual method table pointer to FUN_6fba9424 \n3. Allocate 0x54 (84) bytes from Storm heap via Ordinal_401\n4. If allocation fails, set spinner data pointer to NULL\n5. If successful, call InitializeSpinner to configure with parameters\n6. Store initialized spinner pointer at object offset +0x8\n7. Restore exception handling context\n8. Return this pointer\n\nParameters:\npThis (void *) - IMPLICIT, Spinner object pointer via ECX register\nnItemIndex (int) - Item or slot index identifier\nnItemType (int) - Item classification type value  \ndwFlags (dword) - Configuration/behavior flags\ndwUnknown (dword) - Additional config parameter\n\nReturns:\nvoid * - Pointer to initialized Spinner object (this)\n\nSpecial Cases:\nMemory allocation failure leaves NULL at offset +0x8. Uses SEH for safe exception handling.",
