      "comment": "Cleanup slot arrays and validation state during shutdown\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Release automap handle if allocated (0x6fbfcfe0)\n2. Traverse first item linked list (g_pFirstItemList), send UI clear commands (0x609, 0x60a, 0x688)\n3. Traverse second item linked list (g_pSecondItemList), send UI clear commands (0x609, 0x60a, 0x688, 0x6de)\n4. Close active dialog window (g_dwDialogState)\n5. Invoke cleanup callback via function pointer at g_pCallbackFunction with param 1\n6. Clear validation error flags (g_dwValidationError1, g_dwValidationError2, g_dwValidationError3)\n7. Call CopyConfigurationData(NULL) to reset config\n8. Count items in first slot array (g_pSlotList1Head), verify count matches g_nSlotCount1\n9. Clear first slot array pointer\n10. Count items in second slot array (g_pSlotList2Head), verify count matches g_nSlotCount2\n11. If counts mismatch, report error via Ordinal_10023 and terminate\n12. Call FUN_6fb549d0 with slot data structure reference\n13. Clear cleanup flag (g_dwCleanupFlag)\n\nParameters:\n(none) - operates on global state\n\nReturns:\nvoid - may terminate process on validation failure\n\nSpecial Cases:\nSlot list validation: Function counts linked list items and compares to expected count. Mismatch triggers immediate error reporting and process termination via Ordinal_10023 (assertion/error handler) and FUN_6fb9a10f (exit).\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x609 - UI clear item slot 1\n0x60a - UI clear item slot 2\n0x688 - UI finalize item slots\n0x6de - UI finalize second item slots\n0x6ad - UI clear slot element\n0x6b0 - UI finalize slot\n0x6c7 - Error line number from source",
