      "comment": "ProcessKeyBindingAndGameState - Processes key binding state and manages game state execution with timing throttle.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if key binding command 7 is currently active\n2. If active and matches the cache node's key, skip processing\n3. Reset frame counter\n4. Check elapsed time since last update (100ms throttle)\n5. If throttle elapsed, execute game state and insert cache node\n6. Otherwise insert cache node immediately and clear processing flag\n\nParameters:\n  pCacheNode - Pointer to cache node structure containing key binding info\n\nReturns: void",
