      "comment": "Iterate item list and send skill notification to each item.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if pItemList is NULL, exit if so\n2. Loop through linked list of items starting at pItemList\n3. Load next item pointer from offset +4 in current item\n4. Send skill notification 0x609 (process item cleanup)\n5. Send skill notification 0x60a (post-cleanup hook)\n6. Continue until next item pointer is NULL\n7. Return void\n\nParameters:\n- pItemList (int *): Pointer to first item in linked list, or NULL. Each item has next pointer at offset +4.\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If pItemList is NULL, function returns immediately without processing\n- Called during game state cleanup before item list is freed\n- Notifications allow item-specific cleanup logic via ordinal calls\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x609 (1545): Skill ID for item cleanup notification\n- 0x60a (1546): Skill ID for item cleanup post-hook",
