      "comment": "Initialize message queue based on game mode state transition.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if nGameMode equals 0:\n   - If game state (g_dwGameInitState) equals 1, reset state to 0 and queue 7 messages from g_aMessageQueue for processing\n   - Call Ordinal_10027 (get window handle), then ProcessMessageArray to dispatch messages\n2. Else if nGameMode equals 1 AND game state equals 0:\n   - Set state to 1 to mark initialization in progress\n   - Timestamp current tick via GetTickCount, store in g_dwLastMessageProcessTime\n   - Queue 7 messages from g_aMessageQueue for entry processing\n   - Call Ordinal_10027 for window handle, then ProcessMessageEntryArray to dispatch\n\nParameters:\nnGameMode: Game mode indicator (0 = shutdown, 1 = startup)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\nState machine prevents re-entrancy: only processes when transitioning between states 0 and 1. If already in target state, returns immediately.",
