      "instructions": ["0x860E0|SUB|ESP, 0x340", "0x860E6|PUSH|ESI", "0x860E7|XOR|ESI, ESI", "0x860E9|CMP|word ptr [0x6fbfcf70], SI", "0x860F0|JZ|0x6fb563f7", "0x860F6|PUSH|EBX", "0x860F7|PUSH|EBP", "0x860F8|PUSH|EDI", "0x860F9|MOV|ECX, 0xd", "0x860FE|CALL|0x6fb99a02", "0x86103|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [0x6fbfcf6c]", "0x86109|MOV|ECX, 0x13", "0x8610E|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x2c], EAX", "0x86112|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x14], EBX", "0x86116|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x28], 0x14"],
      "comment": "Render all inventory slots with item names, handling multi-row layout based on scroll mode.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if slot list is empty (g_nSlotCount1) and return if so\n2. Initialize UI parameters: base Y offset (0x14 or 0x5f), max 15 items per column\n3. Determine scroll mode (GetScrollWindowMode): mode 2 uses right-half screen, mode 1 is narrow\n4. Iterate each slot in linked list (g_pSlotList1Head)\n5. For each slot, loop 6 sub-items (inventory structure has 6 elements)\n6. If sub-item is valid and within display bounds, render item text\n7. Build item name string (strcpy/strlen), trim to fit width constraint (0x137 chars max)\n8. Call FUN_6fb92980 to render text at calculated X,Y position\n9. Call Ordinal_10117 to render item icon/marker at slot position\n10. After all items rendered, cleanup expired slots using GetTickCount\n11. For each slot with timestamp in past, call Ordinal_10043 to deallocate 6 items + slot\n\nParameters: none (uses globals: g_nSlotCount1, g_pSlotList1Head, g_dwScreenWidth)\n\nReturns: void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Slot value 0 indicates empty item - skip rendering for that slot\n- Text overflow handled by trimming from end when string >= 0x137 width\n- Handles two scroll modes: full width (mode 0/3) and half-width (modes 1/2)\n- Linked list may modify head during iteration via Ordinal_10043 deallocation\n- Expired slots checked against current GetTickCount value\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x14 - Default Y base offset (20px)\n0x5f - Alternate Y offset for confirmation mode (95px)\n0x13 - Max item rows per column (19)\n0xf - Column width in pixels (15)\n0x6 - Number of sub-items per slot\n0x137 - Max character width before truncation (311px)\n0x22 - Offset to next slot pointer in linked list structure\n0x1a - Offset to decoration/icon data in slot structure\n0x1e - Offset to expiration timestamp in slot structure\n0x6ad, 0x6b0 - Ordinal_10043 magic arguments (resource deallocation IDs)",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_StatList", "PROP_LARGE", "MOD_UI", "STRUCT_Path", "STRUCT_Inventory", "SRC_text.cpp", "STRUCT_Skill", "PARAM_0", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
