      "instructions": ["0x865B0|SUB|ESP, 0x10", "0x865B3|PUSH|EBX", "0x865B4|PUSH|EBP", "0x865B5|PUSH|ESI", "0x865B6|PUSH|EDI", "0x865B7|MOV|EBP, EDX", "0x865B9|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x865BB|PUSH|0x0", "0x865BD|PUSH|0xcfd", "0x865C2|MOV|EDX, 0x6fbc78a8", "0x865C7|MOV|ECX, 0x26", "0x865CC|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x20], EBP", "0x865D0|CALL|0x6fb99a98", "0x865D5|MOV|EBX, EAX", "0x865D7|MOV|ECX, 0x9"],
      "comment": "Allocates and initializes a slot object, validates linked list integrity, and notifies callbacks.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Allocate slot structure (0xcfd bytes) via Ordinal_10042\n2. Zero-initialize 10 dwords + 1 word in slot\n3. Set expiration timeout to current time + 10 seconds (0x2710)\n4. Retrieve screen geometry via Ordinal_10199, limit max slots to 6\n5. Copy slot data from input array, validate count doesn't exceed max\n6. Store parameter flags (dwFlags & 0xff) at offset 0x1a\n7. If g_pSlotList1Head exists: walk linked list via offset 0x22, validate list count matches g_nSlotCount1\n8. Link new slot as tail node in list\n9. Call FUN_6fb567f0 for slot initialization\n10. Increment global g_nSlotCount1\n11. Calculate total slot utilization by summing all slot size fields (offset 0x18)\n12. If total > 0x12 (18): remove first slot and reset count\n13. Call FUN_6fb8d210 for UI update (6 slots)\n14. Query FUN_6fb5d340(0x18) for callback trigger\n15. If callback active via g_pCallbackFunction, iterate slot list and invoke callback at offset 0x30 with slot fields\n\nParameters:\nIMPLICIT ECX dwSlotTypeId - Slot type identifier (passes to Ordinal_10042)\nIMPLICIT EDX dwFlags - Slot flags (stored at offset 0x1a, masked 0xff)\n\nReturns:\nvoid (slot object pointer remains in structure globals g_pSlotList1Head, g_slotDataStructure)\n\nStructure Layout (Slot Object):\nOffset | Size | Field Name          | Type      | Description\n0x00   | 10*4 | reserved            | uint[10]  | Storage for parsed data\n0x28   | 1*2  | nMaxCount           | ushort    | Max slot entries (capped at 6)\n0x2a   | 2    | padding             | word      | Alignment padding\n0x2c   | 1*4  | dwFlags             | uint      | Flags parameter\n0x30   | 1*4  | dwExpireTime        | uint      | Tick count + 10 seconds\n0x34   | 4    | dwNextNode          | uint      | Linked list next pointer (offset 0x22)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Slot count validation fails: calls Ordinal_10023 error handler, terminates via FUN_6fb9a10f(-1)\n- Total utilization overflow (>0x12): removes first slot and resets counter\n- No callback registered: skips callback invocation block",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "MOD_UI", "STRUCT_Path", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_2", "SRC_text.cpp", "STRUCT_Skill", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
