      "comment": "Shuts down game resources and clears resource handles.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if g_pResourceHandle is allocated (non-zero)\n2. If allocated, call FUN_6fb8d0c0(g_pResourceHandle) to shut down resource\n3. If shutdown returns non-zero status, call FUN_6fb8d670(nResourceResult, 0, 0, 4) to cleanup additional resources\n4. Clear g_pResourceHandle to NULL\n5. Clear g_dwCleanupFlag to 0\n6. Return\n\nParameters:\n  (none)\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - If g_pResourceHandle is NULL, both globals are still cleared but no shutdown calls made\n  - If FUN_6fb8d0c0 returns 0, secondary cleanup is skipped\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x4 - fourth parameter to cleanup function (possibly cleanup flags or resource type)\n  0x0 - parameters to cleanup function (null/no-op values)\n\nGlobal Variables:\n  g_pResourceHandle @ 0x6fbfd004 - Resource handle pointer\n  g_dwCleanupFlag @ 0x6fbfcfd3 - Cleanup state flag\n\nRelated Functions:\n  - RenderGameFrame() - Calls this function during game shutdown\n  - FUN_6fb8d0c0() - Resource shutdown handler\n  - FUN_6fb8d670() - Secondary resource cleanup",
