      "comment": "Retrieves validated game resource handle based on initialization state\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if resource validation flag (g_bResourceValidationFlag) is set\n   - If true: call FUN_6fb60e10 with stored resource handle (g_pStoredResourceHandle) and type flag 1, return result\n2. Check if game initialization required flag (g_bGameInitRequired) is set\n   - If true: call FUN_6fb60e10 with game init resource handle (g_dwGameInitResourceHandle) and type flag 2, return result\n3. If neither condition true: return NULL\n\nParameters:\n(none)\n\nReturns:\nPointer to validated resource handle on success (int *), NULL if neither validation flag set\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Returns NULL (0x0) if neither resource validation flag nor game init required flag is set\n- Type flags (1, 2) distinguish between resource validation and game init validation paths\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x1 - Resource validation type flag for FUN_6fb60e10 first call\n0x2 - Game initialization type flag for FUN_6fb60e10 second call",
