      "comment": "Process slot display data by type and format Unicode representation\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize local Unicode buffers (aUnicodeBuffer, aUStack_2d4, aUStack_284, aUStack_2b4)\n2. Extract attribute name from pSlot+0x08 and calculate length\n3. If length exceeds 0x0E bytes, clear flag at pSlot+0x17\n4. Dispatch on slot type (pSlot+0x01): 0=class, 1=race, 2=title, 3=runeset, 4=specialization, 5=quest, 6=skill, 7=rosterfield, 8=special, 9=hidden, 0x0A=conditional, 0x0B=stringref, 0x0D=attribute, 0x0F=customstr, 0x10=reserved\n5. For each type, validate total string length does not exceed 0x131 bytes, else error\n6. If valid, copy/convert/concatenate strings via Unicode::strcpy/strcat\n7. Convert result to sprintf format if needed (types 2,3,0x0F)\n8. For roster field (type 7), load player unit data and process via ProcessSlotTextWrapping\n9. Create final slot object via CreateSlotObject with formatted display string\n\nParameters:\n- pSlot (PlayerSlotData *): Slot record containing type, attribute name, flags, values. IMPLICIT ECX register param\n\nReturns:\n- void: Function modifies global state and creates UI slot object\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Type 6: String length validation with 0xe40/0xe3f magic values for error conditions\n- Type 7: Conditional ProcessSlotTextWrapping call if iStack_2c8 field set (roster filter active)\n- Null player unit (type 7): Uses g_pdwBasePropertyString as fallback\n- String overflow: Triggers Ordinal_10023 error (logs failure), calls FUN_6fb9a10f(0xffffffff) exit\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x0E: Maximum attribute name length before flag clear\n- 0x103: Maximum single string length (259 bytes)\n- 0x131: Maximum total buffer length (305 bytes)\n- 0x132: Buffer size constant (306 bytes)\n- 0x10: Max bytes for Unicode string conversion\n- 0xffbd: Unicode offset adjustment for type 6 subtype 1\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FindPlayerNodeById() - Loads player unit by ID (type 7)\n- GetRosterFieldAt0x66() - Reads player property data pointer\n- CreateSlotObject() - Finalizes and displays UI element\n- ProcessSlotTextWrapping() - Applies text wrapping to formatted string\n- Ordinal_10004() - Clears/initializes buffer state\n- Ordinal_10023() - Logs debug/error messages\n- Ordinal_10582,10626,10668() - Validate skill/item property availability\n",
