      "comment": "Search for quest ID in global array and execute quest handling if found.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Determine search range based on quest ID threshold (g_wQuestListStart = 100)\n   - If wQuestId < g_wQuestListStart: search indices 0-99 (nIndex=0, nEnd=100)\n   - Otherwise: search indices 100 to g_dwQuestListEnd\n2. Iterate through g_awQuestIdList starting at nIndex, comparing each element with wQuestId\n3. If match found: call Ordinal_10004 (Storm_DBGMessage) with ECX=0xe8c and return\n4. If no match after loop: call Ordinal_10004 (Storm_DBGMessage) with ECX=0xe8c and return (JMP not RET)\n\nParameters:\n- wQuestId: Quest identifier to search for\n\nReturns:\n- void (always calls Ordinal_10004 before returning)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Array search is split into two ranges based on g_wQuestListStart threshold\n- Always executes Ordinal_10004 regardless of search result (debug logging call)\n- No direct return value; side effects via Ordinal_10004 call",
