      "instructions": ["0x88810|PUSH|EBX", "0x88811|XOR|ECX, ECX", "0x88813|CALL|0x6fae5be0", "0x88818|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbfcf30]", "0x8881D|XOR|EBX, EBX", "0x8881F|CMP|EAX, EBX", "0x88821|JZ|0x6fb58876", "0x88823|PUSH|EBP", "0x88824|PUSH|ESI", "0x88825|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [EAX]", "0x88827|MOV|EBP, EAX", "0x88829|CMP|ESI, EBX", "0x8882B|JZ|0x6fb5885c", "0x8882D|PUSH|EDI", "0x8882E|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESI]"],
      "comment": "Cleanup and reset global game state, reset item list, resource handles, and process pending messages.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize configuration data by calling CopyConfigurationData\n2. If g_pFirstItemList exists, iterate linked item list (offset +0x4 is next pointer):\n   a. For each item, call Ordinal_10043 with 0x609 (clear item flag)\n   b. Call Ordinal_10043 with 0x60a (secondary item clear)\n   c. Move to next item via ESI = ESI+4\n3. After loop, call Ordinal_10043 with 0x688 (final item list cleanup)\n4. Set g_pFirstItemList to NULL\n5. If g_pResourceHandle exists, call FUN_6fb8d0c0 to get resource info\n6. If resource info valid, call FUN_6fb8d670 with parameters (resource, 0, 0, 4)\n7. Set g_pResourceHandle to NULL\n8. Clear g_dwCleanupFlag (set to 0)\n9. If g_dwGameInitState == 1, set queue size to 7 and call ProcessMessageArray with hWnd\n10. Set g_dwGameInitState to 0\n11. If g_bPacketPending set, send packet with type 0x31 and config word data\n12. Clear g_bPacketPending flag\n\nParameters: None\n\nReturns: void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Item list iteration uses offset +0x4 for linked list traversal (null terminator at 0)\n- Resource handle cleanup only proceeds if initial validity check passes\n- Message processing only if game init state is exactly 1\n- Multiple ordinal calls with fixed parameters indicate flag/state clearing operations",
