      "comment": "HandleInventoryPanelClick - Handles click events on the inventory panel within screen bounds.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract click Y position (upper 16 bits of offset 0xC) and X position (lower 16 bits)\n2. Verify click is within valid screen region (Y < height-48, X < width/2)\n3. Trigger UI state change (0x10, mode 2)\n4. Report and clear any pending validation errors (up to 3)\n5. Mark panel as clicked and reset state\n6. Insert into cache and initialize targeting system\n\nParameters:\n  pPanel - Pointer to panel structure containing click coordinates at offset 0xC\n\nReturns: void",
