      "comment": "Renders UI menu screen with 4 options and displays validation status.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Clear screen region at (UIXOffset, UIYOffset - 224) size (width/2 x height-48)\n2. If validation error flag is clear, write validation error file using wsprintfA and ConcatenatePathAndWriteFile\n3. Initialize slot data array (18 dwords) with zeros\n4. Render 4 menu options at different screen coordinates:\n   - Option 0: (UIXOffset, UIYOffset - 109)\n   - Option 1: (UIXOffset + 256, UIYOffset - 109)\n   - Option 2: (UIXOffset, UIYOffset - 49)\n   - Option 3: (UIXOffset + 256, UIYOffset - 49)\n5. Display additional element (option 10) at (UIXOffset + 277, UIYOffset - 61)\n\nParameters:\nNone - accesses global UI state (g_dwUIXOffset, g_dwUIYOffset, g_dwScreenWidth, g_dwScreenHeight, g_dwValidationError3)\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\nNote: Function uses 1 stack-allocated temporary (pointer to slot data array) optimized away during compilation.\nOrdinal_10055 = Fog.dll ClearRect - Clear screen region\nOrdinal_10072 = Fog.dll DrawText - Render text/menu elements\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x12 (18) - Element count for slot data array\n0x30 (48) - Screen height offset for clear region\n0xe0 (224) - Screen height offset for clear region top\n0x6d (109) - Y coordinate offset for options\n0x31 (49) - Y coordinate offset for options\n0x100 (256) - X coordinate offset for options\n0x115 (277) - X coordinate offset for additional element\n0x3d (61) - Y coordinate offset for additional element\n-1 / 0xffffffff - Color parameter (white)\n0x5 - Rendering flag (depth/priority)",
