      "comment": "Process game mode configuration from a structured data packet.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if word at offset +1 in pModeData equals 4 (mode identifier)\n2. If not 4, skip processing and return immediately\n3. If match, advance pointer by 3 bytes to reach data payload\n4. Copy dword at offset 0 to g_dwGameTypeData\n5. Copy dword at offset 4 to g_dwDifficultyData\n6. Set g_dwExpansionMode to 0 (disable expansion)\n7. Copy dword at offset 8 to g_dwGameClassData\n\nParameters:\n- pModeData (int/pointer): Address of game mode configuration packet\n  Contains word identifier at +1, followed by mode data\n\nReturns:\n- void: No return value, modifies global game configuration\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If word at +1 != 4, function returns without modifying globals\n- Expansion mode is unconditionally cleared when processing",
