      "comment": "Transition game state to menu and record timestamp.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Send transition packet (0x4f) with 2 as parameter count\n2. Check if game mode state (g_dwGameModeState) is already 7\n3. If not 7:\n   a. Set inventory tab to 1 (g_dwCurrentInventoryTab = 1)\n   b. Record current tick count to g_dwLastStateChangeTime via GetTickCount()\n   c. Set game mode state to 7 (STATE_MENU)\n4. Return\n\nParameters:\n(none - __stdcall takes no parameters)\n\nReturns:\n(void)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x4f - Menu transition packet type\n0x7 - STATE_MENU (game mode state value)\n0x1 - Inventory tab 1 (reset to default)\n\nSpecial Cases:\nIf state already at 7, skips state transition to avoid redundant initialization. GetTickCount() provides system tick counter for timing reference.",
