      "comment": "FinalizeGameEntryAndNotifyServer - Completes game entry sequence and notifies server client is ready.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize game object properties for entry mode (type=2)\n2. Close any open dialog and cleanup UI state\n3. Clear dialog state pointer\n4. Set game mode state to 7 (in-game)\n5. Send packet 0x4f to server signaling client is ready\n6. Record timestamp for game ready timeout tracking\n\nReturns: void",
