      "comment": "CloseDialogAndWaitForGameReady - Closes the current dialog and transitions to game ready waiting state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize game object properties with default values\n2. Close the active dialog and cleanup resources\n3. Clear the dialog state pointer\n4. Set game mode state to 7 (waiting for game ready)\n5. Record current tick count for timeout tracking\n6. Send packet 0x4F to notify server of state change\n\nReturns: void",
