      "comment": "Send game state change packet and update local game mode state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Push two zero parameters onto stack\n2. Set EDX to 0x7 (data flag)\n3. Set CL to 0x4f (packet type: game state change)\n4. Call SendPackedData with: CL=packet type, EDX=flags, stack params=0,0\n5. Update g_dwGameModeState to 3 (in-game/playing state)\n6. Return\n\nParameters:\n(none)\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x4f (79 decimal) - Game state change packet type\n- 0x7 - SendPackedData flag bitmask (priority/delivery flags)\n- 0x3 - Game mode state enumeration (in-game/playing)\n\nGlobal Data References:\n- g_dwGameModeState - Updated to 0x3 after packet sent",
