      "instructions": ["0x89EC0|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbfd05c]", "0x89EC5|PUSH|ESI", "0x89EC6|CMP|EAX, 0x4", "0x89EC9|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x89ECB|JZ|0x6fb59f19", "0x89ECD|CMP|EAX, 0x5", "0x89ED0|JZ|0x6fb59f19", "0x89ED2|CMP|EAX, 0x6", "0x89ED5|JZ|0x6fb59f19", "0x89ED7|PUSH|0xe", "0x89ED9|CALL|0x6fb62880", "0x89EDE|PUSH|EAX", "0x89EDF|CALL|0x6fb9826c", "0x89EE4|CMP|ESI, EAX", "0x89EE6|JC|0x6fb59f00"],
      "comment": "Send game mode state transition packet to server based on current game state\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load current game mode state from g_dwGameModeState (address 0x6fbfd05c)\n2. Check if game mode is in active state (4, 5, or 6)\n3. If NOT in active mode:\n   a. Call FUN_6fb62880() to retrieve mode validation value\n   b. Pass value with constant 0xe to Ordinal_10519 for flag processing\n   c. Store returned flag in g_dwUnknownFlag2 (address 0x6fbfd050)\n   d. Compare result against dwValue parameter using carry flag\n   e. If flag value <= dwValue: send standard packet type 0x4f/8 with flag value split into 16-bit parts\n   f. Else: use dwValue instead, save to g_dwUnknownFlag2, send packet with dwValue split into 16-bit parts\n4. Else (in active modes 4, 5, or 6):\n   a. Send transition packet type 0x4f/7 with zero parameters\n   b. Reset g_dwGameModeState to 3 to exit active mode\n5. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\n- dwValue: Comparison threshold value for mode state validation\n\nReturns:\n- void: Function performs side effects (global state modification, packet transmission)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Active game modes (4, 5, 6) bypass validation and trigger immediate transition\n- 16-bit parameter splitting (SHR 0x10) indicates protocol expects paired 16-bit values\n- Constant 0xe passed to Ordinal_10519 is magic number for mode configuration\n- Magic number 0x4f is packet type identifier for game mode state messages\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x4f: Packet type for game mode messages\n- 0xe: Mode validation configuration constant\n- 0x10: Bit shift for high 16-bit extraction\n- Game modes: 3=inactive, 4/5/6=active gameplay, others=transitional",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_1"]
    },
