      "comment": "Validates if game ready state timeout has elapsed.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if g_dwGameModeState equals 7 (game ready mode)\n2. If not in ready mode, return 0 (false)\n3. If g_dwGameReadyTimeout is -1 (undefined), return 1 (true)\n4. Get current system tick count via GetTickCount()\n5. Add 30000 milliseconds (30 seconds) to the start timeout value\n6. Compare timeout deadline against current time\n7. If time has not elapsed (timeout deadline > current time), return 1\n8. If timeout elapsed, initialize UI, reset game objects, reset state flags\n9. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n(none)\n\nReturns:\n1 if game mode is 7 or timeout has elapsed\n0 if game mode is not 7\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Timeout of -1 (value 0xFFFFFFFF) is treated as indefinite (no timeout)\n- Magic number 30000 = 30 second timeout duration in milliseconds\n- After timeout, resets g_dwGameModeState to 0",
