      "comment": "Initialize the complete UI system including panels, resources, and event handlers for the game interface.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load inventory panel graphics assets and initialize UI element state\n2. Configure text display parameters and screen panel layouts\n3. Initialize hireable NPC icons and update game state twice\n4. Load automap resources and UI slider configuration\n5. Initialize inventory slot counters and UI inventory grid rows (6 rows cleared)\n6. Zero-initialize store UI rows (4 rows) and all UI resource buffer (38 dwords)\n7. Load mini panel graphics from Diablo II data via Ordinal_423 (Storm.dll file loader)\n8. If mini panel load fails (result == 0 or size == 0), trigger error event 0x15\n9. Trigger initialization event 0x22\n10. Load cursor graphics (pentspin, focus16, menu box) via formatted path strings with DATA_GLOBAL prefix\n11. Apply cache settings and finalize UI configuration\n12. Load and apply keyboard bindings and menu settings\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid - initializes global UI system state\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Mini panel load failure triggers error recovery via FUN_6fb5d370(0x15, 2, 0)\n- Path strings constructed using wsprintfA with format: s_UI_CURSOR_* templates\n- UI buffer cleared using REP STOSD: 38 dwords * 4 bytes = 152 bytes total\n- All cursor and panel resource handles stored in global pointers for rendering\n- Event system IDs: 0x15 (error), 0x22 (init)\n\nGlobal Variables:\n- g_dwUIInventoryRow0-5: Inventory UI panel row state (6 dwords)\n- g_dwUIStoreRow0-3: Store interface row state (4 dwords)\n- g_dwUIResourceBuffer: UI element resource buffer pointer (38 dwords, 152 bytes)\n- g_dwCursorPentspinHandle: Pentspin cursor handle\n- g_dwCursorFocus16Handle: Focus cursor handle\n- g_dwCursorMenuBoxHandle: Menu box graphics handle",
