      "comment": "Reinitialize entire game session and UI framework after critical event.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize viewport tracking (FUN_6fb5d370)\n2. Clear validation state for all data structures\n3. Validate player skill slots (if FUN_6fb62880 returns non-zero)\n   - Clear error state for individual slots\n4. Call Storm RandSeed ordinal (Ordinal_10116) to reinitialize seed\n5. Cleanup slot arrays and validation tracking\n6. Cleanup UI elements and active slots\n7. Validate and clear pointers in current game state\n8. Clear screen configuration errors\n9. Clear validation error array\n10. Shutdown game session and dialog references\n11. Cleanup automap sprite system\n12. Reinitialize core game state via 3 helper functions\n13. Flush all validation error flags\n14. Clear stale validation errors\n15. Process dialog iteration and updates\n16. Report pending UI slider path errors\n17. Check and report 5 persistent error codes:\n    - Player slot error 1 (g_dwPlayerSlotError1)\n    - Player slot error 2 (g_dwPlayerSlotError2)\n    - Panel error (g_dwPanelError)\n    - UI error (g_dwUIError)\n    - Game state error (g_dwGameStateError)\n18. Disable panel message state\n19. Reinitialize panels and clear validation errors\n20. Report any pending UI menu errors\n21. Jump to main event loop (0x6fb2aa40)\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid (Function does not return in normal control flow - ends with JMP to main loop)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Skill slot validation only performed if FUN_6fb62880() returns non-zero\n- Function loops through 5 error code locations, clearing each after reporting\n- JMP at end transfers control to main event loop, not RET\n- Error codes stored in global dword variables (g_dw*Error*)\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n- 0x0: Zero value for clearing error codes and initializing state\n- 0x1: Enable flag passed to FUN_6fb5d370 (viewport tracking)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FUN_6fb5d370: Initialize viewport and tracking state\n- FUN_6fb62880: Validate skill slots, returns status\n- InitializeGameState: Reinitialize core game state\n- ClearValidationErrorsAndInitializeData: Clear and reinit data structures",
