      "comment": "Initialize game unit configuration and validate resource files based on unit class type.\n\nNote: Function uses 6 SSA-optimized temporaries (pUVar5, iVar2, sVar3, iVar4, uVar1) that cannot be renamed - these are compiler-generated intermediate values.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Decrement global stack depth counter (g_nStackDepth -= 0x10)\n2. Validate input: return if pUnit is NULL\n3. Call FUN_6fb638b0(pUnit) - unit initialization\n4. Determine unit class type via Ordinal_10695:\n   - 4 -> dwUnitClass = 3 (Fire)\n   - 5 -> dwUnitClass = 2 (Cold)\n   - 6 -> dwUnitClass = 9 (Lightning)\n   - 7 -> dwUnitClass = 4 (Poison)\n   - 8 -> dwUnitClass = 8 (Physical)\n   - Other -> Check resource flags 0x800 (line 0x594) and 0x400000 (line 0x599), set dwUnitClass = 5 if found\n5. Validate unit stat at [param_1[1] + 0x2a] is not null and [param_1[1] + 0x80] != 0x2067656c\n   - If validation fails, force dwUnitClass = 4\n6. Initialize Unicode string buffer (local_5fe) with 254 Unicode chars (128 bytes cleared)\n7. If Ordinal_10751(pUnit) == 4 (special path):\n   a. Fetch unit stat value via Ordinal_10519(pUnit, 0xe)\n   b. Format stat value via wsprintfA with format template (&g_szFormatTemplate)\n   c. Convert ANSI format to Unicode via win2Unicode\n   d. Build result string via strcpy/strcat chain\n   e. If nInitType == 0: Call Ordinal_10129(g_nStackDepth, dwUnitClass, 1) and return\n   f. If nMaxPathSize > 0: Build localization config string (dwUnitClass formatted with &g_szLocalizationConfig)\n   g. Validate final string length < nMaxPathSize, error if exceeds\n8. Otherwise (normal path):\n   a. Initialize alternate Unicode buffer (aUStack_4fe) with 254 chars\n   b. Call LoadGameConfiguration(0x100, unaff_EDI) - load resource config\n   c. If nInitType == 0: Call Ordinal_10129(g_nStackDepth, dwUnitClass, 1) and return\n   d. If sStack_500 > 0: Append localization config string to output\n   e. Validate final string length < nMaxPathSize, error if exceeds\n9. Final cleanup: strcpy to output buffer\n\nParameters:\n- pUnit (ECX): UnitAny * - Pointer to unit structure to configure\n- nInitType (EDX): dword - Initialization type (0 = early exit path, other = full init)\n- nMaxPathSize (Stack[0x4]): dword - Maximum path/string buffer size for validation\n\nReturns:\n- void (function returns after processing)\n- Side effects: Modifies global g_nStackDepth, may call FUN_6fb9a10f(0xffffffff) on validation error\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Magic hex constants: 0x800 (resource flag type), 0x400000 (resource flag alternate), 0x2067656c (stat comparison)\n- Ordinal dependencies: Ordinal_10695 (get unit class), Ordinal_10751 (check special path), Ordinal_10519 (fetch stat)\n- Early return when nInitType == 0 (optimization path)\n- String length validation prevents buffer overflow\n\nOrdinal Functions:\n- Ordinal_10695(pUnit) - GetUnitClass\n- Ordinal_10707(pUnit, nFlag, nLine, szSourceFile) - CheckResourceFlag\n- Ordinal_10600(nUnitIndex) - GetUnitData\n- Ordinal_10751(pUnit) - GetSpecialClassType\n- Ordinal_10519(pUnit, nStat) - GetUnitStat\n- Ordinal_10129(nStackDepth, dwClass, nFlag) - RegisterGameConfig\n- Ordinal_10004() - ClearBuffer\n- Ordinal_10023(szMsg, szFile, nLine) - AssertionFailed",
