      "instructions": ["0x8B7D0|SUB|ESP, 0x5c", "0x8B7D3|MOV|EDX, dword ptr [ECX]", "0x8B7D5|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ECX + 0x8]", "0x8B7D8|PUSH|EBX", "0x8B7D9|PUSH|EBP", "0x8B7DA|MOV|EBP, dword ptr [ECX + 0x4]", "0x8B7DD|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ECX + 0xc]", "0x8B7E0|SUB|EAX, EDX", "0x8B7E2|SUB|ECX, EBP", "0x8B7E4|PUSH|ESI", "0x8B7E5|PUSH|EDI", "0x8B7E6|LEA|EBX, [EAX + EDX*0x1 + 0x1]", "0x8B7EA|LEA|EAX, [ECX + EBP*0x1 + 0x1]", "0x8B7EE|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x18], EAX", "0x8B7F2|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x1c], EBX"],
      "comment": "Render a grid overlay pattern on screen with borders and cell tiling.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize 18-element cell array with zeros and set menu box handle reference\n2. Calculate drawable dimensions: nMaxX = (pRect[2] - pRect[0]) + 1 + pRect[0], nHeight = (pRect[3] - pRect[1]) + 1 + pRect[1]\n3. Draw horizontal cells (stride 0xc) from nMinX+0xc to nMaxX-0xd with cell IDs (nCellIndex % 6) + 2 at Y=nMinY+0xc\n4. Draw offset horizontal cells from nMinX+0xd to nMaxX-0xd with cell IDs (nCellIndex % 6) + 0x10 at Y=nHeight+10\n5. Draw left vertical cells from Y=nMinY+0x16 to nHeight-1 (stride 0xc) with cell IDs (nCellIndex % 3) + 10 at X=nMinX-4\n6. Draw right vertical cells from Y=nMinY+0x18 to nHeight-1 (stride 0xc) with cell IDs (nCellIndex % 3) + 0xd at X=nMaxX-7\n7. Render 4 corner cells: (0) nMinX,nMinY+0xc, (1) nMaxX-0xc,nMinY+0xc, (8) nMinX,nHeight+1, (9) nMaxX-0xc,nHeight+1\n8. Return void\n\nParameters:\n  int * pRect - IMPLICIT ECX register; pointer to 4 DWORDs: [minX, minY, maxX, maxY] defining grid bounds\n\nReturns:\n  void - renders grid to screen via Ordinal_10072 calls\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  Cell IDs cycle using modulo to create repeating patterns\n  Magic number 0xc (12) is cell stride in pixels\n  Cell IDs 0-1 for top edge, 8-9 for bottom edge, 2-7 for horizontal cells, 10-15 for vertical cells\n\nStructure Layout:\n  pRect Points to Rectangle:\n  | Offset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description |\n  | 0      | 4    | minX       | int  | Left edge X coordinate |\n  | 4      | 4    | minY       | int  | Top edge Y coordinate |\n  | 8      | 4    | maxX       | int  | Right edge X coordinate |\n  | 12     | 4    | maxY       | int  | Bottom edge Y coordinate |\n\nRelated Functions:\n  - Ordinal_10072(pCellArray, x, y, color, unk1, unk2) - D2CLIENT cell rendering (5 calls per cell)",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Path", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "STRUCT_Skill", "STRUCT_Room2", "STRUCT_ItemData", "PARAM_1", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
