      "comment": "Initialize complete game UI and state on startup/reset.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize party UI frame layout and positioning\n2. Build string length lookup table for rendering\n3. Process skill tree slot allocations\n4. Configure skill UI state and panel colors\n5. Set inventory slot counters to starting values\n6. Initialize game UI state flags and modes\n7. Initialize unit state tracking\n8. Reset game state and clear validation error flags\n9. Initialize menu state (open/closed/active)\n10. Open hireling dialog window\n11. Calculate window border dimensions (1 = default)\n12. Configure always-run movement setting\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Called only once during initial UI setup\n- Must execute in specific order (dependencies between initializers)\n- Last call jumps to next initialization sequence\n\nRelated Functions:\n- InitializePartyUIFrames() - Party member display setup\n- InitializeGameUIState() - Core UI state initialization\n- ResetGameStateAndValidationErrors() - Clear previous session state\n- CalculateWindowBorders() - Viewport dimension calculation",
