      "comment": "UI_UpdateStatAllocationValue - Updates stat allocation UI values based on dialog state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get increment value from row 1 widget via virtual call at offset 0x2c\n2. Get current value from row 2 widget via virtual call at offset 0x30\n3. Calculate max stat value based on g_dwUIDialogState:\n   - State 4: Vitality (stat 0xF) from player\n   - State 5: Vitality + Stamina (stats 0xF + 0xE)\n   - State 7: Experience-based using guild flags and scaled XP\n   - Default: Stamina (stat 0xE)\n4. Apply operation based on EBP parameter:\n   - 1 (add): new = min(current + increment, maxStat)\n   - 2 (subtract): new = max(current - increment, 0)\n5. Update g_dwUIDialogReturnValue and row 2 widget\n\nReturns: void (updates globals directly)",
