      "comment": "Initialize UI buy/sell button panel configuration file.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if g_dwUIError global is zero (no prior error)\n2. If no error, build file path using wsprintfA with format string and DATA_GLOBAL constant\n3. Write formatted path to file using ConcatenatePathAndWriteFile\n4. Store result in g_dwUIError global\n5. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\n(none)\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Function skips initialization if g_dwUIError != 0 (error state already set)\n- File write failure stored in g_dwUIError for caller detection\n- Stack buffer szPathBuffer sized at 260 bytes (MAX_PATH on Windows)",
