      "comment": "Clear all UI store rows and invoke cleanup callbacks.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if g_dwUIStoreRow0 is non-zero\n2. If non-zero, call CloseDialogAndCleanup and reset g_dwUIStoreRow0 to 0\n3. Check if g_dwUIStoreRow1 is non-NULL\n4. If non-NULL, dereference and invoke callback function pointer with parameter 1, reset g_dwUIStoreRow1 to NULL\n5. Check if g_dwUIStoreRow2 is non-NULL\n6. If non-NULL, dereference and invoke callback function pointer with parameter 1, reset g_dwUIStoreRow2 to NULL\n7. Check if g_dwUIStoreRow3 is non-NULL\n8. If non-NULL, dereference and invoke callback function pointer with parameter 1, reset g_dwUIStoreRow3 to NULL\n9. Return\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Each row can be independently initialized before this function is called\n- Rows that are 0/NULL are skipped\n- Cleanup callbacks are invoked with parameter 1 (likely indicates cleanup mode)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- CloseDialogAndCleanup() - Dialog resource cleanup\n- ProcessGameStateHandler() - Calls this function for state transitions\n- ReinitializeGameSessionAndUI() - Calls this function on session reset",
