      "comment": "Initialize core game engine components including UI, graphics, and environmental settings.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if initialization flags are set (g_dwInitializationFlags != 0)\n2. If set, report any validation errors and clear error flags\n3. Initialize rendering (palette, viewport, color mappings)\n4. Initialize audio/environmental effects (weather, random seed)\n5. Initialize UI components (buttons, sliders, automap markers)\n6. Load cell files and cache rendering data\n7. Set rendering timeout deadline to 2000ms\n8. Clear all initialization state flags\n9. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\nvoid - No parameters. Uses global state variables: g_dwInitializationFlags, g_dwGameState, g_pWeatherEffectData.\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Modifies globals: g_dwInitializationFlags, g_dwCelFileLoadStatus, g_dwUIInitializeState reset to 0.\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If initialization flags not set, function skips all initialization and only clears state flags\n- InitializeSliderCursor() called twice (intentional)\n- Timeout deadline 0x7d0 (2000ms) hardcoded",
