      "comment": "Determine viewport rectangle accounting for UI panel expansion\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize viewport bounds: left=0, right=screen_width, top=0, bottom=screen_width\n2. Test if ALL UI panels are hidden (6 state flags all zero)\n3. If any panel visible: set left bound = screen_width / 2\n4. If quest/map panels visible: set right bound = screen_width / 2\n5. Return true if viewport differs (left != right), false if no adjustment needed\nParameters:\n  pRectBounds (int *): 4-element array [left, bottom, right, top] for viewport rectangle\nReturns:\n  true: Viewport was adjusted (left bound differs from right bound)\n  false: All UI panels hidden, no adjustment applied\nSpecial Cases:\n  All state flags zero = base viewport used (unchanged bounds)\n  MercenaryState, ExpandedView, HelpMenu affect left bound\n  WayPointVisibility, PanelLayoutMode affect right bound\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x6fbae0e4: g_dwScreenWidth global\n  0x6fbfd7b8-0x6fbfd7f0: UI panel visibility state flags",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_1", "PROP_LEAF"]
