      "comment": "Initialize game data paths and clear structure array.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Clear four game data path globals (g_dwGameDataPath1-4)\n2. Call BuildAndWriteGlobalDataPath with 't' parameter, store result in g_dwDataPathHandle1\n3. Call BuildAndWriteGlobalDataPath with '`' parameter, store result in g_dwDataPathHandle2\n4. If g_nStructureCount > 0:\n   - Iterate g_nStructureCount times over structure array starting at g_abStructureArray\n   - Each structure is 0x28 (40) bytes in size\n   - Clear bytes at [structure + 0x1] and [structure + 0x0] with XOR EBX = 0\n5. Return\n\nParameters: None\n\nReturns: void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Handles empty structure count (count <= 0) - loop skipped\n- Uses EBX as persistent zero register across multiple global stores\n- Structure stride (0x28) suggests fixed 40-byte structure format",
