      "instructions": ["0x8F210|PUSH|ECX", "0x8F211|PUSH|EBP", "0x8F212|MOV|EBP, EDX", "0x8F214|MOV|EDX, dword ptr [0x6fbc9bf8]", "0x8F21A|PUSH|EDI", "0x8F21B|TEST|EDX, EDX", "0x8F21D|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x8], ECX", "0x8F221|JLE|0x6fb5f237", "0x8F223|MOV|EAX, 0x6fbc9bce", "0x8F228|MOV|ECX, EDX", "0x8F22A|MOV|byte ptr [EAX + 0x1], 0x0", "0x8F22E|MOV|byte ptr [EAX], 0x0", "0x8F231|ADD|EAX, 0x28", "0x8F234|DEC|ECX", "0x8F235|JNZ|0x6fb5f22a"],
      "comment": "Checks all structures in game against viewport bounds and marks matching ones as active.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize: Load structure count from g_nStructureCount\n2. Clear phase: Reset bytes at offsets 0x00 and 0x01 for all structures (40 bytes/structure)\n3. Query loop: For each structure, check if rectangular bounds contain viewport position\n4. Bounds check: Validate param_1 (nMinX) within [field-4, field+0] AND param_2 (nMinY) within [field+4, field+8]\n5. If match: Call FUN_6fb8d210(1,0,0.0,0.0,0) and set bytes at offsets 0x10 and 0x11 to 1\n\nParameters:\nnMinX (int, ECX): Viewport minimum X coordinate for intersection test\nnMinY (int, EDX): Viewport minimum Y coordinate for intersection test\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value, modifies structure state directly\n\nStructure Layout (g_pStructureViewportData):\nOffset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description\n0x00   | 1    | (cleared)  | byte | Reset indicator\n0x01   | 1    | (cleared)  | byte | Reset indicator  \n0x04   | 4    | nMinY      | int  | Min Y coordinate for bounds check\n0x08   | 4    | nMaxY      | int  | Max Y coordinate for bounds check\n0x10   | 1    | (set)      | byte | Active flag\n0x11   | 1    | (set)      | byte | Active flag\n\nNote: Structure array uses 40-byte (0x28) stride per element. Uses __fastcall convention with implicit register parameters.",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_2", "STRUCT_Skill"]
