      "comment": "CompleteGameDataTransition - Finalizes a game data transition and performs UI cleanup.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Marks cache node as complete (sets flags at offsets 0x18 and 0x1c)\n2. Inserts cache node with cookie\n3. Based on g_dwGameDataMode:\n   - Mode 1: Transitions to mode 2 and sets game state\n   - Mode 2: Compresses packed data with game context\n4. Resets g_dwGameDataMode to 0\n5. Updates game object properties based on player unit\n6. Processes pending UI messages\n7. Closes any open dialogs\n8. Triggers UI state change (type 0xE)\n9. Copies configuration data to finalize\n\nParameters:\n  pCacheNode - Pointer to cache node structure being completed\n\nReturns: void",
