      "instructions": ["0x8FFF0|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbfda4d]", "0x8FFF5|SUB|ESP, 0x16c", "0x8FFFB|PUSH|EBX", "0x8FFFC|XOR|EBX, EBX", "0x8FFFE|PUSH|EBP", "0x8FFFF|PUSH|ESI", "0x90000|CMP|EAX, EBX", "0x90002|PUSH|EDI", "0x90003|JNZ|0x6fb6002c", "0x90005|PUSH|0x6fbae3e4", "0x9000A|LEA|EAX, [ESP + 0x7c]", "0x9000E|PUSH|0x6fbc9e34", "0x90013|PUSH|EAX", "0x90014|CALL|0x6fb9a261", "0x90019|ADD|ESP, 0xc"],
      "comment": "Initialize Waygate UI menu with texture resources and portal list layout.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load waygate menu background texture file via path building and write\n2. Load waygate tabs texture (normal or expansion version based on difficulty)\n3. Load waygate icons texture file and cache status\n4. Check UI initialization state; if needed, send waygate menu packet (0x49)\n5. Clear and initialize button config array with 18 element slots\n6. Draw four button panels at calculated screen positions with background texture\n7. Calculate tab entry offsets based on game difficulty (4 tabs normal, 5 tabs expansion)\n8. Iterate through tab entries, check portal availability for each\n9. Draw portal buttons with colored states (selected/available/unavailable)\n10. Load UI buy/sell button state and draw button panel at fixed position\n11. Populate waygate list by iterating through global waygate array\n12. For each waygate entry, draw portal icon and text with difficulty-based coloring\n13. Check if cursor within tooltip area bounds and draw tooltip box with text\n\nParameters:\n(none - void function)\n\nReturns:\n(void)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Difficulty determines tab count: 4 for normal game, 5 for expansion\n- Portal availability checked via GetUnitStat ordinal call on slot type 0x1a\n- Button coloring depends on selection state (g_nUISelectedWaygate global)\n- Tooltip appears only if cursor coordinates in bounds (0x110-0x135 X, 0x182-0x1a5 Y)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x14 = Waygate UI menu state ID for ProcessUIStateChange\n0x49 = Waygate initialization packet code for SendPacketData\n0x100 = X-axis offset for right column button pairs (two-column layout)\n0xe0 = Y-axis offset subtracted from screen height for top button row\n0x30 = Y-axis offset subtracted from screen height for bottom button row\n0x1a = Slot type parameter for portal availability stat lookup\n0x111, 0x1a1, 0x183 = Tooltip panel dimensions and positions\n\nRelated Functions:\n- ConcatenatePathAndWriteFile() - Load texture file into memory\n- ProcessUIStateChange() - Update UI menu state\n- SendPacketData() - Transmit packet to server\n- InitializeUIBuySellButtonPanel() - Set button state\n- GetDifficultyOrStringIndex() - Map portal ID to text label",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Path", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "STRUCT_Skill", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_ItemData", "PARAM_0", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "UI_MENU", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
    },
