      "comment": "HandleUIMessageEvent - Processes UI message events for state initialization.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Early exit for specific message types (0x102/9 and 0x104/0x73)\n2. On first valid event (g_bUIInitialized==0):\n   - Validate game context and room exist\n   - Send packet 0x49 with UI code to server\n   - Set g_bUIInitialized flag\n3. Call ProcessUIStateChange(0x14, 1, 1) to update UI state\n4. Set message fields +0x18=1, +0x1c=0\n5. Insert message into cache via InsertCacheNodeWithCookie\n\nParameters:\n  pMessage - Pointer to UI message structure with fields:\n    +0x04: Message type (0x102, 0x104)\n    +0x08: Message subtype (9, 0x73)\n    +0x18: Processed flag\n    +0x1c: Result/status\n\nReturns: void\n\nCalled from: Jump table (UI message dispatch)",
