      "instructions": ["0x92360|PUSH|ESI", "0x92361|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x92363|PUSH|EDI", "0x92364|XOR|EDI, EDI", "0x92366|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESI + 0x88]", "0x9236C|CMP|ECX, EDI", "0x9236E|JZ|0x6fb6237b", "0x92370|CALL|0x6fad4460", "0x92375|MOV|dword ptr [ESI + 0x88], EDI", "0x9237B|PUSH|EDI", "0x9237C|PUSH|ESI", "0x9237D|CALL|0x6fb983da", "0x92382|CMP|EAX, EDI", "0x92384|JZ|0x6fb6238d", "0x92386|MOV|ECX, EAX"],
      "comment": "Cleanup and destroy a game context object, releasing all associated resources.\nPerforms comprehensive teardown of audio contexts, event handlers, game state data, \nand deregistration from global tracking structures.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Remove primary audio context (offset 0x88) via RemoveAudioContextFromList if set\n2. Retrieve secondary audio context via Ordinal_10958, remove if exists\n3. Call FUN_6fb97a00 to release resource allocations\n4. Call FUN_6fb86da0(1) to notify resource cleanup initiating\n5. Call FUN_6fb897a0(-1) to reset state flags to inactive\n6. Switch on context type (offset 0x00):\n   - Type 0,1,2: Clear linked list iterator (offset 0xc8), process via ProcessLinkedListIterator\n            Type 0: FUN_6fb7fce0 cleanup, FUN_6fb86da0(1) notify\n            Type 1: FUN_6fb7a0c0 cleanup, FUN_6fb86da0(1) notify\n            Type 2: FUN_6fb7e5d0 cleanup, Ordinal_10461 finalize, FUN_6fb86da0(1) notify\n   - Type 3: FUN_6fb6e7e0 specialized cleanup\n   - Type 4: FUN_6fb64910 special context cleanup, Ordinal_10461 finalize\n   - Type 5: If g_hRenderContext != 0, call Ordinal_10386, then Ordinal_10461\n7. If context type == 4, call Ordinal_10688(0, pGameContextData) for final resource deallocation\n8. Call ProcessErrorConditionAndNotify to finalize error states\n9. If pGameContextData == g_pGameContext, reset global game context and reinitialize state\n10. If pGameContextData != NULL, call Ordinal_10043(0x3c6, 0) for final deregistration\n\nParameters:\npGameContextData (ECX:dword*) - Pointer to game context/unit structure to destroy.\n                               Structure format: [Type:offset 0x00, AudioCtx:offset 0x88, Iterator:offset 0xc8]\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Function always returns successfully. All resources are released regardless of type.\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Global game context: If pGameContextData points to g_pGameContext, both the context \n  and global reference are destroyed, triggering state reinitialization\n- Context type 4: Receives special dual-finalization (Ordinal_10688 + Ordinal_10461)\n- Null context safety: Function handles NULL secondary audio contexts gracefully\n- Audio cleanup: Both primary (offset 0x88) and secondary contexts removed independently",
      "tags": ["SRC_CUnit.cpp", "MOD_UNIT", "PARAM_1"]
    },
