      "comment": "Initialize game context and UI state with validation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if current game context (g_pGameContext) is valid (non-NULL)\n   - If valid, call InitializeGameStateWithValidation() to reinitialize state\n2. If provided context pointer (pGameContext) is non-NULL:\n   a. Extract skill slot value from context offset +0x4 (BYTE)\n   b. Retrieve unit data reference at context offset +0x38 (DWORD pointer)\n   c. Call Ordinal_10161 with unit data and parameter 0 (likely skill initialization)\n   d. Store extracted skill slot into g_byCurrentSkillSlot global\n   e. Call SetGlobalStateFlag(0) to reset game state flags\n   f. Call InitializeGameUIAndState() to setup UI and game state\n3. Update global context pointer g_pGameContext to new value\n\nParameters:\npGameContext (int *) - Pointer to game context structure, or NULL to clear context\n  - Non-NULL: Contains unit data at offset +0x38 and skill slot at offset +0x4\n  - NULL: Clears active game context without initialization\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value, performs state initialization\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- NULL Context: If pGameContext is NULL, only clears g_pGameContext, skips UI/state setup\n- Double-Initialization: If g_pGameContext already valid AND pGameContext provided, reinitializes state before switching context\n- Skill Slot: Skill slot value at context+0x4 stored as byte in global (BYTE range 0-255)\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x04 - Offset to skill slot value within context structure (BYTE)\n0x38 - Offset to unit data reference within context structure (DWORD pointer)\n0x00 - Parameter to Ordinal_10161 (skill initialization mode)\n\nGlobals Modified:\ng_pGameContext - Active game context pointer\ng_byCurrentSkillSlot - Current skill slot (0-255)\nvia SetGlobalStateFlag and InitializeGameUIAndState - Multiple state variables\n\nRelated Functions:\n- InitializeGameStateWithValidation() - Resets existing state\n- InitializeGameUIAndState() - Sets up UI and game state\n- SetGlobalStateFlag() - Manages global state flags\n- Ordinal_10161() - Skill/unit initialization (D2Common function)",
