      "instructions": ["0x933B0|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbff2a0]", "0x933B5|PUSH|ESI", "0x933B6|PUSH|EDI", "0x933B7|MOV|EDI, ECX", "0x933B9|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x933BB|JZ|0x6fb63405", "0x933BD|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [EAX + 0xc]", "0x933C0|CMP|ECX, 0x1", "0x933C3|JZ|0x6fb633ca", "0x933C5|CMP|ECX, 0x5", "0x933C8|JNZ|0x6fb63405", "0x933CA|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [EAX + 0x38]", "0x933CD|TEST|ESI, ESI", "0x933CF|JNZ|0x6fb633ef", "0x933D1|PUSH|0x792"],
      "comment": "Process game object data when game context is in specific state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load g_pGameContext pointer from static storage (0x6fbff2a0)\n2. Verify context is not NULL\n3. Check context state at offset 0xc equals 1 or 5 (active game states)\n4. Load data pointer from context at offset 0x38\n5. If data pointer is NULL, log error message and exit with error code 0xffffffff\n6. Call Ordinal_10329(dwGameObject) - retrieve object property data\n7. Call Ordinal_10326(dwGameObject) - retrieve additional object property data\n8. Call Ordinal_10216(nContextData, dwObjectData3, dwObjectData2, 0) - process object in context\n9. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\n- dwGameObject (IMPLICIT ECX): Game object identifier or reference\n- g_pGameContext (GLOBAL): Pointer to game context structure\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No explicit return value. Function exits process on NULL data pointer via FUN_6fb9a10f.\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If game context state is not 1 or 5, function returns immediately without processing\n- If data pointer at offset 0x38 is NULL, logs to error file (line 1938 of D2CLI source) and exits\n- Magic constant 0x792 is line number for error logging\n- Ordinal_10023: Logging function (error output)\n- Ordinal_10329: Retrieves object property data\n- Ordinal_10326: Retrieves additional object property data\n- Ordinal_10216: Core object processing function\n\nRelated Functions:\n- InitializeGameLoad() - Caller, orchestrates game initialization sequence\n- FUN_6fb9a10f() - Fatal exit handler",
      "tags": ["SRC_CUnit.cpp", "MOD_UNIT", "PARAM_1"]
