      "comment": "Clear object state flag 0x00010000 and conditionally set flag 0x04 based on object type and property check\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Clear flag 0x00010000 from object state field (offset 0x3a)\n2. If object type field (offset 0x0) == 1, query object property via Ordinal_10582\n3. Check if queried property at offset 0x2ab is non-zero (active)\n4. If property check fails (value == 0), early return without setting flag\n5. Set flag 0x04 in object state field (offset 0x3a)\n\nParameters:\n  pObject (dword *): Pointer to game object structure with state flags at offset 0x3a, type at offset 0x0, secondary identifier at offset 0x1\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - If object type != 1, skips property query and directly sets flag 0x04\n  - If object type == 1 but property check fails, returns without setting flag",
