      "instructions": ["0x93810|PUSH|EDI", "0x93811|MOV|EDI, ECX", "0x93813|TEST|EDI, EDI", "0x93815|JNZ|0x6fb63835", "0x93817|PUSH|0x8e7", "0x9381C|PUSH|0x6fbc9edc", "0x93821|PUSH|0x6fbca114", "0x93826|CALL|0x6fb99a7a", "0x9382B|ADD|ESP, 0xc", "0x9382E|PUSH|-0x1", "0x93830|CALL|0x6fb9a10f", "0x93835|PUSH|EBX", "0x93836|PUSH|ESI", "0x93837|MOV|EBX, 0x6fbfdca0", "0x9383C|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [EBX]"],
      "comment": "Iterates through all units in the global hash table and invokes a callback on each unit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate callback function pointer is not NULL\n2. If NULL, log assertion error and terminate with fatal error code\n3. If callback valid: Initialize hash bucket iterator to g_pUnitHashTable base\n4. For each bucket in hash table (iterate from 0x6fbfdca0 to 0x6fbfdea0):\n   - Load unit pointer from current bucket\n   - While unit pointer is non-zero:\n     - Call the callback function pointer for current unit\n     - Follow unit chain link at offset +0x108 to next unit in bucket\n5. Return when all buckets processed\n\nParameters:\n- pfnCallback: Function pointer to invoke for each unit (signature: void __fastcall(void))\n\nReturns:\n- void (does not return if callback is NULL)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- NULL callback triggers assertion and fatal exit (via FUN_6fb9a10f with code 0xffffffff)\n- Called during game load (InitializeGameLoad) and frame rendering (RenderGameFrame)\n- Unit chain at offset 0x108 forms linked list within each hash bucket\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x108: Unit structure field offset to next unit in hash bucket chain\n- 0x6fbfdca0: Start address of g_pUnitHashTable\n- 0x6fbfdea0: End address of g_pUnitHashTable (bucket table span)\n- 0x8e7: Line number for assertion error\n\nRelated Functions:\n- InitializeGameLoad() - Calls to process units during game initialization\n- RenderGameFrame() - Calls to process units each frame\n- FUN_6fb9a10f() - Fatal error handler invoked if callback is NULL",
