      "comment": "Initialize unit slot state field to active.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if input pointer pUnit is NULL via TEST ECX,ECX\n2. If NULL (ZF set), push arguments for error logging: error code 0x9a9, source file path 0x6fbc9edc, unit pointer 0x6fbc9f40\n3. Call Ordinal_10023 (D2Storm.PrintText) to log error message with source location\n4. Call FUN_6fb9a10f(-1) which triggers fatal error handler (never returns)\n5. If pUnit is non-NULL, skip error block via JNZ\n6. Set unit state field at offset 0x68 to value 0x3 (indicates active/initialized state)\n7. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\npUnit: Pointer to UnitAny structure; NULL value causes fatal error\n\nReturns:\nvoid; function never returns if pUnit is NULL (fatal error path)\n\nSpecial Cases:\nNULL pointer: Any NULL input immediately logs error at 0x6fbc9edc:0x9a9 and exits\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x68: Offset of unit state field within UnitAny structure\n0x3: Unit active/initialized state constant\n0x9a9: Error code (2473 decimal) for assertion/validation failure",
