      "comment": "Processes item slot with validation and D2Common operations\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pItem pointer is not null\n2. Check if item state equals zero, invoke D2Common.RemoveItemFromUnit if true\n3. Call D2Common.GetItemTxtRecord to retrieve item type record\n4. If record lookup fails OR dwFlags is non-zero, invoke D2Common.SetItemProperty\n5. If dwSlotIndex is non-zero, invoke D2Common.RemoveItemHighlight\n6. Call ProcessItemSocketing to handle socket processing\n7. Call D2Common.UpdateItemVisuals to refresh visual representation\n8. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\n- dwItemType (dword, ECX): Item type identifier for database lookup\n- pItem (void *, EDX): Pointer to item structure being processed\n- dwFlags (dword, Stack[0x4]): Flags controlling item behavior (0=standard, non-zero=special handling)\n- dwSlotIndex (dword, Stack[0x8]): Slot identifier (0=no removal, non-zero=apply highlight removal)\n\nReturns:\n- void: Function returns no value to caller",
