      "instructions": ["0x94910|PUSH|ESI", "0x94911|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x94913|CALL|0x6fb90bc0", "0x94918|PUSH|ESI", "0x94919|CALL|0x6fb9883c", "0x9491E|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0x94920|JZ|0x6fb64941", "0x94922|XOR|EDX, EDX", "0x94924|MOV|ECX, ESI", "0x94926|CALL|0x6fb63b70", "0x9492B|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESI + 0x84]", "0x94931|PUSH|EAX", "0x94932|CALL|0x6fb98d04", "0x94937|MOV|dword ptr [ESI + 0x84], 0x0", "0x94941|PUSH|ESI"],
      "comment": "Performs comprehensive cleanup operations for a game unit/entity before destruction.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FUN_6fb90bc0(pUnit) - Perform initial unit state cleanup\n2. Call Ordinal_10810(pUnit) - Check if unit has active inventory (returns non-zero if true)\n3. If inventory active (dwResult != 0):\n   a. Call EnumerateAndRemoveItemsFromUnit(pUnit, 0) - Remove all items from unit inventory\n   b. Get item list at pUnit[0x21] offset (item slot pointer)\n   c. Call Ordinal_10241(item_list) - Deallocate item structure\n   d. Clear pUnit[0x21] = 0 (zero item list pointer)\n4. Call Ordinal_10527(pUnit) - Cleanup unit-specific rendering/display data\n5. Check if global render context active (g_hRenderContext != 0):\n   a. Call Ordinal_10352(pUnit) - Update unit visibility/viewport state\n   b. Call Ordinal_10342(pUnit) - Get unit screen coordinates\n   c. Call Ordinal_10389(dwScreenData, pUnit) - Perform screen-space cleanup (returns non-zero on success)\n   d. If screen cleanup succeeded (dwResult != 0):\n      - Call Ordinal_10386(pUnit) - Finalize unit rendering cleanup\n6. Return from function\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit (int *) - Pointer to unit structure to cleanup (typically UnitAny in Diablo II context)\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Function only processes inventory if unit has active inventory (Ordinal_10810 check)\n  - Render context dependent operations only execute if g_hRenderContext is non-zero\n  - Screen cleanup (Ordinal_10389) may fail; error is silently handled\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0x21 - Offset in unit structure to item list pointer field\n  0x84 - Offset in unit structure to item list pointer (alternative access path)\n\nRelated Functions:\n  - CleanupGameContextAndResources() - Calls this function during shutdown\n  - EnumerateAndRemoveItemsFromUnit() - Removes items from unit inventory",
