      "comment": "Initialize item fields and validate item creation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate item data pointer (pItemData) is non-null; abort if null\n2. Extract item coordinates from pItemData (offsets 0xB, 0xF, 0x11, 0x13, 0x2E)\n3. Call FUN_6fb64b30 to create new item with attributes\n4. Validate new item created; abort if NULL returned\n5. Query socket count via Ordinal_10480\n6. If socket count > 0: clear sockets (Ordinal_10486), assign (Ordinal_10474), free old (Ordinal_10485), finalize (Ordinal_10376)\n7. Return void\n\nParameters:\n- pItemData (ECX): Item data structure pointer\n- dwItemCode (EDX): Item code identifier\n\nReturns:\n- None (void function, aborts on error)",
