      "comment": "Validates and processes unit quest/act state transitions.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if unit is in valid state (Ordinal_10810)\n2. If valid, check if unit has quest active (Ordinal_10767)\n3. If no quest, check unit quest completion flag (Ordinal_10815)\n4. If flag set, increment progress counter (Ordinal_10691)\n5. Seed random number generator (Ordinal_10918)\n\nParameters:\n  dwUnitId - Unit identifier or pointer (passed in ECX per D2 calling convention)\n\nReturns:\n  void - Function performs state modifications in-place\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Returns early if unit not in valid state\n  - Returns early if quest already active\n  - Only processes if completion flag is non-zero",
