      "api_calls": ["FogAssert", "FogAssert", "FogAssert", "SetInventoryField0x18", "INVENTORY_GetOwner", "GetStatListByKey", "SetUnitStateFlag", "RemoveStatListFromUnit", "FreeStatListChain", "CalculateUnitAnimationFrameCount"],
      "instructions": ["0x95880|PUSH|EBX", "0x95881|PUSH|ESI", "0x95882|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x95884|PUSH|EDI", "0x95885|TEST|ESI, ESI", "0x95887|JNZ|0x6fb658a7", "0x95889|PUSH|0x515", "0x9588E|PUSH|0x6fbca31c", "0x95893|PUSH|0x6fbb6df8", "0x95898|CALL|0x6fb99a7a", "0x9589D|ADD|ESP, 0xc", "0x958A0|PUSH|-0x1", "0x958A2|CALL|0x6fb9a10f", "0x958A7|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESI + 0x2f]", "0x958AA|XOR|EDX, EDX"],
      "comment": "Processes a ground item placement request, initializing item properties and linking it to the game state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate item request pointer (pItemRequest) - abort if NULL (0x515)\n2. Find unit slot by extracting unit ID (dwSlotUnitId) and unit type (byUnitType)\n3. Get game context and compare: if slot matches game context AND byItemClass equals 0x04 (ground item)\n4. Extract source unit ID (dwSourceUnitId) and verify non-existent (prevent duplicate) - abort if found (0x51b)\n5. Initialize item properties via InitializeItemProperties with position from wPosX, wPosY, wPosZ\n6. Return NULL check - abort if initialization fails (0x51e)\n7. Register item in unit slot's inventory (Ordinal_10261)\n8. Update item reference count (Ordinal_10262)\n9. Notify display system (FUN_6fb8f0c0)\n10. Query item enchantment (Ordinal_10480 with magic stat 0x36)\n11. If enchanted: unlink from original owner (Ordinal_10486), apply to new owner (Ordinal_10474), update properties (Ordinal_10485), notify enchantment handler (Ordinal_10376)\n\nParameters:\npItemRequest (ECX): ItemRequest structure containing:\n  dwSourceUnitId: Source unit ID (dword at +0x0b)\n  dwSlotUnitId: Slot unit ID (dword at +0x2f)\n  byUnitType: Unit type (byte at +0x2d)\n  byItemClass: Item class (byte at +0x2e, 0x04=ground)\n  wPosX: Item X position (word at +0x0f)\n  wPosY: Item Y position (word at +0x11)\n  wPosZ: Item Z position (word at +0x13)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Fatal error conditions trigger abort via FUN_6fb9a10f\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Line 0x515: Null pointer validation - indicates invalid item request\n- Line 0x51b: Duplicate detection - prevents placing same item twice\n- Line 0x51e: Initialization failure - item properties could not be created\n- Magic value 0x36: Enchantment stat ID for item linking\n- Offset 0x84 in unit: Item reference count storage\n\nItemRequest Structure Layout:\nOffset | Size | Field Name        | Type    | Description\n-------|------|-------------------|---------|------------------\n0x00   | 4    | dwSourceUnitId    | uint    | Source unit ID\n0x0b   | 4    | dwSlotUnitId      | uint    | Target slot unit\n0x2d   | 1    | byUnitType        | byte    | Unit type identifier\n0x2e   | 1    | byItemClass       | byte    | Item class (0x04=ground)\n0x0f   | 2    | wPosX             | ushort  | X position\n0x11   | 2    | wPosY             | ushort  | Y position\n0x13   | 2    | wPosZ             | ushort  | Z position",
      "tags": ["SRC_Item.cpp", "MOD_UNIT", "UNIT_ITEM", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_Other", "NET_SCMD"]
