      "instructions": ["0x96430|SUB|ESP, 0x20", "0x96433|PUSH|EBX", "0x96434|PUSH|EBP", "0x96435|PUSH|ESI", "0x96436|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x96438|XOR|ECX, ECX", "0x9643A|LEA|EAX, [ESP + 0x14]", "0x9643E|MOV|CL, byte ptr [ESI + 0x2]", "0x96441|PUSH|EDI", "0x96442|PUSH|EAX", "0x96443|SUB|ECX, 0x8", "0x96446|PUSH|0x0", "0x96448|LEA|EDX, [ESI + 0x8]", "0x9644B|PUSH|ECX", "0x9644C|PUSH|EDX"],
      "comment": "Place a unit item on the ground, handling inventory transfer and item state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get item class from parameter (param_1 + 2 byte offset)\n2. Call Ordinal_10883 (Storm/D2Common - Initialize item ground position) with buffer size = class - 8\n3. Find unit in hash table using itemData[4] as key\n4. If unit exists and has property value == 1 (ground item):\n   a. Get current game context (Ordinal_10290 - GetGameContext, player unit)\n   b. Retrieve player unit ID from offset 0x84 (Ordinal_10442 - Get unit ID)\n   c. Ordinal_10255 (Move inventory item to ground slot)\n   d. Ordinal_10243 (Find item in container)\n   e. Ordinal_10254 (Remove item from slot)\n   f. Check if unit empty: Ordinal_10258 (Unit cleanup)\n   g. Ordinal_10707 (Check property 0x100/0x171)\n   h. Ordinal_10524 (Apply item modifications)\n   i. Ordinal_10514 (Finalize player changes)\n   j. ProcessHandlerTable (Update handler state)\n   k. Ordinal_10954 (Set item flags)\n   l. ProcessUnitItemProperties (Refresh item properties)\n5. RemoveUnitFromHashTable (Clear previous item reference)\n6. AllocateAndSetupUnitWithItemData (Create new ground item structure)\n7. Check property 0x36 via Ordinal_10480:\n   - Ordinal_10486 (Clear property 0x36)\n   - Ordinal_10474 (Set property with value)\n   - Ordinal_10485 (Cleanup temporary)\n   - Ordinal_10376 (Refresh item display)\n8. Return void\n\nParameters:\n  nItemData: int - Item data pointer (structure format: itemId@+4, classId@+2, posX@+8, ...)\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value; modifies global state\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Ordinal_10023 assertion: Error handler calls (used at 0x5e1, 0x5eb, 0x5fe)\n  - Ordinal_10024 assertion: Error handler call (used at 0x5f6)\n  - Property 0x36 initialization: Only clears if value != 0\n  - Stack temporaries: abItemDataBuffer for ground position parameters",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "SRC_Item.cpp", "MOD_UNIT", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
