      "comment": "Equips an item on a game unit (player or NPC) and applies necessary effects.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate input request pointer (halt with fatal error if NULL)\n2. Find source unit (item owner) and destination unit (equipment wearer)\n3. If no destination unit exists in game context:\n   a. Create new item from request parameters\n   b. If creation fails, halt with fatal error\n4. If destination unit exists:\n   a. Check if item already equipped on this unit (Ordinal_10754)\n   b. If equipped, call SetItemMode to update item placement\n   c. Otherwise, remove old item from unit and create new item\n5. Validate item location byte != 0xFF (invalid location)\n6. Call FUN_6fb667e0 to update visual/UI representation\n7. Check if equipping causes stat changes (Ordinal_10840)\n8. If stat changes, apply ProcessUnitItemEffect to calculate deltas\n9. Send mouse move message to update cursor\n10. Check if unit has stat updates pending (Ordinal_10480 with flag 0x36)\n11. If updates pending, clear pending flag (Ordinal_10486), update calcs (Ordinal_10474), trigger updates (Ordinal_10485), refresh display (Ordinal_10376)\n12. Validate overall game state for the player owning this unit\n\nParameters:\nparam_1 - ItemEquipRequest structure containing: unit ID, item code, location, stats, equipped unit ID, coordinates, and placement flags\n\nReturns:\nvoid (no return value)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Halt on NULL input request\n- Halt on InitializeItemProperties failure with second attempt\n- Return early if item location byte = 0xFF (invalid location)\n- If destination unit = source unit (item on self), pass 1 to InitializeItemProperties, else pass 0\n\nStructure Layout (ItemEquipRequest):\nOffset | Size | Field | Type | Description\n0x00   | 4    | dwUnitId | uint | ID of unit equipping the item\n0x0B   | 4    | dwOwnerId | uint | ID of unit that owns the item\n0x0F   | 2    | nItemCode | ushort | Item code/type\n0x11   | 2    | nCoordX | ushort | Display coordinate X\n0x13   | 2    | nCoordY | ushort | Display coordinate Y\n0x21   | 4    | dwEquipped | uint | Equipped state flag\n0x2D   | 1    | nQuality | byte | Item quality level\n0x2E   | 1    | nLocation | byte | Equipment location\n0x2F   | 4    | dwItemFlags | uint | Miscellaneous flags\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x0B - Owner unit ID offset\n0x0D - Quality byte offset\n0x0F - Item code offset (word)\n0x11 - X coordinate offset (word)\n0x13 - Y coordinate offset (word)\n0x21 - Equipped state offset\n0x2D - Quality offset (byte)\n0x2E - Location byte offset\n0x2F - Flags offset\n0x36 - Stat update pending flag (checked with Ordinal_10480)\n0x63B - Line 1595 error code\n0x645 - Line 1605 error code\n0x655 - Line 1621 error code (invalid page)\n0xFF - Invalid location marker\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FindUnitInHashTable() - Locates units by ID\n- GetGameContext() - Retrieves game state container\n- InitializeItemProperties() - Creates item on unit\n- SetItemMode() - Updates item placement\n- ProcessUnitItemEffect() - Applies stat delta effects\n- ValidateGameInitializationState() - Checks player consistency",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "SRC_Item.cpp", "MOD_UNIT", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_Other", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control"]
    },
