      "instructions": ["0x98380|SUB|ESP, 0x24", "0x98383|PUSH|EBX", "0x98384|MOV|EBX, ECX", "0x98386|XOR|ECX, ECX", "0x98388|PUSH|EBP", "0x98389|MOV|CL, byte ptr [EBX + 0x2]", "0x9838C|PUSH|ESI", "0x9838D|LEA|EAX, [ESP + 0x18]", "0x98391|PUSH|EDI", "0x98392|PUSH|EAX", "0x98393|SUB|ECX, 0xd", "0x98396|PUSH|0x0", "0x98398|LEA|EDX, [EBX + 0xd]", "0x9839B|PUSH|ECX", "0x9839C|PUSH|EDX"],
      "comment": "Processes item placement and applies visual/mechanical effects when an item is moved between inventory slots.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Decode item path from request structure (uses game-specific path encoding)\n2. Validate path exists in item tree via hash table lookup\n3. Verify path has valid item container (non-null dwUnitType for players)\n4. Find or create destination inventory slot unit\n5. Set item visual properties (highlight flags, mode bits)\n6. Apply item effects: handlers, stat bonuses, skill adjustments\n7. Update game UI state and equipment tracking globals\n8. Return early if path becomes invalid after validation\n\nParameters:\nnItemRequest (IMPLICIT: ECX) - Request structure containing:\n  +0x0: Operation flags\n  +0x2: Source path start offset (byte)\n  +0x3: Target slot type (byte, 0-1)\n  +0x4: Destination unit ID (dword)\n  +0x8: Destination unit type (byte)\n  +0x9: Item container ID (dword)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Function always completes or terminates via FUN_6fb9a10f(-1) on validation failure\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Returns early if Ordinal_10242 (inventory insertion) fails: Ordinal_10029 error message, then return\n- Handles dwUnitType == 0 (player character) by initializing UI on equipment change\n- Doubles item slot processing: first validates existing item, then inserts new item\n- Magic numbers: 0x100/0x171 are validation bounds, 0x36 is special item flag\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x04 - Equip slot marker (sets g_wItemUsageMode to 0 on complete)\n0x05 - Use slot marker (sets g_wEquipmentMode to 0 on complete)\n0x36 - Ethereal/Special item indicator flag\n0x100 - Minimum validation bound check\n0x171 - Maximum validation bound check\n0x1540, 0xa45, 0xa4c, etc - Assertion line numbers (failure path)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FindUnitInHashTable() - Lookup unit by ID and type\n- CreateUnitInInventory() - Create new inventory slot unit\n- Ordinal_10242() - Core inventory insertion primitive\n- ProcessHandlerTable() - Apply item event handlers\n- InitializeGameUIState() - Reset UI on equipment change",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "STRUCT_Item", "PROP_NOCALLER", "SRC_Item.cpp", "MOD_UNIT", "STRUCT_ItemData", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData", "PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Skill"]
