      "comment": "Store item slot value based on slot type (Druid or Other).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call Ordinal_10823 (D2Common.GetItemLevel) to retrieve item value/level from item handle\n2. If slot type (0x04) is Other: store result in g_wItemSlotOther global\n3. If slot type (0x05) is Druid: store result in g_wItemSlotDruid global\n4. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\npnItem: Pointer to item handle (integer identifying the item instance)\ncSlotType: Slot classification byte (0x04 = Other, 0x05 = Druid)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - stores result in appropriate global variable\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x04 - Item slot type: Other\n0x05 - Item slot type: Druid\n\nSpecial Cases:\nFunction handles two distinct item slot types and branches accordingly. Global variables track current slot values for each type.",
