      "comment": "Processes inventory item addition and equipping with full validation and updates.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract item metadata from parameter (class, source/target slots)\n2. Check inventory operation flags (0x40 = primary, 0x80 = alternate)\n3. If only 0x80 flag set, call FUN_6fb69660 handler and return\n4. Locate player unit in hash table, validate type is 0\n5. Find item in target inventory position\n6. Check item existence mode (0x01 flag)\n7. If item missing, validate or create new unit\n8. Initialize item slot with class type via Ordinal_10720\n9. Get inventory container pointer from player[2].pPath\n10. Determine column layout (3 or 4 cols) based on class 0x0B/0x0C\n11. Test inventory capacity with Ordinal_10242\n12. Check for slot conflicts with Ordinal_10257\n13. If conflict, remove with Ordinal_10254 and log\n14. Insert item with Ordinal_10253\n15. Update player and inventory states\n16. Complete: refresh UI and return\n\nParameters:\nnInventoryData - Inventory operation request structure (offsets: +0x2=class, +0x4=dest_unit, +0x8=dest_slot, +0x9=src_unit, +0xd=src_slot)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Always returns or terminates on error via FUN_6fb9a10f",
