      "comment": "Process unit inventory items and apply modifications.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract inventory slot offset (param at +0x2, subtract 8)\n2. Locate unit in hash table using unit ID from param+0x4\n3. Call Ordinal_10882 to mark items with new slot value 0x57\n4. Get game context structure (Ordinal_10023 - return NULL triggers error)\n5. Get inventory reference from context at offset 0x84\n6. Iterate item slots: query slot 0x08 data (Ordinal_10709, Ordinal_10754)\n7. If slot empty: Ordinal_10261 clear inventory, Ordinal_10262 get first item\n8. For each item in inventory (Ordinal_10262):\n   - Ordinal_10480 get item data at offset 0x36\n   - If found: Ordinal_10486 clear slot, Ordinal_10474 set owner, Ordinal_10485 mark changed\n   - If not found: skip updates\n9. Ordinal_10376 finalize and mark game state\n\nParameters:\nIMPLICIT ECX - nUnitPtr (int): Pointer to unit structure\n  + 0x00: (reserved)\n  + 0x02: byte byItemSlot (0x08 to 0x37 range)\n  + 0x04: dword dwUnitId (lookup in hash table)\n  + 0x08: byte* pItemData (buffer start)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Always returns after processing\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Game context NULL: Ordinal_10023 logs error 0xce2, FUN_6fb9a10f terminates (-1)\n- Inventory NULL: Ordinal_10023 logs error 0xce5, FUN_6fb9a10f terminates (-1)\n- Empty slot: Ordinal_10261 clears before iterating\n- Non-existent item: Silently skips modification\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x08 - Item slot offset constant\n0x36 - Inventory item access offset\n0x57 - Item slot marker value\n0x84 - Game context inventory field offset\n0xce2 - Error code for missing game context\n0xce5 - Error code for missing inventory\n-0x01 - Process termination code\n\nOrdinal Functions (D2Common.dll):\n- Ordinal_10882: Mark unit items with slot marker\n- Ordinal_10709: Get item data from unit\n- Ordinal_10754: Check inventory slot existence\n- Ordinal_10261: Clear inventory head\n- Ordinal_10262: Get first/next item in inventory\n- Ordinal_10480: Get item data at offset\n- Ordinal_10486: Clear item at offset\n- Ordinal_10474: Set item owner/flags\n- Ordinal_10485: Mark inventory changed\n- Ordinal_10376: Finalize inventory state\n- Ordinal_10023: Log error message (Fog.dll)",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "SRC_Item.cpp", "MOD_UNIT", "PARAM_1"]
