      "comment": "Place a unit item at the specified slot or find room for it.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pUnit is not NULL; if NULL, log error and terminate process\n2. Initialize dwTargetSlot to 0\n3. If bCheckAvailable is true AND (nWidth != 0 OR nHeight != 0), call FindRoomForUnit to locate available space\n4. Call SetItemMode to apply item to the target slot with dimensions and mode\n5. Call Ordinal_10720 to finalize item placement with mode data\n\nParameters:\npUnit (UnitAny *) - Pointer to unit entity receiving the item\nnWidth (ushort) - Item width in grid cells\nnHeight (ushort) - Item height in grid cells\nnDestType (int) - Destination slot type/index for placement\nbCheckAvailable (int) - Flag to search for available room (0=use nDestType directly, non-zero=auto-find)\ndwItemMode (dword) - Item mode flags to apply during placement\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value; exits on validation failure via FUN_6fb9a10f\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- NULL pUnit triggers error log and process termination\n- If bCheckAvailable is 0 or dimensions are 0, uses provided nDestType directly without searching\n- Ordinal_10023 logs error with error code 0x35a (decimal 858)",
