      "instructions": ["0x9A800|PUSH|ECX", "0x9A801|PUSH|EBX", "0x9A802|PUSH|EBP", "0x9A803|PUSH|ESI", "0x9A804|PUSH|EDI", "0x9A805|MOV|EDI, ECX", "0x9A807|TEST|EDI, EDI", "0x9A809|JNZ|0x6fb6a829", "0x9A80B|PUSH|0xe20", "0x9A810|PUSH|0x6fbca31c", "0x9A815|PUSH|0x6fbb6df8", "0x9A81A|CALL|0x6fb99a7a", "0x9A81F|ADD|ESP, 0xc", "0x9A822|PUSH|-0x1", "0x9A824|CALL|0x6fb9a10f"],
      "comment": "Transfers an inventory item from a source unit to a destination unit with validation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate nItemNodeId is non-zero (exit with error if null)\n2. Find source item unit in hash table using node ID and class\n3. Find destination unit in hash table (class 4)\n4. Get game context from GetGameContext()\n5. If source item matches game context:\n   a. Check if source item is locked (Ordinal_10754) with flags 0x01\n   b. If not locked (iVar4 == 0):\n      - Extract item mode from offset +0x03\n      - Validate destination unit exists (exit with error if NULL)\n      - Set destination item mode via SetItemMode (page=0, page_offset=0)\n      - Apply item mode to destination via Ordinal_10720\n   c. If locked (iVar4 != 0):\n      - Remove destination unit from hash table\n      - Initialize new item properties via InitializeItemProperties\n      - Validate new item created (exit with error if NULL)\n6. Get inventory handle from source item offset +0x21\n7. Validate inventory handle exists (exit with error if zero)\n8. Set destination position via Ordinal_10328 (X coordinate from offset +0x11)\n9. Set destination position via Ordinal_10331 (Y coordinate from offset +0x13)\n10. Add destination unit to inventory via Ordinal_10242\n11. Validate add succeeded (log error and return on failure)\n12. Get page ID from destination via Ordinal_10719\n13. Validate page ID is not 0xFF (log error and return on failure)\n14. Query game state via GetGlobalSystemState()\n15. Get source item state via Ordinal_10409\n16. Get destination position X via Ordinal_10329\n17. Get destination position Y via Ordinal_10326\n18. Execute inventory placement logic via Ordinal_10249 with collected parameters\n19. Validate placement succeeded (exit with error if zero)\n20. Query socket/overlay via Ordinal_10840\n21. If socket/overlay exists, apply item effects via ProcessUnitItemEffect\n22. Refresh UI via SendMouseMoveMessage()\n23. Check for stat modifiers via Ordinal_10480 (stat 0x36)\n24. If modifiers exist:\n    a. Clear stat modifier via Ordinal_10486\n    b. Update stat modifier via Ordinal_10474\n    c. Trigger recalc via Ordinal_10485\n    d. Refresh display via Ordinal_10376\n\nParameters:\n  nItemNodeId (int, ECX) - Inventory item node ID to transfer\n\nReturns:\n  void - Always succeeds or exits process via FUN_6fb9a10f\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - NULL nItemNodeId triggers immediate process termination\n  - Multiple validation checks terminate process on failure\n  - Item locked vs unlocked paths differ in initialization\n  - Page ID 0xFF is invalid and terminates processing\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x2f - Item node ID offset in inventory node structure\n  0x2d - Item class offset in inventory node structure\n  0xb - Destination unit ID offset\n  0x21 - Inventory handle offset in item structure\n  0x3 - Item mode offset in inventory node structure\n  0x2e - Item slot/page offset\n  0x11 - Destination X coordinate offset\n  0x13 - Destination Y coordinate offset\n  0x01 - Item locked flag for Ordinal_10754\n  0xff - Invalid page ID sentinel\n  0x36 - Stat modifier check code for Ordinal_10480\n\nRelated Functions:\n  - FindUnitInHashTable() - Hash table lookup for units\n  - InitializeItemProperties() - Create new item with properties\n  - SetItemMode() - Configure item mode/page\n  - ProcessUnitItemEffect() - Apply item effect bonuses\n  - GetGameContext() - Get active game session pointer\n  - GetGlobalSystemState() - Query game state flags",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Inventory", "STRUCT_Item", "SRC_Item.cpp", "MOD_UNIT", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_Other", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control"]
