      "instructions": ["0x9AEC0|PUSH|ECX", "0x9AEC1|PUSH|EBX", "0x9AEC2|PUSH|EBP", "0x9AEC3|PUSH|ESI", "0x9AEC4|PUSH|EDI", "0x9AEC5|MOV|EDI, ECX", "0x9AEC7|TEST|EDI, EDI", "0x9AEC9|JNZ|0x6fb6aee9", "0x9AECB|PUSH|0xf0a", "0x9AED0|PUSH|0x6fbca31c", "0x9AED5|PUSH|0x6fbb6df8", "0x9AEDA|CALL|0x6fb99a7a", "0x9AEDF|ADD|ESP, 0xc", "0x9AEE2|PUSH|-0x1", "0x9AEE4|CALL|0x6fb9a10f"],
      "comment": "Processes item pickup into player inventory or with ground unit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate item record pointer (non-null)\n2. Find source unit (owner) at item record offset 0x2f/0x2d\n3. Find target unit (inventory owner) at offset 0xb, type 4\n4. If target unit not found: initialize new item properties via GetGameContext\n5. If target unit found: set item mode and apply mode flags\n6. Compare source unit with game context (player)\n7. If source is player:\n   a. Set item coordinates (offsets 0x11, 0x13)\n   b. Get inventory container at source offset 0x84\n   c. Call Ordinal_10242 to inventory operation with mode 2\n   d. If operation succeeds:\n      - Get current slot ID (Ordinal_10326)\n      - Call Ordinal_10266 to update inventory reference\n      - Call Ordinal_10840 to validate item in inventory\n      - If valid: process item effect (ProcessUnitItemEffect)\n      - Call Ordinal_10261 to clear inventory marker\n      - Get next inventory item (Ordinal_10262)\n      - Call FUN_6fb8f0c0 with inventory item\n      - Update game state byte flag at slot\n   e. Send mouse move message to UI\n   f. Get equip slot (Ordinal_10480 with slot 0x36)\n   g. If slot occupied: update paperdoll, apply equip stat changes, redraw UI\n   h. Call InitializeGameStateAndValidateConnection with owner ID\n\nParameters:\n  pItemRecord (__fastcall ECX): Pointer to item record structure\n    - +0x03: Item mode/type (byte)\n    - +0x0b: Owner unit ID (dword)\n    - +0x0f: Owner unit type (ushort)\n    - +0x2d: Source unit type (byte)\n    - +0x2e: Source unit mode (byte)\n    - +0x2f: Source unit ID (dword)\n    - +0x84: Inventory container (dword)\n\nReturns:\n  void (no return value)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Fatal error if item record null (Ordinal_10023, calls FUN_6fb9a10f(-1))\n  - Fatal error if game context inventory missing (Ordinal_10023 at 0xf1f)\n  - Fatal error if target unit null after initialization (Ordinal_10023 at 0x1540)\n  - Handles case where source and target units differ (inventory pickup vs ground placement)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x02 - Inventory operation mode code\n  0x36 - Paperdoll equip slot identifier\n  0x84 - Offset to inventory container in unit structure\n  0xb - Offset to owner unit ID in item record\n  0x0b - Owner unit type offset\n  0x0f - Owner type field offset\n  0x11, 0x13 - Item coordinate offsets\n  0x2d, 0x2e, 0x2f - Source unit fields\n  0xf0a, 0xf1f, 0x1540 - Debug/error line numbers\n\nRelated Functions:\n  - FindUnitInHashTable() - Locate units by ID/type\n  - InitializeItemProperties() - Create new item instance\n  - SetItemMode() - Configure item mode/properties\n  - GetGameContext() - Get player unit pointer\n  - ProcessUnitItemEffect() - Apply item bonuses\n  - SetGameStateByteFlag() - Update game state\n  - InitializeGameStateAndValidateConnection() - Validate game sync",
