      "comment": "HandleItemScreenStateUpdate - Process item screen state change packet\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Parse packet fields: state type (offset +1), flags (offset +6), item ID (offset +2)\n2. If flags == -1 (special handling):\n   a. If state type == -1: Clear item screen state (remove stat list, clear flags)\n   b. Else: Check UI state array, find item, set item flag and screen state\n3. Otherwise: Standard state update - check UI state array, set screen state\n4. Assert if item not found in hash table\n\nParameters:\n- pPacket: Pointer to item screen state packet structure\n\nReturns: void\n\nRelated: ProcessItemScreenStatePacket (caller), SetCurrentScreenState, SetItemFlag",
