      "comment": "RemoveUnitReferenceFromGame - Removes a unit reference from the game state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract unit GUID and type from unit reference info structure\n2. Look up unit in hash table using FindUnitInHashTable\n3. Assert unit exists - crash with FogAssert if not found\n4. Check if unit matches current game context (player unit)\n5. If player unit: get inventory, clear field 0x18, update game state\n6. Remove unit from hash table and validate game state\n\nParameters:\n  pUnitRefInfo - Pointer to unit reference info structure:\n                 +1: Unit type (byte)\n                 +2: Unit GUID (dword)\n\nReturns: void\n\nCalled By: ProcessUnitRefRemoval (network packet handler)",
