      "comment": "RemoveUnitStatListByKey - Removes a stat list (key 0x36) from a unit and frees it.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Find unit in hash table using message data (unit type + GUID)\n2. Assert if unit not found (fatal error)\n3. Get stat list by key 0x36 from the unit\n4. If stat list exists: clear state flag, remove from unit, free chain\n5. Recalculate unit animation frame count\n\nParameters:\n  pMsgData - Pointer to message data containing unit type at offset +1 and GUID at offset +2\n\nReturns: void",
