      "comment": "Check if game session is paused or inactive\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call Ordinal_10481(pGameSession, 2) to check session pause state with flag 2\n2. If returns non-zero (paused/inactive), return 1 (true)\n3. Retrieve game context via GetGameContext()\n4. If game context is valid, call Ordinal_10487(pGameContext, 0x36) to check context state\n5. If returns non-zero (context invalid/paused), return 1 (true)\n6. Return 0 (false) - game is active and not paused\n\nParameters:\npGameSession: void* - Game session handle (passed in ECX, __fastcall)\n\nReturns:\n1 (true) - Game is paused/inactive (either session or context check failed)\n0 (false) - Game is active and running\n\nNote: Uses Diablo II Storm ordinal calls - Ordinal_10481 and Ordinal_10487 check session/context validity",
      "tags": ["PARAM_1", "PROP_SMALL"]
