      "instructions": ["0x9E410|SUB|ESP, 0x18", "0x9E413|LEA|EAX, [ESP]", "0x9E417|PUSH|ESI", "0x9E418|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x9E41A|XOR|ECX, ECX", "0x9E41C|PUSH|EDI", "0x9E41D|MOV|CL, byte ptr [ESI + 0x2]", "0x9E420|PUSH|EAX", "0x9E421|SUB|ECX, 0xd", "0x9E424|PUSH|0x0", "0x9E426|LEA|EDX, [ESI + 0xd]", "0x9E429|PUSH|ECX", "0x9E42A|PUSH|EDX", "0x9E42B|CALL|0x6fb98ddc", "0x9E430|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESI + 0x9]"],
      "comment": "Process item creation and inventory assignment\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize 24-byte item stats buffer via Ordinal_10883 (InitializeItemStats)\n2. Find source unit in hash table using unit node ID and class\n3. Verify source unit exists; trigger error 0x15b5 if not found\n4. Remove source unit from hash table with operation code 4\n5. Create new item in destination unit inventory with initialized stats\n6. Verify new item created successfully; trigger error 0x15b8 if failed\n7. Set new item property 0x46 (ITEM_FLAG_VISIBLE) to 1 via Ordinal_10517\n8. Retrieve destination unit ID from source unit offset +0x84\n9. Assign new item to destination unit via Ordinal_10261 (AssignItemToUnit)\n10. Get destination inventory ID via Ordinal_10262 (GetInventoryId)\n11. Call FUN_6fb8f0c0 to update inventory state\n\nParameters:\npUnit (int *) - Source unit structure pointer (IMPLICIT ECX)\n  +0x2: Unit class/type (byte)\n  +0x4: Destination unit ID\n  +0x8: Unit class/type (byte)\n  +0x9: Destination unit ID (dword)\n  +0xd: Item chain pointer\n  +0x84: Destination unit ID field\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value, modifies game state\n\nSpecial Cases:\nError code 0x15b5 - Source unit lookup failed\nError code 0x15b8 - Item creation failed\nBoth errors invoke FUN_6fb9a10f(-1) non-returning abort\n\nStack Variables:\nabBuffer - 24-byte item stats buffer (initialized at entry)\n\nRelated Ordinals:\nOrdinal_10883 = InitializeItemStats\nOrdinal_10517 = SetItemProperty\nOrdinal_10261 = AssignItemToUnit\nOrdinal_10262 = GetInventoryId\nOrdinal_10023 = ShowErrorMessage",
