      "comment": "Cleanup render context resources for game context type 3\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Ordinal_11214(pRenderData) - D2Gfx initial cleanup for render context\n2. Ordinal_11116(pRenderData) - D2Gfx secondary cleanup for render context  \n3. FUN_6fb97a00(pRenderData) - Common resource deallocation shared by all context types\n4. FUN_6fb90bc0(pRenderData) - Type 3 render context specific cleanup routine\n5. Load g_hRenderContext global to check if render context is initialized\n6. If g_hRenderContext is non-zero: execute Ordinal_10228(pRenderData) and Ordinal_10386(pRenderData) for surface operations\n7. Extract field value from pRenderData structure at offset 0x38\n8. Ordinal_10156(0, extracted_field) - Final cleanup on extracted field value\n\nParameters:\n  pRenderData (RenderContext *) - Pointer to type 3 render context structure being destroyed, contains sub-field at offset 0x38\n\nReturns:\n  void - Always succeeds, releases all render context resources\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Ordinal_11214: D2Gfx render context cleanup 1\n  - Ordinal_11116: D2Gfx render context cleanup 2\n  - Ordinal_10228: D2Gfx conditional surface operation 1 (only if g_hRenderContext active)\n  - Ordinal_10386: D2Gfx conditional surface operation 2 (only if g_hRenderContext active)\n  - Ordinal_10156: Final cleanup with null first param and field value from offset 0x38",
