      "comment": "CreateAreaEffectMissile - Creates a circular area effect using missile type 0x29.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get missile template record for type 0x29\n2. Assert template exists, exit on failure\n3. If unit provided, resolve via GetUnitFromHashTable if not already resolved\n4. Initialize projectile data structure (22 dwords zeroed)\n5. Set flags (0x20), target coords (0,0), missile type (0x2a), random flag (1)\n6. Call InitializeAndAllocateProjectile to spawn the base missile\n7. Get radius from missile template offset 0x78\n8. Call ProcessCircleWithinDistance with flags 0x109 to create area effect\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - Source unit pointer (can be NULL or hash table reference)\n\nReturns: void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x29 (41) = Area effect missile template index\n  0x2a (42) = Secondary missile type for projectile data\n  0x109 (265) = ProcessCircleWithinDistance flags\n  0x20 = Projectile data control flags\n  0x78 = Offset in missile template for effect radius",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_MonsterData", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "MOD_UNIT", "SRC_Missile.cpp", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_Other", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
