      "comment": "SpawnMissileSubProjectile - Spawns a sub-projectile for specific missile types.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Return early if nMode != 0\n2. Get missile class ID and map to sub-missile type:\n   - 0x110 -> 0x158\n   - 0x111, 0x112, 0x1a1 -> 0x159\n   - Default: 0x284\n3. Get owner unit from hash table\n4. Initialize projectile creation params (22 dwords zeroed)\n5. Create new projectile via InitializeAndAllocateProjectile\n6. Set new projectile direction from source missile path\n7. Set target X offset to 0x80\n\nParameters:\n  pMissile - Source missile unit spawning the sub-projectile\n  nMode - Mode flag, only spawns when 0\n\nReturns: void (EAX set to 1 on success, 0 on early return)",
