      "comment": "CreateMultiProjectileEffect - Creates a multi-projectile visual effect pattern.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get source unit from hash table\n2. Determine missile ID based on unit type (0x85, 0x234, or default)\n3. Get missile range and call ordinal setup functions\n4. Initialize offset arrays for projectile positions\n5. Create first wave of 5 projectiles with type 0x67\n6. Create central projectile with type 0x9A and set light radius\n7. Create second wave of 3 projectiles with type 0x69\n8. Create remaining projectiles with type 0x68\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - Source unit that originates the projectile effect\n\nReturns: void",
