      "comment": "CreateProjectilesForNearbyTargets - Creates projectiles targeting nearby units.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Retrieves source unit from hash table\n2. Initializes find data structures (local_bc, local_90)\n3. Gets monster data field and search radius from skill 0x23\n4. Finds region by coordinates and collects units in range\n5. For each unit found (up to missile range limit):\n   - Skips excluded target\n   - Compares unit attributes for validity\n   - Initializes projectile data structure (type 0x20, skill 0xE7)\n   - Creates and allocates projectile\n6. Frees find data allocation\n\nParameters:\n  pSourceUnit - Unit creating the projectiles\n  pExcludedTarget - Unit to exclude from targeting (may be self or ally)\n\nReturns: void",
