      "comment": "CreateMissileEffectForUnit - Creates a missile visual effect centered on a unit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Gets missile template record for missile type 0x3E\n2. Validates template exists (asserts and exits if null)\n3. If unit ID valid, resolves unit from hash table (unless type 0 or 1)\n4. Initializes 88-byte projectile structure on stack (22 DWORDs zeroed)\n5. Sets projectile size (0x20), effect type (0x2A), coordinates, and flags\n6. Calls InitializeAndAllocateProjectile to create the missile\n7. Calls D2Common ordinals and ProcessCircleWithinDistance with missile radius\n\nParameters:\n  pUnitId - Pointer to unit ID or unit pointer (type determined by first dword)\n\nReturns: void",
