      "instructions": ["0x9F9A0|SUB|ESP, 0xdc", "0x9F9A6|PUSH|EBX", "0x9F9A7|PUSH|EBP", "0x9F9A8|PUSH|ESI", "0x9F9A9|MOV|EBP, EDX", "0x9F9AB|PUSH|EDI", "0x9F9AC|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0x9F9AE|PUSH|EBP", "0x9F9AF|CALL|0x6fb9836e", "0x9F9B4|MOV|ECX, 0x1", "0x9F9B9|OR|EDI, 0xffffffff", "0x9F9BC|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x10], EAX", "0x9F9C0|MOV|EAX, 0xfffffffe", "0x9F9C5|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x18], ECX", "0x9F9C9|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x30], ECX"],
      "comment": "Initialize skill charge animation table with frame data\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Query skill data via Ordinal_10589 to get frame information\n2. Initialize a 33-element configuration array with control values\n3. Build charge lookup table by:\n   - Setting array indices with animation frame numbers\n   - Marking valid (0x1), invalid (0x2), or terminator (0xffffffff) entries\n   - Clearing remaining entries (0x0)\n4. Retrieve unit, skill level, and mana requirements via GetUnitFromHashTable and ordinals\n5. Calculate skill offset: (frame_index << 7) from ordinal data at offset 0x78\n6. Loop through initial table (8-byte stride) and call FUN_6fb77720 for each entry\n7. If mode is 2 or 3:\n   - Recalculate offset from ordinal data at offset 0x7c\n   - Loop through offset table with stride 4 (mode 3) or 8 (mode 2)\n   - Call FUN_6fb77720 for each offset entry\n8. Return (void)\n\nParameters:\nnUnitId (int) - Unit/player ID to initialize skills for\ndwSkillId (uint) - Skill ID to process\nnMode (int) - Animation mode (2=normal, 3=alternate)\n\nReturns:\nvoid (no return value)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Mode 2 uses stride of 8 bytes per entry\n- Mode 3 uses stride of 4 bytes per entry\n- Other modes skip the offset table processing\n- Array contains both animation frame indices and validity markers\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x1f - Array terminator marker\n0x20 - Array stride offset (32 dwords)\n0x40 - Offset table start position (128 bytes)\n0x7c - Offset into skill data structure for secondary offset calculation\n0x78 - Offset into skill data structure for primary offset calculation\n33 - Array size (132 bytes total)\n0xffffffff - Invalid/disabled entry marker\n0xfffffffe - Animation frame skip marker",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "STRUCT_Room2", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_ItemData", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData", "STRUCT_StatList", "STRUCT_MonsterData", "STRUCT_Path", "PARAM_3", "STRUCT_Skill"]
