      "comment": "CreateProjectileFromUnit - Creates a projectile from a unit using default configuration.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate input unit pointer is non-null\n2. Resolve unit from hash table if needed (if unit type is not 0 or 1)\n3. Initialize projectile config struct (0x16 dwords cleared via STOSD.REP)\n4. Set config: flags=0x20, projectile type=0x1d, source and resolved unit pointers\n5. Call InitializeAndAllocateProjectile to create the missile\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - Pointer to source unit or unit ID (resolved via GetUnitFromHashTable if type != 0,1)\n\nReturns: void (projectile creation handled by InitializeAndAllocateProjectile)",
