      "comment": "Initialize unit skill array with default values and retrieve unit properties.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Allocate 17 dword skill table array on stack\n2. Set skill values: indices 0,1,3,7,9,10,11 = 0x02, indices 4,5,8,12 = 0xfffffffe (initialized values)\n3. Clear remaining slots via REP STOSD loop (22 dwords)\n4. Call Ordinal_10589 to get unit class info from param_2\n5. Call GetUnitFromHashTable to lookup unit structure by ID\n6. Call Ordinal_10326 to get unit level/class data\n7. Call Ordinal_10329 to get unit experience value\n8. Read offset [class_struct + 0x78] and shift left 7 bits for base experience\n9. Call Ordinal_11120 to get final skill count\n10. Loop through skill indices (8 iterations, step 4 bytes): load skill data, call FUN_6fb77720 to process\n11. Return void\n\nParameters:\nIMPLICIT ECX: int nUnitId - Unit hash table ID\nIMPLICIT EDX: uint dwUnitData - Unit data pointer or config flag\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value, modifies stack array and executes side effects\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Skill table uses fixed initial values (0x02 and 0xfffffffe) to mark type/state\n- Loop processes 8 skill slots (0x20 / 4 bytes per DWORD)\n- Phantom stack variables (local_58 through local_94) optimized away by compiler\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description\n0x00   | 4    | [0]        | uint | Skill type marker\n0x04   | 4    | [1]        | uint | Skill type marker\n0x08   | 4    | [2]        | uint | Skill data placeholder\n0x0c   | 4    | [3]        | uint | Skill type marker\n0x10   | 4    | [4]        | uint | Skill type marker (0xfffffffe)\n0x14   | 4    | [5]        | uint | Skill type marker (0xfffffffe)\n0x18   | 4    | [6]        | uint | Skill data placeholder\n0x1c   | 4    | [7]        | uint | Skill type marker\n0x20   | 4    | [8]        | uint | Skill data placeholder\n0x24   | 4    | [9]        | uint | Skill type marker\n0x28   | 4    | [10]       | uint | Skill type marker\n0x2c   | 4    | [11]       | uint | Skill type marker\n0x30   | 4    | [12]       | uint | Skill type marker (0xfffffffe)\n0x34   | 4    | [13]       | uint | Skill type marker (0xfffffffe)\n0x38   | 4    | [14]       | uint | Skill type marker (0xfffffffe)\n0x3c   | 4    | [15]       | uint | Skill data (0x1f constant)\n0x40   | 4    | [16]       | uint | Skill data placeholder",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_StatList", "STRUCT_MonsterData", "STRUCT_Path", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_2", "STRUCT_Skill", "STRUCT_Room2", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
