      "comment": "CreateMissileWithRangeScaling - Creates a missile projectile with range-based damage scaling.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Resolve target unit from hash table via GetUnitFromHashTable\n2. Get missile range from unit via GetMissileRange\n3. Return early if no valid target unit found\n4. Initialize projectile config struct (0x16 dwords = 88 bytes)\n5. Set config: flags=1, target unit, skill ID from unit field_4\n6. Get coordinates via Ordinal_10326/10329 (D2Common coordinate functions)\n7. Check for special skills (0xf9, 0xfc, 0xff) - apply 0x8000 flag and scaled damage\n8. Call InitializeAndAllocateProjectile to create missile\n9. Set missile direction based on path target direction\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - Source unit initiating the missile attack\n\nReturns:\n  1 on success (missile created), return value discarded on early exit\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0xf9, 0xfc, 0xff - Special skill IDs requiring damage scaling\n  0x96 (150) - Base damage multiplier for GetMonsterLevelScaledValue\n  0x8000 - Config flag for alternate damage calculation",
