      "comment": "InitializeMissileTrajectory - Sets up missile trajectory using precomputed trigonometric lookup tables.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize trajectory lookup tables with sine/cosine-like values for 64 directions\n2. Get target unit from hash table, exit early if none\n3. Calculate missile range and get target direction\n4. Validate direction is within bounds (0-63)\n5. Look up X/Y velocity components from trajectory tables\n6. Initialize projectile allocation with computed values\n7. Set rotated target direction (offset by 19, wrapped to 64 directions)\n8. Process final unit stats\n\nParameters:\n  pMissile - Pointer to the missile unit being initialized\n\nReturns: void",
