      "comment": "CreateMissileNovaFromUnit - Creates a ring of missiles emanating from a source unit in a nova pattern.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize sine/cosine lookup table with 64 angle offsets for X and Y coordinates\n2. Validate mode parameter (only executes when nMode == 0)\n3. Get target unit from hash table using source unit\n4. Initialize missile creation parameters (flags=2, missile ID=0x106)\n5. Loop through 16 directions, creating missiles at 22.5 degree intervals\n6. For each missile, set the target unit and target unit ID\n\nParameters:\n  pSourceUnit - The unit that is firing the nova pattern missiles\n  nMode - Mode flag, function only executes when 0\n\nReturns: void",
