      "comment": "ProcessUnitQuestOverlayOrProjectile - Processes monster unit data to either initialize a projectile or display a quest overlay.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validates pMonsterData is not null\n2. Gets player slot from unit hash table\n3. If monster type is 1, checks monster init stats for projectile flags\n4. If projectile flags set (offset 0x2F0/0x2F1), initializes projectile data structure\n5. Otherwise checks if player slot has active quest and unit is available\n6. If quest conditions met, initializes overlay with type 0x1A (quest indicator)\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - Pointer to the unit (monster) being processed\n  pMonsterData - Pointer to monster data array, [0]=type, [1]=monster class ID\n\nReturns: void",
