      "comment": "Finalize entity cleanup and prepare for destruction.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call validation check (Ordinal_10378) to determine entity finalization readiness\n2. If validation succeeds (non-zero return):\n   a. Set entity finalization flag to mark for cleanup\n   b. Clear audio context reference to remove audio resources\n   c. Return\n3. If validation fails (zero return):\n   a. Call post-finalization processing routine\n\nParameters:\npEntity (uint *) - IMPLICIT ECX: Pointer to entity/unit structure to finalize\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No explicit return value; operations performed in-place on entity\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Validation success path: performs dual cleanup operations then exits\n- Validation failure path: delegates to alternative processing routine\n- Audio context cleanup critical for resource management\n\nRelated Functions:\n- SetEntityFinalizationFlag() - Marks entity for destruction\n- ClearAudioContextReference() - Cleans up audio resources\n- FUN_6fb771e0() - Post-finalization processing when validation fails\n- Ordinal_10378() - Entity readiness validation check",
