      "comment": "CreateProjectileForUnit - Creates a projectile effect for a given unit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validates skill ID and unit pointer are non-null\n2. Resolves unit from hash table if unit type is not 0 (Monster) or 1 (Player)\n3. Initializes projectile info structure with default values\n4. Sets projectile type to 0xCC and flag to 1\n5. Calls InitializeAndAllocateProjectile to create the projectile\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - Pointer to the unit that will generate the projectile\n  nSkillId - Skill identifier for the projectile\n\nReturns: void",
