      "comment": "MISSILES_UpdateHomingMissileTarget - Updates homing missile targeting logic.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validates missile unit and state\n2. Checks missile flags for targeting mode (single target vs multi-target)\n3. For certain missile types (0x56, 0xC1, 0x149), searches for best matching item\n4. Updates missile target coordinates or target unit\n5. Calculates path to target if within range (< 0x19)\n\nParameters:\n  pMissile - Pointer to the missile UnitAny structure\n  dwSkipOwnerCheck - If non-zero, skips owner validation (used for target switch)\n\nReturns: 1 if targeting failed or invalid, 0 on success",
