      "instructions": ["0xA1220|PUSH|EBP", "0xA1221|PUSH|ESI", "0xA1222|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0xA1224|CALL|0x6fb60ef0", "0xA1229|MOV|EBP, EAX", "0xA122B|TEST|EBP, EBP", "0xA122D|JZ|0x6fb712c4", "0xA1233|MOV|ECX, EBP", "0xA1235|CALL|0x6fb63680", "0xA123A|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0xA123C|JNZ|0x6fb712c4", "0xA1242|PUSH|ESI", "0xA1243|CALL|0x6fb98164", "0xA1248|PUSH|EAX", "0xA1249|CALL|0x6fb98416"],
      "comment": "Validates unit state and processes inter-unit slot interactions for matching attributes.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Retrieve unit pointer from hash table using unit ID parameter\n2. If unit not found or validation fails, call error handler and return\n3. Check if unit's stat data is compressed (return if true)\n4. Fetch unit's slot flags via Ordinal_11141 (bit mask)\n5. If slot flag 0x01 set: Call pre-processing step (FUN_6fb85820)\n6. Load associated unit from slot via Ordinal_10180 using offset 0x38\n7. Validate target unit state\n8. Compare attributes between source and target units\n9. If attributes match: Get comparison count via Ordinal_11124\n10. Verify count is multiple of 5 (count % 5 == 0)\n11. Get distance/relationship via Ordinal_10397 between units\n12. If distance in range [4, 24] (3 < distance < 0x19): Execute interaction Ordinal_10142\n13. Post-processing via FUN_6fb771e0\n14. Error path: Call FUN_6fb773b0 with NULL and flag 0\n\nParameters:\nIMPLICIT ECX - pUnitId: Pointer to unit ID (passed via ECX register per __fastcall)\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Unit not found: Short-circuits to error path\n- State validation failure: Indicates corrupted or invalid unit\n- Compressed data: Returns early (data not accessible)\n- Slot flag check: Only processes if bit 0x01 is set\n- Distance check: Requires strict range [4, 24), rejects boundary values (<=3 or >=25)\n- Multiple of 5: Count must have zero remainder when divided by 5\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x01 - Slot active flag bit mask\n0x38 - Offset into unit structure for associated unit pointer (56 bytes)\n5 - Divisor for count validation (modulo check)\n0x03 - Minimum distance threshold (exclusive)\n0x19 - Maximum distance threshold exclusive (25 decimal)\n0x00 - Error flag for error handler call\n\nCalled Functions:\n- GetUnitFromHashTable: Hash table unit lookup\n- ValidateUnitTypeState: State validation\n- Ordinal_10342: Get unit stat (likely stat ID for checking)\n- Ordinal_10082: Check if data compressed\n- Ordinal_11141: Get slot flags\n- FUN_6fb85820: Pre-processing\n- Ordinal_10180: Load target unit from slot\n- CompareUnitsByAttributes: Attribute matching\n- Ordinal_11124: Get comparison count\n- Ordinal_10397: Get distance/relationship value\n- Ordinal_10142: Execute interaction\n- FUN_6fb771e0: Post-processing\n- FUN_6fb773b0: Error handling",
      "tags": ["PARAM_1"]
    },
