      "api_calls": ["GetRandomBoundedValue", "GetMissileTargetY", "GetMissileRange", "UNITS_GetOwnerGuid", "UNITS_GetUnitY", "GetRandomBoundedValue", "GetRandomBoundedValue"],
      "instructions": ["0xA1380|SUB|ESP, 0x60", "0xA1383|TEST|EDX, EDX", "0xA1385|PUSH|EBP", "0xA1386|PUSH|ESI", "0xA1387|PUSH|EDI", "0xA1388|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0xA138A|JZ|0x6fb713a6", "0xA138C|LEA|ECX, [ESI + 0x2c]", "0xA138F|CALL|0x6fb9810a", "0xA1394|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0xA1396|JZ|0x6fb713a6", "0xA1398|PUSH|ESI", "0xA1399|CALL|0x6fb98ecc", "0xA139E|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0xA13A0|JNZ|0x6fb7146e"],
      "comment": "Apply random offset to unit coordinates with validation\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate input: Check if nValidate is 0 or call RandSeed, then call ValidateUnitState\n2. If validation fails, return immediately\n3. Get unit hash table entry via GetUnitFromHashTable\n4. Initialize 22-dword buffer (dwFlags) with 0x20 in first slot\n5. Get unit stat value via GetUnitStatDisplay, store in dwStat\n6. Get initial X/Y coordinates via Ordinal_10326 (nTemp) and Ordinal_10329 (nY)\n7. Loop nIterations times:\n   - Generate random X offset if nOffsetRadius * 2 != 0, else 0\n   - Generate random Y offset if nOffsetRadius * 2 != 0, else 0\n   - Apply absolute offset: nDeltaX = sign(iVar1 - nOffsetRadius) ? nOffsetRadius : -nOffsetRadius\n   - Apply absolute offset: nDeltaY = sign(iVar2 - nOffsetRadius) ? nOffsetRadius : -nOffsetRadius\n   - Compute final coordinates: nComputedX, nComputedY by adding to base coordinates\n   - Call FUN_6fb77720 with dwFlags buffer (applies computed coordinates to unit)\n8. Return (void)\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit (int *): Unit pointer/ID, stored in ECX (first fastcall parameter)\n  nValidate (int): Validation flag; if 0, skip validation; if non-0, validate unit state\n  nIterations (int): Number of offset iterations to apply\n  nOffsetRadius (int): Maximum offset radius for random offset calculations\n  nInitialValue (int): Initial value (stored in nValue local, used in loop counter)\n\nReturns:\n  void - Side effects only (modifies unit coordinates via FUN_6fb77720)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x16 (22): Number of dwords in buffer (88 bytes total)\n  0x20 (32): Initial flag value in buffer slot 0\n  0x2 (multiply by 2): Check if nOffsetRadius is effectively 0 (nOffsetRadius * 2 == 0)\n\nRelated Calls:\n  Ordinal_10918: RandSeed - generates random number (called twice per iteration)\n  Ordinal_11120: GetUnitStatDisplay - retrieves unit stat value\n  Ordinal_11124: ValidateUnitState - validates unit state after RandSeed\n  Ordinal_10326: GetX - retrieves base X coordinate\n  Ordinal_10329: GetY - retrieves base Y coordinate\n  FUN_6fb77720: ApplyUnitOffset - applies computed offsets to unit\n  GetUnitFromHashTable: Retrieves unit from hash table by unit pointer",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_MonsterData", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
