      "api_calls": ["GetUnitPathCoordMismatchFlag", "UNITS_GetOwnerGuid", "UNITS_GetUnitY", "GetMissileRange", "GetRandomBoundedValue", "GetRandomBoundedValue", "UNITS_GetOwnerGuid", "UNITS_GetUnitY", "UNITS_GetUnitX", "STATLIST_GetUnitOwnerType", "...+2 more"],
      "instructions": ["0xA14A0|SUB|ESP, 0x58", "0xA14A3|PUSH|EBX", "0xA14A4|PUSH|ESI", "0xA14A5|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0xA14A7|CALL|0x6fb60ef0", "0xA14AC|MOV|EBX, EAX", "0xA14AE|TEST|EBX, EBX", "0xA14B0|JNZ|0x6fb714c2", "0xA14B2|PUSH|EAX", "0xA14B3|XOR|EDX, EDX", "0xA14B5|MOV|ECX, ESI", "0xA14B7|CALL|0x6fb773b0", "0xA14BC|POP|ESI", "0xA14BD|POP|EBX", "0xA14BE|ADD|ESP, 0x58"],
      "comment": "Prepares unit stats display buffer for UI rendering\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Retrieve unit record from hash table via GetUnitFromHashTable(pUnit)\n2. If unit invalid, dispatch empty stats via FUN_6fb773b0() and return\n3. Retrieve unit class ID via Ordinal_10234(pUnit[0xe])\n4. If valid class, continue to stats preparation:\n   a. Get current unit X/Y position (Ordinal_10326, Ordinal_10329)\n   b. Initialize display buffer (22 DWORDs cleared, first = 0x21 = item display flags)\n   c. Store unit record pointer and position in buffer\n   d. Get difficulty flag via Ordinal_11120(pUnit)\n   e. Retrieve unit subtype from pUnit[1] to determine stat display ID\n   f. For subtype 0x82: stat ID = 0x14B if pUnit[1] != 0x2d, else 0x163\n   g. For subtype 0x1c4: stat ID = 0x1c7\n   h. For subtype 0x1ca: stat ID = 0x1c9\n   i. For other subtypes: query difficulty seed via Ordinal_10918()\n      - Seed 0 => stat ID = 0x68\n      - Seed 1 => stat ID = 0x69\n      - Seed 2 => stat ID = 0x45\n   j. If difficulty non-zero, set difficulty flag (0x4000 OR)\n   k. Get buffer X/Y position (Ordinal_10326, Ordinal_10329)\n5. Create display item via FUN_6fb77720() passing buffer\n6. If item created successfully:\n   a. Get item X/Y position (Ordinal_10327, Ordinal_10330)\n   b. Set item stat ID via Ordinal_10196(itemStatId, dwX)\n   c. Set item property via Ordinal_10197(itemStatId, dwY)\n7. Finalize unit via FUN_6fb771e0(pUnit)\n\nParameters:\n(implicit ECX) pUnit: Pointer to unit record array (indexed)\n\nReturns:\nvoid (all work via side effects)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x21 - Initial display flag value\n0x38 - Unit class ID field offset\n0x2d - Subtype check for special calculation\n0x14b - Stat ID for subtype 0x82 with special condition\n0x163 - Stat ID for subtype 0x82 without special condition\n0x1c7 - Stat ID for subtype 0x1c4\n0x1c9 - Stat ID for subtype 0x1ca\n0x68, 0x69, 0x45 - Stat IDs by difficulty seed\n0x4000 - Difficulty flag\n\nRelated Functions:\n- GetUnitFromHashTable() - Retrieve unit from hash lookup\n- FUN_6fb773b0() - Handle invalid unit\n- FUN_6fb77720() - Create display item from buffer\n- FUN_6fb771e0() - Finalize unit state",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Path", "STRUCT_Inventory", "STRUCT_Skill", "PARAM_0", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
    },
