      "comment": "UpdateMissileAndSpawnProjectile - Updates a missile unit and spawns a child projectile.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get missile template record and retrieve target unit from missile path\n2. Check if missile remaining duration exceeds template minimum\n3. Verify target unit has coordinate mismatch (moved from original position)\n4. Initialize projectile data structure with flags and parameters\n5. Allocate and spawn new projectile aimed at current target position\n6. Set projectile direction and apply stat modifiers\n7. Process unit stats for the original missile\n\nParameters:\n  pMissile - Pointer to the missile UnitAny being updated\n\nReturns: void",
