      "comment": "MissileSpawnChildWithRandomOffset - Spawns a child projectile from a parent missile with random X/Y offsets.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get target unit from hash table for the parent missile\n2. Check if missile target Y is 0 (no target yet)\n3. If valid target and no current target, initialize projectile structure:\n   - Set missile flags to 2\n   - Set missile ID to 0x11d (285)\n   - Generate random X offset: 20 - random(0,40)\n   - Generate random Y offset: 20 - random(0,40)\n   - If both offsets are 0, set X offset to random(0,19)+1\n4. Create and allocate the child projectile\n5. Set target offsets on the child missile\n6. Adjust parent missile target based on remaining duration:\n   - <125 frames: target value 25\n   - <175 frames: target value 10\n   - >=300 frames: target value 15\n   - else: target value 5\n7. Process unit stats for the parent missile\n\nParameters:\n  pMissile - Pointer to the parent missile UnitAny structure\n\nReturns: void",
