      "comment": "UpdateMissileOscillationPath - Updates a missile's path with oscillation behavior.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Gets the source unit from hash table; if not found, process stats and return\n2. Checks if target unit path has coordinate mismatch\n3. If mismatch found, initializes and allocates a new projectile with callback\n4. Every 3rd frame (duration % 3 == 0), applies random oscillation to path\n5. Randomly selects direction for X/Y offsets based on target Y and field 24\n6. Updates missile position coords with calculated oscillation offset\n7. Recalculates unit path to target\n8. Updates missile target unit and target unit ID\n9. Processes unit stats\n\nParameters:\n  pMissile - Pointer to the missile unit being updated\n\nReturns: void",
