      "comment": "UpdateMissileTracking - Updates missile tracking behavior and position.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get target unit from hash table\n2. If no target found, process stats and exit\n3. If path coordinates mismatch, spawn child projectile (ID 0x12d)\n4. Every 4 frames (duration % 4 == 0), calculate randomized offset\n5. Update position coordinates based on random quadrant\n6. Calculate path and set new target position\n\nParameters:\n  pMissile - Pointer to the missile unit being updated\n\nReturns: void",
