      "instructions": ["0xA1ED0|SUB|ESP, 0x74", "0xA1ED3|PUSH|EBP", "0xA1ED4|PUSH|ESI", "0xA1ED5|MOV|EBP, ECX", "0xA1ED7|PUSH|EDI", "0xA1ED8|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x24], EBP", "0xA1EDC|CALL|0x6fb60ef0", "0xA1EE1|MOV|ESI, EAX", "0xA1EE3|PUSH|EBP", "0xA1EE4|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x14], ESI", "0xA1EE8|CALL|0x6fb98ec0", "0xA1EED|MOV|EDI, EAX", "0xA1EEF|TEST|ESI, ESI", "0xA1EF1|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x20], EDI", "0xA1EF5|JZ|0x6fb721e8"],
      "comment": "MISSILE_InfernoEffectHandler - Visual effect handler for Inferno missile during its lifetime.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Gets owner unit from hash table and remaining duration\n2. Calculates intensity based on duration (0-12 scale)\n3. Creates spark projectiles (0x137) based on intensity with random offsets\n4. On even frames, creates fire wave missiles (0x136) with random spread\n5. At duration 0x13b, initializes game object properties (0x1c3)\n6. Every 25 frames, initializes random state array for 0x134 missile\n7. At duration 0x5a, triggers rendering state and processes stats\n8. During mid-life (0x74-0x13b), creates skill objects with varying intervals\n\nParameters:\n  pMissile - Pointer to the inferno missile UnitAny struct\n\nReturns: void (updates visual state and spawns child effects)",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_Room2", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_ItemData", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData", "STRUCT_StatList", "STRUCT_MonsterData", "PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Path", "STRUCT_Skill", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY"]
