      "api_count": 8,
      "api_calls": ["GetRandomBoundedValue", "GetRandomBoundedValue", "GetRandomBoundedValue", "UNITS_GetOwnerGuid", "UNITS_GetUnitY", "UNITS_GetRoom", "FindRegionByCoordinates", "ValidateRoomAttributeMask"],
      "instructions": ["0xA2200|SUB|ESP, 0x60", "0xA2203|PUSH|EBX", "0xA2204|PUSH|EBP", "0xA2205|PUSH|ESI", "0xA2206|MOV|EBP, EDX", "0xA2208|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0xA220A|PUSH|EDI", "0xA220B|LEA|ECX, [EBP + 0x2c]", "0xA220E|MOV|EDX, 0x3", "0xA2213|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x10], 0x0", "0xA221B|CALL|0x6fb9810a", "0xA2220|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x74]", "0xA2224|MOV|EDX, EAX", "0xA2226|MOV|ECX, 0x16", "0xA222B|XOR|EAX, EAX"],
      "comment": "Create skill object at randomized position within search radius\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize 4-element buffer (adwObjectBuffer) with unit ID at [1], flags at [0]=1\n2. Add offset 0x138 to current tick (dwOffsetTimer = Ordinal_10918() + 0x138)\n3. Calculate search radius squared: iVar5 = nLevel * nLevel\n4. Loop 4 times (nLoopCounter = 0 to 3):\n   a. Check if unit already created (pCreatedUnit != NULL) - if yes, jump to apply attributes\n   b. Get random offset for X: nXOffset = nLevel/2 - Ordinal_10918()\n   c. Get random offset for Y: nYOffset = nLevel/2 - Ordinal_10918()\n   d. Validate distance: if nXOffset^2 + nYOffset^2 >= search_radius_squared, skip to next iteration\n   e. Get terrain type via Ordinal_10326 (X direction component)\n   f. Get terrain offset via Ordinal_10329 (Y direction component)\n   g. Get obstacle object via Ordinal_10342 (returns object at position)\n   h. Validate can walk via Ordinal_10042 (checks collision/walkability at nXOffset, nYOffset)\n   i. Validate line-of-sight via Ordinal_10122 (checks LoS with distance 0 to 1)\n   j. If all checks pass: store coordinates (nXCoord=nXOffset, nYCoord=nYOffset) and create unit\n5. Apply attributes if unit created:\n   a. Call FUN_6fb979a0 (initialize/setup unit)\n   b. If nLevel==8: Set 400 with attribute -0x32 (50 negative)\n   c. Else: Set 200 with attribute -0x19 (25 negative)\n\nParameters:\n- dwUnitId (ECX): Unit type/class ID to create (IMPLICIT - __fastcall)\n- dwSkillId (EDX): Skill identifier or property selector (IMPLICIT - __fastcall)\n- nLevel: Difficulty/power level (1-8) determines search radius and attributes\n\nReturns:\n- void (side effect: creates unit in valid location or no unit if all attempts fail)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Early escape: if valid position found in iterations 1-3, loop exits via conditional at 0x6fb7231b\n- Distance check: avoids spawning within nLevel squares (radius = sqrt(nLevel^2))\n- Level-based attributes: level 8 uses higher negative value (-0x32 vs -0x19)\n- Failure case: if no valid position found after 4 attempts, no unit created",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_MonsterData", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_3", "STRUCT_Skill", "STRUCT_ItemData", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
    },
