      "comment": "CreateRandomProjectile - Creates a projectile with a random skill ID.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get target unit from hash table using source unit\n2. If no target or source unit, exit early\n3. Generate random value 0-4\n4. Add 0x13b (315) to get skill IDs 315-319\n5. Initialize projectile structure with zeroes\n6. Set skill ID, source unit, target unit, and flag\n7. Call InitializeAndAllocateProjectile to create the projectile\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - Pointer to the source unit creating the projectile\n\nReturns: void",
