      "comment": "MissileUpdateMeteor - Updates meteor/fireball missile state each frame.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get light handle and current missile range\n2. Determine missile type (0x85=meteor, 0x234=fireball variant) to select skill ID\n3. Calculate light expansion rate based on skill ID\n4. Expand light radius gradually over missile lifetime\n5. At frame 59: spawn two projectiles at offset coordinates\n6. At frame 2: apply inventory effects and initialize game object properties\n7. Process unit stats at end of each update\n\nParameters:\n  pMissile - Pointer to the missile UnitAny being updated\n\nReturns: void",
