      "instructions": ["0xA28C0|PUSH|EBX", "0xA28C1|PUSH|EBP", "0xA28C2|PUSH|ESI", "0xA28C3|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0xA28C5|PUSH|EDI", "0xA28C6|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESI + 0x4]", "0xA28C9|PUSH|EAX", "0xA28CA|CALL|0x6fb9836e", "0xA28CF|MOV|EDI, dword ptr [ESI + 0x50]", "0xA28D2|MOV|EBX, EAX", "0xA28D4|XOR|EAX, EAX", "0xA28D6|MOV|AL, byte ptr [EBX + 0x61]", "0xA28D9|SAR|EDI, 0x8", "0xA28DC|LEA|ECX, [EAX + -0x1]", "0xA28DF|CMP|EDI, ECX"],
      "comment": "Update animation frame for a unit based on current state and available frames.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get state info via Ordinal_10589: Query animation state data (offsets: 0x61 = max_frames, 0x62 = current_animation_count)\n2. Extract current frame: Read pUnitData[0x50] and shift right 8 bits to get current frame number\n3. Check if update needed: Compare current frame against (max_frames - 1)\n4. If frame matches max: Check animation via Ordinal_11124()\n   - If animation equals max: Clamp frame to (max - 3), validate >= 0, else call Ordinal_10025 (assertion) and set to 0\n   - If animation < max: Decrement frame by 2, clamp to 0 if negative\n5. If frame matches max-1: Get random offset via Ordinal_10918 (RandSeed)\n   - Add random value to current frame, shift and store\n6. Update frame: Store modified frame back to pUnitData[0x50] as (frame << 8)\n7. Apply changes: Call FUN_6fb771e0() to notify system of frame update\n\nOrdinal References:\n- Ordinal_10589: Fetch animation state data structure\n- Ordinal_11124: Query current animation index\n- Ordinal_10918: RandSeed - generate random value for frame offset\n- Ordinal_10025: Assertion/error logging function\n\nParameters:\npUnitData (dword *) - Pointer to unit data structure\n  [0x04]: Unit animation state/mode index\n  [0x50]: Current animation frame (stored as frame_number << 8)\n  [0x14]: Animation frame counter (packed in upper byte)\n\nReturns:\nvoid (modifies pUnitData[0x50] and [0x14] in place)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Negative frame values automatically clamped to 0\n- Frame range: 0 to (max_frames - 1)\n- Animation mismatch triggers 2-frame decrement\n- Ordinal_10918 adds random offset for frame variation",
      "tags": ["PROP_NOCALLER", "MOD_UNIT", "SRC_Missile.cpp", "PARAM_1"]
    },
