      "comment": "HandleWerewolfTransformationEffect - Handles werewolf transformation visual effect for shadow units.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get the master unit from hash table using shadow unit\n2. If no master, initialize equipment slots and return\n3. Check if path coordinates mismatch (transformation trigger)\n4. Get werewolf skill (0xC5/197) from master unit\n5. Build projectile data: flags 0x21, random direction flag 0x4000\n6. Get skill level and set duration (0xB4/180)\n7. Initialize and allocate transformation projectile\n8. Process unit stats\n\nParameters:\n  pShadow - Pointer to shadow unit representing the transformation effect\n\nReturns: void",
