      "comment": "UpdatePetFollowerAI - Updates pet/follower AI behavior including movement and effects.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate path pointer exists (assert on null)\n2. Get target unit (owner) from hash table lookup\n3. If owner invalid, initialize slots and return\n4. Manage lifetime counter (decrement until -20)\n5. If close to owner, adjust position to orbit around them\n6. Periodically spawn visual projectile effects\n7. Process unit stats at end\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - The pet/follower unit to update\n\nReturns: void",
