      "comment": "UpdateMissileTargetingBehavior - Updates missile targeting and spawns child missiles.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get missile target Y position and template record (0x120)\n2. Check if target within effective range, spawn timed spell effect if conditions met\n3. Iterate through room units looking for type 2 objects with IDs 0x11-0x15\n4. For each valid target, spawn additional projectiles via InitializeAndAllocateProjectile\n5. Every 8th tick (Y % 8 == 0), attempt to retarget missile to a new unit\n6. Call ProcessUnitStats to finalize missile state\n\nParameters:\n  pMissile - Pointer to the missile UnitAny being updated\n\nReturns: void",
