      "comment": "SpawnRandomizedProjectile - Creates a projectile (missile type 0x21) with randomized spawn coordinates around a unit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract RNG seed from unit structure (offset 0x2C)\n2. Generate random X/Y offsets (0-19 range) and variance (-3 to +2)\n3. Calculate target coordinates relative to unit position (via Ordinal_10326/10329)\n4. Initialize projectile structure with type 0x21 and calculated positions\n5. Call InitializeAndAllocateProjectile to spawn the missile\n6. Update unit stats via ProcessUnitStats\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - Pointer to unit structure (uses fields at +0x04 for type, +0x2C for RNG seed)\n\nReturns: void",
