      "comment": "CreateMissileFromUnit - Creates and launches a missile projectile from one unit targeting another.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Retrieve the target unit from the hash table using pSourceUnit\n2. If target exists, initialize a MissileParams structure (88 bytes, zeroed)\n3. Set missile ID to 0x177 (375) at offset 0x1c\n4. Set count/flag to 1 at offset 0x30\n5. Store source and target unit pointers in params\n6. Allocate and initialize the missile projectile\n7. Set missile's target to the Y coordinate of pSourceUnit\n\nParameters:\n  pSourceUnit - Pointer to source unit that owns missile data\n\nReturns: void",
