      "comment": "SpawnMissilePattern - Spawns a radial pattern of missiles around a target unit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Gets target unit ID from source missile's target Y coordinate\n2. Verifies target exists and missile has 10 ticks remaining (timer gate)\n3. Loads missile template for ID 0x176 (bone spirit variant)\n4. Initializes offset arrays for X/Y positions defining 14 spawn positions\n5. Loops through pattern, calculating distance-based velocity for each missile\n6. Spawns each missile aimed at target with randomized timing offset\n\nParameters:\n  pMissile - Source missile triggering the pattern spawn\n\nReturns: void (spawned missiles allocated separately)",
