      "comment": "CreateMissileEffectProjectiles - Creates projectile visual effects from a missile source.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Gets missile target Y coordinate and template record for missile type 0x17b\n2. Generates random X/Y offsets (0-20 range, centered at -10)\n3. Creates first projectile (type 0x17c) with offset coordinates\n4. If target Y within template bounds, creates second projectile (type 0x17e)\n5. Sets GFX info with random Z offset for second projectile\n6. Processes unit stats to finalize missile state\n\nParameters:\n  pMissile - Source missile unit to create effect projectiles from\n\nReturns: void",
