      "comment": "MissileSpawnChildProjectiles - Spawns child projectiles from a parent missile at intervals.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get current missile Y position and missile template record (ID 0x14c/332)\n2. Check if missile reached spawn trigger height, set target unit ID if so\n3. If missile field24 is set and position is at spawn interval, spawn child projectiles\n4. Generate random X/Y offsets (0-20 range) for projectile spread\n5. Initialize projectile struct with missile ID 0x124 (292) and spawn flags\n6. Call InitializeAndAllocateProjectile to create child missile\n7. Process unit stats for the parent missile\n\nParameters:\n  pMissile - Pointer to the parent missile UnitAny structure\n\nReturns: void",
