      "comment": "SpawnHitEffectProjectiles - Spawns visual hit effect projectiles based on hit type.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Gets hit effect type from missile target Y value\n2. If type is 0x96 (150), sets special rendering state\n3. Iterates through hit effect table matching type values\n4. Creates projectiles with direction and target based on table data\n5. For type < 0xA5 and even values, creates dust effect projectile (0x153)\n6. For type < 0x96, creates blood splatter projectile (0x96) with random offset\n7. Finalizes by processing unit stats\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - Unit to spawn hit effects for\n\nReturns: void",
