      "comment": "SpawnMultipleSubProjectiles - Spawns multiple sub-projectiles with randomized positions.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Early return if nSpawnMode is non-zero\n2. Initialize RNG seed from missile's nState field using MissileGetField24\n3. Get sub-projectile count from MISSILES_GetMissileTargetY\n4. Initialize projectile configuration buffer (0x16 dwords)\n5. Loop up to dwSubProjectileCount times:\n   - Generate random X offset in range [-10, +9]\n   - Generate random Y offset in range [-10, +9]\n   - Skip spawn if offset is exactly (0, 0) to avoid duplicate center\n   - Call InitializeAndAllocateProjectile to create sub-projectile\n   - Apply text control max value clamp to projectile\n\nParameters:\n  pMissile - Parent missile unit to spawn sub-projectiles from\n  nSpawnMode - Spawn mode flag (must be 0 to spawn)\n\nReturns: void\n\nNotes:\n  - 0x21 = projectile config type\n  - 0x15d = projectile type ID\n  - 0x14 (20) = random offset range for X/Y spread",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_MonsterData", "STRUCT_Path", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_2", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
