      "comment": "ProcessUnitStatProjectileSpawn - Checks unit stat value against threshold table and spawns a projectile if conditions met.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Gets target Y coordinate as stat value from missile data\n2. Looks up appropriate threshold entry in g_ProjectileSpawnThresholds table\n3. Checks if stat value is evenly divisible by the corresponding divisor\n4. If divisible, retrieves source unit and creates projectile with missile ID from table\n5. Sets target unit and ID on the spawned missile\n6. Always calls ProcessUnitStats at the end\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - Pointer to the unit being processed\n\nReturns: void",
