      "comment": "SpawnScatterMissiles - Creates scattered projectiles based on missile target Y coordinate.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Gets target Y coordinate from missile\n2. Looks up scatter parameters from table based on Y threshold\n3. If Y divisible by table divisor, spawns multiple scattered missiles\n4. Each scatter missile gets random X/Y offset (-5 to +5, avoiding 0)\n5. Sets target unit based on Y value (3 if Y<25, 2 if Y<=74)\n6. For Y<2, creates audio context and overlay data\n7. Processes final unit stats\n\nParameters:\n  pMissile - Source missile unit to spawn scatter from\n\nReturns: void",
