      "comment": "CreateChildMissileFromTarget - Spawns a new child missile based on an existing missile's target.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Exit early if nParam is non-zero\n2. Get target record ID from source missile\n3. Find target missile unit in link list (type 3 = missile)\n4. Initialize missile configuration structure (0x16 dwords zeroed)\n5. Set missile flags (0xa021), type (0x160), and spawn count (1)\n6. Get owner unit and target Y position\n7. Allocate and initialize new projectile\n8. Set target unit on the new missile\n\nParameters:\n  pSourceMissile - Pointer to source missile unit\n  nParam - Control parameter (must be 0 to proceed)\n\nReturns: void",
