      "comment": "UpdateMissileHomingBehavior - Updates homing missile tracking behavior and visual effects.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get missile's current tracking state and target unit ID\n2. Find target unit using link list lookup\n3. Calculate distance to target and random bounce threshold\n4. State machine handling:\n   - State 0: Close enough -> transition to state 1\n   - State 1: Adjust position towards target\n   - State 2: Fade effect with color tint (0xAA+ range)\n   - State 3: Brighten effect with random color\n   - State 4: Glow effect (fixed 400 intensity)\n5. Set animation rate based on state\n6. Calculate path to target unit\n\nParameters:\n  pMissile - Pointer to the missile UnitAny being updated\n\nReturns: void",
