      "comment": "SpawnRandomUnitVisualEffect - Spawns a random visual projectile effect on a unit with 25% chance.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get unit state value via GetMissileTargetY and check if (value & 3) == 0 (25% chance)\n2. If triggered, initialize projectile config struct (0x58 bytes, 0x16 dwords)\n3. Set missile ID 0x2521 (ambient visual effect) and skill ID 0x162 (354)\n4. Get unit base coordinates via Ordinal_10326/10329\n5. Apply random X offset (0-12 range) and Y offset (-6 to +6 from base)\n6. Call InitializeAndAllocateProjectile to spawn the visual effect\n7. Always call ProcessUnitStats at the end regardless of spawn\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - Unit to potentially spawn visual effect on\n\nReturns: void",
