      "comment": "CreateMissileFromUnit - Creates a missile/projectile from a source unit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Early exit if nFlag is non-zero (condition check)\n2. Get missile range from source unit\n3. Resolve actual unit from hash table if needed\n4. Initialize projectile data structure (0x16 dwords zeroed)\n5. Allocate projectile with range and owner info\n6. Set missile direction based on path target\n7. Set target unit for missile tracking\n\nParameters:\n  pSourceUnit - Source unit creating the missile\n  nFlag - Condition flag, must be 0 for missile creation\n\nReturns: void (creates missile as side effect)",
