      "comment": "SpawnDualEffectProjectiles - Spawns two visual effect projectiles around a unit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get unit from hash table, return if not found\n2. Initialize 0x58-byte projectile data structure to zeros\n3. Set flags to 1 (preset coord mode) and store source unit\n4. Get missile range from source unit\n5. Get unit coordinates via D2Common ordinals\n6. Spawn first projectile with missile ID 0x244\n7. Spawn second projectile with missile ID 0x26f\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - Source unit to spawn projectiles around\n\nReturns: void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x16 (22) - Number of dwords to zero (22 * 4 = 0x58 bytes)\n  0x244 (580) - First projectile missile ID\n  0x26f (623) - Second projectile missile ID",
