      "comment": "CreateAreaEffectProjectiles - Creates area effect projectiles for a unit's skill.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get missile range for the unit via GetMissileRange\n2. Calculate iteration count using GetMonsterSkillId(0x120, range)\n3. Process area positions via ProcessSkillAreaPositions with effect type 0x19c\n4. Resolve unit from hash table if unit type is not 0 or 1 (player/NPC)\n5. Initialize projectile config struct (0x58 bytes zeroed)\n6. Set struct size (0x20), projectile type (0x1d), and flag (1)\n7. Call InitializeAndAllocateProjectile with the config\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - Source unit creating the area effect projectiles\n\nReturns: void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x120 = Monster/skill type constant for skill ID lookup\n  0x19c = Area effect type constant\n  0x16 = Loop count (22 dwords = 0x58 bytes)\n  0x20 = Struct size field\n  0x1d = Projectile type ID (29 decimal)\n  nIterations/4 = Stride for position randomization",
