      "comment": "HandleMissileTimedBehavior - Handles timed behavior phases for missiles.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check missile's remaining duration\n2. At duration 20 (0x14): Spawn 4 projectiles with random offset positions\n3. At duration 45 (0x2D): Set owner unit flags and spawn a child projectile\n4. Process unit stats at end\n\nParameters:\n  pMissile - Pointer to the missile UnitAny\n\nReturns: void",
