      "api_calls": ["MISSILES_GetMissileTargetY", "GetRandomBoundedValue", "MISSILE_GetRemainingDuration", "MissileSetTargetUnit", "MissileSetTargetUnit", "MissileSetTargetUnit", "MissileSetTargetUnit"],
      "instructions": ["0xA5220|PUSH|ESI", "0xA5221|PUSH|EDI", "0xA5222|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0xA5224|CALL|0x6fb60ef0", "0xA5229|MOV|EDI, EAX", "0xA522B|PUSH|ESI", "0xA522C|CALL|0x6fb98eb4", "0xA5231|TEST|EDI, EDI", "0xA5233|JZ|0x6fb752e2", "0xA5239|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0xA523B|JNZ|0x6fb752da", "0xA5241|MOV|EDX, 0x2", "0xA5246|LEA|ECX, [ESI + 0x2c]", "0xA5249|CALL|0x6fb9810a", "0xA524E|TEST|EAX, EAX"],
      "comment": "Determines and applies appropriate skill mode to a game unit based on game state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Retrieve unit data from hash table using unit ID\n2. Call Ordinal_11141 to check if unit has initial state/condition\n3. If unit exists and condition check returns 0:\n   a. Call Ordinal_10918 (RandSeed) to generate random value\n   b. Set skill mode based on random result: 0x1a6 if random==0, else 0x1a0\n   c. Apply selected mode via FUN_6fb752f0\n   d. Query current skill value via Ordinal_11125\n   e. Map skill value to mode number using threshold comparisons:\n      - 0x00..0x95 (150): mode 0x13 (19 decimal)\n      - 0x96..0xC7 (150-199): mode 0x0E (14 decimal)  \n      - 0xC8..0xE0 (200-224): mode 0x09 (9 decimal)\n      - 0xE1+ (225+): computed mode = (skill>=0x177 ? -1 : 0) & 0xFFFFFFEC + 0x19\n   f. Apply mode value - 1 via Ordinal_11140\n   g. Call FUN_6fb771e0 to finalize/render\n4. If unit not found or condition failed, skip mode setting\n5. Always call FUN_6fb771e0 at exit\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit (dword *): Pointer to unit ID/handle (ECX register - __fastcall)\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nOrdinals Used:\n  Ordinal_11141: Check unit initial condition (D2Common - unknown exact function)\n  Ordinal_10918: RandSeed - Generate random number seed (D2Common)\n  Ordinal_11125: Query unit skill value (D2Common - unknown exact function)\n  Ordinal_11140: Set unit mode/animation (D2Common - unknown exact function)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x1A0, 0x1A6: Skill mode enum values\n  0x96 (150), 0xC8 (200), 0xE1 (225): Skill value thresholds for mode mapping\n  0x177 (375): Upper threshold for computed mode formula\n  0x13, 0x0E, 0x09: Skill mode constants",
      "tags": ["PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_1"]
    },
