      "comment": "CreateProjectilesForUnit - Creates two projectile visual effects for a unit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initializes a 22-dword projectile parameter structure to zero\n2. Gets the unit from hash table using the unit ID\n3. Creates first projectile with ID 0x25C (604)\n4. Creates second projectile with ID 0x26D (621)\n5. Sets drawable coordinates for the second projectile if created\n\nParameters:\n  pUnitId - Pointer to the unit ID\n\nReturns: void",
