      "instructions": ["0xA54E0|SUB|ESP, 0x58", "0xA54E3|PUSH|EBX", "0xA54E4|PUSH|EBP", "0xA54E5|PUSH|ESI", "0xA54E6|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0xA54E8|CALL|0x6fb60ef0", "0xA54ED|MOV|EBX, EAX", "0xA54EF|PUSH|ESI", "0xA54F0|CALL|0x6fb98ec0", "0xA54F5|TEST|EBX, EBX", "0xA54F7|MOV|EBP, EAX", "0xA54F9|JNZ|0x6fb75509", "0xA54FB|MOV|ECX, ESI", "0xA54FD|CALL|0x6fb771e0", "0xA5502|POP|ESI"],
      "comment": "ProcessMissilePeriodicEffects - Handles periodic visual effects for missiles.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Gets owner unit from hash table and remaining duration\n2. If no owner, processes unit stats and returns\n3. Initializes drawable objects for missile-owner relationship\n4. Every 20 frames after frame 60: spawns spark effect (missile 0x11d) with random offset\n5. At exactly frame 25: spawns two flame projectiles (missiles 0x269, 0x26a) at owner position\n\nParameters:\n  pMissile - The missile unit to process effects for\n\nReturns: void",
