      "comment": "ProcessMissileDescentEffects - Handles visual effects for descending missiles based on Y coordinate.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get target unit from hash table, early exit if none\n2. Get missile's target Y coordinate\n3. Check against level thresholds table (g_aDescentLevelThresholds)\n4. Spawn additional \"spark\" missiles at interval based on threshold\n5. Set targeting mode based on height (2 if below 0xD2, else 1)\n6. Switch on specific Y values (0x145, 0x177, 0x1A9, 0x1C2) to spawn level-specific effects\n7. If missile has field24 set, spawn ground drop effect at random offset\n8. Process unit stats on exit\n\nParameters:\n  pMissile - Missile unit to process descent effects for\n\nReturns: void",
