      "comment": "UpdateMissileSeekingBehavior - Updates missile seeking/homing behavior based on state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get missile's seek state (field 0x24) and target unit ID\n2. Look up target unit via FindLinkListNodeByIdAndIndex (type 3 = missile target)\n3. If no target found, process stats and return\n4. Based on seek state:\n   - State 0: Random chance to enable animation flag and rate (0xF00)\n   - State 1: Calculate delta position from target and update path\n   - State 2: Set fixed position (0x3B1F, 0x170C) and animation rate\n5. Update missile position and path to target\n\nParameters:\n  pMissile - Pointer to missile unit being updated\n\nReturns: void",
