      "comment": "CreateProjectileFromUnit - Creates a projectile/missile from the given unit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Gets target unit from hash table using source unit\n2. Initializes projectile parameters struct (0x16 dwords zeroed)\n3. Sets missile ID to 500 and gets missile range\n4. Allocates and initializes projectile via InitializeAndAllocateProjectile\n5. Sets projectile target X offset to 0x40\n6. Gets path direction from source and sets projectile direction\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - Pointer to the source unit creating the projectile\n\nReturns: void",
