      "comment": "ConfigureMissilePattern - Configures a missile pattern structure for projectile rendering.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract missile type from unit field (field_4)\n2. Initialize 22-dword pattern structure to zeros\n3. Set structure type to 3 (missile pattern marker)\n4. Call D2Common ordinals to set up context\n5. Get owner unit from hash table\n6. Check missile type: 0x1B6 -> skill ID 0x1B8, iterations 18; else -> skill ID 0x1B1, iterations 10\n7. Get missile range from unit data\n8. Store callback pointer (ApplyTextControlMaxValueClamp)\n9. Call ApplyDCTTransform to generate pattern coefficients\n\nParameters:\n  pMissile - Pointer to missile UnitAny structure\n\nReturns: void",
