      "comment": "ProcessMissileExplosionEffects - Handles visual effects during missile explosion lifecycle.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get owner unit from hash table and remaining missile duration\n2. If duration < 110, create projectiles based on time intervals\n3. At duration 0: Create single 0x214 projectile if owner exists\n4. At duration 50-78: Create 1 projectile, at 79+: Create 5 projectiles\n5. Each projectile gets random offset (0-100) and random frame (2-9)\n6. At duration 5: Set rendering state (600, 4000, 3000)\n7. Every 7th frame: Try to spawn debris at random room tile positions\n8. Process unit stats at end\n\nParameters:\n  pMissile - Pointer to the missile unit being processed\n\nReturns: void",
