      "comment": "SpawnMissileTrailProjectile - Spawns trailing projectiles from an active missile.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Gets the missile's remaining duration\n2. Every 3rd frame (duration % 3 == 0), spawns a trail projectile\n3. Calculates random X/Y offsets (0-19 range, centered at -10)\n4. Gets missile's current coordinates via D2COMMON ordinals\n5. Initializes projectile structure with type 0x21, sub-type 0x21e\n6. Calls InitializeAndAllocateProjectile to spawn the trail effect\n7. Always calls ProcessUnitStats on the missile\n\nParameters:\n  pMissile - Pointer to the missile unit spawning trail effects\n\nReturns: void",
