      "comment": "ProcessMonsterProjectileAI - Handles special monster projectile AI behavior.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Gets missile template record and target Y coordinate\n2. Initializes RNG seed from missile state\n3. Randomly selects behavior type (0 or 1)\n4. If behavior 0: Creates child projectile (missile 0x223) at random offset\n5. If behavior 1: Initializes skill charge table (skill 0x225)\n6. Processes unit stats on completion\n\nParameters:\n  pMissile - Pointer to the missile unit triggering this AI\n\nReturns: void",
