      "comment": "ProcessMissileTargetTracking - Updates missile target tracking and spawns child projectiles.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get missile target Y position and current tracking counter (field 24)\n2. Retrieve source and target units from hash table\n3. If target exists and is valid unit type (player/NPC), sync path to target\n4. Otherwise initialize equipment slots for missile\n5. Calculate unit coordinates for path finding\n6. If counter < target threshold, increment counter\n7. Otherwise spawn child projectile with full configuration (flags 0x228)\n8. Update missile target unit ID and process stats\n\nParameters:\n  pMissile - Missile unit to process target tracking for\n\nReturns: void\n\nNotes:\n- 0x228 flags = preset coords | adjust target | custom damage | scale damage\n- Path type 0xE = projectile homing path\n- local_5c array holds 0x16 (22) ints for projectile data config",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_StatList", "STRUCT_MonsterData", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
