      "api_calls": ["MISSILE_GetRemainingDuration", "FogAssert", "MISSILES_GetMissileTargetY", "InitRngSeed", "MissileGetField24", "GetRandomBoundedValue", "FogAssert", "UNITS_GetUnitY", "UNITS_GetOwnerGuid", "SetPositionCoords", "...+4 more"],
      "instructions": ["0xA6F70|PUSH|EBX", "0xA6F71|PUSH|EBP", "0xA6F72|PUSH|ESI", "0xA6F73|MOV|EBX, ECX", "0xA6F75|PUSH|EDI", "0xA6F76|PUSH|EBX", "0xA6F77|CALL|0x6fb98ec0", "0xA6F7C|CDQ|", "0xA6F7D|MOV|ECX, 0x3", "0xA6F82|IDIV|ECX", "0xA6F84|TEST|EDX, EDX", "0xA6F86|JNZ|0x6fb77086", "0xA6F8C|LEA|EDI, [EBX + 0x2c]", "0xA6F8F|TEST|EDI, EDI", "0xA6F91|JNZ|0x6fb76fb1"],
      "comment": "Renders a path (line segment) on the game surface at specified coordinates with offset calculations.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call Ordinal_11125(pPath) to get path divisor\n2. Check if result % 3 == 0; exit if not\n3. Validate pPath != 0xffffffd4 (invalid pointer check)\n4. Call Ordinal_11141, Ordinal_10913 for initialization\n5. Call Ordinal_11143(pPath) to get coordinate pair (nCoordX, nCoordY) as packed uint\n6. Extract low word (nCoordY) and high word (nCoordX) using MOVSX and shift\n7. Call Ordinal_10918() to determine coordinate negation (returns non-zero if invert)\n8. Calculate scaled offsets: nOffsetY = ±nCoordY + nCoordY*4, nOffsetX = ±nCoordX + nCoordX*4\n9. Round-divide both offsets by 4 using CDQ/AND trick (arithmetic right shift with adjustment)\n10. Ensure both offsets >= 1 (set to 1 if zero)\n11. Validate dwSurfaceHandle (pPath[0x38] == pPath+0x38) non-zero; abort if null\n12. Call Ordinal_10329(pPath) to get offset base, add nOffsetX\n13. Call Ordinal_10326(pPath) to get second offset component\n14. Call Ordinal_10170(dwSurfaceHandle, second+nOffsetY, first+nOffsetX)\n15. Call Ordinal_10142(dwSurfaceHandle, pPath, 0) for cleanup\n16. Call Ordinal_10914() to get state value\n17. Call Ordinal_11140, Ordinal_11142 to update path state with offsets\n18. Call FUN_6fb771e0(pPath) for post-rendering finalization\n\nParameters:\npPath (uint *): Pointer to path data structure (ECX register - __fastcall); accessed at offset 0x2c (state ptr), 0x38 (surface handle)\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Early exit at 0x6fb77086 if path divisor % 3 != 0\n- Double validation: checks pPath pointer validity and surface handle existence\n- Coordinate inversion determined by Ordinal_10918() return value (0 vs non-zero)\n- Minimum offset values enforced (1 if calculated result is 0)\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x3 (3): Path divisor modulo check\n0xffffffd4: Invalid/null path pointer sentinel\n0x2c: Offset to path state field\n0x38: Offset to surface handle field\n0x185b, 0x1877: Error line numbers in source\n0x4: Coordinate scaling factor (multiply before division)\n0x1f: Sign extension bit for arithmetic operations\n0x10: Shift distance for coordinate extraction and packing\n0xffff: Bitmask for word isolation in 32-bit values",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "MOD_UNIT", "SRC_Missile.cpp", "STRUCT_ItemData", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control"]
    },
