      "instructions": ["0xA70A0|PUSH|ECX", "0xA70A1|PUSH|ESI", "0xA70A2|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0xA70A4|PUSH|ESI", "0xA70A5|CALL|0x6fb98ec0", "0xA70AA|AND|EAX, 0x80000001", "0xA70AF|JNS|0x6fb770b6", "0xA70B1|DEC|EAX", "0xA70B2|OR|EAX, 0xfffffffe", "0xA70B5|INC|EAX", "0xA70B6|JNZ|0x6fb77100", "0xA70B8|PUSH|EBX", "0xA70B9|PUSH|EBP", "0xA70BA|MOV|EBP, dword ptr [ESI + 0x38]", "0xA70BD|PUSH|EDI"],
      "comment": "UpdateMissilePathPosition - Updates missile path and position every other frame.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if missile duration is even (update every 2 frames)\n2. If even frame, get missile's path pointer and current position\n3. Calculate delta position from target coordinates\n4. Update path position coords toward target\n5. Recalculate unit path to target\n6. Always process unit stats at end\n\nParameters:\n  pMissile - Pointer to missile unit to update\n\nReturns: void",
