      "instructions": ["0xA7110|PUSH|EBP", "0xA7111|PUSH|ESI", "0xA7112|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0xA7114|MOV|EBP, dword ptr [ESI + 0x4]", "0xA7117|PUSH|EBP", "0xA7118|CALL|0x6fb9836e", "0xA711D|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0xA711F|JNZ|0x6fb7713f", "0xA7121|PUSH|0x1b49", "0xA7126|PUSH|0x6fbcdd80", "0xA712B|PUSH|0x6fbb1418", "0xA7130|CALL|0x6fb99a7a", "0xA7135|ADD|ESP, 0xc", "0xA7138|PUSH|-0x1", "0xA713A|CALL|0x6fb9a10f"],
      "comment": "Process audio context lighting updates and resource transformations for a unit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load unit resource index from parameter\n2. Validate audio data exists via Ordinal_10589(D2Common.GetUnitOvdType); abort if missing\n3. Check audio context bit 0x11 for validity\n4. If valid, get unit audio context pointer (offset 0x88)\n5. Verify audio context exists and resource flags (0x300 mask) are clear\n6. Get current audio processed samples count via GetAudioContextProcessedSamples\n7. Compare byte at audio_data + 0x10 with sample count\n8. If sample count sufficient AND audio_data + 0x78 positive, update lighting\n   - Call Ordinal_10918() to get seed value\n   - Call SetLightRadius() with context and (samples + seed)\n9. Retrieve transformation codes via three Ordinals:\n   - Ordinal_10342(D2Common.GetUnitStat)\n   - Ordinal_10329(D2Common transform B)\n   - Ordinal_10326(D2Common transform C)\n10. Combine transformations with Ordinal_10042(Storm.dll)\n11. Check result via Ordinal_10082(validate)\n12. If invalid, call FUN_6fb773b0 to process slot and return\n13. If valid, call function pointer table at EDI [resource_index * 5]\n\nParameters:\npUnitData - Pointer to unit structure (ECX register)\n  Offset 0x4: Resource index (retrieved as dwResourceIndex)\n  Offset 0x50: Flags (checked for 0x300 mask)\n  Offset 0x88: Audio context pointer\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Audio data validation failure (offset 0x11 check) triggers warning abort via Ordinal_10023(Storm.dll)\n- Handles invalid transformation codes by calling processor function\n- Silent return if function pointer table entry is NULL\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x1b49 - Error line number for abort message\n0x4 - Resource index offset in unit data\n0x11 - Audio validation offset in audio data\n0x10 - Sample count threshold offset\n0x78 - Audio property offset\n0x50 - Unit flags offset (0x300 mask checks bits 8-9)\n0x88 - Audio context pointer offset\n0x2c - Light radius field offset (ESI + 0x2c)\n0x5 - Function pointer table stride (5 entries per resource)\n\nOrdinal Calls:\n- Ordinal_10589: D2Common.GetUnitOvdType\n- Ordinal_10023: Storm.dll log error function\n- Ordinal_10918: Random seed generator\n- Ordinal_10342: D2Common.GetUnitStat\n- Ordinal_10329: D2Common stat function B\n- Ordinal_10326: D2Common stat function C\n- Ordinal_10042: Storm.dll combine transformation codes\n- Ordinal_10082: Validate combined transformation result",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "MOD_UNIT", "SRC_Missile.cpp", "STRUCT_ItemData", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_Other", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control"]
