      "api_count": 10,
      "api_calls": ["GetEntityField", "GetLevelDataEntry", "GetRandomBoundedValue", "GetMonsterInitStatsPtr", "GetRandomBoundedValue", "CopyOrInitCoords", "GetMonsterInitStatsPtr", "GetRandomBoundedValue", "GetRandomBoundedValue", "GetRoomAttributeModeValue"],
      "instructions": ["0xA8060|SUB|ESP, 0x48", "0xA8063|PUSH|EBX", "0xA8064|PUSH|EBP", "0xA8065|PUSH|ESI", "0xA8066|MOV|EBX, ECX", "0xA8068|PUSH|EDI", "0xA8069|PUSH|EBX", "0xA806A|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x1c], EBX", "0xA806E|CALL|0x6fb98140", "0xA8073|XOR|ESI, ESI", "0xA8075|CMP|EAX, ESI", "0xA8077|JZ|0x6fb781fe", "0xA807D|PUSH|EAX", "0xA807E|CALL|0x6fb9813a", "0xA8083|CMP|EBX, ESI"],
      "comment": "Processes unit spawn slots in a game state/level.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get game state from Ordinal_10057 and retrieve its data via Ordinal_10631\n2. Initialize slot pointer to offset 0x14C in the data structure\n3. Loop through 5 slots:\n   a. Check if slot is active (non-zero), exit if inactive\n   b. Get random seed from Ordinal_10918 and compare against slot threshold\n   c. If below threshold, proceed to spawn units\n   d. Get slot data via Ordinal_10582 and calculate spawn count\n   e. Calculate actual spawn count: base + optional seed offset, multiplied by slot multiplier\n4. For each spawn count, attempt to find valid coordinates:\n   a. Get base coordinates from Ordinal_10034 (cell file coordinates)\n   b. Calculate spawn rectangle boundaries (width = local_1c-1, height = local_18-1)\n   c. Up to 10 attempts to find valid spawn location using Ordinal_10119\n   d. Once valid location found, allocate and initialize unit via AllocateAndInitializeUnit\n5. Continue to next slot\n\nParameters:\ndwGameState (uint, IMPLICIT ECX): Game state/level ID for spawning context\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value, modifies game state in-place by creating units\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Slot threshold check (puVar10[5]) gates unit spawning\n- Slot may be inactive (first check at 0x6fb780a4)\n- Spawn count can be 0 if disabled slot multiplier\n- Max 10 spawn attempts per unit to find valid location\n- Coordinates adjusted by offsets from Ordinal_10034 call\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x14C - Offset to slot array base pointer in game data\n0x64 - Parameter to Ordinal_10918 (possibly seed range)\n0x1CC, 0x1CB - Offset to bytes used in spawn calculation\n0x28 - Offset to slot multiplier in slot data (offset 0x28 = puVar10[10])\n0x190 - Offset to spawn data in unit structure\n0x3F11 - Flag/parameter passed to Ordinal_10119 (validation check)\n0x5 - Number of slots to process\n0xA (10) - Maximum spawn location attempts\n\nOrdinal Comments:\nOrdinal_10057 - Get/retrieve object from game state\nOrdinal_10631 - Extract data pointer from object\nOrdinal_10918 - Random seed/RNG generator\nOrdinal_10582 - Get data for slot/unit\nOrdinal_10034 - Load cell coordinates from resource\nOrdinal_10119 - Validate spawn position (returns 0 if valid)\nAllocateAndInitializeUnit - Create unit at coordinates",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_StatList", "STRUCT_Path", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "STRUCT_Skill", "STRUCT_ItemData", "PARAM_1", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
