      "comment": "Add value to first empty slot in slot table.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize pointer to start of 8-element slot table (g_apSlotTable)\n2. Loop through up to 8 slots, checking if slot is NULL (0x0)\n3. If NULL slot found, store param_1 into that slot and return\n4. Continue loop until all 8 slots checked\n5. If no empty slot found, return without storing\n\nParameters:\nparam_1 (int) - Value to store in the first empty slot\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value. Success implicit if slot was empty.\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If all 8 slots are filled, function returns without storing value\n- Does not validate param_1 is non-zero before storing\n- Slot table size is fixed at 8 elements",
