      "comment": "Search and clear an active slot from the global active slots array.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize pointer pdwSlot to g_adwActiveSlots array\n2. Initialize loop counter nIndex to 0\n3. Loop: Compare current array element (*pdwSlot) with nSlotId\n4. If match found, clear the element to 0 and return\n5. Otherwise, advance pointer to next array element (+ 4 bytes)\n6. Increment counter and continue loop while nIndex < 8\n7. Exit loop if no match found after 8 iterations\n\nParameters:\n  nSlotId (int, ECX): Slot identifier to search for and clear\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value, modifies g_adwActiveSlots in place\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Array has fixed size of 8 elements (32 bytes total)\n  - No validation if nSlotId not found - function silently returns\n  - Operates on global data structure, no local state\n\nStructure Layout:\n  Offset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description\n  0x0    | 4    | [0]        | dword| First slot element\n  0x4    | 4    | [1]        | dword| Second slot element\n  0x8    | 4    | [2]        | dword| Third slot element\n  0xC    | 4    | [3]        | dword| Fourth slot element\n  0x10   | 4    | [4]        | dword| Fifth slot element\n  0x14   | 4    | [5]        | dword| Sixth slot element\n  0x18   | 4    | [6]        | dword| Seventh slot element\n  0x1C   | 4    | [7]        | dword| Eighth slot element",
      "tags": ["PARAM_1", "PROP_LEAF", "PROP_SMALL"]
