      "comment": "Clear all 8 active slot status flags\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize loop counter to 8\n2. Clear EAX register (XOR)\n3. Set EDI to base address of g_adwActiveSlots array (0x6fbff2ac)\n4. Use REP STOSD to fill 32 bytes (8 DWORDs) with zero\n5. Restore EDI and return\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value, clears g_adwActiveSlots in-place\n\nSpecial Cases:\nMagic Numbers - Loop count: 0x8 (8 DWORDs = 32 bytes)",
