      "globals": ["0xFFFFFFFF90530000||", "0xFFFFFFFF9053000C||", "0x12F2AC|g_adwActiveSlots|0x0", "0xFFFFFFFF9052FFDC||", "0x12F2B0|DAT_6fbff2b0|0x0", "0xFFFFFFFF90530004||", "0xFFFFFFFF9052FFE4||", "0xFFFFFFFF9052FFE8||", "0xA874C|switchdataD_6fb7874c|0x0", "0xA8734|switchdataD_6fb78734|6fb78510", "0xFFFFFFFF9052FFE0||", "0xA87D0|UpdateClosestUnitCandidate|", "0xFFFFFFFF90530008||", "0xFFFFFFFF9053001C||"],
      "api_count": 17,
      "api_calls": ["GetUnitDistanceApprox", "UNITS_GetOwnerGuid", "UNITS_GetUnitY", "UNITS_GetOwnerGuid", "UNITS_GetUnitY", "GetMonsterInitStatsPtr", "IsValidEntityState", "GetMonsterInitStatsPtr", "GetRandomBoundedValue", "UpdateUnitTileAttributes", "...+7 more"],
      "instructions": ["0xA82F0|SUB|ESP, 0x24", "0xA82F3|PUSH|EBX", "0xA82F4|PUSH|ESI", "0xA82F5|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0xA82F7|PUSH|EDI", "0xA82F8|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESI + 0x70]", "0xA82FB|CALL|0x6fb796c0", "0xA8300|MOV|ECX, EAX", "0xA8302|CALL|0x6fb5a350", "0xA8307|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [EAX]", "0xA8309|TEST|ECX, ECX", "0xA830B|JLE|0x6fb78317", "0xA830D|DEC|ECX", "0xA830E|POP|EDI", "0xA830F|POP|ESI"],
      "comment": "Process spell input for a unit and apply spell effects based on spell type and unit state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get spell counter from unit data, decrement if counter > 0, return early if non-zero (skip processing)\n2. Iterate through 8 active unit slots to find nearest unit with valid state (not NULL, state != 0 and != 0xc)\n3. Calculate distance using Ordinal_10397, track nearest unit and minimum distance (0x7fffffff initially)\n4. If no nearest unit found, get game context as fallback, or return error (0x19) with spell IDs\n5. If distance > 0x1e (30), calculate delay: (distance - 0xf, cap at 200), store in counter, apply spell IDs\n6. Check unit flag at offset 0x35a for special state:\n   - If set, check Ordinal_11064 for active flag, verify param_1[3] == 1\n   - Check offset 0x1eb for second state flag\n   - If both cleared, use random seed (Ordinal_10918): distribute effects by time ranges\n     * 0x27 < seed < 0x3c: Call FUN_6fb78820 with slot 6\n     * 0x3c <= seed < 0x50: Call FUN_6fb78880 with slot 8, flags 1, duration 4\n     * seed >= 0x50: Call FUN_6fb78990 with flags 1, duration 4\n   - Else call FUN_6fb78a80 with 0x14, then FUN_6fb78a40\n7. For normal spell types (param_1[1] field):\n   - Handle spell types via switch: 0x95, 0x10c, 0x97, 0x10d (slots 4-8, various durations)\n   - Special handling for 0x9d, 0x9e (call FUN_6fb78ab0)\n   - Handle 0x9f (spell type check with distance and time limits)\n   - Handle 0xe3 (call FUN_6fb78c10 with nearest unit)\n   - Handle 0x140, 0x11b, 0x13e, 0x13f (apply spell IDs)\n   - Handle 0x153, 0x22c, 0x23e with respective callers\n   - Default: apply spell IDs with Ordinal_10326 and Ordinal_10329\n\nParameters:\npUnit (uint*) - Pointer to unit structure with fields at offsets: [1]=spell type, [3]=flags, [0x1c]=spell counter, [0xe]=status\nReturns:\nvoid (no return value)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- DeactivateAllUnits() - Caller, main spell deactivation routine\n- FUN_6fb78820() - Apply slot 6 effects\n- FUN_6fb78880() - Apply delayed effects with flags\n- FUN_6fb78990() - Apply immediate effects\n- FUN_6fb78a80() - Handle error case\n- FUN_6fb78ab0() - Handle special spell types\n- FUN_6fb78c10() - Handle spell type 0xe3\n- FUN_6fb7b140() - Apply spell IDs to unit",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_StatList", "PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "STRUCT_Skill", "STRUCT_ItemData", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
