      "comment": "UpdateClosestUnitCandidate - Evaluates a target unit as a potential closest unit candidate.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Skip if source and target are the same unit\n2. Filter target by unit type (type 0 = player, or type 1 = monster excluding class IDs 0x95 and 0x22C)\n3. Validate source unit type state\n4. Calculate distance between units\n5. If closer than current closest, update closest unit pointer and distance\n\nParameters:\n  pSourceUnit - Source unit to measure distance from\n  pTargetUnit - Target unit being evaluated as candidate\n  ppClosestUnit - Pointer to store closest unit found (output)\n  pnClosestDistance - Pointer to current/new closest distance (in/out)\n\nReturns: void (updates ppClosestUnit and pnClosestDistance if target is closer)",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_4"]
    },
