      "comment": "Load data from two structures and process with ordinal functions.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load first value from pdwData1[0x38] offset into EDI\n2. Load first dword from pdwData2[0] via EAX into local stack location\n3. Load second dword from pdwData2[0x8] via ECX into local stack location\n4. Call Ordinal_10187 with loaded value from offset\n5. Store result in local_10\n6. Call Ordinal_10189 with same loaded value\n7. AND result with 0xFF mask (extract lowest byte)\n8. Pass stack-based parameter structure to FUN_6fb7b140\n\nParameters:\npdwData1 - Pointer to structure (accessed at offset 0x38)\npdwData2 - Pointer to structure with dwords at offsets 0 and 0x8\nnParam3 - Integer parameter passed to FUN_6fb7b140\ndwParam4 - Optional parameter (stored in local_1c)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value (passes results via stack structure)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- local_14 initialized to 0 before ordinal calls\n- Ordinal_10189 result masked to lowest byte (0xFF)\n- All ordinal results stored in local variables for FUN_6fb7b140",
