      "instructions": ["0xA8FB0|PUSH|EBX", "0xA8FB1|PUSH|ESI", "0xA8FB2|MOV|ESI, EDX", "0xA8FB4|PUSH|EDI", "0xA8FB5|MOV|EBX, ECX", "0xA8FB7|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESI]", "0xA8FB9|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0xA8FBB|JZ|0x6fb78fc2", "0xA8FBD|CMP|EAX, 0x1", "0xA8FC0|JNZ|0x6fb79022", "0xA8FC2|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESI + 0xc]", "0xA8FC5|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0xA8FC7|JNZ|0x6fb78fd8", "0xA8FC9|TEST|ECX, ECX", "0xA8FCB|JZ|0x6fb78fe1"],
      "comment": "Validates spell action parameters for casting operations\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check action type in pAction[0]: must be 0 (normal) or 1 (special)\n2. If action type 0: validate pAction[3] (target class) is 0x00 or 0x11\n3. If action type 1: validate pAction[3] (target class) is 0x00 or 0x0c\n4. Call Ordinal_10397(nUnitId, pAction) to get skill ID\n5. Verify skill ID in range 0x03-0x19 (3-25 inclusive)\n6. Get game context via GetGameContext()\n7. Call Ordinal_10397(pAction, pGameContext) for additional validation\n8. Verify returned value > 0x07\n9. Call Ordinal_10918() random/seed function\n10. If successful (non-zero result), write skill ID to pnSkillId and action ptr to pnTargetClass\n\nParameters:\n- nUnitId (ECX): uint - Unit/player identifier passed to ordinal function\n- pAction (EDX): int * - Pointer to action structure with type at [0], target class at [3]\n- pnSkillId (Stack): uint * - Output: validated skill ID (3-25)\n- pnTargetClass (Stack): int * - Output: action structure pointer\n\nReturns:\n- 0 (success): Validation passed, outputs written\n- nActionType (failure): Validation failed at type check, returns action type\n- 0 (failure): Validation failed at target class check (for type 1)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x00, 0x01: Action types (normal, special)\n- 0x11: Valid target class for action type 0\n- 0x0c: Valid target class for action type 1\n- 0x03, 0x19: Skill ID range bounds (3-25 decimal)\n- 0x07: Context validation threshold\n- 0x2c: Offset into structure for field access",
