      "comment": "Validates game state parameters and returns success or error code.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call Ordinal_11056 with dwParam1\n2. Check if dwParam2 != 0xB7 OR dwParam4 != 0xAA\n3. If condition true: return dwParam3\n4. If condition false: return 0x95E (error code)\n\nParameters:\ndwParam1 (dword) - IMPLICIT in ECX, passed to Ordinal_11056\ndwParam2 (dword) - First validation parameter, compared against 0xB7\ndwParam3 (dword) - Return value if validation succeeds\ndwParam4 (dword) - Second validation parameter, compared against 0xAA\n\nReturns:\ndword - 0x95E if validation fails (dwParam2 == 0xB7 AND dwParam4 == 0xAA), else dwParam3\n\nSpecial Cases:\nMagic number 0xB7 (183) - First state validation constant\nMagic number 0xAA (170) - Second state validation constant\nMagic number 0x95E (2398) - Error code returned on validation failure",
