      "comment": "Validates if unit curse count exceeds maximum threshold.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load curse data pointer from unit structure at offset 0x70\n2. Test curse data pointer for NULL, return 0 if NULL\n3. Load curse count address from curse data at offset 0xcc\n4. Test curse count address for NULL, return 0 if NULL\n5. Call FUN_6fb7c7e0 to obtain curse table entry pointer\n6. Test curse table pointer for NULL, return 0 if NULL\n7. Load ushort curse count value from returned pointer\n8. Compare curse count with 0xffbd (max 65340)\n9. Return 1 if curse count > 65340, else return 0\n\nParameters:\npUnit (UnitAny *) - pointer to unit structure with curse metadata\n\nReturns:\n1 if curse count exceeds 65340\n0 otherwise (NULL checks or insufficient curse count)",
