      "instructions": ["0xA9C60|PUSH|ECX", "0xA9C61|PUSH|ESI", "0xA9C62|CMP|EDX, 0x158", "0xA9C68|PUSH|EDI", "0xA9C69|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0xA9C6B|JG|0x6fb79d0f", "0xA9C71|JZ|0x6fb79cd5", "0xA9C73|LEA|EAX, [EDX + 0xffffff6a]", "0xA9C79|CMP|EAX, 0xb5", "0xA9C7E|JA|0x6fb79e12", "0xA9C84|XOR|ECX, ECX", "0xA9C86|MOV|CL, byte ptr [EAX + 0x6fb79e28]", "0xA9C8C|JMP|dword ptr [ECX*0x4 + 0x6fb79e18]", "0xA9C93|CALL|0x6fb62880", "0xA9C98|TEST|EAX, EAX"],
      "comment": "Process unit game events with multiplexed event dispatch\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Compare event type against thresholds to select dispatch path\n2. For skill initialization events (0x158), retrieve game context and current unit stat\n3. For projectile events (0x1f1, 0x1f2, 499, 500), validate missile index, allocate structure with event data\n4. For various menu/dialog events (0x96, 0x9d, 0x9e, 0x13f, 0x14b, 0x16b, 0x19d, 0x23a), dispatch to handlers\n5. Return after processing matched event type\n\nParameters:\npUnit: Pointer to active game unit context (ECX register)\nnEventType: Event message ID to process (EDX register)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - no return value, process events and update global state\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Event 0x158: Special skill initialization path with context validation\n- Events 0x1f1+ (>= 0x159): Upper event handler dispatch with projectile/structure creation\n- Events < 0x159: Lower event handler dispatch with switch-based routing\n- Missile validation (0x1f1, 0x1f2, 499, 500) with index bounds check (must be <= 4)\n- Flags 0x40000: Project state indicator set during projectile initialization",
