      "comment": "CheckUnitBehindTarget - Checks if pUnit is positioned behind pTarget for backstab mechanics.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Verify pTarget is a player (field_0 == 1)\n2. Check if target has armor type 0x12A (backstabbable)\n3. Verify units are within 2 tiles of each other\n4. Get target's facing direction from path\n5. Map direction through rotation table (offset by 6)\n6. Calculate expected backstab position based on direction\n7. Compare attacker position against expected backstab position\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - The attacking unit\n  pTarget - The target unit being checked\n\nReturns: Target's facing direction if pUnit is behind pTarget, 0 otherwise",
