      "comment": "Remove game unit from active play and cleanup all associated resources.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Perform unit cleanup preprocessing (FUN_6fb90bc0)\n2. Enumerate and remove all items from unit inventory\n3. Release active skill/spell slot (field at +0x84 bytes offset)\n4. If render context active: cleanup visual representations and animations\n5. Destroy inventory management state\n6. Clear game audio context references\n7. Reset animation timer\n8. Unregister from game event system\n9. Clear fog of war references\n10. Clear console state flags\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit: Pointer to UnitAny structure being removed from game\n\nReturns:\n  void (always succeeds - no error conditions)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - If g_hRenderContext is null, skips render-dependent cleanup (steps 4b-4c)\n  - Clears field at offset 0x84 (skill slot) before removal\n  - Safe to call multiple times (later calls operate on cleared state)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x84 (132 decimal): UnitAny.pSkillSlot offset - active skill reference\n  0x0E (14 decimal): UnitAny animation timer field - reset to 0\n  0xB5 (181 decimal): Console flag CLEAR_OVERLAYS\n  99 (0x63 decimal): Console flag CLEAR_STATUS_MESSAGES",
      "tags": ["MOD_UNIT", "SRC_Monster.cpp", "PARAM_1"]
