      "api_calls": ["FreeInventory", "FreeUnitStatLists", "FreeLinkedListCC", "ReleasePoolAllocation", "ReleasePoolAllocation", "GetMonsterInitStatsPtr", "SetUnitAnimationRate", "SetMonsterTileMode", "CreateInventory", "InitUnitStats", "...+19 more"],
      "instructions": ["0xAA160|SUB|ESP, 0x10", "0xAA163|PUSH|EBX", "0xAA164|PUSH|EBP", "0xAA165|PUSH|ESI", "0xAA166|MOV|EBP, EDX", "0xAA168|PUSH|EDI", "0xAA169|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0xAA16B|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x10], EBP", "0xAA16F|CALL|0x6fb90bc0", "0xAA174|XOR|EDX, EDX", "0xAA176|MOV|ECX, ESI", "0xAA178|CALL|0x6fb63b70", "0xAA17D|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESI + 0x84]", "0xAA183|PUSH|EAX", "0xAA184|CALL|0x6fb98d04"],
      "comment": "Initializes a newly created unit with base properties, equipment, skills, and appearance.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Clear existing items and audio context\n2. Clear existing skill and behavior state using Ordinal calls\n3. Set unit class and retrieve class data table\n4. Initialize equipment and default attributes (skills, stats)\n5. Set unit flags based on class configuration (visibility, immunities)\n6. Allocate and initialize equipment arrays/tables\n7. Process unit event triggers\n8. Apply experience and skill initialization \n9. Finalize unit appearance and item success flags\n\nParameters:\npUnit (int *): Pointer to UnitAny structure being initialized (ECX register)\nnUnitClass (int): Unit type/class constant (EDX register, e.g. 0x9c Barbarian, 0xf3 Druid)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Unit fully initialized in-place\n\nSpecial Cases:\nMagic Numbers: 0x50, 0x35, 0x33, 0x34, 0xad (memory allocation sizes)\nFlag values: 0x02, 0x20, 0x08, 0x0c (unit state flags at offset 0x3a/0x3b)",
