      "comment": "Process skill action by type, handling setup and execution for various spell/ability modes.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract skill parameters and validate caster unit state\n2. Route to type-specific handler based on nSkillActionType (0x00-0x1d)\n3. Execute pre-action initialization (damage, buff, projectile setup)\n4. Apply skill effect (damage, knockback, teleport, aura)\n5. Execute post-action cleanup (set flags, clear audio context)\n\nType Handlers (param_1):\n- 0x00, 0x18: Damage/affliction spells (single target)\n- 0x01, 0x17: Passive aura effects\n- 0x04-0x1c: Offensive/defensive abilities (ranged, AOE, spawns)\n- 0x06, 0x13: Projectile creation (nova, enchant, summon)\n- 0x07: Movement/teleport with targeting\n- 0x08-0x09: Specialized modes (mercenary, corpse skills)\n- 0x12, 0x14-0x16: Complex multi-step abilities\n\nParameters:\n- nSkillActionType (ECX): Skill action ID (0x00-0x1d, case-based routing)\n- pCaster (EDX): Pointer to executing unit (UnitAny)\n- pSkillParams (stack): Skill parameters (coordinates, flags, targets)\n  - [0]: X coordinate or unit ID\n  - [1]: Y coordinate or unit type\n  - [2]: Level or animation frame\n  - [3]: Target mode flag\n  - [4]: Duration or damage\n  - [5]: Rotation or direction\n  - [6]: Buff effect ID\n\nReturns: void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- NULL param_3 error: Calls FUN_6fb9a10f with error code 0xffffffff\n- bVar10 (bool): Skill validation flag determining effect type\n- local_88 (local_88 != 0): Indicates advanced skill with param_3 processing\n- DAT flags: Checks *local_8c & 0x08 for special unit state\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x08: Unit state flag (special/hidden mode)\n- 0x0d: Skeleton type ID (undead)\n- 0xe: Class type (physical immunity check)\n- 0x20: Unit attribute flag for animation\n- 0x40000: Extended unit state flag\n- 0x1b3, 0x1f1, 0x1a1: Skill class IDs requiring special handling\n- 0x6e, 0x9a, 0x9b, 0xb2: Special unit type behaviors",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "MOD_UNIT", "SRC_Monster.cpp", "STRUCT_Room2", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_ItemData", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData", "STRUCT_MonsterData", "PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Path", "PARAM_3", "STRUCT_Skill", "STRUCT_Other"]
