      "comment": "Locate unit in hash table and set attribute value on unit structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Retrieve unit pointer from hash table using ID from nUnitRecord[1]\n2. If unit found, access structure at offset 0x70 (dwUnitPtr) from unit\n3. Load pointer from offset 0xd0 (pAttrBlock) of that structure  \n4. Write ushort value from nUnitRecord[5] to offset 0x10 of attribute block\n5. Return\n\nParameters:\nnUnitRecord: Unit record pointer containing ID at offset 1, attribute value at offset 5\n\nReturns:\nvoid (modifies unit attribute in-place)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x1 - Slot index parameter for FindUnitInHashTable\n0x70 - Offset to unit data pointer in unit structure\n0xd0 - Offset to attribute block pointer in unit data\n0x10 - Offset of target attribute within attribute block\n0x5 - Offset of ushort attribute value in unit record",
