      "api_count": 0,
      "api_calls": [],
      "instructions": ["0xACD60|SUB|ESP, 0x14", "0xACD63|PUSH|EBX", "0xACD64|MOV|EBX, ECX", "0xACD66|PUSH|ESI", "0xACD67|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [EBX + 0x70]", "0xACD6A|MOV|ECX, ESI", "0xACD6C|CALL|0x6fb796b0", "0xACD71|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [EAX + 0x8]", "0xACD74|ADD|EAX, 0x8", "0xACD77|TEST|ECX, ECX", "0xACD79|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x8], EAX", "0xACD7D|JZ|0x6fb7cdf1", "0xACD7F|PUSH|EBP", "0xACD80|MOV|EDX, 0x1", "0xACD85|MOV|EBP, 0x4"],
      "comment": "Invoke unit initialization callbacks for stat indices.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load unit pointer from pGameLogic[0x70]\n2. Call GetUnitFieldAt0xCC to get unit structure base (typically skill/stat buffer)\n3. Check if buffer exists (non-null check)\n4. If valid: Initialize callbacks array with indices [1, 2, 3, 4] (4 items)\n5. Call IsFlagSet to check unit flag 0x01 (determines callback behavior)\n6. Loop through callbacks 1-4: invoke g_ppUnitInitCallbacks[index] if non-null\n7. Loop through callbacks 8-16: invoke g_ppUnitInitCallbacks[index] if non-null\n8. Return\n\nParameters:\npGameLogic: Pointer to game logic/context structure, contains unit pointer at offset 0x70\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value, function has side effects (callback invocation)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If unit field is NULL, entire callback block is skipped\n- Callbacks are optional (NULL pointers are safe, checked before CALL)\n- First callback loop uses hardcoded indices [1,2,3,4], second uses pointer iteration\n- Flag check result (fIsUnit) passed to all callbacks\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n- 0x70: Offset to unit pointer in pGameLogic\n- 0xCC: Field descriptor for unit skill/stat base in UnitAny structure\n- 0x08: Offset into field descriptor for actual pointer value\n- 1, 2, 3, 4: First four callback indices (hardcoded in local array)\n- 8: Starting index for second callback loop (9 total iterations)\n- 0x04: Callback pointer table entry size (dword/4 bytes)",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
    },
