      "instructions": ["0xACE00|PUSH|ECX", "0xACE01|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x8]", "0xACE05|PUSH|ESI", "0xACE06|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0xACE08|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0xACE0A|JZ|0x6fb7ceb9", "0xACE10|LEA|EAX, [ESP + 0x4]", "0xACE14|LEA|ECX, [ESP + 0xc]", "0xACE18|PUSH|EAX", "0xACE19|PUSH|ECX", "0xACE1A|PUSH|ESI", "0xACE1B|CALL|0x6fb98656", "0xACE20|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESI + 0xc]", "0xACE23|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0xACE25|JNZ|0x6fb7ceb9"],
      "comment": "CreateDiagonalEffectPattern - Creates visual effects in a diamond pattern around a unit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If nEffectType is 0, exit early\n2. Store unit pointer and get unit's target XY coordinates\n3. Check if unit field at offset 0xc is 0 AND nEffectType equals 4\n4. If conditions met:\n   - Call Ordinal_10326 and Ordinal_10329 (coordinate helpers)\n   - Create 5 projectile/effects of type 0x52 at:\n     a. Center position (nXCoord, nYCoord)\n     b. Northeast diagonal (nXCoord+1, nYCoord+1)\n     c. Southeast diagonal (nXCoord+1, nYCoord-1)\n     d. Northwest diagonal (nXCoord-1, nYCoord+1)\n     e. Southwest diagonal (nXCoord-1, nYCoord-1)\n   - Initialize game object properties with asset index 0x99a\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - Pointer to the unit that is the center of the effect pattern\n  nEffectType - Type/mode of effect (only creates pattern if value is 4 and unit field 0xc is 0)\n\nReturns: void",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_3"]
    },
