      "comment": "HandleSpecialSkillEffect - Processes special skill effects for units by creating appropriate missiles/projectiles.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Early exit if nFlags!=0 and nSkillId=0x12 (Special case optimization)\n2. If nSkillId=0x2a (42) and unit type is 0, create Fire Wall effect (missile type 0x5a)\n3. Get unit target coordinates\n4. If unit type is 0 and target mode is 4:\n   - If nSkillId=0x0a (10): Create Arrow projectile (type 0x9b)\n   - If nSkillId=0x12 (18): Create Lightning effect (missile 0x77, object 0xc2)\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - Pointer to the acting unit\n  nSkillId - Skill identifier (10=Arrow, 18=Lightning, 42=FireWall)\n  nFlags - Flags controlling execution flow\n\nReturns: void\n\nConstants:\n  0x0a=Arrow skill, 0x12=Lightning skill, 0x2a=FireWall skill\n  0x5a=FireWall missile, 0x77=Lightning missile, 0x9b=Arrow projectile, 0xc2=Lightning object\n  0x0c=Level stat ID",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_3"]
