      "comment": "ApplyUnitBaseRateStats - Applies base velocity and attack rate stat lists to a unit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if mode equals 6 (specific game mode trigger)\n2. Remove any existing temporary stat lists from the unit\n3. Allocate a new stat list and set stat 0x43 (velocity percent) to 100\n4. Link the velocity stat list to the unit\n5. If fApplyAttackRate is set, allocate another stat list for stat 0x44 (attack rate) at 100\n6. Recalculate the unit's animation frame count\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - Pointer to the unit receiving the stat lists\n  nMode - Mode value; function only acts when this equals 6\n  fApplyAttackRate - If non-zero, also applies the attack rate stat\n\nReturns: void",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_3", "STRUCT_ItemData"]
