      "comment": "ApplySlowEffectToUnit - Applies a -50% velocity modifier to a unit when state 0x24 (36) is set.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if state ID equals 0x24 (specific state trigger)\n2. Remove any existing temporary stat lists from unit\n3. Allocate new stat list with flags for temporary effect\n4. Set stat 0x43 (velocity percent) to -50 (-0x32)\n5. Link the stat list to the unit\n6. Recalculate unit animation frame count\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - Pointer to the unit receiving the slow effect\n  nStateId - State ID to check (only applies effect if 0x24)\n\nReturns: void",
