      "comment": "Initialize item features with two sequential feature configurations.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Initialize base item state\n  2. Get first feature ID (type 0x43, field8 parameter)\n  3. Configure first feature with scale 0x14\n  4. Attach first feature to item\n  5. Get second feature ID (type 0x44, field8 parameter)\n  6. Configure second feature with scale 0x78\n  7. Attach second feature to item\n  8. Finalize item configuration\n\nParameters:\n  nItemHandle (int): Item reference passed via ECX register (D2 __fastcall)\n\nReturns:\n  void - Modifies item state in-place through ordinal function calls\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Identical feature fetch mechanism used twice with different configuration values\n  - Feature types (0x43, 0x44) and scales (0x14, 0x78) are magic constants\n  - No error checking on ordinal function returns",
