      "comment": "CreatePairedProjectilesFromUnit - Creates two symmetric projectiles from a unit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validates missile is type 3 and retrieves parent unit from hash table\n2. Gets missile template and checks if it's not type 0x147 and has specific flag\n3. Gets target position from mercenary position or path coordinates\n4. Calculates direction vectors (normalized to -1, 0, or 1)\n5. For missiles 0x3F-0x42, zeroes out direction vectors\n6. Sets state flag, creates two projectiles with mirrored offsets, clears flag\n\nParameters:\n  pMissile - Missile unit structure (this pointer)\n  param_1 - Unused, but must be non-zero to execute\n\nReturns: void",
