      "comment": "Initialize unit with coordinate-based entities (resources, items, effects)\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract unit X coordinate using Ordinal_10326 (GetUnitX)\n2. Extract unit Y coordinate using Ordinal_10329 (GetUnitY)\n3. Initialize resource entity (type 0x75) at retrieved coordinates with flag 1\n4. Initialize item entity (type 0x221) at retrieved coordinates with flag 1\n5. Initialize effect entity (type 0x99a) at origin (0.0, 0.0) with no flags\n\nParameters:\nnUnitPtr (uint): Unit pointer/reference for coordinate extraction\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Two entities initialized at unit's coordinates (0x75, 0x221)\n- One entity initialized at origin (0.0, 0.0)\n- Ordinal calls extract coordinates on-demand rather than storing locally\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x75 - Resource entity type\n0x221 - Item entity type (545 decimal)\n0x99a - Effect entity type (2458 decimal)\n1 - Enable/activation flag for coordinate-based entities\n0.0 - Origin coordinates for effect entity initialization",
