      "comment": "Apply skill modifiers to a unit based on skill index or type.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load unit pointer from this[0x70]\n2. Retrieve unit skill data via GetUnitFieldAt0xCC\n3. Check if unit has primary skill using IsFlagSet with flag 0x01\n4. If nSkillIndex != 0x04, iterate normal skill modifiers (9 entries)\n5. Call handler from g_pSkillModifierHandlers table with fHasMainSkill\n6. Else for unique skills (nSkillIndex==0x04), iterate unique modifiers\n7. Validate function pointer safety with IsBadCodePtr before calling\n8. Call handler from g_pUniqueSkillModifierHandlers table\n9. On invalid pointer, log error and terminate with FUN_6fb9a10f\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - UnitAny instance containing skill data (implicit ECX parameter)\n  nSkillIndex - Skill index (0x00-0x03 normal, 0x04 unique)\n\nReturns:\n  void - Modifiers applied in-place to unit structure",
