      "comment": "Searches record table for entry matching type\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if record table is active via g_dwRecordTableActive flag\n2. If inactive, return 0 (not found)\n3. Initialize pointer to start of g_pRecordTable array\n4. Loop through 8-byte record entries:\n   a. Check if current record value is 0 (end of table)\n   b. If match found (record type at offset 4 equals nRecordType), return record value\n   c. Advance to next record (add 8 bytes)\n5. Return 0 if no match found\n\nParameters:\nnRecordType (short): Record type identifier to find\n\nReturns:\nint: Record value if match found, 0 if not found or table inactive\n\nStructure Layout (8-byte record):\nOffset | Size | Field       | Type  | Description\n0      | 4    | dwRecordId  | uint  | Record identifier/value\n4      | 2    | nRecordType | short | Record type to match\n6      | 2    | reserved    | word  | Unused padding",
