      "instructions": ["0xAE210|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x10]", "0xAE214|PUSH|EBX", "0xAE215|PUSH|EBP", "0xAE216|PUSH|ESI", "0xAE217|XOR|EBX, EBX", "0xAE219|PUSH|EDI", "0xAE21A|MOV|EBP, EDX", "0xAE21C|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0xAE21E|AND|EAX, 0xff", "0xAE223|PUSH|EBX", "0xAE224|PUSH|0x74", "0xAE226|MOV|EDX, 0x6fbd047c", "0xAE22B|MOV|ECX, 0x38", "0xAE230|MOV|dword ptr [ESI + 0x88], EBX", "0xAE236|MOV|dword ptr [ESI + 0xc], EAX"],
      "comment": "Initialize unit-specific attributes based on class, level, and unit type.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Clear unit attribute flags (offset 0x88)\n2. Store base attribute ID in unit.attribute (lower 8 bits of dwAttribute)\n3. Allocate and initialize attribute storage (56 bytes = 14 DWORDs)\n4. Determine class/act ID from dwAttribute parameter\n5. Check character class skill tree availability (acts are locked by class)\n6. Set skill tree availability flag (0x02) in unit.flags[0xE8] if available\n7. Call class initialization routine (Ordinal_10350)\n8. Apply optional extended skill tree (Ordinal_10351) if available\n9. Check for item drops (acts 1-5 have specific drop rules)\n10. Set item drop flag (0x04) in unit.flags[0xE8] if drops available\n11. Call difficulty setup (Ordinal_10384) with extra parameters\n12. Clear temporary flag (0x08) in unit.flags[0xE8]\n13. Initialize animation state (Ordinal_10349)\n14. Apply act-specific flags (0x20 for act-specific properties)\n15. Apply special flags (0x100000) if unit marked with special attribute\n16. Route class-specific initialization (0x152=Amazon, 0x153=Sorceress, 0x154=Necromancer, 0x3b=Barbarian, 0x3c=Druid)\n17. Load class-specific animations (via Ordinal_11181, Ordinal_11185, etc.)\n18. Swap class-specific properties if needed (0x26 swapped with 0x04 for specific case)\n19. Initialize rendering and animation (FUN_6fb7e160)\n\nParameters:\n- pUnit (UnitAny *): Unit being initialized\n- nUnused1 (uint): Unused parameter (passed to Ordinal_10350/10351)\n- nUnused2 (uint): Unused parameter (passed to Ordinal_10350/10351)\n- nUnused3 (uint): Unused parameter (passed to Ordinal_10350/10351)\n- nUnused4 (uint): Unused parameter (passed to Ordinal_10384)\n- dwAttribute (uint): Base attribute ID (0-255), determines class/act\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Level ID > 0xFF triggers fatal error and exit (Ordinal_10085 validation)\n- Classes without skill trees skip Ordinal_10351\n- Acts without drops skip drop flag set\n- Barbarian (0x3b) uses special conversion (Ordinal_10057 for conversion table)",
      "tags": ["PARAM_6", "PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "MOD_UNIT", "SRC_Object.cpp", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
