      "instructions": ["0xAE8A0|MOV|EDX, dword ptr [ECX + 0x70]", "0xAE8A3|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ECX + 0xc]", "0xAE8A6|CMP|EAX, 0x1", "0xAE8A9|MOV|EDX, dword ptr [EDX]", "0xAE8AB|MOV|EDX, dword ptr [EDX + EAX*0x4 + 0xd8]", "0xAE8B2|JNZ|0x6fb7e8d8", "0xAE8B4|LEA|EAX, [EDX + 0xffffff00]", "0xAE8BA|MOV|EDX, dword ptr [ECX + 0x50]", "0xAE8BD|CMP|EDX, EAX", "0xAE8BF|JNZ|0x6fb7e8c6", "0xAE8C1|JMP|0x6fb7e920", "0xAE8C6|PUSH|ESI", "0xAE8C7|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [ECX + 0x58]", "0xAE8CA|ADD|EDX, ESI", "0xAE8CC|POP|ESI"],
      "comment": "Updates animation slot direction and position for unit animations.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Read direction value from pAnimSlot[0x0C]\n2. If direction == 1 (forward):\n   a. Load calculated target position from structure offset + direction index\n   b. Subtract 0x100 to get actual slot index\n   c. Compare with current position (pAnimSlot[0x50])\n   d. If equal, reset animation frame via UpdateAnimationSlotFrame and return\n   e. Calculate new position = current + increment (pAnimSlot[0x58])\n   f. Clamp: if new position exceeds target, use target position\n3. Else if direction == 3 (backward):\n   a. Get current position\n   b. If position <= 0, reset animation frame and return\n   c. If position < increment, set position to 0 and return\n   d. Else decrement by increment amount\n4. Else invalid direction, log error via Ordinal_10025 (debug output)\n\nParameters:\npAnimSlot (int * - ECX): Animation slot structure pointer\n  - [0x0C]: Direction indicator (1=forward, 3=backward)\n  - [0x14]: Current animation frame position\n  - [0x16]: Frame increment/step size\n  - [0x1C]: Base structure offset for lookup table\n  - [0x50]: Current position (modified in-place)\n  - [0x58]: Step/stride value\n\nReturns:\nvoid - modifies pAnimSlot in-place with new position value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Direction value 1 uses complex lookup via [pAnimSlot[0x1C]] + 0xD8\n- Magic numbers: 0x100 subtracted from table value to compute slot index\n- Invalid directions (not 1 or 3) trigger error logging at 0x6fbd047c:0x151",
      "tags": ["MOD_UNIT", "SRC_Object.cpp", "PARAM_1"]
    },
