      "instructions": ["0xAE920|PUSH|ESI", "0xAE921|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0xAE923|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESI + 0xc]", "0xAE926|CMP|EAX, 0x3", "0xAE929|JNZ|0x6fb7e953", "0xAE92B|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESI + 0x70]", "0xAE92E|MOV|dword ptr [ESI + 0xc], 0x0", "0xAE935|XOR|EDX, EDX", "0xAE937|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [EAX]", "0xAE939|MOV|DL, byte ptr [ECX + 0x139]", "0xAE93F|MOV|dword ptr [ESI + 0x50], EDX", "0xAE942|XOR|EDX, EDX", "0xAE944|MOV|ECX, ESI", "0xAE946|CALL|0x6fb936b0", "0xAE94B|PUSH|ESI"],
      "comment": "Processes animation slot state transitions for units.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check current slot state (pUnit->animState at offset 0x0c)\n2. If state == 3: Reset to 0, read animation byte from (pUnit->pData->0x139)\n3. Else if state == 1: Call Ordinal_10352, set state to 2, read animation byte from (pUnit->pData->0x13b)\n4. Else: Error log and jump to finalization\n5. Store animation byte to pUnit->field_0x50\n6. Call FUN_6fb936b0 and Ordinal_10349 to process updates\n7. Check character at (pUnit->pData->[0xc4 + state]) - null terminator test\n8. If non-null: Set pUnit->field_0xe8 |= 0x02 (enable some flag)\n9. If null: Clear flag with AND 0xFD\n\nParameters:\nECX: pUnit - Unit structure pointer, __fastcall implicit\n\nReturns:\nvoid - State modified in-place via pUnit\n\nStructure Layout (UnitAny):\nOffset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description\n0x0c   | 4    | animState  | uint | Animation state (1=process, 2=active, 3=reset)\n0x50   | 4    | animByte   | uint | Current animation byte value\n0x70   | 4    | pData      | void*| Pointer to animation data structure\n0xe8   | 4    | flags      | uint | Animation flags (0x02 = flag bit)",
      "tags": ["MOD_UNIT", "SRC_Object.cpp", "PARAM_1"]
    },
