      "comment": "ReverseUnitClassString - Reverses the class string of a player or monster unit in place.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Gets the class string pointer from the unit via GetPlayerMonsterClassPtr\n2. If valid, reverses the string using __strrev\n3. Copies the reversed string back to the original buffer (max 16 chars)\n\nParameters:\n  dwUnused - Unused parameter (passed in ECX)\n  pUnit - Pointer to the unit whose class string will be reversed\n\nReturns: void",
