      "comment": "CreateBlizzardProjectileGrid - Creates a 5x5 grid of projectiles around a unit for Blizzard-style spell effects.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Iterates Y offsets from -5 to +20 in steps of 5 (alternating positive/negative)\n2. For each Y, iterates X offsets from -5 to +20 in steps of 5 (alternating positive/negative)\n3. Gets unit level (stat 0xC), divides by 5, clamps to 1-8 for projectile count\n4. Initializes projectile data structure and calls InitializeAndAllocateProjectile\n\nParameters:\n  dwUnused - Unused parameter (fastcall convention artifact)\n  pUnit - Source unit casting the spell\n\nReturns: void",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_StatList", "STRUCT_Path", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_2", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
