      "comment": "SpawnProjectilePattern - Spawns 6 projectiles in a hexagonal pattern around the source unit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize directional offset array with 6 coordinate pairs forming a hexagonal pattern\n2. Loop 6 times, creating one projectile per direction offset\n3. Get base coordinates via Ordinal_10326/10329 (likely unit X/Y position)\n4. Calculate damage scale from stat 0xC (level?), divided by 5, clamped to range [1,8]\n5. Initialize projectile config struct with missile type 0x520, positions, flags\n6. Call InitializeAndAllocateProjectile to spawn each projectile\n\nParameters:\n  dwMissileType - Missile configuration type identifier\n  pSourceUnit - Unit from which projectiles originate\n\nReturns: void (projectiles spawned as side effect)",
