      "comment": "FireHexagonalProjectileRing - Fires 6 projectiles in a hexagonal pattern around the source unit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize array of 6 offset pairs defining hexagonal directions\n2. Loop 6 times, one for each projectile direction\n3. Get unit's current X/Y position via D2Common ordinals\n4. Calculate projectile target position by adding directional offset\n5. Get unit's level stat (ID 0xC) and scale intensity (range 1-8)\n6. Call InitializeAndAllocateProjectile for each direction\n\nParameters:\n  dwSkillId - The skill ID triggering this projectile pattern\n  pUnit - Pointer to the source UnitAny casting the skill\n\nReturns: void",
