      "comment": "Sets object mode for Diablo II entity transitions.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate dwNewMode in [0-7], assertion fail if invalid\n2. Mode 0 (normal): Check stat 0xe4 != 0x100 and current mode == 2 to special-case transition\n3. Flags: Update field 0xe8 bit 0x02 based on dwMode (set if nonzero)\n4. Mode change: If dwNewMode differs from current field 0xc value:\n   - Modes 2/4/5: Call Ordinal_10352 if transitioning from other mode\n   - Mode 0: Call Ordinal_10351 if leaving any mode\n5. Call Ordinal_10348 with dwNewMode and FUN_6fb936b0 for sync\n6. Load mode byte from mode table and store to field 0x50\n7. Check state at field 0x128: Set flag 0x20 if null, else clear\n\nParameters:\n- pObject (uint *): Entity pointer (param in ECX)\n- dwMode (uint): Mode direction (param in EDX, 0=normal other=special)\n- dwNewMode (uint): Target mode 0-7 (stack param)\n\nReturns:\n- void",
