      "instructions": ["0xAFB00|PUSH|ESI", "0xAFB01|PUSH|EDI", "0xAFB02|MOV|EDI, EDX", "0xAFB04|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0xAFB06|CALL|0x6fb78290", "0xAFB0B|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x10]", "0xAFB0F|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESP + 0xc]", "0xAFB13|PUSH|0x1", "0xAFB15|PUSH|ESI", "0xAFB16|PUSH|EAX", "0xAFB17|PUSH|ECX", "0xAFB18|PUSH|EDI", "0xAFB19|PUSH|0x0", "0xAFB1B|CALL|0x6fb98e7e", "0xAFB20|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESI + 0x84]"],
      "comment": "Initialize unit skills, audio context, and skill-related attributes.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Add unit to global slot table\n2. Initialize unit class if not already initialized using class index at [param_1 + 0x84]\n3. Initialize unit skills reference (0x33 field) from Ordinal_10945\n4. Set skill reset flag (Ordinal_10946)\n5. Initialize skill cooldowns to 100 (offsets 0x43, 0x44, 0x45)\n6. Record audio frequency sample rate from unit ID (stored in g_dwAudioFrequency)\n7. Set skill override flag to 0x0E with mask 0xFFFFFFDF\n8. If unit is not player class (0x11 or 0), set state flag (0x8000) and call skill initialization\n9. Create audio context if unit ID has no audio stat configured\n10. Process all active units' skill lists and call FUN_6fb936b0 for type 1 units with skill 0x3F set\n\nParameters:\npUnit (dword *): Pointer to unit structure\ndwUnitId (dword): Unit classification ID or type identifier\nnParam3 (int): Additional parameter (used in audio context creation)\ndwParam4 (dword): Additional parameter (concatenated with random value for skill init)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Initializes unit in place, no return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Player unit (pUnit == pGameContext): Skip skill initialization to avoid audio config\n- Missing game context: Skip audio creation and skill processing loop\n- Unit ID 0 or 0x11: Initialize skill state flags\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description\n0x00   | 4    | [base]     | -    | Unit base data\n0x04   | 4    | [+1]       | -    | Unit base +1 \n0x08   | 4    | [+2]       | -    | Unit base +2\n0x0C   | 4    | [+3]       | uint | Unit class type\n0x38   | 4    | [+0x0E]    | uint | Skill reference\n0x84   | 4    | [+0x21]    | uint | Unit class/type index\n0x88   | 4    | [+0x22]    | void *| Audio context pointer\n0xCC   | 4    | [+0x33]    | uint | Skill flags/reference\n0xE8   | 4    | [+0x3A]    | uint | Unit state flags (AND 0xFFFFFFDF, OR 0x0E)\n0x10C  | 4    | [+0x43]    | uint | Skill cooldown 1\n0x110  | 4    | [+0x44]    | uint | Skill cooldown 2\n0x114  | 4    | [+0x45]    | uint | Skill cooldown 3\n0x2C   | 4    | [+offset]  | int *| Skill list pointer",
