      "comment": "Dispatch unit state operations (spell cast, movement, item interact, etc.).\nProcesses nOperationType 0x00-0x19 (cases vary by unit type/status).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Remove unit from audio context if exists\n2. If operation not 0x13: check unit resource state, process skill effects if needed\n3. Extract unit resource ID from [pUnit+0xC], validate destination type\n4. Set success/failure state codes based on resource validation\n5. Switch on operation type and execute corresponding handler:\n   - 0x00,0x01: Validate/cast selected skill, return failure on validation error\n   - 0x02: Special projectile targeting (cast immediately)\n   - 0x06,0x12,0x13,0x14: Perform resource-specific actions, update unit state\n   - 0x07: Validate unit type, mark dirty, process skill with source validation\n   - 0x08,0x09: Full unit state reset (clear items, disable selection, finalize)\n   - 0x15,0x16: Coordinate-based skill or delayed skill activation\n   - 0x17-0x19: Movement/interaction variants\n6. Default case 0x0A+: Assert/debug (unreachable)\n7. Fallthrough: Apply final resource effect, return 1\n\nParameters:\n- nOperationType: Operation code 0x00-0x19 (ECX) - determines action type\n- pUnit: UnitAny* (EDX) - actor unit pointer, accessed at +0xC, +0x21, +0x35, +0x3A, +0xD4, +0xE8\n- pOperationData: uint*[] (ESP+0x4) - [0]=resource/coord, [1]=subtarget coord/param, [2]=inventory slot\n- bFlag: int (ESP+0x8) - 0x13 operation flag (return early if param_4==0 and destination type==0x13)\n\nReturns:\n- 1: Operation succeeded, unit state updated\n- 0: Operation failed (validation error on cases 0, 1, 15, 16, 17, 18)\n\nStructure Offsets (UnitAny*):\n- +0xC: dwResourceId (resource/monster/item ID)\n- +0x21: dwInventorySlot/dwEquipSlot\n- +0x35: dwItemEquipIndex\n- +0x3A: dwUnitStateFlags (flag 0x02=dirty, 0x04=active, 0x40=specific)\n- +0xD4: dwTargetX\n- +0xE8: dwUnitActionState\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n- 0x13: Special operation type (likely town NPCs/portal)\n- 0x40: Unit state flag (specific context check)\n- 0x02: Dirty flag (state modified)\n- 0x04: Active flag\n- 0xFB, 0xFD: Bitmask constants\n\nRelated Functions:\n- ProcessSkillEffect() - Apply initial skill effects\n- FUN_6fb85cf0() - Validate inventory-based action\n- FUN_6fb858c0() - Validate resource-based action\n- FUN_6fb86790() - Set unit animation state\n- FUN_6fb858f0() - Apply unit movement/transition\n- GetGameContext() - Retrieve global player context\n- Ordinal_10342() - D2Common.GetUnitStat(unit, stat_type)\n- Ordinal_10082() - D2Common.GetUnitType(stat_value)",
