      "comment": "Validates and processes unit selection from search criteria.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize search context (FUN_6fb81e90)\n2. Search for unit matching criteria (search type 7, strict matching)\n3. If unit found (dwUnitId != -1):\n   a. Look up unit in hash table (table index 1)\n   b. If hash lookup succeeds (unit node found):\n      i. Get linked list node by unit ID key\n      ii. Check if node field [+8] equals 2 (state flag)\n      iii. If state is 2, update linked list node value with unit\n4. Return success (0)\n\nParameters:\npSearchConfig (uint *): Pointer to search configuration array containing criteria and search context\n\nReturns:\nuint: Always returns 0 on completion\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Returns early if unit not found in search (dwUnitId == 0xffffffff)\n- Returns early if hash table lookup fails (unit node is NULL)\n- Update only occurs when linked list node has state value 2 at offset +8",
