      "instructions": ["0xB21A0|SUB|ESP, 0x2c", "0xB21A3|PUSH|EBX", "0xB21A4|PUSH|EBP", "0xB21A5|PUSH|ESI", "0xB21A6|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0xB21A8|PUSH|EDI", "0xB21A9|XOR|EDI, EDI", "0xB21AB|MOV|EBP, dword ptr [ESI + 0xc]", "0xB21AE|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESI + 0x38]", "0xB21B1|XOR|EBX, EBX", "0xB21B3|CMP|EBP, 0x2", "0xB21B6|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x18], EDX", "0xB21BA|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x1c], EAX", "0xB21BE|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x10], EDI", "0xB21C2|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x14], EDI"],
      "comment": "Update unit viewport display with mercenary position tracking.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract unit type from offset +0x0c\n2. Extract fog index from offset +0x38\n3. Check if unit type is valid mercenary (types 2-3 or 6)\n4. If mercenary: retrieve mercenary position or calculate unit coordinates\n5. Call Ordinal_10230 with fog index and viewport parameters\n6. If mercenary tracking active:\n   - Initialize 7-element state buffer with zeros\n   - If mercenary position available: copy mercenary coords to buffer\n   - Otherwise: use calculated unit coordinates\n   - Call ProcessUnitStateOperation with state flag (0x18 if type=3, else 0x17)\n\nParameters:\npUnit (UnitAny *) - Unit to process, contains type at +0x0c, fog index at +0x38\ndwViewportX (dword) - Viewport X coordinate\ndwViewportY (dword) - Viewport Y coordinate  \ndwUnknown (dword) - Additional parameter passed to Ordinal_10230\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Function uses __fastcall convention: pUnit in ECX, dwViewportX in EDX\n- Viewport parameters passed via stack (dwords at 0x4, 0x8)\n- Mercenary tracking active only for specific unit types\n- State flag calculation: (type==3 ? 1 : 0) - 1 masked with 0x18 or 0xffffffea +0x17\n- Note: Function uses SSA temporaries optimized away in decompilation\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description\n0x0c   | 4    | dwType     | dword | Unit type identifier (1-6+)\n0x38   | 4    | dwFogIdx   | dword | Fog map index for viewport updates\n\nRelated Functions:\n- GetMercenaryPosition(UnitAny*) - Returns mercenary coords or NULL\n- CalculateUnitCoordinates(UnitAny*,int*,int*) - Computes unit position\n- Ordinal_10230(dword,UnitAny*,uint,uint,uint) - Fog index/viewport operation\n- ProcessUnitStateOperation(dword,UnitAny*,uint[7],dword) - Apply state changes",
