      "comment": "Iterates through linked list of skill nodes and calls GetSkillData for each node.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if pSkillListHead is non-NULL; exit if NULL\n2. Load first node pointer from pSkillListHead\n3. Loop while nCurrentNodePtr != 0:\n   a. Load next node pointer from offset +8 of current node\n   b. Call GetSkillData(0x3b, 0) - process node (skill ID 59)\n   c. Continue to next iteration with new nCurrentNodePtr\n4. After loop terminates, call GetSkillData(0x3f, 0) - finalization (skill ID 63)\n\nParameters:\npSkillListHead (int *) - Pointer to head of linked list; first element is pointer to first node\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nLinked List Structure:\nOffset 0 - Pointer to first node (or NULL)\nOffset +8 - Pointer to next node in list\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x3b = 59 (decimal) - Skill ID used in loop processing\n0x3f = 63 (decimal) - Skill ID used in finalization call",
