      "instructions": ["0xB3280|PUSH|ESI", "0xB3281|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [ESP + 0xc]", "0xB3285|PUSH|EDI", "0xB3286|CMP|ESI, 0x2", "0xB3289|MOV|EDI, ECX", "0xB328B|JNZ|0x6fb832a3", "0xB328D|CMP|dword ptr [EDI], 0x1", "0xB3290|JNZ|0x6fb832a3", "0xB3292|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [EDI + 0x4]", "0xB3295|CMP|EAX, 0x1a6", "0xB329A|JC|0x6fb832a3", "0xB329C|CMP|EAX, 0x1a8", "0xB32A1|JBE|0x6fb832c0", "0xB32A3|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0xc]", "0xB32A7|PUSH|ESI"],
      "comment": "Set unit light color if Y-coordinate in valid range (0x1a6-0x1a8)\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if nLightIndex == 2 AND pUnit[0] == 1 AND 0x1a6 <= pUnit[1] <= 0x1a8\n2. If ALL conditions true: skip to cleanup and return\n3. If ANY condition false: call FUN_6fb834e0 with all parameters\n4. Load light color from g_aLightColorTable[nLightIndex * 0x20]\n5. Call SetUnitLightColor with unit pointer and light color value\n6. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\n- pUnit: Pointer to unit structure, checked fields: [0]=type flag, [1]=Y-coordinate\n- nUnused: Unused parameter (passed through to FUN_6fb834e0)\n- nUnused2: Unused parameter (passed through to FUN_6fb834e0)\n- nLightIndex: Light table index (0-4), uses stride 0x20 for array lookup\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Magic value 0x1a6: Lower bound for Y-coordinate range\n- Magic value 0x1a8: Upper bound for Y-coordinate range\n- Type check (pUnit[0] == 1) indicates specific unit type requirement\n- Only applies light if unit passes all validation checks",
      "tags": ["PARAM_4"]
    },
