      "comment": "RemoveUnitOverlayState - Removes an overlay state from a unit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Look up initial asset overlay ID from g_pInitialAssets table\n2. If valid, remove audio contexts for all overlay templates\n3. Look up equipment asset overlay ID from g_pEquipmentAssets table\n4. If valid, remove audio contexts for all equipment templates\n5. Find the associated stat list (default flag, damage, or by key)\n6. If stat list exists and matches the state, remove and free it\n7. Recalculate unit animation frame count\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - Pointer to the unit to modify\n  dwStateId - State identifier used to lookup overlays and stat lists\n\nReturns: void",
