      "comment": "CreateRandomizedVisualEffect - Creates a randomized visual effect/projectile attached to a unit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calls D2Common ordinals for initialization (10326, 10329)\n2. Gets random offset 0-3 to vary effect type\n3. Initializes effect parameters structure (22 dwords)\n4. Sets effect ID to 0xa6 + random offset (166-169)\n5. Allocates projectile via InitializeAndAllocateProjectile\n6. Positions drawable at coordinates (0,0) with z-offset 0x118\n7. Sets GFX properties with y-offset -0x28\n8. Resets flag system\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - Pointer to unit that receives the effect (offset +0x2c accessed for RNG seed)\n\nReturns: void",
