      "instructions": ["0xB4170|SUB|ESP, 0x8", "0xB4173|PUSH|EBX", "0xB4174|PUSH|EBP", "0xB4175|PUSH|ESI", "0xB4176|PUSH|EDI", "0xB4177|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0xB4179|MOV|EBX, EDX", "0xB417B|PUSH|0xe", "0xB417D|PUSH|ESI", "0xB417E|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x18], EBX", "0xB4182|CALL|0x6fb986a4", "0xB4187|MOV|EBP, EAX", "0xB4189|TEST|EBP, EBP", "0xB418B|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x14], EBP", "0xB418F|JZ|0x6fb84352"],
      "comment": "UpdateUnitOverlayState - Updates or creates overlay visual state for a unit based on current/max values.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get overlay stat list (key 0x0E) for the unit\n2. If no overlay exists, create one via ApplyAnimationFramesToUnit\n3. Compare current/max values with stored values (stats 0x84/0x85)\n4. If values differ significantly, remove old overlays and recreate\n5. If similar, calculate tier difference and remove excess overlay layers\n6. Update stored current value in stat list\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - Pointer to unit structure\n  nCurrentValue - Current value (e.g., current health)\n  nMaxValue - Maximum value (e.g., max health)\n\nReturns: void\n\nNotes:\n- Overlay codes: 0x8C-0x90 are animation overlay properties\n- Tier calculation divides values by 3 to determine visual segments\n- Used for health/mana bar visual updates",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_3", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
    },
