      "comment": "Process all items in a specified container slot.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if nSlotId is -1 (invalid slot marker) and return if so\n2. Call Ordinal_10680(nSlotId) to retrieve count of items in slot\n3. Initialize loop counter nIndex to 0\n4. Test if nItemCount > 0; skip loop if not\n5. For each item from 0 to nItemCount-1:\n   - Calculate absolute index as nIndex + nSlotId\n   - Call FUN_6fb93500(pUnit, absolute_index) to process item\n   - Increment nIndex\n6. Return after loop completes or on invalid slot\n\nParameters:\n- pUnit (IMPLICIT EDX): void* - Pointer to container unit structure\n- nSlotId: int - Slot identifier (-1 = invalid/skip processing)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Returns immediately if nSlotId == -1 (invalid slot)\n- No processing if slot contains 0 items",
