      "comment": "UpdateCharacterProgressionOverlays - Updates visual overlays based on character progression tier.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get existing stat list with key 0x97 (progression state)\n2. If no stat list exists, initialize skill tree levels\n3. Compare stored level vs current level to determine tier changes\n4. Tiers are calculated as: Level / (MaxLevel / 3), giving 3 tiers\n5. If tier decreased, remove appropriate overlay items and audio contexts\n6. Process slots 0xCF-0xD4 for tier-based overlays\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - Pointer to unit structure\n  dwCurrentLevel - Current character level\n  dwMaxLevel - Maximum level cap for tier calculation\n\nReturns: void",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_3", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY"]
