      "instructions": ["0xB4940|SUB|ESP, 0x8", "0xB4943|PUSH|EBX", "0xB4944|PUSH|EBP", "0xB4945|PUSH|ESI", "0xB4946|PUSH|EDI", "0xB4947|MOV|EDI, EDX", "0xB4949|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0xB494B|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x10], EDI", "0xB494F|CALL|0x6fb929b0", "0xB4954|MOV|EDX, 0x1", "0xB4959|MOV|ECX, ESI", "0xB495B|CALL|0x6fb86790", "0xB4960|MOV|EDX, 0x1", "0xB4965|MOV|ECX, ESI", "0xB4967|CALL|0x6fb936b0"],
      "comment": "Initializes game object properties and applies asset definitions.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Clear object state via initialization routines (InitializeBasicProperties, InitializeNamedProperties, InitializeObjectDefaults)\n2. Clear field at offset 0x50 to zero\n3. Apply default asset configuration\n4. Load initial asset indices from g_pInitialAssets table at [param_2 * 0x20]\n   - Retrieve asset count via Ordinal_10680\n   - Iterate through each asset index and apply to object via ApplyAsset\n5. Load equipment asset indices from g_pEquipmentAssets table at [param_2 * 0x20]\n   - Retrieve asset count via Ordinal_10680\n   - Iterate through each asset index and apply to object via ApplyAsset\n6. Determine special asset type to apply:\n   - Check Ordinal_10497(param_2) - returns flag if primary type set\n   - If not set, check Ordinal_10500(param_2) - returns flag if secondary type set\n   - Set asset type 0x10 if secondary set, 0x20 if primary set\n   - If neither set, use Ordinal_10480 (default asset handler)\n7. Apply the selected asset type to object via ApplyAssetWithFlag\n8. If asset applied successfully:\n   - Verify Ordinal_10479 returns param_2 (asset type validation)\n   - If validation passes, apply post-asset routines via ApplyAssetEffect, ReleaseAsset, FinalizeAsset\n\nParameters:\n  pObject (void*) - Pointer to game object being initialized\n  nAssetIndex (int) - Asset category index\n\nReturns:\n  void - Object properties modified in place\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Asset indices of -1 indicate no asset in that category (skip iteration)\n  - Multiple conditional branches for asset type determination (primary vs secondary vs default)\n  - Final asset validation ensures returned asset type matches requested index",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_2", "PROP_NOCALLER", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
