      "comment": "ClearUnitStateEffect - Removes all audio and stat list effects associated with a state from a unit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Iterates through wereform overlay table, removing audio contexts for each entry\n2. Gets overlay ID from initial assets table and removes audio for each overlay template\n3. Gets overlay ID from equipment assets table and removes audio for each overlay template\n4. Determines appropriate stat list based on state type (default flag, damage state, or key)\n5. If stat list found and matches state ID, removes it from unit and frees memory\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - Pointer to the unit to clear state effects from\n  dwStateId - State identifier to clear\n\nReturns: void",
