      "instructions": ["0xB4EA0|PUSH|EBX", "0xB4EA1|PUSH|EBP", "0xB4EA2|PUSH|ESI", "0xB4EA3|PUSH|EDI", "0xB4EA4|MOV|EDI, ECX", "0xB4EA6|PUSH|EDI", "0xB4EA7|CALL|0x6fb990fa", "0xB4EAC|MOV|EAX, [0x6fbab218]", "0xB4EB1|CMP|EAX, -0x1", "0xB4EB4|MOV|EBP, EAX", "0xB4EB6|JZ|0x6fb84ed8", "0xB4EB8|PUSH|EAX", "0xB4EB9|CALL|0x6fb990d6", "0xB4EBE|MOV|EBX, EAX", "0xB4EC0|XOR|ESI, ESI"],
      "comment": "Process unit equipment initialization for active unit and mercenary slots.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Notify system of unit (Ordinal_11241 - notify system of unit)\n2. Process active unit slot (g_nActiveUnitSlot): Get slot item count (Ordinal_10680 - get item count), iterate through items (0 to count-1), process each item with FUN_6fb93500\n3. Process mercenary slot (g_nMercenarySlot): Get slot item count (Ordinal_10680 - get item count), iterate through items (0 to count-1), process each item with FUN_6fb93500\n4. Check for stat modifiers (Ordinal_10497(0x95) - check primary stat). If found:\n   - If Ordinal_10500(0x95) found - check secondary stat: create modifier 0x20 via Ordinal_10481\n   - Else: Ordinal_10480 attempt or create modifier 0x10 via Ordinal_10481\n5. If modifier created, verify modifier type via Ordinal_10479 equals 0x95\n6. If valid modifier: process with Ordinal_10474, free with Ordinal_10485, finalize with Ordinal_10376\n\nParameters:\n- pUnit (void*): Unit object to process\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Slot indices of -1 indicate inactive slots, skip processing\n- Modifier type must equal 0x95 for finalization\n- Note: Function uses 3 stack-allocated temporaries (local_EAX_174, local_ESI_76, local_ESI_32) optimized away\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x95: Equipment modifier type identifier\n- 0x20, 0x10: Modifier subtype flags",
      "tags": ["PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_1"]
    },
