      "comment": "ResetUnitGraphicsAndApplyEffect - Resets a unit's graphics state and applies an effect.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Clears component graphics info for the unit\n2. Clears unit state and processes transition with flag 1\n3. Reinitializes the unit's graphics\n4. Initializes unit animation system\n5. Clears unit field at offset 0x50 (animation counter/state)\n6. Calls D2Common ordinal 10324\n7. Applies the specified effect type with parameters\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - Pointer to the unit structure to reset\n  dwEffectType - Type of effect to apply after reset\n  dwEffectParam - Additional effect parameter\n  nFlags - Flags controlling effect application\n\nReturns: void",
