      "instructions": ["0xB5510|PUSH|ESI", "0xB5511|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0xB5513|CALL|0x6fb90b60", "0xB5518|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0xB551A|MOV|dword ptr [ESI + 0x64], EAX", "0xB551D|JNZ|0x6fb8553a", "0xB551F|PUSH|0x15", "0xB5521|PUSH|0x6fbd0b2c", "0xB5526|PUSH|0x6fbd0b18", "0xB552B|CALL|0x6fb99a7a", "0xB5530|ADD|ESP, 0xc", "0xB5533|PUSH|-0x1", "0xB5535|CALL|0x6fb9a10f", "0xB553A|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESI]", "0xB553C|CMP|EAX, 0x4"],
      "comment": "Initialize unit graphics/GFX system for a unit based on its type\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call FUN_6fb90b60() to get GFX handle pointer\n2. Store GFX pointer at pUnit->uGfx (offset 0x64 / 0x19 dwords)\n3. If GFX is NULL, call Ordinal_10023 to log assertion error and exit\n4. Switch on pUnit->dwType (case 0-4 valid):\n   - Cases 0,2: Call FUN_6fb936b0(pUnit) with EDX=0 (load graphics)\n   - Case 1: Call FUN_6fb936b0(pUnit) with EDX=1 (alternate mode)\n   - Cases 3,4: Jump to case 0 logic (same handler)\n   - Default (5+): Call Ordinal_10024 to log assertion error and exit\n5. Return success after initialization\n\nParameters:\npUnit (UnitAny*): Unit structure to initialize graphics for\n  - Offset 0x00: dwType - unit type (0-4 valid, 5+ error)\n  - Offset 0x64: uGfx - GFX handle pointer (output)\n\nReturns:\nvoid (no explicit return value on success; process exits on error)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- NULL GFX handle indicates graphics subsystem unavailable (fatal assertion)\n- Unit types 3,4 reuse case 0 initialization logic\n- Invalid unit types (5+) cause assertion failure with \"Invalid unit type\" error\n- Both error paths call FUN_6fb9a10f(0xffffffff) which never returns\n- Ordinal_10023 called with: assertion message, source file path, line 0x15\n- Ordinal_10024 called with: assertion message, source file path, line 0x27\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x64 (100): Offset of uGfx field in UnitAny structure\n- 0x19: Dword offset of uGfx field (0x64 / 4)\n- 0x15 (21): Line number in error message for NULL GFX assertion\n- 0x27 (39): Line number in error message for invalid unit type assertion\n- 0xffffffff (-1): Exit code passed to termination handler\n\nCalling Functions:\n- InitializeUnit: Primary unit initialization routine\n- InitializeGameUnit: Game unit setup\n- InitializeUnitOnCreation: Unit creation initialization\n\nRelated Functions Called:\n- FUN_6fb90b60(): GFX handle allocation/retrieval\n- FUN_6fb936b0(): Unit graphics initialization handler (specific to unit type)\n- FUN_6fb9a10f(): Fatal error termination handler\n- Ordinal_10023: Assertion logging (Fog.dll pattern - error message logging)\n- Ordinal_10024: Assertion logging (Fog.dll pattern - error message logging)",
