      "instructions": ["0xB5B60|SUB|ESP, 0x1c", "0xB5B63|PUSH|EBX", "0xB5B64|PUSH|EBP", "0xB5B65|PUSH|ESI", "0xB5B66|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0xB5B68|PUSH|EDI", "0xB5B69|MOV|EBX, EDX", "0xB5B6B|PUSH|ESI", "0xB5B6C|XOR|EDI, EDI", "0xB5B6E|CALL|0x6fb98122", "0xB5B73|MOV|ECX, EBX", "0xB5B75|SUB|ECX, EAX", "0xB5B77|JNS|0x6fb85b7b", "0xB5B79|NEG|ECX", "0xB5B7B|CMP|ECX, 0x1"],
      "comment": "Validates target location and processes skill actions by unit type\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate absolute distance deltas: |nTargetX - GetX()| and |nTargetY - GetY()|\n2. Check activation condition: unit type == 1 with valid state, OR both distances < 2\n3. If activated: validate pUnit is not NULL, extract unit action type (0x01 or 0x17), then dispatch\n4. Route skill action by unit type: 0=player, 1=minion, 2=shrine, 4=quest object\n5. For forced actions on game context: call ValidateAndProcessUnitMovement before return\n6. Store coordinates in local variables nX/nY for cross-call parameter passing\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit (IMPLICIT ECX): Pointer to unit/target object [0]=type, [1..N]=extended data\n  nTargetX (IMPLICIT EDX): Target X coordinate for skill action\n  nTargetY (Stack+0x4): Target Y coordinate for skill action\n  bForcedAction (Stack+0x8): Non-zero to force movement validation before action\n\nReturns: void, no error return\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  NULL unit pointer: Fatal error, logs 0x160 with error code -1 via Ordinal_10023\n  Distance < 2 pixels: Triggers activation despite unit state\n  Unit type out of range: Falls through to return, no action taken\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x1eb: Offset to unit state flag in extended unit data\n  0x17: Action type for game context units\n  0x160: Error code line number for logging\n  0x1c: Stack frame size (28 bytes)\n\nStructure Layout - Unit Object (*pUnit):\n  Offset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description\n  0x00   | 4    | dwType     | uint | Unit type (0=player, 1=minion, 2=shrine, 4=quest)\n  0x04   | 4    | pData      | ptr  | Extended unit data\n  0x38   | 4    | dwActionID | uint | Action/state identifier",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Path", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "MOD_UNIT", "STRUCT_Skill", "PARAM_4", "SRC_UnitMode.cpp", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
