      "instructions": ["0xB5D30|SUB|ESP, 0x8", "0xB5D33|PUSH|ESI", "0xB5D34|PUSH|EDI", "0xB5D35|MOV|EDI, ECX", "0xB5D37|TEST|EDI, EDI", "0xB5D39|JNZ|0x6fb85d56", "0xB5D3B|PUSH|0x25", "0xB5D3D|PUSH|0x6fbd0b64", "0xB5D42|PUSH|0x6fbb0bcc", "0xB5D47|CALL|0x6fb99a7a", "0xB5D4C|ADD|ESP, 0xc", "0xB5D4F|PUSH|-0x1", "0xB5D51|CALL|0x6fb9a10f", "0xB5D56|MOV|ESI, dword ptr [EDI + 0x38]", "0xB5D59|TEST|ESI, ESI"],
      "comment": "Validates unit path and processes unit effects (sound, missile).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate param_1 is not NULL (param_1 from ECX register)\n2. Get path element from unit at offset 0x38\n3. Validate path element is not NULL\n4. If path is active, extract path coordinates using Ordinal_10171\n5. Look up unit in hash table to verify path consistency\n6. If unit mismatch found, call Ordinal_10179 to clear path\n7. Check unit flag 0x0D and play sound effect if set\n8. Check unit flag 0x16 and create directional missile if set\n9. Get game system state and check unit flag with state\n10. Return TRUE if success, FALSE if flag check fails\n\nParameters:\n- pUnit (ECX): UnitAny * - unit entity to process\n\nReturns:\n- TRUE (1): Unit processing successful\n- FALSE (0): Unit flag check failed (Ordinal_10226 returned non-zero)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Function terminates (non-returning) if pUnit is NULL\n- Function terminates (non-returning) if path element is NULL at offset 0x38\n- Path coordinates returned in dwY (Y) and dwX (X)\n- Ordinal_10180 checks if path is active/valid\n- Note: Function uses 3 stack-allocated temporaries optimized away by compiler\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n- 0x38: Offset in UnitAny to path element\n- 0x0D: Unit flag for sound effect flag\n- 0x16: Unit flag for missile effect flag\n- 0xFFFFFFFF: Error code passed to FUN_6fb9a10f for termination",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "MOD_UNIT", "SRC_UnitMode.cpp", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_Control"]
