      "comment": "Process unit packet slot with context validation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Retrieve game context to verify unit belongs to active game\n2. If unit is game context or flag 0x800000 not set, abort packet processing\n3. Call Ordinal_10516 with unit and slot 0 (likely cleanup/reset)\n4. Call auxiliary processor FUN_6fb97c90 to update unit state\n5. Extract unit flags (offset 0x3a), unit ID (offset 0x2), and slot type (offset 0x0)\n6. Call pre-processor FUN_6fb8f7e0 before mode-specific handler\n7. Dispatch to slot-specific handler based on unit type:\n   - 0: ProcessUnitStateChange - Update unit state flags\n   - 1: ProcessUnitSkillEffect - Apply skill effects\n   - 2: ProcessUnitAnimationSlot - Update animation\n   - 3: ProcessAudioContextLighting - Update audio/lighting\n   - 4: UpdateUnitModeState - Update mode state\n8. Check flag bit 0x15 (0x200000 mask) to select unit location:\n   - If bit clear: Use hash table lookup (FindUnitInHashTable)\n   - If bit set: Use linked list lookup (FindLinkListNodeByIdAndIndex)\n9. If node found: Process pending packet commands\n10. Otherwise: If flag 0x20 (offset 0x3b) set, send packet 0x4b and clear flags\n11. If flag 0x200000 (offset 0x3a) set, remove unit from linked list and return\n\nParameters:\npUnit - UnitAny * - Unit structure to process (offset accessed: 0, 2, 0x3a, 0x3b)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Aborts if unit is not game context AND flag 0x800000 is clear\n- Uses either hash table or linked list based on flag bit 0x15\n- Clears flags 0x800000 (offset 0x3a) and 0x20 (offset 0x3b) when sending packet 0x4b",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_1"]
    },
