      "instructions": ["0xB5F10|SUB|ESP, 0x20", "0xB5F13|PUSH|EBX", "0xB5F14|PUSH|EBP", "0xB5F15|PUSH|ESI", "0xB5F16|PUSH|EDI", "0xB5F17|MOV|EDI, EDX", "0xB5F19|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0xB5F1B|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x10], EDI", "0xB5F1F|CALL|0x6fb62880", "0xB5F24|MOV|EBP, ESI", "0xB5F26|MOV|ECX, EDI", "0xB5F28|AND|EBP, 0xffff", "0xB5F2E|MOV|EBX, EAX", "0xB5F30|MOV|EDX, EBP", "0xB5F32|CALL|0x6fb60e10"],
      "comment": "Process unit interaction events (cast spell, attack, interact with object)\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get current game context (player state)\n2. Extract interaction code from nInteractionType (lower 16 bits)\n3. Find target unit by ID in hash table\n4. If unit not found, exit\n5. Switch on interaction code (0-4):\n   Case 0: Direct skill cast - get skill index/level, send activation packet\n   Case 1: Delayed/throttled action - check 200ms cooldown timer, update if passed\n   Case 2: Interaction with NPC/Object - validate NPC type (0x194=Npc, 0x178=Object)\n      - For Npc (0x194): validate class (0x20326671), populate skill params, activate\n      - For Object (0x178): check object subtype (0=disabled, 2=valid, else skip)\n      - For Object type 0x178 subtype 2: validate class (0x20686668), activate skill\n      - Fill skill params (ID=0xffffffff, param1=0xffffffff, param2=2, param3=nUnitId)\n   Case 4: UI resource interaction - get selected resource, send UI packet\n6. Always send interaction confirm packet (0x13) at end\n7. For error conditions, call error handler (0x12)\n\nParameters:\nnInteractionType: Interaction event (lower 16 bits = action code 0-4)\nnUnitId: Target unit ID to interact with\n\nReturns:\nNone (void function)",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_2", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
