      "instructions": ["0xB6120|SUB|ESP, 0x1c", "0xB6123|PUSH|EBX", "0xB6124|PUSH|EBP", "0xB6125|PUSH|ESI", "0xB6126|MOV|ESI, EDX", "0xB6128|PUSH|EDI", "0xB6129|MOV|EBX, ECX", "0xB612B|PUSH|ESI", "0xB612C|CALL|0x6fb983c2", "0xB6131|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0xB6133|JZ|0x6fb8614f", "0xB6135|PUSH|EAX", "0xB6136|CALL|0x6fb98338", "0xB613B|PUSH|EAX", "0xB613C|CALL|0x6fb98398"],
      "comment": "Processes and executes skill action effects on units with proper state validation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate unit state via Ordinal_10323 (unit availability)\n2. Check unit state at offset 0xe8, return if cleared\n3. Initialize skill parameter array [7] with zeros\n4. Set first two parameters from dwParam3 and dwParam4\n5. Switch on action type to map to skill action code\n6. For action types 5,8: Extract unit reference via ordinals\n7. For action types 6,7,9,10: Extract unit reference, skill action 0x16\n8. For action types 0xc,0xf: Extract via Ordinal_10322, skill action 0x15\n9. For action types 0xd,0xe,0x10,0x11: Extract via Ordinal_10322, skill action 0x16\n10. For action type 0x13: Validate target is type 4 with flag 0x02 clear\n11. Dispatch based on unit type field (offset 0x00)\n12. If result nonzero and unit type 0, dispatch network packet\n13. Clear unit state fields: offset 0x1c, 0x20, 0x24, 0x28\n\nParameters:\nnActionType (int): Skill action type (1-17, 0x13 special). Determines behavior\npUnit (UnitAny *): Unit pointer, accessed at offsets 0x00 type field, 0xe8 state flag\ndwParam3 (uint): First parameter value (X coordinate or target parameter)\ndwParam4 (uint): Second parameter value (Y coordinate or target unit ID)\n\nReturns:\nvoid (no return value)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Action type 0x13: Validates target is type 4 creature without flag 0x02 before executing\n- Invalid unit state (offset 0xe8 cleared): Early return without further processing\n- Unit type 0 with ProcessUnitStateOperation result 0: Skips network packet\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x00: Unit type field offset\n0x1c,0x20,0x24,0x28: Unit state field offsets\n0xe8: Unit state flag offset\n0x13: Special action type requiring target validation\n0x15,0x16,0x17,0x18: Skill action codes\n0x3a: Unit flag offset for validation",
