      "comment": "Clear unit inventory and equipment slots by zeroing out 4 consecutive 32-bit slot fields.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load zero value into EAX (XOR EAX, EAX)\n2. Write 0 to offset 0x1c (inventory slot 0)\n3. Write 0 to offset 0x20 (inventory slot 1)\n4. Write 0 to offset 0x24 (inventory slot 2)\n5. Write 0 to offset 0x28 (inventory slot 3)\n6. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\npUnit (UnitAny *) - Unit structure pointer, inventory slots will be cleared\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value, modifies unit structure in-place\n\nSpecial Cases:\nClears exactly 4 consecutive 32-bit inventory slots in the unit structure. Called during unit initialization and state cleanup operations.\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description\n0x1c   | 4    | nInventorySlot0 | uint | Inventory slot 0 item index\n0x20   | 4    | nInventorySlot1 | uint | Inventory slot 1 item index\n0x24   | 4    | nInventorySlot2 | uint | Inventory slot 2 item index\n0x28   | 4    | nInventorySlot3 | uint | Inventory slot 3 item index",
