      "comment": "Search unit stat in slot list - Find first slot matching stat type/range\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pUnitAny non-null; else assert via Ordinal_10023 (Storm.dll)\n2. Check unit initialized via FUN_6fb8a560(); return 0 if false\n3. Get stat identifier from nResourceType via FUN_6fb8b4c0()\n4. Get stat range from FUN_6fb8b500(); mask with 0xFF for offset limit\n5. Load list head from pUnitAny->field[0x9C]\n6. For each list node: get slot index and call FUN_6fb8db10()\n7. Compare returned stat against range [id, id+limit)\n8. Return slot index on first match; else return 0\n\nParameters:\npUnitAny (UnitAny *) - Unit structure, validated non-null\nnResourceType (int) - Resource type index for stat lookup\n\nReturns:\nint - Slot index value if found; 0 if not found or unit uninitialized",
