      "globals": ["0xFFFFFFFF9052FFF4||", "0xFFFFFFFF9052FFFC||", "0xFFFFFFFF9052FFF8||", "0x106CF0|g_pAuraTableArray|6fbd25d8", "0x1032F8|g_pPoisonEffectMarker|-0x65", "0xFFFFFFFF90530000||", "0x103370|g_pAltAttackAuraTable|0x89b", "0xFFFFFFFF9053001C||", "0x101048|g_pCurseEffectTable|-0x62", "0x1011B0|g_pNullAuraTable|0x2b5", "0x1033B0|DAT_6fbd33b0|0x8b3", "0x1033B4|DAT_6fbd33b4|0x0", "0x1033B8|DAT_6fbd33b8|0x0", "0x1033BC|DAT_6fbd33bc|0x0"],
      "api_count": 9,
      "api_calls": ["UNITS_GetDirection", "UpdateAnimationModeFromStates", "UNITS_GetDirection", "UpdateAnimationModeFromStates", "FogAssert", "UNITS_GetRoom", "GetEntityField", "GetCharacterTierIndex", "FogAssert"],
      "instructions": ["0xB75D0|SUB|ESP, 0xc", "0xB75D3|PUSH|EBX", "0xB75D4|MOV|EBX, ECX", "0xB75D6|PUSH|EDI", "0xB75D7|PUSH|EBX", "0xB75D8|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [EBX]", "0xB75DA|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [EBX + 0x4]", "0xB75DD|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0xc], EAX", "0xB75E1|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x14], ECX", "0xB75E5|CALL|0x6fb98c9e", "0xB75EA|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0xc], EAX", "0xB75EE|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x8]", "0xB75F2|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0xB75F4|JNZ|0x6fb8760b", "0xB75F6|LEA|EDX, [ESP + 0xc]"],
      "comment": "Process unit curse and aura effects. Applies active aura-based effects to unit dependencies based on unit state and curse types.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract unit class ID, row count, and effect index from unit data via Ordinal_10369 (D2Common.GetUnitState)\n2. If class ID uninitialized, call Ordinal_11013 (D2Common.InitializeUnitState) to initialize values from unit attributes\n3. Check if unit state == 1 (initialized), else return\n4. Validate effect index <= 0x23F (575 decimal) - assertion failure if exceeded\n5. Lookup aura table pointer from g_pAuraTableArray[effect_index]\n6. Determine active aura table:\n   - If table == g_pAttackAuraTable AND (GetStructureFieldBit OR GetBitFlag returns non-null): use g_pAltAttackAuraTable\n   - Else if table == g_pCurseAuraTable AND CheckUnitExceedMaxCurseCount non-zero: resolve curse chain via Ordinal_10342 (GetUnitCurseData), Ordinal_10057 (ResolveCurseChain), Ordinal_10001 (GetCurseType), if result == null char use g_pNullAuraTable\n7. If final aura table is null, return\n8. Assert unit pointer non-null (assertion failure if null)\n9. Iterate through unit dependency list at [pUnit + 0x9C]:\n   - For each dependency entry: extract ID from [pDependency + 0], next from [pDependency + 4]\n   - Call FUN_6fb8db10 to lookup item/unit data from ID\n   - Call FUN_6fb8b4c0 to extract class ID from resolved data\n   - Compare class against aura table class offsets [+0x40], [+0x44], [+0x48], [+0x4C]\n   - If match found, call FUN_6fb8cf80(dwItemId, pUnit, 1) to apply effect with flag=1\n   - Continue to next dependency until pNextListNode == null\n10. Return void\n\nParameters:\npUnit: UnitAny * - unit entity to process effects for\n\nReturns:\nvoid - no return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Null unit pointer triggers assertion failure and FUN_6fb9a10f with -1 exit code\n- Effect index > 0x23F triggers assertion failure and FUN_6fb9a10f with -1 exit code\n- Null dependency list ([pUnit + 0x9C]) returns without effect application\n- Curse exceeding max count can resolve to null curse type (use g_pNullAuraTable)\n- Phantom variable extraout_var: compiler-generated, cannot be renamed\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x23F (575 decimal) - maximum valid effect index\n0x9C (156 decimal) - offset to unit dependency list in UnitAny structure\n0x40, 0x44, 0x48, 0x4C (64, 68, 72, 76 decimal) - aura table class field offsets\n0xFFFFFFFF (-1 signed) - exit code for assertion failures\n\nStructure Layout (Aura Table Format):\nOffset | Size | Field Name         | Type     | Description\n0x40   | 4    | dwClassId1         | uint     | First valid class ID for effect\n0x44   | 4    | dwClassId2         | uint     | Second valid class ID for effect\n0x48   | 4    | dwClassId3         | uint     | Third valid class ID for effect\n0x4C   | 4    | dwClassId4         | uint     | Fourth valid class ID for effect\n\nOrdinal Mappings:\n- Ordinal_10369 = D2Common.GetUnitState - fetch unit state and effect index\n- Ordinal_11013 = D2Common.InitializeUnitState - populate state fields from unit\n- Ordinal_10342 = D2Common.GetUnitCurseData - fetch curse binding information\n- Ordinal_10057 = D2Common.ResolveCurseChain - traverse curse linkage chain\n- Ordinal_10001 = D2Common.GetCurseType - resolve final curse type",
