      "comment": "Process unit animation effects based on state and class type\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract unit properties: type (FIELD_0x0), entity (FIELD_0x4), class (Ordinal_10369)\n2. If entity is invalid (0), rebuild from unit pointer via Ordinal_11013\n3. If entity != 2: verify FUN_6fb87c20==1; get Ordinal_11056; check spawn/lightning triggers\n4. Validate triggers via frame counters (FUN_6fb87dd0, FUN_6fb87e00); apply FUN_6fb8d210\n5. If entity == 2: check FIELD_0x1A==0x1A && class==0; assert unit non-null\n6. Process animation slots: FUN_6fb87d70, FUN_6fb87da0\n\nParameters:\npUnit (int *) - Pointer to unit with animation/state fields\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Modifies unit animation state\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Unit null-check assertions at 0x1520 and 0x14DE\n- Class value (0-7) range validation; frame counter caching",
