      "comment": "Get graphic index for unit animation display.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Read unit type from first dword of pUnit\n2. Read unit class value from second dword\n3. Call D2Common.GetUnitClass(pUnit) to resolve class\n4. If unit type is 0, call D2Common.GetUnitStat with three params to initialize\n5. Return dwGraphicIndex (animation table index)\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit - Pointer to UnitAny structure (starts with type, class fields)\n\nReturns:\n  Graphic index for unit (0-568) used in animation tables\n  Special: Returns 0x23c for unknown unit classes\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  Unit type 0 requires stat resolution via Ordinal_11013\n  Value capped at 0x23c for boundary validation\n\nRelated Functions:\n- Ordinal_10369 (D2Common.GetUnitClass) - Get unit's class type\n- Ordinal_11013 (D2Common.GetUnitStat) - Initialize stat if needed",
