      "api_calls": ["UNITS_GetDirection", "UpdateAnimationModeFromStates", "UNITS_GetDirection", "UpdateAnimationModeFromStates", "FogAssert", "UNITS_GetRoom", "GetEntityField", "GetCharacterTierIndex", "FogAssert"],
      "instructions": ["0xB86F0|SUB|ESP, 0xc", "0xB86F3|PUSH|EBX", "0xB86F4|MOV|EBX, ECX", "0xB86F6|PUSH|ESI", "0xB86F7|PUSH|EBX", "0xB86F8|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [EBX]", "0xB86FA|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [EBX + 0x4]", "0xB86FD|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0xc], EAX", "0xB8701|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x14], ECX", "0xB8705|CALL|0x6fb98c9e", "0xB870A|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0xc], EAX", "0xB870E|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x8]", "0xB8712|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0xB8714|JNZ|0x6fb8872b", "0xB8716|LEA|EDX, [ESP + 0xc]"],
      "comment": "Process aura effects for a unit, applying conditional aura table substitutions.\\n\\nAlgorithm:\\n1. Initialize: Load unit class and primary/secondary aura indices from structure offsets [0] and [4]\\n2. Fetch aura count using Ordinal_10369, store in local_8\\n3. If unit class is 0 (uninitialized), call Ordinal_11013 to populate class/aura fields\\n4. Branch on local_c == 1 (check primary aura):\\n   a. Re-fetch all three values from unit structure\\n   b. Re-execute step 3 initialization if needed\\n   c. Validate aura index < 0x240 (576 max auras), abort if exceeded\\n5. Determine aura table: Load base table pointer from g_pAuraTableArray[dwAuraIndex]\\n6. Apply aura table substitutions:\\n   - If table == g_pPoisonEffectMarker AND (unit has field bit OR GetBitFlag returns non-zero): use g_pAltAttackAuraTable\\n   - Else if table == g_pCurseEffectTable AND CheckUnitExceedMaxCurseCount returns non-zero:\\n     * Get unit class via Ordinal_10342 chain (Ordinal_10057 then Ordinal_10001)\\n     * If result char is null (0x00): use g_pNullAuraTable\\n7. If no aura table found (nullptr), skip aura processing, exit\\n8. Validate unit pointer non-null, abort if nullptr via D2Common_AssertionOrdinal\\n9. Process aura list: Iterate unit aura linked list at offset [0x27]:\\n   a. Load head pointer, loop while non-null\\n   b. Extract aura id from node[0], next pointer from node[1]\\n   c. Call FUN_6fb8db10 to dereference aura, get effect id via FUN_6fb8b4c0\\n   d. Compare effect id against aura table entries (17 comparisons at specific offsets: [0], [6], [0xc], [0x19], [0x10], [0x11], [0x12], [0x13], [0x1b], [0x1c], [0x1d])\\n   e. If match found: call FUN_6fb8cf80 to apply aura effect with parameter 1 (enable flag)\\n10. Exit, stack cleanup via RET\\n\\nParameters:\\n- pUnit: Pointer to UnitAny structure, validated non-null at step 8\\n- IMPLICIT ECX: Contains pUnit (fastcall convention)\\n\\nReturns:\\n- void (no return value, stack effects applied in-place)\\n\\nSpecial Cases:\\n- If unit class == 0x00 on first check, Ordinal_11013 initializes unit structure before proceeding\\n- Poison aura substitution requires BOTH field bit check AND GetBitFlag validation (OR condition)\\n- Curse aura requires CheckUnitExceedMaxCurseCount > 0 and terminal character check (0x00) of class lookup\\n- Null aura table safely terminates processing without error\\n\\nMagic Numbers:\\n- 0x23f (575 decimal): Maximum valid aura index check, exceeding triggers assertion failure\\n- 0x27: Offset to aura linked list head in UnitAny structure [0x27] pointer\\n- 0x9c: Offset in aura node for field access (assembly reference at 0x6fb88817)\\n- 0x04, 0x1c: Secondary/tertiary offsets within unit structure ([EBX+0x4])\\n- Aura table field offsets: [0]=base, [6], [0xc], [0x19], [0x10], [0x11], [0x12], [0x13], [0x1b], [0x1c], [0x1d] (17 effect IDs per aura table)\\n- 0x6fbd6cf0: g_pAuraTableArray base address (indexed by aura class)\\n- 0x6fbd32f8: g_pPoisonEffectMarker sentinel\\n- 0x6fbd1048: g_pCurseEffectTable sentinel\\n- 0x6fbd3370: g_pAltAttackAuraTable pointer\\n- 0x6fbd11b0: g_pNullAuraTable pointer\\n\\nStructure Layout (UnitAny - relevant offsets):\\nOffset | Size | Field Name         | Type     | Description\\n   0x0 | 0x4  | nUnitClass         | int      | Unit classification (monsters, players, etc)\\n   0x4 | 0x4  | nPrimaryAuraId     | int      | Primary aura index into g_pAuraTableArray\\n   0x27 | 0x4  | pAuraListHead      | void*    | Pointer to head of aura linked list\\n   0x9c | 0x4  | pAuraNodeList      | void*    | Alternative aura node reference\\n\\nRelated Functions:\\n- GetStructureFieldBit() - Query unit stat bit fields\\n- GetBitFlag() - Check unit condition flags\\n- CheckUnitExceedMaxCurseCount() - Validate curse count limits\\n- FUN_6fb8db10 - Dereference aura handle to pointer\\n- FUN_6fb8b4c0 - Extract aura effect ID\\n- FUN_6fb8cf80 - Apply aura effect with flag parameter\\n- Ordinal_10369 - Query aura count\\n- Ordinal_10342 - Get unit class (redundant call)\\n- Ordinal_10057 - Class normalization\\n- Ordinal_10001 - Get terminal class character\\n- Ordinal_11013 - Initialize unit aura fields",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Unit", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "MOD_UNIT", "PARAM_1", "SRC_UnitSnd.cpp", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
