      "instructions": ["0xB8BA0|SUB|ESP, 0xc", "0xB8BA3|PUSH|EBX", "0xB8BA4|PUSH|ESI", "0xB8BA5|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0xB8BA7|PUSH|EDI", "0xB8BA8|MOV|EBX, EDX", "0xB8BAA|PUSH|ESI", "0xB8BAB|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESI]", "0xB8BAD|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESI + 0x4]", "0xB8BB0|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x10], EAX", "0xB8BB4|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x18], ECX", "0xB8BB8|CALL|0x6fb98c9e", "0xB8BBD|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x10], EAX", "0xB8BC1|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0xc]", "0xB8BC5|TEST|EAX, EAX"],
      "comment": "Process aura application to a unit, validating and applying property-specific effects.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load unit state from param_1 (units loaded at offsets 0 and 4) and retrieve aura table index via Ordinal_10369\n2. If unit state is uninitialized (0), initialize via Ordinal_11013\n3. If unit state is active (1), continue to aura processing\n4. Validate aura table index <= 0x23e, else trigger assertion\n5. Look up aura table from g_pAuraTableArray[dwAuraTableIndex]\n6. Check for poison effect special case: if table equals g_pPoisonEffectMarker, get structure field bit and bit flag; if either is set, redirect table to g_pAltAttackAuraTable\n7. Check for curse special case: if table equals g_pCurseEffectTable, validate curse count via CheckUnitExceedMaxCurseCount; if exceeded, retrieve class index (Ordinal_10342 -> Ordinal_10057 -> Ordinal_10001) and verify non-null\n8. If table pointer is non-null, get global frame counter\n9. Based on dwAuraPropertyId (8=offset 0x10, 9=0x11, 10=0x12, 11=0x13), extract property offset from aura table\n10. Validate property value: if 0xa84, check unit NULL and enforce 25-frame cooldown (current frame - param_1[0x28]); if 0, skip application\n11. Apply property via FUN_6fb8d210(nPropertyOffset, pUnit, 0.0, 0.0, 0)\n12. Update unit frame counter (param_1[0x28]) and global counter (_g_dwGameStateCounter)\n\nParameters:\nIMPLICIT ECX = pUnit (UnitAny *): Unit entity to apply aura to\nIMPLICIT EDX = dwAuraPropertyId (dword): Aura property ID (8, 9, 10, or 11)\n\nReturns:\nvoid: No return value, modifies unit in-place\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Magic constant 0x23e (574): Aura table boundary validation\n- Magic constant 0xa84: Cold-type aura identifier\n- Magic constant 0x19 (25): Minimum frame interval between applications\n- NULL unit assertions at offsets 0x150a and 0x1515 (D2Cli line numbers)\n- Poison and curse effects require special case handling (separate tables and state checks)\n\nOrdinal References:\n- Ordinal_11013: Initialize unit state\n- Ordinal_10369: Get aura table index from unit\n- Ordinal_10342: Get unit class index\n- Ordinal_10057: Get class property\n- Ordinal_10001: Verify property non-null (return \\\\0 if null)\n- Ordinal_10001: Poison/curse validation calls",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Unit", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_2", "MOD_UNIT", "STRUCT_ItemData", "SRC_UnitSnd.cpp", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
