      "instructions": ["0xB8D60|SUB|ESP, 0x8", "0xB8D63|PUSH|EBX", "0xB8D64|MOV|EBX, ECX", "0xB8D66|PUSH|EBP", "0xB8D67|PUSH|ESI", "0xB8D68|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [EBX + 0x4]", "0xB8D6B|PUSH|EDI", "0xB8D6C|CMP|EAX, 0x7", "0xB8D6F|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x14], EBX", "0xB8D73|JC|0x6fb88d93", "0xB8D75|PUSH|0x138e", "0xB8D7A|PUSH|0x6fbd7a78", "0xB8D7F|PUSH|0x6fbd7ad0", "0xB8D84|CALL|0x6fb99a7a", "0xB8D89|ADD|ESP, 0xc"],
      "comment": "Processes hotkey-based skill and equipment slot selection for player units.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate player class index (must be < NUM_PLAYERCLASS/7)\n2. Retrieve player class table entry from global g_ppPlayerClassTable; exit if NULL\n3. Extract slot key from lower 16 bits (wSlotKey & 0xFFFF = wSlotIndex)\n4. If current player in menu state, exit immediately\n5. Check for reserved equipped item slots 0x17-0x1F:\n   - If FUN_6fb8e720 (IsRestricted) returns non-zero, calculate offset into class table + 0x20\n   - Offset = [pClassTable + 0x20] + (wSlotIndex - 0x30) * 2\n6. Stack inventory slots 0x20-0x52 (hardcoded skill mapping):\n   - Handle special cases: 0x20-0x24, 0x31-0x52 with skill parameters via FUN_6fb8eab0\n   - For example: 0x22=Charge(0x124F), 0x21=Lightning Sentry(0x124D)\n   - For other slots, retrieve float parameter from switch (0.0 or 1.68E-44)\n   - Call FUN_6fb8d210(nSkillId, nPlayerUnit, flSkillParam, 0.0, 0)\n   - Call FUN_6fb8db10(nSkillId) to activate\n   - Call FUN_6fb59210 to update stat display\n   - Return immediately\n7. Default slot handling: switch on wSlotIndex (1-0x17) to get default skill ID\n   - Slots 1-9, 0xB, 0x12-0x17: fetch from class table offsets\n   - Other slots: use hardcoded skill IDs (0xeb, 0x8b6, 0x8b7, 0x9, 0xe4)\n   - Slots 2-6: reset nLocalSlotKey to 0\n8. For valid slot (nSkillId != 0):\n   - Check cooldown: (GetGlobalFrameCounter - g_dwGameStatusFlag) < 0x4B\n   - Skip if cooldown active (continue to next check)\n9. Apply skill via FUN_6fb8d210(nSkillId, nLocalSlotKey, 0.0, 0.0, 0)\n10. Activate with FUN_6fb8db10 and update item stat display with FUN_6fb59210\n\nParameters:\nnPlayerUnit (ECX): Player unit ID/pointer (passed as first arg to sub-calls)\nwSlotKey (EDX): Hotkey slot identifier (lower 16 bits = wSlotIndex)\n\nReturns:\nvoid (no return value)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- nLocalSlotKey reset to 0 for slots 2-6 (player skill assignment)\n- Hardcoded skill IDs for default slots (Teleport=0xeb, Summon=0x8b6, etc.)\n- Cooldown check: frame_counter difference must be >= 0x4B\n- pTooltipUnit marker used for some special slots\n- Note: Compiler optimized away some temporaries (phantom variables)",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_2", "MOD_UNIT", "SRC_UnitSnd.cpp", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
