      "instructions": ["0xB9190|SUB|ESP, 0x8", "0xB9193|AND|EDX, 0xff", "0xB9199|PUSH|ESI", "0xB919A|PUSH|EDI", "0xB919B|CALL|0x6fb60e10", "0xB91A0|MOV|ESI, EAX", "0xB91A2|TEST|ESI, ESI", "0xB91A4|JZ|0x6fb89289", "0xB91AA|MOV|EDI, dword ptr [ESP + 0x14]", "0xB91AE|MOV|EAX, EDI", "0xB91B0|AND|EAX, 0xffff", "0xB91B5|ADD|EAX, -0xa", "0xB91B8|CMP|EAX, 0x52", "0xB91BB|JA|0x6fb8927b", "0xB91C1|XOR|ECX, ECX"],
      "comment": "Dispatch unit state command handler for various unit event types.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Look up unit in hash table using dwUnitId and unit type\n2. If unit not found, return immediately\n3. Extract command ID from lower 16 bits of dwCommand parameter\n4. Switch on command ID to dispatch appropriate handler:\n   - 0x0A (10): Animation notify - call FUN_6fb8d210 with animation ID 0xa71, then FUN_6fb8d640 with 0x78\n   - 0x0C (12): Quest event - call FUN_6fb8d210 with event ID 0xa4a\n   - 0x0D (13): Monster event - call FUN_6fb8d210 with event ID 0xa4b\n   - 0x0E (14): Skill ready check - extract class ID, invoke stat lookup, verify class != 0x10f (Fallen Angel), call FUN_6fb8d210(0x10c2)\n   - 0x0F (15): Aura effect handler - validate class ID <= 0x23e, check poison/curse table, apply aura effect or null aura\n   - 0x10 (16): Timed aura update - similar to 0x0F but with frame counter check, minimum 4 frame delay, call FUN_6fb8ebc0 with param 3\n   - 0x11 (17): Handler animation - get animation state from GetUnitHandlerAnimationState, call with context\n   - 0x53-0x56 (83-86): Equipment slot selection - determine slot ID based on unit class, call FUN_6fb8d210\n   - 0x59 (89): Generic event 0x111b\n   - 0x5A (90): Game context event - call FUN_6fb8d210(8) on game context\n   - 0x5B (91): FX trigger - call FUN_6fb8eb70(0x19, 1)\n   - 0x5C (92): Generic event 0x9f9\n   - Default: if unit type = 0 (Player), forward to ProcessSkillEquipmentSlotSelection\n\nParameters:\n  dwUnitId (IMPLICIT ECX) - Unit ID for hash table lookup\n  bUnitType (IMPLICIT EDX) - Unit type filter (AND with 0xFF)\n  dwCommand (stack param) - Command ID in lower 16 bits, routing key for dispatch\n\nReturns:\n  void - Handler executes command side effects on unit state\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Unit not found: silent early return\n  - Invalid class ID >= 0x23f: triggers D2Common assertion before FUN_6fb9a10f\n  - Poison/Curse aura: complex condition checks field bit and flag status\n  - Frame counter check (case 0x10): prevents rapid re-application (4-frame minimum)\n  - NULL aura table pointer: defaults to 0 for FUN_6fb8d210 call\n  - Non-player units without matching command: early return\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0xFF - Unit type filter mask (EDX AND 0xFF)\n  0xFFFF - Command ID extraction mask (param_3 AND 0xFFFF)\n  0x10F - Invalid class marker (Fallen Angel entity ID)\n  0x23E/0x23F - Max valid class ID (255 classes 0-0x23E)\n  0x78 - Animation parameter for FUN_6fb8d640\n  0x6 - Animation offset for aura update (added to FUN_6fb8ebc0 result)\n  0x4 - Minimum frame delay for timed aura (DVar8 - _g_dwGameStateCounter < 4 check)\n\nOrdinal Calls:\n  Ordinal_10369(pUnit) - D2Common.GetUnitStat - fetch unit stat lookup\n  Ordinal_11013(pUnit, &dwUnitType, &dwClassId, &dwStat) - D2Common data population\n  Ordinal_10342(pUnit) - D2Common.GetUnitInventory\n  Ordinal_10057(dwInventory) - D2Common.GetInventoryStat\n  Ordinal_10001(dwStat) - D2Common.GetStatValue\n\nRelated Functions:\n  FindUnitInHashTable() - Unit lookup by ID and type\n  FUN_6fb8d210() - Primary aura/animation dispatcher\n  FUN_6fb8d640() - Animation notification\n  ProcessSkillEquipmentSlotSelection() - Equipment slot handler for players\n  GetStructureFieldBit() - Check poison effect marker\n  GetBitFlag() - Check alt attack aura flag\n  CheckUnitExceedMaxCurseCount() - Curse count validation\n  GetGlobalFrameCounter() - Frame timing check\n  FUN_6fb8ebc0() - Random animation offset generator\n  GetUnitHandlerAnimationState() - Animation state lookup\n  GetGameContext() - Global game context retrieval",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_3", "MOD_UNIT", "SRC_UnitSnd.cpp", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
