      "api_calls": ["UNITS_GetDirection", "UpdateAnimationModeFromStates", "FogAssert", "UNITS_GetDirection", "UpdateAnimationModeFromStates", "FogAssert", "UNITS_GetRoom", "GetEntityField", "GetCharacterTierIndex", "UNITS_GetDirection", "...+2 more"],
      "instructions": ["0xB97A0|SUB|ESP, 0xc", "0xB97A3|PUSH|EBX", "0xB97A4|PUSH|ESI", "0xB97A5|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0xB97A7|PUSH|EDI", "0xB97A8|MOV|EDI, EDX", "0xB97AA|PUSH|ESI", "0xB97AB|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESI]", "0xB97AD|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESI + 0x4]", "0xB97B0|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x10], EAX", "0xB97B4|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x18], ECX", "0xB97B8|CALL|0x6fb98c9e", "0xB97BD|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x10], EAX", "0xB97C1|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0xc]", "0xB97C5|TEST|EAX, EAX"],
      "comment": "Apply aura state animation effects to a unit. Sets up animation data based on unit class and aura state, applying effects via the appropriate effect table.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load unit's dwType, dwMonsterId, dwSubType from structure offsets\n2. If dwType is zero (invalid), initialize it via Ordinal_11013 (D2Common.InitializeUnitType)\n3. Validate unit pointer is non-null, assert on failure\n4. Check unit's aura state flag at offset 0xAC, validate it matches nAuraStateId parameter\n5. Set aura state flag based on nAuraStateId (1=active, 0=inactive)\n6. Branch on dwType:\n   - Type 1 (Monster): Load animation data array via dwSubType index (0x23D max), apply 8 sequential animation updates\n   - Type 2 (Unit): Similar animation loading and application\n   - Default (Player): Load aura table by dwSubType (0x23F max), check for poison/curse effects\n7. For poison effects (piAuraTable == g_pPoisonEffectMarker): Check poison immunity bits, use alternate attack aura if immune\n8. For curse effects (piAuraTable == g_pCurseEffectTable): Check curse count limit, use null aura if exceeded\n9. Apply selected aura table animation data at offsets 0x0, 0x18, 0x30, 0x34, 0x74, 0x54 via FUN_6fb8c200\n\nParameters:\n- pUnit (ECX): Pointer to UnitAny structure to receive aura state animation\n- nAuraStateId (EDX): Aura state change (non-negative=activate, negative=deactivate)\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Null unit pointer triggers assertion failure via D2Common_AssertionOrdinal\n- Invalid dwType/dwSubType values trigger assertion failures (type >= 0x23F, subtype >= 0x23D)\n- Animation data may not exist (null checks at 0x6fb8999b, 0x6fb898ef)\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n- 0xAC: Offset of unit's aura state flag within UnitAny\n- 0x2B: Offset of animation state field within UnitAny\n- 0x23D: Maximum animation data array index (573)\n- 0x23F: Maximum unit class/type value (575)\n- 0x1a6d: Assertion line number for invalid class check\n- 0x1398: Assertion line number for invalid subclass check\n- 0x154c: Assertion line number for null unit check\n- Offsets (0x0, 0x18, 0x30, 0x34, 0x74, 0x54): Aura animation field offsets within effect table",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Unit", "PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_2", "MOD_UNIT", "SRC_UnitSnd.cpp", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
