      "api_calls": ["GetSampleSoundBuffer", "GetSoundMixerValue", "GetSoundMixerValue", "GetSampleSoundBuffer", "GetAudioStreamPositionInSamples", "CloseSoundStream", "InitSoundSample", "UNITS_SetUnitHighlight", "SetStructField", "WriteSoundBufferSlot", "...+3 more"],
      "instructions": ["0xB9E40|SUB|ESP, 0x58", "0xB9E43|PUSH|EBX", "0xB9E44|PUSH|EBP", "0xB9E45|PUSH|ESI", "0xB9E46|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0xB9E48|PUSH|EDI", "0xB9E49|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x10], ESI", "0xB9E4D|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESI + 0x4]", "0xB9E50|CALL|0x6fb8b480", "0xB9E55|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x14], EAX", "0xB9E59|MOV|AL, byte ptr [ESI + 0x38]", "0xB9E5C|TEST|AL, 0x1", "0xB9E5E|JNZ|0x6fb89e6b", "0xB9E60|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [ESI + 0x4]", "0xB9E63|CALL|0x6fb8cc90"],
      "comment": "Locate or allocate a unit animation slot, validating game state and slot occupancy.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get unit base pointer via FUN_6fb8b480 (access offset 0x04 = unit classification ID)\n2. Test bit 0 of flag at offset 0x38; if clear, rebuild class via FUN_6fb8cc90\n3. If global g_dwExpansionModeActive != 0: search predefined slots array\n   - Iterate through g_dwSlotSearchBase table (0x6fbff848 base)\n   - Call Ordinal_10013 to query slot availability\n   - Match on unit classification (offset 0x04)\n   - Filter by proximity: distance < 2 tiles (offset 0x34 = X, 0x3c = Y)\n   - Select slot with minimum distance if multiple available\n4. Validate found slot: check offset 0x3d == 0 (not already bound)\n5. If existing match invalid, skip to main search\n6. Update unit linked list: save [iVar1 + 0x68], set [iVar1 + 0x64] = classification\n7. Check game mode gate: if [iVar2 + 0x4f] != 0, call FUN_6fb8c660 + check [iVar2 + 0x86] != 2\n8. Check blocking flag: if [iVar2 + 0x81] != 0, return NULL\n9. Get activation state from [iVar2 + 0x50]: if 0, call Ordinal_10044 twice to compute mode flags\n   - If Ordinal_10044 returns 1: OR flags with 0x02\n   - If Ordinal_10044 returns 2: OR flags with 0x06\n10. Search primary slot table g_dwSlotSearchBase:\n    - Check [slot + 0x08] == 0 AND [slot + 0x04] == dwModeFlags\n    - Call Ordinal_10013; if success, jump to LAB_6fb8a035\n11. If no primary slot, search secondary table (0x6fbff848):\n    - Match [slot - 0x04] == dwModeFlags AND [slot] != 0\n    - Call FUN_6fb8e660 for compatibility check (parameters: slot, unit, 1, 1)\n12. If valid slot found and FUN_6fb8e660(unit, slot, 0, 0) succeeds:\n    a. If [slot] != 0: call Ordinal_10018, write to [slot + 0x08 + 0x41]\n    b. Call Ordinal_10012 to reset unit state\n    c. Clear slot: [slot + 0x08 + 0x30] = 2, [slot + 0x08 + 0x2c] = 0, [slot + 0x08] = 0\n    d. Call Ordinal_10009(implicit_EDI) to initialize\n    e. If cold path ([iVar2 + 0x4f] == 0):\n       - Call Ordinal_10019\n       - Check [iVar2 + 0x80] == 0x01, if so call Ordinal_10020\n       - Call Ordinal_10010([iVar2 + 0x70]); if 0, return NULL\n    f. Set [slot + 0x08] = pUnit\n    g. If dwModeFlags & 0x04:\n       - Set local_54 = 0x3f800000 (zoom 1.0) or 0 if [iVar2 + 0x4b] == 0\n       - Call Ordinal_10022(zoom_value)\n    h. Initialize slot fields: [slot + 0x18] = 0xffffffff, [slot + 0x1C] = 0\n       [slot + 0x0C] = 0, [slot + 0x10] = 0, [slot + 0x14] = 0\n    i. Call FUN_6fb8a210(slot) to finalize display\n    j. If hot path ([iVar2 + 0x4f] != 0):\n       - Call FUN_6fb8cd40 (populate szLocalPath buffer)\n       - Call Ordinal_10025 with animation data\n       - If result == 0, return NULL\n    k. Return slot pointer\n13. Else return NULL\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit (ECX): Pointer to unit/entity structure\n    - Offset 0x04: Unit classification ID\n    - Offset 0x24: Animation/skill state\n    - Offset 0x34: World position X\n    - Offset 0x38: Flags (bit 0: initialized state)\n    - Offset 0x3c: World position Y\n    - Offset 0x3e: Animation frame/rotation\n    - Offset 0x4b: Special animation flag\n    - Offset 0x4d: Mode check flag (affects FUN_6fb8c660)\n    - Offset 0x4f: Cold/hot path selector (NULL=cold, non-NULL=hot)\n    - Offset 0x50: Activation bit (slot active)\n    - Offset 0x80: Animation direction flag\n    - Offset 0x81: Blocking state (prevents slot allocation)\n    - Offset 0x86: Game state mode code\n\nReturns:\n  uint *: Pointer to allocated/configured slot structure on successful allocation\n  NULL: If validation fails, no available slots, animation path check fails, or slot already occupied\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Expansion mode check: If g_dwExpansionModeActive == 0, skips initial predefined slot search\n  - Zoom level calculation: Default 1.0 (0x3f800000) unless animation flag inhibits it\n  - Two activation paths: cold (animation validation) vs hot (skills/effects)\n  - Note: Function uses register-reuse SSA variables optimized during decompilation\n  \nOrdinal Comments:\n  Ordinal_10009, Ordinal_10010, Ordinal_10011, Ordinal_10012, Ordinal_10013, Ordinal_10018, Ordinal_10019, Ordinal_10020, Ordinal_10022, Ordinal_10025, Ordinal_10044: See KNOWN_ORDINALS.md for mappings",
      "tags": ["PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Path", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "STRUCT_Skill", "STRUCT_Room2", "STRUCT_ItemData", "PARAM_1", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
