      "comment": "Retrieve game context and process unit stat data.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call GetGameContext() to retrieve current game context pointer\n2. If context is null, return early (no game active)\n3. Call Ordinal_10342(pGameContext) to retrieve unit stat value\n4. If stat value is zero, return early (no stat data available)\n5. Call Ordinal_10057(nStatValue) to process the stat data\n\nParameters:\nNone (retrieves game context via GetGameContext)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Returns immediately if game context unavailable\n- Returns immediately if unit stat value is zero\n- Ordinal_10057 purpose unknown - behavior-based: processes unit stat data\n\nRelated Functions:\n- GetGameContext - Retrieves current game context\n- Ordinal_10342 (D2Common.GetUnitStat) - Gets stat value from unit\n- Ordinal_10057 - Unknown; processes stat data",
