      "instructions": ["0xBC310|PUSH|EBX", "0xBC311|PUSH|ESI", "0xBC312|TEST|ECX, ECX", "0xBC314|JZ|0x6fb8c38e", "0xBC316|MOV|EDX, dword ptr [0x6fbffa68]", "0xBC31C|TEST|EDX, EDX", "0xBC31E|JZ|0x6fb8c38e", "0xBC320|TEST|ECX, ECX", "0xBC322|JL|0x6fb8c3ac", "0xBC328|CMP|ECX, 0x125a", "0xBC32E|JGE|0x6fb8c3ac", "0xBC330|LEA|EAX, [ECX + ECX*0x8]", "0xBC333|SHL|EAX, 0x3", "0xBC336|SUB|EAX, ECX", "0xBC338|LEA|ESI, [EDX + EAX*0x2]"],
      "comment": "Validate and clear status field for all slots in a unit's inventory.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate nUnitIndex is non-zero and pUnitArrayBase is initialized\n2. Range-check: Ensure 0 <= nUnitIndex < 0x125A (4698 max units)\n3. Calculate pUnit pointer: pUnitArrayBase + (nUnitIndex * 0x8E)\n4. Verify pUnit is non-NULL (address != 0)\n5. Retrieve nSlotCount from [pUnit + 0x3D] and nSlotIndex from [pUnit + 0x60]\n6. Validate nSlotIndex < nSlotCount\n7. Iterate through inventory slots from nSlotIndex to nSlotCount\n8. For each slot: Calculate offset (nSlotIndex * 0x8E), validate range, clear field at offset 0x8A to 0\n9. Increment slot index, continue until all slots processed\n\nParameters:\nnUnitIndex (int) - IMPLICIT in ECX: Unit index (0-4697) into unit array\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value, modifies unit slot status in-place\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Assertion failures if nUnitIndex out of range or pUnitArrayBase is NULL\n- Asserts on offset overflow (nSlotIndex * 0x8E >= 0xA2DEC)\n- Silent return if nUnitIndex is 0 or pUnitArrayBase is NULL\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x8E - Unit/slot structure size (142 bytes)\n0x3D - Offset to slot count field\n0x60 - Offset to slot index field\n0x8A - Offset to status field being cleared\n0x125A - Maximum unit count (4698)\n0xA2DEC - Maximum slot array offset (671212 bytes)",
      "tags": ["SRC_SoundHdr.cpp", "MOD_SOUND", "STRUCT_Inventory", "SND_SYSTEM", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_UnitAny"]
