      "comment": "Process a single frame update of the game session, including viewport, sound, and game object state refreshes.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call GetSlotTableActiveStatus() to check if game session is active\n2. If inactive, skip remaining steps and return early\n3. Load global game session flags (g_dwGameSessionFlags) into ECX\n4. Call UpdateRenderViewportSettings(flags) to refresh viewport configuration\n5. Call FUN_6fb8e830(flags) for unknown viewport-related update\n6. Call ProcessSoundDataEntries(flags) to update audio state\n7. Call FUN_6fb8db40(flags) for unknown frame update step\n8. Call ProcessGameObjectSlots() to refresh all game object slots\n9. Increment global game session flags by 1 (frame counter)\n10. Call Sleep(0) to yield CPU time to other threads\n\nParameters:\n(none)\n\nReturns:\n(void)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Early exit if GetSlotTableActiveStatus() returns 0 (inactive session)\n- Frame counter (g_dwGameSessionFlags) increments every processed frame\n- Sleep(0) allows thread scheduling without blocking game logic",
      "tags": ["PARAM_0"]
    },
