      "api_calls": ["GetAsyncResult", "GetAsyncIoResult", "FogAssert", "SetAsyncFileHandle", "GetFileSize", "CloseFileHandle", "FogAssert", "GetDataFilePath", "RemoveListNode", "LinkedListAppendNode", "...+9 more"],
      "instructions": ["0xBC660|SUB|ESP, 0x6c", "0xBC663|PUSH|EBX", "0xBC664|MOV|EBX, ECX", "0xBC666|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [0x6fbffa68]", "0xBC66C|PUSH|EBP", "0xBC66D|PUSH|ESI", "0xBC66E|PUSH|EDI", "0xBC66F|TEST|ECX, ECX", "0xBC671|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x18], EDX", "0xBC675|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x24], EBX", "0xBC679|JNZ|0x6fb8c683", "0xBC67B|XOR|ESI, ESI", "0xBC67D|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x10], ESI", "0xBC681|JMP|0x6fb8c6a8", "0xBC683|TEST|EBX, EBX"],
      "comment": "Initialize and play sound for unit with optional priority/flags configuration.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate unit ID range (0-0x1259), retrieve unit slot from array\n2. Check if unit sound already initialized (0x81 flag) - return if set\n3. Check unit state at offset 0x86: return if state=2 (complete), process if state=0 or 1\n4. For state=1 (active): Mark complete (state=2), call ValidateSoundDataState, decrement game mode\n5. For state=0 (idle):\n   a. Build full sound path: select global/local data prefix based on unit ID range\n   b. Concatenate path components into 80-byte buffer\n   c. Build SFX suffix path similarly\n   d. Combine both strings into final path buffer\n   e. Allocate sound channels via Ordinal_10102, update channel count\n   f. If successful: load audio data via FUN_6fb994dc, set state=2, validate, update game mode\n   g. If failed: enumerate existing channels, free low-priority entries, retry allocation\n6. Update unit last-played timestamp (offset 0x7c) to current session flags\n7. Trigger sound system update via Ordinal_10059 and Ordinal_10063\n\nParameters:\nnUnitId (int): Unit identifier (0-4681), ECX register, validated against 0x1259\nnPriority (int): Priority level control, EDX register, affects channel allocation/freeing\nnFlags (int): Processing flags, stack parameter, controls resource allocation strategy\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Updates unit structure in-place; modifies global channel count, game mode counter\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Unit validation triggers fatal assertion on out-of-range ID\n- Invalid path length (>80 bytes) triggers assertion/exit\n- Sound already initialized: immediate return without reprocessing\n- Channel allocation failure: attempts to free existing lower-priority channels\n- Multiple path branches based on unit ID thresholds (0xb76, 0x1230, 0x1259)\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x81 - Unit initialization flag offset (1=initialized)\n0x86 - Unit state field offset (0=idle, 1=active, 2=complete)\n0x8e - Unit slot size in array\n0x8a, 0x4c - Channel validation fields\n0x7c - Last-played timestamp field\n0x2ee - Timestamp delta threshold\n0x50 - Path buffer size (80 bytes)\n0x5c, 0x35e, 0x2b5, 0x2ce - Assertion/error codes\n0x1259 - Maximum unit ID value\n\nStructure Layout (Unit Slot - 0x8e bytes):\nOffset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description\n0x50   | 1    | InitFlag   | byte | Initialization state (0x81 offset)\n0x7c   | 4    | LastTime   | uint | Last play timestamp\n0x82   | 4    | WavHeader  | uint | Wave data header pointer\n0x86   | 4    | State      | uint | Sound state (0=idle, 1=active, 2=done)\n0x8a   | 4    | Reserved   | uint | Channel validation field",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "API_FILE_IO", "SND_SYSTEM", "STRUCT_Room2", "STRUCT_Room1", "STRUCT_ItemData", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData", "SRC_SoundHdr.cpp", "PROP_LARGE", "MOD_SOUND", "PARAM_3", "STRUCT_Skill", "STRUCT_Other", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY"]
