      "comment": "Search inventory linked list for item by ID\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load inventory list head pointer from global\n2. Loop through linked list nodes\n3. Check if node's item ID matches parameter\n4. Return node's associated data (offset +8) on match\n5. Advance to next node via offset +4\n6. Return 0 if end of list reached without match\n\nParameters:\nnItemId (__fastcall ECX) - Item ID to search for\n\nReturns:\nEAX - Item data value if found, 0 if not found\n\nStructure Layout (Inventory Node):\nOffset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description\n0x0    | 4    | pNext      | uint*| Next node pointer\n0x4    | 4    | nItemId    | uint | Item identifier\n0x8    | 4    | dwValue    | uint | Associated data/value",
