      "comment": "Search inventory list for entry with matching ID\nIterates through linked list of inventory nodes, comparing each node's ID field to find target\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if dwInventoryId is non-zero (validate search parameter)\n2. Load head pointer from g_pInventoryListHead global\n3. If head is NULL, return NULL (empty inventory)\n4. Loop: Load node pointer from current list entry [pCurrent + 0]\n5. Compare node[0x8] (ID field) against dwInventoryId\n6. If match found, load field at node[0x1c] and return (inventory data pointer)\n7. If no match, advance pCurrent to next entry [pCurrent + 0x4]\n8. If next entry is NULL, return NULL (not found)\n9. Repeat loop at step 4\n\nParameters:\n  dwInventoryId - Target inventory entry ID to search for (uint)\n\nReturns:\n  Pointer to inventory entry data if found, NULL if not found or dwInventoryId is 0\n\nStructure Layout:\n  Offset | Size | Field Name | Type    | Description\n  0x00   | 4    | pData      | int *   | Pointer to inventory data\n  0x04   | 4    | pNext      | int *   | Next inventory entry in list\n  0x08   | 4    | dwId       | uint    | Inventory ID for comparison\n  0x1c   | 4    | pInventory | int *   | Inventory structure pointer (return value)",
      "tags": ["PARAM_1", "PROP_LEAF", "PROP_SMALL"]
    },
