      "comment": "Searches inventory list for item matching ID and validates required fields.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Return 0 if nItemId is NULL or g_pInventoryListHead is NULL\n2. Iterate through linked list starting at g_pInventoryListHead\n3. For each node: load item pointer from list node, read item ID at offset 0x08\n4. If item ID matches nItemId parameter:\n   a. Return 0 if item pointer is NULL\n   b. Return 0 if field at offset 0x28 is NULL\n   c. Return 0 if dword at [offset 0x28] + 0x04 is NULL\n   d. Return 1 (all validations passed)\n5. Advance to next list node via pointer at offset 0x04\n6. Continue until list end (NULL), then return 0 if no match found\n\nParameters:\n- nItemId: Item identifier to search for\n\nReturns:\n- 1 if item found with all validations passing\n- 0 if nItemId is NULL, inventory empty, item not found, or any validation fails",
