      "comment": "Initialize game object state and reset instance counter.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set g_dwGameObjectStateFlag = 0x01 (object system enabled)\n2. Set g_dwObjectInstanceCounter = 0x00 (reset instance count)\n3. Call ClearGameState() to clear all game state structures\n\nParameters:\n(none) __stdcall convention\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Called during game session initialization\n- Resets counter before ClearGameState to ensure clean state\n- Order critical: flag set BEFORE counter reset",
