      "comment": "Initialize and render legacy overlay rendering engine with specified viewport parameters.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate both height (wHeight) and Y coordinate (wY) are non-zero\n2. If validation fails, return 0 (false)\n3. Check if global g_pLegacyEngine has been initialized\n4. If not initialized, call Ordinal_11155(0) to initialize engine and store pointer\n5. Call Ordinal_11157 with all parameters and engine pointer\n6. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\ndwX - Viewport X coordinate (32-bit)\nwY - Viewport Y coordinate (16-bit, must be non-zero)\ndwWidth - Viewport width in pixels (32-bit)\nwHeight - Viewport height in pixels (16-bit, must be non-zero)\ndwFlags - Rendering flags controlling overlay behavior (32-bit)\n\nReturns:\n1 on success (valid parameters and rendering called)\n0 on validation failure (wHeight or wY is zero)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Global g_pLegacyEngine caches engine pointer across calls for performance\n- Function enforces minimum viewport dimensions (height > 0, Y > 0)\n- Engine initialization happens automatically on first valid call",
      "tags": ["PROP_NOCALLER", "PARAM_5", "STRUCT_Control"]
