      "comment": "Initialize screen state with unit pointer and screen parameters.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Store unit pointer parameter (pUnit from ECX) to global g_pCurrentUnit\n2. Set global g_nSelectedScreen to 6 (screen index constant)\n3. Store screen parameter (dwScreenParam from EDX) to global g_nScreenParam\n4. Set global g_dwScreenState to 6 (active/initialized state)\n5. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\npUnit (UnitAny *): Pointer to unit/entity structure for current screen context\ndwScreenParam (uint): Screen parameter value determining screen configuration\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value, updates global screen state variables\n\nSpecial Cases:\nMagic number 6 indicates active screen context state in Diablo II UI system",
