      "comment": "UpdateCursorAnimation - Updates and renders the animated cursor based on current screen state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate draw position clamped to screen bounds\n2. Initialize GFX parameter array and call GfxInterfaceCall84 to draw cursor\n3. Validate cursor table size and selected screen index (asserts if invalid)\n4. Process state machine: handle cursor animation frame advancement\n5. Use randomization for state 1 (idle animation variance)\n6. Transition between states based on animation completion\n7. Check idle timeout (5 seconds) to trigger screen saver transition\n\nParameters:\n  None (uses globals for cursor state)\n\nReturns: void",
