      "comment": "Search graphics info list for entry matching search value\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Retrieve graphics info structure via GetGfxInfoPointer(dwGfxInfoId)\n2. Verify pointer is not NULL (assertion on failure)\n3. Load linked list head from graphics info offset +0x2c\n4. While current node is non-NULL:\n   - If node field at offset +0x4 equals dwSearchValue, return 1 (found)\n   - Advance to next node via offset +0xa4\n5. Return 0 if list exhausted (not found)\n\nParameters:\nECX/dwGfxInfoId - Graphics info identifier\nEDX/dwSearchValue - Value to search for in list entries (compared at offset +0x4)\n\nReturns:\n1 if entry found\n0 if entry not found or list empty\n\nSpecial Cases:\nNULL graphics info pointer causes assertion failure and program termination\nAssumes linked list is properly NULL-terminated at last node\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x2c - Offset of list head pointer within graphics info structure (0xb dwords)\n0x4 - Offset of search field within each list node\n0xa4 - Offset of next pointer within each list node (0x29 dwords)",
      "tags": ["SRC_Gfx.cpp", "PARAM_2", "STRUCT_Other"]
