      "instructions": ["0xBF7E0|SUB|ESP, 0xc", "0xBF7E3|PUSH|EBX", "0xBF7E4|PUSH|EBP", "0xBF7E5|PUSH|ESI", "0xBF7E6|PUSH|EDI", "0xBF7E7|MOV|EDI, ECX", "0xBF7E9|CALL|0x6fb628b0", "0xBF7EE|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0xBF7F0|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x10], EAX", "0xBF7F4|JNZ|0x6fb8f814", "0xBF7F6|PUSH|0x296", "0xBF7FB|PUSH|0x6fbd84f4", "0xBF800|PUSH|0x6fbd84e8", "0xBF805|CALL|0x6fb99a7a", "0xBF80A|ADD|ESP, 0xc"],
      "comment": "Process animation slot for unit with mode-specific state updates.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Retrieve graphics information pointer for unit (offset 0x0)\n2. Assert pointer is valid, abort if NULL\n3. Get current tick count (elapsed game time)\n4. Locate animation slot in unit's slot list (traverse offset 0xa4 chain)\n5. Skip slots with matching tick count (0x2c offset) to find next pending\n6. Update slot's tick time to current tick (0x2c = dwCurrentTick)\n7. Branch on slot type (*pSlotData offset 0x0):\n   - Type 0: Validate against FUN_6fb95870 result, remove if mismatch\n   - Type 1: Decrement counter (offset 0x8), cleanup when zero\n   - Type 2: Cleanup if counter (offset 0x8) is zero\n   - Type 6: Check time delta between now and offset 0xc, set counter to 1 if exceeded\n   - Type 8: Call Ordinal_10487 to validate mode, increment counter (0x8) if field 0xf set (max 0x32)\n8. Add frame delta (offsets 0x18 += 0x14 + 0x18) to slot\n9. Check overflow against max (offset 0x1c):\n   - Type 1/3/8: Wrap by subtracting max\n   - Type 2: Reset counter to zero\n   - Type 4: Call FUN_6fb8fb90, trigger mode updates via FUN_6fb931f0\n   - Type 5: Reset frame progression, set counter\n   - Type 6: Reset counter, reset frame position, cache current tick\n   - Type 7: Cleanup and spawn mode 0x8c/0x8d\n   - Type 9: Cleanup and dispatch mode updates with param\n10. Loop to next slot\n\nParameters:\npUnitData - uint * - Unit pointer (IMPLICIT ECX) containing graphics info chain\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\nAborts with error if graphics info NULL\nOrdinal_10487 returns mode validity (0=invalid, nonzero=valid)\nNote: Function uses stack temporaries optimized away during decompilation\n\nStructure Layout (Slot at pSlotData):\nOffset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description\n0x0    | 4    | dwType     | uint | Animation slot type (0-9)\n0x2c   | 4    | dwTickTime | uint | Last processed tick count\n0x8    | 4    | dwCounter  | uint | Mode-specific counter\n0xc    | 4    | dwTimeout  | uint | Time reference for type 6\n0xe    | 4    | dwModeData | uint | Type 8 mode parameter\n0xf    | 4    | dwFlags    | uint | Control flags (0xf=1 means increment)\n0x14   | 4    | dwFrameAdd | uint | Frame delta per update\n0x18   | 4    | dwFramePos | uint | Current frame position\n0x1c   | 4    | dwFrameMax | uint | Maximum frame value\n0xa4   | 4    | pNext      | ptr  | Next slot in chain\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x2c - Tick time field offset in slot\n0x8  - Counter/duration field offset in slot\n0x32 - Maximum counter value for type 8 (50 in decimal)\n0xb  - First slot pointer offset from graphics info\n0xa4 - Next slot pointer offset (linked list chain)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FUN_6fb95870() - Validate slot state (type 0)\n- FUN_6fb8fb90() - Remove animation slot\n- Ordinal_10487() - D2Common ordinal, validates mode for type 8\n- FUN_6fb931f0() - Send mode update packets\n- FUN_6fb8faa0() - Handle counter overflow (type 8)",
      "tags": ["SRC_Gfx.cpp", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "STRUCT_ItemData", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData", "PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Path", "STRUCT_Skill", "STRUCT_Other", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY"]
