      "instructions": ["0xBFC40|PUSH|ESI", "0xBFC41|MOV|ESI, EDX", "0xBFC43|CALL|0x6fb628b0", "0xBFC48|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0xBFC4A|JNZ|0x6fb8fc6a", "0xBFC4C|PUSH|0x328", "0xBFC51|PUSH|0x6fbd84f4", "0xBFC56|PUSH|0x6fbd84e8", "0xBFC5B|CALL|0x6fb99a7a", "0xBFC60|ADD|ESP, 0xc", "0xBFC63|PUSH|-0x1", "0xBFC65|CALL|0x6fb9a10f", "0xBFC6A|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [EAX + 0x28]", "0xBFC6D|TEST|EAX, EAX", "0xBFC6F|JZ|0x6fb8fc7c"],
      "comment": "Search graphics node list by ID, return node data pointer or NULL\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get graphics info structure for given graphics type\n2. Assert graphics info exists; abort if NULL\n3. Get head of node linked list from graphics info offset 0x28\n4. While node pointer non-NULL:\n   a. Check if node's first field (offset +0) equals search ID\n   b. If match found, break from loop\n   c. Otherwise advance to next node at offset +0x10\n5. If node not found, return NULL (EAX = 0)\n6. If node found, load node data pointer from offset +0x8\n7. Return value from node data at offset +0x14, abort if NULL\n\nParameters:\n  nGfxType (ECX, int) - Graphics type ID passed to GetGfxInfoPointer\n  nNodeID (EDX, int) - Node ID to search for in linked list\n\nReturns:\n  EAX (int *) - Pointer to node data (from offset 0x8) at offset 0x14, or NULL if not found\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Asserts and aborts if graphics info NULL (first assertion)\n  - Asserts and aborts if node found but node data at offset 0x14 is NULL (second assertion)\n  - Returns 0 if search ID not found in any node\n\nStructure Layout (Graphics Node):\nOffset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description\n0x00   | 4    | nNodeID    | int  | Node identifier to search\n0x08   | 4    | pNodeData  | void*| Pointer to node data structure\n0x10   | 4    | pNext      | void*| Pointer to next node in list\n0x14   | 4    | nData      | int  | Return value data",
