      "comment": "Allocate and initialize graphics info structure for rendering\n  \nAlgorithm:\n1. Call D2Common.GetItemData(0x739) to allocate graphics data structure\n2. If allocation fails, trigger assertion and terminate\n3. Initialize 16 dwords at the structure base to 0 (size: 64 bytes)\n4. Set field at offset 0x34 (index 0xd) to 2\n5. Set field at offset 0x38 (index 0xe) to 2\n6. Return structure pointer\n\nParameters:\n(none)\n\nReturns:\nPointer to initialized graphics info structure (64 bytes allocated by D2Common)\nNULL on allocation failure (function does not return, asserts instead)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Magic number 0x739: Item code used as allocation ID for graphics structure\n- Fields at 0x34 and 0x38: Set to mode value 2 (likely rendering flags)\n- Loop initializes 16 contiguous dwords to 0 using REP STOSD\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset | Size | Field Name     | Type    | Description\n0x00   | 56   | (reserved)     | byte[14] | Uninitialized buffer\n0x34   | 4    | dwRenderMode1  | dword   | Set to 0x02\n0x38   | 4    | dwRenderMode2  | dword   | Set to 0x02",
      "tags": ["SRC_Gfx.cpp", "PARAM_0", "STRUCT_Other", "STRUCT_Control"]
