      "instructions": ["0xC0BC0|PUSH|EBX", "0xC0BC1|CALL|0x6fb628b0", "0xC0BC6|MOV|EBX, EAX", "0xC0BC8|TEST|EBX, EBX", "0xC0BCA|JNZ|0x6fb90bea", "0xC0BCC|PUSH|0x749", "0xC0BD1|PUSH|0x6fbd84f4", "0xC0BD6|PUSH|0x6fbd84e8", "0xC0BDB|CALL|0x6fb99a7a", "0xC0BE0|ADD|ESP, 0xc", "0xC0BE3|PUSH|-0x1", "0xC0BE5|CALL|0x6fb9a10f", "0xC0BEA|MOV|ECX, dword ptr [EBX + 0x28]", "0xC0BED|PUSH|ESI", "0xC0BEE|TEST|ECX, ECX"],
      "comment": "Remove audio contexts and cleanup graphics audio data for a game unit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call GetGfxInfoPointer(nUnitIndex) to retrieve graphics info structure\n2. If graphics info is NULL, assertion failure - call D2Common_AssertionOrdinal\n3. If graphics info valid:\n   a. Process first audio context list (offset 0x28):\n      - Loop through linked list of audio contexts\n      - Each context is at offset 0x10 from previous\n      - Call Ordinal_10043(0x74f, 0) for each element (audio cleanup flag 0x74f)\n   b. Process second audio context list (offset 0x2c):\n      - Loop through linked list of audio contexts\n      - Read audio context pointer at offset 0x40, next at offset 0xa4\n      - If context pointer is non-zero:\n        * Call RemoveAudioContextFromList to unlink audio context\n      - Call Ordinal_10043(0x5f5, 0) for each element (audio cleanup flag 0x5f5)\n   c. Call Ordinal_10043(0x755, 0) to finalize audio cleanup (final cleanup flag)\n4. If assertion triggered, call FUN_6fb9a10f(-1) and never return\n\nParameters:\n  nUnitIndex (int) - Unit/entity index in ECX; passed to GetGfxInfoPointer\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Function aborts if graphics info pointer is NULL\n  - Handles NULL audio context pointers gracefully (skips RemoveAudioContextFromList)\n  - Audio flag 0x74f applied to first context list, 0x5f5 to second, 0x755 as final\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0x28 - Offset in graphics info for first audio context list pointer\n  0x2c - Offset in graphics info for second audio context list pointer\n  0x10 - Offset in audio context node to next pointer (first list)\n  0x40 - Offset in audio context node to audio context pointer (second list)\n  0xa4 - Offset in audio context node to next pointer (second list)\n  0x74f - Audio cleanup flag for first context list (Ordinal_10043)\n  0x5f5 - Audio cleanup flag for second context list (Ordinal_10043)\n  0x755 - Final audio cleanup flag (Ordinal_10043)\n  0x749 - Assertion code in D2Common_AssertionOrdinal\n\nRelated Functions:\n  - ProcessUnitCleanup() - Calls this during unit cleanup flow\n  - GetGfxInfoPointer() - Retrieves graphics info for unit\n  - RemoveAudioContextFromList() - Unlinks audio context\n  - Ordinal_10043() - Audio management ordinal call",
      "tags": ["SRC_Gfx.cpp", "STRUCT_Inventory", "STRUCT_ItemData", "PARAM_1", "STRUCT_Other", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control"]
