      "instructions": ["0xC2980|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x10]", "0xC2984|PUSH|EAX", "0xC2985|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x10]", "0xC2989|PUSH|EAX", "0xC298A|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x10]", "0xC298E|ADD|EAX, EDX", "0xC2990|PUSH|EAX", "0xC2991|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x10]", "0xC2995|ADD|EAX, ECX", "0xC2997|PUSH|EAX", "0xC2998|PUSH|EDX", "0xC2999|PUSH|ECX", "0xC299A|CALL|0x6fb99286", "0xC299F|RET|0x10"],
      "comment": "Renders a sprite/image with source region offset transformation to destination coordinates.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate transformed source offset: srcOffsetX = nSrcX + nX\n2. Calculate transformed source offset: srcOffsetY = nSrcY + nY\n3. Call Ordinal_10055 (Fog.dll sprite render) with:\n   - Destination coordinates: (nX, nY)\n   - Source region offset: (srcOffsetX, srcOffsetY)\n   - Region dimensions: (nWidth, nHeight)\n4. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\n- nX (int): Destination X coordinate for sprite rendering\n- nY (int): Destination Y coordinate for sprite rendering\n- nSrcX (int): Source region X offset from current draw surface\n- nSrcY (int): Source region Y offset from current draw surface\n- nWidth (dword): Width of source region to render\n- nHeight (dword): Height of source region to render\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Used by multiple UI/viewport rendering functions for translated sprite rendering\n- Ordinal_10055 handles actual rendering operations via Fog.dll\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n- None (coordinate offsets are parameters)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- Ordinal_10055 (Fog.dll) - Core sprite rendering with region clipping",
