      "comment": "Clear graphics info linked lists for all 16 components. Iterates through components 0-15, clears internal component lists, and clears graphics info pointers.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. For each component index from 0 to 15:\n2.   For internal index 0 to 15: clear component data via FUN_6fb96ec0\n3.   Get graphics info pointer via GetGfxInfoPointer\n4.   If pointer exists, walk linked list at offset 0x28, freeing nodes\n5.   Clear graphics info pointer to null\n6. Return after processing all 16 components\n7. Assert if component count exceeds 15 (error condition)\n\nParameters:\nnComponent (dword) - Component ID to initialize/clear graphics for\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If GetGfxInfoPointer returns NULL, skips linked list walk and clears\n- Assertion fires if component count reaches 16 (NUM_COMPONENTS limit)\n- Linked list traversal at [pointer + 0x28], nodes chained via offset 0x10\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x10 - 16 (NUM_COMPONENTS, loop bounds)\n0xf  - 15 (component count limit for assertions)\n0x28 - Offset to graphics info linked list head\n0x10 - Offset to next node in linked list\n0x5d2 - Ordinal parameter for linked list processing\n0x5c4 - Line number for first assertion\n0x5cd - Line number for graphics info null assertion",
