      "instructions": ["0xC2DC0|SUB|ESP, 0x168", "0xC2DC6|PUSH|EBX", "0xC2DC7|PUSH|EBP", "0xC2DC8|PUSH|ESI", "0xC2DC9|PUSH|EDI", "0xC2DCA|MOV|EBX, EDX", "0xC2DCC|PUSH|0x1", "0xC2DCE|LEA|EAX, [ESP + 0x24]", "0xC2DD2|PUSH|EBX", "0xC2DD3|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0xC2DD5|PUSH|EAX", "0xC2DD6|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x34], EBX", "0xC2DDA|MOV|dword ptr [ESP + 0x24], 0x1", "0xC2DE2|CALL|0x6fb958f0", "0xC2DE7|PUSH|EAX"],
      "comment": "Process unit's graphics and appearance update\nUpdates visual representation (COF data, components, colors) for a unit.\nReturns success flag or error indication.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize component tracking: dwInitFlag=1, dwComponentCode buffer\n2. Get COF record ID from unit using Ordinal_10888 (D2Common: Get unit component index)\n3. Validate gfx info pointer exists, assert if NULL\n4. Resolve inventory mode: if 0xFFFFFFFF, call FUN_6fb95870\n5. Search existing gfx records in gfx_info->ptCofNode[10] linked list\n6. If found existing record, jump to processing\n7. If not found, check unit type (nUnitType = FUN_6fb95830):\n   - Type 1: Call ProcessUnitGfxCleanup, search again\n   - Type 0: Create new record via InsertGfxUnitRecord, init via InitializeGfxUnitRecord\n   - Type 2: Call InitializeGfxUnitRecord\n8. Search for gfx record with matching mode via SearchInventoryItemByStatAndLevel\n9. Process gfx components:\n   - Load COF header via FUN_6fb96be0\n   - Get component count from COF header[2]\n   - Validate Ordinal_10457 (D2Common: Get component code) returns valid component code\n   - For each component (0 to component_count-1):\n     a. Clear gfx_component_cache[6] (adGfxComponentCache)\n     b. Call FUN_6fb968e0 to build component data\n     c. Call Ordinal_10055 (D2Common: Process gfx component) - returns success/failure\n     d. If success, call Ordinal_10056 (D2Common: Finalize component)\n     e. Check dwReturnFlag = (bGfxFlags & 0x04) ? 1 : 0\n   - Return dwReturnFlag (success) or 0xFFFFFFFF (failure)\n10. On error: Format error message via FUN_6fb9a261, log via Ordinal_10029 (D2Common: GetLevel), assert\n\nParameters:\npUnit (ECX IMPLICIT) - UnitAny pointer, unit to process\npdwInventoryMode (EDX IMPLICIT) - uint pointer, inventory mode (0xFFFFFFFF = resolve)\ndwFlags (Stack[0x4] IMPLICIT) - uint, reserved flags\n\nReturns:\n0xFFFFFFFF (-1) - Fatal error, component processing failed\n0x00000000 (0) - Success, no special effects\n0x00000001 (1) - Success, gfx component applied (dwReturnFlag)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- param_2 = 0xFFFFFFFF: Automatically resolve via FUN_6fb95870\n- Multiple gfx records: Searches entire linked list chain\n- COF component validation: Asserts if component > 0x0F\n- Note: Function uses 6+ stack-allocated temporaries optimized away by compiler\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x01 - dwInitFlag initial value (component processing enabled)\n0x04 - Flag mask for checking gfx component applied (bGfxFlags & 0x04)\n0xFF - Mask for component code validation (dwComponentCode & 0xFF)\n0x10 - Component count validation limit (must be < 0x10)\n0xFFFFFFFF - Magic value for auto-resolve mode, error return code\n0x33F, 0x465, 0x469, 0x328, 0x616, 0x619, 0x61B, 0x624, 0x62B - Assertion line numbers\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description\n0x0    | 4    | *pOwner    | uint*| Owner unit pointer\n0x4    | 4    | nType      | uint | Unit type ID\n0x10   | 4    | *ptCofNode | uint*| Graphics node list (linked)\n0x14   | 4    | *ptCofData | uint*| COF data pointer\n0x28   | 4    | *ptNodeChain | uint*| Node chain for gfx records\n\nRelated Functions:\n- GetGfxInfoPointer() - Retrieve gfx info structure\n- ProcessUnitGfxCleanup() - Clean up previous gfx state\n- SearchInventoryItemByStatAndLevel() - Find gfx record by component\n- InsertGfxUnitRecord() - Create new gfx record\n- InitializeGfxUnitRecord() - Initialize gfx record data\n- FUN_6fb968e0() - Build component gfx data\n- FUN_6fb96be0() - Get COF header\n- FUN_6fb95870() - Resolve inventory mode\n- FUN_6fb95830() - Get unit type\n- D2Common.Ordinal_10888 - Get unit component index\n- D2Common.Ordinal_10055 - Process gfx component visual\n- D2Common.Ordinal_10056 - Finalize component rendering\n- D2Common.Ordinal_10457 - Get component code\n- D2Common.Ordinal_10029 - GetLevel for error logging",
      "tags": ["UNIT_PLAYER", "SRC_Gfx.cpp", "PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_3", "STRUCT_Skill", "STRUCT_Other", "PROP_LOOPHEAVY", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
