      "comment": "Retrieves a specific field from graphics info structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call GetGfxInfoPointer to retrieve graphics info structure pointer\n2. If pointer is NULL, return 0 (null/invalid condition)\n3. Otherwise, retrieve and return field at offset 0x30 (0xc DWORD index)\n\nParameters:\n- nGfxIndex: Graphics info index for lookup\n\nReturns:\n- Field value from graphics info structure at offset 0x30\n- 0 if graphics info structure not found\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Returns 0 for invalid/null graphics info pointer\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x30 (decimal 48): Byte offset to field within graphics info structure (0xc * 4)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- GetGfxInfoPointer() - Retrieves graphics info structure pointer",
