      "strings": ["0x1084F4|s_C:\\Projects\\Diablo2\\Source\\D2Cli_6fbd84f4|C:\\Projects\\Diablo2\\Source\\D2Client\\ENGINE\\Gfx.cpp", "0x10855C|s_GFXUTILUnitGetType(hUnit)_==_UNI_6fbd855c|GFXUTILUnitGetType(hUnit) == UNIT_PLAYER", "0x108740|s_ptCofHeader_6fbd8740|ptCofHeader", "0x1084E8|s_ptGfxInfo_6fbd84e8|ptGfxInfo", "0x10854C|s_lpbCurrCofData_6fbd854c|lpbCurrCofData", "0x108528|s_ptUnitCofNode->ptCofData->lpbDat_6fbd8528|ptUnitCofNode->ptCofData->lpbData"],
