      "instructions": ["0xC4940|SUB|ESP, 0x28", "0xC4943|MOV|dword ptr [0x6fc1bd34], 0x1", "0xC494D|PUSH|EBX", "0xC494E|PUSH|EBP", "0xC494F|PUSH|ESI", "0xC4950|MOV|ESI, ECX", "0xC4952|PUSH|EDI", "0xC4953|XOR|ECX, ECX", "0xC4955|CALL|0x6fb94de0", "0xC495A|CALL|dword ptr [0x6fba6098]", "0xC4960|LEA|ECX, [ESP + 0x1c]", "0xC4964|MOV|[0x6fc1bd24], EAX", "0xC4969|CALL|0x6fb79540", "0xC496E|XOR|EDI, EDI", "0xC4970|CMP|EAX, EDI"],
      "comment": "Initialize all game units with monster definitions and graphics.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Mark initialization as forced (g_bInitForced = 1)\n2. Clear initialization counter (FUN_6fb94de0)\n3. Get active unit data pointer and validate it exists\n4. Retrieve region list (Ordinal_11074) and verify valid\n5. For each region with active units:\n   a. Iterate through all units in region\n   b. Copy unit data to temp buffer [ESP+0x24]\n   c. Get monster type ID via Ordinal_10582\n   d. For each monster definition, check if unit type matches at offset 0x1e9\n   e. If match (0x01 flag), initialize COF graphics data (InitializeCofDataUnit)\n   f. Update loading screen progress every 4th unit (AND 0x3)\n6. If forced init or 600ms+ elapsed since last init:\n   a. Get active game context\n   b. Get player units list (Ordinal_10342)\n   c. For each player unit:\n      - Check unit type (FUN_6fb95830): 1=Monster, 0=Player/Summon\n      - If Monster: Process all matching monster definitions (InitializeCofDataUnit)\n      - If Player/Summon: Process all skill definitions (FUN_6fb94d50)\n      - Check timeout every iteration (Ordinal_10057)\n   d. Update last init timestamp\n7. Clear forced initialization flag (g_bInitForced = 0)\n\nParameters:\nNone (void __stdcall)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Always returns success. Assertion failures cause non-return (FUN_6fb9a10f).\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Requires valid region data and monster definitions loaded\n- Timeout check (0x1d) interrupts initialization loop\n- Random seed mode (g_bRandomSeedMode) clears skill context\n- Forced init bypasses timeout check\n- Updates loading screen UI every 4th processed unit\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x01 - COF data validity flag at offset 0x1e9\n0x1e9 - Offset in monster def of COF flag\n0x2c - Offset in unit to linked unit list pointer\n0x10c - Offset in unit to next unit in chain\n0x43 - Index multiplier for next unit (0x43 * 4 = 0x10c)\n0x1d - Timeout threshold (29ms)\n0x1f - Load screen update interval mask (every 32nd)\n0x3 - Loading screen update interval mask (every 4th)\n0x10 - Region array offset in region data\n0xa0 - Monster class flags stride (160 bytes)\n0xc - Special unit class value (12)\n0xe01, 0xe2c, 0xe2d, 0x67f, 0xe07 - D2Common assertion line numbers\n600 - Millisecond timeout interval",
