      "comment": "Validates unit state and optionally triggers unit state processing operations.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Call ValidateUnitTypeState to check if unit is valid\n  2. If validation returns 0 (success) AND unit pointer is non-zero:\n     3. Call ProcessUnitStateOperation with operation code 7 (state initialization)\n  4. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\n  pUnit (UnitAny *): Pointer to unit structure to validate and process\n\nReturns:\n  void - Returns unconditionally after processing\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - If validation fails (returns non-zero), skips state processing\n  - If unit pointer is NULL, skips state processing even on validation success\n  - Operation code 7 appears to trigger unit state initialization\n\nRelated Functions:\n  - ValidateUnitTypeState() - Validates unit structure validity\n  - ProcessUnitStateOperation() - Applies state change operations to unit",
