      "comment": "Retrieve graphics animation frame for unit rendering\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Extract field 0 (offset 0x0) from unit structure - graphics state field 0\n2. Extract field 1 (offset 0x4) from unit structure - graphics state field 1\n3. Call Ordinal_10369(pUnit) to retrieve current animation frame ID from unit graphics state\n4. Call Ordinal_11013(pUnit, &field0, &field1, &frameId) to validate frame against unit fields\n5. Return animation frame ID for rendering unit graphics\n\nParameters:\npUnit (UnitAny *) - Pointer to unit structure containing graphics state and animation data\n\nReturns:\ndword - Current animation frame index for unit graphics rendering; zero if no animation active\n\nSpecial Cases:\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x0 - Field offset for graphics state component 0\n0x4 - Field offset for graphics state component 1",
