      "comment": "Retrieve graphics state information from a unit record.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load first stat value from unit record [pUnitRecord + 0x0]\n2. Load second stat value from unit record [pUnitRecord + 0x4]\n3. Call Ordinal_10369 with unit record pointer to retrieve graphics index (Unknown - appears to retrieve graphics-related index)\n4. Call Ordinal_11013 with unit record and stat parameters to populate graphics info (Unknown - appears to populate graphics state)\n5. Return second stat value (dwStat1) as graphics state pointer\n\nParameters:\npUnitRecord - Pointer to unit record structure (ECX register, __fastcall)\n\nReturns:\ndword - Graphics state/pointer value from stat index\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- The function loads two initial stat values before calling the ordinal functions\n- Ordinal_10369 appears to compute a graphics index from the unit record\n- Ordinal_11013 populates graphics information into the local variables\n- Return value is the second stat value (dwStat1)\n- Unknown ordinal imports: Ordinal_10369, Ordinal_11013 (not in KNOWN_ORDINALS.md)",
