      "comment": "Initialize COF data for unit component information structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate and store unit component class index, token ID, component ID in unit info structure fields\n2. Assert COF data pointer and COF action data pointer are non-NULL (abort if NULL)\n3. Initialize unit info line counter to 1 and store token ID and action offset\n4. Store cell context pointer from indexed town units array\n5. Call Ordinal_10647 to resolve token properties; assert result is non-NULL\n6. Store resolved token properties pointer from result\n7. Get COF data buffer from COF action data structure at offset 0x14\n8. Validate buffer is non-NULL (abort if NULL)\n9. Loop through COF action lines: each line is 9 bytes, loop until line count exhausted\n10. For each line, compare component ID field with target component; if match found, exit loop\n11. For matching component line: extract 4 bytes from offset +5 to +8 as weapon/class value\n12. Fill missing dwWClass bytes with 0x20 (space character) if original is zero\n13. Special handling for classes 0 and 0xc: call Ordinal_10582 to get monster stats\n14. Check animation support flag in monster stats; use default if unsupported\n15. Call Ordinal_11070 to resolve final animation data based on class and component type\n16. Store resolved animation data in unit info\n17. Validate all structure pointers (cel context, cell unit, town units) are non-NULL\n18. Initialize default placeholders (0x20787878) if animation or object data is NULL\n19. Return 1 on successful component match and initialization; return 0 if no match found\n\nParameters:\n- pUnitInfo (int *): Pointer to tUnitInfo structure for target unit component\n- dwClassIndex (dword): Character/monster class index for animation resolution\n- nComponentIdx (int): Component structure index being initialized\n- bComponent (byte): Component enumeration ID to match against COF line data\n- dwTokenId (dword): Token ID from unit data (for stat lookup via Ordinal_10582)\n- pCofData (int *): Pointer to COF (Component Object File) main data structure\n- pCofActionData (int *): Pointer to COF action data containing component lines buffer\n- pdwLineNo (dword *): Pointer to current line number counter in iteration\n- dwActionIdxOffset (dword): Action ID index offset for animation data lookup\n- nLineIdx (int): Line index used in component animation override resolution\n\nReturns:\n- 1: Component line found and unit info successfully initialized with animation data\n- 0: No matching component line found in COF data (matching failed)\n- Non-returning: Fatal assertion if critical pointers NULL or indices invalid (Ordinal_10647, Ordinal_10582)",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_StatList", "PROP_LARGE", "STRUCT_Path", "STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "STRUCT_Skill", "STRUCT_Other", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "PARAM_10", "STRUCT_Control", "SRC_GfxUtil.cpp", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
