      "instructions": ["0xC6C10|PUSH|EBP", "0xC6C11|MOV|EBP, EDX", "0xC6C13|TEST|ECX, ECX", "0xC6C15|JNZ|0x6fb96c35", "0xC6C17|PUSH|0x43b", "0xC6C1C|PUSH|0x6fbd88c0", "0xC6C21|PUSH|0x6fbd865c", "0xC6C26|CALL|0x6fb99a7a", "0xC6C2B|ADD|ESP, 0xc", "0xC6C2E|PUSH|-0x1", "0xC6C30|CALL|0x6fb9a10f", "0xC6C35|CMP|EBP, 0x10", "0xC6C38|JL|0x6fb96c58", "0xC6C3A|PUSH|0x43c", "0xC6C3F|PUSH|0x6fbd88c0"],
      "comment": "Retrieves graphics rendering data for a component from a component graphics array structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate input parameters: pbComponentData != NULL and 0 <= dwComponentIndex < 16\n2. Initialize result (bGraphicsData = 0) and iteration counter (dwComponentCount = 0)\n3. Load component count from array header at pbComponentData[0]\n4. If component count > 0, search component array starting at offset 0x1C\n5. Load component ID at current position [offset + 0] and compare with dwComponentIndex\n6. If match found, extract byte at [offset + 3] and return as result\n7. Advance to next component entry (offset += 9 bytes) and increment dwComponentCount\n8. If dwComponentCount < array count, repeat from step 5\n9. If component not found after all iterations, return 0x00\n10. Return graphics data byte (non-zero if found, 0x00 if not found or invalid inputs)\n\nParameters:\npbComponentData (byte *) - Pointer to component graphics array with header and entries\ndwComponentIndex (uint) - Component ID to search (valid range 0-15)\nIMPLICIT ECX - First parameter (pbComponentData) in __fastcall convention\nIMPLICIT EDX - Second parameter (dwComponentIndex) in __fastcall convention\n\nReturns:\nAL (byte) - Graphics rendering byte from found component at array[offset+3], 0x00 if not found\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- NULL pbComponentData triggers assertion at line 0x43B\n- dwComponentIndex >= 16 triggers assertion at line 0x43C\n- Empty component array (count=0) returns 0x00 without iteration\n- Component ID not in array returns 0x00\n\nComponent Array Structure:\nOffset | Size | Field Name      | Type     | Description\n0x00   | 1    | nComponentCount | byte     | Number of component entries\n0x01   | 27   | reserved        | byte[27] | Reserved/padding\n0x1C   | 1    | nComponentId    | byte     | Component ID (0-15)\n0x1D   | 2    | reserved        | byte[2]  | Padding\n0x1F   | 1    | nGraphicsData   | byte     | Graphics data (returned)\n0x20   | 5    | reserved        | byte[5]  | Padding\n0x25   | 9    | next_entry      | byte[9]  | Next component (9-byte stride)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x1C (28) - Offset to first component entry in array\n0x09 (9) - Component entry size/stride in bytes\n0x10 (16) - Maximum component index value\n0x03 (3) - Offset of graphics data byte within component entry\n0x43B - Assertion line for NULL pointer check\n0x43C - Assertion line for index bounds check",
      "tags": ["PARAM_2", "SRC_GfxUtil.cpp"]
