      "comment": "Retrieves a unit stat byte value at a fixed offset.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call Ordinal_10591(nUnitIndex) to retrieve stat structure pointer for unit\n2. Validate structure pointer is not NULL\n3. Return byte value at offset 0x7c from structure\n\nParameters:\nnUnitIndex (dword) - Unit index value passed to Ordinal_10591 for stat lookup\n\nReturns:\nbyte - Stat value at offset 0x7c of the unit stat structure\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- NULL/invalid structure pointer triggers assertion and process termination (FUN_6fb9a10f)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x7c - Fixed offset to stat byte field within unit stat structure  \n0x1e3 - Assertion line number (483 decimal) - stat structure validation failure\n\nRelated Functions:\n- Ordinal_10591 - Retrieves stat structure (D2Common ordinal, unidentified)\n- D2Common_AssertionOrdinal - Assertion handler (line 483 reference)",
