      "comment": "Retrieve and process cel context data for game unit sprite rendering\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize local buffer array (20 bytes) to zeros\n2. Read animation mode from unit data at offset 0x18\n3. Read unit property from unit data at offset 0x04\n4. Call Ordinal_10457 with dwUnit - extract visualization property\n5. Mask result to low byte and store in buffer[3]\n6. Set buffer[1] = 0, buffer[2] = animation mode, buffer[4] = 1\n7. Call GetCelContextFromUnit with prepared buffer - return 0 on failure\n8. Call Ordinal_10055 to load cel context - return 0 on failure\n9. Right-shift cel context result by 8 bits and return\n\nParameters:\n- dwUnit (ECX, uint): Unit entity ID/handle\n- dwUnitData (EDX, uint): Pointer to unit data structure containing animation/property fields\n\nReturns:\n- int: Result code or cel data (data_value << 8), returns 1 on operation failure\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Function optimizes away 3 stack temporaries (local_3c, local_40, local_44)",
