      "comment": "Sets graphics info structure fields for a given GFX info ID.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call GetGfxInfoField(nGfxInfoId) to retrieve pointer to graphics info structure\n2. If pointer is NULL, return without modification\n3. Set field at offset 0x44 to dwValue2 (likely height or second dimension)\n4. Set field at offset 0x40 to dwValue1 (likely width or first dimension)\n5. Set flag 0x04 in first dword to mark structure as modified/initialized\n\nParameters:\n  nGfxInfoId (int) - Graphics info identifier to locate structure\n  dwValue1 (uint) - First dimension value (width), stored at offset 0x40\n  dwValue2 (uint) - Second dimension value (height), stored at offset 0x44\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value, modifies structure in-place\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - If GetGfxInfoField returns NULL, function returns immediately without modification\n  - Flag 0x04 is OR'd with existing flags, preserving other bits",
