      "instructions": ["0xC7F00|PUSH|EDI", "0xC7F01|MOV|EDI, EDX", "0xC7F03|CALL|0x6fb931c0", "0xC7F08|MOV|ECX, EAX", "0xC7F0A|XOR|EDX, EDX", "0xC7F0C|CMP|ECX, EDX", "0xC7F0E|JZ|0x6fb97f6a", "0xC7F10|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ECX]", "0xC7F12|OR|AL, 0x2", "0xC7F14|MOV|dword ptr [ECX], EAX", "0xC7F16|MOV|EAX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x8]", "0xC7F1A|CMP|EAX, 0x1", "0xC7F1D|MOV|dword ptr [ECX + 0x48], EAX", "0xC7F20|JGE|0x6fb97f29", "0xC7F22|MOV|dword ptr [ECX + 0x48], 0x1"],
      "comment": "Initialize projectile graphics info structure with animation frame and trajectory calculations.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Retrieve graphics info structure via GetGfxInfoField\n2. If structure exists, set flag byte to enabled (OR with 0x02)\n3. Clamp animation frame to minimum 1 if param_3 < 1\n4. Initialize movement fields: velocity scaled by 0x800, positions to 0\n5. Check field[0x24] (gravity); if 0 use default 0xFFFFF000\n6. Calculate parabolic trajectory: field[0x18] = (velocity - gravity * frame^2 / 2) / frame\n\nParameters:\n  nGfxType (int, ECX) - Graphics object type identifier\n  nVelocityParam (int, EDX) - Velocity parameter, scaled by 0x800\n  nAnimFrame (dword, Stack[0x4]) - Animation frame count, clamped to minimum 1\n\nReturns:\n  void - Structure fields modified in place\n\nStructure Layout (Graphics Info):\n  Offset | Size | Field Name | Type | Description\n  0x00   | 4    | flags      | uint | Enabled flag (0x02 = active)\n  0x04   | 4    | field_4    | int  | Position X component\n  0x08   | 4    | field_8    | int  | Position Y component\n  0x0C   | 4    | field_c    | int  | Velocity component\n  0x10   | 4    | field_10   | int  | Movement X\n  0x14   | 4    | field_14   | int  | Movement Y\n  0x18   | 4    | field_18   | int  | Calculated trajectory\n  0x24   | 4    | gravity    | int  | Gravity value, default 0xFFFFF000\n  0x48   | 4    | field_48   | uint | Animation frame counter\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x02 - Enable flag mask\n  0x800 - Velocity scale factor (2048 decimal)\n  0xFFFFF000 - Default gravity value (-4096 in 2's complement)\n\nRelated Functions:\n  GetGfxInfoField() - Retrieves graphics info structure pointer by type",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Act", "STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_3", "STRUCT_UnitAny", "STRUCT_Control", "STRUCT_PlayerData"]
