      "comment": "Set the lowest bit flag on the graphics info structure for a unit type.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call GetGfxInfoField with unit type to retrieve graphics info pointer\n2. Test if returned pointer is non-NULL\n3. If non-NULL, set the lowest bit (0x1) of the dword at that address\n4. Return\n\nParameters:\nnUnitType - Unit type ID to set graphics info flag for\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If GetGfxInfoField returns NULL, function does nothing (no crash)\n- Sets bit 0x1 using OR operation (idempotent)",
