      "instructions": ["0xD1749|PUSH|EBX", "0xD174A|MOV|EBX, dword ptr [ESP + 0x8]", "0xD174E|XOR|EAX, EAX", "0xD1750|PUSH|ESI", "0xD1751|TEST|BL, 0x10", "0xD1754|JZ|0x6fba1759", "0xD1756|PUSH|0x1", "0xD1758|POP|EAX", "0xD1759|TEST|BL, 0x8", "0xD175C|JZ|0x6fba1760", "0xD175E|OR|AL, 0x4", "0xD1760|TEST|BL, 0x4", "0xD1763|JZ|0x6fba1767", "0xD1765|OR|AL, 0x8", "0xD1767|TEST|BL, 0x2"],
      "comment": "Converts x87 FPU control word bit flags to SSE MXCSR control register format.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize result to 0 and extract invalid operation mask from bit 4 of FPU control word\n2. Convert FPU exception mask bits to MXCSR format:\n   - Bit 3 (divide-by-zero) → MXCSR bit 2 (0x04)\n   - Bit 2 (denormal) → MXCSR bit 3 (0x08) \n   - Bit 1 (overflow) → MXCSR bit 4 (0x10)\n   - Bit 0 (underflow) → MXCSR bit 5 (0x20)\n3. Convert FPU flush-to-zero from bit 19 (0x80000) to MXCSR bit 1 (0x02)\n4. Extract and convert rounding mode from bits 8-9 (0x300):\n   - 0x100 (round to nearest) → MXCSR bits 10-11 (0x400)\n   - 0x200 (round down) → MXCSR bit 11 (0x800)\n   - 0x300 (round up) → MXCSR bits 10-11 (0xC00)\n5. Convert precision control from bits 16-17 (0x30000):\n   - 0x00000 (24-bit) → MXCSR bits 8-9 (0x300)\n   - 0x10000 (53-bit) → MXCSR bit 9 (0x200)\n   - 0x20000 (64-bit) → No MXCSR equivalent (default)\n6. Convert infinity control from bit 18 (0x40000) to MXCSR bit 12 (0x1000)\n\nParameters:\n  dwFpuControlWord - x87 FPU control word containing exception masks, rounding mode, precision control\n\nReturns:\n  Equivalent MXCSR control register value with converted bit flags\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0x10 (16) - FPU invalid operation mask bit\n  0x08 (8) - FPU divide-by-zero mask bit  \n  0x04 (4) - FPU denormal operand mask bit\n  0x02 (2) - FPU overflow mask bit\n  0x01 (1) - FPU underflow mask bit\n  0x80000 (524288) - FPU flush-to-zero flag\n  0x300 (768) - FPU rounding mode mask (bits 8-9)\n  0x100 (256) - Round to nearest even\n  0x200 (512) - Round toward negative infinity\n  0x300 (768) - Round toward positive infinity\n  0x30000 (196608) - FPU precision control mask (bits 16-17)\n  0x10000 (65536) - 53-bit precision (double)\n  0x40000 (262144) - FPU infinity control bit\n  0x400 (1024) - MXCSR round to nearest (bits 13-14)\n  0x800 (2048) - MXCSR round down (bit 14)\n  0xC00 (3072) - MXCSR round up (bits 13-14)\n  0x1000 (4096) - MXCSR denormals-are-zero flag",
      "tags": ["STRUCT_Inventory", "PARAM_1", "PROP_LEAF"]
